{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Beam level measurement results based on CSI-RS related measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":25056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rsIndexResults","paragraph_zero_based":25057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Beam level measurement results.","paragraph_zero_based":25058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"timeBetweenEvents","paragraph_zero_based":25059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the time elapsed between fulfilling the conditional execution conditions included in choConfig. Value in milliseconds. The maximum value 1023 means 1023ms or longer. This field may be included in the reports associated to UEInformationResponse message, e.g., rlf-Report or in the SCGFailureInformation message.","paragraph_zero_based":25060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasResultUTRA-FDD field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":25062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"physCellId","paragraph_zero_based":25063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The physical cell identity of the UTRA-FDD cell for which the reporting is being performed.","paragraph_zero_based":25064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"utra-FDD-EcN0","paragraph_zero_based":25065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"According to CPICH_Ec/No in TS 25.133 [46] for FDD.","paragraph_zero_based":25066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"utra-FDD-RSCP","paragraph_zero_based":25067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"According to CPICH_RSCP in TS 25.133 [46] for FDD.","paragraph_zero_based":25068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasResults field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":25070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"coarseLocationInfo","paragraph_zero_based":25071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the coarse location information reported by the UE. This field is coded as the Ellipsoid-Point defined in TS 37.355 [49]. The first/leftmost bit of the first octet contains the most significant bit. The least significant bits of degreesLatitude and degreesLongitude are set to 0 to meet the accuracy requirement corresponds to a granularity of approximately 2 km.","paragraph_zero_based":25072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is up to UE implementation how many LSBs are set to 0 to meet the accuracy requirement","paragraph_zero_based":25073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"excessDelay","paragraph_zero_based":25074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the ratio of packets in UL per DRB exceeding the configured delay threshold among the UL PDCP SDUs, according to the UL PDCP Excess Packet Delay per DRB mapping table, as defined in TS 38.314 [53], Table 4.3.1.e-1.","paragraph_zero_based":25075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measId","paragraph_zero_based":25076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Identifies the measurement identity for which the reporting is being performed.","paragraph_zero_based":25077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measQuantityResults","paragraph_zero_based":25078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The value sinr is not included when it is used for LogMeasReport-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":25079}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bf4ad29a16155c157a7693cd35a1ca930dcd0c8c68b104adf6d09dff7e408ce6","b9d2fa0ffb861dc22289e22c7c5f3876b4e6970bcf42f06c1c5dd6a3079de5d3","49522a6420711306ba3d737e1294ece3f5c104a3a344a22c53dcd1c0956faa21","f224641341ef7c0825ac6b26a4e22e472e6e17b542186554d0c6c985c71dd8fe","59e4cf672ef1f00fc8dee38