{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MsgA-ConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":25417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MsgA-ConfigCommon is used to configure the PRACH and PUSCH resource for transmission of MsgA in 2-step random access type procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":25418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":25419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MSGACONFIGCOMMON-START","paragraph_zero_based":25420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MsgA-ConfigCommon-r16 ::=           SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":25422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    rach-ConfigCommonTwoStepRA-r16      RACH-ConfigCommonTwoStepRA-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":25423},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    msgA-PUSCH-Config-r16               MsgA-PUSCH-Config-r16                                      OPTIONAL --Cond InitialBWPConfig","paragraph_zero_based":25424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":25425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MSGACONFIGCOMMON-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":25427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":25428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MsgA-ConfigCommon field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":25430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"msgA-PUSCH-Config","paragraph_zero_based":25431},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of cell-specific MsgA PUSCH parameters which the UE uses for contention-based MsgA PUSCH transmission of this BWP. If the field is not configured for the selected UL BWP, the UE shall use the MsgA PUSCH configuration of initial UL BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":25432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rach-ConfigCommonTwoStepRA","paragraph_zero_based":25433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of cell specific random access parameters which the UE uses for contention based and contention free 2-step random access type procedure as well as for 2-step RA type contention based beam failure recovery in this BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":25434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":25436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":25437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"InitialBWPConfig","paragraph_zero_based":25438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present when MsgA-ConfigCommon is configured for the initial uplink BWP, or when MsgA-ConfigCommon is configured for a non-initial uplink BWP and MsgA-ConfigCommon is not configured for the initial uplink BWP, otherwise the field is optionally present, Need S.","paragraph_zero_based":25439}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a91d7f78b34fb3b5fd5bf9f56e98942ece7cb41454b07afcc882a5442d46f75a","38a01925b20a37685eeaa6966bb0b22101ab5931fe8b130237400cde5326df07","a8ae5e96827b4153667edb0521e947b11e6ab4a6d41c63cc7b38afcd4197534f","bcd9858b9e1951c95126501853e6b2fb434dcc17d02998fb329581ddc611141b","48162891cc724f489083e328274955327b2c1858ab368387ad27385e01316521","93f2ca50257108e307814c1788819f55d3d55318858f9c677b1dc8e6ad7c745a","6b3a2588c1963fdacb6676a941a6f42a946988201dbe740fb5293e36f2b569ad","8312617c4c11c9d0b68cae1529a64ee641e906ef40dc0c1ad525c6cdf27950b4","53cf8a346db9100cb54f5d9