{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapsNR-r16  ::=                        SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":26089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    bandNR-r16                                   FreqBandIndicatorNR,","paragraph_zero_based":26090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    gapIndication-r16                            ENUMERATED {gap, no-gap}","paragraph_zero_based":26091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":26092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NeedForGapsInfoNR-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapsInfoNR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"intraFreq-needForGap","paragraph_zero_based":26098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement gap requirement information for NR intra-frequency measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":26099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"interFreq-needForGap","paragraph_zero_based":26100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement gap requirement information for NR inter-frequency measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":26101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapsIntraFreq field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servCellId","paragraph_zero_based":26104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the serving cell which contains the target SSB (associated with the initial DL BWP) to be measured. ","paragraph_zero_based":26105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndicationIntra","paragraph_zero_based":26106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap is required for the UE to perform intra-frequency SSB based measurements on the concerned serving cell. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed if any of the UE configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB) do not contain the frequency domain resources of the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB). Value no-gap indicates a measurement gap is not needed to measure the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB) for all configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB), no matter the SSB is within the configured BWP or not. This field shall be set to 'no-gap' for the corresponding band(s) where bwpOperationMeasWithoutInterrupt-r18 is supported by the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":26107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapsNR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bandNR","paragraph_zero_based":26110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the NR target band to be measured.","paragraph_zero_based":26111}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["218aa9e1b1d60f0cafb6f0bc5764a0b260c78575a6f96c65b97a62c7dc147c04","b4598cdeb5fb2a6588a5aee18f9ff179d099c533e979df77484e4172270c8660","258428a5d08e012e155ebc7925b3ccd2eeb066232fb9ddac2284f5b518b49560","6812c193ce03a737bf8c9fe6c2eb7b77fe6184dc8ea26c721619b8e46984c216","dd65877c8135693277d84400e5b6e90a54ac78fef607d4b1ddb949362b92086d","0890c0567fb97a5f15e7109370c4b63e3f37448741b71eaa