{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndication","paragraph_zero_based":26112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap is required for the UE to perform SSB based measurements on the concerned NR target band while NR-DC or NE-DC is not configured. The UE determines this information based on the resultant configuration of the RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume message that triggers this response. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed, value no-gap indicates a measurement gap is not needed. ","paragraph_zero_based":26113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NeedForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":26115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NeedForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA contains configuration related to the reporting of measurement gap and NCSG requirement information.","paragraph_zero_based":26116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA information element","paragraph_zero_based":26117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NeedForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA-START","paragraph_zero_based":26119},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA-r17 ::=        SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":26121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-EUTRA-r17   SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxBandsEUTRA)) OF FreqBandIndicatorEUTRA     OPTIONAL    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":26122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":26123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NeedForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-EUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":26129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the target E-UTRA bands that the UE is requested to report the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information.","paragraph_zero_based":26130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NeedForGapNCSG-ConfigNR","paragraph_zero_based":26132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NeedForGapNCSG-ConfigNR contains configuration related to the reporting of measurement gap and NCSG requirement information.","paragraph_zero_based":26133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapNCSG-ConfigNR information element","paragraph_zero_based":26134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26135}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6d4cf7a50748d0f25ac46b4e4aa8edfe22245db0bcd17bdbbb05d2bf0df7c62f","857e5c29ab040921b204782cf1f8e93ad3e7700182fb596a54c09199cad5d3b3","3db69fb60c8edf0e54eca1fd7c9e25f52d640909afb8e8dd8424ae46cdab65b0","923d29e2e6a21f69682735a70d884cdbd6216f1e2eb24fc34fd7c300e09aea62","5c85c4aa6b7451840a5ba767a6080739324769f94d32c8e7e70cf654084bac07","062ce0694d822494f0781011c73fc3f2238cad055abdd5b931439ed0838626c4","353ecd4663ca88e9742246894982ec46b32f739ddcbd417ee227ab65c0ef11d1","1200987175d4de1cc03373b5eb3dbc66de4fb24a8c9372718c04a87fb4812eaf","47bb4e008242a35a219c7d4662fe2ae4931973c6b48f86206a1336efa673b