{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NextHopChainingCount is used to update the KgNB key and corresponds to parameter NCC: See TS 33.501 [11].","paragraph_zero_based":26256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NextHopChainingCount information element","paragraph_zero_based":26257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NEXTHOPCHAININGCOUNT-START","paragraph_zero_based":26259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NextHopChainingCount ::=                    INTEGER (0..7)","paragraph_zero_based":26261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NEXTHOPCHAININGCOUNT-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26263},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NG-5G-S-TMSI","paragraph_zero_based":26266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NG-5G-S-TMSI contains a 5G S-Temporary Mobile Subscription Identifier (5G-S-TMSI), a temporary UE identity provided by the 5GC which uniquely identifies the UE within the tracking area, see TS 23.003 [21].","paragraph_zero_based":26267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NG-5G-S-TMSI information element","paragraph_zero_based":26268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NG-5G-S-TMSI-START","paragraph_zero_based":26270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NG-5G-S-TMSI ::=                         BIT STRING (SIZE (48))","paragraph_zero_based":26272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NG-5G-S-TMSI-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NonCellDefiningSSB","paragraph_zero_based":26277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NonCellDefiningSSB is used to configure a NCD-SSB to be used while the UE operates in an (e)RedCap-specific initial BWP or a dedicated BWP that does not contain the CD-SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":26278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NonCellDefiningSSB information element","paragraph_zero_based":26279}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a587b592ac3ac90dc2f2567504ec50a5f96312bb8a478a780adba7de32a7e4fe","e996efb001c78c8e75cc962eb41a9c5ba2e1dbb3599b28f55d025a2ea971cfd0","9cd345233e4c4d3402b183f42354837e28985e6351334f881113cf39472ed46e","0c68bac05d6d8a1ac8856855d2a88154cd8d86e8b9fd5e681e322a5e5e4e0c27","8784b6e3633233331c81c1ba365968bf423473fb0704762336cf0694edfbb9e0","c9e299337a1da6f22297e60cf8f5b5ac41f15747728f41ced9e01cb48356795f","957b2ef96af0306be06e79b34b748d6a0ce9841de042910254d4ccfe5c810ade","8dd6589170c53f47f8f995f6d4ca5a95dbf50a06223d802eade075c4d5be36b2","f5357fd8d2ca41ce9336aadc1dad27be298819a764ec39d75c740dcce835d1d7","1252564c6e6b4f85e9dcb6a1fcb013df1b8abf11b42fba75aedbd5f4276ef801","4ba03a4234c0fd143e79c577ca791dc26fb70e395c508b4ba0064e368e736cef","59e6288bdd0e08fa59b0695287f2457e5bedabf85ba0cc7ab89cc35f91f8db91","e02d3a54fc8fca97c0fe09b818b425ee7d1dba24799f6317cfdb1c73afd5c0a1","946771ba2f2bede5a36e5361297f2b0c99767680db294e034944328eae3c0660","1574108c936aac92b207c831111c47ffd5f4e0087c09f6a2afb9e16837fca41d","17e889e91a1706cd9012c5eb61e07d1aaba2ed27f12b3d8f799438314870f40a","dc21c1032b02f673daa469d1df90bde35d1caa62cb3ae5d942562b747c6fdab0","5161b741ec453d1a7b02b49c3f573e30b9cee620d961655546695cddfdbac89a","7cdc4ce0145a1e820dcb571c1fb50bd475d91662f2fda81723b1dc399a7b891c","0e14208b26ad4c704b5a4dada7a24dd80a84ee8d4ea37af068fddbeb8a2dd684","2a9175f67b7225874166daa0bc591f527a9aea177433af38bb279ec6df1ffaf1","a78211d52c9741800d9d40c089af230292966455424a51f6b26851510e95d3b6","b2f80a3352db5234243ecddc31ccf2dfcc9e1294aa5b03549032e79eb3c00c4d","aee46595226d7d6fe178b0f0ff4c289205545f3f18cff0dd09d67f8a61791a91"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[26256,26279],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx:p26256"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NONCELLDEFININGSSB-START","paragraph_zero_based":26281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NonCellDefiningSSB-r17 ::=      SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":26283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    absoluteFrequencySSB-r17        ARFCN-ValueNR,","paragraph_zero_based":26284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ssb-Periodicity-r17             ENUMERATED { ms5, ms10, ms20, ms40, ms80, ms160, spare2, spare1 }       OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":26285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ssb-TimeOffset-r17              ENUMERATED { ms5, ms10, ms15, ms20, ms40, ms80, spare2, spare1 }      OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":26286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":26287},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":26288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NONCELLDEFININGSSB-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NonCellDefiningSSB field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"absoluteFrequencySSB","paragraph_zero_based":26294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Frequency of the NCD-SSB. The network configures this field so that the SSB is within the bandwidth of the BWP configured in BWP-DownlinkCommon.","paragraph_zero_based":26295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-Periodicity","paragraph_zero_based":26296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The periodicity of this NCD-SSB. The network configures only periodicities that are larger than the periodicity of serving cell's CD-SSB. If the field is absent, the UE applies the SSB periodicity of the CD-SSB (ssb-periodicityServingCell configured in ServingCellConfigCommon or ServingCellConfigCommonSIB).","paragraph_zero_based":26297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-TimeOffset","paragraph_zero_based":26298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The time offset between CD-SSB of the serving cell and this NCD-SSB. Value ms5 means the first burst of NCD-SSB is transmitted 5ms later than the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted after the first symbol of SFN=0 of the serving cell, value ms10 means the first burst of NCD-SSB is transmitted 10ms later than the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted after the first symbol in SFN=0 of the serving cell, and so on. If the field is absent, UE considers that the time offset between the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted in the serving cell and the first burst of this NCD-SSB transmitted is zero. For RedCap UEs in TDD cells, the network configures this time offset to be an integer multiple of the periodicity of the serving cell's CD-SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":26299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NPN-Identity","paragraph_zero_based":26301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NPN-Identity includes either a list of CAG-IDs or a list of NIDs per PLMN Identity. Further information regarding how to set the IE is specified in TS 23.003 [21].","paragraph_zero_based":26302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NPN-Identity information element","paragraph_zero_based":26303}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["308ab683