_w_t_and_m_t":"iab-Support","paragraph_zero_based":26369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field combines both the support of IAB and the cell status for IAB. If the field is present, the cell supports IAB and the cell is also considered as a candidate for cell (re)selection for IAB-nodes; if the field is absent, the cell does not support IAB and/or the cell is barred for IAB-node.","paragraph_zero_based":26370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gNB-ID-Length","paragraph_zero_based":26371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the length of the gNB ID out of the 36-bit long cellIdentity. This field is always present if the mobileIAB-Support is broadcasted in a cell.","paragraph_zero_based":26372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mobileIAB-Support","paragraph_zero_based":26373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the support of mobile IAB. If the field is absent, the cell is barred for mobile IAB-node.","paragraph_zero_based":26374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NPN-IdentityInfo","paragraph_zero_based":26375}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6a08674994682ae5ebb2c3d975b41aca1852257b71c562e25482f9443bdcfd24","3361131b3f57edafce0b125ad00fa9dc901c919cbcfa145add4ec536b6456bf2","df76de8807d12d64caf0861664ba63da6bf9f47d7c7a3e19a89d350b0a6d6d75","5d88b49a92aa88592cf1194005394d1b5a7c7074e8f2b52cf44072721c7dd231","3612933d031c6ae3d7da9e47c84405301d66337eb7656382b0dec83f8ac0e801","47f69c9596b94cf9f5eced6c4ed930f58dd16e4baa5002ea273c078d89c80f8b","22a742b0c7d3e21104fc1cd926b21b70538f0aa5f7ae9415c20c0fdde1bc029e","a1c3ebb64ed0d1c473b01d81cc0731bdd228e56e2721860f1a5c4d8a31a52505","affa803eb9ba9ddb5ab8664c7ea727d565900ba1250dca06044ca705