{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The NPN-IdentityInfo contains one or more NPN identities and additional information associated with those NPNs. Only the same type of NPNs (either SNPNs or PNI-NPNs) can be listed in a NPN-IdentityInfo element.","paragraph_zero_based":26376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"npn-IdentityList","paragraph_zero_based":26377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The npn-IdentityList contains one or more NPN Identity elements.","paragraph_zero_based":26378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"trackingAreaCode","paragraph_zero_based":26379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the Tracking Area Code to which the cell indicated by cellIdentity field belongs. ","paragraph_zero_based":26380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ranac","paragraph_zero_based":26381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the RAN Area Code to which the cell indicated by cellIdentity field belongs. ","paragraph_zero_based":26382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cellReservedForOperatorUse","paragraph_zero_based":26383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the cell is reserved for operator use (for the NPN(s) identified in the npn-IdentityList) as defined in TS 38.304 [20]. This field is ignored by NPN capable IAB-MT and NPN capable NCR-MT.","paragraph_zero_based":26384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NR-DL-PRS-PDC-Info","paragraph_zero_based":26386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NR-DL-PRS-PDC-Info defines downlink PRS configuration for PDC.","paragraph_zero_based":26387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-PDC-Info information element","paragraph_zero_based":26388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NR-DL-PRS-PDC-INFO-START","paragraph_zer