{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    powerControlOffsetSS                ENUMERATED{db-3, db0, db3, db6}                 OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":26688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    scramblingID                        ScramblingId,","paragraph_zero_based":26689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    periodicityAndOffset                CSI-ResourcePeriodicityAndOffset                OPTIONAL,   -- Cond PeriodicOrSemiPersistent","paragraph_zero_based":26690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    qcl-InfoPeriodicCSI-RS              TCI-StateId                                     OPTIONAL,   -- Cond Periodic","paragraph_zero_based":26691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":26692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":26693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    subcarrierSpacing-r18               SubcarrierSpacing                               OPTIONAL,   -- Cond LTM","paragraph_zero_based":26694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    absoluteFrequencyPointA-r18         ARFCN-ValueNR                                   OPTIONAL,   -- Cond LTM","paragraph_zero_based":26695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    cyclicPrefix-r18                    ENUMERATED {extended}                           OPTIONAL    -- Cond LTM","paragraph_zero_based":26696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":26697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":26698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NZP-CSI-RS-RESOURCE-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NZP-CSI-RS-Resource field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"periodicityAndOffset","paragraph_zero_based":26704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Periodicity and slot offset sl1 corresponds to a periodicity of 1 slot, sl2 to a periodicity of two slots, and so on. The corresponding offset is also given in number of slots (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1). Network always configures the UE with a value for this field for periodic and semi-persistent NZP-CSI-RS-Resource (as indicated in CSI-ResourceConfig).","paragraph_zero_based":26705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"powerControlOffset","paragraph_zero_based":26706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Power offset of PDSCH RE to NZP CSI-RS RE. Value in dB (see TS 38.214 [19], clauses 5.2.2.3.1 and 4.1). The UE shall ignore this field in case NZP-CSI-RS-Resources is received as part of an LTM-Candidate IE.","paragraph_zero_based":26707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"powerControlOffsetSS","paragraph_zero_based":26708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Power offset of NZP CSI-RS RE to SSS RE. Value in dB (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1).","paragraph_zero_based":26709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qcl-InfoPeriodicCSI-RS","paragraph_zero_based":26710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For a target periodic CSI-RS, contains a reference to one TCI-State in TCI-States for providing the QCL source and QCL type. For periodic CSI-RS, the source can be SSB or another periodic-CSI-RS. Refers to the TCI-State or dl-OrJoint-TCI-State which has this value for tci-StateId and is defined in tci-StatesToAddModList or in dl-OrJointTCI-StateList in the PDSCH-Config included in the BWP-Downlink corresponding to the serving cell and to the DL BWP to which the resource belongs to (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1). In case NZP-CSI-RS-Resources is received as part of an LTM-Candidate IE, it refers to the TCI state identifier in CandidateTCI-State and is defined in ltm-DL-OrJointTCI-StateToAddModList within the LTM-Candidate IE.","paragraph_zero_based":26711}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["35d8daae2b09f12f8b5df1ae93894d749ee6d557b946c23a9b0c4969ee99f1c1","7006b18aed5e39030272f2f8c523e947be05276fed88de9bab389082b208c8e2","bd68f53fc9e7c7dfd67773ce3a12f4fc70f63f7d73b6de654ac958be0b11472b","ffaff514139a5d2b9a06f17aae54f5de41b9c754eb54c533c091cfd9f69014d2","9ad4efefaa4c9139ec9929a832b194f44d187b4739068d67db2885f4c3068af7","bba7524512472c5aeed3a2e6f7044b142f405bcfa9c5e2e0907a4acc0539ddf8","16e2a11677d50f297431bafb62af8c5a2a72541757defb7644b007626a52a680","81a03849c02dae2c653a8691c1027bfeba66ace9e6df15de06c08c263de6c8ff","9766484405b6737143778e76ac2ab3d72d2723e5592b9dd2565b21a2e7cc0883","7e828e0048bab3bdffeab127f3c1e49a88f7d73c618af4500133640010fe2aef","d7cc016fe8185a235785071fc96bba6214779ad5ec4ca05487d241183a549226","7101918368f548446eeb186be5da0272620e9961e1f9fbab2c18c9a63d11e7ba","4857a3bb9047dd6139851f91aafa9aede3278e7b9ba9a5d0f826070a95edf815","9095190beffbfb2d5efbeb062319db79f113d4ecc4aa839b286c2bbe699cb3ba","24c721b098035a4d44219870382519a465f90f3260f61de0ca0654d579adf998","de8d88290f7f5341f534ff0a2ec0bbd84bb147b449d66884271245b166e4293b","1497430d61f50a566f9d54decfe3fbade7301a61612e0de948de72a0f661f7d1","7ecb35ee22aebed02d18451ac25fda81b0cc7e5460fd47999e33a6b8ffa83cb2","45a2aa61bbf31a9c3ba8f58fcc191ad79b283df4b1bb1160fff079475eebcea0","ee26cd5b596545b5b10169af645d7117b1c367c99f31cf03b29560f1b2e774f4","f2353751341e4d09134fe17340bb6e2fe7e2a61749310263cf635cd58bc13336","de4130ff2fd0316204c5aed88b102abb4a080be25fddb66b352bcd826424124d","8883dcb281f0103aa8a854a5492b4464dd5add2a6fe8a56bb28799c8ab4a92c1","b8e4ed62c4a244c5466c8e9c03a7469d9f08f0c6799efa838bd9b6f0ccb1e2a