{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourceMapping","paragraph_zero_based":26712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"OFDM symbol location(s) in a slot and subcarrier occupancy in a PRB of the CSI-RS resource.","paragraph_zero_based":26713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scramblingID","paragraph_zero_based":26714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Scrambling ID (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1).","paragraph_zero_based":26715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":26717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":26718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"LTM","paragraph_zero_based":26719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present in case NZP-CSI-RS-Resources is part of an LTM-Candidate IE. Otherwise, the field is absent, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":26720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Periodic","paragraph_zero_based":26721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, Need M, for periodic NZP-CSI-RS-Resources (as indicated in CSI-ResourceConfig). The field is absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":26722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PeriodicOrSemiPersistent","paragraph_zero_based":26723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, Need M, for periodic and semi-persistent NZP-CSI-RS-Resources (as indicated in CSI-ResourceConfig). The field is absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":26724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId","paragraph_zero_based":26726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId is used to identify one NZP-CSI-RS-Resource.","paragraph_zero_based":26727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId information element","paragraph_zero_based":26728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NZP-CSI-RS-RESOURCEID-START","paragraph_zero_based":26730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId ::=           INTEGER (0..maxNrofNZP-CSI-RS-Resources-1)","paragraph_zero_based":26732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NZP-CSI-RS-RESOURCEID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26735}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["899305b032292044176db43c78d4daa9dd03031e47c6952e5b33055ba997a221","9ecbcf64fd7271cd2ba8ffec3b936483c26848b29042df6720e9d70e43827afc","0f66035707d6557243e40b64cdb66ac82f4baed6ad4dd40da23d1cdbc5b23194","aaee088a1c0d0946a064b3e09df514ffbe0856426dfedd63987cb2b7aed64e8b","39468054c88a64d5b6b3e3506f28e7426a176acfea2155738de1235c874cd714","c1c9e4c198d766f1f4096e582226195bf464e94d125751427d181efb6fb5e86f","7ba9b100eb257998c342796b9a96a26a479e04595b0774170bdfe268f97e6240","114522bd56120852630db97090ef2c667b239731042cf29a337fcdc25508bf54","7d291a75f97c36ca44d49ab69967dae17416e7d3d143c1e34420052986211d4c","b7c7039cb1de29d2d328d70ec967bbb8cd6b5676fe6b62d36b6d8ec890e67b3c","adacab9764ffa7addd804f292b5370da7421238dd25c8939fba75bd07bcba9bb","e4f141f53731c2f15b6e675acaf449c3eead451f26b025120db6925b213063bd","4a81d1796ba9a05fd8dcf7f9e5ad78898b8dc26302988135ff23875513702598","115c1fee20b1aa074d65735ba052c4698e232f6e14a2136b3c5834bce3c7ad00","52221a7d53d76af7ce