{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PCI-RANGEINDEX-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PCI-RangeIndexList","paragraph_zero_based":26955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PCI-RangeIndexList concerns a list of indexes of physical cell id ranges, which may be used for different purposes.","paragraph_zero_based":26956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PCI-RangeIndexList information element","paragraph_zero_based":26957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PCI-RANGEINDEXLIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":26959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PCI-RangeIndexList ::=              SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofPCI-Ranges)) OF PCI-RangeIndex","paragraph_zero_based":26961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PCI-RANGEINDEXLIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PDCCH-Config","paragraph_zero_based":26966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PDCCH-Config is used to configure UE specific PDCCH parameters or MBS multicast PDCCH parameters such as control resource sets (CORESET), search spaces and additional parameters for acquiring the PDCCH. If this IE is used for the scheduled SCell in case of cross carrier scheduling, the fields other than searchSpacesToAddModList and searchSpacesToReleaseList are absent. If the IE is used for a dormant BWP, the fields other than controlResourceSetToAddModList and controlResourceSetToReleaseList are absent. If this IE is used for MBS CFR, the field downlinkPreemptiom,tpc-PUSCH, tpc-SRS, uplinkCancellation, monitoringCapabilityConfig, and searchSpaceSwitchConfig are absent.","paragraph_zero_based":26967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PDCCH-Config information element","paragraph_zero_based":26968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PDCCH-CONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":26970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PDCCH-Config ::=                    SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":26972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    controlResourceSetToAddModList      SEQUENCE(SIZE (1..3)) OF ControlResourceSet                      OPTIONAL,   -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":26973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    controlResourceSetToReleaseList     SEQUENCE(SIZE (1..3)) OF ControlResourceSetId                    OPTIONAL,   -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":26974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    searchSpacesToAddModList            SEQUENCE(SIZE (1..10)) OF SearchSpace                            OPTIONAL,   -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":26975}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["abfccc7d260da493f1726ebed39e0942b827f757e83ea3720ecfa52f8fbb0535","48c76a17138fedcf0f7e150f1d55c5de8b3ed758da71e5353372687b583859b9","04d3bd3ba865a4314c86a93a73bc9aaf5e2f70bf14c9a855f9f9044ce7a82537","3e3c386bfa85afbefc49db1d1b2e47692720d11fdddff01d79256ff8df431009","4a7ed4fcc42f8576c285e6493499c68213826f7a7869c21be79aa53dad18ca05","65e8e41fb3a65cf5d