{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates Tracking Area Code to which the cell indicated by cellIdentity field belongs. The absence of the field indicates that the cell only supports PSCell/SCell functionality (per PLMN) or is an NTN cell.","paragraph_zero_based":28368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"trackingAreaList","paragraph_zero_based":28369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of Tracking Areas to which the cell indicated by cellIdentity field belongs. If this field is present, network does not configure trackingAreaCode. Total number of different TACs across different PLMN-IdentityInfos shall not exceed maxTAC. This field is only present in an NTN cell.","paragraph_zero_based":28370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":28372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":28373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eventID-TSS","paragraph_zero_based":28374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If eventID-TSS is present in SIB9, this field is mandatory present in the PLMN-IdentityInfo IE of PLMN-IdentityInfoList in SIB1. Otherwise, the field is optionally present, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":28375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PLMN-IdentityList2","paragraph_zero_based":28377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Includes a list of PLMN identities.","paragraph_zero_based":28378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PLMN-IdentityList2 information element","paragraph_zero_based":28379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":28380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PLMNIDENTITYLIST2-START","paragraph_zero_based":28381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PLMN-IdentityList2-r16 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..16)) OF PLMN-Identity","paragraph_zero_based":28383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PLMNIDENTITYLIST2-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":28385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":28386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PRB-Id","paragraph_zero_based":28388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PRB-Id identifies a Physical Resource Block (PRB) position within a carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":28389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PRB-Id information element","paragraph_zero_based":28390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":28391}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["58d0e5846f4f11b9e2ecef3e35a5c6b7e09974d9f482946061c16d491c603781","4f3627e93d5d23ca00fb0efd83a84098d68c4ae2b902d90b6a05746e145e07ed","636d21ea6b8d8e8c9810d8469594858d6c65b36822acb3354d5b4feaa2f72ed5","2921b3d9f0924d1ec353830afa6db9370424c79eaa5465a34e7633e0b21a601f","32aaa5f7a3d1aff192b4ae12ade171279a3f4e112349dc88f621b0561b482659","d3901b92640f734d3709e11d400e3423c197790e7c62b02a4cd765139c1cf9ec","b7757ac369882b987501286078d1ee122506071d6abcd193ab0aa2fff7222d65","0b45de138a4617e96c2d1c3f7ad15e709b52688f9a80181cfb6d1f4b215da055","9ad3cc88c447c68fefabbfea59691ec71a729ba2ea59646c7a16d0a1d90798cc","dc50a0ec45db0c48b494c0786169d314a09a10afcd33b76032788d3b8065ad98","046f949e24abf11946890aa38a6dc0cf260d9503cc4506c7d684d71460ad54b3","32590a54c1c6e84c6682d37f169966e6d28ded6634809ec60dddf58c53a2c56b","1f2984b1b9e0efa733460ee849482b