{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ptrs-Power","paragraph_zero_based":28464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UL PTRS power boosting factor per PTRS port (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1, table 6.2.3.1.3).","paragraph_zero_based":28465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourceElementOffset","paragraph_zero_based":28466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the subcarrier offset for UL PTRS for CP-OFDM. If the field is absent, the UE applies the value offset00 (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 6.4.1.2.2).","paragraph_zero_based":28467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sampleDensity","paragraph_zero_based":28468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sample density of PT-RS for DFT-s-OFDM, pre-DFT, indicating a set of thresholds T={NRBn, n=0,1,2,3,4}, that indicates dependency between presence of PT-RS and scheduled BW and the values of X and K the UE should use depending on the scheduled BW, see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1, table 6.2.3.2-1.","paragraph_zero_based":28469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"timeDensity","paragraph_zero_based":28470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Presence and time density of UL PT-RS for CP-OFDM waveform as a function of MCS If the field is absent, the UE uses L_PT-RS = 1 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1).","paragraph_zero_based":28471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"timeDensityTransformPrecoding","paragraph_zero_based":28472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Time density (OFDM symbol level) of PT-RS for DFT-s-OFDM. If the field is absent, the UE applies value d1 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1).","paragraph_zero_based":28473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"transformPrecoderDisabled","paragraph_zero_based":28474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of UL PTRS without transform precoder (with CP-OFDM).","paragraph_zero_based":28475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"transformPrecoderEnabled","paragraph_zero_based":28476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of UL PTRS with transform precoder (DFT-S-OFDM).","paragraph_zero_based":28477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PUCCH-Config","paragraph_zero_based":28479},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PUCCH-Config is used to configure UE specific PUCCH parameters (per BWP).","paragraph_zero_based":28480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PUCCH-Config information element","paragraph_zero_based":28481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":28482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PUCCH-CONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":28483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PUCCH-Config ::=                        SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":28485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    resourceSetToAddModList                 SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofPUCCH-ResourceSets)) OF PUCCH-ResourceSet   OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":28486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    resourceSetToReleaseList                SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofPUCCH-ResourceSets)) OF PUCCH-ResourceSetId OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":28487}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5b78aabb802448cba301490e884eb567a7ed7ece798137407a933e6cee5d88fe","5815580271c06ab5182bfd47a02271d179f4b946a4bdf078ea742bbec2c8920a","f18a734c84bb1f7486042c562288db9f5b218baed7caf543f296a75377bd198f","c55eb9d4478784fd11b37f074ec614c6c233d0495db9b6f292abb4fbab913b5d","b4083bd0cfeaf65f0ccddbde7ca0f16ced41ce747600cb613b45aa6a2f413028","8c9192743565a618b