{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ra-PrioritizationTwoStep","paragraph_zero_based":30264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameters which apply for prioritized 2-step random access type procedure to a given target cell (see TS 38.321 [3], clause 5.1.1).","paragraph_zero_based":30265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":30267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":30268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mandatory","paragraph_zero_based":30269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present.","paragraph_zero_based":30270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Occasions","paragraph_zero_based":30271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, Need S, if the field occasions is present, otherwise it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":30272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2StepCFRA","paragraph_zero_based":30273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present for the case of 2-step RA type contention free random access, Need S, otherwise it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":30274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4StepCFRArep","paragraph_zero_based":30275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For non-RedCap UEs, the field is optionally present, Need S, if resources is set to ssb and there is one FeatureCombinationPreambles entry indicating only msg1-Repetitions which is associated with the same Msg1 repetition number.","paragraph_zero_based":30276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For RedCap UEs, the field is optionally present, Need S, if resources is set to ssb and there is one FeatureCombinationPreambles entry indicating only redCap and msg1-Repetitions which is associated with the same Msg1 repetition number.","paragraph_zero_based":30277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Otherwise, it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":30278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–RACH-ConfigGeneric","paragraph_zero_based":30280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE RACH-ConfigGeneric is used to specify the random-access parameters both for regular random access as well as for beam failure recovery.","paragraph_zero_based":30281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RACH-ConfigGeneric information element","paragraph_zero_based":30282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":30283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-RACH-CONFIGGENERIC-START","paragraph_zero_based":30284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RACH-ConfigGeneric ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":30286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    prach-ConfigurationIndex            INTEGER (0..255),","paragraph_zero_based":30287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["70c570718c9f342758f35d73d0b72ae7abae4b1d41280c995c68cbb8add0f7b7","e8d9de2a9e2c29a0974e63fe2ecb20a093ac8027436a90ab79d4bd49a04037d2","67a521bf91d43c344774495eeb677e1f9b928dca807c3a9f3f37edc87a51d44f","956f0c98152b8d1b5e9ab53fa3544d3c867d00f5e2cd2646b246570dda06f0f3","ef79a1c816d9a24f09ae0c79d95b5f7b6266f8d52d1e1b69768e710ffa88e04a","c7041ffed5f426e975b7ddee5ee6fa5f18824a061bf00eb16f6b7a8a5835bb57","496a4aa667027e45f7b28ea848d012d668533a407b1d22ceae070a7477bccfea","a1bf69393e632d81bce2fa0a2d786b6393a2997a520225f843281e11f25dcf90","5b73f7e8cbf4143fbc6f5b4b605a4c2559946cd36dfa47e5d461cf3c0cf4843c","3b94625c48a8a014a