{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2 U2N Relay threshold value associated with the selected trigger quantity (i.e. RSRP) to be used in measurement report triggering condition for event Y1.","paragraph_zero_based":31176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"y2-Threshold-Relay","paragraph_zero_based":31177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2 U2N Relay threshold value associated with the selected trigger quantity (i.e. RSRP) to be used in measurement report triggering condition for event Y2.","paragraph_zero_based":31178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"z1-Threshold1-Relay","paragraph_zero_based":31179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2 U2N Relay threshold value associated with the selected trigger quantity (i.e. SL-RSRP and/or SD-RSRP) to be used in measurement report triggering condition for serving Relay UE in event Z1. If the field sd-RSRP is not included, the UE considers it to be equal to sl-RSRP.","paragraph_zero_based":31180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"z1-Threshold2-Relay","paragraph_zero_based":31181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2 U2N Relay threshold value associated with the selected trigger quantity (i.e. SD-RSRP) to be used in measurement report triggering condition for candidate Relay UE in event Z1.","paragraph_zero_based":31182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PeriodicalReportConfigInterRAT field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":31184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxReportCells","paragraph_zero_based":31185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Max number of non-serving cells/candidate L2 U2N Relay UEs to include in the measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":31186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportAmount","paragraph_zero_based":31187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of measurement reports applicable for eventTriggered as well as for periodical report types","paragraph_zero_based":31188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportQuantity, reportQuantityUTRA-FDD","paragraph_zero_based":31189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The cell measurement quantities to be included in the measurement report. If the field reportQuantityUTRA-FDD is present, the UE shall ignore the value(s) provided in reportQuantity.","paragraph_zero_based":31190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31191},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CellIndividualOffsetList-EUTRA field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":31192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cellIndividualOffset","paragraph_zero_based":31193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Cell individual offsets applicable to a specific measurement event.","paragraph_zero_based":31194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"physCellId","paragraph_zero_based":31195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Physical cell identity of a cell in the cell list.","paragraph_zero_based":31196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ReportConfigNR","paragraph_zero_based":31198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ReportConfigNR specifies criteria for triggering of an NR measurement reporting event or of a CHO, CPA or CPC event or of an L2 U2N relay measurement reporting event. For events labelled AN with N equal to 1, 2 and so on, measurement reporting events and CHO, CPA or CPC events are based on cell measurement results, which can either be derived based on SS/PBCH block or CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":31199}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8aa5c5ef34e19dd82d9ece66581624eb6