{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A1:Serving becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":31200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A2:Serving becomes worse than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":31201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A3:Neighbour becomes amount of offset better than PCell/PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":31202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A4:Neighbour becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":31203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A5:PCell/PSCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Neighbour/SCell becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":31204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A6:Neighbour becomes amount of offset better than SCell;","paragraph_zero_based":31205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event D1:Distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation1 becomes larger than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference1 and distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation2 becomes shorter than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference2;","paragraph_zero_based":31206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A3: Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes amount of offset better than PCell/PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":31207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A4: Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes better than absolute threshold where condEventA4 can also be used for current PSCell (i.e., in case it is configured as candidate PSCell for CondEvent A4 evaluation) for CHO with candidate SCG(s) case;","paragraph_zero_based":31208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A5: PCell/PSCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":31209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent D1: Distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation1 becomes larger than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference1 and distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation2 of conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes shorter than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference2;","paragraph_zero_based":31210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent D2: Distance between UE and a moving reference location determined based on referenceLocation1 becomes larger than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference1 and distance between UE and a moving reference location determined based on referenceLocation2 of conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes shorter than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference2;","paragraph_zero_based":31211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent T1: Time measured at UE becomes more than configured threshold t1-Threshold but is less than t1-Threshold + duration;","paragraph_zero_based":31212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event X1:Serving L2 U2N Relay UE becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND NR Cell becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":31213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event X2:Serving L2 U2N Relay UE becomes worse than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":31214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For event I1, measurement reporting event is based on CLI measurement results, which can either be derived based on SRS-RSRP or CLI-RSSI.","paragraph_zero_based":31215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event I1:Interference becomes higher than absolute threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":31216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The reporting events concerning Aerial UE altitude are labelled HN with N equal to 1 and 2. Additionally, the reporting events concerning Aerial UE altitude and the neighboring cell measurements simultaneously are labelled AMHN with M equal to 3, 4, 5 and N equal to 1, 2.","paragraph_zero_based":31217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event H1:Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":31218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event H2:Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":31219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A3H1:Neighbour becomes offset better than SpCell and the Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":31220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A3H2:Neighbour becomes offset better than SpCell and the Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":31221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A4H1:Neighbour becomes better than threshold1 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold2.","paragraph_zero_based":31222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A4H2:Neighbour becomes better than threshold1 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold2.","paragraph_zero_based":31223}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["aabde5fad2f2dd0fd29b9b2b3378348d7175b432bf33693304b67ba77182deb0","b232c2b804049ec9f297e1f6b80bc2cf199233a019e45624c961920430b3b4e5","ecaf14a43a83848a34b5c3a114aa89bc7a21e37b61b677478d5d15ef7ca553e0","3e214c848a6bfa1090f694dbbc44eccbf48645ae7d83cff03272bd8f7639b1cc","e687ca81cc94c0961bcd94c78c14d411f1fc9198997b0d50cbbb8b3cd12c8eab","2b230ebe260ea13f6c48f0afa89b12a5392495dc47a8f1bf46cfd1ffcbd34ad0","58e63425eef47af1499cb172361b1778bdd88c9a1ba53511097746437bc5d3e2","c5ad3650c8881cadb2eab5c8c485f7af8668c83307eba06dd7a1a0cc1ad092ec","5c125ef996e1715b394a59bdd340e13c698791a815b290e95073d11abfc70bc2","fe905d0c8e17b5df72621c4