{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether to include the measurement result per RS index in the measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":31752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CellIndividualOffsetList field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":31754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cellIndividualOffset","paragraph_zero_based":31755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Cell individual offsets applicable to a specific measurement event.","paragraph_zero_based":31756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"physCellId","paragraph_zero_based":31757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Physical cell identity of a cell in the cell list.","paragraph_zero_based":31758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ReportConfigNR-SL","paragraph_zero_based":31760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ReportConfigNR-SL specifies criteria for triggering of a CBR measurement reporting event for NR sidelink communication/discovery. Measurement reporting events are based on CBR measurement results on the corresponding transmission resource pools. These events are labelled CN with N equal to 1 and 2.","paragraph_zero_based":31761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event C1:CBR of NR sidelink communication/discovery is above a threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":31762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event C2:CBR of NR sidelink communication/discovery is below a threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":31763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ReportConfigNR-SL information element","paragraph_zero_based":31764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":31765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-REPORTCONFIGNR-SL-START","paragraph_zero_based":31766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragrap