{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T-ReassemblyExt-r17 ::=             ENUMERATED {ms210, ms220, ms340, ms350, ms550, ms1100, ms1650, ms2200}","paragraph_zero_based":32088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-RLC-CONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":32093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxRetxThreshold","paragraph_zero_based":32094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter for RLC AM in TS 38.322 [4]. Value t1 corresponds to 1 retransmission, value t2 corresponds to 2 retransmissions and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":32095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"pollByte","paragraph_zero_based":32096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter for RLC AM in TS 38.322 [4]. Value kB25 corresponds to 25 kBytes, value kB50 corresponds to 50 kBytes and so on. infinity corresponds to an infinite amount of kBytes.","paragraph_zero_based":32097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"pollPDU","paragraph_zero_based":32098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter for RLC AM in TS 38.322 [4]. Value p4 corresponds to 4 PDUs, value p8 corresponds to 8 PDUs and so on. infinity corresponds to an infinite number of PDUs.","paragraph_zero_based":32099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sn-FieldLength","paragraph_zero_based":32100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the RLC SN field size, see TS 38.322 [4], in bits. Value size6 means 6 bits, value size12 means 12 bits, value size18 means 18 bits. The value of sn-FieldLength of an RLC entity for the DRB/multicast MRB shall be changed only using reconfiguration with sync. The network configures only value size12 in SN-FieldLengthAM for SRB.","paragraph_zero_based":32101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"t-PollRetransmit","paragraph_zero_based":32102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Timer for RLC AM in TS 38.322 [4], in milliseconds. Value ms5 means 5 ms, value ms10 means 10 ms and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":32103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"t-Reassembly, t-ReassemblyExt","paragraph_zero_based":32104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Timer for reassembly in TS 38.322 [4], in milliseconds. Value ms0 means 0 ms, value ms5 means 5 ms and so on. If t-ReassemblyExt-r17 is configured, the UE shall ignore t-Reassembly (without suffix).","paragraph_zero_based":32105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"t-StatusProhibit","paragraph_zero_based":32106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Timer for status reporting in TS 38.322 [4], in milliseconds. Value ms0 means 0 ms, value ms5 means 5 ms and so on. If t-StatusProhibit-v1610 is present, the UE shall ignore t-StatusProhibit (without suffix).","paragraph_zero_based":32107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":32109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":32110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reestab","paragraph_zero_based":32111}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bc5b088cb5310c8ff188fb281e3aef28a35225dc44a4f7b0dea1fb66595d08b1","433c864bf4ece9bb0977f6959e57117ce1b72d504a62d56b92d4468f6be9cb1f","e564804b7af64fd5783e5e0f65e6b41243a3d751cc0fce8a4d726229f008a21a","3189e75430f8058ccfa6760636d81d52cf8c92b4465b8dbefcb6aa0cec87e634","3ca68ac25bd6265efb8b31fcbb14286