{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–RSRQ-Range","paragraph_zero_based":32161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE RSRQ-Range specifies the value range used in RSRQ measurements and thresholds. For measurements, integer value for RSRQ measurements is according to Table 10.1.11.1-1 in TS 38.133 [14]. For thresholds, the actual value is (IE value – 87) / 2 dB.","paragraph_zero_based":32162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RSRQ-Range information element","paragraph_zero_based":32163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":32164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-RSRQ-RANGE-START","paragraph_zero_based":32165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RSRQ-Range ::=                      INTEGER(0..127)","paragraph_zero_based":32167},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-RSRQ-RANGE-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–RSSI-Range","paragraph_zero_based":32172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE RSSI-Range specifies the value range used in RSSI measurements and thresholds for NR operation with shared spectrum channel access. The integer value for RSSI measurements is according to Table 10.1.34.3-1 in TS 38.133 [14].","paragraph_zero_based":32173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RSSI-Range information element","paragraph_zero_based":32174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":32175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-RSSI-RANGE-START","paragraph_zero_based":32176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_an