{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    scellActivationRS-Id-r17         SCellActivationRS-ConfigId-r17,","paragraph_zero_based":32208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    resourceSet-r17                  NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSetId,","paragraph_zero_based":32209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    gapBetweenBursts-r17             INTEGER (2..31)                                                            OPTIONAL, -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":32210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    qcl-Info-r17                     TCI-StateId,","paragraph_zero_based":32211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":32212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":32213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SCELLACTIVATIONRS-CONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCellActivationRS-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":32218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapBetweenBursts","paragraph_zero_based":32219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When this field is present, there are two bursts and it indicates the gap between the two bursts in number of slots. When this field is absent, there is a single burst.","paragraph_zero_based":32220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qcl-Info","paragraph_zero_based":32221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reference to TCI-State for providing the QCL source and QCL type for each NZP-CSI-RS-Resource listed in nzp-CSI-RS-Resources of the NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet indicated by resourceSet (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.6.1.1.1). TCI-StateId refers to the TCI-State which has this value for tci-StateId and is defined in tci-StatesToAddModList or dl-OrJointTCI-StateList in the PDSCH-Config included in the BWP-Downlink of this serving cell indicated by firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id in the ServingCellConfig in which this IE is included.","paragraph_zero_based":32222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourceSet","paragraph_zero_based":32223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nzp-CSI-ResourceSetId of the NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet of this serving cell used as resource configuration for one or two bursts for SCell activation. This NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet consists of four NZP CSI-RS resources in two consecutive slots with two NZP CSI-RS resources in each slot (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.6.1.1.1). The CSI-RS associated with this NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet are located in the BWP addressed by firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id.","paragraph_zero_based":32224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SCellActivationRS-ConfigId","paragraph_zero_based":32226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SCellActivationRS-ConfigId is used to identify one SCellActivationRS-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":32227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCellActivationRS-ConfigId information element","paragraph_zero_based":32228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":32229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SCELLACTIVATIONRS-CONFIGID-START","paragraph_zero_based":32230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32231}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e2c13804c16ca63f7318de6f70746b6722cbdfe23d76dc7e740fab40131dd882","f658d441b523f21c7b0ee72ef02990d74ded3b7ed8e7b3e98ee2d7c995e45d42","b2d89a981e2b38e3