{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If UE is connected to E-UTRA/EPC, this field indicates the integrity protection algorithm to be used for SRBs configured with NR PDCP as specified in TS 33.501 [11], and DRBs configured with integrity protection as specified in TS 33.401 [30]. The network does not configure nia0 for SRB3.","paragraph_zero_based":32808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SelectedPSCellForCHO-WithSCG","paragraph_zero_based":32810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SelectedPSCellForCHO-WithSCG is used to indicate the information of the selected target PSCell to target MN at execution of a conditional reconfiguration for CHO with candidate SCG(s).","paragraph_zero_based":32811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SelectedPSCellForCHO-WithSCG information element","paragraph_zero_based":32812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":32813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SELECTEDPSCELLFORCHO-WITHSCG-START","paragraph_zero_based":32814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32815},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SelectedPSCellForCHO-WithSCG-r18 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":32816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ssbFrequency-r18                     ARFCN-ValueNR,","paragraph_zero_based":32817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    physCellId-r18                       PhysCellId","paragraph_zero_based":32818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":32819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SELECTEDPSCELLFORCHO-WITHSCG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SemiStaticChannelAccessConfig","paragraph_zero_based":32824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SemiStaticChannelAccessConfig is used to configure channel access parameters when the network is operating in semi-static channel access mode (see clause 4.3 in TS 37.213 [48].","paragraph_zero_based":32825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SemiStaticChannelAccessConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":32826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":32827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SEMISTATICCHANNELACCESSCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":32828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SemiStaticChannelAccessConfig-r16 ::=    SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":32830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    period-r16                               ENUMERATED {ms1, ms2, ms2dot5, ms4, ms5, ms10}","paragraph_zero_based":32831}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["48398402ebdaf304e4d62e013734d128471a800e9bfdc511299f8934dc8fc853","f7d7f53f77e95cc51893cffa9d01af55e65ab87732a82e43b3afc737274248be","f215ab135b996f9ad841feb2f8e4321ff89fc08733b1b9ecbf2fefaeccc50721","68d80017a5684774b3bcc48f08e471050b70cb9c74df9ad262241ba4e1467c59","4caa3a01dd100b23f6ff12f37dcdb82e1fe3f9ca48da47f79bd7dad703565adb","4d4c1fa12d7bdbe9daadd3f59586e045c5b5a853e48dedb60e8e87953ef947ba","f8285ddb86d4f60f2fdc4bc0f75f5142e7214380a5088a691b1d38daad09c056","c1f72b1e5d9ebe0e989d9604eeafa039539439f087832cb1b407892a964a6e7a","92e8ac7f696a1d4370732906db2962f8010a8e18fa4fda10678cbd5650395acf","7bcc1b0fef29fddbc7e0bee41071455bdcbea7c52131a061f98ed990f4d