{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field provides motion sensor measurements as Sensor-MotionInformation defined in TS 37.355 [49]. The first/leftmost bit of the first octet contains the most significant bit.","paragraph_zero_based":32880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ServingCellAndBWP-Id","paragraph_zero_based":32882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ServingCellAndBWP-Id is used to indicate a serving cell and an uplink or a downlink BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":32883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServingCellAndBWP-Id information element","paragraph_zero_based":32884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":32885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SERVINGCELLANDBWP-ID-START","paragraph_zero_based":32886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32887},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServingCellAndBWP-Id-r17 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":32888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    servingcell-r17              ServCellIndex,","paragraph_zero_based":32889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    bwp-r17                      BWP-Id","paragraph_zero_based":32890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":32891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SERVINGCELLANDBWP-ID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ServCellIndex","paragraph_zero_based":32896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ServCellIndex concerns a short identity, used to uniquely identify a serving cell (i.e. the PCell, the PSCell or an SCell) across the cell groups. Value 0 applies for the PCell, while the SCellIndex that has previously been assigned applies for SCells.","paragraph_zero_based":32897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServCellIndex information element","paragraph_zero_based":32898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":32899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SERVCELLINDEX-START","paragraph_zero_based":32900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServCellIndex ::=                   INTEGER (0..maxNrofServingCells-1)","paragraph_zero_based":32902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32903}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["abcbd6a15ab1d0bf9702260411d94cf781268dacacc288172f44f3777473c5ea","b08a802ab82c2256e3d65b483fcefd53fcb7dfaffa5f84e2c0af7f4e71207844","58e4f063a435fac3d44af6bfc47d771d948e483c9e838b444eb459644876a6f1","80cca62f4fdd4013e31b061d34ae3e63cf62d0df01093a2174b54c6c78174076","292b072d4f2902e1385615027ae1f3dc6e9ff78850675d2aa37d6b4cb2804883","073236da2773354356a6dbe7ec23a989f74a8760ee951189580fa933733a90a0","3e753bdb839964d21ed58250748479f944d61c6d88e7ccbce336c85775601f1d","ba91008c9da61611a83408a7dd5b72166c8bc25871d4f2b52ea499b34a21476b","53cfafc73e1617f2f8f20089954f240d56c947d22a179d71c8def8d946168539","f9982a24e329580d84ece01d9bd48c592412031b861b4db1d71b7c2a8c52f00c","7dc139fc59f32fdaad205cb234ddcdee21b5ee07117684bea6e55d07c6477de5","101ac8e78d05dcc76361272aa1cb7f4d98203b410e28b640a96ba2394e630c17","889f778027dc1f440fd28cbc1fc8337dce7c4fe8a99eb40a1e39bef1f49a6e9d","94317e1b51a05d78c5601f8ab06aa56b23a6c531e628787b0d4aa5953d55c1e8","f73168d6628485cb738cdaf326153bf6af3