{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The (starting) position (bit) of the slotFormatCombinationId (SFI-Index) for this serving cell (servingCellId) within the DCI payload (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1.1).","paragraph_zero_based":33960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servingCellId","paragraph_zero_based":33961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The ID of the serving cell for which the slotFormatCombinations are applicable.","paragraph_zero_based":33962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"slotFormatCombinations","paragraph_zero_based":33963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list with SlotFormatCombinations. Each SlotFormatCombination comprises of one or more SlotFormats (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 4.3.2). The total number of slotFormats in the slotFormatCombinations list does not exceed 512. ","paragraph_zero_based":33964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subcarrierSpacing2","paragraph_zero_based":33965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reference subcarrier spacing for a Slot Format Combination on an FDD or SUL cell (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1.1). For FDD, subcarrierSpacing (SFI-scs) is the reference SCS for DL BWP and subcarrierSpacing2 (SFI-scs2) is the reference SCS for UL BWP. For SUL, subcarrierSpacing (SFI-scs) is the reference SCS for non-SUL carrier and subcarrierSpacing2 (SFI-scs2) is the reference SCS for SUL carrier. The network configures a value that is smaller than or equal to any SCS of configured BWPs of the serving cell that the command applies to. And the network configures a value that is smaller than or equal to the SCS of the serving cell which the UE monitors for SFI indications.","paragraph_zero_based":33966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subcarrierSpacing","paragraph_zero_based":33967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reference subcarrier spacing for this Slot Format Combination. The network configures a value that is smaller than or equal to any SCS of configured BWPs of the serving cell that the command applies to. And the network configures a value that is smaller than or equal to the SCS of the serving cell which the UE monitors for SFI indications (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1.1).","paragraph_zero_based":33968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":33969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SlotFormatIndicator","paragraph_zero_based":33970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SlotFormatIndicator is used to configure monitoring a Group-Common-PDCCH for Slot-Format-Indicators (SFI).","paragraph_zero_based":33971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SlotFormatIndicator information element","paragraph_zero_based":33972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":33973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SLOTFORMATINDICATOR-START","paragraph_zero_based":33974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":33975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SlotFormatIndicator ::=     SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":33976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sfi-RNTI                    RNTI-Value,","paragraph_zero_based":33977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    dci-PayloadSize             INTEGER (1..maxSFI-DCI-PayloadSize),","paragraph_zero_based":33978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    slotFormatCombToAddModList  SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofAggregatedCellsPerCellGroup)) OF SlotFormatCombinationsPerCell","paragraph_zero_based":33979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                                                                                              OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":33980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    slotFormatCombToReleaseList SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofAggregatedCellsPerCellGroup)) OF ServCellIndex                       OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":33981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":33982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":33983}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["000196ba50894b569fe852ddde004325ae91caec99b13d32d02e61b544b4f8b8","d728572eb3bc2db41b9dd44b7a817b040bccd1ad16c0bc946f33e847bf80c9c4","6bdca8680fa6ed0a3037960060ae2d18cd65c15aa47a3a243a1a89b6bdfe7d13","20d5715ba70775d25315196c449f2c5802c1bc15b2219644de443c40e5fc7be4","585fa90c14798aec8cfa6f80e9bbfa9d26ba1b18efa6b16aa44c91041b226516","cc0b7d43193bc057466c11ae6a02cce079424b84b66f7a557b3ed5b52d3e64a3","eb61b2378fc1f583fded00401733acda4fd113781d2be77d275f052209c229d3","8f6945ba9d4e5794204615ebb4160cfa86f31929ac2c249a5e6ed280e1546d88","b4bcd340057ae4dd8a6cd8d78d1f08b6464270b0ac010de161075f7579f6eb4b","575c39d8d4ccfb5b73481a9ed3644f712e3440733e8f7692670a655e3698dd20","cb742590cc158eda8ac221e18447bf3791474fd3ec6f6677ca16f3a3b9f16c93","e4d5fcab585d30b1f694f9481271309d6746db64fddb7c7f425c8db08850a232","032b86ed38dd4b2d82fdf9cd5a2a58d8810e0eb46602984d8a1da8072c346f5c","4e3ed476111c3fde8d199cbe4037b8e0bafa8984b21ee4fed03ed37511a934e2","9da7f1d9882745aed5bdd7fc2b649936445b54717f9379b9278b46f19bd6c411","d37d7df78a4226ed7b2b75e0800a43c59e27440a5bd7e08ddeb8a3f36d827d91","87fec3b8c953fdfd06a40d421b0947b949e0cfa789368fb65151efe7060dbcd7","35b30db2a961e70509c64f0a8374d707f53e150637724fad4adc11fe185a5ba9","4d032396b43eff07bf6b77dc4123860571bd34ae990e89854b6f22ed03030bdf","1117bfcba08b5253ce1c9236c3bc1a27c222cac0690774347ec365d83773bbac","f6081066aa6f7576e6880d95b6ff742338a5f53ae0cb4d3f355b99e868a417c6","fb4fa7c22631057fa15c85b3e4cba8fc5f1c4dda4497357a5463f61c98675fcf","2aa5c61b795905076847dbc0f1d48494a8321452d9abce704c537bd85c3dcc4e","71bd