{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SRS-CarrierSwitching","paragraph_zero_based":34249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SRS-CarrierSwitching is used to configure for SRS carrier switching when PUSCH is not configured and independent SRS power control from that of PUSCH.","paragraph_zero_based":34250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-CarrierSwitching information element","paragraph_zero_based":34251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":34252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SRS-CARRIERSWITCHING-START","paragraph_zero_based":34253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-CarrierSwitching ::=            SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":34255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-SwitchFromServCellIndex         INTEGER (0..31)                                                         OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":34256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-SwitchFromCarrier               ENUMERATED {sUL, nUL},","paragraph_zero_based":34257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-TPC-PDCCH-Group                 CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":34258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        typeA                               SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..32)) OF SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Config,","paragraph_zero_based":34259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        typeB                               SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Config","paragraph_zero_based":34260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    }                                                                                                           OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":34261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    monitoringCells                     SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofServingCells)) OF ServCellIndex               OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":34262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":34263},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":34264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Config ::=            SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":34266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-CC-SetIndexlist                 SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..4)) OF SRS-CC-SetIndex                                OPTIONAL    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":34267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":34268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-CC-SetIndex ::=                 SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":34270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    cc-SetIndex                         INTEGER (0..3)                                                          OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":34271}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d2cdeb146a60159ec6e9af3f3dd152190999220768e889e3380dbd9d9afbc806","47604062ebf52b09a62f5176af7d828c8f9986120719adbd201201bfc09d5eb1","e49871f380896f332a96c66e0566da7aae68b2606ac02b7a0bf275e6ca805035","bbe0502631586f44481612c5b819c6293b889dc1772adcf2925b0f0bad321bad","c628993d530ca3a541b325d51ce4169c85e2d17d00ec824d76ad45a386d681e1","72df928d3391afcae3af4ddf6fa80c6ad81321fa63419ae978242b77e638078a","c0b930c2e4adfff247be0130d6a1552e4228bad361aada7fba5652c4569d38d1","26edb8c66087fbc94322312e44a64483efe00d9a9074f97df262efc3a25aadde","583a1d32e960fcee3fcbc9dadbe04a37fc006465849a02e3463a939883bb7b77","c6de20ceb38f2df9beb15b10788fca055eb4423b3b393a127fd8a15ba1fc41e5","ce9749266cf11997f3df50550eef75407344bbade0701d2b899f03bd61254744","82b1bab476616180ade1718bdda60e54e4af95863065d2c788e246b7f523335e","744582df95fef42d8da7ab0be702e81881cc432dac10c420a4181ce1a75c5fa3","b76751fcb70a6277e0abf58c51d501ba5d6776f6d12dec0db12efe1eb7914712","69f35cc4e1e19e67ee79380bf42e17da72004588828418ed3ea3274177ced2ea","4676849810e8b8e63a0509b9b659082da69e4bd55521f961d8579448ace8e42f","8b154710c6999d39f69030ae87b9ca129b040921020f4e42d2077e7708727acb","390352c1e92882e46b7668e091efea1c8bff1c77b5044f5088169879d4d3453c","f41f1f94bac8d06b0d58c5059d6e80d4278d5b11c30b6a9fd735ba5198f0aa51","b119b438e2634ff0a10b3e09b57621c9130540e755963a31b290c2190d6f888e","e301a63cc9d6836564b72c1f9a1ac6f5bcf174c100b5e40b7703a77f4be6745c","a459b07ff129cbe2c890dea4eaab458bc067dafafa3d4484f5712657e9d515ae","0e701d2784e449bddc3100d0e1db7c8a3807a40cf4f8b79a9419e3f916bccc7b","bea9b06b2366b887a7550b10de8a26d33f325d5dae6501ab1f210c2a715c3feb"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[34248,34271],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx:p34248"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    cc-IndexInOneCC-Set                 INTEGER (0..7)                                                          OPTIONAL    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":34272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":34273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SRS-CARRIERSWITCHING-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":34275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":34276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-CC-SetIndex field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":34278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cc-IndexInOneCC-Set","paragraph_zero_based":34279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the CC index in one CC set for Type A (see TS 38.212 [17], TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.3.1, 11.4). The network always includes this field when the srs-TPC-PDCCH-Group is set to typeA.","paragraph_zero_based":34280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cc-SetIndex","paragraph_zero_based":34281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the CC set index for Type A associated (see TS 38.212 [17], TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.3.1, 11.4). The network always includes this field when the srs-TPC-PDCCH-Group is set to typeA. The network does not configure this field to 3 in this release of specification.","paragraph_zero_based":34282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-CarrierSwitching field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":34284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"monitoringCells","paragraph_zero_based":34285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A set of serving cells for monitoring PDCCH conveying SRS DCI format with CRC scrambled by TPC-SRS-RNTI (see TS 38.212 [17], TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.3.1, 11.3).","paragraph_zero_based":34286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-SwitchFromServCellIndex","paragraph_zero_based":34287},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the serving cell whose UL transmission may be interrupted during SRS transmission on a PUSCH-less SCell. During SRS transmission on a PUSCH-less SCell, the UE may temporarily suspend the UL transmission on a serving cell with PUSCH in the same CG to allow the PUSCH-less SCell to transmit SRS. (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.2.1.3).","paragraph_zero_based":34288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-TPC-PDCCH-Group","paragraph_zero_based":34289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Network configures the UE with either typeA-SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Group or typeB-SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Group, if any.","paragraph_zero_based":34290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeA","paragraph_zero_based":34291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Type A trigger configuration for SRS transmission on a PUSCH-less SCell (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.4). In this release, the network configures at most one entry (the first entry) of typeA, and the first entry corresponds to the serving cell in which the SRS-CarrierSwitching field is configured. SRS carrier switching to SUL carrier is not supported in this version of the specification.","paragraph_zero_based":34292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeB","paragraph_zero_based":34293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Type B trigger configuration for SRS transmission on a PUSCH-less SCell (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.4).","paragraph_zero_based":34294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34295}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["33e341e0847eb7dc62c36d