{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":34296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-CC-SetIndexlist","paragraph_zero_based":34297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of pairs of [cc-SetIndex; cc-IndexInOneCC-Set] (see TS 38.212 [17], TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.3.1, 11.4). The network does not configure this field for typeB.","paragraph_zero_based":34298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SRS-Config","paragraph_zero_based":34300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SRS-Config is used to configure sounding reference signal transmissions. The configuration defines a list of SRS-Resources, a list of SRS-PosResources, a list of SRS-PosResourceSets and a list of SRS-ResourceSets. Each resource set defines a set of SRS-Resources or SRS-PosResources. The network triggers the transmission of the set of SRS-Resources or SRS-PosResources using a configured aperiodicSRS-ResourceTrigger (L1 DCI). The network does not configure SRS specific power control parameters, alpha (without suffix), p0 (without suffix) or pathlossReferenceRS if unifiedTCI-StateType is configured for the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":34301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-Config information element","paragraph_zero_based":34302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":34303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SRS-CONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":34304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-Config ::=                          SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":34306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-ResourceSetToReleaseList            SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofSRS-ResourceSets)) OF SRS-ResourceSetId        OPTIONAL,   -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":34307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-ResourceSetToAddModList             SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofSRS-ResourceSets)) OF SRS-ResourceSet          OPTIONAL,   -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":34308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-ResourceToReleaseList               SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofSRS-Resources)) OF SRS-ResourceId              OPTIONAL,   -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":34309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-ResourceToAddModList                SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofSRS-Resources)) OF SRS-Resource                OPTIONAL,   -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":34310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    tpc-Accumulation                        ENUMERATED {disabled}                                                   OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":34311},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":34312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":34313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-RequestDCI-1-2-r16                  INTEGER (1..2)                                                          OPTIONAL, -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":34314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-RequestDCI-0-2-r16                  INTEGER (1..2)                                                          OPTIONAL, -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":34315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-ResourceSetToAddModListDCI-0-2-r16  SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofSRS-ResourceSets)) OF SRS-ResourceSet          OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":34316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-ResourceSetToReleaseListDCI-0-2-r16 SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofSRS-ResourceSets)) OF SRS-ResourceSetId        OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":34317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-PosResourceSetToReleaseList-r16     SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofSRS-PosResourceSets-r16)) OF SRS-PosResourceSetId-r16","paragraph_zero_based":34318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                                                                                    OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":34319}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4afa70bcdb15faedfb173ae12c02881845c6aec45e91a3a3ac8d6204e5626b63","ce4f6ffdb5906c3c222668901a3c1cbc81382a8d49b3dd5bdbe7938798f4aa13","6ff4544941b009756b988671401612bb1fefe8642683ac3d52035518b68b7fff","48216c614adc83fdc66324e1bb0f01010d67497ea38ea7cf74fbe4eb2aed030b","678c2733fb8203d24ee09722fc15b11f8100858b94a33f7ca22f7ff9c2aacbab","6f1b35f2ce27ec3ab3931b9f92209e27f13f0aa54c4d4dad60c22a003095715c","8481fac1289c73abbe560a7386db8c72c7c23ae0d700f71ab0b1b0e7006761d3","2ba402fee9726062b3781a5d0a531fcdbcbf5b78def92be411c41c1229126e1f","9216cad5a515bd242fd91e61347880ee399fb9e9b274c567fa8750594770c743","4b14bcda096c5527803f90f69db880d7c631fb81a0b2b1b2447b33ee7f2038e4","a3d9bf3437fbf4ca8e8e6856f6e000b54e791e7889a8ea1d321607dae794e502","af2d360f59de600f45278e5cb4a2dcb80f88031dbc6ba937db160c21301b6762","15146abdfc70e1470c6e4d5d8e75d4af858e73127adf365c4f229a693df83e95","5ab5c4d7745aa05bb155b62152f873c95e2d2e91a019fd07c7f2a3aeaecac183","246fef2efed847a19b64ef0c97669aa751cfce3349754259ad5ec8a6ffdc0dc5","bdd1b349064b3a511d8c15064b66104d9f7011ba3976933b5306a9395998c215","e74959f4e9e419966b407c9075f8f4314e5ea29e4ca8f8e03d484b803c00ba40","32280e398d20bece4ad9f1c4bf6ed5734a2cab6b403320ed4bfdeb78355cd9e7","1be5fae183859f515aaa6d922cacb9976dd9c0a8feaf60f8ccee36ddc4a250d4","53a809f26a920e0443359ba2482a140185586e4d489e23baea156c813d29d721","658772013b5d83c14b416d81f7c4d47701df6612eb4f583b6c5b7f0a583e163f","1a4972682090dfc5585ce59c91da2bfe4dd4ac34039b8ac231389