{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SRS-PosTx-Hopping-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":34945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":34946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-PosTx-Hopping field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":34948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-PosConfig","paragraph_zero_based":34949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Provides the SRS Configuration to be used for frequency hopping.","paragraph_zero_based":34950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bwp","paragraph_zero_based":34951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For RRC_CONNECTED state, indicates the frequency region outside of active BWP for SRS for positioning frequency hopping. For RRC_INACTIVE state indicates the BWP configuration for SRS for Positioning during the RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":34952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-PosUplinkTransmissionWindowConfig","paragraph_zero_based":34953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UL time window for UL SRS for positioning with Tx hopping configured to be periodic with configurable starting SFN, slot and symbol number, periodicity, duration.","paragraph_zero_based":34954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-PosUplinkTransmissionWindowConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":34956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"duration","paragraph_zero_based":34957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the duration of the uplink SRS for positioning transmission window with frequency hopping. Value s1 indicates 1 slot, s2 indicates 2 slot and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":34958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"periodicityAndOffset","paragraph_zero_based":34959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the Periodicity and slot offset for uplink SRS for positioning transmission window occurrence with frequency hopping.","paragraph_zero_based":34960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"startSFN","paragraph_zero_based":34961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the starting SFN of the uplink SRS for positioning transmission window with frequency hopping.","paragraph_zero_based":34962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SRS-PosResourceSetLinkedForAggBW","paragraph_zero_based":34964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SRS-PosResourceSetLinkedForAggBW provides the SRS Positioning Resource Sets that are linked for bandwidth aggregation.","paragraph_zero_based":34965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-PosResourceSetLinkedForAggBW information element","paragraph_zero_based":34966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":34967}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c456b1838b59c6777e44c0dbf7e197b549a6bc6f98e30c6e1fef27b849037c40","4b97b235b977b236f202788f602a803546c6a717464389b3472aba5e5dccfd7a","2ddd79bad250a11c582654710faf0260a7a9eee6b75aef3406973bc6dfd7f34a","fabe8f6d94c454e10a45794105de8f9649a907d770ce88ced421258e5b6e8724","84f86f7df187e909fb27c05a91fe0abc0c656e2da5d74ad0b6d7ad9779515cb7","56996cc4cac676612e5343948c5d9efe064f6cb8f4f22eb22cc0632abe5f5061","0188c2705ba41cfd0aa5ea331031a6873421cf039655589f7f28c266a7b8a046","b59915b3620877f7d6b9a7688c0af5220c3ed92dcef80807fdf9848d4d5333ff","3740f2724f5b4327eb213c29a52f227ab4d8f4bf0b868afe460bb8c05e317358","f65d774d48fb35642260f087c9b00f1aaf389fbd47991b1361