{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the SRS Positioning Resource set that is linked for bandwidth aggregation.","paragraph_zero_based":34992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ul-bwp-ID","paragraph_zero_based":34993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the SRS Positioning Resource set uplink bandwidth ID that is linked for bandwidth aggregation.","paragraph_zero_based":34994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":34995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SRS-RSRP-Range","paragraph_zero_based":34996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SRS-RSRP-Range specifies the value range used in SRS-RSRP measurements and thresholds. The integer value for SRS-RSRP measurements is according to Table 10.1.22.1.2-1 in TS 38.133 [14]. For thresholds, the actual value is (IE value –140) dBm, except for the IE value 98, in which case the actual value is infinity.","paragraph_zero_based":34997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-RSRP-Range information element","paragraph_zero_based":34998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":34999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SRS-RSRP-RANGE-START","paragraph_zero_based":35000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-RSRP-Range-r16 ::=                      INTEGER(0..98)","paragraph_zero_based":35002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SRS-RSRP-RANGE-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":35004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":35005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SRS-TPC-CommandConfig","paragraph_zero_based":35007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SRS-TPC-CommandConfig is used to configure the UE for extracting TPC commands for SRS from a group-TPC messages on DCI","paragraph_zero_based":35008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-TPC-CommandConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":35009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":35010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SRS-TPC-COMMANDCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":35011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-TPC-CommandConfig ::=               SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":35013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    startingBitOfFormat2-3                  INTEGER (1..31)                                                     OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":35014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    fieldTypeFormat2-3                      INTEGER (0..1)                                                      OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":35015}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7870c992d9610e91745d8f47215ea7bf8e32b1befbb75ac95d9f1501f6098864","54497ebde99f4c23fedad2e39fda3b92561eeb33a6f8f1a22c65c4c62c138481","8330d8cca7a8d58d642ff4aadddbc796693fbe0571a6967d4b20a9db7311237e","bc1ed827c2ef4b99fc89029372917d9f4ff017b7eb5b05ad8007fb4c574deb16","d4003a25d130b9859f0f9cb8bfc5f0056709c1fd874098545b7cef2b343b09e8","b4e1eade10f87bcfc7cfa91ae7a777820d8db1956f758654cad6e2761bdf8c77","d5d7c15daee613f1545cb24a4858b27c3da2b1763f0e95675ce82ca8ee8c7c2f","a91d8d47ceb9077cb7cee00bfb26c443bc82e646a2a056e4a21448c2b37f5ae7","24435e0d5c568a7e39846d8deecf909882672ef97bd6897aa6a04b9c3eb7bdf9","aa541fcadca97a1ed9bd364eda311daa99088e8cb8e1d5273375578cc86dc1c4","b250546e302874