 TCI states for PDSCH and/or PDCCH of the PSCell or of an SCell.","paragraph_zero_based":35272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TCI-ActivatedConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":35273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":35274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-TCI-ACTIVATEDCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":35275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TCI-ActivatedConfig-r17 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":35277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    pdcch-TCI-r17               SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..5)) OF TCI-StateId,","paragraph_zero_based":35278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    pdsch-TCI-r17               BIT STRING (SIZE (1..maxNrofTCI-States))","paragraph_zero_based":35279}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d134890c7b504038ca7ccd0084a917de699430e36f15dff63c77958f4c6843ba","884f674cf16941633bfa2167438740d513f7a57d7535d2167feafe92b54004a6","f638e8761d0f703b4b0380a030eb16445719e56797349c21a4a0b8dbf6882903","cc5eb4be23b0e85ee35902ccb1b857cb0e367b264efc60b7d7566184dcc8053d","fd2d341f0ae14ad3c5e74cad4c75eeb83d17f719aa2a627d17547e960f5b4438","d331955dbbd761e1dc37fecf9f60e86ad1ccf47a3d2770e2008b7596fbdf4d56","d97b258f8331cc740a5698c881a761113e604a3f2473e917a0c315f3e65ca478","78eff46dc6d7ec3e4fb8695d8d8613831f44519ca14839833ff3e23a63b7053a","936b9c5c8a9c115a963441b492a3785b01abf5f330805c30111c6bb527e876ba","2ea65fab6d457f9992d26928dd2b1a1df16f44371827f46fdb64957a722884db","ebe9d3c546d3bb23c4871531fd5a8aa1d4499d9de68d35e947df92a8c42461fb","66091124fbfc86653f0408a862f4e91e945a80476c9b8a916cb3dab4cd6681c9","7e72f742ab41a02b69419e8568377202b729faf8b0491f61e43967fd5a641d14","f51efe334f069538f929b61618e2932704d28f7c681bff824b674192273f3154","f3f8b035f64e9e000e14d36735c5d08a71c0e8c15458202d5c0e4ebff1b09d49","2bf10de6269d4cf138cc741c112b8d0d870013603c085178cf6a6124c538582f","01403283f312160aff13100d9b1b86bce6f18dcc859115df226f4d1abf30468b","e7c27dbeae3c831001da2d4236b2d9450093be8bbc2de570c652d652fc1297d4","5326fd66a40f1449261b8ade52aaeb781eff0189f050d0d9accdad664d3f906e","5fbc992d7411d8bd5cdf06d53a1e90f411ae1ed11b25592fd3fd01b929c6d5d4","4d0d4548cd8f26c34d9c66ddf22d6ca684cae1639b82e5e74865eda2b5fdc26e","52c3307329d6b7fdd6282f46e477cdfdd45d9db734fec580980017353e2e708e","1e4b04862eefeae4e51d42e816b4e7da528d05688b5b026765c165a228b5f460","64a2fb349e68fea501392159e95534ffeda734ab1f9d40d34ba1853a741e6951"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[35256,35279],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx:p35256"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":35280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-TCI-ACTIVATEDCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":35282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":35283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TCI-ActivatedConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":35285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"pdcch-TCI","paragraph_zero_based":35286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the TCI state for PDCCH for each configured CORESET of the DL BWP to be activated at SCell activation, to be activated for the PSCell at SCG activation and/or to be used for BFD, RLM and measurements while the SCG is deactivated. The list includes exactly as many entries as CORESETs configured in this BWP, ordered by increasing values of ControlResourceSet-Id, i.e. the first entry indicates the TCI state for the configured CORESET with the lowest ControlResourceset-Id value, the second value indicates the TCI states for the configured CORESET with the second lowest ControlResourceset-Id value, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":35287},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"pdsch-TCI","paragraph_zero_based":35288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates TCI states for PDSCH reception at SCell addition/activation or of the PSCell at SCG activation. This field indicates activated TCI state(s) for this BWP ordered by increasing values of TCI-StateId, i.e. the first bit indicates the activation state of the TCI state with the lowest TCI-StateId value, the second value indicates the activation status of the TCI state with the second lowest TCI-State-Id value, and so on. A bit set to 0 indicates that the corresponding TCI state is deactivated, a bit set to 1 indicates that the TCI state is activated.","paragraph_zero_based":35289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–TCI-State","paragraph_zero_based":35291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE TCI-State associates one or two DL reference signals with a corresponding quasi-colocation (QCL) type.","paragraph_zero_based":35292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TCI-State information element","paragraph_zero_based":35293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":35294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-TCI-STATE-START","paragraph_zero_based":35295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TCI-State ::=                       SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":35297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    tci-StateId                         TCI-StateId,","paragraph_zero_based":35298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    qcl-Type1                           QCL-Info,","paragraph_zero_based":35299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    qcl-Type2                           QCL-Info                                                    OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":35300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":35301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":35302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    additionalPCI-r17                   AdditionalPCIIndex-r17                                      OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":35303}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f6d63a6d064d21fe8186ee2245fa05d3b81d4455405d5587487d1f45e24e5e5e","34