rationCommon, see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1. ","paragraph_zero_based":35536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TDD-UL-DL-ConfigDedicated-IAB-MT field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":35538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"slotSpecificConfigurationsToAddModList-IAB-MT","paragraph_zero_based":35539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The slotSpecificConfigurationToAddModList-IAB-MT allows overriding UL/DL allocations provided in tdd-UL-DL-configurationCommon with a limitation that effectively only flexible symbols can be overwritten in Rel-16.","paragraph_zero_based":35540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"slotSpecificConfigurationsToReleaseList-IAB-MT","paragraph_zero_based":35541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The slotSpecificConfigurationsToReleaseList-IAB-MT allows release of a set of slot configuration previously add with slotSpecificConfigurationToAddModList-IAB-MT.","paragraph_zero_based":35542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35543}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9e893903fb63c200b3d235780b344d3e08fb070e7b447b56f70d1dee764e287a","91bdc647b347768c6cf4f4ac73cf81de0fe41d2abcea22165e4ea8bb1ecd22d2","2b6200a2f46d51a76e884c1bb9cbb61e87d7abccb9ff26ade6da62268fb2bcbb","364e0caf4774f4852884583d37f86e089e137cfe19cbebd4238bda6b5ee5730e","047fc35cb7fd7584fdd16546e715618172335ee4270abda4a9cb7a4404149941","6f51735cec0efa78854fb78141f8186a0e1c29d1c121707d57e7768600ee0e1b","fcf1a7f7d088319cf5df32300ebec0e1b6c2a34875191e21c72144be9ab207cd","0047ed9289afc38e962e66e6c7407cfe855ecbe177b81a5c567574564c98e657","1e7cd01eb8ce76ac46ec3f60ea22a5f87f7b851980d7116909710de66b3