{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Periodicity and slot offset for periodic/semi-persistent ZP-CSI-RS (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.4.2). Network always configures the UE with a value for this field for periodic and semi-persistent ZP-CSI-RS resource (as indicated in PDSCH-Config).","paragraph_zero_based":36240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourceMapping","paragraph_zero_based":36241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"OFDM symbol and subcarrier occupancy of the ZP-CSI-RS resource within a slot.","paragraph_zero_based":36242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"zp-CSI-RS-ResourceId","paragraph_zero_based":36243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP CSI-RS resource configuration ID (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.4.2).","paragraph_zero_based":36244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":36246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":36247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PeriodicOrSemiPersistent","paragraph_zero_based":36248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, Need M, for periodic and semi-persistent ZP-CSI-RS-Resources (as indicated in PDSCH-Config). The field is absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":36249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet","paragraph_zero_based":36251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet refers to a set of ZP-CSI-RS-Resources using their ZP-CSI-RS-ResourceIds.","paragraph_zero_based":36252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet information element","paragraph_zero_based":36253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":36254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-ZP-CSI-RS-RESOURCESET-START","paragraph_zero_based":36255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet ::=           SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":36257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    zp-CSI-RS-ResourceSetId             ZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSetId,","paragraph_zero_based":36258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    zp-CSI-RS-ResourceIdList            SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofZP-CSI-RS-ResourcesPerSet)) OF ZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId,","paragraph_zero_based":36259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":36260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":36261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-ZP-CSI-RS-RESOURCESET-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":36263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f6473135f312b231f6e93ff30be3aa762170dee5817e17e05d9e786ee2361595","9928572ae6f000d79a31abab313108de2d2c54f5c5ed83d7e2d079db02d65e45","0bd0bb8ef03ab4e894e0b25e6e2fe380726ad41da0a68abaa5a320dd841bca64","a468450dcda111e46bb666d5ffccea5979f46cd71213509616122269952c4a53","76155882b20bc121a36c568c37089addba853b5ce9ab14d8181cee16933ee2e6","d39a25d06f041852ea8519626d1c2e735cbfd70a60cd2cfb8832c8f99b894898","dfe02c78edc26e5f376f81b093b936b3e976e6a43d58ee40cb301b5312dd3ad5","1d2b294ee5dd38b3358b6fdb010d4a9297a3a4fb041ccd962a7d126517ecf3f5","77482b2f58f86337bd49b759e8e0a64be42afbe9b41e904987490cab64340a59","d9e7b622cdd036dfbbaaad52dedca452a01a39d9a33b218dbae9b0625c905751","1dafd411ab273cbd3f9506861ef496a148bf1bc9ff8f2f8e8a8498dd595fe0cb","d98abfa6d6b7dbfc27693e448023fea0a8e47fc92ff379c80b293bbdc6ac5236","506fe41