{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    appLayerBufferLevelList-r18          ENUMERATED {true}                                                         OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":43224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    playoutDelayForMediaStartup-r18      ENUMERATED {true}                                                         OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":43225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":43226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":43227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-APPLAYERIDLEINACTIVECONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":43229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":43230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"AppLayerIdleInactiveConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":43232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"appLayerBufferLevelList","paragraph_zero_based":43233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field defines whether the buffer level for DASH streaming and VR service types can be collected as a RAN visible QoE metric from the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":43234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"configForRRC-IdleInactive","paragraph_zero_based":43235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field indicates whether the application layer measurement configuration is applicable to both RRC_IDLE and RRC_INACTIVE. The field is not configured if the application layer measurement configuration is only applicable to RRC_IDLE or only applicable to RRC_INACTIVE. If the field is not present, the UE assumes that the configuration is not applicable to RRC_IDLE and RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":43236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qoe-AreaScope","paragraph_zero_based":43237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field contains the area where the application layer measurement shall start if an application layer session starts.","paragraph_zero_based":43238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qoe-MeasurementType","paragraph_zero_based":43239},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the application layer measurement is signalling based or management based.","paragraph_zero_based":43240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qoe-Reference","paragraph_zero_based":43241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the QoE Reference as defined in TS 28.405 [55], clause 5.2.","paragraph_zero_based":43242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mce-id","paragraph_zero_based":43243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field contains the Measurement Collection Entity Id, see TS 28.405 [55].","paragraph_zero_based":43244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"playoutDelayForMediaStartup","paragraph_zero_based":43245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field defines whether the playout delay for DASH streaming and VR service types can be collected as a RAN visible QoE metric from the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":43246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43247}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["648ed6ab08764d0c9ebe11597ac9a58c1530f992cb0eb23999e45506f15ee177","3947466d54169b38c417931b1ef76d02b52b681efc8e764d8d82cbb854161f89","6cdec5d08007a56281b44be86da887fecd8ff42f7d6de38ca8a394dd9ee8cb66","8cdebf629fd99ffdc8a28cd3bf45bc1b3f10cb7a10ac320d23e97ca2cd869044","dc0b4b10f5a84e550942b7ae5d25f6c69144e7a45467a28bc55b3a402c37a27e","ece5c4559fc3f5839c0dbc3849ff9f107666b71303edd24792d0014e87a47f2c","e10ec41c00d2c95