{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If configured, it indicates the neighbouring frequency and cells for which UE is requested to perform measurement logging. It can include sync raster or non-sync raster frequencies.","paragraph_zero_based":43416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nid-IdentityList","paragraph_zero_based":43417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The nid-IdentityList contains one or more NID. All NIDs associated to the same PLMN ID are listed in the same nid-IdentityList entry.","paragraph_zero_based":43418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–BT-NameList","paragraph_zero_based":43420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE BT-NameList is used to indicate the names of the Bluetooth beacon which the UE is configured to measure.","paragraph_zero_based":43421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BT-NameList information element","paragraph_zero_based":43422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":43423},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BTNAMELIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":43424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BT-NameList-r16 ::=                SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxBT-Name-r16)) OF BT-Name-r16","paragraph_zero_based":43426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BT-Name-r16 ::=                    OCTET STRING (SIZE (1..248))","paragraph_zero_based":43428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BTNAMELIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":43430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":43431},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BT-NameList field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":43433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bt-Name","paragraph_zero_based":43434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If configured, the UE only performs Bluetooth measurements according to the names identified. For each name, it refers to LOCAL NAME defined in Bluetooth specification [51].","paragraph_zero_based":43435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–DedicatedInfoF1c","paragraph_zero_based":43437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE DedicatedInfoF1c is used to transfer IAB-DU specific F1-C related information between the network and the IAB node. The carried information consists of F1AP message encapsulated in SCTP/IP or F1-C related (SCTP)/IP packet, see TS 38.472 [64]. The RRC layer is transparent for this information.","paragraph_zero_based":43438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DedicatedInfoF1c information element","paragraph_zero_based":43439}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8b96dd450bc87f425f5816ddc08b1180d9e58f4514e2de70302e72c5b82362dd","bfc0c3f7a42744152180ab67e780e9a4c258ac19ed5792cde5138ff876e3f16f","1d5e0ba97be4919ab8cbd01d6793f68956574f9fd6e2721c44b906a17ea4de39","0f2aadafed631d3155bf1e01388dee3b08dfd48536719174b6b13b6249a0ee56","0d180a52a2c64c1ff0dd9b65a445d07d06fae16978b3825f342844b1254d965a","bdc20b58e461b492ead0d07fa1dd530a58dfe114ef626fc95c64ad513d0f8572","dd07c69d90c46e29545c89ef20868177201b0efc7e61a5db738533b61129ea5c","34c5c02f8b0f80fffac8a89774428ffd4a09fe238944560fd594b45a24c07a33","43e5db4c9fe6c85517419627dad20c4bc036c3fc852d7bb6dc28eb5d714b2d98","fcdbf54823d93ebff793e8da8f7955a7de5b41655bd96545062068e277e416d3","86