{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field as defined in MBSFN-SubframeConfig in TS 36.331 [10], where SFN refers to the SFN of the NR serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":43488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subframeAllocation1","paragraph_zero_based":43489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field as defined in MBSFN-SubframeConfig in TS 36.331 [10], where the UE assumes the duplex mode (FDD or TDD) of the NR cell for which the E-UTRA-MBSFN-SubframeConfig is provided.","paragraph_zero_based":43490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subframeAllocation2","paragraph_zero_based":43491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field as defined in MBSFN-SubframeConfig-v1430 in TS 36.331 [10], where the UE assumes the duplex mode (FDD or TDD) of the NR cell for which the E-UTRA-MBSFN-SubframeConfig is provided.","paragraph_zero_based":43492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–EUTRA-MultiBandInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":43494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE EUTRA-MultiBandInfoList indicates the list of frequency bands in addition to the band represented by CarrierFreq for which cell reselection parameters are common, and a list of additionalPmax and additionalSpectrumEmission.","paragraph_zero_based":43495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"EUTRA-MultiBandInfoList information element","paragraph_zero_based":43496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":43497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-EUTRA-MULTIBANDINFOLIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":43498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"EUTRA-MultiBandInfoList ::=     SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxMultiBands)) OF EUTRA-MultiBandInfo","paragraph_zero_based":43500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"EUTRA-MultiBandInfo ::=         SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":43502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    eutra-FreqBandIndicator         FreqBandIndicatorEUTRA,","paragraph_zero_based":43503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    eutra-NS-PmaxList               EUTRA-NS-PmaxList                           OPTIONAL    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":43504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":43505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-EUTRA-MULTIBANDINFOLIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":43507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":43508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–EUTRA-MultiBandInfoListAerial","paragraph_zero_based":43510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE EUTRA-MultiBandInfoListAerial indicates the list of frequency bands for aerial UE in addition to the band represented by CarrierFreq for which cell reselection parameters are common, and a list of additionalPmax and additionalSpectrumEmission.","paragraph_zero_based":43511}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4a5210ba38053564a6fd5351decf5b8c27338a05d6da183e2fbf35eefaa89602","5116b113416cf7de4b7fdc69bbbbec53c008a5701a4b9e79d3874d2fa851499d","2c569b55de46561ac590fad8c3f1c416494972b32a6702236f8208e7810c9602","aeea870854af166960a733301ed64587a02db67790ce71768f7d7d75c3fcd4b5","2b0f887e8cd9d03bb52d1eacd392dd6fbdb1d4e2dddbf09f158216f84eafdc0e","42839af47634551e2ebe65da9e71761bfd2f87965da89152a35f2c6df049b0d2","a42127c5aae9d49d8caf8152fcab9cc11bbb0a6465a44641a61423d93