{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PDU-SessionToReportUL-TrafficInfo-r18 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":43969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"     pdu-SessionID                            PDU-SessionID,","paragraph_zero_based":43970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"     qfi-ToReportUL-TrafficInfoList-r18       SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofQFIs)) OF QFI","paragraph_zero_based":43971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":43972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-OTHERCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":43974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":43975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"OtherConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":43977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig","paragraph_zero_based":43978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report the relaxation state of BFD measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":43979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"btNameList","paragraph_zero_based":43980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report measurements from specific Bluetooth beacons. NG-RAN configures the field if includeBT-Meas is configured for one or more measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":43981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateBandwidth","paragraph_zero_based":43982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the bandwidth of the candidate frequency range around the center frequency.","paragraph_zero_based":43983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateCenterFreq","paragraph_zero_based":43984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the center frequency of the candidate frequency range.","paragraph_zero_based":43985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateServingFreqListNR","paragraph_zero_based":43986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates for each candidate NR serving cells, the center frequency around which UE is requested to report IDC issues.","paragraph_zero_based":43987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateServingFreqRangeListNR","paragraph_zero_based":43988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the candidate frequency range with the combination of the center frequency and the candidate bandwidth, around which the UE is requested to report IDC issues.","paragraph_zero_based":43989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"connectedReporting","paragraph_zero_based":43990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that the UE can report a preference to remain in RRC_CONNECTED state following a report to leave RRC_CONNECTED state. If absent, the UE cannot report a preference to stay in RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":43991}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c8f025fcc500b7f9f0449ef8a1ad6a096831379560779cfa278163cf80bd423a","bacba7764312b0f3b794a837edc10000fb56e27d87ad31c2a0b4e5cc52cf42d0","d64e1e12fc9f9e0a0044a1148390e125ecebc617bf54b3492e3a0cf1f501d7e3","2ae1c45f9dfdd6a752a9ab5de79942e7f9f55758e20e92e9b90d9be5b88d641c","6aad147141dce9be9d7c647d9a9c9ee047e86afbdd8333bcd4200c5188d9fe89","26fc3333cc6cc2a5e16760dc549a58c40f61528bb4d42540aecfab435ec0ab9d","5fb1a877f7618e0f71a52ee357bd40e2d9b6dbc662bbafda3203b231bbf989ca","d626c0e5355b44b40824ecc1c32b82b8048cfba3db228d51657cf7c25045b84d","f924d015c635ec332b841262dce22c7c137bfe47cc80f1bc00157950c342915e","f2b5ca1e57e534c8344659686bff4105da