{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-CBR-LevelsDedicatedSL-PRS-RP-r18 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (0..maxCBR-LevelDedSL-PRS-1-r18)) OF SL-CBR-Dedicated-SL-PRS-RP-r18","paragraph_zero_based":44713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-CBR-SL-PRS-TxConfig-r18 ::=          SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":44715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PRS-CR-Limit-r18                     INTEGER(0..10000)                                                    OPTIONAL,    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":44716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PRS-MaxTx-power-r18                  INTEGER (-30..33)                                                    OPTIONAL,    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":44717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PRS-MaxNum-Transmissions-r18         INTEGER(1..32)                                                       OPTIONAL     -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":44718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":44719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-CBR-Dedicated-SL-PRS-RP-r18 ::= INTEGER (0..100)","paragraph_zero_based":44721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-CBR-COMMONTXDEDICATEDSL-PRS-RP-LIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":44723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":44724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-CBR-CommonTxDedicatedSL-PRS-RP-List field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":44726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CBR-RangeDedicatedSL-PRS-RP-List","paragraph_zero_based":44727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of CBR ranges. Each entry of the list indicates in SL-CBR-LevelsConfig-Dedicated-SL-PRS-RP the upper bound of the CBR range for the respective entry. The upper bounds of the CBR ranges are configured in ascending order for consecutive entries of SL-CBR-LevelsConfig-Dedicated-SL-PRS-RP. For the first entry of SL-CBR-LevelsConfig-Dedicated-SL-PRS-RP the lower bound of the CBR range is 0. Value 0 corresponds to 0, value 1 to 0.01, value 2 to 0.02, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":44728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CBR-SL-PRS-TxConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":44729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of available SL PRS transmission parameters configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":44730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PRS-CR-Limit","paragraph_zero_based":44731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum limit on the occupancy ratio. Value 0 corresponds to 0, value 1 to 0.0001, value 2 to 0.0002, and so on (i.e. in steps of 0.0001) until value 10000, which corresponds to 1.","paragraph_zero_based":44732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PRS-MaxNum-Transmissions","paragraph_zero_based":44733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates maximum Number of SL PRS (re-)transmissions.","paragraph_zero_based":44734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PRS-MaxTx-power","paragraph_zero_based":44735}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5382ef307506b7675c4ccc9d6b26820121dc74991bfc28f251e37188d59302e8","cd8cb44f2e76884d1c014492b2bb0dd51440193ac703ebfe5af09b2f56c7bef9","2bc2679bb5e9461681a89aa71135bf8fefee01f8a02ba2c98c7d0078337b67fa","1a4e450e036d40fe0a74ae8659aa75e05558d701ab5471499f898619dfb567