{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        ms2560                              INTEGER(0..2559),","paragraph_zero_based":45168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        ms5120                              INTEGER(0..5119),","paragraph_zero_based":45169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        ms10240                             INTEGER(0..10239)","paragraph_zero_based":45170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    },","paragraph_zero_based":45171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-drx-SlotOffset                       INTEGER (0..31)","paragraph_zero_based":45172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":45173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":45174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-DRX-CONFIGUC-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":45175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":45176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":45177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":45178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-DRX-ConfigUC field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":45179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-CycleStartOffset","paragraph_zero_based":45180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sidelink drx-Cycle in ms and sidelink drx-StartOffset in multiples of 1 ms.","paragraph_zero_based":45181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-HARQ-RTT-Timer1, sl-drx-HARQ-RTT-Timer2","paragraph_zero_based":45182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the BWP where the transport block was received. Value sl0 corresponds to 0 slots, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on. sl-drx-HARQ-RTT-Timer1 is used for HARQ feedback enabled sidelink retransmission if SCI does not indicate retransmission resource(s). sl-drx-HARQ-RTT-Timer2 is used for HARQ feedback disabled sidelink retransmission in resource pool configured with PSFCH if SCI does not indicate retransmission resource(s).","paragraph_zero_based":45183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-InactivityTimer","paragraph_zero_based":45184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the BWP where the transport block was received, sl0 corresponds to 0, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":45185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-onDurationTimer","paragraph_zero_based":45186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiples of 1/32 ms (subMilliSeconds) or in ms (milliSecond). For the latter, value ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, value ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":45187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-RetransmissionTimer","paragraph_zero_based":45188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the BWP where the transport block was received. Value sl0 corresponds to 0 slots, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":45189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-drx-SlotOffset","paragraph_zero_based":45190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in 1/32 ms. Value 0 corresponds to 0 ms, value 1 corresponds to 1/32 ms, value 2 corresponds to 2/32 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":45191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f5595411dbe39085c7b45705969c4cb72444870c2bdcd47306096d63e6888573","1a2c2582729c47cad17378efb00d3b8154c95ea8706e680881cb8cb43a44f6b7","d2a732cfa5b1f96db25403d732edb05361ddc849fae29a723d87abaa87aeba16","664b5a68b6f9929488e3aab11ffee5f5374c2fc6eaf8803314f92d96105