{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ue-ToUE-COT-SharingED-Threshold-r18    INTEGER (-85..-52)                                      OPTIONAL,  -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":45264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    harq-ACKFeedbackRatioforCW-AdjustmentGC-Option2-r18 INTEGER (10..100)                              OPTIONAL,  -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":45265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":45266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":45267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":45268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-FREQCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":45269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":45270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":45271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-FreqConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":45272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"absenceOfAnyOtherTechnology","paragraph_zero_based":45273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Presence of this field indicates absence on a long term basis (e.g. by level of regulation) of any other technology sharing the carrier; absence of this field indicates the potential presence of any other technology sharing the carrier, as specified in TS 37.213 [48] clauses 4.5. This parameter is not expected to be provided if the sidelink carrier is overlapped with uplink carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":45274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-EnergyDetectionConfig","paragraph_zero_based":45275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether to use the maxEnergyDetectionThreshold or the energyDetectionThresholdOffset (see TS 37.213 [48], clause 4.5.5).","paragraph_zero_based":45276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-EnergyDetectionThresholdOffset","paragraph_zero_based":45277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the offset to the default maximum energy detection threshold value. Unit in dB. Value -13 corresponds to -13dB, value -12 corresponds to -12dB, and so on (i.e. in steps of 1dB) as specified in TS 37.213 [48], clause 4.5.5.","paragraph_zero_based":45278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyShift7p5khzSL","paragraph_zero_based":45279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Enable the NR SL transmission with a 7.5 kHz shift to the LTE raster. If the field is absent, the frequency shift is disabled.","paragraph_zero_based":45280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"harq-ACKFeedbackRatioforCW-AdjustmentGC-Option2","paragraph_zero_based":45281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the ratio threshold for contention window adjustment for SL groupcast option 2 as specified in TS 37.213 [48], clause 4.5.4. Unit is percentage.","paragraph_zero_based":45282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MaxEnergyDetectionThreshold","paragraph_zero_based":45283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the absolute maximum energy detection threshold value. Unit in dBm. Value -85 corresponds to -85 dBm, value -84 corresponds to -84 dBm, and so on (i.e. in steps of 1dBm) as specified in TS 37.213 [48], clause 4.5.5.","paragraph_zero_based":45284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-AbsoluteFrequencyPointA","paragraph_zero_based":45285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Absolute frequency of the reference resource block (Common RB 0). Its lowest subcarrier is also known as Point A.","paragraph_zero_based":45286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-AbsoluteFrequencySSB","paragraph_zero_based":45287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["09c24d9fbd4f31f95199