{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the frequency location of sidelink SSB. The transmission bandwidth for sidelink SSB is within the bandwidth of this sidelink BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":45288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-ToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":45289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the list of sidelink BWP(s) on which the NR sidelink communication configuration is to be added or reconfigured. In this release, only one BWP is allowed to be configured for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":45290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-ToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":45291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the list of sidelink BWP(s) on which the NR sidelink communication configuration is to be released. ","paragraph_zero_based":45292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-Freq-Id","paragraph_zero_based":45293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the identity of the dedicated configuration information on the carrier frequency for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":45294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SCS-SpecificCarrierList","paragraph_zero_based":45295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A set of UE specific channel bandwidth and location configurations for different subcarrier spacings (numerologies). Defined in relation to Point A. The UE uses the configuration provided in this field only for the purpose of channel bandwidth and location determination. In this release, only one SCS-SpecificCarrier is allowed to be configured for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":45296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SyncTxDisabled","paragraph_zero_based":45297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that the carrier, even though equipped with synchronisation resources, cannot be used as a synchronisation carrier frequency to transmit S-SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":45298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SyncPriority","paragraph_zero_based":45299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates synchronization priority order, as specified in clause 5.8.6. All values in sl-SyncPriority are same across all carrier frequencies configured for UEs performing NR sidelink communication on multiple carrier frequencies.","paragraph_zero_based":45300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ue-ToUE-COT-SharingED-Threshold","paragraph_zero_based":45301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the energy detection threshold that is to be used by a UE to initiate a channel occupancy to be shared to other UE(s), and another UE that shares the initiated channel occupancy shall use this configured parameter for accessing the channel(s) as specified in TS 37.213 [48], clause 4.5.5 for sidelink channel access. Unit in dBm. Value -85 corresponds to -85 dBm, value -84 corresponds to -84 dBm, and so on (i.e. in steps of 1dBm).","paragraph_zero_based":45302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"valueN","paragraph_zero_based":45303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the NR SL transmission with a valueN *5kHz shift to the LTE raster. (see TS 38.101-1 [15], clause 5.4E.2).","paragraph_zero_based":45304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":45305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":45306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":45307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"V2X-SL-Shared","paragraph_zero_based":45308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present if the carrier frequency configured for NR sidelink communication is shared by V2X sidelink communication. It is absent, Need R, otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":45309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":45310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-FreqConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":45311}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["793ac9a8d1b1cda69a92eea6a6b45a721296a825752d823d97a6b2a08b88ff10","232b9474391465533030b259a739effa42339bec1e0c2a468339b39dc333556f","7e3ecd7c9124947623805c07c54f273a48a18bc602b0e16fe71259b21b4bd173","bf515c1863b059a68cb9b8a247e56e8e04f9bdbd8e8d26078b9b3746ada2a5c6","1435099ca262e1f403acccbd8cfb42ab2a43b8c3a66912f4fee87ab46fc06ed3","809ecbb6f6216bf6191ef1beefc3fc4d049d5c71bd36b97c8969001de2940755","e10482cde7fbfcb66de03ad2898c475290f6da45c5c9da3c8656e3cfdfb1d2b0","8a57a0ef5a452a8297864a2dc1cef618be9f97ff3e220b803df2084e85f3cfb7","fde7000bbe1ce27e3103d35b7aa8cf8bf0230219e6fd81753789ea68398a01b4","6dcb23dcfb6c9e41c20426ffd9aa44154dfb3d09b523db1f5356d819ae5e33a5","11fb54905ec359aac0ff330dd0d0c04e42de2edd1efed96e2fca64e8b376f6e8","8239874c9079971a0644e7396ef323e843763c8f8233a461771dc119e2e189ff","7477e6cb228bb2d74067625651ec3d3f8c9977a7670cc39ab466c4bca87a4330","b31e0967b9f1c54587393f4f525c19107a1139c18d984c0bd5cd130c5a130321","0a0a6b1abb5e8cbfed4406a2d17c04a5aeefc1b9ce8955c1520ff31be32e2eb3","b1715255d5015f3754ede2555088b5cc79214061d85da39fe494e48ac60a47cc","10830c3ea5319fc8b97d1f33fbbd9588ee5258f928c875594536e28573a275cb","2296a635ceaab254e90809fc7a87a0ddf74fa3a918d8b6a764de94cfae58ade3","201b18eb5fd999ae4c17f0124af751e4272d5e86516c6be117237b2faa94dadc","70a433c3f1a96a522e3cbaa2d88fa47d3d59f0e241da609e5790de8b07299def","ee7f612806b64bc292acd83c976e8245709098438c170073409830ab12750c3b","3e67b63752e76102d46fa7b66d11a788763241b373ee5477092939f0f11dbdf4","72dca088e854451e2259115385686bc285c95ffc8a67dcf820a56841a71703ef","681667ec6e57a05c59fbe4c15564083ef5a75d19151957bb75b0b4905ec7b71c"],"paragr