{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-PSBCH-CONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":46152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":46153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSBCH-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":46155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-Alpha-PSBCH","paragraph_zero_based":46156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates alpha value for DL pathloss based power control for PSBCH. When the field is not configured the UE applies the value 1.","paragraph_zero_based":46157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-P0-PSBCH","paragraph_zero_based":46158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates P0 value for DL pathloss based power control for PSBCH. If not configured, DL pathloss based power control is disabled for PSBCH. When dl-P0-PSBCH-r17 is configured, the UE ignores dl-P0-PSBCH-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":46159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A Remote UE which is out of coverage, considers downlink pathloss based power control is disabled for PSBCH when dl-P0-PSBCH is configured.","paragraph_zero_based":46160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":46162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList indicates PSSCH transmission parameters. When lower layers select parameters from the range indicated in IE SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList, the UE considers both configurations in IE SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList and the CBR-dependent configurations represented in IE SL-CBR-PriorityTxConfigList. Only one IE SL-PSSCH-TxConfig is provided per SL-TypeTxSync.","paragraph_zero_based":46163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList information element","paragraph_zero_based":46164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":46165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-PSSCH-TXCONFIGLIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":46166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46167},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSSCH-TxConfigList-r16 ::=    SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxPSSCH-TxConfig-r16)) OF SL-PSSCH-TxConfig-r16","paragraph_zero_based":46168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSSCH-TxConfig-r16 ::=        SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":46170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-TypeTxSync-r16                SL-TypeTxSync-r16                                   OPTIONAL,    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":46171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-ThresUE-Speed-r16             ENUMERATED {kmph60, kmph80, kmph100, kmph120,","paragraph_zero_based":46172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                kmph140, kmph160, kmph180, kmph200},","paragraph_zero_based":46173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-ParametersAboveThres-r16      SL-PSSCH-TxParameters-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":46174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-ParametersBelowThres-r16      SL-PSSCH-TxParameters-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":46175}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d14688bb127056cb806081e6d2bf7dab3d79d7ce3691c474c0c026195dfd5e22","f55a863c1dcad9974e178e87520c7426b63ac07f5c9264ea7b3b93fd157ce89e","402f1adb51f87bb6c291a8efc373d8ba0fbf1905e211e209c2545be998f4a4fe","19308f984558bfc991bae6d9cf32fb0dc41ab73ed4cce24b427ea2ae30d85dbf","c7a6e14dd327829992f3087d28733751190d859015f2c291e748a6482524ebbb","dacb