{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToAddList-r16         SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofSL-QFIs-r16)) OF SL-QoS-FlowIdentity-r16  OPTIONAL,    -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":47208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToReleaseList-r16      SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofSL-QFIs-r16)) OF SL-QoS-FlowIdentity-r16  OPTIONAL     -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":47209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":47210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-SDAP-CONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":47212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":47213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-SDAP-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":47215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-DefaultRB","paragraph_zero_based":47216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether or not this is the default sidelink DRB for this NR sidelink communication transmission destination. Among all configured instances of SL-SDAP-Config for this destination, this field shall be set to true in at most one instance of SL-SDAP-Config and to false in all other instances.","paragraph_zero_based":47217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MappedQoS-Flows","paragraph_zero_based":47218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates QoS flows to be mapped to the sidelink DRB. If the field is included in dedicated signalling, it is set to sl-MappedQoS-FlowsListDedicated; otherwise, it is set to sl-MappedQoS-FlowsList.","paragraph_zero_based":47219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MappedQoS-FlowsList","paragraph_zero_based":47220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of QoS profiles of the NR sidelink communication transmission destination mapped to this sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":47221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToAddList","paragraph_zero_based":47222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of SL QoS flows ID of the NR sidelink communication transmission destination to be additionally mapped to this sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":47223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":47224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of SL QoS flows ID of the NR sidelink communication transmission destination to be released from existing QoS flow to SLRB mapping of this sidelink DRB. ","paragraph_zero_based":47225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SDAP-Header","paragraph_zero_based":47226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether or not a SDAP header is present on this sidelink DRB. The field cannot be changed after a sidelink DRB is established. This field is set to present if the field sl-DefaultRB is set to true.","paragraph_zero_based":47227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-ServingCellInfo","paragraph_zero_based":47229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-ServingCellInfo is used to indicate the L2 U2N Relay UE's PCell/camping cell, which is considered as PCell/camping cell by the L2 U2N Remote UEs connecting with this L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":47230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-ServingCellInfo information element","paragraph_zero_based":47231}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["02e7e0c0110bc147d0f690cfba8c9a0fee4b670bd575a9038f5b26c635fc5ea2","156d0f038f3b696