{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-Thres-RSRP-List","paragraph_zero_based":47400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"IE SL-Thres-RSRP-List indicates a threshold used for sensing based UE autonomous resource selection (see TS 38.215 [9]). A resource is excluded if it is indicated or reserved by a decoded SCI and PSSCH/PSCCH RSRP in the associated data resource is above the threshold defined by IE SL-Thres-RSRP-List. A NR sidelink resource is excluded if the corresponding PSFCH transmission occasions overlap with resources indicated or reserved by the decoded EUTRA SCI in time domain and EUTRA PSSCH RSRP in the associated data resource is above the threshold defined by IE sl-NRPSFCH-EUTRA-ThresRSRP-List. A NR sidelink resource is excluded if it is indicated or reserved by the decoded EUTRA SCI and EUTRA PSSCH RSRP in the associated data resource is above the threshold defined by IE sl-NRPSSCH-EUTRA-ThresRSRP-List. Value 0 corresponds to minus infinity dBm, value 1 corresponds to -128dBm, value 2 corresponds to -126dBm, value n corresponds to (-128 + (n-1)*2) dBm and so on, value 66 corresponds to infinity dBm.","paragraph_zero_based":47401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-Thres-RSRP-List information element","paragraph_zero_based":47402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":47403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-THRES-RSRP-LIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":47404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-Thres-RSRP-List-r16 ::=    SEQUENCE (SIZE (64)) OF SL-Thres-RSRP-r16","paragraph_zero_based":47406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47407},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-Thres-RSRP-r16 ::=         INTEGER (0..66)","paragraph_zero_based":47408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-THRES-RSRP-LIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":47410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":47411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-TxPower","paragraph_zero_based":47413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-TxPower is used to limit the UE's sidelink transmission power on a carrier frequency. The unit is dBm. Value minusinfinity corresponds to –infinity.","paragraph_zero_based":47414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-TxPower information element","paragraph_zero_based":47415},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":47416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-TXPOWER-START","paragraph_zero_based":47417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-TxPower-r16 ::=                    CHOICE{","paragraph_zero_based":47419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    minusinfinity-r16                     NULL,","paragraph_zero_based":47420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    txPower-r16                           INTEGER (-30..33)","paragraph_zero_based":47421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":47422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47423}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a9292ca68b14832add616f7cfda62299b184a71a4b191140f7f22f3341da2e14","1564d7f213572251743965ff11a409cb62c3c268f1e10d0d200c88e778768321","afe5e4aca0854fb3e0847ea2a035369d2026491e6f2756352b4cf3d22bcd70be","fe6b128c38131ebbc3b94cda37edeffe158d6f9fd218b0009277a98c6d9940c1","8649f5b1d0b8272a