{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-CBR-CommonTxConfigList-r16                SL-CBR-CommonTxConfigList-r16                               OPTIONAL,    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":47448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ul-PrioritizationThres-r16                   INTEGER (1..16)                                             OPTIONAL,    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":47449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PrioritizationThres-r16                   INTEGER (1..8)                                              OPTIONAL,    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":47450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":47451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":47452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-CBR-CommonTxDedicatedSL-PRS-RP-List-r18  SL-CBR-CommonTxDedicatedSL-PRS-RP-List-r18                 OPTIONAL    -- Cond notSIB12","paragraph_zero_based":47453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":47454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47455},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":47456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-UE-SELECTEDCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":47458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":47459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-UE-SelectedConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":47461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PrioritizationThres","paragraph_zero_based":47462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the SL priority threshold, which is used to determine whether SL TX is prioritized over UL TX, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. Network does not configure the sl-PrioritizationThres and the ul-PrioritizationThres to the UE separately.","paragraph_zero_based":47463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-ProbResourceKeep","paragraph_zero_based":47464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the probability with which the UE keeps the current resource when the resource reselection counter reaches zero for sensing based UE autonomous resource selection (see TS 38.321 [3]).","paragraph_zero_based":47465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PSSCH-TxConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":47466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates PSSCH TX parameters such as MCS, sub-channel number, retransmission number, associated to different UE absolute speeds and different synchronization reference types for UE autonomous resource selection.","paragraph_zero_based":47467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-ReselectAfter","paragraph_zero_based":47468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the number of consecutive skipped transmissions before triggering resource reselection for sidelink communication (see TS 38.321 [3]).","paragraph_zero_based":47469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ul-PrioritizationThres","paragraph_zero_based":47470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the UL priority threshold, which is used to determine whether SL TX is prioritized over UL TX, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. Network does not configure the sl-PrioritizationThres and the ul-PrioritizationThres to the UE separately.","paragraph_zero_based":47471}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3eea5319dc178c829774619f80534802f6a5f066125dc1528e987a9edb6885fa","6f3ee5a67248e5248fff21cc311a635b2e1acb22759b43a9662d8e8b9349c9d1","0f86a113a906da5616250ae900aaf64af8c9e