{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiple integers of 1 ms. ms0 corresponds to 0, ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":47616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-LongCycleStartOffsetPTM","paragraph_zero_based":47617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-LongCycle-PTM in ms and drx-StartOffset-PTM in multiples of 1 ms.","paragraph_zero_based":47618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-onDurationTimerPTM","paragraph_zero_based":47619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiples of 1/32 ms (subMilliSeconds) or in ms (milliSecond). For the latter, value ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, value ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":47620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-RetransmissionTimer-DL-PTM","paragraph_zero_based":47621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the CFR where the transport block was received. value sl0 corresponds to 0 slots, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":47622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-SlotOffsetPTM","paragraph_zero_based":47623},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in 1/32 ms. Value 0 corresponds to 0 ms, value 1 corresponds to 1/32 ms, value 2 corresponds to 2/32 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":47624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":47626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":47627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HARQFeedback","paragraph_zero_based":47628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present if HARQ feedback is enabled for a G-RNTI/G-CS-RNTI associated with this DRX configuration. The field is optionally present if the IE DRX-ConfigPTM is included in MBSMulticastConfiguration, need R. It is optionally present. Need R, otherwise. ","paragraph_zero_based":47629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MBS-NeighbourCellList","paragraph_zero_based":47631},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MBS-NeighbourCellList indicates a list of neighbour cells where ongoing MBS sessions provided via broadcast MRB in the current cell may also be provided, as indicated in the mtch-NeighbourCell.","paragraph_zero_based":47632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBS-NeighbourCellList information element","paragraph_zero_based":47633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":47634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MBS-NEIGHBOURCELLLIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":47635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBS-NeighbourCellList-r17 ::=     SEQUENCE (SIZE (0..maxNeighCellMBS-r17)) OF MBS-NeighbourCell-r17","paragraph_zero_based":47637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBS-NeighbourCell-r17 ::=         SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":47639}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["886f829613ceeb1c7cc6237b75d9febe5be0231d1264972e6c7bb3cc1d6e0e70","3bbfc4b02fd616fd7e8fb5a806ac9edb204cef46943b1de989b6853acbfbf81a","7eed50875d868a8fc54c792206c57dd3dc57004dd2b7ebcd23cbe3e041a2175c","a9c3fc99ca456b6702fe55010c43eb4ba9aba70b992078e6e974ad1846a239ce","8899df3de5d56683ada62937ddfea3fb4a91c70c138401de89af6c32f0468d9c","bacbc8eb59d3b8ba41056273eb85760f05f096ebcabceeefed504da3d12e0a0e","368ca2e0bdc98eb5099