{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the CFR bandwidth of the non-serving cell for MBS broadcast reception.","paragraph_zero_based":47688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cfr-LocationAndBW","paragraph_zero_based":47689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the CFR location and bandwidth of the non-serving cell for MBS broadcast reception.","paragraph_zero_based":47690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subcarrierSpacing","paragraph_zero_based":47691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the subcarrier spacing of the CORESET#0 of the non-serving cell for MBS broadcast reception.","paragraph_zero_based":47692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CFR-LocationAndBW field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":47694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"locationAndBandwidthMBS","paragraph_zero_based":47695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the starting PRB and the number of PRBs of CFR used for MBS broadcast reception from non-serving cell. The value of the field shall be interpreted as resource indicator value (RIV) as defined TS 38.214 [19] with assumptions as described in TS 38.213 [13]. The first PRB is a PRB determined by subcarrierSpacing, offsetToCarrierMBS and absoluteFrequencyPointA-MBS of the non-serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":47696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"absoluteFrequencyPointA-MBS","paragraph_zero_based":47697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the absolute frequency position of the reference resource block (Common RB 0) of the non-serving cell for MBS broadcast reception. Its lowest subcarrier is also known as Point A (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 4.4.4.2). ","paragraph_zero_based":47698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"offsetToCarrierMBS","paragraph_zero_based":47699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the offset in frequency domain between Point A (lowest subcarrier of common RB 0) and the lowest usable subcarrier on this carrier in number of PRBs (using the subcarrierSpacing indicated for the non-serving cell).","paragraph_zero_based":47700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MBS-ServiceList","paragraph_zero_based":47702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MBS- ServiceList is used to inform the network of the MBS services that the UE is receiving or interested to receive.","paragraph_zero_based":47703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBS-ServiceList information element","paragraph_zero_based":47704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":47705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MBS-SERVICELIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":47706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBS-ServiceList-r17 ::=         SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofMBS-ServiceListPerUE-r17)) OF MBS-ServiceInfo-r17","paragraph_zero_based":47708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBS-ServiceInfo-r17 ::=         SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":47710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    tmgi-r17                        TMGI-r17","paragraph_zero_based":47711}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["70b16b6451e8c07076f4cb90c02cae6ffc6cb4952ade28dc38387543c5d211ce","24ac706f4b5a6a693a131b92b6703d4ee23ca8d8814bca8409bd52e41bc36d37","ddf821add294d5ffd00d4acd580e7848d686d009124aa27e7a0783cb8d9d614f","723e58c5a11b4f9d5e99a7c1ac4c03b2e2fdc4ffb22485aaeea1c223db40ecd8",