{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":48816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RemoteUEInformationSidelink-IEs field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":48818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"connectionForMP","paragraph_zero_based":48819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the connected L2 U2N Relay UE by the L2 U2N Remote UE that the access is for MP.","paragraph_zero_based":48820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE","paragraph_zero_based":48821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the L2 U2N Remote UE's UE specific DRX cycle as the minimum value of the one provided by upper layers (if configured) and the one provided by RRC layer (if configured). Value rf32 corresponds to 32 radio frames, value rf64 corresponds to 64 radio frames and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":48822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE","paragraph_zero_based":48823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the L2 U2N Remote UE's paging UE ID.","paragraph_zero_based":48824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE","paragraph_zero_based":48825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the paging information used by L2 U2N Relay UE to perform the connected L2 U2N Remote UE's paging monitoring.","paragraph_zero_based":48826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RequestedPosSIB-List","paragraph_zero_based":48827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains a list of requested PosSIBs.","paragraph_zero_based":48828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RequestedSIB-List","paragraph_zero_based":48829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains a list of requested SIBs.","paragraph_zero_based":48830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SFN-DFN-OffsetRequested","paragraph_zero_based":48831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If present, this field indicates that the L2 U2N Remote UE requests the L2 U2N Relay UE to provide the SFN-DFN offset in a subsequent RRCReconfigurationSidelink message.","paragraph_zero_based":48832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-SIB-ReqInfo","paragraph_zero_based":48833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the requested SIB type. Values sibNotReq11, sibNotReq10, …, sibNotReq1 shall be ignored by L2 U2N relay UE (i.e., no SIB requested).","paragraph_zero_based":48834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional presence","paragraph_zero_based":48836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":48837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS-ID-SBAS","paragraph_zero_based":48838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present if gnss-id is set to sbas. It is absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":48839}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["90cfb6327d8b37f42cad6f0afe1f3b5a359f36bffcbe95f01a3c2f45cc774f34","14515890c121ff3b7b396e031c39fb0996059b294807c80a76f97cc71c66bef6","9c9772841709446f3b9472445595a96a3121a58ec1ac4556be928d18cc3b78f5","249f2e1aa49eb6cc69f10e524f2ea8b264a0d03c01bf7756cd2c8ea4e41fe405","afe570ef9acf31d8907ed8c29327926c6d24a96fffff98c897e914cb3443b655","a2814bda3d6113e7d1c268b5f442e4be05d6bfb50c92bca6da420f794d9f9928","8ed71b83e8a092aa0a813bda2ca49489461062b6aa622c8a0530b53d171dc4f9","ccad4d4e868126b6c3ef0cb66cedb3777421c3841a71a3cd2e1dce3622c90874","e9fcbd019cabaea9eaf60485f23b010ea33c8e2237f855e2ee6eb507b5ffe6de","01cd11c872d8524c9e4dc96b7c8d8a0ede99b3f12770aec85f7c5db2efb32a42","41