{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-SlotOffset-r18                       INTEGER (0..31)","paragraph_zero_based":48984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":48985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-SRAP-ConfigPC5-r18 ::=               SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":48987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PeerRemoteUE-L2Identity-r18          SL-DestinationIdentity-r16                                          OPTIONAL, -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":48988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PeerRemoteUE-LocalIdentity-r18       INTEGER (0..255)                                                    OPTIONAL, -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":48989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-RemoteUE-L2Identity-r18              SL-SourceIdentity-r17                                               OPTIONAL, -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":48990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-RemoteUE-LocalIdentity-r18           INTEGER (0..255)                                                    OPTIONAL, -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":48991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":48992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":48993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-RRCRECONFIGURATIONSIDELINK-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":48995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":48996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor's note: Whether the field sl-AbsoluteFrequencyPointA, together with sl-OffsetToCarrier, is sufficient for Rx UE to understand the carrier to add/modify/release from Rx UE perspective.","paragraph_zero_based":48998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRCReconfigurationSidelink field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":49000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-AbsoluteFrequencyPointA","paragraph_zero_based":49001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Absolute frequency of the reference resource block (Common RB 0). Its lowest subcarrier is also known as Point A.","paragraph_zero_based":49002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CarrierToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":49003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the carrier(s) to be added/modified for transmission by UE transmitting RRCReconfigurationSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":49004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CarrierToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":49005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the carrier(s) to be released for the transmission by UE transmitting RRCReconfigurationSidelink message.","paragraph_zero_based":49006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CSI-RS-FreqAllocation","paragraph_zero_based":49007}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["578d85ab2f2abb2d21fc4477c9a78db9d53ee08695bc6b4ea98c7933b7cc260d","02b1026419dc39f9887fc165226d04d33f139bc27f7080fa044081015a901875","bcae3a0999451ee76f860cb3832c9d5f460da78a4967474d12dc40135c7d4380","8c25f77bf4639b80876cb26aee1c2d7dafb6c02ee795227d4e575be3d1bc175d","a54d4c17bc22793c79df30979f731e84e0d553bdf65833b8b894a7e93fd62f73","288fa786ac81cb765cac3513dc69b83cecb36742a1058e91a86449e9fe52eb25","18d90817803be4447c2dd5003f2b827ee54fa2b7b482b98a487e59e7e495813d","6704db7ac6ff9762f74df7cafc8e14595abe3febac913e91393e185e6180c2e6","6421061acca09d4825e14fe559a7e1bb310b