{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that the full configuration should be applicable for the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message.","paragraph_zero_based":49032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RLC-BearerToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":49033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the additional Sidelink RLC bearer to be added / modified for the configured sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":49034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":49035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the additional Sidelink RLC bearer to be released for the configured sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":49036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SDAP-Header","paragraph_zero_based":49037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether or not a SDAP header is present on this sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":49038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SFN-DFN-Offset","paragraph_zero_based":49039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the SFN-DFN offset to be used for determining the SFN timeline based on the DFN timeline.","paragraph_zero_based":49040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SRB-IdentityWithDuplication","paragraph_zero_based":49041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the sidelink SRB for which duplication is configured.","paragraph_zero_based":49042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"slrb-PC5-ConfigIndex","paragraph_zero_based":49043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the identity of the configuration of a sidelink DRB. In case of L2 U2U relay, only value 4-31 can be signaled for end-to-end sidelink DRB, and all other values are reserved.","paragraph_zero_based":49044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":49045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-SRAP-ConfigPC5 field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":49046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RemoteUE-LocalIdentity","paragraph_zero_based":49047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the local UE ID of the L2 U2U Remote UE used in SRAP as specified in TS 38.351 [66].","paragraph_zero_based":49048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RemoteUE-L2Identity","paragraph_zero_based":49049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the Source L2 ID of the L2 U2U Remote UE as specified in TS 23.304 [65].","paragraph_zero_based":49050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PeerRemoteUE-LocalIdentity","paragraph_zero_based":49051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the local UE ID of the peer L2 U2U Remote UE used in SRAP as specified in TS 38.351 [66].","paragraph_zero_based":49052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PeerRemoteUE-L2Identity","paragraph_zero_based":49053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the Source L2 ID of the peer L2 U2U Remote UE as specified in TS 23.304 [65].","paragraph_zero_based":49054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":49055}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["65035876f85c4ec9cba32ec2cf0887a396fd1619f45f12b2e2ac34b4f279a9d1","88088ea6c251671092c871e990512544a68934712cceb954669f2d17889cc484","58ba8c6d26ec311dfb9dc308cbbb48007d8a81a736f046ba976cb315cec9db6d","f465b0d1da21bb4028fa2843705b50c3f6e5aa8ad13078b474d0c316e979a14a","f3ab3613173883dbf0162e5479968b1c9e2ff797d50a42f59573927c07a55106","f34b881ce0fe0bfedb0bb6de9a6f67795a38318da63b5aab68da0df3e0688bb5","f3b4def991530acd6ae51b6c34149400cac520deaf73348e10411ef156caaf36","116909fb8287a907d0a78915c9602c7d7e558a01c75de981800478f17f3b51fe","baee84317f46fe705a427d55eeb658f01a348140e4f0b58fa41ea47cb8b5