{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T342","paragraph_zero_based":49536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with DelayBudgetReport.","paragraph_zero_based":49537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing delayBudgetReportingConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, and upon receiving delayBudgetReportingConfig set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":49538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":49539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T345","paragraph_zero_based":49540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with overheatingAssistance","paragraph_zero_based":49541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing overheatingAssistanceConfig during the connection re-establishment procedure, upon initiating the connection resumption procedure, and upon receiving overheatingAssistanceConfig set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":49542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":49543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346a (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":49544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with drx-Preference.","paragraph_zero_based":49545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing drx-PreferenceConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving drx-PreferenceConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":49546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":49547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346b (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":49548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with maxBW-Preference.","paragraph_zero_based":49549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing maxBW-PreferenceConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving maxBW-PreferenceConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":49550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":49551},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346c (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":49552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with maxCC-Preference.","paragraph_zero_based":49553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing maxCC-PreferenceConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving maxCC-PreferenceConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":49554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":49555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346d (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":49556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with maxMIMO-LayerPreference.","paragraph_zero_based":49557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":49558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":49559}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1cfa3e61c1f1cd0ebb259651274449feab66aa186a560a4635