{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346k (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":49584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":49585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":49586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":49587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346l","paragraph_zero_based":49588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(The UE maintains one instance of this timer per QoS flow)","paragraph_zero_based":49589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with ul-TrafficInfo for the concerned QoS flow.","paragraph_zero_based":49590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing ul-TrafficInfoReportingConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, or upon receiving ul-TrafficInfoReportingConfig set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":49591},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":49592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346m","paragraph_zero_based":49593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with multiRx-PreferenceFR2.","paragraph_zero_based":49594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing multiRx-PreferenceReportingConfigFR2 during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving multiRx-PreferenceReportingConfigFR2 set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":49595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":49596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346n","paragraph_zero_based":49597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmission of MUSIM temporary restriction of musim-CapRestriction for constraint combination of bands and/or band(s) or combination bands to avoid ","paragraph_zero_based":49598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing musim-CapabilityRestrictionConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, or upon receiving musim-CapabilityRestrictionConfig set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":49599},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action. ","paragraph_zero_based":49600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T348","paragraph_zero_based":49601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmission of MUSIM temporary restriction of musim-CapRestriction for serving cell(s) with capabilities restricted, release of SCell or release of SCG. ","paragraph_zero_based":49602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCReconfiguration message that does not exceed UE temporary capability restriction transmitted via musim-CapRestriction.","paragraph_zero_based":49603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE may apply the temporary UE capability restriction in accordance with the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-CapRestriction.","paragraph_zero_based":49604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T350","paragraph_zero_based":49605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting DedicatedSIBRequest message with requestedSIB-List and/or  requestedPosSIB-List.","paragraph_zero_based":49606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon acquiring the requested SIB(s) or posSIB(s), upon releasing onDemandSIB-Request during the connection re-establishment procedures, upon receiving onDemandSIB-Request set to release, upon reception of RRCRelease or upon successful change of PCell while in RRC_CONNECTED.","paragraph_zero_based":49607}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_co