{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.2.2.6.","paragraph_zero_based":49632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":49633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor's Note: FFS the stop condition for other cases, i.e. PC5-RRC trigger, CONNECTED relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":49634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":49635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7.1.2Timer handling","paragraph_zero_based":49636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When the UE applies zero value for a timer, the timer shall be started and immediately expire unless explicitly stated otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":49637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7.2Counters","paragraph_zero_based":49638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Counter","paragraph_zero_based":49639},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reset","paragraph_zero_based":49640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Incremented","paragraph_zero_based":49641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When reaching max value","paragraph_zero_based":49642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N310","paragraph_zero_based":49643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of \"in-sync\" indication from lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":49644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"upon receiving RRCReconfiguration with reconfigurationWithSync for that cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":49645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"upon initiating the connection re-establishment procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":49646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of \"out-of-sync\" from lower layer while the timer T310 is stopped.","paragraph_zero_based":49647},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Start timer T310","paragraph_zero_based":49648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N311","paragraph_zero_based":49649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of \"out-of-sync\" indication from lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":49650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"upon receiving RRCReconfiguration with reconfigurationWithSync for that cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":49651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"upon initiating the connection re-establishment procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":49652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of the \"in-sync\" from lower layer while the timer T310 is running.","paragraph_zero_based":49653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Stop the timer T310.","paragraph_zero_based":49654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":49655}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e5898e81e9960426355465b125b153569cd87a1fb45e4c9a40a3e23534a722cf","7d5fcc0d9c94482adf94808eba5155758e898ee99ae70171f03be264ce84d7d0","0905b6b925228824f0e3d919e308395cff02b8ae9c7bfaf27aa83ca057765e16","2561b4fdb254ceaea3aa7efb984c20c4f5cba4f446078ab57846f807dcde597a","bd3c0c621db7716cd457bb19366906203fb75a468ba6a7873b388164a24f2c0a","0fce81367bcd6f885af528af242c1aa8cb7588000385c08f427f996117dea557","d2b19d0f85d21ac5ee0de857627141899aae31e836ee7758a4ee7ee3ffdade69","cc424f1e769c7fd1692b7e9b6aee66594feb5508b559e36a18936958969a8f43","1ee66a7b1bade58c0afb472f44d5bd394b02d30693526699b72243a883f30036","cbe65118e244cddbb0d9938660a06a9583875d4efbccab4dd448fd753e138ef2","dd102179043cd694bb33a9f0155db8328a2db238de8dabbc660a65854d39fbab","e73a68bbbdd04d4a91969a5e0da4d08ea6ce8b16bee87ee6959805f7466a5cf6","5161fd3883961d4a56bd6d11f2865b8d0772e665538b80d35dc0958f14b28793","9f4644c81c486189ed8922148790763635aae42a5be22100ce6199caa8e3dccb","0c135ef39ab2b886645aa499e57a8d76ba9997