{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7.3Constants","paragraph_zero_based":49656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Constant","paragraph_zero_based":49657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Usage","paragraph_zero_based":49658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N310","paragraph_zero_based":49659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Maximum number of consecutive \"out-of-sync\" indications for the SpCell received from lower layers","paragraph_zero_based":49660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N311","paragraph_zero_based":49661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Maximum number of consecutive \"in-sync\" indications for the SpCell received from lower layers","paragraph_zero_based":49662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":49663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7.4UE variables","paragraph_zero_based":49664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:To facilitate the specification of the UE behavioural requirements, UE variables are represented using ASN.1. Unless explicitly specified otherwise, it is however up to UE implementation how to store the variables. The optionality of the IEs in ASN.1 is used only to indicate that the values may not always be available.","paragraph_zero_based":49665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NR-UE-Variables","paragraph_zero_based":49666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This ASN.1 segment is the start of the NR UE variable definitions.","paragraph_zero_based":49667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":49668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- NR-UE-VARIABLES-START","paragraph_zero_based":49669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":49670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-UE-Variables DEFINITIONS AUTOMATIC TAGS ::=","paragraph_zero_based":49671},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":49672},{"literal_tex