{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"9Specified and default radio configurations","paragraph_zero_based":50280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Specified and default configurations are configurations of which the details are specified in the standard. Specified configurations are fixed while default configurations can be modified using dedicated signalling. The default value for the parameters not listed in following clauses shall be set such as the corresponding features are not configured, i.e. release or false unless explicitly stated otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":50281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The UE applies the default values specified in the field description of ASN.1 parameters only when the parent IE is present. Hence, the UE does not apply all default values in field descriptions when it applies the \"default radio configuration\" in accordance with this clause.","paragraph_zero_based":50282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"9.1Specified configurations","paragraph_zero_based":50283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"9.1.1Logical channel configurations","paragraph_zero_based":50284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"9.1.1.1BCCH configuration","paragraph_zero_based":50285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameters","paragraph_zero_based":50286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Name","paragraph_zero_based":50287},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value","paragraph_zero_based":50288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Semantics description","paragraph_zero_based":50289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ver","paragraph_zero_based":50290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SDAP configuration","paragraph_zero_based":50291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Not used","paragraph_zero_based":50292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":50293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_z