{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HO","paragraph_zero_based":52032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present in case of handover within NR or UE context retrieval, e.g. in case of resume or re-establishment. The field is optionally present in case of handover from E-UTRA/5GC. Otherwise the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":52033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HO2","paragraph_zero_based":52034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present in case of handover within NR; otherwise the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":52035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":52036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The following table indicates per source RAT whether RAT capabilities are included or not.","paragraph_zero_based":52037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":52038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Source RAT","paragraph_zero_based":52039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR capabilities","paragraph_zero_based":52040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"E-UTRA capabilities","paragraph_zero_based":52041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MR-DC capabilities","paragraph_zero_based":52042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UTRA capabilities","paragraph_zero_based":52043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR","paragraph_zero_based":52044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"May be included if UE Radio Capability ID as specified in 23.502 [43] is used for the UE. Included otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":52045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"May be included","paragraph_zero_based":52046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"May be included","paragraph_zero_based":52047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"May be included, ignored by gNB if received","paragraph_zero_based":52048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"E-UTRAN","paragraph_zero_based":52049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"May be included if UE Radio Capability ID as specified in 23.502 [43] is used for the UE. Included otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":52050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"May be included","paragraph_zero_based":52051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"May be included","paragraph_zero_based":52052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"May be included, ignored by gNB if received","paragraph_zero_based":52053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":52054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The following table indicates, in case of inter-RAT handover from E-UTRA, which additional IEs are included or not:","paragraph_zero_based":52055}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cb5c8d9aeccecd2d3a23dfdb673b10f856c308296d3220c5a3d2ac859ff9c849","c968b18eb7aa1c6f5668091208158fba86fc296fc17b58d292d37d779c184d4c","fcaebdd890b67d74ff51fe25b768d197551983896f406d5ea2659d0344692f99","171ce8bb704458fe9f106bcfea41102ebcb7bb040bf2d87edc132ba77fbf2462","d3dbf49818d9aef19c8b26d63320c5cc93a9e9351da8a9a1a30864699e112bb7","6de9123940c0bd16f5f2bdd53a110bc0dedfa0e9eb8f148c7c0a856f38ba1ee2","dfcdbf2ec82393c0d360a3284c5d784758445bfb387f86adae6bd2a363d05811","7054b749372151e2a74a8eb950dfcfefa6f9c216e52eef1806685457a7f4aea1","8ee241e59fa67369976472fd31ef97f33a3be7abcdfc92226242ce68b6430627","c7eb0c2532e8fbaea049f13808e96a39990ca36aea028f37cc99046f9025104f","c79a6ac481c7481c20acb24feb4d2878d0e8ddb7ffb5302b287e01160fe7b1b7","56c370e91358caca66b466aabd4c845794c09ba7baea8f17d961d828b1d75160","99aaecd4de800821e88a38f0604a70dd06b7d5a8d54484f78a0149018ebb2096","ae471b67b45250cbdadf786be9eed6180a180ad90e2f583d414db89fe676ac86",