{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403537.zip::R2-2403537 RRC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of active configured grant configurations. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberConfigsAllCC-r16 in activeConfiguredGrant-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":53160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNumberCSI-RS-BFD","paragraph_zero_based":53161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximal number of different CSI-RS resources for the UE to monitor PDCCH quality. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberCSI-RS-BFD.","paragraph_zero_based":53162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNumberCSI-RS-SSB-CBD","paragraph_zero_based":53163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximal number of different CSI-RS (and/or SSB) resources for new beam identifications. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberCSI-RS-SSB-CBD.","paragraph_zero_based":53164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNumberSSB-BFD","paragraph_zero_based":53165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximal number of different SSBs for the UE to monitor PDCCH quality. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberSSB-BFD.","paragraph_zero_based":53166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sps-MaxNumberConfigsAllCC","paragraph_zero_based":53167},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of SPS configurations. Corresponds to the UE capability maxNumberConfigsAllCC-r16 in sps-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":53168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"trs-MaxConfResourceSetsAllCC","paragraph_zero_based":53169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum configured CSI-RS for tracking (i.e. TRS) resource sets. Corresponds to the UE capability maxConfiguredResourceSetsAllCC in csi-RS-ForTracking.","paragraph_zero_based":53170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":53171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"11.4Inter-node RRC multiplicity and type constraint values","paragraph_zero_based":53172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–Multiplicity and type constraints definitions","paragraph_zero_based":53173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":53174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NR-MULTIPLICITY-AND-CONSTRAINTS-START","paragraph_zero_based":53175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":53176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxMeasFreqsMN              INTEGER ::= 32  -- Maximum number of MN-configured measurement frequencies","paragraph_zero_based":53177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxMeasFreqsSN              INTEGER ::= 32  -- Maximum number of SN-configured measurement frequencies","paragraph_zero_based":53178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxMeasIdentitiesMN         INTEGER ::= 62  -- Maximum number of measurement identities that a UE can be configured with","paragraph_zero_based":53179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxCellPrep                 INTEGER ::= 32  -- Maximum number of cells prepared for handover","paragraph_zero_based":53180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":53181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NR-MULTIPLICITY-AND-CONSTRAINTS-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":53182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":53183}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f01cecfcbc1522794d08c404da28751df9fad945d4b5ca02d13391d06008ebab","5a17f7ea79038045b687cf3f2e54f3f980e7e59ca0493ea7cfd55ccb5047909e","c935ba67d3b1c8760b962fab923a2a87f1afd6b7dd8e4ac1a96338de6372fbcb","4ad3415694ca7f362f4bb56e767d4184ae15d4a7c56c9acd2843d8ce3e8fd296","fed1e7ea813954ee37cac2dfc8da9fd54803e