 for transmission of RRCResumeComplete and the data is transmitted over common search space with DCI format 0_0.","paragraph_zero_based":53252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In this scenario, the RRC procedure delay [ms] can extend beyond the reception of the UL grant, up to 7 ms.","paragraph_zero_based":53253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":53254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For other cases, Value = 10 applies.","paragraph_zero_based":53255}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3766e0911ef1aaf617f1c44270e04d314f46e1ea6b971f374458ec068bbc9bb5","original_member_sha256":"0471885931db9d8903847ae27a7db1ede99f912460c3f55d37683308dfbebd05","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a4b5e2cd000fc04b289a443c3d1f3d5ca60c77e40f386af14cefc8f211e24c5d","c6fd2df20b1cdadb5eda35879dcff14952a1aed4b5fa5697526f36b423f4babe","75a9cafa8cf08b43b994ee54a94d215cdd4729b7cbe950f64d8bbe85dd382c94","542ddba309c544ce8ea5d212bcc374d801a5ee7033c5cefb54a217f89e47a7b3","ec41de0c78e3b73c3593159da6883f62bf40310b8db5b67f1d7f9a0a6a3e4a70","7c4f9f9abfe654ae8214c491dcb4bdaa1ac00294c926337d0d7c6efef69d83f1","6adeeb7342fbb605e219917347e6e681a8bb7931375d8c17800008bced358558","824ecd7f464d3c193b43fbf5f6f78372807a8f7cdfa9da548a528ccf97798d43","6e511c41b9a7503811626c987d0cd15c5ebbca575a120e1f579e4dcfbf983fa3","686772158258efc2f8b4ee6d7f3a8cebf072abdf68859cb259dda4cc7b62cf20","3912912a14a6e193e7560062f70475511f03f64e6b80c1218aae81aef87fe88b","d5b37dcf22747e71452b52ba9c9f76b625c23199491a2d9b647788f02c1ff7cb","af6553d9963e57b6e59a846eb11cbd58caa23a9574a0113d639c99e853bb4399","8b9845dfda529d9bced8f658e927b66d6c7f903d27327685376d23fddcdb9a66","1e33c3743ad0b414fb6bead7f479bbcd8740c54b7a24501fcdcf8d14f2dc00bd","b9d5d529e1dcf15fd9d1b4dcb1179b42a928679682f4d220b714e7d66946f534","80a81123c4a3cfa09697d7aae74c7f1fe36e8141d8f714f2a38de449c6719136","dc0e0b22ad1e52392cae737bb