0},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-MeasurementTimeWindowsConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-StartSFN-TimeWindow","paragraph_zero_based":452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the start of the time window in system frame number.","paragraph_zero_based":453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-PeriodicOrOneShotTimeWindow","paragraph_zero_based":454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A one-shot field specifies the slot offset of the periodic or one-shot time window with respect to the SFN in IE nr-StartSFN-TimeWindow slot #0 for the TRP where the DL-PRS Resource Set is configured, and the periodicity of the periodic time window in slots configured per DL-PRS Resource Set.","paragraph_zero_based":455}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e47b79743f7f668dac0c837a3ce23ecd71537dc2c3d64c043690847a357e7e80","original_member_sha256":"47772c0117bde699cb677c5e317a254942a85deef6390c97d04168794b0fb47a","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fec024a790862ddc34d889896123b0fe57f732ff429a36757d9e303f7a496e6d","4fe6b7e7c66712ad845f2c5cae25552c6e8bafc46cf3ad1755208813cacd4d80","c069efd333e400e45a7f326adbd94ac6c5e235fcd3653f1ee9c2d9aa5d3991f2","aac2b7f156a152ebc0864c150896d4e849528036cf1e950d65afe9ba67d61261","a13fe4e1b26e8f70e7227107b68f510198d8e459b377b1442569dce2d53ce923","c4be7dbffdb7a8feff38cf894c17f73e6069319b83b2746fcb1294c0ff38dd69","9f24d5d987e4687eb18bdb841e84db59250c5592a199bc135d37a3c9a6cc78ff","c2cb5df473b45c54f3aa0f794f62991e9096c27bed009f81449b83589a03afb6","df23e9deaa1cd1a5361290b8659d9e55ae8def9fe723731373281a71dcfdd53a","7e05faee46069ac52f535ee577afa6349f09882d1354cd0aa3b45356d62f40f1","c06dd039703bc48f877720d32c4f8f29d24094a5c5b87af4b26c240f29aa726a","7d79ac67e16bb8a4e031cc0feb603577566f2b6ffe91e72c333a9e9e27a5f116","6f7b811385fb3be563acfdbf90a8f701717845ea93938779f05fe98f1845a263","31c6ec2b1f0e58b5f78c3082b941848771837e686c82515c66d6de1244e95b4e","7bb077dd538796869ee4f90a7e1c3a060128c3282ad2cb559f6cbbeba27c953e","243b1ca04e9d85d132c3b6802ecdbf0f798f4917dc06f2f33e6b27958b8a34c5","4c92dee0ef5dcd550d87168517035e01dac6cbba118a5f8c2ab0391eaee8d834","183dcd962e61760f21f923ce570bddf93021b2045866252d1692bbe0dc02505c","599cabc68fbd313a49416443413842310c432627e9aca70a9bb27e7e42cf1916","ae68fe75eba09c4adb0a0aae927fee2f0a6cb121b76b5a19b9a856692a29b5be","5e566579e43c165d31926d7abe3434c80951341cdf374283c2b8fd07832ba7ea","27a79dcc6f9ce124f505cfc27d2b77332ca1b5d1e28a42e9d8afdc7885aca3db","cf80e80ac75debfd09dc7847fd27b41178f33232686c6a2ee79d1a7cc50b1844","92b23605ea88b9a39f018822208f675ef4060c3126456c0198248b63ab9338ba"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[432,455],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2403818.zip::R2-2403818 Corrections to TS 37.355.docx:p432"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403818.zip::R2-2403818 Corrections to TS 37.355.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-SymbolOffsetTimeWindow","paragraph_zero_based":458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the symbol offset with respect to the slot offset in nr-PeriodicOrOneShotTimeWindow.","paragraph_zero_based":459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DurationTimeWindow","paragraph_zero_based":460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the desired duration of a time window for the indicated DL-PRS Resource Set in unit of slots. Enumerated value 'n1' corresponds to 1 slot, n2 to 2 slots, n4 to 4 slots and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-SelectedDL-PRS-FrequencyLayerIndex","paragraph_zero_based":462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the frequency layer provided in IE NR-DL-PRS-AssistanceData. Value 0 corresponds to the first frequency layer provided in nr-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataList in IE NR-DL-PRS-AssistanceData, value 1 to the second frequency layer in nr-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataList, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-SelectedDL-PRS-IndexListPerFreq","paragraph_zero_based":464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field provides the list of addressed TRPs of the selected frequency layer. If this field is absent, all DL-PRS Resources of all TRPs of the indicated frequency layer are addressed. The number of the indicated DL-PRS Resource Set(s) for all the selected TRPs in this list is the same.","paragraph_zero_based":465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-SelectedTRP-Index","paragraph_zero_based":466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the addressed TRP of the selected frequency layer. Value 0 corresponds to the first entry in nr-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataPerFreq provided in IE NR-DL-PRS-AssistanceData, value 1 corresponds to the second entry in nr-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataPerFreq, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-SelectedPRS-ResourceSetIndexList","paragraph_zero_based":468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field provides the list of addressed DL-PRS Resource Sets of the selected TRPs of the selected frequency layer. If this field is absent, all DL-PRS Resource Sets and Resources of the indicated TRP are addressed.","paragraph_zero_based":469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NR-PositionCalculationAssistance","paragraph_zero_based":471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NR-PositionCalculationAssistance is used by the location server to provide assistance data including integrity information to enable UEbased downlink positioning.","paragraph_zero_based":472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-PositionCalculationAssistance-r16 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-TRP-LocationInfo-r16NR-TRP-LocationInfo-r16OPTIONAL,-- Need ON","paragraph_zero_based":476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-PRS-BeamInfo-r16NR-DL-PRS-BeamInfo-r16OPTIONAL,-- Need ON","paragraph_zero_based":477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-RTD-Info-r16NR-RTD-Info-r16OPTIONAL,-- Need ON","paragraph_zero_based":478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"...,","paragraph_zero_based":479}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e47b79743f7f668dac0c837a3ce23ecd71537dc2c3d64c043690847a357e7e80","original_member_sha256":"47772c0117bde699cb677c5e317a254942a85deef6390c97d04168794b0fb47a","paragrap