{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403818.zip::R2-2403818 Corrections to TS 37.355.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the maximum number of DL-PRS RSRP measurements on different DL-PRS Resources from the same TRP. If this field with -r17 suffix is present, the field with -r16 suffix should not be present.","paragraph_zero_based":1200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxDL-PRS-RSRPP-MeasurementsPerTRP","paragraph_zero_based":1201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the maximum number of DL-PRS RSRPP measurements on different DL-PRS Resources from the same TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":1202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-los-nlos-IndicatorRequest","paragraph_zero_based":1203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present, indicates that the target device is requested to provide the indicated type and granularity of the estimated LOS-NLOS-Indicator in the NR-DL-AoD-SignalMeasurementInformation.","paragraph_zero_based":1204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reducedDL-PRS-ProcessingSamples","paragraph_zero_based":1205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present and set to 'requested', indicates that the target device is requested to perform the requested measurements with reduced number of samples (M=1 or M=2) as specified in TS 38.133 [46].","paragraph_zero_based":1206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"lowerRxBeamSweepingFactor-FR2","paragraph_zero_based":1207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present, indicates that the target device is requested to use a lower Rx beam sweeping factor than 8 for FR2 according to UE's capability.","paragraph_zero_based":1208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-PRS-MeasurementTimeWindowsConfig","paragraph_zero_based":1209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates DL-PRS Resource Set(s) occurring within time window(s) for performing measurements where the time window is indicated by a start time, periodicity, offset and duration.","paragraph_zero_based":1210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6.5.12.4NR Multi-RTT Location Information Elements","paragraph_zero_based":1213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NR-Multi-RTT-SignalMeasurementInformation","paragraph_zero_based":1214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NR-Multi-RTT-SignalMeasurementInformation is used by the target device to provide NR Multi-RTT measurements to the location server.","paragraph_zero_based":1215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":1216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-Multi-RTT-SignalMeasurementInformation-r16 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":1218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-Multi-RTT-MeasList-r16NR-Multi-RTT-MeasList-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":1219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-NTA-Offset-r16ENUMERATED { nTA1, nTA2, nTA3, nTA4, ... }OPTIONAL,","paragraph_zero_based":1220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"...,","paragraph_zero_based":1221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[[","paragraph_zero_based":1222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-SRS-TxTEG-Set-r17SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxTxTEG-Sets-r17)) OF","paragraph_zero_based":1223}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e47b79743f7f668dac0c837a3ce23ecd71537dc2c3d64c043690847a357e7e80","original_member_sha256":"47772c0117bde699cb677c5e317a254942a85deef6390c97d04168794b0fb47a","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["93594bd7e1a96f724d312a03fc5b2f70df6621df2ad143333122139c86d0b345","1767a40815aff47e8fde85b19c73199faeb3645739f206f7b0a95484404f00f9","cacb46c01fa67188e39da56744e504c16032744656925e66a14cdf56dee2fa5a","cffa8da