-Info is provided for choice case3. Otherwise it is not present.","paragraph_zero_based":1387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TEGCase2-3","paragraph_zero_based":1388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, need OP, if the IE NR-UE-RxTx-TEG-Info is provided for choice's case2 and case3. Otherwise it is not present.","paragraph_zero_based":1389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TEGCase1-2","paragraph_zero_based":1390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, need OP, if the IE NR-UE-RxTx-TEG-Info is provided for choice's case1 and case2. Otherwise it is not present.","paragraph_zero_based":1391}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e47b79743f7f668dac0c837a3ce23ecd71537dc2c3d64c043690847a357e7e80","original_member_sha256":"47772c0117bde699cb677c5e317a254942a85deef6390c97d04168794b0fb47a","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0a31b9c7c9f00d307f03ead2444900ef2c836a53685441e1678c514ca042d679","8e109bb10660817bba5668cafb1ffe0161f69693a2b1d34183a815b814d438c7","09a02bb8de0dbf5e9373cfb438a33ad927d16b5c33ec183e5b4c0ebeec7dc2a4","6b6071a2bce641b19279669b813ddcf7f184fd30448456eace68b91e3f29af02","9232f725115e1e15929d80c9a6ce7db2352bbd2bb94d589c8c00c58aea89247e","ce7b2e85eda6fc4aa22575570c2188d1f71e7cf2a1f6196754b80009d93a6525","8379611c7e9c7d74ae55575055273174ed45a1ebb4b728e768b4d21cba52ff41","ecf4687f742f05a907c3f361c5d2d96b6bf64f561a2ed02e4431a8e775c1d5d8","b753e7d581b65fc29701e4ad06ea971b184bffd533d5666446b12fb589955754","ceef11fd61a40fe0ad584c81b6c889d20a69e78410241aabcf807fe6036ace9f","b530872e6279bfd43971cbf1f482cab16d408ffa9f2bdd01eaa3016b680c6fd9","86aba1065df04d36446f5b349323d84774c4c74d05294b3698ca946e2afce5a4","66b93eeaed61142fd3a5a20edb6d3c6d1620932a1ec9affc78fa4abbf82d6970","347f6b5454023b3214ee5582a004fa319d2819221368859676ab2bbec014ea07","5d6ea38dbea8d16736782e4a580747632c9bb5d04a5c760320953