{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2403818.zip::R2-2403818 Corrections to TS 37.355.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the target device's best estimate of the LOS or NLOS of the UE Rx-Tx Time Difference, RSRP or RSRPP of first path measurement for the resource.","paragraph_zero_based":1464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field may only be present if the field nr-LOS-NLOS-Indicator choice indicates perResource.","paragraph_zero_based":1465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-RSCP-AdditionalMeasurementsAddSample","paragraph_zero_based":1466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, provides up to 3 RSCP measurement samples associated with the UE Rx-Tx Time Difference measurement in NR-Multi-RTT-AdditionalMeasurementElement.","paragraph_zero_based":1467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-NTN-UE-RxTxMeasurements","paragraph_zero_based":1468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field provides additional measurements for the UE Rx-Tx time difference in NTN and comprises the following subfields:","paragraph_zero_based":1469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-nr-NTN-UE-RxTxTimeDiffSubframeOffset specifies the UE Rx-Tx time difference subframe offset measurement in unit of subframe, as defined in TS 38.215 [36].","paragraph_zero_based":1470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-nr-NTN-DL-TimingDrift specifies the DL timing drift measurement, as defined in TS 38.215 [36]. The granularity of nr-NTN-DL-TimingDrift is 0.1 ppm. Values are given in unit of corresponding granularity.","paragraph_zero_based":1471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6.5.12.5NR Multi-RTT Location Information Request","paragraph_zero_based":1474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NR-Multi-RTT-RequestLocationInformation","paragraph_zero_based":1475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NR-Multi-RTT-RequestLocationInformation is used by the location server to request NR Multi-RTT location measurements from a target device.","paragraph_zero_based":1476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":1477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-Multi-RTT-RequestLocationInformation-r16 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":1479},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-UE-RxTxTimeDiffMeasurementInfoRequest-r16","paragraph_zero_based":1480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ENUMERATED { true }OPTIONAL, -- Need ON","paragraph_zero_based":1481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-RequestedMeasurements-r16BIT STRING { prsrsrpReq (0),","paragraph_zero_based":1482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"firstPathRsrpReq-r17 (1),","paragraph_zero_based":1483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-PRS-RSCP-Request-r18 (2)","paragraph_zero_based":1484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"} (SIZE(1..8)),","paragraph_zero_based":1485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-AssistanceAvailability-r16BOOLEAN,","paragraph_zero_based":1486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-Multi-RTT-ReportConfig-r16NR-Multi-RTT-ReportConfig-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":1487}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e47b79743f7f668dac0c837a3ce23ecd71537dc2c3d64c043690847a357e7e80","original_member_sha256":"47772c0117bde699cb677c5e317a254942a85deef6390c97d04168794b0fb47a","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1654e48492b09235cff8529fc2203ad4af026717f19ece9c6fac4ca84765b0ca","dae38d2a08ba1117dbfdfea43e6aba079b2f4ff8b79edd0fbd6162cf12ef822d","0cceb8801ea051142f2d7818b81f2bb006f99b8c35f11a4a2f1f0d3e1b1c9fc3","4fd0daf3467f1799c6ac4e79973736b84ff73320a549151045d8da84bcb5d2a2","a78e06c3b261de47fe9a707006f4efd93ff76fd900540b8098a0266e2984a0d8","9081646bb4e924190ba5c2e255