{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2404430.zip::R2-2404430_CR5000_36.331 Correction on redirection to GERAN.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if stored, discard the cell reselection priority information provided by the idleModeMobilityControlInfo or inherited from another RAT;","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if stored, discard the altFreqPriorities provided by the RRCConnectionRelease;","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if stored, discard the dedicated offset provided by the redirectedCarrierOffsetDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T300;","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T302, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T303, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T305, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T306, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T308, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T320, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T322, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T323, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>forward the dedicatedInfoNAS, if received, to the upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>reset MAC and release the MAC configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCEarlyDataComplete message includes redirectedCarrierInfo indicating redirection to geran, utra-FDD or utra-TDD; or","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCEarlyDataComplete message includes idleModeMobilityControlInfo including freqPriorityListGERAN or freqPriorityListUTRA-FDD or freqPriorityListUTRA-TDD:","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if upper layers indicate that redirect to GERAN or UTRAN without AS security is not allowed:","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> ignore the content of RRCEarlyDataComplete;","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions upon leaving RRC_CONNECTED as specified in 5.3.12, with release cause 'other', upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>forward the dedicatedInfoNAS, if received, to the upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCEarlyDataComplete message includes idleModeMobilityControlInfo:","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the cell reselection priority information provided by the idleModeMobilityControlInfo;","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the t320 is included:","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"708f3bf17b8f6a9f223c3643ac2f82eb0fdb59a9de57fd5ab548b451f4c0e913","original_member_sha256":"59dbe1574ec38535648563015e0ce60a339298c8b5b70ba400618d7a85382db0","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["740ab2a983639824ad50bf24887c1d9e9276e78febe25bffd1428e77450a7e80","547299f49225d9ce46231051c070b62c67dae65d2f46c9b486600b0c6c35f154","32c9d658ae70bd5d4b24df532da5a91cdcfc6c111589762caf138e2d9c88e5e7","22924ba61b15f94d3c6b8d9355244d703dc0f405a9d6bc97a404f5e150d1cd8b","662ab0f798be6e92f3cfd0f987d5fd33ebafae9ae746552503d3dd92adbdc715","ac39fabb997a5e915dbcddc96106585ead1d95306c573e6fbc88e6a19e0a