{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2404430.zip::R2-2404430_CR5000_36.331 Correction on redirection to GERAN.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T320, with the timer value set according to the value of t320;","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the cell reselection priority information broadcast in the system information;","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for NB-IoT, if the RRCEarlyDataComplete message includes redirectedCarrierInfo:","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the redirectedCarrierOffsetDedicated is included in the redirectedCarrierInfo:","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the dedicated offset for the frequency in redirectedCarrierInfo;","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T322, with the timer value set according to the value of T322 in redirectedCarrierInfo;","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the extendedWaitTime is present; and","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE supports delay tolerant access or the UE is a NB-IoT UE:","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the extendedWaitTime to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>indicate the release of the RRC connection to upper layers together with the release cause 'other', upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"End of change","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":156}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"708f3bf17b8f6a9f223c3643