:"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["46564c5b1172463774f4efa32c3c9e1da774750571416e7f5e54002e218d2ca7","11d7abdbd828f0c60ca62043650b9c488a91ee299116966bcba3d88d743d8160","83c129c2cb546324e6ac36815e0d4f94f4e2d87b56697a2e91aaee0037f8fe3c","1bf9ecb53e7f885020211e944c31fada529f76b06bf1dd98e86b31348740017c","f53e9e2745a02d088cb5907627bb9442da7af9b50e213fbf482c6093f3a6ef2e","b99c55262d893391e7209a125019e3ac30834f76611ad146be3188080990685c","7fe74656e60f2a0f09b10e29b75f3421121c127be79d79394eee30e3914bb36f","eaede90646868334d918618f4fd6abf381d1377531f4f7433a233c8ce97d6d57","e2745e703e125c7ff4c936ba69e25974e8378d6685b28a23ddde88f08fd80d07","4e06d15ea800d1a6550954fa0d69fd292bf495052a2e202ebfd3bc9c1d16f4cd","d7a7d87ce6a1204292044246630895c13ce6bdf13114eba8c8acdd5788717145","7942fd5dd546a00a530a56ffe5b7374638dd48f7c89d9dfc884312528b81ba4a","8ae4bf87cbf07f22a6b40b3f720896c02b5abef37e1f990986f6c72c825bc3a3","0fe034897519e9c8fb85eff16c559d6e3c497ff1e1bd7fed7b4117c3935f8bce","98eb42fb8e2f188d5ac890dda86b69d2e5aff300ed0ffb3e0cdda6905a71c81a","378836fc961c8297c0a6d7e267457c9e2e4331d6874f9719a4adaf3942ca02e4","583e54f97771dcf4dd82a658eec896d1fef16b25cafc1132cf006750c261e693","8371d0c92564882183abcff46bc2ed7e4d5817b85d17bbb8d54f7171373cb74c","d18c68baa19584e97a6f25c59cd17b016b81d2aa04f96d45d67baf931352c2b2","fde1b4ca38262145d1ce1476f749f0c59888866739a72034b16616ed1220d42d","8ca2a189a7295f54ce5bb5af9953732cc62ce2706d1742a5bb80095fc59a45b3","8ca640d53b326fc55d12fcd144e1f2faf1820ae42abde8e494c6d28c096a7ed4","e2341e1d6f73785faefe03ae6e6d0227c0963c6174549c00e111b44baabda824","bf122d1ae22a2618e80be95a5bc528c94e9e62e28c76161db0cee62471c83965"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[24,47],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"To capture the PropAgree RILs (N128, O436), as well as some procedural text clarification collected before RAN2#126, including:","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1. For E2E DRB release triggered by E2E link failure due to per-hop RLF, remote UE can not send E2E sidelink RRC reconfiguration message to release E2E PDCP/SDAP, thus to clarify the remote UE locally release E2E PDCP/SDAP. ","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2. For RLC channel release triggered by E2E DRB release in case of E2E link failure due to per-hop RLF, for the hop with RLF, the remote UE and the relay UE release RLC channel locally in the RLF clause; for the other hop with no RLF, the remote UE and relay UE should send per-hop sidelink RRC reconfiguration message to release RLC channel, thus no local release.","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3. E2E DRB addition/modification/release, the existing conditions should apply to L2 U2U Remote UEs. But for L2 U2U Relay UE, the condition is whether source L2 U2U Remote UE inform E2E DRB addition/modification/release to the Relay UE. Another modifcation needed for L2 U2U Relay UE is that the DRB addtion/modification is triggere by receiving new/updated DRB info in UEInformationRequestSidelin message during QoS split procedure, so the condition of “for a end-to-end sidelink DRB” is moved to level-1, otherwise the L2 Relay UE can not execute the following steps for a E2E DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Make clarification to Sidelink DRB release/addition/modification clause and sidelink RRC reconfiguration procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Note that the changes are made on top of R2-2403813 which was endorsed in post125bis #402.","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["10c07b9c7406f99770467ddaab3c6bd7f21850a114da8beb31c6640c2e2bc245","3427cf94976388a3768f96b90f88abbbd44e981d9c27ff40e00e69874fa18f25","a84d4f1855d6a19fe0d1fc4c5a0cb89b9a1f7addfe76df51f3289a31d32b23db","be5c88930345d1fe84a43d7b31e8ea3cad2ded7f7c8d1ab7e4a121aba49fc5c9","cd2112f600011efec9270551070684a52f7e10d66809679fc981342d50a42f01","7661aba9446b68a4ea96c25b523d90dfeda4deddccc8cad13db7b778b33e71f6","2760fe2bb7db713137afb2356b509c7f8d1680e65ea3557662b0c3536b7718e4","e6355c21809c2e4734be6a23abd5c3371e6e16315b5c2d3e6f15c7d13207970e","68584b30f61a7c2fc706b7afe000e7d82e3e9ec5d4a94dabb42b4caeb8aa719b","952e704e36a36f30248222767ea2554317fbb11212c232ee3559c321fd751867","94d8214f77fa834565a024f8c10c9f49075704f63f785b121cf888b8b71e7cbc","047d7ce7e9d04e7898eaf62c4ee0394912662e498514f13e2d9c04d8c4ffa66f","c7428c8848d2c2b91a06926b84c97c452eb1146b5881cc737a57fe0e014f8cb9","f2b6b8e99e2ff272756a4b261b2074177696153e2b3c91240016fac8ad8a934c","0dff27a84e75e67dbdb1771b89cdc4e47a301b54fa04fcf2134ca6c45ba56f92","1af73faaf3e7613307417f9a1f1d01cee2a6662b5fb4ecade2231fdaa089ce92","9b4eb6e1a622d4d2041e1df87f6335df01837e284b948eeb8109fb114e2081b0","213572b8ab9d1c4591d641576e1bc6e0b6ec7aa46b21094473d0e3081238a84f","bc05e2879c44212327c9091951411031d3f79bd64e92612ed5c285aa64a6c39b","2b5e906241084954cdde0e8bb3796eadb118b4f8e8490b76578f2bc46eef5e7e","ace261e229a6809d5b1fb03f859f4282cab90eaec64f3f69951551cdcd3ff3f3","de6109cee1ac2a5cedecdcdab7469935e552a6d585e6823202e598b20af07b77","065a3367d66fe70ca27133ea92bdcd752a074efd0c82386613b3be826792e76c","81eec78460a064133c3985be6549a5d6401c289b40f3be231b507c211d7ce600"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p48"}
