{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the CCCH configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcSystemInfoRequest in accordance with 5.2.2.3.4;","paragraph_zero_based":697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if acknowledgement for RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcSystemInfoRequest is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if cell reselection occurs while waiting for the acknowledgment for SI request from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SI request is based on RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcSystemInfoRequest:","paragraph_zero_based":702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release RLC entity for SRB0.","paragraph_zero_based":703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:After RACH failure for SI request it is up to UE implementation when to retry the SI request.","paragraph_zero_based":704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.3aRequest for on demand positioning system information","paragraph_zero_based":705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall, while SDT procedure is not ongoing:","paragraph_zero_based":706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SIB1 includes si-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfigSUL-MSG1-Repetition and criteria to select supplementary uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met and if criteria to apply MSG1 repetition as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1e for the concerned posSI-RequestConfigSUL-MSG1-Repetition is met:","paragraph_zero_based":707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on supplementary uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) associated with the applicable MSG1 repetition number in posSI-RequestConfigSUL-MSG1-Repetition corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE requires to operate within the cell, and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is an (e)RedCap UE and if initialUplinkBWP-RedCap is configured in UplinkConfigCommonSIB and if SIB1 includes si-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfigRedCap-MSG1-Repetition and criteria to select normal uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met and if criteria to apply MSG1 repetition as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1e for the concerned posSI-RequestConfigRedCap-MSG1-Repetition is met:","paragraph_zero_based":711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on normal uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) associated with the applicable MSG1 repetition number in posSI-RequestConfigRedCap-MSG1-Repetition corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE requires to operate within the cell, and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if SIB1 includes posSI-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfigSUL and criteria to select supplementary uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met:","paragraph_zero_based":715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on supplementary uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) in posSI-RequestConfigSUL corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE upper layers require for positioning operations, and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is an (e)RedCap UE and if initialUplinkBWP-RedCap is configured in UplinkConfigCommonSIB and if SIB1 includes posSI-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfigRedCap and criteria to select normal uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met:","paragraph_zero_based":719}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["49b9e011a0cec81f54b7a8ecd328f8137505e6943165928e0972522b0dcd7d69","90a90406a22bb7aee01dad5e09e1dfb8ee72403b94abef29d164e5f2885b6867","4eb164daca7b61937548840743858ffc344321fbb467369b892b31a14a78ec15","0cb90d756c0a8151711981d95644e4775910576fe3f2aec39369c7458b9da245","24b97c2091ebed53c3e388ab16be96601b04ef717d974b160333fa21b0ed4b0e","af124606