{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on normal uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) in posSI-RequestConfigRedCap corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE upper layers require for positioning operations, and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is neither a RedCap nor an eRedCap UE and if SIB1 includes si-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfigMSG1-Repetition and criteria to select normal uplink and to apply MSG1 repetition as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1e for the concerned posSI-RequestConfigMSG1-Repetition are met; or","paragraph_zero_based":724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is an (e)RedCap UE and if initialUplinkBWP-RedCap is not configured in UplinkConfigCommonSIB and if SIB1 includes si-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfigMSG1-Repetition and criteria to select normal uplink and to apply MSG1 repetition as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1e for the concerned posSI-RequestConfigMSG1-Repetition are met:","paragraph_zero_based":725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on normal uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) associated with the applicable MSG1 repetition number in posSI-RequestConfigMSG1-Repetition corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE requires to operate within the cell, and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is neither a RedCap nor an eRedCap UE and if SIB1 includes posSI-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfig and criteria to select normal uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met; or","paragraph_zero_based":729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is an (e)RedCap UE and if initialUplinkBWP-RedCap is not configured in UplinkConfigCommonSIB and if SIB1 includes posSI-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfig and criteria to select normal uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met:","paragraph_zero_based":730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on normal uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) in posSI-RequestConfig corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE upper layers require for positioning operations , and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the default L1 parameter values as specified in corresponding physical layer specifications except for the parameters for which values are provided in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the default MAC Cell Group configuration as specified in 9.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the timeAlignmentTimerCommon included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the CCCH configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcPosSystemInfoRequest in accordance with 5.2.2.3.4;","paragraph_zero_based":739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if acknowledgement for RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcPosSystemInfoRequest is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if cell reselection occurs while waiting for the acknowledgment for SI request from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":743}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a6b1a17d43005bf100a451f65d366a4c5769189a9d7ed01808f965089da00009","598875efdd051d84db9982366f7c44bd813a8b720e5483e4c92b9c6b3108ec08","32e04ac8b1ef3f3d0554a7337ece8eccf28e16581cc22a6d5bab0bcbae4a8464","631a12be55a57170cbd12075cfe435a091192694158a5c7ca1c1a5fe9a550e56","5e333d473f1af697c63a22da59b318893148af3b167c1be646f97ef0be897a7c","e83e934d8a1b60305e1267cc60384d0389df6047abc1b34dd27cec9e5915fa8a","d3ae9104e35bd1f2165fde5ea2c8c178c5af0407778ab5924276de285d425d3a","2fefa8f5475768423a73edbe7ea1e4910d2c3efe75ebc1e25895f2dbb4465d4d","8a3963466aa56e925c8c9b162bc7fca1a68d11bbca11473ad3af105ae408e61e","1fb20fa4fab6673f1bf92307bedd35e618923e45882253c5e5a23b4d6a0b252f","b47602a7ccc9e22353f1e746c3a4f9f672ff685ec57562a220e6d3b5aba160ad","962cacf33ad267610d7727dfb6c0b3673343aa633e28da404047e89cdaeb7022","4ca9e69049d015a849389655f166107d68e8e9a0a79301640f78844c5d8330c4","941276b9af3c6da2db738cbf84cb204c01d095136df153857e41cd2c81c59ddb","0edd15893cd881b4b483d0349756f727313069050b10ff6a908a21021e52fb3f","e56e940423c6d1ab10b095d68c96585dfe18efcca943a867b07aaef94211bae8","1e4f9688e53cef104e1aced583441f64808c6dc27ad00f8241a90540e0af50f8","69e5649169fdacfac92944ae385e3e2a30f651a1d17004ae028b439d8f936ccc","c0d6df8486a9c5db27866c6a798370db23e3e4cb8e45f0cba8415ac1913c7eb7","ec95d00e2ce0323adacf0f79b89553ce32f0b256e1c5f88c32043602dd746c80","123642b7f30ee331239b00adf812b95daf07a24a614a91df3d1da97655e56a9d","63da9a69c02ec65a5f79d8e3b3bab661e467139676a3ff647ac29d27eabfc9aa","afea7c1846feaf058ac5ca9f6b08a965763d8b1ff8719da0c9bdebb018c58a8f","56f90e7b5a4cda25471206f3082b481a1bf1d412fc83aa372678d94550471c71"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[720,743],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p720"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SI request is based on RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcPosSystemInfoRequest:","paragraph_zero_based":744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release RLC entity for SRB0.","paragraph_zero_based":745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:After RACH failure for SI request it is up to UE implementation when to retry the SI request.","paragraph_zero_based":746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.4Actions related to transmission of RRCSystemInfoRequest message","paragraph_zero_based":747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of RRCSystemInfoRequest message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered to request the required SI message(s) other than positioning:","paragraph_zero_based":749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the requested-SI-List to indicate the SI message(s) that the UE requires to operate within the cell, and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the procedure is triggered to request the required SI message(s) for positioning:","paragraph_zero_based":751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the requestedPosSI-List to indicate the SI message(s) that the UE upper layers require for positioning operations, and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting.","paragraph_zero_based":752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the RRCSystemInfoRequest message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.5Acquisition of SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED","paragraph_zero_based":754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED with an active BWP not configured with common search space with the field searchSpaceOtherSystemInformation and the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB or posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1, or","paragraph_zero_based":756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED and acting as a L2 U2N Remote UE and the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo or posSI-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one required SIB or requested posSIB:","paragraph_zero_based":758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED with an active BWP configured with common search space with the field searchSpaceOtherSystemInformation and the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB or posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":767}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b37350e39790da48cce6d83ef27f1b89d13444addcc4af78fee71e7d268bbb37","63789b0ce27d76e6868ea35ae25a53f3c2094118aafe2b324f6135925a211557","25c6bfb826b5bf2ae947bee5c4c9ed54e293ede1257d7dd46ae616e40a4b37f2","cca30e8baf5973dea83be86b023ae137aa06b19e1e404b3a1e42d08be7d94b7a","12e7e7721da955aac47747e93cf5e34238697f00fa573523942568cf4cb8d948","df51dbd4abe7b311b6c8e94ffeaf5454ddce3b87408c280bd6982ea564d9e60f","f9ea59b1315dc55c4eb339be47d002efc51c72144e4b767a9609e21a74f412eb","a550b8e6d4d3a354821955a9e51dee95635dbf4f78735cb701dc2b3119514ac6","92100a232fac68685a00e5f3d2628e18a05201c774a622922693aa6e2dfeb9d5","274be5caac5486b020925d4f5901fa393fd526c5690224af62c77e612d61bfdc","4893dcb759f75bd41123053f59b334669c43360b41e30b2600e34d386f3fb919","a6781fd40dda7c7d14d2ad9601328073cd27a87de1acbf0dada3facbbfee077d","78b623ee05ca06f6aa4d5605fab2353dd5b7cb886e2ac0457435515f6ec7eeab","a2673e468e9f5754207084c0a8edf939a1fb4a41fae50f3e4b7da05a26ad7db3","9a402324ee0e1dd8b64b7e8c5ed3830c38228d808b3bc3fd316bfa0d0cf55336","b52237d377c11b48738205b5f3bb11deddfba3fe6a59e03ec77d13d7c0dac6ff","219815d63fffe64a7ac146bb619e7f3e9c390a1ebec78f2836708262904d3ac7","025ff457f4c4bf71b80d97507a3a2f1b8139ce024dad0e4d304da5182d592ae4","c958d41429f2aae7e646e97777dae2602d43aa9b46c1202ec1a8a04c31f3d4de","27d0c9fa02e2411cd05c789aa7ec25ef5d51e11f4221b6fe176df0a5bb25c50e","fde6ad2c6787f412c080a90c1fe69aa529201f9ce01c9285c0aeb6cb198992b2","cf29be1d6731161a833f16910ec0f357aec35a99e5ad86090af7de71937718a2","e48567e179574517bfcede0c4464ce077000f85f423f3340d6970b59a6cb6a38","96ac44c84274b9c9206b9bbd056c83b86da6fa1eae24f184450c147644f8bebf"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[744,767],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p744"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) corresponding to the requested SIB(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2.","paragraph_zero_based":769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) corresponding to the requested posSIB(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2.","paragraph_zero_based":776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:UE may include on demand request for SIB and/or posSIB(s) in the same DedicatedSIBRequest message.","paragraph_zero_based":777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.6Actions related to transmission of DedicatedSIBRequest message","paragraph_zero_based":778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of DedicatedSIBRequest message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered to request the required SIB(s):","paragraph_zero_based":780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include requestedSIB-List in the onDemandSIB-RequestList to indicate the requested SIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered to request the required posSIB(s):","paragraph_zero_based":782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include requestedPosSIB-List in the onDemandSIB-RequestList to indicate the requested posSIB(s).","paragraph_zero_based":783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the DedicatedSIBRequest message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4Actions upon receipt of System Information","paragraph_zero_based":785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.1Actions upon reception of the MIB","paragraph_zero_based":786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the MIB the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the acquired MIB;","paragraph_zero_based":788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the access is not for NTN or the UE is not capable of NTN; and","paragraph_zero_based":790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE does not support nes-CellDTX-DRX; and","paragraph_zero_based":791}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b6564f2541be8f391912a031700756f7a649157f4e7854dad1c734a81ecb4e47","a1e5f582db84a6086fc96394564b1fadffaac855a4e1d63963a26c74a084fa30","5ec48d43714af629ffe3a7d545c34004e6e5cfc19830fd9da35a4c6b4249b8ed","32508fe2a41240e02b2d810e903dc1986fd7a325541872657e8d421b940a2588","58e4002f6b4bbb5acbf8f3f0323d527df1b21c178deacea4c54bbeaefe021248","9651b7a27e56fc28690596e19a9460b601443e730b010c9dc30aba680a8d7c25","7b0ae4b6804f8c529d033bc7f5bbc81ae715b7b0a81215f3c55e47c71afd3c7e","f24c5d669cabbea31e419a0542430f93705607afa1101f38625485a44b2857e6","258ae7b6ff81e51fbb811bba4884e9affe0319ebca7457a5243e82ffcbc58357","18649bcf04709a37d1429ca65271a101d97dbc60ba11680262e1a21b5f8f815f","00f60fb1b70229879be10cd22e20b19674b6052a5fae6b304c98e23bd4fc2edb","b0758ae2761fd150c03b879b7bca07b8c57aea2a100a4fffee3087145c8663e7","1b0472bc07304e78cf601f76a5d3a95151c7ebafce4877c9fd6e727ba34116b4","caa89ded0e85f6ad3095c1c7c7ab95c54774fb5762b0230e9914ea062443fa06","8531207f870ec6afe9fc28654dd3253aebf0704f0f41269144fc6f18dad30990","da749c144bc08b24696cc6299fec823d6487f1e4466166fa03a61a214c90021e","6cffd9eb275f8be7e0402e2d1f3537fefea4edc458ca2bd1d62aa94f9c904949","829eeadb1b0feef6f5ff6b9d1a4ac94366c53ee922c5c1c9b878b2fbeae54e46","b8c6fc27482a320f1cc126d759e5acf378da43984f7ec02977122c6dbf575f80","65f7784ca53e8d992695a99d24c7993ee42433f91644453cce82590149368f69","9651be0137746101d9062c44b6a0dfd69512d1ae03c04f940de02a905e70e622","ebe579f639c2beabb0ad819343315af8b4886de473491eb8b8e40f2f2def9ca8","580c3ed7106a27ac96f283f51c9407e139ef5b23f30a6ad3a74213923ada0100","9ddd94b5a329c4ac5cdb656f064c35a76993f39861164a8c6733a0e5a02c368b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[768,791],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p768"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the access is not for ATG or the UE is not capable of ATG; and","paragraph_zero_based":792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the cellBarred in the acquired MIB is set to barred:","paragraph_zero_based":793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is an (e)RedCap UE or a 2Rx XR UE and if ssb-SubcarrierOffset indicates SIB1 is transmitted in the cell (TS 38.213 [13]):","paragraph_zero_based":794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the SIB1, which is scheduled as specified in TS 38.213 [13];","paragraph_zero_based":795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the received systemFrameNumber, pdcch-ConfigSIB1, subCarrierSpacingCommon, ssb-SubcarrierOffset and dmrs-TypeA-Position.","paragraph_zero_based":799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:A UE capable of NTN access should acquire SIB1 to determine whether the cell is an NTN cell.","paragraph_zero_based":800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:A UE capable of ATG access should acquire SIB1 to determine whether the cell is an ATG cell.","paragraph_zero_based":801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:A UE indicating any of the values in nes-CellDTX-DRX should acquire SIB1 to determine the cell barring status when the cellBarred in MIB is set to barred.","paragraph_zero_based":802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.2Actions upon reception of the SIB1","paragraph_zero_based":803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the SIB1 the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the acquired SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the access is for NTN:","paragraph_zero_based":806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cellBarredNTN in the acquired SIB1 is set to barred or the cellBarredNTN is not included in the acquired SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is a fixed VSAT UE and the cellBarredFixedVSAT in the acquired SIB1 is set to barred or the cellBarredFixedVSAT is not included in the acquired SIB1, or","paragraph_zero_based":811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is a mobile VSAT UE and the cellBarredMobileVSAT in the acquired SIB1 is set to barred or the cellBarredMobileVSAT is not included in the acquired SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the access is for ATG:","paragraph_zero_based":815}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f04