{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is an eRedCap UE and it is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the eRedCap UE is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if intraFreqReselection-eRedCap is not present in SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform barring as if intraFreqReselection-eRedCap is set to allowed upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cellBarred-eRedCap1Rx is present in the acquired SIB1 and is set to barred and the UE is equipped with 1 Rx branch; or","paragraph_zero_based":847},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cellBarred-eRedCap2Rx is present in the acquired SIB1 and is set to barred and the UE is equipped with 2 Rx branches; or","paragraph_zero_based":848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the halfDuplexRedCapAllowed is not present in the acquired SIB1 and the UE supports only half-duplex FDD operation:","paragraph_zero_based":849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform barring based on intraFreqReselection-eRedCap as specified in TS 38.304 [20] upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the cellAccessRelatedInfo contains an entry of a selected SNPN or PLMN and in case of PLMN the UE is either allowed or instructed to access the PLMN via a cell for which at least one CAG ID is broadcast:","paragraph_zero_based":852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>in the remainder of the procedures use npn-IdentityList, trackingAreaCode, and cellIdentity for the cell as received in the corresponding entry of npn-IdentityInfoList containing the selected PLMN or SNPN;","paragraph_zero_based":853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the cellAccessRelatedInfo contains an entry with the PLMN-Identity of the selected PLMN:","paragraph_zero_based":854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>in the remainder of the procedures use plmn-IdentityList, trackingAreaCode, trackingAreaList, and cellIdentity for the cell as received in the corresponding PLMN-IdentityInfo containing the selected PLMN;","paragraph_zero_based":855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE in RRC_INACTIVE is configured for feature(s) that it does not support in current serving cell:","paragraph_zero_based":856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>not use the corresponding configuration in current serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:The requirement above applies only to UE that indicates different support of UE capabilities for TN and NTN.","paragraph_zero_based":858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>disregard the frequencyBandList, if received, while in RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the cellIdentity to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the trackingAreaCode to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the trackingAreaList to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":863}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0dc1b266b73dccd8549b426139f5a7cf0abfc98dd0740d12fd235f1f8c065cb4","d094f01c1b48a70ab69f11138a608a900d1a5ccde9051c5bb7c34e0374356769","43808e430d01b18badda5645b8261aeb14b14af983a05d8fa0916b56906a8271","ae6efefeba2b0db521cc28d44eb6fda3363fbf294a4cd69a45f0754608c2bf29","67de6a8905aa74c4062dc6c3c32e6dfd4c377ddedda090d4c3eb073f2c3a9636","9201f20e42a7333d01dbeeaadc9e7873fe6f45c0898daf069bd2dbba4f1c938e","55168294d3af2c585ab0e9d76f76a59e7b51aa9b59a99fe280dc8f8a54d5a751","58f845f548b193d9021aa76f5a443d7383c99029ba1a717d55877d158b49d162","fe3e83c369baf9f1e58c6033308cc0b391cd0477742c0c298e747c8dc5e97644","de0637e47d06c4627b6ee71763de110138ad7395917932c427c5b343afb7fe2c","900853f5f3e45f1fd6ced599efc441a593a5082d40675cf76cf064329c3202ed","40c5f695fb3f07476ea965fafaab3134a98e69f5801b5e91ef0870d3b7f6bc47","6eb2f4afdf2fa747d205fd1b191fb1c1b33e34456f13594f59d3d010a61cf4c6","b18412ec8ec13dfff3fe530a22b9e1ad58dd7965a00f25193a76602383d7fe9e","4c3d9d02b832d36db5b274cc71264ea60fee6158a153e1ce6fac6ea1063c4b96","fc5e35cf82a725d7c292c6d07abdae95b7253f34b5ba0c0de9bd2447c7e1173c","ae1347afae78bdcef3123776828c548b2c8d673c62c93f28f24775f760da5019","c0154231dc2a1c451e496b4dba72a0583f13f294ef2cabb07bc2c8e872ba6835","64d184f8f1f8bbe0c0a4cd31ec1d0de6f380ea6567b05ec081271899f4107bb3","31d6a3f9c5c4ae1225b847509a9cb98f2426f7085059545d8b97df23c65cc63d","933c5251e1695b3c167d7c6a79a04db95a0fd6c85f227f47c855a923df34576a","7881f0562dc7bdad19f21e250ef932f5c116a21953fd17ffd40642da3e294d88","0fe19dcf67668a488cb617006aa565de5a8c045381cf8e610e47484458113416","