{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20]; and","paragraph_zero_based":961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform barring as if intraFreqReselection, or intraFreqReselectionRedCap for RedCap UEs, or intraFreqReselection-eRedCap for eRedCap UEs, or intraFreqReselection2RxXR for 2Rx XR UEs is set to notAllowed;","paragraph_zero_based":962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.3Actions upon reception of SIB2","paragraph_zero_based":963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB2, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if, for the entry in frequencyBandList with the same index as the frequency band selected in clause 5.2.2.4.2, the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the nr-NS-PmaxList within the frequencyBandList; or","paragraph_zero_based":966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if, for the entry in frequencyBandListAerial with the same index as the frequency band selected in clause 5.2.2.4.2, the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the nr-Ns-PmaxListAerial within the frequencyBandListAerial:","paragraph_zero_based":967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is aerial UE and it supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxListAerial within the frequencyBandListAerial:","paragraph_zero_based":968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in nr-NS-PmaxListAerial within frequencyBandListAerial;","paragraph_zero_based":969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in nr-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList;","paragraph_zero_based":971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within nr-NS-PmaxList or nr-NS-PmaxListAerial:","paragraph_zero_based":972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the additionalPmax;","paragraph_zero_based":973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE selects a frequency band (from the procedure in clause 5.2.2.4.2) for the supplementary uplink:","paragraph_zero_based":976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if, for the entry in frequencyBandListSUL with the same index as the frequency band selected in clause 5.2.2.4.2, the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the nr-NS-PmaxList within the frequencyBandListSUL:","paragraph_zero_based":977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in nr-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandListSUL;","paragraph_zero_based":978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within nr-NS-PmaxList:","paragraph_zero_based":979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the additionalPmax;","paragraph_zero_based":980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":983}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":