{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.11Actions upon reception of SIB10","paragraph_zero_based":1104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB10, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>Forward the HRNN-list entries with the corresponding PNI-NPN and SNPN identities to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":1106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.12Actions upon reception of SIB11","paragraph_zero_based":1107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB11, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, and T331 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":1109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.7.8.1a;","paragraph_zero_based":1110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.13Actions upon reception of SIB12","paragraph_zero_based":1111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB12, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has stored at least one segment of SIB12 and the value tag of SIB12 has changed since a previous segment was stored:","paragraph_zero_based":1113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard all stored segments;","paragraph_zero_based":1114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the segment;","paragraph_zero_based":1115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if all segments have been received:","paragraph_zero_based":1116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>assemble SIB12-IEs from the received segments;","paragraph_zero_based":1117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-FreqInfoList/sl-FreqInfoListSizeExt is included in SIB12-IEs:","paragraph_zero_based":1118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured to receive NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":1119},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-RxPool for NR sidelink communication reception, as specified in 5.8.7;","paragraph_zero_based":1120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured to transmit NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":1121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal, or sl-TxPoolExceptional for NR sidelink communication transmission, as specified in 5.8.8;","paragraph_zero_based":1122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform CBR measurement on the transmission resource pool(s) indicated by sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal or sl-TxPoolExceptional for NR sidelink communication transmission, as specified in 5.5.3.1;","paragraph_zero_based":1123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use the synchronization configuration parameters for NR sidelink communication on frequencies included in sl-FreqInfoList/sl-FreqInfoListSizeExt, as specified in 5.8.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured to perform SL-PRS measurement:","paragraph_zero_based":1125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-RxPool for SL-PRS measurement, as specified in 5.8.18.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured to transmit SL-PRS:","paragraph_zero_based":1127}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c742f246775954ae875b139e3e95008a62f2defb1361c8899a69a5594c04a186","0910f550be400c91d286db8a6874d154c24d4476c195d9aa9ad56ecc45959db2","e8dfd922cb46061f8f76238e98d395458bd01f02e8b676029f2bfaa62a108ad9","c3df91c372da5b28dc6af604d54d7524b4bef0410e924cc7b620055ca