{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal, or sl-TxPoolExceptional for for SL-PRS transmission, as specified in 5.8.18.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform CBR measurement on the transmission resource pool(s) indicated by sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal or sl-TxPoolExceptional for SL-PRS, as specified in 5.5.3.1;","paragraph_zero_based":1129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use the synchronization configuration parameters for NR sidelink positioning on frequencies included in sl-FreqInfoList/sl-FreqInfoListSizeExt, as specified in 5.8.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured to receive NR sidelink discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":1131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-DiscRxPool or sl-RxPool for NR sidelink discovery reception, as specified in 5.8.13.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured to transmit NR sidelink discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":1133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay discovery messages and sl-L2U2N-Relay is included in SIB12; or","paragraph_zero_based":1134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay discovery messages and sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery is included in SIB12; or","paragraph_zero_based":1135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages and sl-NonRelayDiscovery is included in SIB12; or ","paragraph_zero_based":1136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2U relay discovery messages and sl-L2-U2U-Relay is included in SIB12; or","paragraph_zero_based":1137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2U relay discovery messages and sl-L3-U2U-RelayDiscovery is included in SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":1138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>use the resource pool(s) indicated by sl-DiscTxPoolSelected, sl-TxPoolExceptional or sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for NR sidelink discovery transmission, as specified in 5.8.13.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform CBR measurement on the transmission resource pool(s) indicated by sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal, sl-DiscTxPoolSelected or sl-TxPoolExceptional for NR sidelink discovery transmission, as specified in 5.5.3.1;","paragraph_zero_based":1140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>use the synchronization configuration parameters for NR sidelink discovery on frequencies included in sl-FreqInfoList, as specified in 5.8.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-RadioBearerConfigList or sl-RLC-BearerConfigList is included in sl-ConfigCommonNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform sidelink DRB addition/modification/release as specified in 5.8.9.1a.1/5.8.9.1a.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1143},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-RLC-BearerConfigListSizeExt is included in SIB12-IEs:","paragraph_zero_based":1144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform additional sidelink RLC bearer addition/modification/release as specified in 5.8.9.1a.5/5.8.9.1a.6;","paragraph_zero_based":1145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> if sl-MeasConfigCommon is included in sl-ConfigCommonNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> store the NR sidelink measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":1147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC is included in SIB12-IEs:","paragraph_zero_based":1148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the NR sidelink DRX configuration and configure lower layers to perform sidelink DRX operation for groupcast and broadcast as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":1149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":1150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-TimersAndConstantsRemoteUE is included in SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":1151}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ca98be1a3b7edfeba782438b425f65cd80e640144cbbed2d2a073daee03f4621","1590aff442e815b89cf1de682c258dc9fdfa8b356c5ed848783e158067af46f5","959d8d64d4f54dd54d24e45f7bdfdea731ec645648514eaeba70c55aca241f06","c69939b1230457638ca306115d865de7534cb19b1e6cf88d6abf0e2ee8eee1c1","577b23ae8600e139a84009a7a48ba05377f3f8b0cecd9b2d52683a89e9a0d60e","c4ab5b68c68057382b0861c72ee2141a49d97e7dc1398334751b43d88ddbf562","f4ccf0735951d058079104ba874c2d5b212419c50961cbcf022ba0cf9af444c1","23bd3589e3e7a65f303ca6668542152df9ba86d4a4afab4bddd9afb3e4c8fe9a","412d6411d45b9a5cd4ba4987dbffadf38e27f1cb777942001db3c5ca45936416","6eb27fa91cfbafc3f87a2f7f7178ec55618f2eaa264df374568879cc87719772","b3f6807288158634656f826c686f87e86e7916fcbeb7b80de06d2723d6417466","06d5ec3593bebe8c6db7d8d33367510494f3ec26d5f8b3117a91fd69bf98ffab","628edf566c18a07e53a61b3b7c47bf07597f3068e2830fd4ccabc2dc6b19e1d4","d44e44db6744b3632fac616cc23236b6c78b5acb46f3d0449ee76c220390aba6","e2ce441eea92a61e42c8c86df672c3ccca4e21e7e54d9f40996c2a2c7f9fab57","b6f3acaca7d61b0fd59a9a7f1eaa86f2b868bd680f6f8201441973897828f2c9","f11028574275bc0a0e7854c6bbc935b668632ab9cda2fac57a1c7fa75a370cc5","3bde65598372e29cf949da431c4910729e6b1122abf4c8ce41ccc386a269de