{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use values for timers T300, T301 and T319 as included in the sl-TimersAndConstantsRemoteUE received in SIB12;","paragraph_zero_based":1152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use values for timers T300, T301 and T319 as included in the ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":1154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE should discard any stored segments for SIB12 if the complete SIB12 has not been assembled within a period of 3 hours. The UE shall discard any stored segments for SIB12 upon cell (re-)selection.","paragraph_zero_based":1155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE: the L2 U2U UE is allowed to use previous configuration based on SIB12 before receiving dedicated configuration during and immediately after state transition from idle/inactive to connected.","paragraph_zero_based":1156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.14Actions upon reception of SIB13","paragraph_zero_based":1157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB13, the UE shall perform the actions upon reception of SystemInformationBlockType21 as specified in 5.2.2.28 in TS 36.331 [10].","paragraph_zero_based":1158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.15Actions upon reception of SIB14","paragraph_zero_based":1159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB14, the UE shall perform the actions upon reception of SystemInformationBlockType26 as specified in 5.2.2.33 in TS 36.331 [10].","paragraph_zero_based":1160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.16Actions upon reception of SIBpos","paragraph_zero_based":1161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No UE requirements related to the contents of the SIBpos apply other than those specified elsewhere e.g. within TS 37.355 [49], and/or within the corresponding field descriptions.","paragraph_zero_based":1162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.17Actions upon reception of SIB15","paragraph_zero_based":1163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB15, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>forward the applicable disaster roaming information for each PLMN sharing the cell to upper layers.","paragraph_zero_based":1165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.18Actions upon reception of SIB16","paragraph_zero_based":1166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB16 with cell reselection priorities for slicing, the UE shall perform the actions as specified in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":1167},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.19Actions upon reception of SIB17","paragraph_zero_based":1168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB17, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has stored at least one segment of SIB17 and the value tag of SIB17 has changed since a previous segment was stored:","paragraph_zero_based":1170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard all stored segments;","paragraph_zero_based":1171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the segment;","paragraph_zero_based":1172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if all segments have been received:","paragraph_zero_based":1173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>assemble SIB17-IEs from the received segments.","paragraph_zero_based":1174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE should discard any stored segments for SIB17 if the complete SIB17 has not been assembled within a period of 3 hours. The UE shall discard any stored segments for SIB17 upon cell (re-) selection.","paragraph_zero_based":1175}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786