{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.20Actions upon reception of SIB18","paragraph_zero_based":1176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB18, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>forward the Group IDs for Network selection (GINs) in SIB18 with the corresponding SNPN identities to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":1178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.21Actions upon reception of SIB19","paragraph_zero_based":1179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB19 in an NTN cell, the UE in RRC_CONNECTED shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>start or restart T430 for serving cell with the timer value set to ntn-UlSyncValidityDuration for the serving cell from the subframe indicated by epochTime for the serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":1181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SatSwitchWithReSync and t-Service are included, and the UE supports hard satellite switch with resynchronization;","paragraph_zero_based":1182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if t-ServiceStart is included and the UE supports soft satellite switch with resynchronization:","paragraph_zero_based":1183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start acquiring DL synchronization with the SpCell served by the satellite indicated by ntn-Config in SatSwitchWithReSync between the time indicated by t-ServiceStart and the time indicated by t-Service for the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":1184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the satellite switch with resynchronization as specified in 5.7.19 at the time indicated by t-Service for the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":1185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:UE should attempt to re-acquire SIB19 before the end of the duration indicated by ntn-UlSyncValidityDuration and epochTime by UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.22Actions upon reception of SIB20","paragraph_zero_based":1187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No UE requirements related to the contents of SIB20 apply other than those specified elsewhere e.g. within procedures using the concerned system information, and/or within the corresponding field descriptions.","paragraph_zero_based":1188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.23Actions upon reception of SIB21","paragraph_zero_based":1189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No UE requirements related to the contents of SIB21 apply other than those specified elsewhere e.g. within procedures using the concerned system information, and/or within the corresponding field descriptions.","paragraph_zero_based":1190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.24Actions upon reception of SIB22","paragraph_zero_based":1191},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No UE requirements related to the contents of SIB22 apply other than those specified elsewhere e.g. within procedures using the concerned system information, and/or within the corresponding field descriptions.","paragraph_zero_based":1192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.25Actions upon reception of SIB23","paragraph_zero_based":1193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB23, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has stored at least one segment of SIB23 and the value tag of SIB23 has changed since a previous segment was stored:","paragraph_zero_based":1195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard all stored segments;","paragraph_zero_based":1196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the segment;","paragraph_zero_based":1197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if all segments have been received:","paragraph_zero_based":1198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>assemble SIB23-IEs from the received segments;","paragraph_zero_based":1199}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b6cdf9e633726a09aa4a689770f0e70e4e85b48eaff15b9abfe39c4f6e223c36","d484e6c9230dfd47fa1a9bef59bc64878cb5c2d6f3cdf48ee210d53019f9208f","d37542a099a11d6398a91ecee8a0828560bd9915c53e845f301d07f6768f9f29","efe0d131e8051a43d230fbf6aab3ebbac34730ad31418c3bd8345b23259b938b","c85ceafdfedcddc55b1ae21b1fcef4049d626e5c6351fcab45235e1730eb8398","52ca056b03c13381e5f11e040a0b1fbd114e9751066c8029dfb26fbcf8ce10ab","d7b876c4e6635c763a08adec705ad8c363143b05ae8e11e19bf9cc743cf81f38","add98c8eae61836a2b444a62e6ea4f8caaf5c6c4483b3ef2f076f2f86a3f425e","2e552cc16f26b8a95a9efebf09d6e4ffa53926e5c875a04f89e05a770796e6a0","dc7eb55ea4c7c604df8110b3bf7b50754c25db011580410f8f3b163acbd301ef","f973f60c83d25e1df86fffa7f0375344cb326268e8084c93bbca14afa1996e04","b67e894ebf2bcd6415b2d00f0000b07b357903fcf441656fc27e7dbcc0e77e0a","8bcadd1be0233716741f9ae1f0e03f7a6b69b2b967408645c14c8d59d0af13a7","1bad83daa39f37611b344ecadfc5b85657e802f88d9394bf7a4ab0cc7a9f5128","59a461a99781a86b3c0e7cbd487db8fa6c319cc42e80503c0c4ac0256e4e3743","59628d5bc418c2000f886935c7ba11c5e0b7d08012681fd91c40525ce545b2c8","f97935e5486f7c81bccac99725bed27c04eff546c4b723866678bef5e69d33fd","2d803b42481747e3f9610961e51bbbb3190fa869793ce56a2e2fb1a58348b02f","28f7593910628405e190c3dabc7dafb38c633e337168a0035498d2e0c9339f51","5f8668deca914083d3a24cfd28871396a5c80ff08f2670f2ce18bc89d9d04e96","3050ace1ce903ded2921f09a91739646ec180e0a428986bee14e3c4cb7a941de","de5ceab561683d7c6f86ad893716e4aa17d9b661a8fae9408411614334081c85","0040ea51d0e276047a71be6d541acd5ac2508a332efc9840393cba8a413a3bb0","806631be2ae87df60e379507b1097a83665a9041651385374792f342dd635d4e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1176,