{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCSetup is received in response to an RRCResumeRequest, RRCResumeRequest1 or RRCSetupRequest:","paragraph_zero_based":1440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if T331 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":1441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T331;","paragraph_zero_based":1442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions as specified in 5.7.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>enter RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":1444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop the cell re-selection procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":1445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop relay (re)selection procedure if any for L2 U2N Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":1446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the current cell to be the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1447},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the L2 U2N Remote UE configuration procedure in accordance with the received sl-L2RemoteUE-Config as specified in 5.3.5.16;","paragraph_zero_based":1448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the sidelink dedicated configuration procedure in accordance with the received sl-ConfigDedicatedNR as specified in 5.3.5.14;","paragraph_zero_based":1449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":1450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconnectCellId in VarRLF-Report is not set after failing to perform reestablishment and if this is the first RRCSetup received by the UE after declaring the failure:","paragraph_zero_based":1451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE supports RLF-Report for conditional handover and if choCellId in VarRLF-Report is set:","paragraph_zero_based":1452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set timeUntilReconnection in VarRLF-Report to the time that elapsed since the radio link failure or handover failure experienced in the failedPCellId stored in VarRLF-Report;","paragraph_zero_based":1453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set timeUntilReconnection in VarRLF-Report to the time that elapsed since the last radio link failure or handover failure;","paragraph_zero_based":1455},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set nrReconnectCellId in reconnectCellId in VarRLF-Report to the global cell identity and the tracking area code of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE supports RLF report for inter-RAT MRO NR as defined in TS 36.306 [62], and if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10] and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10]:","paragraph_zero_based":1457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconnectCellId in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331[10] is not set after failing to perform reestablishment and if this is the first RRCSetup received by the UE after declaring the failure:","paragraph_zero_based":1458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set timeUntilReconnection in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331[10] to the time that elapsed since the last radio link failure or handover failure in LTE;","paragraph_zero_based":1459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set nrReconnectCellId in reconnectCellId in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331[10] to the global cell identity and the tracking area code of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RPLMN is not included in plmn-IdentityList in VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":1463}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["be79bf696807acc6309acaec2e7d226d30ea8e200803db670cab8ed345a01a95","f76371a4930f9078768882ea59154092f05705e217ad6eb59dc747e43063b07c","344c97d890d759cc25d8c4cadc9c0cb11162b5baa88393604235077a5b097bf0","89f0091616c9b3ac42c39228e6bee9eecc641c58e724f2abca5994853c3f67c6","0a0d56c4c92303812b0c4abc8013902b10afa07f8517959128ed5f51089a5874","4ea482010d0d0982c79acfd11c89968f8ffa5d2c2196259c4d5f15731b1ca152","0d597eda54f45a52c6dba506d967501bcc5b103b74185a7bccbb21027a3ce300","cfa455a154b4c0f45b87aca25df4eff10c9c6398a1d6450baa7c47ee078f97d1","c8041423bd2a107e6cda1370c85e7760b46f846107dc4311342e98bbbfe1d36a","cc2c9059a8e11ba0777f2939655139bf77207901fd59c18e968e84f45e9bc6f2","9781a8efa53c5ef5ad4140fdf6491f2c9a53aa5b3ed4a6c960644cd9bd41e335","dd75a37de1a4f9693c797284959026cbb454b0a3ec2d461ea35d8e87240865cc","43e23ad870892c03d7d42b6f64f3e33b3b831768275d9b009de4fd5931167cd5","3db4d89fbc8b4d5155ba41267be54f6e887af8442bd9712e9f927cd47a538861","7c610705edc98e5b246b75bb9628c1137d216fa83f86c2d31a435eaada520da4","ae28c738f40a5a73f5c200d4133d6b1485a3a0707ad96e690ac57dc1802e97fd","1925e29c3da5bdbbe6f187d4262a23f9cfcafdc22c19fea433cce2095037cdff","3901f596d4ab88f819c3e115c034734a14c32bbcd2ae4d7bd9498e4fe0fb04b5","ddb4eff55d147a35bf4a00c917d2da88153305554c54f1631c592d8295077fa4","1877cdeaa0d8aef4755e87d8147d96837bb986aa1aed6fd1061810e4a186e775","bf6a2c733b3fcfa3a8ece239b3bbf97031c3679779058457856c34393497a77f","95a5c597d2c506683f5a64c80080626c82c572e90cee45ed372d0ad1e75eacf7","5aa9012ca0cfa7d7b4d8753f79bd6978db3a8165ca070aea3ee3a352c4a50c6e","33e28f9d59b6f787d710e60c9b003648fea24239bc39a94c6e4a5af3a4cd48f4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1440,1463],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p1440"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the application layer measurement configuration including its fields in the UE variables VarAppLayerIdleConfig and VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>discard any application layer measurement reports which were not yet fully submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement reports for the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":1466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the content of RRCSetupComplete message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if upper layers provide a 5G-S-TMSI:","paragraph_zero_based":1468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCSetup is received in response to an RRCSetupRequest:","paragraph_zero_based":1469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the ng-5G-S-TMSI-Value to ng-5G-S-TMSI-Part2;","paragraph_zero_based":1470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the ng-5G-S-TMSI-Value to ng-5G-S-TMSI;","paragraph_zero_based":1472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if upper layers selected an SNPN or a PLMN and in case of PLMN UE is either allowed or instructed to access the PLMN via a cell for which at least one CAG ID is broadcast:","paragraph_zero_based":1473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the selectedPLMN-Identity from the npn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":1474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the selectedPLMN-Identity to the PLMN selected by upper layers from the plmn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":1476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if upper layers provide the 'Registered AMF':","paragraph_zero_based":1477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include and set the registeredAMF as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the PLMN identity of the 'Registered AMF' is different from the PLMN selected by the upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":1479},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the plmnIdentity in the registeredAMF and set it to the value of the PLMN identity in the 'Registered AMF' received from upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":1480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the amf-Identifier to the value received from upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":1481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include and set the guami-Type to the value provided by the upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":1482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if upper layers provide one or more S-NSSAI (see TS 23.003 [21]):","paragraph_zero_based":1483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the s-NSSAI-List and set the content to the values provided by the upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":1484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if upper layers provide onboarding request indication:","paragraph_zero_based":1485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the onboardingRequest;","paragraph_zero_based":1486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the dedicatedNAS-Message to include the information received from upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":1487}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["67a126f4152df3e1ae2f19387aa1a7130ae3394feb7c8a59e79718e9d8328989","f54018e00a7f6285f372ca2a99807355cfb4e13261d70beb656381a0edcd8530","93f9864d66e76488b93558aefc797d2f4b44cd02e10b52b5be10148fb50e6a41","80058d5608d42e77da7c62fbe7b9d302ee1aebdb0ac3954f53a8ca62c826ce6b","145bc022e83178288513c670a4b381171812bedfda6fbb4e01b954ff34401817","87839142ec62c626200e01a8e083076f1e836520c098da42c405915ddc8cd214","413cd8b4c613f7026e184a89251294345129484f3f86d4bfbcc39e821b24e083","6846bd6a3b9815e238a994ad9d54b87706bdaab27ebe4880c84226d4cdf5e3f5","b408e774f39ac0bde60732c4679510e54ef205f59ab191ef6121a302a8543f82","177aede4bc5e358e4829e0248b2bfd90e63e48ebf459002375ce5108ae9bc87a","76f603037e8da69924abe218568e8acc3d1bea712032b927613a206ad57dd0b5","9482dcc53eec295891afc004c2ede8ef1a6b16f884c5808737ae7196504b4f36","726f848cdc291326a8632a7a51b1e3075accaadcc9e8e85923c4e87b7f1cb2e2","207d4c9f61088789822e697a3b1100a0595c4e36b804d5c98c910ec80c7c3553","4ac6be6a38c402905418948425a7363e064d6be87984988d905da18bc48e3676","c7e42846f9adae7e917052010f046e457afdf6c3dc72a8ef36683c329d892593","67c3deb931099b28374d8009fbb3f3b6eefe247b9f21b7dc2befbde3e05a9a75","d0270e6bea665a66767845c2a01cf5bd7458d3e0b469e09de2820881340d7071","c52f5faf038cfd9322ae6d3e6ec9f2ab562ed394a658d0b994fb4bc86ce81c4c","316c0a182e5cfffed2ec20a196ea9ef81c3d5a2e3de7f9af43bee71b4ff41fc2","f08e049c88862582bc339b78ddd5dc2453d1c9e31307a4416d4858f26783ac14","2df90cbcd18db85a6995f874c5a2bcf47b9291ef86a071523c1a5da5fa47e3cf","ce214743bc5363f720df98ba37fd45728fceab40e08b1de0a3b0679557a4f58d","678b772cfb7ef372ceb079fee3df1ca9a9cee69c5b4174532fa986943bc57bb8"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1464,1487],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p1464"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if connecting as an IAB-node but not as a mobile IAB-node:","paragraph_zero_based":1488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the iab-NodeIndication;","paragraph_zero_based":1489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if connecting as a mobile IAB-node:","paragraph_zero_based":1490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the mobileIAB-NodeIndication;","paragraph_zero_based":1491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if connecting as an NCR-node:","paragraph_zero_based":1492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the ncr-NodeIndication;","paragraph_zero_based":1493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SIB1 contains idleModeMeasurementsNR and the UE has NR idle/inactive measurement information concerning cells other than the PCell available in VarMeasIdleReport; or","paragraph_zero_based":1494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SIB1 contains idleModeMeasurementsEUTRA and the UE has E-UTRA idle/inactive measurement information available in VarMeasIdleReport:","paragraph_zero_based":1495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the idleMeasAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":1496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SIB1 contains reselectionMeasurementsNR and the UE has valid NR reselection measurements available for any frequency listed in measReselectionCarrierListNR in VarMeasReselectionConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the reselectionMeasAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":1498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarLogMeasReport; or","paragraph_zero_based":1499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-ConfigIDList stored in VarLogMeasReport:","paragraph_zero_based":1500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the logMeasAvailable in the RRCSetupComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if Bluetooth measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":1502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the logMeasAvailableBT in the RRCSetupComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if WLAN measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":1504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the logMeasAvailableWLAN in the RRCSetupComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sigLoggedMeasType in VarLogMeasReport is included; or","paragraph_zero_based":1506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports the override protection of the signalling based logged MDT for inter-RAT (i.e. LTE to NR), and if the sigLoggedMeasType in VarLogMeasReport of TS 36.331 [10] is included:","paragraph_zero_based":1507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if T330 timer is running (associated to the logged measurement configuration for NR or for LTE):","paragraph_zero_based":1508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to true in the RRCSetupComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has logged measurements in VarLogMeasReport or in VarLogMeasReport of TS 36.331 [10]:","paragraph_zero_based":1511}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eebedbe6baf43504a4b647e677f6f5c8c232a57eeebaefb92b98a89150b39cfa","2bcd9b713667a2156a7dad7daa3e044b52ba715f80b629e6ba4798acd876baa3","b7806bed9de508a37deec575537a0d9d52f5aaaad429377aa962a6b5778bb591","9f9296e98519ba8b7313446477f8551198e7d77aa495a57ad4ed680592d4b597","d19d6149a4c3103bb8fc22fa1cb0b65df8d4b3881a50e251f048fd39d7a222d1","eb35f02c4b003b1a70e84ca7aa14312efb65a65d7562c293e8e13b5dcf1f7a3a","53b235d73e56a9026d2cd6cda14c9dc09a44999d021756a3b4fd4f8b2c82c687","769135b7c9a9c2b734477a98e98f38e9ca4ad695cf5540117f70a323f86212d2","2fbd8efc2194f8556aff32266b333cd1c90b8cab3bca4bdadc2ea31c62ff84b5","adf55a7003b18bc123827065b83e4243bdf51176f77fee93d9595fd4fd07aadb","d0e0a9c2b3278230d8bf45d855e8dd0754d14297cf41ca4a22d5ef2abc31a66a","d980263e66bc447bb05fd5d8803f354f8de53f8dee55128849db2fba45a0572b","c4934a5b1a4d2503f52f71f2c323647f3d1f9f28310731867f6eef2147e2847c","175e49700eb3f93dd9698852aa8e4b62a67e686827adab966abdd4bbc991e444","8dcfebbdf878c8c82022577ec17fd8cb7d4d4244f75320fab251002d4f88ca30","6cf91a4d4d0a2c9ec63463a89ba50d2419b236a4cd94dc0346bcdf63a57f990f","e4ef2b4f9505636bd050500c9634499f52cf019c4ac4d366813fe1f79ba73b7d","0f3202b38336238891dfad8272dcfa616ed2e932c414b14947e05e84c45d706e","fdef76a5820c7f72c6a60f5f231f40441bae74afae59c1fd828757078f645ca8","81918b55998aa2bd4daa9b3502c55922ee7c0eb3be2b3974e98208803f9f4399","0c319766c07bc262fa3cb51575aed0c8a4b772737f3907765da5d8951dc1f57d","91c7d534b394ce6cdbd25a2064ba407801fdef05b6122c189e19e13125d4eb22","cfef50023f75a4b1a54af9d911fcd6a4d889c8d06ef9b43555956ea45a735353","0bfd101506e8a114591be9f567650efd67612fe612e38570f789ac8a811cf3a5"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1488,1511],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p1488"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to false in the RRCSetupComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has connection establishment failure or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the RPLMN is equal to plmn-Identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or in at least one of the entries of VarConnEstFailReportList; or","paragraph_zero_based":1513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the current registered SNPN identity is equal to snpn-identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or any entry of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":1514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include connEstFailInfoAvailable in the RRCSetupComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report, or","paragraph_zero_based":1516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10], and if the UE is capable of cross-RAT RLF reporting and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10]; or","paragraph_zero_based":1517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarRLF-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":1518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include rlf-InfoAvailable in the RRCSetupComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1519},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessHO-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":1520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarSuccessHO-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":1521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include successHO-InfoAvailable in the RRCSetupComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessPSCell-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":1523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarSuccessPSCell-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":1524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include successPSCell-InfoAvailable in the RRCSetupComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports storage of mobility history information and the UE has mobility history information available in VarMobilityHistoryReport:","paragraph_zero_based":1526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the mobilityHistoryAvail in the RRCSetupComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1527},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has at least one stored application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include measConfigReportAppLayerAvailable in the RRCSetupComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports uplink RRC message segmentation of UECapabilityInformation:","paragraph_zero_based":1530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>may include the ul-RRC-Segmentation in the RRCSetupComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCSetup is received in response to an RRCResumeRequest, RRCResumeRequest1 or RRCSetupRequest:","paragraph_zero_based":1532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if speedStateReselectionPars is configured in the SIB2:","paragraph_zero_based":1533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the mobilityState in the RRCSetupComplete message and set it to the mobility state (as specified in TS 38.304 [20]) of the UE just prior to entering RRC_CONNECTED state;","paragraph_zero_based":1534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SIB1 contains musim-CapRestrictionAllowed:","paragraph_zero_based":1535}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["27b69564bd1449fc400ecfd0e0d112c94a6f744e55376c8dc1e9ccf7bfe4d874","3f0ad24e9b1f9d8a2f3e46287c0e36c0913fe647d10534fe938b16460b6ca6b6","543f4c5b0faf6f5be3e63209589c3174cfa2100dc7300885321c2b0552acb95b","e31970b579983ee30b18b335e436168f164be28bc770c766187ac25050ef7b35","6e6e92155bbd7ffe28ea0dd7a93d6e5fd77c6863e17ac881e8612f4fcec001c9","d362fdf5bfd9c5401efef4491ae934a25450a13e3c070fa89ec0a26d652cdded","260af1bd785649d0904766c11076139537b07cbaa3e11847a3250bc389eb9b99","45f724980a9bda0a7c97e3817404da590e3643b03ddb18d63a5e4deb6cc0e4e3","1d7783ec0139ee1212ec0bde865ef84fc6fa835209c6b1c6f0d1c52ac4cb1cbe","10470f1845bd3dd53b1a48f960036f9584b1cea991a424c40285a546198d167e","a31cbfa12cb3340d7b66075b625cad732633cffabec9951e07dfa8802ef19880","ee606889d4496b2628ce8fc8f2005cb3e0e3ce0869fb3c90db638baa2a9b84be","9c768e751e08cf3967249e7fac1f0cd648d57504c442c032ecbdb54973d3c050","effbf5563e38f3daf6feedceff2a7a437d06f3fb847ace11e7c627995e3116ef","a790e1c34831cb873e9860dc3bc9aac9405614272955858300af16324e02b38f","13cb12e81fa8cb8ec1661af83abfdb1f6d36f44b61f620cc039b8070aa09cd3e","7e76ba46e13264a5c59532b831aec7e0367b329f523c39f2a4f0f9b5c65d1816","93dd75d25868cd76d317fc6815012954e2128fb07bde2193afac56e37a426524","f0f6b79156c8b52c97a0d483aa92b471e5ba0ee2eda3be50e8746fae3ca10efe","d08b63ac0c9f423efaef49aabfa763b58f3dbfdddbc4c2b34dff7c6eef6c6dc5","ba97f92177d778b076a13ba03469eb9af0c4ca831e3cea892320bf4bd98fd86b","050819146950e19af2112cc362c8a143300a0ff5e81b9f5aab4fc325a50c3b37","cf2476193ec5c7527b602d50018a056904c6821780db8141dae0901c3d61dc36","a910cbfc1f3e0a535891b0e22e558720d02f2a46ebd315fcb25332caf9f7458f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1512,1535],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p1512"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if supported, include the musim-CapRestrictionInd in the RRCSetupComplete message upon determining it has temporary capability restriction;","paragraph_zero_based":1536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has flight path information available:","paragraph_zero_based":1537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include flightPathInfoAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":1538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the RRCSetupComplete message to lower layers for transmission, upon which the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":1539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE: Upon reception of musim-CapRestrictionInd in RRCSetupComplete, it is up to network implementation to configure the UE with a limited configuration that is used until network sends RRCReconfiguration based on the actual restricted UE capabilities included in UEAssistanceInformation.","paragraph_zero_based":1540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.3.5Reception of the RRCReject by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":1541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.15;","paragraph_zero_based":1543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.3.6Cell re-selection or cell selection or relay (re)selection while T390, T300 or T302 is running (UE in RRC_IDLE)","paragraph_zero_based":1544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if cell reselection occurs while T300 or T302 is running; or","paragraph_zero_based":1546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if relay reselection occurs while T300 is running; or","paragraph_zero_based":1547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if cell changes due to relay reselection while T302 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":1548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause 'RRC connection failure';","paragraph_zero_based":1549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if cell selection or reselection occurs while T390 is running; or","paragraph_zero_based":1551},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>cell change due to relay selection or reselection occurs while T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":1552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":1553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4.","paragraph_zero_based":1554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.3.7T300 expiry","paragraph_zero_based":1555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if timer T300 expires:","paragraph_zero_based":1557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC, release the MAC configuration and re-establish RLC for all RBs that are established (except broadcast MRBs);","paragraph_zero_based":1558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports RRC Connection Establishment failure with temporary offset and the T300 has expired a consecutive connEstFailCount times on the same cell for which connEstFailureControl is included in SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":1559}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["493599c51a54064136bc7c99f274d48bd88a41559294e2589a64f505b5754b28","683aaeecb696d92d5f4ce8012314034f0fe7aeb84869e8a6b2de47e5839c0ab3","ecc7d8c201d58417918edbe3edff7de07003d063b9c14560a1ced00cd15a23de","9d1d496f50145e17ded0997fed1deafa526c70c6f254aafded0ca3bed4f2c989","d6a480b82e24bea3e85e530164cffb61bf6dcce93388ca238883960d3dc2fa46","2c79149904d6d5521cf6a1b7f79a7bf4e8fd09311f95879834db107d61bd1633","36e9d8dd952ff5726d89c15d72aefe328cdf87d39a42c0793dd9c21310b0b29b","3bbfbe41b1ded56089d1cf9da4dd10133c72e18f9326fcdd179c6bb0c758ee5b","b78a76caa2ebdc557dac5e582e673a66c20a5ad1a8499ffa9f8eff2d5ece4b8d","8224d490d953f2283ebb1de54922c0ce0458b79aae0c10a29f54f55f69b3ea44","e3213e4dff973a67a9f4d1c33cbfe6fc843548f3e0445fedcc2b6ba4b618b22c","e98f0ebfebcd358296c50d5b86c5f954e2b739b09ac554d029178b4f62ea1d45","15560edf4ec7f5f3b2caffe7ad6f84d894f67dcc56715b840d2ededc4d9e82e3","239efc55697f5c6d42df4457266402e757aa8b4b33227b5836cb4eb653457fe1","f76e3936256fe202c76bd984aa67d53d2349713abf05bff3dcbd8bcd4e6bae4a","6c2fc6df64af2ae6a94937af1915aa012fc2a5efb68d523bb827b69f31bc3e7a","0b88e453f9157e02fd7c5b0d0b0910cdd2095952068c461601c04ed0e235323f","5247ba2dae20c63df241d7c18cda44e63f0c8d94fd127dcc5c1a6aa8fa4ec4c5","d241d88ab6fb075ea46e0614e3e8d5eca7d7b35df9f4efb493a7fdc49bf577ab","dbcd879996c9d1140ff63ac9204f913ffbccb627c89bcbf284aea7cd204e1070","2609c4b831141b31bced68ba3cad7da9a7bc086cb7f1694b1eb3cf2d5ed77c25","6e8467934f896ce1edf2a48444969846b7331228ea81ba80e5dec9b82035b25f","dca64f127f6a0596ee80653a1fdce4283c71f3c6a903c46ba89fb2710c280e53","114c5247fcdda1da366221cb86079dc31cbd1091b7a134e7ee99fbd9d4838556"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1536,1559],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p1536"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for a period as indicated by connEstFailOffsetValidity:","paragraph_zero_based":1560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use connEstFailOffset for the parameter Qoffsettemp for the concerned cell when performing cell selection and reselection according to TS 38.304 [20] and TS 36.304 [27];","paragraph_zero_based":1561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:When performing cell selection, if no suitable or acceptable cell can be found, it is up to UE implementation whether to stop using connEstFailOffset for the parameter Qoffsettemp during connEstFailOffsetValidity for the concerned cell.","paragraph_zero_based":1562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports multiple CEF report:","paragraph_zero_based":1563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is not in SNPN access mode and if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport and if the RPLMN is equal to plmn-identity in networkIdentity stored in VarConnEstFailReport; or","paragraph_zero_based":1564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is in SNPN access mode and if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport and if the registered SNPN identity is equal to snpn-identity in networkIdentity stored in any entry of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":1565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the cell identity of current cell is not equal to the cell identity stored in measResultFailedCell in VarConnEstFailReport and if the maxCEFReport-r17 has not been reached:","paragraph_zero_based":1566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>append the VarConnEstFailReport as a new entry in the VarConnEstFailReportList;","paragraph_zero_based":1567},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if UE is not in SNPN access mode and if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport and if the RPLMN is not equal to plmn-identity in networkIdentity stored in VarConnEstFailReport; or","paragraph_zero_based":1568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in SNPN access mode and if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport and if the registered SNPN identity is not equal to snpn-identity in networkIdentity stored in any entry of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":1569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the cell identity of current cell is not equal to the cell identity stored in measResultFailedCell in VarConnEstFailReport:","paragraph_zero_based":1570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset the numberOfConnFail to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":1571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports multiple CEF report and if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReportList and if the RPLMN is not equal to plmn-identity in networkIdentity stored in any entry of VarConnEstFailReportList;or","paragraph_zero_based":1572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports multiple CEF report and if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReportList and if the registered SNPN identity is not equal to snpn-identity in networkIdentity stored in any entry of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":1573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear the content included in VarConnEstFailReportList;","paragraph_zero_based":1574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>clear the content included in VarConnEstFailReport except for the numberOfConnFail, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":1575},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the following connection establishment failure information in the VarConnEstFailReport by setting its fields as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is not in SNPN access mode:","paragraph_zero_based":1577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the plmn-Identity in networkIdentity to the PLMN selected by upper layers (see TS 24.501 [23]) from the PLMN(s) included in the plmn-IdentityInfoList in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":1578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the UE is in SNPN access mode:","paragraph_zero_based":1579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the snpn-Identity in networkIdentity to include the SNPN identity selected by upper layers (see TS 24.501 [23]) from the list of SNPN(s) included in the npn-IdentityInfoList in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":1580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the measResultFailedCell to include the global cell identity, tracking area code, the cell level and SS/PBCH block level RSRP, and RSRQ, and SS/PBCH block indexes, of the failed cell based on the available SSB measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected connection establishment failure;","paragraph_zero_based":1581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if available, set the measResultNeighCells, in order of decreasing ranking-criterion as used for cell re-selection, to include neighbouring cell measurements for at most the following number of neighbouring cells: 6 intra-frequency and 3 inter-frequency neighbours per frequency as well as 3 inter-RAT neighbours, per frequency/ set of frequencies per RAT and according to the following:","paragraph_zero_based":1582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each neighbour cell included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":1583}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["db8e7e47554440b71205251d2d94c346bf2da5815035340cd0fc93b586d9b266","af7d9324065081c399703d617205d08e3dffcc135eac1204dad312c4f2068066","9b5cd64d8b9a327150ed24c262c4eccbd37e4e35c1603b3669656c3fdf2bfc28","0de355087203937f41ce59a187e01b3e50be2e60096272a1478ec43dc0eb4aaa","4e68764cf00971010524212bb4cc7aa3d4f9a88b662d47b7ae4f00ca800b7717","71c1aba3099f063c6aa0a1dd71f974155b7c6f2f1c38c9d3b61b33871d7e5e89","bebffe6baf2af68a948fc737fe5df194c76228514215e2fe2ea26d88d0194283","b7a0076585d408d888adae21eb9a71cf1d8d3ea3b3c4dff95aa306a7eec70b4e","f17f79759a59ff6f1dc8b07d3970734030a7e8819051f8b45b7202927ea3b869","2688a0ca5e497690c7dad181d8ef5466b130c5d0366617592c93238a711eea6a","d9dcb58c76ac29c9687bb64f8738490d98c3f6c0d326ccd25477a193c1be6391","0826e9e5e90c4c2258ac8ca4038a32d3685e6deb8fcb96c56f2f2217d9b7f517","b0caee677363ed8fed1b167f574f85efa9b824799fde7b7ed6e2ef8ce2193166","799b27229deaf69d5bdca6a71044b4170264dd7cb1f556ca4800d6f41457cec0","afbe8ceebaf19ccc0d7cbe754ac52fa141b9481cbd530df38e6b8e4d37e31f9c","9db72b7536a58c89f0ad4030b92bf79e170a8753999a832622dcd7283bf07ee5","bf0ad12184346bdbef5a67b08654862a758e357ad30b7abf548ca60ab84a53ed","b73706641dda2c2d05ce596a38371ecadea4704dd47f2843ac14315c32dbf8a8","ca16b31a8fc18fd2fc6ca9c4e66f633204ca029e4f7c137524014d7719bb2caa","69bb1fb282c0fc13699f5f0637c2c273994fc8e1cc70091991bd8dc08dde6d5d","663eff300a52dca1a09790d2b4d7a4afe7432e1001ee435a02f40696426cf548","25031c9892f0b2419c95f5a23aef27a2821da6521a28fa90659e14e8a3ed6b36","81d736f2b43fc489351ddba6877c2098a9034fcca34d5dae6cfad788105c503d","8f99754f6570192451cec4b3abecbe47c37f49bc094da29b501815289e087062"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1560,1583],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p1560"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The UE includes the latest results of the available measurements as used for cell reselection evaluation, which are performed in accordance with the performance requirements as specified in TS 38.133 [14].","paragraph_zero_based":1584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if available, set the locationInfo as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if available, set the commonLocationInfo to include the detailed location information;","paragraph_zero_based":1586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if available, set the bt-LocationInfo to include the Bluetooth measurement results, in order of decreasing RSSI for Bluetooth beacons;","paragraph_zero_based":1587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if available, set the wlan-LocationInfo to include the WLAN measurement results, in order of decreasing RSSI for WLAN APs;","paragraph_zero_based":1588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if available, set the sensor-LocationInfo to include the sensor measurement results as follows;","paragraph_zero_based":1589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if available, include the sensor-MeasurementInformation;","paragraph_zero_based":1590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if available, include the sensor-MotionInformation;","paragraph_zero_based":1591},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:Which location information related configuration is used by the UE to make the locationInfo available for inclusion in the VarConnEstFailReport is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set perRAInfoList to indicate the performed random access procedure related information as specified in 5.7.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the numberOfConnFail is smaller than 8:","paragraph_zero_based":1594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>increment the numberOfConnFail by 1;","paragraph_zero_based":1595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>inform upper layers about the failure to establish the RRC connection, upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":1596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE may discard the connection establishment failure or connection resume failure information, i.e. release the UE variable VarConnEstFailReport and the UE variable VarConnEstFailReportList, 48 hours after the last connection establishment failure is detected.","paragraph_zero_based":1597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE either indicates to upper layers (to trigger PC5 unicast link release) or sends NotificationMessageSidelink message to the connected L2 U2N Remote UE(s) in accordance with 5.8.9.10.","paragraph_zero_based":1598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.3.8Abortion of RRC connection establishment","paragraph_zero_based":1599},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If upper layers abort the RRC connection establishment procedure, due to a NAS procedure being aborted as specified in TS 24.501 [23], while the UE has not yet entered RRC_CONNECTED, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T300, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>reset MAC, release the MAC configuration and re-establish RLC for all RBs that are established (except broadcast MRBs).","paragraph_zero_based":1602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE either indicates to upper layers (to trigger PC5 unicast link release) or sends NotificationMessageSidelink message to the connected L2 U2N Remote UE(s) in accordance with 5.8.9.10.","paragraph_zero_based":1603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE indicates to upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release with its connected L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":1604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.4Initial AS security activation","paragraph_zero_based":1605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.4.1General","paragraph_zero_based":1606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1607}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a65e6ba1a4e0a1c213b5257571e892e81851468db09704c2439f458348bf7a7c","e5e7e5facafaea497218f9368ce80e1e8d3ce2fa7cc3ed0252c6aac28e6610c8","5a1aad69f5103c3202c60151879a8cbd5c8ab8b4bcaa134838fac164c5ac3628","b4c194c08906f85002b3989bca7cb1d86f98b1ed6217b69dbe27238fca942e17","953a131a484053ad204ec159d6a6dddf7d0c9240d76fea91969c267fd0b0b2c6","a0ea371b7c0fefa725b91e3e3baaee9a6a010864ca6575e36f3ebd19ac9179fe","01d04df6728ee4ae76bff5c3a74829d03f40de7f3a8bed25b3b75d04b1c42fc2","bf61169ff895f107de47c767a05e5a735165f9f3229cded545bf49a8d30676b8","26a8c380b79d9a1d75e4c2116f81cbf0977554a11d60139bd0f84946c880b4aa","f0e29f52aee676950f9104a2adff43f24e15c85f7b227c9c0728e7659565f4d2","1f2b0f0e32ac20b0caf5922f623003c993d521c10b60894e802b2227482dab0a","3a1eed6dd71e1e0e82387ceaf13b96b9dff50464873f69df58eddd61a2495501","6cffce86b8455ea704bae2237b1429292c4799469e3d71b72831baf7af1055ab","f1d34c4f1350d1436230d7c5254230a9462300bf38e046a726a4752f23bf3410","ecb0e7655f4f319831cd5800a2519b1f3746ab01f6a92c86fe4a3f9bc6907f04","71556835ac5d41d792b0a54625b034aee43733b669d6d739619ce1fbaf623fb8","b2b733d971e73513df8b117fcb320659d63ef88d651be88f666c79b4cc0a9c5d","a0c9141f8d6ed67caf378591ca3599499fd6e70a189bb5bd43001efe417d256d","0b2f87e8e33d091d618546bfcf53fb4f99085ae720a0b5a365890b0981d645cb","5642e7d28ec40dcf02db1e411ee3fae6edbe02b1943a08f9b3b399f80c9907f2","1b2e4f87e88efec8a19083e1f0c8cc575945669cdbc71fa6f74ea39aace06e47","882b1f10a813ee84244c58d2381764cf20274ba75c4abdd67ef5d1120bb79eb1","77856daba5a3621e1f121e71f505c69ba45862be9e622c4e8305ef472cf95430","98063a6786fa6211bdcfe2c51a6609c111da8c74760b8c2b9f01bf692aedf085"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1584,1607],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p1584"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.4.1-1: Security mode command, successful","paragraph_zero_based":1608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.4.1-2: Security mode command, failure","paragraph_zero_based":1610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to activate AS security upon RRC connection establishment.","paragraph_zero_based":1611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.4.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":1612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network initiates the security mode command procedure to a UE in RRC_CONNECTED. Moreover, the network applies the procedure as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-when only SRB1 is established, i.e. prior to establishment of SRB2, multicast MRBs and/ or DRBs.","paragraph_zero_based":1614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.4.3Reception of the SecurityModeCommand by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":1615},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>derive the KgNB key, as specified in TS 33.501 [11];","paragraph_zero_based":1617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>derive the KRRCint key associated with the integrityProtAlgorithm indicated in the SecurityModeCommand message, as specified in TS 33.501 [11];","paragraph_zero_based":1618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>request lower layers to verify the integrity protection of the SecurityModeCommand message, using the algorithm indicated by the integrityProtAlgorithm as included in the SecurityModeCommand message and the KRRCint key;","paragraph_zero_based":1619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SecurityModeCommand message passes the integrity protection check:","paragraph_zero_based":1620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>derive the KRRCenc key and the KUPenc key associated with the cipheringAlgorithm indicated in the SecurityModeCommand message, as specified in TS 33.501 [11];","paragraph_zero_based":1621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>derive the KUPint key associated with the integrityProtAlgorithm indicated in the SecurityModeCommand message, as specified in TS 33.501 [11];","paragraph_zero_based":1622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure lower layers to apply SRB integrity protection using the indicated algorithm and the KRRCint key immediately, i.e. integrity protection shall be applied to all subsequent messages received and sent by the UE, including the SecurityModeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1623},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure lower layers to apply SRB ciphering using the indicated algorithm, the KRRCenc keyafter completing the procedure, i.e. ciphering shall be applied to all subsequent messages received and sent by the UE, except for the SecurityModeComplete message which is sent unciphered;","paragraph_zero_based":1624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider AS security to be activated;","paragraph_zero_based":1625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the SecurityModeComplete message to lower layers for transmission, upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":1626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>continue using the configuration used prior to the reception of the SecurityModeCommand message, i.e. neither apply integrity protection nor ciphering.","paragraph_zero_based":1628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the SecurityModeFailure message to lower layers for transmission, upon which the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":1629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5RRC reconfiguration","paragraph_zero_based":1630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.1General","paragraph_zero_based":1631}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0520d40c6e125a69224da3ad2cc5be0681c0a04bb34f705852be60d92725bc1d","b7326af14a7ba61cdd02029c57ae4e99c1ce801051aadd44b4934537cda809e1","18f51e7d4742665c141f75a847caf1e023b977d48e85463a8c61d2824ed02ddb","2cb336b75343676b522033876ba6ea367f4d6c7c69bf456c37ce0881bf0914cc","578a0d16073960c17b8d10175d1b40278ee907e5c7881a10f854e8141dce1e7a","12c3ffd127142348c4537099af13420ff18c70d50531fd53d81a038de6d60479","2d15f1c9e4a8f76a19704219acfd76bee4647b2a9b912fce242528fed3371de6","81f3724a7a3f2eb3d0b421fe15d8a1f6e32363397488b03464194c442a12289a","beaab69c812d34a7199bf0f35ebfe1c8e544a016d62cddae656c09a25fc8c457","37fa3d5d4b043319f1e9ec574f051fc34906caf39e6e61688fc36baabf569edb","c65ca54172cf20487dd1d4b58a4a89c94f167858887ac3d2235a6caaf580fc5e","4fdbeabfb57062ef2be408c6c665921bb97a3c96967f19588bd72000006e8452","13278401130dd701ad3d2d1a5b0c2cb04e89ae35215ecbad0759db7147444496","8159ab4e77b36b2c6a69cb99f73bc5940e9eeb6f32ffff9df1df335f7b312926","51728a48a84b7cd2621aaba70eb252d8e9df26ac88af13d8d8d1941140684e3e","9abbf5f3001b6e4932d8373173cb11a2849fbed9e8618e45ecfec1ff3a8b8a2c","9db89251b2b79eb512b0dd42480204fd326e73c07104472dc62875d4b494759c","977cf1126aaddf3b2b831c90699dd590d2e911cf2669642c6217fe8d857d2802","48e405f1e682198b3aa8d3dd3064ee5cc6ca0196a1eabaf74afb1ae9a4f8c8fd","3f9939c6c3f7e85e059d503593e487871f8b3c900ce8e57ad27147a055062e0d","4d49c8935bbd59a08a670744fa83a00d87dbd85fdba9abc1d25b40510308e2a5","61ac60b1a2cc5de3b42dbd8c9998a3c5589b065b589b2c511ed039f236b5b0cb","191eff5dedef323e6668fd895ad26c62baa537fcfb2c43d746692edabd0e0194","2f58f7104e2470781fd517183352f497ebabc8ccad5e6cc81ea4173890949f15"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1608,1631],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p1608"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.5.1-1: RRC reconfiguration, successful","paragraph_zero_based":1633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.5.1-2: RRC reconfiguration, failure","paragraph_zero_based":1635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to modify an RRC connection, e.g. to establish/modify/release RBs/BH RLC channels/Uu Relay RLC channels/PC5 Relay RLC channels, to perform reconfiguration with sync, to setup/modify/release measurements, to add/modify/release SCells and cell groups, to add/modify/release conditional reconfiguration configuration, to add/modify/release LTM configuration, and to add/modify/release MP configuration. As part of the procedure, NAS dedicated information may be transferred from the Network to the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":1636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRC reconfiguration to perform reconfiguration with sync includes, but is not limited to, the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":1637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-reconfiguration with sync and security key refresh, involving RA to the PCell/PSCell, MAC reset, refresh of security and re-establishment of RLC and PDCP triggered by explicit indicators;","paragraph_zero_based":1638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-reconfiguration with sync but without security key refresh, involving RA to the PCell/PSCell, MAC reset and RLC re-establishment and PDCP data recovery (for AM DRB or AM MRB) triggered by explicit indicators;","paragraph_zero_based":1639},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-reconfiguration with sync for DAPS and security key refresh, involving RA to the target PCell, establishment of target MAC, and","paragraph_zero_based":1640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-for non-DAPS bearer: refresh of security and re-establishment of RLC and PDCP triggered by explicit indicators;","paragraph_zero_based":1641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-for DAPS bearer: establishment of RLC for the target PCell, refresh of security and reconfiguration of PDCP to add the ciphering function, the integrity protection function and ROHC function of the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-for SRB: refresh of security and establishment of RLC and PDCP for the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-reconfiguration with sync for DAPS but without security key refresh, involving RA to the target PCell, establishment of target MAC, and","paragraph_zero_based":1644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-for non-DAPS bearer: RLC re-establishment and PDCP data recovery (for AM DRB or AM MRB) triggered by explicit indicators.","paragraph_zero_based":1645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-for DAPS bearer: establishment of RLC for target PCell, reconfiguration of PDCP to add the ciphering function, the integrity protection function and ROHC function of the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-for SRB: establishment of RLC and PDCP for the target PCell.","paragraph_zero_based":1647},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-reconfiguration with sync for direct-to-indirect path switch or indirect-to-indirect path switch, not involving RA at target side, involving re-establishment of PDCP /PDCP data recovery (for AM DRB) triggered by explicit indicators;","paragraph_zero_based":1648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-reconfiguration with sync for LTM cell switch (without security key refresh), and","paragraph_zero_based":1649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-involving or not involving RA to the target LTM candidate SpCell according to a network indication;","paragraph_zero_based":1650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-MAC reset;","paragraph_zero_based":1651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-depending on a network indication, involving or not involving re-establishment of RLC and PDCP data recovery (for AM DRB).","paragraph_zero_based":1652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In (NG)EN-DC and NR-DC, SRB3 can be used for measurement configuration and reporting, for UE assistance (re-)configuration and reporting for power savings, for IP address (re-)configuration and reporting for IAB-nodes, to (re-)configure MAC, RLC, BAP, physical layer and RLF timers and constants of the SCG configuration, to reconfigure PDCP for DRBs associated with the S-KgNB or SRB3, to reconfigure SDAP for DRBs associated with S-KgNB in NGEN-DC and NR-DC, to add/modify/release conditional PSCell change configuration or subsequent CPAC configuration, and to add/modify/release the LTM configuration associated with the SCG (only in NR-DC), provided that the (re-)configuration does not require any MN involvement, and to transmit RRC messages between the MN and the UE during fast MCG link recovery. In (NG)EN-DC and NR-DC, only measConfig, radioBearerConfig, conditionalReconfiguration, ltm-Config (only in NR-DC), bap-Config, iab-IP-AddressConfigurationList, otherConfig, appLayerMeasConfig and/or secondaryCellGroup are included in RRCReconfiguration received via SRB3, except when RRCReconfiguration is received within DLInformationTransferMRDC.","paragraph_zero_based":1653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When a clause of 5.3.5 is executed due to an LTM cell switch execution (i.e., as specified in 5.3.5.18.6) or due to a conditional reconfiguration execution for subsequent CPAC (i.e., as specified in 5.3.5.13.8), every appearance of \"the received\" before RRCReconfiguration, before a field name, or before an IE name, refers to the RRCReconfiguration, to the field name or to the IE, respectively, that was generated and stored by the UE as specified in 5.3.5.18.6 or 5.3.5.13.8.","paragraph_zero_based":1654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":1655}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f57ba152d40ad311e9d6f653d885de69317d2137c137c9b0a65d0e4dc3822984","0ef1efa31da019b43ce2e48b6c1947928b84b82a393cac0f9543b15b1e6cdab9","85b12b57459dc142e4b6d47882f80cbbe07dff56ec242ff4c41ff5e86c89c320","f1649bfb26eafa6ccc05f2fb1e09d5f5870f7c79aa20e4f56dba993daa21b6b2","8863b905b95ce012e62d3cd4b286f3f28ca857f01419e0971ec5fefe0e82f23b","c96a0e5dfa6a593f29101b172eafe27c8738010586e439d7baf83d9d50d0ffd2","8929eef97630b5fb495a412ab7a0acb09c6ca4b44731e9777c1588307cc36305","5b2583df51ad3ada9aa1ade497b58fe60dc539c5d759a6d6a62a2fadc17f46ae","fc2ea3b2fb36f2b1c6167033caa3d9b14903a0ec5084cf9390ffd5c4422a9090","b966454aea211a74579a9afb3dbbd521bed3926bdf0f35a73385510882e60a33","9416c3caed2c842a1ed23fca45f3c6274e2fc7d667415fe13bc7aa19f7a5f4f1","3b3df713ef7d8d9ce61d45914e0903c66091c0f13b4d26e08b54c0015a3a84c6","963197a2acd8138823de58eca3469c774e87c2203f9df13e7aa90200d4801e2a","22b6ae6d4989e6859ec18c82dbfa828ff3f427c28c21ceb3a4fd733c3d6ad747","82423da66adb4e307602e019deea22780972002cbe9a0339e76bf9119f7de2a4","f9aecc8d05ee3d7dff1d529c11a22f97aea035aa95e19eae49cea931b47843ae","a2d60915efefa5892acbbeac906f60f3a29484e1d270763844db2239e01332db","d0820ec1bab222717dfe50b0f39b0b78a9f10d8ab361dbd019175d7bee7c4a3d","60e3220cd365a5d04fb93421955b737d77903992e996c4cdd6ff02688cde866b","e3153ea4e4c436221a1e8aec4efe3b42f49bdf9e8ca6542cf523f72fdf29c666","fdb6fd5adf30058af6e8f354352d16ac9d8e23b4fdacceed6d606471bb8ee9c8","338bf76ce536ef29c2b71a5fc270a9975a570ca66287be6e86cb5ae464f215c0","229c6277e5297a2cfbcce64fcb5c177da8954cd667c036e48c42dc7887293d8d","08c8c20550d22b639063c25b2736cafe456c83f53aa6e2a85ae8bb8fb71a56d4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1632,1655],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p1632"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The Network may initiate the RRC reconfiguration procedure to a UE in RRC_CONNECTED. The Network applies the procedure as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the establishment of RBs (other than SRB1, that is established during RRC connection establishment) is performed only when AS security has been activated;","paragraph_zero_based":1657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the establishment of BH RLC Channels for IAB is performed only when AS security has been activated;","paragraph_zero_based":1658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the configuration of NCR-Fwd is performed only when AS security has been activated;","paragraph_zero_based":1659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the establishment of Uu Relay RLC channels and PC5 Relay RLC channels (other than SL-RLC0 and SL-RLC1) for L2 U2N Relay UE is performed only when AS security has been activated, and the establishment of PC5 Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N Remote UE (other than SL-RLC0 and SL-RLC1) is performed only when AS security has been activated;","paragraph_zero_based":1660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the establishment of PC5 Relay RLC channels for L2 U2U Relay UE and L2 U2U Remote UE is performed only when AS security has been activated;","paragraph_zero_based":1661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the addition of Secondary Cell Group and SCells is performed only when AS security has been activated;","paragraph_zero_based":1662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the reconfigurationWithSync is included in secondaryCellGroup only when at least one RLC bearer or BH RLC channel is setup in SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the reconfigurationWithSync is included in masterCellGroup only when AS security has been activated, and SRB2 with at least one DRB or multicast MRB or, for IAB and NCR, SRB2, are setup and not suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":1664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the conditionalReconfiguration for CPC is included only when at least one RLC bearer is setup in SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the conditionalReconfiguration for CHO, CPA, or subsequent CPAC is included only when AS security has been activated, and SRB2 with at least one DRB or multicast MRB or, for IAB, SRB2, are setup and not suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":1666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the addition of indirect path for MP is performed only when AS security has been activated;","paragraph_zero_based":1667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the ltm-Config for LTM on the MCG is included only when AS security has been activated, and SRB2 with at least one DRB are setup and not suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":1668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the ltm-Config for LTM on the SCG is included only when at least one RLC bearer is setup in SCG.","paragraph_zero_based":1669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor's Note: Coexistance of LTM with other features is addressed during the ASN.1 review or maintainance.","paragraph_zero_based":1670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.3Reception of an RRCReconfiguration by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":1671},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall perform the following actions upon reception of the RRCReconfiguration, upon execution of the conditional reconfiguration (CHO, CPA, CPC, or subsequent CPAC), or upon execution of an LTM cell switch:","paragraph_zero_based":1672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution upon cell selection performed while timer T311 was running, as defined in 5.3.7.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all the entries in the condReconfigList within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig except for the entries in which subsequentCondReconfig is present, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":1674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the daps-SourceRelease:","paragraph_zero_based":1675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the source MAC and release the source MAC configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":1676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":1677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the PDCP entity to release DAPS as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":1679}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ac1cd29380772f8b2b09757194dd542de2be2e3acd7988a405d5650e9269cc26","d4885b475068366a28c2e094060d2cea359d2ec1bf8c93c577302087e98b489c","813d01291272a0f6bb1479bb7b965b061e80f061a9c11472644b134477e86f1e","63693132a1850a3c8312f7c4ec62b0cda1eab4da695cb6d483935914fc59758f","f9c1acfe03c79b48ecb19b5b5ff787ecd9aa178b4d549590cfea1b8c61e129db","0324fb0bea0dbb92ea36fac2f349a086b8abe945725525b8379fad89af5a6de2","93f19c10f89b88d19ef9a6d2816d729e393cc9c0afb49c3fd56e6399e35fd0cb","075ac618cdd2f2debf9d53df8c2ec7119114580d256c7b227ee69ae891448376","6cdcab4d2d8a5f0c5b1466dc290d29459c0dae1bbbf2f0a0ab6b47cbc1a07d55","d05e0348dcf9e62ba1e3599f1012da8c9ccb42e1501b27e47af15f2d56cf2e81","86f1282e291d8b7c03da421ad2c4ed52d5093f81913067085ce822c1fa97fce0","8511262e38fbf148946c69b038446a9312a972cd42a8e8dcdd3801e6a5b49945","0d96d1cb0e1b27027824499d9c423a7c643b70e9629335bb40e5a44ad94fca01","9578b7b25468e203848bf2f2f0f9cffd2ebc1e779b5ed46c858246b2f7642510","b12e86b748594183e28e0d8ddf43b652b654a23699531f3d42d5a83e8d1899c8","de33b164d6af19affedd4842f49320d31284ecee0447a4ba9d2494e8925023d4","e64bf78de30e468c5759fba0023052a5cb6f51ff355b13c415abe003595e18ac","88022737f31e2449c02ef13ee37de9da12ea70fca98842e93142f63c6baada9a","e5d682666a1e8a17c3054cfb6846a97b4896a9d762dee0027bd088b169998b67","4a5ee39145888e50646eea982c278189411c71d60282f5e87f193fc289220269","6540d0a0b0ec6b04bcd1f4fa84ce4ede2f09472e3e57e78b1bf769a2ff8642d2","f2c651f4c7fe1e929891ea02d584eed5ece5145690464f50871caac062bf2fce","5318f2d7937c26363a3ba039875ac8a5bba9c3ed3654c9b539e0e5eb7d32eb0e","c75b368ead71b001e738591648507a42d95b8363f4258df90de30a51c2ded1f3"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1656,1679],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p1656"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":1680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the PDCP entity for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the physical channel configuration for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the keys used in the source SpCell (the KgNB key, the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key), if any;","paragraph_zero_based":1684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration is received via other RAT (i.e., inter-RAT handover to NR):","paragraph_zero_based":1685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration does not include the fullConfig and the UE is connected to 5GC (i.e., delta signalling during intra 5GC handover):","paragraph_zero_based":1686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-use the source RAT SDAP and PDCP configurations if available (i.e., current SDAP/PDCP configurations for all RBs from source E-UTRA RAT prior to the reception of the inter-RAT HO RRCReconfiguration message);","paragraph_zero_based":1687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the fullConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the full configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.11;","paragraph_zero_based":1690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":1691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the cell group configuration for the received masterCellGroup according to 5.3.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterKeyUpdate:","paragraph_zero_based":1693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform AS security key update procedure as specified in 5.3.5.7;","paragraph_zero_based":1694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the sk-Counter:","paragraph_zero_based":1695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform security key update procedure as specified in 5.3.5.7;","paragraph_zero_based":1696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":1697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the cell group configuration for the SCG according to 5.3.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig includes mrdc-ReleaseAndAdd:","paragraph_zero_based":1701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform MR-DC release as specified in clause 5.3.5.10;","paragraph_zero_based":1702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup is set to nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1703}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["895c7c7c06fa8918a056ad062d4e9f8139ff56de5f9ed36e0adc23baef11311a","4a3aa7ea699e93fe9d88ae2f05428804ed2abbdd96e0aa46d0f44e5cb82e16b6","82c2884f26919dcc15dfef5a832c033487124ce6a14b8d71b8c7b18a478ecbc6","c6ea292fe4026127f005949405c75a1381879c91e61f4894876eec9f2f5bc6c4","7ce0ce0fe8cef2b6d0e1decc74030a5f7069fc8c066477f8c2d9ac8f4676e74f","8ebf8d9595096c6d5086a43703efbe795ef1de09d14a8e016fcbc847e02ae94f","0fe78b21a5a82d6de81c348c16b83125b88ebd6df2f0923f4f26fb278df7317f","cf50893572d16eb0830939d1c0a6533009228f7ade40776a38b0418f1dd38323","7b160069e3fbc4ff131260cd9044eb43c6ba4658b4b6d7379e7168030b78c1fd","c21ef940a093da197ba6013aad91bce10fbddf40427e3135b3cf55123301e383","1a07b3bc4bdf02568e3e5b79c7dac5343d5ccabe77816a822ff0e29f9f719c79","d766c5d868a825647df7b096e9e22dd27227aa2f247fc1024bae83ae44206f82","91beee0d4c35ece4682a328f2d4317119093e87ef2e007e903f5cd06ec500a54","95dd8896f35289677f95070390e73b21abd9b773f65a7518689000154130e773","d321ddba8aa3be7c0d0708f64750fa51a213d367b936abf2a929a1ab219b492c","9ee6bf837aa629e7f1b014625aaa361cc83c884025bff8c1e67f12c1a0361622","0e7a276140d67063181d22c1da3744f2dfa0e401c10013b12314d70775a61c84","bc92c9c384a1412c09fe5320f48a514fb16c8d8fa6b666b76a9b73e113aadb47","175906992d626e7859ad7d9b802527a7f306b7cdbe51b4f3fa0220aa1541b487","5685bb5abe0949eb73beca5966c07f828263f8991d8ed7e1c769015cbfe63059","0062a28769c7967ed8655724ca4d82bc3271c79a652c632fcc5f86adec95123c","5d460eb8bd367f99044cedc937c5905eaeef9d54ac400c4d1a65490447a04182","500e92452535793b67f97df4d146261171656adaf9f8bae46850c91dbe8345f0","79c00d42ceeaffbdb966f85c3c9d9a3c727faa8c440f7b1887579c33967c16ac"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1680,1703],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p1680"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the RRC reconfiguration according to 5.3.5.3 for the RRCReconfiguration message included in nr-SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup is set to eutra-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the RRC connection reconfiguration as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.3 for the RRCConnectionReconfiguration message included in eutra-SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig is set to release):","paragraph_zero_based":1707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform MR-DC release as specified in clause 5.3.5.10;","paragraph_zero_based":1708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the radioBearerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the radio bearer configuration according to 5.3.5.6;","paragraph_zero_based":1710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the radioBearerConfig2:","paragraph_zero_based":1711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the radio bearer configuration according to 5.3.5.6;","paragraph_zero_based":1712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the measConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the dedicatedNAS-MessageList:","paragraph_zero_based":1715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward each element of the dedicatedNAS-MessageList to upper layers in the same order as listed;","paragraph_zero_based":1716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the dedicatedSIB1-Delivery:","paragraph_zero_based":1717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the action upon reception of SIB1 as specified in 5.2.2.4.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:If this RRCReconfiguration is associated to the MCG and includes reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig and dedicatedSIB1-Delivery, the UE initiates (if needed) the request to acquire required SIBs, according to clause 5.2.2.3.5, only after the random access procedure or the LTM cell switch execution towards the target SpCell is completed.","paragraph_zero_based":1719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the dedicatedSystemInformationDelivery:","paragraph_zero_based":1720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the action upon reception of System Information as specified in 5.2.2.4;","paragraph_zero_based":1721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if all the SIB(s) and/or posSIB(s) requested in DedicatedSIBRequest message have been acquired:","paragraph_zero_based":1722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the dedicatedPosSysInfoDelivery:","paragraph_zero_based":1724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the action upon reception of the contained posSIB(s), as specified in clause 5.2.2.4.16;","paragraph_zero_based":1725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if all the SIB(s) and/or posSIB(s) requested in DedicatedSIBRequest message have been acquired:","paragraph_zero_based":1726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1727}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["79f3fbe8b9e503d463cc0197d31cce1bd740309c300448432847a87f598d76ec","5a952c125e25ded7a86d64b6f991a41a5e5ed9942207abe97d6eda0cac82ec6c","7b2a659cd2cce3cfcecfb47b28e08c42a0cfab72d8965f59649383e886c4b991","59af2ac36fe01a5f08eb52c4200d55b11a176d86321a700e73904fa363414523","8c650258cc67ca413ef5fa9b8517497cb3f069469549f0e9e4abebadeb764811","f0ef7d007bbbab3f2a1f3eaed83f41ffd18f82fed13f79536865989f86de6453","af28bf80193c99b2d4468db6056cf3bd5af5d5cc52485d3bcbce4ac35288a10f","80297d31bc943119e31edebc35511667dc0dc11b169666c19992aa6dd8223dcb","4bfb2a60b1907caf43a26faf95bb8f787e214ff9cb9d24b2907d04f5677fd96e","b9ccfb530f324ce5b618c4e8c73773f24583ead817d62ecbc5202bbdff364cbe","144f51b17388cf83a202c1f3fc99a6d7d8df02246da03ac4bc96e1c676f8accc","360277329292e7a51b7faf28d47421f53c4e291b114e3ed6e6a3306f277b2dc8","3093830422fe03acd0f072e4af92581460990306f2105851f88ab1423c39e059","006a5839bff29c02ed5599d2ed765fb56289a6fac8fb65c2c08b6f62184b750a","bac08ab9e67dffe97a0007a6dc5a9e9dbdcf5e422864bdf5eba282ebc32cb012","54600f77715996a4eb65435c79ffd3bce37daf1ee4bb5d37330f8d5ce2c8e764","19f04fbede74938684216a220a84a18401399f97734cb243b626c1a40da3cb39","8b322344325d9353431ec1fcba31ced9afe952001179817dc864304bffb074be","95c95a92311f690061aa3b71dd2bd841a978fb8635fe1cd5f9b9274ec6f35a49","d34dbfd012b8ae78a5e2dede7a957339351eeda1bc1a52e172e1ae0139402261","3577109860d8f5d8df16d853cf3206551975f54e5e32045e719c40c0a4d2273d","885347c0dff7c40a56b20c95deb706e7ffdd1495eeb8eb49557872fcc3f710c9","40781baefcb28dae6094a938433f142818b61e325ea3efe17e55d2b8fd458c99","71eab898828632eb687be4d7ff3cb164a6e494c8634f1f5843a3cecd8ca55ce2"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1704,1727],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p1704"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the otherConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the other configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.9;","paragraph_zero_based":1729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the bap-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the BAP configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.12;","paragraph_zero_based":1731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the iab-IP-AddressConfigurationList:","paragraph_zero_based":1732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if iab-IP-AddressToReleaseList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":1733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform release of IP address as specified in 5.3.5.12a.1.1;","paragraph_zero_based":1734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if iab-IP-AddressToAddModList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":1735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform IAB IP address addition/update as specified in 5.3.5.12a.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the conditionalReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":1737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform conditional reconfiguration as specified in 5.3.5.13;","paragraph_zero_based":1738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapsConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapsConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1743},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":1749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1751}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0541a031abb6d8f86f4dfbf08058ecfe654cd07c7a2c8a82b1060b33b96ad8de","573310a44e6a5bfd9fe283d56bd6dedf5f376671bd7caa180375c0ca91122ab0","43de5572250565235165998cb8de1e17d59da007514ef08c4be78009fa723e92","fa4af12a3c1ee0649406b63230ebb4999587ee2cb9b00b76224d15d110a1ac8b","07f272bdaaf639c74091