{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the onDemandSIB-Request:","paragraph_zero_based":1754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if onDemandSIB-Request is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to request SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED in accordance with clause 5.2.2.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to request SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED in accordance with clause 5.2.2.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the sidelink dedicated configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.14;","paragraph_zero_based":1761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0a:If the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR was received embedded within an E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration message, the UE does not build an NR RRCReconfigurationComplete message for the received sl-ConfigDedicatedNR.","paragraph_zero_based":1762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-L2RelayUE-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the L2 U2N or U2U Relay UE configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.15;","paragraph_zero_based":1764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the L2 U2N or U2U Remote UE configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.16;","paragraph_zero_based":1766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the dedicatedPagingDelivery:","paragraph_zero_based":1767},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the Paging message reception procedure as specified in 5.3.2.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-ConfigDedicatedEUTRA-Info:","paragraph_zero_based":1769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform related procedures for V2X sidelink communication in accordance with TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.10 and clause 5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the ul-GapFR2-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the FR2 UL gap configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.13c;","paragraph_zero_based":1772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the musim-GapConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the MUSIM gap configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.9a;","paragraph_zero_based":1774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the appLayerMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1775}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8db907f11fd59f41c9a88234dd5c64041d7123b