{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RPLMN is not included in plmn-IdentityList in VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>discard any application layer measurement reports which were not yet fully submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":1779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the application layer measurement configuration including its fields in the UE variables VarAppLayerIdleConfig and VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement report for the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":1781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if idleInactiveReportAllowed is included in the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":1782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the UE is configured with at least one application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the procedure in 5.7.16.2 after the RRCReconfigurationComplete has been transmitted;","paragraph_zero_based":1784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":1787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the application layer measurement configuration including its fields in the UE variables VarAppLayerIdleConfig and VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>discard any application layer measurement reports which were not yet fully submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement reports for the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":1790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the application layer measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.13d;","paragraph_zero_based":1791},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the ue-TxTEG-RequestUL-TDOA-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if ue-TxTEG-RequestUL-TDOA-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the UE positioning assistance information procedure as specified in 5.7.14;","paragraph_zero_based":1794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the configuration of UE positioning assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":1796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the aerial-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>(re)configure the aerial parameters in accordance with the included aerial-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":1798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-IndirectPathAddChange:","paragraph_zero_based":1799}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["aed1e530a707ed6cc0de8f4a0234076ace5e97be1a1acb4c915d829c7492003d","dc45a0a22878b58bbcea7011e1cc7eea809445b33d8939fde040d4a6a54e2780","3527504f7a979f72511443ca8dcad099d4c3983dbbbcb88dbc08b19fc3f2c3a3","d8b778c2f42cc8640d2c1239db13f5b573414cef20b372883ec7186622066869","f59a1bf247fa2a5c93031710999195842612771c2935f1fb5e7e4e945ddb6ac4","5ef6b48b1383bc15bb061e93306511721d46d1bcf495a9d6aabac20da65de179","a5a6796b0ef6d1c3cf5b430c945ecd247cc3a83d1882b573fbab03ee5b0f07d2","9d4f10f263bc04b20fd2a7666ddcdae9c658a34ead04d3486c582e3c4288e668","3fb65a3868945b061743ec761fa873a48426f73abbe8a4b05e6223f97b851244","607109a1d2b2609bacc87bc7e381130f929ebb8bb3b3a62ef4f8894baf20face","5177699707ec396cfb354c72cd3faa749f28b9cc5f00e8e0ffd28b0cc8d43375","63e171c0e191eb8e0252d1bbabd88f5073def909ef59afd9fe9f7e8c40bece97","79c463d4ee28e5e10de55c0119e4d293ea8b63cc95e07735b3c05c887a353760","42d638d29b1f2f9d969395b61f1b7481282635567a06584a8a4e695b17342436","5ebfcd20e89ab6d79c47aa5d0e29d7b9459675a1cd34e0827d7ba831f6e90e48","98d407158db666694e8bd1311631acb350ea5ba7cba402b2f75f5add41ff5227","13072ae64d39ea14793dd4fb200a96761e91a2fbbd5093a54e91501ef8945f9a","00040ecd74a6f7632a2151215ea66124a7b8408bf5b0cb80451ca8340d13e8c4","6937f58d8c5ca70f754383e83a525a10913486b84e80d2c2723f68afd8a9c203","99d8018e35a826faee53b10c2324a096be7bb3a4faf538dabc570286f3e71b5d","dd89568c7d342e56668750d3249206b3c71dbbea9830fb48642a45782d57971d","67c1d5195b4ff1b11598a0e9ce5c750d4190c8ef4a9373ee7f5f6ba75f49d532","7f9e21c1bf854160a9332484bef00039e7c72c1a2ba9e69935e6435258e753fa","2d1b3658c0cfec294a81852b552206ab3af69b6d7dfcc7a91f08cbb17b082663"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1776,1799],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/dele