{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the SL indirect path specific configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.17.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the n3c-IndirectPathAddChange:","paragraph_zero_based":1801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform configuration procedure for the remote UE part of N3C indirect path as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay:","paragraph_zero_based":1803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the configuration procedure for the relay UE part of N3C indirect path as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the ltm-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the ltm-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the LTM configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.18.1;","paragraph_zero_based":1807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the LTM configuration release procedure as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.7;","paragraph_zero_based":1809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the srs-PosResourceSetLinkedForAggBWList:","paragraph_zero_based":1810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosResourceSetLinkedForAggBWList is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the SRS for positioning transmission using bandwidth aggregation provided in configuration srs-PosResourceSetLinkedForAggBW as specified in TS 38.211 [16];","paragraph_zero_based":1812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release all the configuration of srs-PosResourceSetLinkedForAggBW;","paragraph_zero_based":1814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the content of the RRCReconfigurationComplete message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1815},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent:","paragraph_zero_based":1816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList for each MCG serving cell with UL;","paragraph_zero_based":1817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include uplinkDirectCurrentBWP-SUL for each MCG serving cell configured with SUL carrier, if any, within the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList;","paragraph_zero_based":1818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":1819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":1821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent:","paragraph_zero_based":1823}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212