{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE was configured with successPSCell-Config when connected to the source PSCell (for PSCell change) or to the PCell (for PSCell addition or change):","paragraph_zero_based":1992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the actions for the successful PSCell change report determination as specified in clause 5.7.10.7, upon successfully completing the Random Access procedure triggered for the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessPSCell-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":1994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarSuccessPSCell-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":1995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include successPSCell-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":1996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission using the new configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":1997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (RRCReconfiguration was received via SRB1):","paragraph_zero_based":1998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in NR-DC and;","paragraph_zero_based":1999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration does not include the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the scg-State:","paragraph_zero_based":2001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":2002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG activation without SN message as specified in 5.3.5.13b1;","paragraph_zero_based":2004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":2005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if ta-Report or ta-ReportATG is configured with value enabled and the UE supports TA reporting:","paragraph_zero_based":2006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate TA report initiation to lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":2007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SRB1 to lower layers for transmission using the new configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if this is the first RRCReconfiguration message after successful completion of the RRC re-establishment procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":2009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>resume SRB2, SRB4, DRBs, multicast MRB, and BH RLC channels for IAB-MT, and Uu Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N Relay UE, that are suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":2010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-IndirectPathAddChange was included in RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":2011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SRB1 is configured as split SRB and pdcp-Duplication is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>when successfully sending RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SL indirect path (i.e., PC5 RLC acknowledgement is received from target L2 U2N Relay UE):","paragraph_zero_based":2013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T421;","paragraph_zero_based":2014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> else (i.e. split SRB1 with duplication is not configured):","paragraph_zero_based":2015}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["39dc1f81c758b6885add9c5adbce5b0748c15d3db323c780574c63ed39dd8534","90513cace5a06e5264b8627a9d4c033efe3eafaf375d598306a96069dbb9bb6d","42153d62845dabe26bbae632ba5ac0b30ad4f42975031cddbc119c82e8976ee0","0658d79de1f462466a2ed674be091f8931a0211b1f9f1d5e86eeec94a19839c2","aac3e645727eeaf495d8128d1c402de1144a5bd5501e6f4e438fedd40b994861","95b61fafd96790de717450cdd5fa5f41cfab38a60bb449f952f21c1983b52076","687175ada9a017bdca641242756476df2aee662eb77d7bf82af1a9f3e2c3be7e","d5e7bad7eada84f9b58d26232f97aabbbce85a5b67740d728854ea5214889c42","25c8ceb3360e78ac441dc9863165b21f71c4ff08dce7457d3a5242b8907aab96","754ff2c41f7fa257f057f4171e2dd38a2d9a5fa786aa74137f88c5158f1cb7e8","6ea5594373c5e86790184e0d213cdf2405d6a9c02b905c67ca84f074f7890ef1","8416bd0a88b296855e822e97135dc546c4c12c293a5825e12c62c1b108862614","7df588518d27bfb1fdfebbbdd2020fd8aa7bc78f39ad952b2175ba957adb20c6","2715b505cec68b8fa2a6de68b302c32d9a053b5bbdff4e60eaa5dd05bdba1ee7","df1696529db3385b7d6fc977992800fe78054278ae6f82fe8928c6db55d83e0b","b34e39c97b73e345ddd15b6dcfb500111e3c1f7d2b9d3b8d46277e3d131ba6a2","40101050a5f038dddaa5210e74b704abde6418dd73283cc1e4c3fa44e7263f93","0955783cecc684c45f4df1f40928cd60534e6c777d5a0c35be5affef9fdc6f28","bc18a76eb685307c7aab684aa895d52fa5678b36156a39446e0c35f62132b798","4748ce50b357b1751e9cb9a5ed3a001466f423fd998793ee30f10e12a29248e4","d9ebf5546aee3fa93db7cdfb74850ac56168b5310fcb232dd8b17303c930e0c8","75d1671e8165cd4160282ab451786e77e70d5275717fe15798d8dd0d2aee0a85","960b00c7051e9b63d2a88904f1e5c3116c5263a589a6f6c48912a8f0e3f849dd","25fa39e05e171b0f43a096967c0aa0d71cc4e2b87135709f28814154aac5a53b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1992,2015],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p1992"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> when receiving RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message from target L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":2016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T421;","paragraph_zero_based":2017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG or SCG and when MAC of an NR cell group successfully completes a Random Access procedure triggered above; or,","paragraph_zero_based":2018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-PathSwitchConfig was included in reconfigurationWithSync included in spCellConfig of an MCG, and when successfully sending RRCReconfigurationComplete message (i.e., PC5 RLC acknowledgement is received from target L2 U2N Relay UE); or,","paragraph_zero_based":2019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if rach-LessHO was included in reconfigurationWithSync included in spCellConfig of an MCG, and upon indication from lower layers that the RACH-less handover has been successfully completed; or,","paragraph_zero_based":2020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG or SCG and the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to an LTM cell switch execution and upon an indication from lower layer that the LTM cell switch execution has been successfully completed:","paragraph_zero_based":2021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T304 for that cell group if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-PathSwitchConfig was included in reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":2023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sl-IndirectPathMaintain is not included in reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":2024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T420;","paragraph_zero_based":2025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release all radio resources, including release of the RLC entities and the MAC configuration at the source side;","paragraph_zero_based":2026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>reset MAC used in the source cell;","paragraph_zero_based":2027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (sl-IndirectPathMaintain is included):","paragraph_zero_based":2028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release radio resources on the direct path, including release of the RLC entities and the MAC configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>reset MAC used in the source cell;","paragraph_zero_based":2030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if rach-LessHO was included in reconfigurationWithSync and cg-NTN-Configuration was configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the uplink grant configured for RACH-less handover;","paragraph_zero_based":2032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2b:PDCP and SDAP configured by the source prior to the path switch that are reconfigured and re-used by target when delta signalling is used, are not released as part of this procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":2033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T310 for source SpCell if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the parts of the CSI reporting configuration, the scheduling request configuration and the sounding RS configuration that do not require the UE to know the SFN of the respective target SpCell, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the parts of the measurement and the radio resource configuration that require the UE to know the SFN of the respective target SpCell (e.g. measurement gaps, periodic CQI reporting, scheduling request configuration, sounding RS configuration), if any, upon acquiring the SFN of that target SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DRB configured as DAPS bearer, request uplink data switching to the PDCP entity, as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":2037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":2038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":2039}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e5fce428be818aa949d6976db9571b8c3a70d50934eaab9a1007b8f146b71047","12e12baed339146716b3427fb186d101c169e07028c8d2363bb46391726224be","2b1d382d3459b08afd210dfb3e38f4d8ee341242f66cc74097f8ea877d3f1c32","6d87f31432e2ce365a7a7b0dc58c28a2182e3382e7d221e579478b5265368050","e8127d3965544574403e9dd91aab365fb36a6c1f9e0effbb0569f9e364b4f2f1","cd8d27c2884dad3d12e9257e6a9196a3588a4728d45aa61df4db6b11131511d0","869891a04dd7e893a8d1d471d6b0e471e8021c9eb96a6d9148647b7ef20becbe","f7682645efef93ce36de771e4a316894e640e060ea73ac1ef56ec05dbd7f4261","fb492e7dc650ad4840caaab392d32d284c5de3bb8c16afe2b4265a020741304f","45ff35818b1002a4a07187fd4d8e591e182d5aad54fd6c7cd332841bfb9a2a96","a3cfe8b7cecd51fe7449e80553ecf3c88f104c123e85bd57b6004ef5cddb3ff0","3bacdb62f0d14ca09f8373ec29663ca6bf37b55a314613d65d60ef2b8c79ef01","8cb0d6abf10c7b0818f821311940e5806fa67a16330b77ae8bc7389b7fd3241e","d0691faca5469b920c644823f6f315568a195b76a6cb7a21139259f023791bf3","687f90c10f380555fcdc11fb0eabd59d8c2c5e375793afb9922ced026b3cffce","41233d538dacd1cfe214b29d49a80c564b89dbb71fd80a2a5c263ed0716be7d9","cac1f9e3760d5656d4a9d22db62e9dd4c726b2f4de9994c46af8553f0a6a792a","3c4d9ac317cbdaa7684e2a18e2282427446e8c6b121b2658b5a5c424e979e7d5","fd491a6878b4e76dcb7b6b5e0014ad2fae32c7e8090954d217e2cc9affbcfb32","3ac6f2c9a27ed61e74cd1745f96e12c153c8d12b5fc9635b39a47529dbe804cf","76858fe3ccb1e95fab0bf60777b24121cfe031d3cea623211eb03b1852c7a691","4fef441e9b7a1c809978f37c8e8caa307150e6b957a51f4188ac9f5a4fc419ea","95f7f7f5bb89cc1a1d045a7c1a4bb420f2d1aea2eab07b5b95311b715a1e7b0f","5469fcc6e0c0d5f1d3954d672b3acdb2f1d92c6ad9b6c70ae2bbbae17be0df35"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2016,2039],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2016"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":2040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4.","paragraph_zero_based":2041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if T350 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":2042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T350;","paragraph_zero_based":2043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if RRCReconfiguration does not include dedicatedSIB1-Delivery and","paragraph_zero_based":2044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the active downlink BWP, which is indicated by the firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id for the target SpCell of the MCG, has a common search space configured by searchSpaceSIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":2045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the SIB1, which is scheduled as specified in TS 38.213 [13], of the target SpCell of the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":2046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>upon acquiring SIB1, perform the actions specified in clause 5.2.2.4.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution and the subsequentCondReconfig is included in the entry in VarConditionalReconfig containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":2048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each entry in the condReconfigList within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if there is an entry in condExecutionCondToAddModList within the subsequentCondReconfig that has subsequentCondReconfigId matching the condReconfigId in the entry of the condReconfigList: ","paragraph_zero_based":2050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if subsequentCondExecutionCond is included in the entry of the condExecutionCondToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>store in the condExecutionCond in the entry of the condReconfigList the value of subsequentCondExecutionCond in the entry of the condExecutionCondToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":2052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if subsequentCondExecutionCondSCG is included in the entry of the condExecutionCondToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>store in the condExecutionCondSCG in the entry of the condReconfigList the value of subsequentCondExecutionCondSCG in the entry of the condExecutionCondToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":2054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":2055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an SCG and the CPA, CPC, or subsequent CPAC was configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove all the entries in the condReconfigList within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig except for the entries in which subsequentCondReconfig is present, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove all the entries within VarConditionalReconfiguration as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.9.6, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each measId of the MCG measConfig, if configured, and for each measId of the SCG measConfig, if configured, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the reportConfigId is not associated with any measId indicated by the condExecutionCond or the condExecutionCondSCG in an entry of condReconfigList in VarConditionalReconfig in which subsequentCondReconfig is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching reportConfigId from the reportConfigList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the associated measObjectId is only associated to a reportConfig with reportType set to condTriggerConfig; and","paragraph_zero_based":2062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the measObjectId is not associated with any measId indicated by the condExecutionCond or the condExecutionCondSCG in an entry of condReconfigList in VarConditionalReconfig in which subsequentCondReconfig is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2063}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9a0136e960cc7e3dd6ee07c68f54a10e489cdad8d47a78d5026df522a088336d","1cdfc1f8c71efd44aadef4ab83e95b2b7aa789b336d8a7709079a4a10f9461f3","45c37359bb7d0fc1edf6053f540beb28234ba8eadb82ceddf48d3d73086aa241","3f8b2f40c308d83ce3e1e249d8ea85ae56d87f2f83863ad6b11d373bbd6ea08c","51fedf1a33b687bed500722207d8ff433349d22ff50d99077841ffb94c19beba","ccb469f218077e6b6f257eee32f2681d71560ad928b3067f1e4c74ad99741c47","bd83588dfd2b7c5e3e897b70456ea854521aca7584d50c550a2c06f46dcaeea0","62bfc80d3f3ad6a909456f29abaa235784603b432d5902d371c5584324ed00d8","b8602bc8a9fd76984f766993d9ac20f3fbe39971fca9aa94a36feea07fb16ec3","b61ef2b42096336d000c60eddc133bca595bd96fcdca93b5252b712e1d201eb8","d302b18e036601684b108d1abb7344f0a708eda9003c412159eda9db878f26d8","73531967af03accf4eb7114c8389af2484afc6ce1118e97e8ee1e4e488863194","f5b1b976f4c20ae463ba53af71ccbcf593d12644c183b832042134bfb152c26e","790fcc1c12f23e469a3e1c8fcef63e57c1e070e932d9ba01a1b42369e525b83d","ca1ce58dd470f5f37a2c865474a9b03561039bf60b41a081d5c256367f3d3056","609d70ee44d66021ac18d8296fa6f80a0ee2ffb8020e1018653b867607b70a03","7be4dd19f2ae7bbd70bb9e1889f6a9395102a2733343f421291863d48d2e7478","771eac0e226683e8b04e1f53e18641f3f846fe601ce32a701b296b5b210fca0c","5c0111d5dd66308a0ee2826361c317e5f5081d1f2540d651e8f5f00a4bf38a95","e51618782c910c2ca6ec6a3ad0049ac5da8bbfacb519e9fa0d526766a1588029","dcb6153b1236d8b02b1472db85c57793691b4ee7fbbbf01d056b572691b330f3","fa4990d9b77b40378454f8617d2cbf8cb7765959e82bd0f1a249c059003e82d7","b589b4c2eabb6622115ea669664d5698113947615bf51a19fe2ba8d01feb4f9b","b71fcc19461caf4a029daef1336c5852819a9dddac73bf13209a65c268ef86ee"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2040,2063],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2040"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching measObjectId from the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching measId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in masterCellGroup or secondaryCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":2066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE initiated transmission of a UEAssistanceInformation message for the corresponding cell group during the last 1 second, and the UE is still configured to provide the concerned UE assistance information for the corresponding cell group; or","paragraph_zero_based":2067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution or an LTM cell switch procedure, and the UE is configured to provide UE assistance information for the corresponding cell group, and the UE has initiated transmission of a UEAssistanceInformation message for the corresponding cell group since it was configured to do so in accordance with 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":2068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of a UEAssistanceInformation message for the corresponding cell group in accordance with clause 5.7.4.3 to provide the concerned UE assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":2069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start or restart the prohibit timer (if exists) or the leave without response timer or the wait timer for the MUSIM associated with the concerned UE assistance information with the timer value set to the value in corresponding configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB12 is provided by the target PCell, and the UE initiated transmission of a SidelinkUEInformationNR message indicating a change of NR sidelink communication/discovery related parameters relevant in target PCell (i.e. change of sl-RxInterestedFreqList or sl-TxResourceReqList) during the last 1 second preceding reception of the RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of an MCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":2071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution and the UE is capable of NR sidelink communication/discovery and SIB12 is provided by the target PCell, and the UE has initiated transmission of a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since it was configured to do so in accordance with 5.8.3.2:","paragraph_zero_based":2072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each application layer measurement configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if application layer measurement report container has been received from upper layers for which the successful transmission of the MeasurementReportAppLayer message or at least one segment of the message via SRB4 (if reconfigurationWithSync was included in masterCellGroup) or SRB5 (if reconfigurationWithSync was included in secondaryCellGroup) has not been confirmed by lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":2075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if RRC segmentation was used for the MeasurementReportAppLayer message:","paragraph_zero_based":2076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if RRC segmentation is enabled based on the field rrc-SegAllowedSRB4 or rrc-SegAllowedSRB5 for the reportingSRB (or SRB4 if reportingSRB is not configured):","paragraph_zero_based":2077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>re-submit all segments of the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to lower layers for transmission via the reportingSRB (or SRB4 if reportingSRB is not configured);","paragraph_zero_based":2078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2079},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>discard all segments of the MeasurementReportAppLayer message;","paragraph_zero_based":2080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>re-submit the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to lower layers for transmission via the reportingSRB (or SRB4 if reportingSRB is not configured);","paragraph_zero_based":2082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in masterCellGroup and the target cell provides SIB21 or provides SIB1 including non-ServingCellMII:","paragraph_zero_based":2083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE initiated transmission of an MBSInterestIndication message during the last 1 second preceding reception of this RRCReconfiguration message; or","paragraph_zero_based":2084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution, and the UE has initiated transmission of an MBSInterestIndication message after having received this RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":2085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of an MBSInterestIndication message in accordance with clause 5.9.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":2087}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["91652ae454ca898f5313f64820bbf765d073f70d0f0c85fab3d5a6770f3e2d3b","fe3aedc139bb83835e60916faa319f1b839e4d0a39b84426d5f7f1ab73a587a0","b31973f3830b017cfc6fa5cff0a6709967eb8424fd00097a7195d512e7154a76","657f63c54e0a75eaf476436562f2736f203e4e56c1987f932e5b238449f3fa70","9e31ce040b649810b2d59fd641330daf4cefc080ee5b1d681c82f8b0738dde70","2d18fbc6c922d4242f3f6371987d07c78468f4884bf91e38b22bdce7e2dfd00f","b3af1631c92abaa0c718de815c8cdb187dc1fa387d5c6a0f02450694e1bd1b39","a85451916553cc68e780f5bfca147d0cd23c674f8d3baa082636f98af4b689f2","cf24fe04e2f4d234900cb8d1cb02baae098c3b99a8d826ad82b2930fedba54af","8f56aa2c899f203f83ce9674c7e4a3c31fec840109656241318ab6685be107b9","fed7eed231e9a191a1291ba5e19ac776da29893567ded8afc1895914d8ba44c5","d0d8507090907e84f40dc1f6887ee5f2363c89e06070f732a651d12deba8fb5e","4613975f30aaaf769c5cf769ef425da0837b6b43424d641f94b72fcac10bfc9e","173fb48f663908daa324eb2e432cd0d3f9218b58358baab8993e73a846a24305","6b882647325650bea280d291884f2a10242d1d4d90e748057e561e748252eebf","859502754941243b8f780419861f21c13af5ccb5830e0347e17f3f350c313ae2","5495139838d27cadf588af60c8e3f31d97518ca1a4471d660786585395887474","7486a9f8aa140a484bfb9d6ba0388fc70a1e3d17a35a8c45bb6765dfba903201","a2111c0599ca6ef393bc4c49f947a5e40374d291af00977a1ddb12bc0bbe3c4c","e6786119f2f461fe25ff52f798ce0ae92c18e5cf71f8ef926172c13160d12201","1deb3eb771cec53a7e89351d667f86d2ebed514ce8b33536192d62c785ecae46","a2197fb67eecf736e5a804fd8ff53b19afaaec7e9a15b119b619d0b66c4695fd","9335cb153303f015c7852ff25ee83cdc885f88eda1c28d11651308f9f6831af2","c454c023b611b1144c568f970e38a4c06c244bf6741ddc391b0b3691f846d6cb"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2064,2087],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2064"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:The UE is only required to acquire broadcasted SIB1 if the UE can acquire it without disrupting unicast or MBS multicast data reception, i.e. the broadcast and unicast/MBS multicast beams are quasi co-located.","paragraph_zero_based":2088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4: The UE sets the content of UEAssistanceInformation according to latest configuration (i.e. the configuration after applying the RRCReconfiguration message) and latest UE preference. The UE may include more than the concerned UE assistance information within the UEAssistanceInformation according to 5.7.4.2. Therefore, the content of UEAssistanceInformation message might not be the same as the content of the previous UEAssistanceInformation message.","paragraph_zero_based":2089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.4Secondary cell group release","paragraph_zero_based":2090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>as a result of SCG release triggered by E-UTRA (i.e. (NG)EN-DC case) or NR (i.e. NR-DC case):","paragraph_zero_based":2092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset SCG MAC, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each RLC bearer that is part of the SCG configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform RLC bearer release procedure as specified in 5.3.5.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each BH RLC channel that is part of the SCG configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform BH RLC channel release procedure as specified in 5.3.5.5.10;","paragraph_zero_based":2097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the SCG configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each application layer measurement configuration that is part of the SCG configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the application layer measurement configuration including its fields in the UE variables VarAppLayerIdleConfig and VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":2101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>discard any application layer measurement reports which were not yet fully submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":2102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement reports for the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":2103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard any application layer measurement reports which were configured to be reported via SRB5 and which were not yet fully submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":2104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all the entries within the SCG VarConditionalReconfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SCG release was triggered by NR (i.e. NR-DC case):","paragraph_zero_based":2106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove all the entries in the condReconfigList within the MCG VarConditionalReconfig for which subsequentCondReconfig is not present and the RRCReconfiguration within condRRCReconfig does not include the masterCellGroup with reconfigurationWithSync, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (i.e. EN-DC case):","paragraph_zero_based":2108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform VarConditionalReconfiguration CPC removal as specified in TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.9.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T310 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T312 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2111}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e025f422b02a80497b3c87dfb1ee05cb3a8f4fa8176968a818583765bb73f85b","5030481ba9503ab567773da3d03b1ad5f7fd90cca2c29c8926b0a23265738065","7ca26415423d8361f6d1966bcf5214aba382825775bdb9dfba6b84770caa93fb","47c534e63839a3777a33765aa9e7e675c3b7e999a7a76ab427e1abaff1b2c35d","8f6b8761975cb3f8b6fad9435784266514108705ed57e3ebc6b79875064a40f3","a0bbd074ebb8c7d2932d177360b96e70ab09a5edd05917dc72522758b7eac2ec","7e024d42a9d310c6e7d244b09ceae7d8fc7d32b51fc93ea171ddcbe4783d91e6","0e396d0849f1664e4f370701142846b48b8c0f5325cfed7aa42700acbd8f6546","028d0021c3721fc5da1f3a870fcc7313eee443953f19516a933b9706839183ee","5d923fcb93e598f0f6679041c366ebdb0034c15433ed5c067f9b0ea0198aa08b","60f2583c0674d8fa6a0c08793b2af42ca3fda65dbeae0dc82216360730f73f78","c576d621d9cf3dd1b5956aada8376933b40dfc410b3f6abe240537d5bd29232b","5f6f3b541622de3402ead5d10bf601be689db49489c351c9bb4c45bfa37fb4e4","61f8a6011dcbee29cfb11b05e96d3701f16daa4ab8b23a89cdc110ce48675813","99cb4909503d4075bdee20c6a69cf17076af4b9bea3d7a6a1377579708da1f6f","0265672f1b91c394a124cc64244c8a4220672acf4f5d4c6e689d2943c7eb1bf1","55696a17986b0f6b3e3c1be8a9e7beffd82771fa592a312a4664eda514d92684","e746a69d608ff74e9ae63d00853606033d1340972f2a4cc81005256f9f6750d8","ce4785dddc6358000f3368c2c6a25e2ffa76e9e1c1642a3dc25d6b697c486bee","a526a54ca0077435c2e82d2b024f5e4dec85f159a44a86e4817e6187fb6113b4","ca9679609e5965644a3498b1f5be4ae0bc069940237f0e9f7b53547e924efb5e","d4838f3d7beb984dc5299eb67961e9c73ed5c0d2aba91fa30b7113f541279f22","ea10e155ae73c40be61dc997493858134acbe1aa2b5fd3dc1ebed82d86c08c67","9b6ac7ffffcc7a7567d86f318c0df71a9d70696d5bf33a0de3b16a0c8345242d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2088,2111],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2088"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T304 for the corresponding SpCell, if running.","paragraph_zero_based":2112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:Release of cell group means only release of the lower layer configuration of the cell group but the RadioBearerConfig may not be released.","paragraph_zero_based":2113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5Cell Group configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.1General","paragraph_zero_based":2115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network configures the UE with Master Cell Group (MCG), and zero or one Secondary Cell Group (SCG). In (NG)EN-DC, the MCG is configured as specified in TS 36.331 [10], and for NE-DC, the SCG is configured as specified in TS 36.331 [10]. The network provides the configuration parameters for a cell group in the CellGroupConfig IE.","paragraph_zero_based":2116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE performs the following actions based on a received CellGroupConfig IE:","paragraph_zero_based":2117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the spCellConfig with reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":2118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform Reconfiguration with sync according to 5.3.5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2119},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>resume all suspended radio bearers except the SRBs for the source cell group, and resume SCG transmission for all radio bearers, and resume BH RLC channels and resume SCG transmission for BH RLC channels for IAB-MT, if suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":2120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:If the SCG is deactivated, resuming SCG transmission for all radio bearers does not imply that PDCP PDUs can be transmitted or received on SCG RLC bearers.","paragraph_zero_based":2121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the rlc-BearerToReleaseList or rlc-BearerToReleaseListExt:","paragraph_zero_based":2122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform RLC bearer release as specified in 5.3.5.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the rlc-BearerToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the RLC bearer addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.5.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the mac-CellGroupConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure the MAC entity of this cell group as specified in 5.3.5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":2127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the sCellToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform SCell release as specified in 5.3.5.5.8;","paragraph_zero_based":2129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the spCellConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure the SpCell as specified in 5.3.5.5.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the sCellToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform SCell addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.5.9;","paragraph_zero_based":2133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the bh-RLC-ChannelToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform BH RLC channel release as specified in 5.3.5.5.10;","paragraph_zero_based":2135}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2b137bb17c21bc54c9b1ecfaa558dbf942d352a51ac260bff3a12100d1b51cd3","fb227b66971c45eb5a4848a865638d0458bfd1ea4cdc7b2c4582b7ce06ec3d69","c3b9cb5d8b0183cf90ded7f16bb978dec9e5248830a74de7200d0df15825fbf4","2b1a80064aef3a62b638218f06207a5419cc34ebb9e4965bcc946629ba79463f","8ea57534ac40ffce4a8babcf06b612c2c432dd0e00d970ebb94cc3cdef10da6d","e70fab42d0cbb73972c4e741515c86c66f718822f4de333cab725bef7e3ab872","482753d6ea935262bb809bb602384efec9fb1a9f7ddf8a0867a71a97699602df","936d9ec42486f5ca7492c03db6310266e1bb04cd158eec05cf6b04a53b789775","dc7720aab0b3d95c98f9672cc4dd4b93c7a7bfb406b7fec4e3143816b7f320df","4a582b0813b94f062d6cb7c3e7b343e52b96ccb990d5dc1dd912db1f73d24944","0f2610ae075a6a8cbb56b5fe56dd40b40306514d5b7c9b71faa5ead09203773c","87bfce0ed9466e8e72bcd1e5836ba5a1f984dfb1b0e918f400c25c6cc2c869b9","82942c9d5e90cb0fd38419addbd44bc6e9e0b4221eaa8352667ef51054b11479","e9338d4f9742370ef5ed90510b46dd02435f28f6cbb755f83af97dec5c3ad0ea","fcf91aad8c76dbbc7bc0798067a2e90ce515543456ecf6742d6df80f8c414a03","c1dfb2599f92754d6092be8d1ab3cc3706bfa237e42d0c61e1a235241711748b","3f1c5c377d0097b0c57df0ea70818aa67795052869ac81be38dede54fb9cccad","b2f1d5b973db51e0f5d4825d26b80036867693f206e81f3a0765f3abe2ae715c","cd0bce72409b82062307052eacaf1f1b12c0fda8f61cfed590bb9475cbb96f15","51f3bc1ea6e709f939a1583038e3451963b277444827bd7c74d5c28910551bd1","bdf8f190b270e7d0b795dfacfcc7d1c0b94b0ea7730460898eae7a19e73dc587","8a4747baa8832913b696c671e3d599be2d61e49ed0a3a6e6cbb5043dd4789eed","80f1330ef75d6f474bd09c0f0a67baf3d83d66c2b3c56803ac2a0c304b9f892c","74b057354f3a8b00311dafe31d890c87cd25f1ae8795e8eb7926aa78a295762a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2112,2135],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2112"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the bh-RLC-ChannelToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the BH RLC channel addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.5.11;","paragraph_zero_based":2137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the uu-RelayRLC-ChannelToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform Uu Relay RLC channel release as specified in 5.3.5.5.12;","paragraph_zero_based":2139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the uu-RelayRLC-ChannelToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the Uu Relay RLC channel addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.5.13;","paragraph_zero_based":2141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the ncr-FwdConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the NCR-Fwd configuration as specified in 5.3.5.5.14;","paragraph_zero_based":2143},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the CellGroupConfig contains the autonomousDenialParameters:","paragraph_zero_based":2144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself to be allowed to deny any transmission in a particular UL slot if during the number of slots indicated by autonomousDenialValidity, preceding and including this particular slot, it autonomously denied fewer UL slots than indicated by autonomousDenialSlots within the same cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:When counting the number of denied UL slots, the UE sums up the denied UL slots across all serving cells within the same cell group. When counting the number of slots indicated by autonomousDenialValidity, the UE sums up the UL slots across all serving cells within the same cell group.","paragraph_zero_based":2146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:When multiple denied UL slots across all serving cells partially or fully overlap in the time domain, the number of denied UL slots across all serving cells is counted as one denied UL slot, based on the longest slot.","paragraph_zero_based":2147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.2Reconfiguration with sync","paragraph_zero_based":2148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall perform the following actions to execute a reconfiguration with sync.","paragraph_zero_based":2149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the AS security is not activated, perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with the release cause 'other' upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":2150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T430 if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if no DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T310 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if this procedure is executed for the MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":2154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if timer T316 is running;","paragraph_zero_based":2155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T316;","paragraph_zero_based":2156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE supports RLF-Report for fast MCG recovery procedure as specified in TS 38.306 [26]:","paragraph_zero_based":2157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the elapsedTimeT316 in the VarRLF-Report to the value of the elapsed time of the timer T316;","paragraph_zero_based":2158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the pSCellId in the VarRLF-Report to the global cell identity of the PSCell, if available, otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2159}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2ff906a9712f8a880e34d60cc8cd2b7274a6c68c3843c34906ebd28920890ca4","59ed8bea41c18d48af02b05b52bb4705a1a4d2d0c8fbaaa15947ea1effa9c5fb","7285bf0cb8a38e1e24f646509ee148c2c3b5342b839ebb68a652db27bf317715","ffa6ced4fb839a413320ef106c726e90d37d8dc32d7d7a75ee214a541bcaba89","297a6255edc7138630f935727f30d25665ae38ddab5c91f90324b9d1b283637e","c98726e19ce880f7b7e91e9cedf9929c401c6cfdcdc8c1ebca5934bb8bcd0130","e286a79a99652357714314548e1fe903f006759f6a8e51d623cd4a577937a51e","48634b458fc6acc22c2a430dbd06a1d443cc644dc1c6b6e12467e878bba3d904","6bb8b9b4f85a1176b4550fec702d9f5db59571dc544ef5350e727f45933c8a31","2deb3492c9e9ec13bf62cb767caf419d2c9b7c314e7e0f16c3802d0971a9b7d9","a13411984421a2c623209c0985783e8396f72ac4fdb5f5b75d58aa29fb1ba4bf","38c44af9ff1298ac091a8d44a7e32327c90f3ad79baf8fd209625f12d11d1442","5821768523724c3f1a2125ac02840f87513391fdc1c21e7dbce98269c450df75","b82b779a5a0be19cc8e923810d4e632febd3ba9c87676d9811e476f0029e8828","9d61ebac257d0ebcccc0ed27339b5581801c3c912f4f4502f22ddec781da8fe6","79c84fca96aa2f87f467cf0595ccf457cfb61259ec443719ff3537d7125663f1","1f4c0d3c8627602ad6f24c3823b4b5fa6ff322dad9edd2ebea6142a838010b85","5578f4da1aabf7c04625c4297a1e65c4ab3a9f17b53b937a691e153cea92984e","096da20621bd56cb2e47ae361d1d2cd0cc8762f01d5c8e82b50896bed59ee801","04fcf61d0d6d097f63f414ada77c363e7656e4f3d8612d55d919be6d288f7862","cbae3e1333074f4dd7788ccedb5adddfa526716dc6a7949f2ed3cbf8f465c4ec","9013b1803abe74f66fda260fddd75e028e41490932fb2235f2967b39bf03ebff","c2a6981b42928c2e8294f68e121e16f63baffacfec28d955844320475ffd87ba","a013bd9747167cb360b773bf3cf5bb3d85abaad4afe55b84669305be6fd94018"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2136,2159],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2136"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>clear the information included in VarRLF-Report, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>resume MCG transmission, if suspended.","paragraph_zero_based":2162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T312 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-PathSwitchConfig is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the value of the newUE-Identity as the C-RNTI;","paragraph_zero_based":2165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-IndirectPathMaintain is not included in reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":2166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is L2 U2N remote UE at source side:","paragraph_zero_based":2167},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to upper layer to trigger PC5 unicast link release with the source L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":2168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the target L2 U2N Relay UE to be the one indicated by the targetRelayUE-Identity in the sl-PathSwitchConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T420 for the corresponding target L2 U2N Relay UE with the timer value set to t420, as included in the sl-PathSwitchConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate to upper layer (to trigger the PC5 unicast link establishment) with the target L2 U2N Relay UE indicated by the targetRelayUE-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":2171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the default configuration of SL-RLC1 as defined in 9.2.4 for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the serving cell of the L2 U2N relay UE to be the serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":2174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (sl-PathSwitchConfig is not included):","paragraph_zero_based":2175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if this procedure is executed for the MCG or if this procedure is executed for an SCG not indicated as deactivated in the E-UTRA or NR RRC message in which the RRCReconfiguration message is embedded:","paragraph_zero_based":2176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T304 for the corresponding SpCell with the timer value set to t304, as included in the reconfigurationWithSync;","paragraph_zero_based":2177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the frequencyInfoDL is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the target SpCell to be one on the SSB frequency indicated by the frequencyInfoDL with a physical cell identity indicated by the physCellId;","paragraph_zero_based":2179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the target SpCell to be one on the SSB frequency of the source SpCell with a physical cell identity indicated by the physCellId;","paragraph_zero_based":2181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start synchronising to the DL of the target SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the specified BCCH configuration defined in 9.1.1.1 for the target SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2183}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["979a9f957fb2b195f51cc1112569c63edff4183d0f6e1a73369dc03c2d23d959","28d43ba974ab8c27f2420b23cff6877ed01bd1a63a46720a7670ff2a472e1c9c","daf996457c0088ec4e53b8d443d678f1af4b1f9593e08e0ec4911a356b16f0a0","916afd1f8b4704d635c70c33987ba94d755a7ecb89f61be13b6ca413ad6f5b7b","e51c77f3567e94cfcbd7ba1b6cab148a5f350f71ed9093b1f7a517a0e7bed143","19b22b8bdecd8c79778f7e0c3e301097f9b0e7b31fb37c9ec873e6423ce8975d","8a6649d651c7c919814c9fcf51056618a2fa76416dfdcf5e0a735fbc2944db7d","b25d5c1285e0d38ad3f348fdb47b276eaa0e0b3d477264042fee60f81b1e7cc5","19ee2b31efde6da23fe009f874700528dcc80603e5a1edbcf9ee756457406438","60ca134957c5b0ee1238a50c3785aeba1ec18a45553378ecf412aae73fc818d8","df472640522b48db7a7782da9c4e8803e08716e38fe695c8e19601d5f419fba3","51d29d2110c5b9c0dd95a7ad668857cb44a2819b35de58c1cb74f9d4db8f5167","f8ed7feaeec03f7631ad18d47c0d70cb6661c6ce2ac084542370944f6c3de13d","bb4c700d02306bd7db38046d36f702dbf8e2d149a8da054d31c3ca675259b716","8a0fbd22fff0d78ce13da3fe497a4e788dc79f8e0ff51d11b3c3a127038b74d8","9f310331c5d2cd878183dc9782c638f2a8a6abebf08040f1d8660e62a3447fd3","f242cf396dd744dab222893a08b7806217a250ca947d814032b59faad6c7b14e","e7a11705b46ac1e60a24c360627a3cf33399b7dd00886457818b9c0710612350","286cf760274da52644cedf7fc4805e022b069c4b189093e71de01c62e682bda3","596e0ffd4bb5e018b0ee31cdd29c588f624cc065b3cf495385c91e3e27e579d9","0fefaa7ce3ba2ad0d5f841a8f415bed8e5d772b311745e79a4a6e3545a443606","796ad8e73853f3247471bceb9900bd58f9c3ce3cba8b071c3c1cc04402883d49","f7577e58043253a9c5fbd722aa6c53c2211953678e5bd4b15d5d72c734c2c636","602d366dc51a88accdb23b084d7e2c87b4d67ae55c6e3053a84398090613c90f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2160,2183],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2160"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>acquire the MIB of the target SpCell, which is scheduled as specified in TS 38.213 [13];","paragraph_zero_based":2184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if NTN-Config is configured for the target cell:","paragraph_zero_based":2185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T430 with the timer value set to ntn-UlSyncValidityDuration from the subframe indicated by epochTime, according to the target cell NTN-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE should perform the reconfiguration with sync as soon as possible following the reception of the RRC message triggering the reconfiguration with sync, which could be before confirming successful reception (HARQ and ARQ) of this message.","paragraph_zero_based":2187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The UE may omit reading the MIB if the UE already has the required timing information, or the timing information is not needed for random access.","paragraph_zero_based":2188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2a:A UE with DAPS bearer does not monitor for system information updates in the source PCell.","paragraph_zero_based":2189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>If any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>create a MAC entity for the target cell group with the same configuration as the MAC entity for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2191},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":2192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish an RLC entity or entities for the target cell group, with the same configurations as for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish the logical channel for the target cell group, with the same configurations as for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2b:In order to understand if a DAPS bearer is configured, the UE needs to check the presence of the field daps-Config within the RadioBearerConfig IE received in radioBearerConfig or radioBearerConfig2.","paragraph_zero_based":2195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":2196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish an RLC entity for the target cell group, with the same configurations as for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish the logical channel for the target cell group, with the same configurations as for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>suspend SRBs for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:Void","paragraph_zero_based":2200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the value of the newUE-Identity as the C-RNTI in the target cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers for the target SpCell in accordance with the received spCellConfigCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":2202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers for the target SpCell in accordance with any additional fields, not covered in the previous, if included in the received reconfigurationWithSync.","paragraph_zero_based":2203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset the MAC entity of this cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the SCell(s) of this cell group, if configured, that are not included in the SCellToAddModList in the RRCReconfiguration message, to be in deactivated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the value of the newUE-Identity as the C-RNTI for this cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2207}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a79bddd7f9af530b294fe8494c2d801306bcfe2b694252acc0b92f26360aa129","e00ae67ba07fd049d5687fe09836a8a20feea18a8fb2068601bdc50fef90acab","e4eddaf392c4f7307893749ca5c90c1343229f00e8d3670f438592dfa949af32","85b30ccb86d12ae615a873b7addb6c4a804753eaf1f5eeec628d1283a29f31f7","08e782a98dbfbadd470f35fd3393242abb799f16c845e89bd0de5c3a59270726","888e90936e152dba112db5b431d81bf595f85ef05952177502d2bb38531f5cc9","e503da9129334a2e48122f40606b29eeee8a9aad53b113d260a36760b56a678b","8fbcda64346e988d093d0c84919270ef8a5810137bec336e694daf304be5a7ee","46e64ce484112f17ecae1ba1ecd24c83c5f656346594e3200d1b58bb7403a315","e3e4d0f25246fd0f7876c57903996936be0ff024b2fbd48cafd11d8439c8264a","1c9de320c28acc5e8295644487de37c12d68d6c99301e6c75e2dd347b1165fd6","9c50d38ebd64275bf5a49f1553121024e62373370d31608da9022260a20fb3e9","f0dca4544618274de49127be76a00d607f90cbb35a84e9ed16add374968eddf5","8f9c14bb3cb2e28d487a0b0b910bf7aca81c9ca17887cbd0d01755a75d1d98f8","329e8b26e399e2350f237e62e02bcc8ddf639e10e188331419fd9c413a1847b7","b95202f7f9ffb65a114c16f5020905f9d21ef1092f7d701caff2caca6093ce98","a2311da48c6f215503fcd6c5f3b3e18507323a88f1d46c7960ab49c5b433f370","3f9a83f5a6aeb9b5041d58a4b1c47050f5c522448d0782ced823567bede1139c","5091e2379fdbc74c54ec68fa327ee2cad44801cdcd1a84ad60ddad342d5b4138","504be2e88347245d94bc2c22498bc22e66785581a899971c11e71958799a1d50","4e01451d39cf5e3118ded31843772e4f393569e619f3b53852141e053b7fa0e4","aaa76f8cb340d8e34369c31a13ef2fc32c2bc092d6c8b820a757146150e0683c","90a91bc67851efb71eb5fb89760fd3373c76b19a2746ed8bc8a1ec12ca32e985","d403b5e8c9553fdd6588c7e1df2dea03269f10ae645f20bbe940d461ebe1fe31"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2184,2207],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2184"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers in accordance with the received spCellConfigCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":2208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if rach-LessHO is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers in accordance with rach-LessHO for the target SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers in accordance with any additional fields, not covered in the previous, if included in the received reconfigurationWithSync.","paragraph_zero_based":2211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE at the source side:","paragraph_zero_based":2212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sl-IndirectPathMaintain is not included in reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":2213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate upper layer to trigger PC5 unicast link release.","paragraph_zero_based":2214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon L2 U2N Relay UE receiving reconfigurationWithSync, it either indicates to upper layers (to trigger PC5 unicast link release) or sends NotificationMessageSidelink message to the connected L2 U2N Remote UE(s) in accordance with 5.8.9.10.","paragraph_zero_based":2215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:The MP direct path release is realized by direct-to-indirect path switch procedure (i.e. sl-PathSwitchConfig and sl-indirectPathMaintain included in RRCReconfiguration message), where MP is configured in source side.","paragraph_zero_based":2216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.3RLC bearer release","paragraph_zero_based":2217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each logicalChannelIdentity/LogicalChannelIdentityExt value included in the rlc-BearerToReleaseList/rlc-BearerToReleaseListExt that is part of the current UE configuration within the same cell group (LCH release); or","paragraph_zero_based":2219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each logicalChannelIdentity value that is to be released as the result of an SCG release according to 5.3.5.4:","paragraph_zero_based":2220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the corresponding logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":2222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.4RLC bearer addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":2223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each RLC-BearerConfig received in the rlc-BearerToAddModList IE the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE's current configuration contains an RLC bearer with the received logicalChannelIdentity/LogicalChannelIdentityExt within the same cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":2225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RLC bearer is associated with an DAPS bearer, or","paragraph_zero_based":2226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if any DAPS bearer is configured and the RLC bearer is associated with an SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":2227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the RLC entity or entities for the target cell group in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the logical channel for the target cell group in accordance with the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if reestablishRLC is received:","paragraph_zero_based":2231}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["99a071b7b7b3e85017c29a931aabee629f8c48e333ea8b0a982449635fc7cb61","ad5076b575b3068154975448e4e7086edf009df9c00aa785ffae952fd061422a","ff13a5cdc57c39d27764c07ade96145d3e9b50ea9e52ded7fc4cf74e516f9e51","07f752e5a12f9d2d3333b1254eac4659cf03d85130c1c7f24b69079d382fbadd","cb8990c79fccc6167b37bf4dcb856e1d036a96834ca0922a2bd5880095de5d0d","592bae318776ed69641a8350768e9edce9df58bd86410fa9f9bf91f15f397a31","a445b2d5193bb28a2b72d1aab18d90d014c87b7e0f454ab2418e5b0449994235","d9728db9a03fd083715854f7da453d8f33de295452cca298fe2e444dd8befece","9eda180411e426777efad80f90d3a089fcb1bda3fa8e3e9f1a23b89bd3ea5968","e00371fdbd29a34a2bd3616281cf65e09e1c75f89dd5de70a7c7e906b3a1a738","a47e4c7bdb3e09b3ce271a1642a894597b3c3e49926e8b4808736170eac28658","b7bce025d5b8a7ea20f8df760a9c10c2f75fd074e18f8ed028f4f989037cae6d","7493cd7baa290c4b1dcb156bfe8a3dc41992539c99cfcc5454f9678e21b21716","fb162ef4fb7513d0fae6fd6af628e6af334839ef0c80361899d8b29db8a56372","3a2c807d95f693aedb8d332faedc7bc55740825f595286d6a7a10c8e4341f56c","947fffc17a45013aa42cfba0fa477943c2039cb4466fe172f47d110128ad8634","08e630a5e86e7b8a3f735ee4907aef15d3c7124e87294e56e934fa6e7116590b","023a183eee9e11a44d230ed5fe09d05494e4685c1e9c74058fdd38998600fcca","3a7bef341bfb187b9589c81be3714326f52767318dade9f83a736d07a88be6a7","bcd2bd2b6b68224e0c489f5fa223374046e5646085d6fd8fef1437992cf25f69","e18a3c2defd03c13c0c8c84fffae3c091104989b6c50912eaeb0dd1fa409f16b","91d2ff5b767ec4159d766e0b48cbf0f2df5c919d8b3a54295781d3a8e715402b","490afdf3ceb7026ae036a2d6fe2e29f011e1a8bd9b548cf5a2f17139b9bbd841","cd7f1707bfce7af7b1025b2b48476fd348739e4df20d9e13598809a1fe39f306"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2208,2231],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2208"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>re-establish the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":2232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the RLC entity or entities in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the logical channel in accordance with the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if servedMBS-RadioBearer is received:","paragraph_zero_based":2235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>associate this logical channel with the PDCP entity identified by servedMBS-RadioBearer;","paragraph_zero_based":2236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:For DRB and SRB, the network does not re-associate an already configured logical channel with another radio bearer. Hence, servedRadioBearer is not present in this case. For MRB, the network does not re-associate an already configured logical channel with DRB or SRB or another MRB (i.e. MRB with another PDCP entity). Hence multicastRLC-BearerConfig is not present in this case. If a radio bearer is released and another is added with the same radio bearer identity, it is considered as a new (different) radio bearer. Hence, the network also releases the RLC bearer(s) associated with the released radio bearer.","paragraph_zero_based":2237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:In DAPS handover, the UE may perform RLC entity re-establishment (if reestablishRLC is set) for an RLC bearer associated with a non-DAPS bearer when indication of successful completion of random access towards target cell is received from lower layers as specified in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":2238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (a logical channel with the given logicalChannelIdentity/LogicalChannelIdentityExt is not configured within the same cell group, including the case when full configuration option is used):","paragraph_zero_based":2239},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the servedRadioBearer associates the logical channel with an SRB and rlc-Config is not included:","paragraph_zero_based":2240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish an RLC entity in accordance with the default configuration defined in 9.2 for the corresponding SRB;","paragraph_zero_based":2241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish an RLC entity in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the servedRadioBearer associates the logical channel with an SRB and if mac-LogicalChannelConfig is not included:","paragraph_zero_based":2244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure this MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance to the default configuration defined in 9.2 for the corresponding SRB;","paragraph_zero_based":2245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure this MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance to the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>associate this logical channel with the PDCP entity identified by servedRadioBearer or servedMBS-RadioBearer.","paragraph_zero_based":2248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.5MAC entity configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SCG MAC is not part of the current UE configuration (i.e. SCG establishment):","paragraph_zero_based":2251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>create an SCG MAC entity;","paragraph_zero_based":2252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the MAC main configuration for the target cell group in accordance with the received mac-CellGroupConfig excluding tag-ToReleaseList and tag-ToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":2254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2255}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c3c16c5645f3db0fe0aff110130e21e55a16d5fe1c6e5ac7d26d0e392d771f13","356f23ec6cd8cc0b5c544e6ad4b5ae81f7c8c3c87892dd9f268a0bb452229a53","f9fd48e9ec814ea77e339cd9f1bcb5d8bb033ed7c2a6eebfa5d6cc743d7fb38b","38915b611dfb70d46fc8bdaa7cd2439167199b04ed65e6cac91f609f61272c0b","7b964f04f36e27b92c90e3c3c70bd56bb5c574ec30ab23c903f1ef930f6fb2fc","5a5591dd331000f6cf380e453cc8caaae8abef2c4bec740f3afb97bc74efb81d","c731181d4fa08c89ab0fcc356805d9a28ee967c221016a601e776cf3d6aca878","204994501ddb1082cdde3e01af84c8f4c06dfa7f4c881d5e5a79a53376be3a97","16d00622493d275767ac9ee9b50184c0ed0616bdd49991d5f5e21ce0ec58ca9d","ff1846fc0224bacaa88551f91fc9ed526c8c9699323723ec6eda1d0b48b6262f","583cd4f4aa793dc66112485d9cf6136e6955f835c7e7c433b3933e2a481a024a","7afefd7a328eb3687bab80b4204673994b3032b242bcf76fe5d3681365764401","ee5266688d92d20f8fa0877e1acdcb296f54f3a353f0606ff4d73774212e4e33","4aed394eca16d0f6262519928ca9353f2a792b6214c846605cc5059ae0a7589d","1cbd314ebf9c6fff5a4f9106774b96b20636c36e8a0b24c40517fb30cfd343da","3ca24d93912709ab81e02edcbf88232196a1a21b49e9b9381ef5211aa37a815c","b3069660506b08e8aa8f408918775d696f3a6ba2e55e5278957eed645653d00d","4e7a31a63eb2ac1e8bbe7ab078bdcf256e6a25ade11bc36366277387af05efc2","4367e2d86d21258e35d8a9758b72f6f97607d232598591c95d5330bc34334277","b17b3898a56bdf4e2adb0f5d48b1f5efb34990049374c8adcdd9777515b08c4d","bb4f0e77b8ec24187fc4893d2865726a0d78dd143ab45bc6eedb2c622b5daa32","16a5d1cc21d2b550cf442f0a479e73e195c786b3a775fbd26672d29f0b7ce4e1","19de31b153b1a4bdb41017fb92295abeb52383789b54629b8a817c1e120b9867","ba93dd5ba8cf672459759872aa2f1a5345040e2ca8af1efda78c60b73c6f665c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2232,2255],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2232"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the MAC main configuration of the cell group in accordance with the received mac-CellGroupConfig excluding tag-ToReleaseList and tag-ToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":2256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received mac-CellGroupConfig includes the tag-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each TAG-Id value included in the tag-ToReleaseList that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the TAG indicated by TAG-Id;","paragraph_zero_based":2259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received mac-CellGroupConfig includes the tag-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each tag-Id value included in tag-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (TAG addition):","paragraph_zero_based":2261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>add the TAG, corresponding to the tag-Id, in accordance with the received timeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":2262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each tag-Id value included in tag-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (TAG modification):","paragraph_zero_based":2263},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the TAG, corresponding to the tag-Id, in accordance with the received timeAlignmentTimer.","paragraph_zero_based":2264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.6RLF Timers & Constants configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received rlf-TimersAndConstants is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":2267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use values for timers T301, T310, T311 and constants N310, N311 for the target cell group, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use values for timers T301, T310, T311 and constants N310, N311, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the value of timers and constants for the target cell group in accordance with received rlf-TimersAndConstants;","paragraph_zero_based":2274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>(re-)configure the value of timers and constants in accordance with received rlf-TimersAndConstants;","paragraph_zero_based":2276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T310 for this cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T312 for this cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset the counters N310 and N311.","paragraph_zero_based":2279}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7e8f93170227254b8ce1c7e86881adbcf465f4b58a998ec63cb76e5550a62a53","3ecadc6112c6be8c37cdf7905acf6d47537338601ed0a2f99edf0774a34c1274","69427f644b8c4a2468807bed5e1cf66d695c9dfc4f3c092fee8e237cade1f79a","fa6f23c9db6cdeda7bf0e5bf10c9515e57720324622d99142908b4e4582076c8","3db5574909df7a9bf3634d8c3f245417eeef514ce797c4c13f34dd85f709a20f","9a170f902259f210828ec44aa7332a809245bb67f8a089c5850c58295c4d9b94","b0ebd5ebc89831b3d2eda3857189936ec6006bf430e4ae820c15492550b65cfb","04509f93ebd251d8162c453aac1de368bb786d2b9f3ae5e41419ee71ec97dd0e","f7a7407059be783f678444e72276c2e719f59fd7141023af806588083815efbf","8deda843a9094fa1771f15f2282803608e8cbae5d7e5d09494160686dbcb482e","927f5f1f0dd551c287bc9fd9409b290576d556bf5f9e4959494f5f932476bc82","31b817f37f9c0b6a16f803a4087dd7975bb8daca188ea0458a1d09b3a3848167","77f3c40598f635f6dafb662397913b0da6b84b55d23477ad71ec6b273de0ebdb","34c4a47051eaf9579b21a6d63722522228adf6790362f9b607756ee9c4f58efb","201937cb90087eea8a5f81538929feacba755ff4f3294ac2a8e4da6adf82f2ed","7d8470c7f730e04b7f138e3a86cdcbc66027001b84e8874fe5505bb899d47eb0","0b5596f69a843ce4c9cb0fc65319b5b19bfb3e138558bb145f708b4a151d00e7","2b123b612608f9fa4c34c0e55913377cc768f8a7d0be8db4600233fc69adec5b","b07e15358e8cd481a363bcbab072bbf6e0165cdaa9eb65d5e42ab4b262541728","122ebd8e4c723fde124b56a24c81388b1018209ef863052ce33ace119fe2ed3c","7f366e24384f0f49086ee2e95331432425dff935cf8b43c09e4e63e63d9ae8ca","e2be0be7786d6eb582b05517863f4257a6045d098d509144ff8f4c943fb9e17d","b728288dab252ff429a335bc4e3e31baaf309ab67a84e51698eb36d01148d1bf","cf1d3b8255b855db8dcab39a184505d59014377a397531a26ed5f702837c2660"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2256,2279],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2256"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.7SpCell Configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE and is not configured with MP:","paragraph_zero_based":2282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SpCellConfig contains the rlf-TimersAndConstants which is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use value for timers T311 as received in rlf-TimersAndConstants;","paragraph_zero_based":2284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if rlf-TimersAndConstants is not configured for this cell group or SpCellConfig contains the rlf-TimersAndConstants which is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":2285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use value for timers T311, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else","paragraph_zero_based":2287},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SpCellConfig contains the rlf-TimersAndConstants:","paragraph_zero_based":2288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the RLF timers and constants for this cell group as specified in 5.3.5.5.6;","paragraph_zero_based":2289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if rlf-TimersAndConstants is not configured for this cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":2290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use values for timers T301, T310, T311 and constants N310, N311 for the target cell group, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else","paragraph_zero_based":2293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use values for timers T301, T310, T311 and constants N310, N311, as included in ue-TimersAndConstants received in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SpCellConfig contains spCellConfigDedicated:","paragraph_zero_based":2295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the SpCell in accordance with the spCellConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":2296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the bandwidth part indicated in firstActiveUplinkBWP-Id, if included in the spCellConfigDedicated, to be the active uplink bandwidth part;","paragraph_zero_based":2297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id is included in the spCellConfigDedicated:","paragraph_zero_based":2298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the SpCellConfig is included in an RRCReconfiguration message contained in an NR or E-UTRA RRC message indicating that the SCG is deactivated:","paragraph_zero_based":2299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the bandwidth part indicated in firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id to be the bandwidth part for Radio Link Monitoring, Beam Failure Detection and measurements;","paragraph_zero_based":2300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the bandwith part indicated in firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id to be the active downlink bandwidth part;","paragraph_zero_based":2302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if any of the reference signal(s) that are used for radio link monitoring are reconfigured by the received spCellConfigDedicated:","paragraph_zero_based":2303}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["896198f21dde8