{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T310 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T312 for the corresponding SpCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>reset the counters N310 and N311.","paragraph_zero_based":2306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SpCellConfig contains the lowMobilityEvaluationConnected:","paragraph_zero_based":2307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the UE may perform the evaluation of the low mobility criterion for this cell group as specified in 5.7.13.1;","paragraph_zero_based":2308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SpCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationRLM:","paragraph_zero_based":2309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this SpCell as specified in 5.7.13.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SpCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationBFD:","paragraph_zero_based":2311},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this serving cell as specified in 5.7.13.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.8SCell Release","paragraph_zero_based":2313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of the sCellToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the current UE configuration includes an SCell with value sCellIndex:","paragraph_zero_based":2317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the SCell.","paragraph_zero_based":2318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.9SCell Addition/Modification","paragraph_zero_based":2319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (SCell addition):","paragraph_zero_based":2321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>add the SCell, corresponding to the sCellIndex, in accordance with the sCellConfigCommon and sCellConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":2322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sCellState is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in activated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in deactivated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId included in the measIdList within VarMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2327}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["14b062ec395d41067c63d71668c49e78fc8fe8d31abaaf12d7774e0cc9e63245","3cb569e6825f26e3d09c7661fd909188e3a65f247a7fb1e3565138cc0d8b7963","79694ded6697d5317c3b5964b6b1d98405a87217f9571e78e1010575396ad1c1","4eb7014c40566706f12a4dd0cbedc74786e97d1fc901c523f125accfe3708e9e","b6ed177041e48989228a10823203f53e1fcfaa4bae5dbc460f0ed05ec40fdf32","fa43df45696d8bd6798dda187a30d7f2b03a72b89da2e8f356415f4b8044b2f3","6c58f47be82e7c89ba5ffda5