{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SCells are not applicable for the associated measurement; and","paragraph_zero_based":2328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the concerned SCell is included in cellsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":2329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the concerned SCell from cellsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":2330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationBFD:","paragraph_zero_based":2331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this serving cell as specified in 5.7.13.2.","paragraph_zero_based":2332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (SCell modification):","paragraph_zero_based":2333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>modify the SCell configuration in accordance with the sCellConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":2334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sCellToAddModList was received in an RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync, or received in an RRCResume message, or received in an RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync embedded in an RRCResume message or embedded in an RRCReconfiguration message or embedded in an E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration message or embedded in an E-UTRA RRCConnectionResume message, or received in an RRCReconfiguration message embedded in an RRCReconfiguration message or embedded in an E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration message activating deactivated SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":2335},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sCellState is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in activated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in deactivated state.","paragraph_zero_based":2339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationBFD:","paragraph_zero_based":2340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this serving cell as specified in 5.7.13.2.","paragraph_zero_based":2341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.10BH RLC channel release","paragraph_zero_based":2342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB-node shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each BH-RLC-ChannelID value included in the bh-RLC-ChannelToReleaseList that is part of the current IAB-node configuration within the same cell group (LCH release); or","paragraph_zero_based":2344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each BH-RLC-ChannelID value that is to be released as the result of an SCG release according to 5.3.5.4:","paragraph_zero_based":2345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the corresponding logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":2347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.11BH RLC channel addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":2348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each BH-RLC-ChannelConfig received in the bh-RLC-ChannelToAddModList IE the IAB-node shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the current configuration contains a BH RLC Channel with the received bh-RLC-ChannelID within the same cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":2350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reestablishRLC is received:","paragraph_zero_based":2351}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6089461bacec79e8ad3cd8253af1d67f9c1bf4e7dfc09b9403815c494698dbe0","3c15ea3cb85b98595556f3f1fce13ebd6ac3be00227fb60b3ec20ee6801f59c5","7a27b9f0029fd205af77cadea44574b9b0a7a5baf25c30ad624755d415e05d0c","e8e204535a1653aa977d3f60257218c5ff4c6aaa5fba7d810ddf86fe52ad9490","da46ca9db67d06258818895bd97d15d67265f346ea0a8ef9154c2a0162179813","8f14eaf1ac9dade7a8725b8e776eb87f755719a542fb4d3f265ba01e75280027","2c4c659471e878b45b766e23fa8fcfcb2d6a325deee2f6b3dcfe7848981986ba","e8b4d024aba1b04a57f1a0829286974f96fc81fe45151e6e95c3449441c941d4","3788f34efc4eea2d3ecb7f3ef75f0a7d82011581cff2fb2a9094d8620fd8b549","b943e3abb4be51fe8388441761ce342ab4697dc66be5d09bd8dadf0a43e808c6","2942f18f24dc9f0bb9d1bcfb71f8d441cd18073f4477ec40fa3119d6fb9ee63d","2c52240940b9d0e61afcb17cf3f3fbd17f8b596b6555c651420cafbf4855a562","ae98e28729dde5a6526377906f5c11a5a31773b2c4c6cc7ff0f8baee1920c6c6","d3c54c315db47792190caae9e081a9669ad712ff887779d177f6671a6ba7f500","79c0a9f7eaf1415cf32a63f9868910eae9261e8a93ffd1e1748ce71db8d9b52b","0913bbea9041b5fa3eb3c303b52597bb89c21f40ce6694722c83d6ab874c6687","8a217e6b7b2cebee763f00e08798c7712048da49b1ead101167ca85c463f066d","45a299306bbe072d714db9a0e1bd44dcad16406b80b68d008a00703ea29537d1","2a81273c3b0186247f449c254b372be34593b0e0f8244d7960268ffc64f0dbec","ed3f12f5db3a2c555fedfa9054062abdebc5076baaf65f587a7c8e2f674cb1d2","ed494562afb7f503d07003dcc618871e6877766242ef8cd2aadf45786db1fb4e","23aaccd5507ecaf7cccafc5c3995b6f63e53f967e7d47de4774297163b9404cd","920f4caa4a498305941badc0bbb20d4b2090a3c8beda03d46f9499d4c5985718