{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if ncr-FwdConfig includes periodic forwarding resource configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate to NCR-Fwd to forward in accordance with the configured periodic forwarding resource set(s);","paragraph_zero_based":2377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (ncr-FwdConfig is set to release):","paragraph_zero_based":2378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release NCR-Fwd configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to NCR-Fwd to cease forwarding.","paragraph_zero_based":2380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.6Radio Bearer configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.6.1General","paragraph_zero_based":2382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall perform the following actions based on a received RadioBearerConfig IE:","paragraph_zero_based":2383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RadioBearerConfig includes the srb3-ToRelease, srb4-ToRelease or srb5-ToRelease:","paragraph_zero_based":2384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the SRB release as specified in 5.3.5.6.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RadioBearerConfig includes the srb-ToAddModList or if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the SRB addition or reconfiguration as specified in 5.3.5.6.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RadioBearerConfig includes the drb-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform DRB release as specified in 5.3.5.6.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RadioBearerConfig includes the drb-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform DRB addition or reconfiguration as specified in 5.3.5.6.5;","paragraph_zero_based":2391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RadioBearerConfig includes the mrb-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform multicast MRB release as specified in 5.3.5.6.6;","paragraph_zero_based":2393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RadioBearerConfig includes the mrb-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform multicast MRB addition or reconfiguration as specified in 5.3.5.6.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release all SDAP entities established for the PDU sessions, if any, that have no associated DRB as specified in TS 37.324 [24] clause 5.1.2, and indicate the release of the user plane resources for PDU Sessions associated with the released SDAP entities to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":2396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release all SDAP entities established for the MBS multicast sessions, if any, that have no associated multicast MRB as specified in TS 37.324 [24] clause 5.1.2, and indicate the release of user plane resources for these MBS multicast sessions to upper layers.","paragraph_zero_based":2397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.6.2SRB release","paragraph_zero_based":2398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2399}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5f3e07bb051d66bc757e8ecb5ba52d04165555c039a181c349566ceb803061d2","d0633cfa984841724250251bae8e052700cf5cd771d72ea325b7ea28f4a892da","d96442dce5ec801df663daa3f