{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if srb3-ToRelease is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity and the srb-Identity of the SRB3;","paragraph_zero_based":2401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if srb4-ToRelease is included","paragraph_zero_based":2402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity and the srb-Identity of the SRB4;","paragraph_zero_based":2403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if srb5-ToRelease is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity and the srb-Identity of the SRB5.","paragraph_zero_based":2405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.6.3SRB addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":2406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2407},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>If any DAPS bearer is configured, for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":2408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish a PDCP entity for the target cell group as specified in TS 38.323 [5], with the same configuration as the PDCP entity for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the masterKeyUpdate is received:","paragraph_zero_based":2410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the PDCP entity with the security algorithms according to securityConfig and apply the keys (KRRCenc and KRRCint) associated with the master key (KgNB);","paragraph_zero_based":2411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the PDCP entity for the target cell group with state variables continuation as specified in TS 38.323 [5], and with the same security configuration as the PDCP entity for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each srb-Identity value included in the srb-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (SRB establishment or reconfiguration from E-UTRA PDCP to NR PDCP):","paragraph_zero_based":2414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish a PDCP entity;","paragraph_zero_based":2415},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if AS security has been activated:","paragraph_zero_based":2416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if target RAT of handover is E-UTRA/5GC; or","paragraph_zero_based":2417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is connected to E-UTRA/5GC:","paragraph_zero_based":2418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of E-UTRA/5GC, but not capable of NGEN-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":2419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>configure the PDCP entity with the security algorithms and keys (KRRCenc and KRRCint) configured/derived as specified in TS 36.331 [10];","paragraph_zero_based":2420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else (i.e., UE capable of NGEN-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":2421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>configure the PDCP entity with the security algorithms according to securityConfig and apply the keys (KRRCenc and KRRCint) associated with the master key (KeNB) or secondary key (S-KgNB) as indicated in keyToUse, if applicable;","paragraph_zero_based":2422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e., UE connected to NR or UE connected to E-UTRA/EPC):","paragraph_zero_based":2423}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9c806a81845600456f5d781e03866d04c3926d8ef28c4f27595412ab28d399dc","4a8466085921dac278e28c87317857886a06930e5bb4ea023350166f5248eb0f","5ed4a