{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish the PDCP entity of this SRB as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":2448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else, if the discardOnPDCP is set:","paragraph_zero_based":2449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>trigger the PDCP entity to perform SDU discard as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":2450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the pdcp-Config is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the PDCP entity in accordance with the received pdcp-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":2452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.6.4DRB release","paragraph_zero_based":2453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each drb-Identity value included in the drb-ToReleaseList that is part of the current UE configuration; or","paragraph_zero_based":2455},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each drb-Identity value that is to be released as the result of full configuration according to 5.3.5.11:","paragraph_zero_based":2456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity and the drb-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":2457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SDAP entity associated with this DRB is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the release of the DRB to SDAP entity associated with this DRB (TS 37.324 [24], clause 5.3.3);","paragraph_zero_based":2459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the DRB is associated with an eps-BearerIdentity:","paragraph_zero_based":2460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if a new bearer is not added either with NR or E-UTRA with same eps-BearerIdentity:","paragraph_zero_based":2461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate the release of the DRB and the eps-BearerIdentity of the released DRB to upper layers.","paragraph_zero_based":2462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE does not consider the message as erroneous if the drb-ToReleaseList includes any drb-Identity value that is not part of the current UE configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":2463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:Whether or not the RLC and MAC entities associated with this PDCP entity are reset or released is determined by the CellGroupConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":2464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.6.5DRB addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":2465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each drb-Identity value included in the drb-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (DRB establishment including the case when full configuration option is used):","paragraph_zero_based":2467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish a PDCP entity and configure it in accordance with the received pdcp-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PDCP entity of this DRB is not configured with cipheringDisabled:","paragraph_zero_based":2469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if target RAT of handover is E-UTRA/5GC; or","paragraph_zero_based":2470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is connected to E-UTRA/5GC:","paragraph_zero_based":2471}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["260dc8dfce1d9b21235675878cfc2c8d9b12af7f7bf932c79dd33191dff7cf7a","4cba3692bb70aefa5c1a10c55525494acae903459948e613a3795242a5b74d16","d6f29fbc790fa343f0fb22cc057b1483bba2c4aa3f6c055484b94f9a22bceed8","9aeb7750076e54bee7cad816ef9f09f953268464999777c058a0eef4ced59d74","aebe6b786ffab910f1f1bf8548ef1044e8965a4255880e3759f64a484b581e33","df4cb63bca139232f952aa47287705da1f257f2df9d17b0a128d34bab0a948d2","defcfb3d6d67d41614bbaa48c5fa9b9760949d1738f9c779d275c44afca16d88","e82ebe2f891ee62339a5149e8920f6eaaf90ff9ddcd81b9300da71212359dfda","cac9b60af7787d5f95e169d0f1f303caf839c45cc0ca418db40e7bce20f7cf68","bd2b3d2bce2e56247c10c5f51648c02ef05ab3d00eef6f577f823df0c7b884b3","c91951dab088f407ee555d7089c93840460a4cba0f4bf44a073aa96114563bdb","1ffa18e0ed78257a358c21fc2d1d53a8bdede334f1395299cfdd429e0c411415","33197c3767a3122af022253c4eff4ac377b3f8463d2af7418eb48da0c0925c08","66987c0b63f6b9ed3d998b8e81a4248bc69a6baefe30377a4b170bac157c2687","4a6aa0eb44cebec8505cc0cde3a64aed387de9f4f4161fe826de9dccc8fbe255","5ef9f4e63be049511531db33fb577dbfc68cb7eaad1a4b3f5c87e94f30be4a16","e54e19da432fc9fc32bda43ae12df6eccb86ee8ba9ed65a7712af7a9c9a600c1","0975c4a25baeff10838a4627fc501b3499e011c1283fada2cac9742157fd2918","e326d1ee024ee9fe936be90217ce8391065ce22606ea7c39bce4c31c07dd0c35","7dae6fc5d3e744d729ead6c9e6448a3e2179edb9a9da093be9afc0259e3a0ab6","9bfbf8496e786585793763ed441b61488df215c396ee927ea5d63d71399bd18c","de53ae2b5ddf43243f80ca8a22f1859d79f05f78f3deaf54938cf9b89ac78d84","5302a9c254d499c26e9db28fc772e0d6d70e880fe6fba3efa99e1507b2be4de1","7a13f00caa4b05d30b555bcd69887edfb2f9f44323bb128bd0345df8fd344eed"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2448,2471],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2448"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of E-UTRA/5GC but not capable of NGEN-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":2472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>configure the PDCP entity with the ciphering algorithm and KUPenc key configured/derived as specified in TS 36.331 [10];","paragraph_zero_based":2473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else (i.e., a UE capable of NGEN-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":2474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>configure the PDCP entity with the ciphering algorithms according to securityConfig and apply the key (KUPenc) associated with the master key (KeNB) or secondary key (S-KgNB) as indicated in keyToUse, if applicable;","paragraph_zero_based":2475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e., UE connected to NR or UE connected to E-UTRA/EPC):","paragraph_zero_based":2476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the PDCP entity with the ciphering algorithms according to securityConfig and apply the KUPenc key associated with the master key (KeNB/KgNB) or the secondary key (S-KgNB/S-KeNB) as indicated in keyToUse;","paragraph_zero_based":2477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PDCP entity of this DRB is configured with integrityProtection:","paragraph_zero_based":2478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the PDCP entity with the integrity protection algorithms according to securityConfig and apply the KUPint key associated with the master (KeNB/KgNB) or the secondary key (S-KgNB) as indicated in keyToUse;","paragraph_zero_based":2479},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if an sdap-Config is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if an SDAP entity with the received pdu-Session does not exist:","paragraph_zero_based":2481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish an SDAP entity as specified in TS 37.324 [24] clause 5.1.1;","paragraph_zero_based":2482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if an SDAP entity with the received pdu-Session did not exist prior to receiving this reconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":2483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>indicate the establishment of the user plane resources for the pdu-Session to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":2484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the SDAP entity in accordance with the received sdap-Config as specified in TS 37.324 [24] and associate the DRB with the SDAP entity;","paragraph_zero_based":2485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each QFI value added in mappedQoS-FlowsToAdd, if the QFI value is previously configured, the QFI value is released from the old DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":2486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the DRB is associated with an eps-BearerIdentity:","paragraph_zero_based":2487},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the DRB was configured with the same eps-BearerIdentity either by NR or E-UTRA prior to receiving this reconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":2488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>associate the established DRB with the corresponding eps-BearerIdentity;","paragraph_zero_based":2489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate the establishment of the DRB(s) and the eps-BearerIdentity of the established DRB(s) to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":2491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the n3c-BearerAssociated is included for a DRB:","paragraph_zero_based":2492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider this radio bearer to be associated with the N3C indirect path;","paragraph_zero_based":2493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each drb-Identity value included in the drb-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration and configured as DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":2494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the PDCP entity to configure DAPS with the ciphering function, integrity protection function and ROHC function of the target cell group as specified in TS 38.323 [5] and configure it in accordance with the received pdcp-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2495}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["de26224e81b06190673a54e3e9f4dff9da1cc0b82e13a4bd97406487a9c1894c","f82907d5f43b0b953f772cf65694f18624d1b7792c470531ca4524cc02048db2","e49597827e22659f49193d433af92b5c8167f74416240560ff6a4a435ac45ec5","9a69c4c55f60db837bb28682caf84ded28241cc05d57f241923eefd598edd1d0","8ecb5a03066284d377dedd11a661f18f626db2703da7515326b65e1eb5afc7bd","4e32159c65224b59ade1e603f6214f26dd91bad670cb3dcdfe7982963468293f","5c55e732c21a0b9c8d6124ace666b07918e5415003f1de702d517e94b187342e","b8cc33f243d94f113f37fe9bb0dda8966ab0be2746739b2851b9550d194dae6e","2cfd7d40a89972185374b17d692650b68f96d98c97cf9d7150eeed80665e5f49","3a83e0d261303ead979eb1eff1c6f56779dc3ba7cb1dfc5210099774b150d4fd","3788c1dabcbd038b2becc466ab7b21fda4266427ce8cf3c70461f5a7c56b454e","2c55d0b71e0d334b07fc4bb37838db62b88ae35d5a184bb98cb38dc8df6dbae6","3eb95f3126d846b4b5cdc6febbeddf584c6a724011b0b9515a0db82f2b6f3e9a","e5da562d9427e705c366f60504fe1fde988d2e01bf0d2572968087cfd248e6db","7d3af1f6ab22a5f1d25d2a1aa5f5c904edcfe405170e8cff712a1fe802980a50","35d3cf5848cf06878fc94c4dd49faeb10d11c9805f7abc29f6e1a61a185fb860","6eaa6403779dea9931c24c1f8b2967392ade0180faf69aa77d8514781f7730c8","3d8c2381273208978a5a85d699dde1a9cbc925323561ab8042787cd54dd213d4","26e3a09ba9b815bc893801570739c9d2ad7674d7d0ddde3b1de7a718521fb47e","a436c2d7f41b4ccd6c3e8679e2267ac611d78dd29bf1574987879ec3999fc6e5","e5dccebba7f82fcdc6c9702df5fafd79e8578891cfacfba8ecdfacf1299db248","822191aa526245ee0f264f2e4f8fc179bdf846aa6c67fb3fdcfa89791e4fb351","e6cfffa5cf076541af0c972626c3527aa2d3e0be3411bf160b01531b3240c519","09cdcf16cf4fe87804fba3543708331a5a941a58469347895e60fc2a083a8c2f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2472,2495],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2472"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the masterKeyUpdate is received:","paragraph_zero_based":2496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the ciphering function of the target cell group PDCP entity is not configured with cipheringDisabled:","paragraph_zero_based":2497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the ciphering function of the target cell group PDCP entity with the ciphering algorithm according to securityConfig and apply the KUPenc key associated with the master key (KgNB), as indicated in keyToUse, i.e. the ciphering configuration shall be applied to all subsequent PDCP PDUs received from the target cell group and sent to the target cell group by the UE;","paragraph_zero_based":2498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the integrity protection function of the target cell group PDCP entity is configured with integrityProtection:","paragraph_zero_based":2499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the integrity protection function of the target cell group PDCP entity with the integrity protection algorithms according to securityConfig and apply the KUPint key associated with the master key (KgNB) as indicated in keyToUse;","paragraph_zero_based":2500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the ciphering function and the integrity protection function of the target cell group PDCP entity with the same security configuration as the PDCP entity for the source cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":2502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sdap-Config is included and when indication of successful completion of random access towards target cell is received from lower layers as specified in [3]:","paragraph_zero_based":2503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the SDAP entity in accordance with the received sdap-Config as specified in TS 37.324 [24];","paragraph_zero_based":2504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each QFI value added in mappedQoS-FlowsToAdd, if the QFI value is previously configured, the QFI value is released from the old DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":2505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each drb-Identity value included in the drb-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration and not configured as DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":2506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reestablishPDCP is set:","paragraph_zero_based":2507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if target RAT of handover is E-UTRA/5GC; or","paragraph_zero_based":2508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is connected to E-UTRA/5GC:","paragraph_zero_based":2509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of E-UTRA/5GC but not capable of NGEN-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":2510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the PDCP entity of this DRB is not configured with cipheringDisabled:","paragraph_zero_based":2511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>configure the PDCP entity with the ciphering algorithm and KUPenc key configured/derived as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.4.2.3, i.e. the ciphering configuration shall be applied to all subsequent PDCP PDUs received and sent by the UE;","paragraph_zero_based":2512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else (i.e., a UE capable of NGEN-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":2513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the PDCP entity of this DRB is not configured with cipheringDisabled:","paragraph_zero_based":2514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>configure the PDCP entity with the ciphering algorithm and KUPenc key associated with the master key (KeNB) or the secondary key (S-KgNB), as indicated in keyToUse, i.e. the ciphering configuration shall be applied to all subsequent PDCP PDUs received and sent by the UE;","paragraph_zero_based":2515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e., UE connected to NR or UE connected to E-UTRA/EPC (in EN-DC or capable of EN-DC)):","paragraph_zero_based":2516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the PDCP entity of this DRB is not configured with cipheringDisabled:","paragraph_zero_based":2517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>configure the PDCP entity with the ciphering algorithm and KUPenc key associated with the master key (KeNB/ KgNB) or the secondary key (S-KgNB/S-KeNB), as indicated in keyToUse, i.e. the ciphering configuration shall be applied to all subsequent PDCP PDUs received and sent by the UE;","paragraph_zero_based":2518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the PDCP entity of this DRB is configured with integrityProtection:","paragraph_zero_based":2519}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c4f0db387e9fa91804e36e920cf697ca657c3366386ac06da6285185036b0924","ee23acf55746241c04001b228753242aeff5d8e89c603cc1391c1f30c9a59e2f","fbd661d3fa33fbe17de5640dad0c7b973adbb47f76b5d2fbfa166818addff00c","14db1e99d19e3400808aa8d350666f1ae3719195333f990061ddc3034ebc5ab7","4f2454feb57e5e5dfb231dc715ff402facbac7062642107b6ebd53c4b2c94ff3","61d4d78f973b25366e13913db6017f59df86f5ab9a0a57aa9e7f81dbd8893696","5f48acdc011e8c6d4b80dcb097e272d39d72c048268a82aa9aba7448ef889a8d","6ebd7362ff55791f2a648dfe5b9842c3218515f768e00d3ef511f299d80bda45","0fe08918a1d40e221a6638783df2db333a91127c8436795bfb1a322ac583dc6d","8c4fce23433263340ce41d7a9e776537dff8a6984df5370852584b49a21d9269","7b83465381e3f54e7b7ed39222356a2dd040212229202ee739862f6505ae44ae","4c98ad513d2745866ad9baa8d27d1a645aca6f843cfb88cc9f035cf081e43a02","5e1d4d7c985601618ee20567352a106d6b7ec32dfdc66320a52abe242e826bc4","98ee878cbde4b08371d87beb1ab88d5fadb7db5898b811af2ea7333239e3746a","44ec2d93cd219c07f6a385d1222b539da88d6e4aa1436926ff5f663a3757d9cd","365fa71c2f1e2505289788b574441dbf7f927a22334efb0be41923d77931c37d","b851301ba3330566df6e3acb6e2f0d1b2f6232de9dbc969ef67e6dffb9efc14b","6fa8e0e1f3f17ce82ae2ad1709c1424b73a6a07cdb52349712cd92be748d8a5d","f75932d5baad673e2de96fd209647ebf3950f4418ad1e9c66af391d38f5ef389","c7895d046070c4e1c0b7454071806f7506581ac2608c95b324003c686ad5c1c9","92d192850d5ee7b53ef4bf2af8f81b8843698c9b53474a5e9ce6ef1e51cdcc97","41caa2a5a87a18714fcc91695497558c9ba76e4c7ea5300e2a9024a5d6569594","4ab3d24c4ebb1e9a6f4e3b8ef1962f74d33960f6e3d2014973ffc135e5cb7536","cd1e6e2580035e252737d0d9eb4fdd2fdc10cd7877be7096a8eb684d6b5e7a4d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2496,2519],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2496"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>configure the PDCP entity with the integrity protection algorithms according to securityConfig and apply the KUPint key associated with the master key (KeNB/KgNB) or the secondary key (S-KgNB) as indicated in keyToUse;","paragraph_zero_based":2520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if drb-ContinueROHC is included in pdcp-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":2521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to lower layer that drb-ContinueROHC is configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if drb-ContinueEHC-DL is included in pdcp-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":2523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to lower layer that drb-ContinueEHC-DL is configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if drb-ContinueEHC-UL is included in pdcp-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":2525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to lower layer that drb-ContinueEHC-UL is configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if drb-ContinueUDC is included in pdcp-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":2527},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to lower layer that drb-ContinueUDC is configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish the PDCP entity of this DRB as specified in TS 38.323 [5], clause 5.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else, if the recoverPDCP is set:","paragraph_zero_based":2530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>trigger the PDCP entity of this DRB to perform data recovery as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":2531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the pdcp-Config is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the PDCP entity in accordance with the received pdcp-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":2533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sdap-Config is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the SDAP entity in accordance with the received sdap-Config as specified in TS37.324 [24];","paragraph_zero_based":2535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each QFI value added in mappedQoS-FlowsToAdd, if the QFI value is previously configured, the QFI value is released from the old DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":2536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the n3c-BearerAssociated is included for a DRB:","paragraph_zero_based":2537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider this radio bearer to be associated with the N3C indirect path;","paragraph_zero_based":2538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":2539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:When determining whether a drb-Identity value is part of the current UE configuration, the UE does not distinguish which RadioBearerConfig and DRB-ToAddModList that DRB was originally configured in. To re-associate a DRB with a different key (KeNB to S-KgNB, KgNB to S-KeNB, KgNB to S-KgNB, or vice versa), the network provides the drb-Identity value in the (target) drb-ToAddModList and sets the reestablishPDCP flag. The network does not list the drb-Identity in the (source) drb-ToReleaseList.","paragraph_zero_based":2540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:When setting the reestablishPDCP flag for a radio bearer, the network ensures that the RLC receiver entities do not deliver old PDCP PDUs to the re-established PDCP entity. It does that e.g. by triggering a reconfiguration with sync of the cell group hosting the old RLC entity or by releasing the old RLC entity.","paragraph_zero_based":2541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:In this specification, UE configuration refers to the parameters configured by NR RRC unless otherwise stated.","paragraph_zero_based":2542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 5: Ciphering and integrity protection can be enabled or disabled for a DRB. The enabling/disabling of ciphering or integrity protection can be changed only by releasing and adding the DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":2543}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5eb8c556801c7ba104cd063760326c588a47f95858fc74a67fb77d140eb435ab","06c7cf496c621d3db4a9770fed5258b43f4f56483e6e58e3ffef2f0327377870","dea11ec73c71ffb482f1e77391d6b96e559bf715b0698fae9584700b39b987b6","521936791d96a616610ab9d22ca953c4fcd19b1243f58d1c467ce835e5f5e7c6","3d31ae03b88db2cd85630e10fc1c05771e331425037c029cfdf3ccb919bd7ae1","0e86bd88a0333bdd85723ebd26854b0e43311024cd4ade24053d313bdce5d2d2","9b3fb4c3d835bea1ae4c49d1bbf74d89275913a1b9eca500f1c55e17c81807c6","7e05ae118183b721d830c146152a747f513afbb79bf5f01ac9aa591e1ee01194","47446c7862a287c8759effac48ea7a54c3d41f0187cd35757b7d5489bb17f560","b77f7cbc564bc0286e23b2745f7f96b00910661aa124eced9bc8407fa73e08f7","1f8749729c1379771a5c63dafc1447b4daf207f3fede30e41e696f243ee81d41","376d1894f2ceadb583638f282b47cd1f6f3b2e84a9ecc26c9ae910e25665ff64","e38c74fe3a1107c66c90c9d95ee6ff2eb0f626820ae27ca0dc20da18772fe1b4","ecb4ac7820775d63bf4a61edf75f3e9bdd10ac20487b2b11292d6c12a9c2ca3e","428ba692925ce192f7894bc553c364f95a5d16286e527b1b248b215043261cd3","301efe340aa4970f99a9b0930314b981a51fc38ed9d4c3f72a078fde156b35c2","6e4c46929579e22d1d5baaed9e5658daad7eea6238530f8fca33dc05d548493e","26a61987b8eacead27cb182b8aacb7af6dea5fa27a14caa6d7d7e8125ea98d36","41c51fa6b3d6c593efef78ec17e1856d7bcceb214affe8e7bd70ec74a6edc5ed","563ee2f40d8b9f55e97904f9255905b3580713b73b4a21c2fb8b7e00aba7291f","025a7b1e92b2a3aba14f3abd07e072b236e7d48b969cc492a69258802d094dbe","32024768b9d868cf90ace09445df93c8913e02eaea6ce1b94edfb9b4fe5cf4d7","a22e95b2f838d8d90f92541b53546717942fa88f45b31d004d9bc739c3640761","4c43ae0d7de7f92bc6d616569ea3a9c658c78428a851974da6ea9fd7f0bd6e69"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2520,2543],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2520"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 6:In DAPS handover, the UE may perform PDCP entity re-establishment (if reestablishPDCP is set) or the PDCP data recovery (if recoverPDCP is set) for a non-DAPS bearer when indication of successful completion of random access towards target cell is received from lower layers as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. In this case, the UE suspends data transmission and reception for all non-DAPS bearers in the source MCG for duration of the DAPS handover.","paragraph_zero_based":2544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.6.6Multicast MRB release","paragraph_zero_based":2545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each mrb-Identity value included in the mrb-ToReleaseList that is part of the current UE configuration; or","paragraph_zero_based":2547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each mrb-Identity value that is to be released as the result of full configuration according to 5.3.5.11:","paragraph_zero_based":2548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity and the mrb-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":2549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE does not consider the message as erroneous if the mrb-ToReleaseList includes any mrb-Identity value that is not part of the current UE configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":2550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:Whether or not the RLC and MAC entities associated with this PDCP entity are reset or released is determined by the CellGroupConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":2551},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.6.7Multicast MRB addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":2552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall for each element in the order of entry in the list mrb-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if mrb-Identity value included in the mrb-ToAddModList is part of the UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":2554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if mrb-Identity value included in the mrb-ToAddModList for which mrb-IdentityNew is included (i.e., multicast MRB ID change):","paragraph_zero_based":2555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>update the mrb-Identity to the value mrb-IdentityNew;","paragraph_zero_based":2556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reestablishPDCP is set:","paragraph_zero_based":2557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if drb-ContinueROHC is included in pdcp-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":2558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to lower layer that drb-ContinueROHC is configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2559},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if drb-ContinueEHC-DL is included in pdcp-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":2560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to lower layer that drb-ContinueEHC-DL is configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish the PDCP entity of this multicast MRB as specified in TS 38.323 [5], clause 5.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else, if the recoverPDCP is set:","paragraph_zero_based":2563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>trigger the PDCP entity of this MRB to perform data recovery as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":2564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the pdcp-Config is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the PDCP entity in accordance with the received pdcp-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if mrb-Identity value included in the mrb-ToAddModList is not part of the UE configuration (i.e., multicast MRB establishment including the case when full configuration option is used):","paragraph_zero_based":2567}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2f4e890bd17ffe351bc742b577780973447ddb04a111c6ba276e624e13859903","cdf43253791c4bb0ea65025b11fa36228b3ff9d2bf1ffa8a5422fa2eac1b69b9","9062dfb9ee864661eb15f165f8f5ae51cc727494fa5c69ebbb803db7bd2b2c94","10f844c1718e613286b56a07fde6990e1a62137cff1c07994e7d667ba7a2219d","ca063ae3918a989c6666c29a5a19cf0192ecde0edbe27b9dc74a5710cfb36076","685cfe0bd2cd2f2665fca6a8a29684325f4db7a461c3a6ecd624056e1559d34c","66f62ef325bcdb6216bee537c530375185022e9345edbbfba3fc8fd30e047b25","5b961231288876d09c2996101a912616088eed3ce8b4de7d9917d5c1efb7d2ab","5ab670c8f26329b5d1304d86c6d9619c3898d62bdb76cdb1326aee74b5fde1f0","a7450dbca88324cebbdcf6ede5199a204523b14a79468654644f9faaa16583f4","d349a7eb215babffba01dbc8a9accc3b2b44fc6ee45a07a9d2fd4b501aca794b","e460112b55eb74d69f030189c0123bacf879ad5620ab36cae410340f65f63693","56bfe3443df6dcbf921fffa8327c1e69888a60b61442eba459ff9244900cadf2","bebba2cc8ec18d330871a4e0ad5d7c5fb8afb2c54484a72be46eca3d25672331","8c62a24bde979cf62e43a18b4ebb0dad6f18b494ac0d4112e530cb45eef70efc","c0500c3260a658cb1d26b29d0690c36f6c8dcee9b7d5045409e7a323a3e3f62e","4eaf136f7279f19adf806cc5146977bac1a1f2582f561192165e8f4910f0586a","4cdc44e9bfb9b91641d30359d2db9b0ffed71fc53dfe56e85035fd929fbd327e","b9b165f07cc078382ff86c7924a8fa55c0745e857e97fc0148898f99a91b039e","a0a11cc7123dd2b5b7eaef8ec3814ca3741837a5a0235047435401b961e7b8a5","6609a3a45f286464addfa175f930073eac58ff297c54c65bc8d0d1e015505d97","64cfd3988ce8254f9de1c1f4bed06666cd141191fd645b7a14ec291219043d04","f08cc0b62ad3a222c2e14e0cc92c221f35520d5ceacf31de332c35ebae2b0007","56fcecb228db5958e70ac57b273ba4ba582b3f29cd1b0ce7f6b7d3e3dab3da7b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2544,2567],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2544"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish a PDCP entity and configure it in accordance with the received pdcp-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>associate the established multicast MRB with the corresponding mbs-SessionId;","paragraph_zero_based":2569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if an SDAP entity with the received mbs-SessionId does not exist:","paragraph_zero_based":2570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish an SDAP entity as specified in TS 37.324 [24] clause 5.1.1;","paragraph_zero_based":2571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if an SDAP entity with the received mbs-SessionId did not exist prior to receiving this reconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":2572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate the establishment of the user plane resources for the mbs-SessionId to upper layers.","paragraph_zero_based":2573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:When setting the reestablishPDCP flag for a radio bearer, the network ensures that the RLC receiver entities do not deliver old PDCP PDUs to the re-established PDCP entity. The network does that e.g. by triggering a reconfiguration with sync of the cell group hosting the old RLC entity or by releasing the old RLC entity.","paragraph_zero_based":2574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:In this specification, UE configuration refers to the parameters configured by NR RRC unless otherwise stated.","paragraph_zero_based":2575},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:When updating the mrb-Identity, the network ensures new MRBs are listed at the end of the mrb-ToAddModList if they have the same MRB ID as in the existing UE configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":2576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.7AS Security key update","paragraph_zero_based":2577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if UE is connected to E-UTRA/EPC or E-UTRA/5GC:","paragraph_zero_based":2579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon reception of sk-Counter as specified in TS 36.331 [10]:","paragraph_zero_based":2580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>update the S-KgNB key based on the KeNB key and using the received sk-Counter value, as specified in TS 33.401 [30] for EN-DC, or TS 33.501 [11] for NGEN-DC;","paragraph_zero_based":2581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>derive the KRRCenc and KUPenc keys as specified in TS 33.401 [30] for EN-DC, or TS 33.501 [11] for NGEN-DC;","paragraph_zero_based":2582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>derive the KRRCint and KUPint keys as specified in TS 33.401 [30] for EN-DC or TS 33.501 [11] for NGEN-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":2583},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if this procedure was initiated due to reception of the masterKeyUpdate:","paragraph_zero_based":2584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the nas-Container is included in the received masterKeyUpdate:","paragraph_zero_based":2585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>forward the nas-Container to the upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":2586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the keySetChangeIndicator is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":2587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>derive or update the KgNB key based on the KAMF key, as specified in TS 33.501 [11];","paragraph_zero_based":2588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>derive or update the KgNB key based on the current KgNB key or the NH, using the nextHopChainingCount value indicated in the received masterKeyUpdate, as specified in TS 33.501 [11];","paragraph_zero_based":2590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the nextHopChainingCount value;","paragraph_zero_based":2591}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4f9af8e4196d9f5af5ab5e26f476cce850d557cb3c7a936a5f8c7e529187d488","8a286d4051943f8fb48a61abfff73ad561ff322923c161756f9cb13fe0ef3568","0e186550a704f9234ad9d9115e25cdefb5c8cf6ce79b068c10caa671c1e0c58a","aa6da51cb136660f25a5eceefe5ca5f3fb86fbb0aa0b9a6a7fa159d6346981cc","445d3b47749e69374f80a0e0e5e6f7a396d10cd6cb5cee3a3ea551eed6f54376","3ba2ffed85f1beed62b61f9d336207397d0fcc2d795d622444f4875c0562cc2c","4f56c32617d37fdfafa452e228e7584ef59e32c579aca5bba362425c73b5aed0","4f35ed9bafff78a6894a461cb2d152d15cc5942e0ccf70a72c20ba254dd16ec8","8432cd4e52da60da75c4d448f073720a3eb46adcf354e248f9bd123567e335d1","5e37f2b145c6b15f87c12141fb5988509e1fe6d4efdeb962fdb561e94cc020b2","6b9f5f6fa566ba8145b175957959d3177c803f6aca27ef7b9db7ce1644f7c6bf","55a74e41a9693c8f1c7a89706c2e8209024542ffde46ab725014fd6279b1a246","5a29445a3fe1869785a9525b26df35e4536336135e2333ce3eb9ea3558cc7c6a","b166aea865557fcb862c83ef1a16add70b2daffdf6cefcd7fa027ffb702184c9","8c4f65ae9eea65dea4c57465ed0c3dd65f7fa36492e3cac3fbbed722ea7efdf1","47babbb04fd38df6393e8de1ac81ef3f014fbf0c776e1f805c64c935bf594c60","938edae4f49ee0a1cdea39d547369cad5bca2701c4e4bd29feff9537ae58dc3d","1bb3ed83ef623c6d6cb7c5eb0b3bd6c7e4f499cfeabc89a159c03bfbe5271561","05babdda676baae768a0b39af6d601c7e022ac20e424780b13b54e32dd526d22","4d06b468570acd806789c91b34284f34b5038058175a5cfd541a9b0fec014f5b","ba41b3009e5d13012010f8ef041f88a4af20838031e533115ba3360d6e19a4c2","6430273e5800be6c6df8713f35dcea313fe4668630c768c8f15c056520479ae5","cb51fcb6b3a87b72f85e46cc32873699cfe4fb64905a946c00240458c39b5d12","0e5fb1878f455d331fbd65ab2573426a2aacebceacf89df2b47ced3513ad1ebe"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2568,2591],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2568"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>derive the keys associated with the KgNB key as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":2592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the securityAlgorithmConfig is included in SecurityConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>derive the KRRCenc and KUPenc keys associated with the cipheringAlgorithm indicated in the securityAlgorithmConfig, as specified in TS 33.501 [11];","paragraph_zero_based":2594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>derive the KRRCint and KUPint keys associated with the integrityProtAlgorithm indicated in the securityAlgorithmConfig, as specified in TS 33.501 [11];","paragraph_zero_based":2595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>derive the KRRCenc and KUPenc keys associated with the current cipheringAlgorithm, as specified in TS 33.501 [11];","paragraph_zero_based":2597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>derive the KRRCint and KUPint keys associated with the current integrityProtAlgorithm, as specified in TS 33.501 [11].","paragraph_zero_based":2598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Ciphering and integrity protection are optional to configure for the DRBs.","paragraph_zero_based":2599},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if this procedure was initiated due to reception of the sk-Counter (UE is in NE-DC, or NR-DC, or is configured with SN terminated bearer(s)) or if the procedure was initiated due to selection of an sk-Counter for  conditional reconfiguration execution for subsequent CPAC (UE is in NR-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":2600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>derive or update the secondary key (S-KgNB or S-KeNB) based on the KgNB key and using the received or selected sk-Counter value, as specified in TS 33.501 [11];","paragraph_zero_based":2601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>derive the KRRCenc key and the KUPenc key as specified in TS 33.501 [11] using the ciphering algorithms indicated in the RadioBearerConfig associated with the secondary key (S-KgNB or S-KeNB) as indicated by keyToUse;","paragraph_zero_based":2602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>derive the KRRCint key and the KUPint key as specified in TS 33.501 [11] using the integrity protection algorithms indicated in the RadioBearerConfig associated with the secondary key (S-KgNB or S-KeNB) as indicated by keyToUse;","paragraph_zero_based":2603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:If the UE has no radio bearer configured with keyToUse set to secondary and receives the sk-Counter or an sk-Counter is selected for subsequent CPAC without any RadioBearerConfig with keyToUse set to secondary, the UE does not consider it as an invalid reconfiguration.","paragraph_zero_based":2604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.8Reconfiguration failure","paragraph_zero_based":2605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.8.1Void","paragraph_zero_based":2606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.8.2Inability to comply with RRCReconfiguration","paragraph_zero_based":2607},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 00:The UE behaviour specified in this clause does not apply to the following, and the UE ignores, i.e. does not take an action on and does not store, the fields that it does not support or does not comprehend:","paragraph_zero_based":2608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The fields in ServingCellConfigCommon that are defined in Rel-16 and later.","paragraph_zero_based":2609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The fields of searchSpaceMCCH and searchSpaceMTCH in PDCCH-ConfigCommon that are defined in Rel-17 and later.","paragraph_zero_based":2610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in (NG)EN-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":2612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is unable to comply with (part of) the configuration included in the RRCReconfiguration message received over SRB3;","paragraph_zero_based":2613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received as part of ConditionalReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":2614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>continue using the configuration used prior to when the inability to comply with the RRCReconfiguration message was detected;","paragraph_zero_based":2615}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f2bb73ee3a6f4c36b0f7dda69ea46b874c69a8f013bbf2035c1c795ea0900299","71c3f65f1a82c204b835492ee3d3491c31e5f865806e7f5fadf6b666bf37324a","7dd6f17e103280843d272f09f9f979a85a8eec9476eaa842d863a66cf6dd2d7e","db4ccda19bd64625cf7b9d6b00754faab2877f698fd232d0036c67678f179f9d","a6b4a027523fd39cdfb4ed486f0ea62606c099176e6530e3f8b6cc5032dd87be","26b97581f400944ca2d1a5cde7c8c614403ce09d01a93676c20138ba04231a14","8790b65cf9f1303c72b7bf966dbfb42981fb976eabb1db6bea4ea935b5fde2ab","7fb41837617776849d9dc7393bb303291765d18459adbc631fb3dfb84ce423fe","db2f18f147b97e705854f0aa4e4686c0eda789100e6e9a143b45f0c889c5daae","f294429ee071acbbff88acba46d94fd9bf8b8644aa6352acffc02c3fc2b7340d","b69fe7dc1253f86a026fc64d3cde3aef3046aba1dbb81a1c92ff0c32f9c24b8d","099d3ab16c9b68aeb6d8848f8409cf9d4a19457d1327d73975c2a4be00adb9aa","5140934518b7fbd95c41d0385d4af4f7e24f94573f1492c743c7a2bcb717cf57","8d703ab6f3eb7c13a28c65b33be3a0e540402e6e61eaa6276b8b8b0bd4eedac1","37d6c91975bc7598daff4d71ca22d417c9adcb3f7d4010aa8c58cd1eb6a4b927","3420abba11d89db6c8676436055533a84092afa15f108c15d64f9a3102fae12b","322f181b7f7687567d235138d8d94f445db93e9cb3a695adf324cdc86d110db9","548b58405c096c7660742ce5b33957802b189560920fff33716ee447808d8974","cebb53a8730bcd8838ab808554469c8ebaa7752c1d62004b30339337f7ba4e36","00cbc6c24bb36dc710cf4b2e20a30c9729afab781f0579e0c67ba3efabff2509","e8a4f13582821c25cdf9922070f63426f5c194bed13731353d0c840221ba3c18","e6618489f2660558cf24816b22dec0a3ae28cdcf5eeddf4dec691e8ec8f51ddd","966672ef868811c2058990dada27a06f20572bf2acec175291473d0e109d0935","0f5a8ab32c491d59aa2ac70648d05c49e47d4dd917efd26efa40742c404cc942"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2592,2615],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2592"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>continue using the configuration used prior to the reception of RRCReconfiguration message;","paragraph_zero_based":2617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if MCG transmission is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":2618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the SCG failure information procedure as specified in clause 5.7.3 to report SCG reconfiguration error, upon which the connection reconfiguration procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":2619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.7, upon which the connection reconfiguration procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":2621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else, if the UE is unable to comply with (part of) the configuration included in the RRCReconfiguration message received over SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":2622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received as part of ConditionalReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":2623},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>continue using the configuration used prior to when the inability to comply with the RRCReconfiguration message was detected;","paragraph_zero_based":2624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>continue using the configuration used prior to the reception of RRCReconfiguration message;","paragraph_zero_based":2626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.7, upon which the connection reconfiguration procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":2627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if RRCReconfiguration is received via NR (i.e., NR standalone, NE-DC, or NR-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":2628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is unable to comply with (part of) the configuration included in the RRCReconfiguration message received over SRB3;","paragraph_zero_based":2629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:This case does not apply in NE-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":2630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received as part of ConditionalReconfiguration; or,","paragraph_zero_based":2631},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received as part of ltm-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":2632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>continue using the configuration used prior to when the inability to comply with the RRCReconfiguration message was detected;","paragraph_zero_based":2633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>continue using the configuration used prior to the reception of RRCReconfiguration message;","paragraph_zero_based":2635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if MCG transmission is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":2636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the SCG failure information procedure as specified in clause 5.7.3 to report SCG reconfiguration error, upon which the connection reconfiguration procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":2637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in clause 5.3.7, upon which the connection reconfiguration procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":2639}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a43c618ed3a322cbc2edc175ace8f9848a9d4db776c06b7c2e140f9380ae6ecd","5bc4b8f314a0662e4b4361a3de062bc27ce92af04b09f51917bb9d00c6afc1e6","2fc9e20b38a72d5cce8cd14f0c97b3e63b66112133293aa2ffbc314cf72d3512","27147f903bb921f2af65875f6f41e77ede161e090a6acbcfff8514132819cb1e","e6bc59a3da87499aace29bf09801396fb37d98e06b220ec1f94f785e3af4f79f","ca0cfa1e8cda619911ad5845b2d2d63a4608697d075529ed729572d194b327e6","ae74c09f61a5d90450ba10ba329b87a857835fbc8cae6cd34bea13aa18d9aa0c","388d109e10928f7948d14435439ebdbc258459081532099346ae3d4efcf043c4","2115f73206d34322b2decc845b7a0bd29a44bad5a5ecc42091a35221fea0f852","3e157f6a862d07a1a3713a1f00413acab2c284dc7100795c191c0ec711e9b5b7","0556c7d8c1fd9cd8415d240eb0a6ea15945880e7ad0691335b6e0426879ae7e6","cdfa11dbfbdc0e3afd0599fcef9dd8eaf345dc3eb0ef450bcccbdc7e6142a4cf","0ae6f6bd4b70813e4bfd48030b00c474bd5c1a790d85da063b802363afdb7102","e67192e0675ae0444892a64680849e8e46f45ed215cd97198ef07077f8c92ebd","485ff4853b7418c6d5fb9af4e9a68b0f7106cd5f2bd4d1d88058f0b857890a2c","1896d092a6a8bf04e0823501d954b945e1a2236cb6de187641b181e75a9467eb","6076150010ba6278345b717c1aea2e893923768cae2b8dce5573f28565c1166d","73edd9f4350411696f8c0c70f79167085c5b6c487bcf7dba747446954bf17875","4cdd8d9a2bfc614bb70d3de10a852aef32359ab49184767363e59b54154b759b","e0a8812c79ce96a9892fcf5d9e97689654d48c7c5229772a500168538e7c3703","e4ed313d1669466818abc13b9d632cbe154466cc8c3fa6d550fde99c0aada4e7","d344324cdbb6105321a294bb9dfe2bb17737b6c1fc218f31caf6183832e5d11b","5fbe0047aa300560dbd51868cfdc5cc043f63f39205ba71902472547af8713d8","89a0394873ad25accc9bbac18df8c3131cb45ffee7bedcd7899b8aa1f01b8b5d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2616,2639],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2616"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is unable to comply with (part of) the configuration included in the RRCReconfiguration message received over the SRB1 or if the upper layers indicate that the nas-Container is invalid:","paragraph_zero_based":2640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0a:The compliance also covers the SCG configuration carried within octet strings e.g. field mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig. I.e. the failure behaviour defined also applies in case the UE cannot comply with the embedded SCG configuration or with the combination of (parts of) the MCG and SCG configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":2641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0b:The compliance also covers the V2X sidelink configuration carried within an octet string, e.g. field sl-ConfigDedicatedEUTRA. I.e. the failure behaviour defined also applies in case the UE cannot comply with the embedded V2X sidelink configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":2642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received as part of ConditionalReconfiguration; or,","paragraph_zero_based":2643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received as part of ltm-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":2644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>continue using the configuration used prior to when the inability to comply with the RRCReconfiguration message was detected;","paragraph_zero_based":2645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>continue using the configuration used prior to the reception of RRCReconfiguration message;","paragraph_zero_based":2647},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if AS security has not been activated:","paragraph_zero_based":2648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11, with release cause 'other'","paragraph_zero_based":2649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if AS security has been activated but SRB2 and at least one DRB or multicast MRB or, for IAB and NCR, SRB2, have not been setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11, with release cause 'RRC connection failure';","paragraph_zero_based":2651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in 5.3.7, upon which the reconfiguration procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":2653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if RRCReconfiguration is received via other RAT (Handover to NR failure):","paragraph_zero_based":2654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is unable to comply with any part of the configuration included in the RRCReconfiguration message or if the upper layers indicate that the nas-Container is invalid:","paragraph_zero_based":2655},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions defined for this failure case as defined in the specifications applicable for the other RAT.","paragraph_zero_based":2656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE may apply above failure handling also in case the RRCReconfiguration message causes a protocol error for which the generic error handling as defined in clause 10 specifies that the UE shall ignore the message.","paragraph_zero_based":2657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:If the UE is unable to comply with part of the configuration, it does not apply any part of the configuration, i.e. there is no partial success/failure.","paragraph_zero_based":2658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:It is up to UE implementation whether the compliance check for an RRCReconfiguration received as part of ConditionalReconfiguration is performed upon the reception of the message or upon CHO, CPA, CPC, and subsequent CPAC execution (when the message is required to be applied).","paragraph_zero_based":2659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:It is up to UE implementation whether the compliance check for an RRCReconfiguration message received as part of an LTM-Config IE is performed upon the reception of the message or during an LTM cell switch procedure (when the message is required to be applied).","paragraph_zero_based":2660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.8.3T304 expiry (Reconfiguration with sync Failure) or T420 expiry (Path switch failure)","paragraph_zero_based":2661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T304 of the MCG expires; or","paragraph_zero_based":2663}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5e9f2f8e0dfdbb3ed9101200521d2d1ae0d9141a3b58c3c7336e77daf89dfa5b","26e769e3a0e1f949e59c27ba3c2e9bf81e230d58ef7ca30d9e4fd216e6e8e5ff","3b893355e58179ee50f2d0b466a741f5675dbe48924f81da36c1a5bbfdfdfc98","92747bdf94850249b2714bf77b523d9ec12cc76d14f739ca6809322c70b75c77","fe102787ce0f0405d50651f2120c64dc8a9f897b6a8ddc2cab27bac7227a5eaf","6698f05de30b10d6c6f52a38e04a23f632c1062d0e42151db07e959c370957fa","1d031384e6bf7a7a9d0ea08bf57381bc530451349218f15c3998964a73a6359a","8759e680ce391df19c3b5d1bc49093d8d8c2b570f332a432f49f0034b4a5f945","64a505f8118501b2dad9f4ce604e0cb302d5587e3ee1128405ee62de74bf6b6c","11dcd21b8a8e4a76eed0d64cbee61a755de789d61029d3f066f975e7c8f1e84f","53dc10c12ff28b0a694323e7b8c77774eee279ae6659db2618c5fd603eb9f934","04b1b3a25bc4e0aae8c50707d39d54d2187bf31a37e242a31862dfcc46b2dd7a","8f74cd49822fde109868feeb98cb031077d608b82de179193dbf15846e190e52","cb52b553a0aeabbaddad418729640ee0d0ce3d35a73dd044e0edd1ba799eb3f6","bc723fa4d09506e6dd33063a622eaf259bf9c598b62b5c952db8af0ee3c57b09","094f0e206abe65d019cfd080cfc96562d978f5e6bdd8b517511811f6209d299c","26e2efcea262760031d1b823471459c4f4b1e9ea7b2dd6f3c46ea746ecf8f1b7","949b9b41802b9c8b4545f8bd0fd2dfbf2612f7e19db683cf5ad95ed1253ecc91","971f7ad153647571183fe08456be08d7819834cc8a32ad76c32a51801ad351dc","bec0d903e664f1bec8a6058b154767092a2f0741843e98cafc3c537b5b0d9ad3","6e2069964b9db4be2faedc8b32dc0bcbe258172f476ede0f37ae4eb61fcd6b7a","64b5749de8b2b1bf1b843c2e1e69f824c8370e3864948b92a7f0513edcd896ed","8437fe7efa43aa7c702e140addc995e2879f2fe021bac1a35f5539f8d8c1b144","58115708f1f6869ed81c1ecabac5b01be529ae827d6fd9c80ed6e0c07ed769ee"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2640,2663],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2640"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> if T420 expires; or,","paragraph_zero_based":2664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> if the target L2 U2N Relay UE (i.e., the UE indicated by targetRelayUE-Identity in the received RRCReconfiguration message containing reconfigurationWithSync indicating path switch as specified in 5.3.5.5.2) changes its serving PCell before path switch:","paragraph_zero_based":2665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release dedicated preambles provided in rach-ConfigDedicated if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release dedicated msgA PUSCH resources provided in rach-ConfigDedicated if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if any DAPS bearer is configured, and radio link failure is not detected in the source PCell, according to clause 5.3.10.3:","paragraph_zero_based":2668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset MAC for the target PCell and release the MAC configuration for the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":2670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2671},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>reconfigure the PDCP entity to release DAPS as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":2672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":2673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the masterKeyUpdate was not received:","paragraph_zero_based":2674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>configure the PDCP entity for the source PCell with state variables continuation as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":2675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the PDCP entity for the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>trigger the PDCP entity for the source PCell to perform SDU discard as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":2678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>re-establish the RLC entity for the source PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2679},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the physical channel configuration for the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>discard the keys used in target PCell (the KgNB key, the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key), if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>resume suspended SRBs in the source PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each non-DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":2683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>revert back to the UE configuration used for the DRB or multicast MRB in the source PCell, includes PDCP, RLC states variables, the security configuration and the data stored in transmission and reception buffers in PDCP and RLC entities ;","paragraph_zero_based":2684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>revert back to the UE measurement configuration used in the source PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the handover failure information in VarRLF-Report as described in the clause 5.3.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":2686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the failure information procedure as specified in clause 5.7.5 to report DAPS handover failure.","paragraph_zero_based":2687}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1038b0e5b001c5bcd358fcd36e2f0485aadc094916d633e8b45af0eb972af120","6073f620ad19d737b67d12828de415f8f4c6022d130f58e24b5791b459398491","bb5f9a206b07f695e81d469e0249daf41211aa15e83d6593b9687cfd011e56cb","96cd464f3f6de88caacbefadc99993ea97a726d3156268e18e9e5cacad963825","651e86eddcfea598b3929cb9d21db27764647435f3a49f524b67ccc06484df8a","6f4726de8205d7150f8f4b29f1e09acf750e9ce50d45bfa09383cc8f35b02761","dbc45f0f6c82805bfee8aba91155c0dfcd6c0c3358331daba304238182e8e447","bf39ca298f65dd8eac944ecc2eaaed1c52194449f25dbdb06d3c5da1be2bcce1","8947b5c62e703624f51cbf20592dec04536e61efd6fe3c64d556f88bae83774b","d5f73e4d8790f7efe3068a5d99e9e87ffe30ee5a98b2483c7a9a50eceb9913f2","c28ec5c25333579612d4868430233164fe6ee65870bc3759d0b09f45937e3824","bec9e844b501eb631af58d9045f14733f052675953b341eb4e677c01aa57ca56","bba73cab58abf73aa5398042156fcba6b2eee0e227dff16c1a49ce026fbe1114","778d393f746a3ee046b4f7c83be56db3dbf28382918bec8e90c37af8c4ffb799","5456a3d9683397d7ecea84dfe147a91bc5701b12f1c2a50f7784e16167cf048b","e4eac285d9e70ebd95fac6c847229f21376f026678f7cf0b443ddd176e2902ab","5f2bbe925691fe2e97ce3a488a8791a266b0410eb258618aba5569cabacec6b2","27cc372f35956320c258d2dbe0ec187733b726bd6f5fea4d484123d2e2fea2dd","a6b88e6ce40f187593a015abf7ba1dec817c6d59ee3fc96bdda0d09690450403","107ed3b3df699828758c3923ab95f63fa9c4e79788a9a46496db23ce84e01be0","4175c5186359c1941823c43b11f35cec99fedd40226bcabc19fd4831143d2c08","60ef725547a3ecfafa1fb86070e713bf387597d71f4ec8f4ec299dca0eddc31d","b7520763086f75ebd6a53a1a8c831155ff69712fd76d2838396d3bbf83bc930c","d7c34f6fabe312a77426461303281ceebe7d7ddb16f584dc52454aa39c0df745"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2664,2687],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p2664"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>revert back to the UE configuration used in the source PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the associated T304 was not initiated upon cell selection performed while timer T311 was running, as defined in clause 5.3.7.3:","paragraph_zero_based":2690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the handover failure information in VarRLF-Report as described in the clause 5.3.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":2691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in clause 5.3.7.","paragraph_zero_based":2692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:In the context above, \"the UE configuration\" includes state variables and parameters of each radio bearer.","paragraph_zero_based":2693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if T304 of a secondary cell group expires:","paragraph_zero_based":2694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if MCG transmission is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":2695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release dedicated preambles provided in rach-ConfigDedicated, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release dedicated msgA PUSCH resources provided in rach-ConfigDedicated, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the SCG failure information procedure as specified in clause 5.7.3 to report SCG reconfiguration with sync failure, upon which the RRC reconfiguration procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":2698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is in NR-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":2700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in clause 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (the UE is in (NG) EN-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":2702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if T304 expires when RRCReconfiguration is received via other RAT (HO to NR failure):","paragraph_zero_based":2704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":2705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions defined for this failure case as defined in the specifications applicable for the other RAT.","paragraph_zero_based":2706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:In this clause, the term 'handover failure' has been used to refer to 'reconfiguration with sync failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":2707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.9Other configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the delayBudgetReportingConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if delayBudgetReportingConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2711}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["071224e0a47c80fce7ccee48e518a36573165ec1ff26b99dfcf1494f0dfe1669","249eab80dbfa91f3cdc67c2cfc60094cc2b8102e6055d192bbe35e8190cf0a79","2b3cfabfb80a0cb1c64c011ec6193227f21743bccb3df5f87fdb366485f42504","7cf1081ca7326321b96cae098202da73e93042ce83903481bf4d3e80b693c197","0313fc10fa