rs for FR2-2 for power saving for the cell group in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for power saving for the cell group and stop timer T346d associated with the cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for power saving for the cell group in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if otherConfig includes minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfigExt:","paragraph_zero_based":2752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider itself to be configured to provide its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for 480 kHz SCS and/or 960 kHz SCS for cross-slot scheduling for power saving for the cell group in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for power saving for the cell group and stop timer T346e associated with the cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the releasePreferenceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if releasePreferenceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide assistance information to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2759}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fc584faa62064ccc149a116838422c9b201dccb926f02aae29e046f97e531aaf","2638bad9997fb9b1335244c0e365212e8e90edcda9d2c2f7dafe864b5b18c872","ff0cc5f8174712a6fb6839389f8e1278380a2ec8aaa539cdced685058ca85bfe","2829e336081366f2787da2ca78475352783b9a4e87fd517d5502cfe9a3fc61a4","f4472438fa33e9fb75f048b231ee03d68b1f6dd73b1e1ea8acae9ec074ebdf76","587bb6f070cc0ae1f9eb7be50e75577fa51e100cd4235c9be5f567846c8a746d","fce48533dd32b47a17e3c265fce32d3b35590ce1d17b3d60baa3ac4e1f045c0d","f196059d1e6ea1ebe5e8910ff7fb11bc6bc4d4cb929ed81acee3a9c6722b8821","2ad28f1e38e1a5e8e7907086b9b0253998989f3bbea9d82e78134fbf1dbadba7","f2ebef052f3fc0324c1fc55ac584158021fb63f7adc7f9a260377eb4ce8ddad3","09370ce905c26c5a0fc4b9db0c69b2d8db96ff735e938aac8983d05f1e1d2195","7a9dade69b2240b9e548d606142dfe34a1ab9eb256564ea2b37f144aaa683c33","3300d40078b8c9e67e68a9686776d0b2f0f367c491c6c5f6944195a25f7b28cf","85c4d81374e7e12217cf4db64be26865b48b65887f8938dc899f978c18875eb2","ef0a64a9362b81f3af50e5f7b8e294edfc8f59fa12d54eb326614fc17b9872f8","bc7d0b524e0c20784ce21bda6ddeb506b099f45d9ba38ea695c3975ff29c1921","b3dae75e72da963aa866475cf73852e4da38c27d1ff465b0d6d31ddfeb9a6497","0d333fdc2fce1ec0fdbc8ac0bb67eaac21a4737f95aab75f9803c6667a62f37b","03067cb6bd91b94d78b3b7b46a2fb93cf753df55fe4514373fe016b3864a8785","bce4fc9003b78b12929cc43ed9067486a4affebe7dcf5eff16b53a0b03731191","99b7ae7e95ffc2bb21b4ca092a419202e8986db502b375db07b5ee18871f8266","cd77abb92f489574