 T346k associated with the cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide its SCG deactivation preference in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide its SCG deactivation preference and stop timer T346i, if running.","paragraph_zero_based":2825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the propDelayDiffReportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the propDelayDiffReportConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s) in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s).","paragraph_zero_based":2830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2831}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4fad18c