{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of the sl-RemoteUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-DestinationIdentity value included in the sl-RemoteUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the current UE has a PC5 RRC connection to a L2 U2N Remote UE with SL-DestinationIdentity:","paragraph_zero_based":3410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release.","paragraph_zero_based":3411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2U Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of the sl-U2U-RemoteUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-DestinationIdentity value included in the sl-U2U-RemoteUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the current UE has a PC5-RRC connection to a L2 U2U Remote UE with this SL-DestinationIdentity:","paragraph_zero_based":3415},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the configuration associated with the L2 U2U Remote UE.","paragraph_zero_based":3416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.15.3L2 U2N or U2U Remote UE Addition/Modification","paragraph_zero_based":3417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if no SRAP entity has been established:","paragraph_zero_based":3419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66];","paragraph_zero_based":3420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sl-L2IdentityRemote value included in the sl-RemoteUE-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (L2 U2N Remote UE Addition):","paragraph_zero_based":3421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure the parameters to SRAP entity in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigRelay;","paragraph_zero_based":3422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SRB1 is included in sl-MappingToAddModList, and sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3423},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release SL-RLC1, if established;","paragraph_zero_based":3424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>associate the PC5 Relay RLC channel as indicated by sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 with SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else: (i.e. SRB1 is not included in sl-MappingToAddModList, or SRB1 is included in sl-MappingToAddModList, but sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 is not configured)","paragraph_zero_based":3426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SL-RLC1 is not established:","paragraph_zero_based":3427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the default configuration of SL-RLC1 as specified in clause 9.2.4 and associate it with the SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sl-L2IdentityRemote value included in the sl-RemoteUE-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (L2 U2N Remote UE modification):","paragraph_zero_based":3429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>modify the configuration in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigRelay;","paragraph_zero_based":3430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2U Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3431}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["87fa7072a1087420a314fbd255444bd6ab95ea94be97ae028fa41154df5b66cf","009aab2e11dd7986f556218