{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if no SRAP entity has been established:","paragraph_zero_based":3432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66];","paragraph_zero_based":3433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each target L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-L2IdentityRemoteUE value included in the sl-U2U-RemoteUE-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (target L2 U2U Remote UE Addition):","paragraph_zero_based":3434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each source L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-SourceUE-Identity in accordance with one entry of the sl-SourceRemoteUE-ToAddModList: ","paragraph_zero_based":3435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the parameters to SRAP entity in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U;","paragraph_zero_based":3436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each target L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-L2IdentityRemote value included in the sl-U2U-RemoteUE-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (target L2 U2U Remote UE modification):","paragraph_zero_based":3437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each source L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-SourceUE-Identity included in the sl-SourceRemoteUE-ToReleaseList (source L2 U2U Remote UE Release):","paragraph_zero_based":3438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the configuration associated with the source L2 U2U Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":3439},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the source L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-SourceUE-Identity included in the sl-SourceRemoteUE-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (source L2 U2U Remote UE Addition):","paragraph_zero_based":3440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the parameters to SRAP entity in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U;","paragraph_zero_based":3441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the source L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-SourceUE-Identity included in the sl-SourceRemoteUE-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (source L2 U2U Remote UE modification):","paragraph_zero_based":3442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>modify the configuration in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U;","paragraph_zero_based":3443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.16L2 U2N or U2U Remote UE configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network configures the L2 U2N or U2U Remote UE with relay operation related configurations, e.g. SRAP configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":3445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-L2RemoteUE-Config is set to setup or received from RRCSetup message:","paragraph_zero_based":3447},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config contains the sl-SRAP-ConfigRemote:","paragraph_zero_based":3448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if no SRAP entity has been established:","paragraph_zero_based":3449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66];","paragraph_zero_based":3450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the parameters to SRAP entity in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigRemote;","paragraph_zero_based":3451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SRB1 is included in sl-MappingToAddModList, and sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release SL-RLC1, if established;","paragraph_zero_based":3453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> associate the PC5 Relay RLC channel as indicated by sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 with SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else: (i.e. SRB1 is not included in sl-MappingToAddModList, or SRB1 is included in sl-MappingToAddModList, but sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5 is not configured)","paragraph_zero_based":3455}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["868a7229cedfbc14597c9b1176b60af7e841144127924dc46a61a51993e9215a","f20eaaf6344a4de2ab5f16359cbf31786536cea4276bb4a4bb3dd64363073da6","055d6c0d006551b7da3297a27642a6fac7d36c1ef90e086ae9a7d431102b4f8e","49802a87666dce531c272c621a3484059706669a8ebbf3ff3c30664323e0ef0f","72f93d5c36503ba9f4d74f37d06a1ff598de9b2544a17fbc8256a0c15f37439a","d17239ba94353583fb55d7ae18515be4b6fe22bee4d53731bb5d6868b1c68835","500745f26732a0f80982da814278cfbf558f579b02a62659d8584c9c8fbad8c2","e6ff237684b1d81483ac4fc7f05d0a46f73b8e29578d289f9cf44f2955626cc9","0d56bf6724cf4c2d4c8f74d4433d26bfe62c40fd70ddbf5c24c94a530eef024c","9c2c01fc3df8608424bff174a0e7d5f2551a62740b5559a6f77f96fc9aa77e64","1b845837340c4ec4148f4587546033cc31a3057283f5511bbb560fb7ee936dde","6887d706f046ae3c68db18f8189d70b678162070b5e8ff0df6ede84c542515ee","ba49ccd2c9ef3b752189afa1c043e7c7084f1420a5eb50f045922415cda06dba","6eb919de1cbc1d16643fff4d088466d37970b8e5510ef5ffd141a98ce5e70dcc","09141f0d264c6a3073c5c3a4eea0da0c28800a4ed438e8d753c369bc2f87aa55","20aa7c4c5095e31c97942629e91fab929666e0e08b76d052695a582f52d54907","4286a18286cfdab30833611090eb4994873ba67a75d3227c4a194cd0d36e4e66","e29f86e284cd2fb3d1fa8f97d31a33e7ecb42518dedaeea0ada1b22af7b902b0","bb8e4d4cbad9e6f5864ba96d9c3d05ccdd0d5ccff506d27c636e3521bcb7172d","943a9d8dbb829b04f4094023dbbb45c3d1230123bd0b99541fd043cd70722b55","70ebaad0c86bdab618202516c5a2167e530babb4c2dbbebc49d9b2092ee10694","a3779f7b6642005eb6b2421e78556f2d8987227e921ea12c50ae8788b91c09dc","a59bae553e44457779c5a12e05700206c206cb53be4d2655525f6e52c6fb0921","7bfca17fb7306b890a84d57f72979e8e01050bae2032a52fed7703d1beb6a973"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3432,3455],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p3432"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if SL-RLC1 is not established:","paragraph_zero_based":3456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the default configuration of SL-RLC1 as specified in clause 9.2.4 and associate it with the SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config contains the sl-UEIdentityRemote:","paragraph_zero_based":3458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the value of the sl-UEIdentityRemote as the C-RNTI in the PCell.","paragraph_zero_based":3459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if sl-L2RemoteUE-Config is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the L2 U2N relay operation related configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":3461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2U Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-L2RemoteUE-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config contains the sl-U2U-RelayUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the L2 U2U Relay UE release as specified in 5.3.5.16.1;","paragraph_zero_based":3465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config contains the sl-U2U-RelayUE-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the L2 U2U Relay UE addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.16.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if sl-L2RemoteUE-Config is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the L2 U2U relay operation related configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":3469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.16.1L2 U2U Relay UE Release","paragraph_zero_based":3470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2U Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of the sl-U2U-RelayUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-DestinationIdentity value included in the sl-U2U-RelayUE-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the configuration associated with the L2 U2U Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":3474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.16.2L2 U2U Relay UE Addition/Modification","paragraph_zero_based":3475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2U Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if no SRAP entity has been established:","paragraph_zero_based":3477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66];","paragraph_zero_based":3478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each L2 U2U Relay UE indicated in sl-L2IdentityRelay value included in the sl-U2U-RelayUE-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (L2 U2U Relay UE Addition):","paragraph_zero_based":3479}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eb9ffda099fdaa5c67c4209803dc9438e78e3df6e58e1bcbbe2837e51a04e9c6","666faa088b4462f68654340d36cc1b58eeab5ff86339a6292c3925730cfeef9f","2a9a4763ff2c3a588756d528469f9f496323e0fa283480d6865c57f1167ba7d3","03c12e46490765f3a28c1eeb1f56f03bcda21b6f57522c049c0fc712b170754f","3b33473de5a0d07d3aad9ee9abb158ad8ca2d538a2334bd150635e0bb714aafa","0711383648af5f382f55cdb778ba59eeb35e0d1333799162064028d4d4b4e91d","ec2c3bc66deb2c1726715c1817366727b41ffbe3190e6365d1af454edbee838d","ca94e7adc61d9bfda1873ef7b5f3744e38e8343b3247f06e48c6dc02463f3f71","2aeb7104408dda584f3778c2029a09f5d280f28539b1aa8f374c7f8f5f015016","a6c27b2866914755c01433d76f7379042af5319f992e927294ea0cf4753942da","20d9c4e4f1c07c7586f8d7504d2baaffeb11a3f68539d248dd4a7a3ded47060d","e2efae23b365fc93a579614b4a8a97d93acf99d296af82cf89c1b731e3cc27ef","dbda705724581443e715d6c5802342dcb655e5ae9a101e2df58acc275fbe0bc8","945ba6ef05cb93477a853f3da52c90bbe7586d45c4669dab5f75183cd56ac3b3","7e81a5bb61303f8caae1706f78b34258c371a0ae95ca056ab0cea558b556eb4c","17c6d316c52c40017b33df20513449d0912febb776c96502fa9461034bd7a007","feb179b861e9d1286e73ab06f71d7e5d6d96313450b2ab690e8e96ada13c7577","fdf36e2717898df50ad9c56c853e97cbe37cb120534695c784ba3e5b47421b2f","bf8a071a51e30f9dde6848c8bce19694e9d4a3f840495fe0175f78f28313f9ea","71aba3a0e4f53d66461f81112b9f43ef1c22b442dab8d7ff51e8517820d83c8b","e1b1ed2b8cbc3ce113c95578bcaf9f59dee6a8880bf975b265d8281b23d319a9","777aba943f4a38f67f05620b6f494eef6b192a87199306b9244ebf22362a631e","c6612702a24075ae5ab74a24eaef2a3c63efa998857435a987fe25a1304f2f93","08965597180b043d9873d71f06bcd2de60f00baba337c60b6c475634312e36db"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3456,3479],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p3456"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for target L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-TargetUE-Identity in accordance with one entry of the SL-PeerRemoteUE-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the parameters to SRAP entity in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U;","paragraph_zero_based":3481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each L2 U2U Relay UE indicated in sl-L2IdentityRelay value included in the sl-U2U-RelayUE-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (L2 U2U Relay UE modification):","paragraph_zero_based":3482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-DestinationIdentity value included in the sl-TargetRemoteUE-ToReleaseList (target L2 U2U Remote UE Release):","paragraph_zero_based":3483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the configuration associated with the peer target L2 U2U Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":3484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the target L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-TargetUE-Identity included in the sl-TargetRemoteUE-ToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (target L2 U2U Remote UE Addition):","paragraph_zero_based":3485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the parameters to SRAP entity in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U;","paragraph_zero_based":3486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the target L2 U2U Remote UE indicated in sl-TargetUE-Identity included in the sl-TargetRemoteUE-ToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (target L2 U2U Remote UE modification):","paragraph_zero_based":3487},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>modify the configuration in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U;","paragraph_zero_based":3488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17MP configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.1Introduction","paragraph_zero_based":3490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of MP, a MP remote UE is configured with one direct path (i.e. MCG) and one indirect path. The MP remote UE connects to network on the direct path using NR Uu, and connects to network on the indirect path via a MP relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":3491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"On indirect path, for the hop between the MP remote UE and the MP relay UE, when the MP remote UE connects to a L2 U2N Relay UE, i.e. the MP remote UE is acting as a L2 U2N Remote UE, the network provides the configuration of SL indirect path to the MP remote UE and the L2 U2N Relay UE as specified in 5.3.5.17.2; when the MP remote UE connects to a N3C relay UE using non-3GPP connection, the network provides the configuration of N3C indirect path to the MP remote UE and the N3C relay UE as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.","paragraph_zero_based":3492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.2Configuration of SL indirect path","paragraph_zero_based":3493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.2.1General","paragraph_zero_based":3494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For SL indirect path:","paragraph_zero_based":3495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the L2 U2N Remote UE is provided with sidelink dedicated configuration as specified in 5.3.5.14, L2 U2N Remote UE configuration as specified in 5.3.5.16, and SL indirect path specific configuration as specified in 5.3.5.17.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the L2 U2N Relay UE is provided with sidelink dedicated configuration as specified in 5.3.5.14, L2 U2N Relay UE configuration as specified in 5.3.5.15, as well as Uu Relay RLC channel configuration as specified in 5.3.5.5.12 and 5.3.5.5.13.","paragraph_zero_based":3497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.2.2SL indirect path specific configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-IndirectPathAddChange is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-IndirectPathMaintain is not included in reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":3501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the UE indicated by the sl-IndirectPathRelayUE-Identity to be the (target) L2 U2N Relay UE and indicate to upper layer to trigger the PC5 unicast link establishment with the L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":3502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T421 for the corresponding L2 U2N Relay UE with the timer value set to T421;","paragraph_zero_based":3503}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["afbd9b30e88cb9e2d654b26e9cccc2535ae41b1224deab5353aa84c244d1d569","ee4649d15e99d7cdf98c37710505466706fb64a52a3f856ac26c77e0de99c7ea","1d71f2a4be1156cd445b6a6348d59f0d1fcfbc7b8b4de7ac34148147520c015f","4629d9fc84acb3a736e1e0ebcdb86e4c51121583decaf370ae96ea6b5c215b94","2baa1d914f9a5742e37a79e4860e8af83f8e7986252386aa6b56ee425c04a328","084d612f1bac924b6d533c33978c3ce2cfdf468c4ab69bf19c6fc97084b51f43","eb33c18ffcb261b75d454fa9189a3260d31e63da5591f7c8f136f977175a037f","04b00452f0b22eb89945f2a2c09db4a5b602c82685d1389a40bc281bde8bcf77","5be1954fe44f5367436ab23f6c8a719a871dd26d29ce89fdd638ec07e13e04ef","0f40a6ec8fe24295a2944fc5bb97cf6dd0a88af8cbae0144aa57274cfa04eb31","c18a1928893bc6962b25d6b6002acc466223670199f3e68c21b446f88944c0a7","345c42d4c3b5e6b62655b9cab4c4eca49e721376223a17a29abbb579b7f79d59","68b6ad3837c15a2b27cb0f66da267b9cb318f25abccbbc56379bac4eace3f9de","4efaee8f0347f1846d0044c45d8f27714041811ba73f00d91caee2b39ef1ba1c","e558b1d7da76fe30a7147fad9036e6f4cded843901b53fa2dd43c869d7c35f12","27b8db660e04dd4e76b1e11dece6ac1cbe4aa584ae330acae3116672c3c5b984","9dbdeef01c8d10f8cfd91c98847019a1c3a7defdf78ca49edc31bd184b9fd973","32bad2f5b2d30068a3394411b1ad42dc4952d7824216cdf4dfbde996112e5049","c92cb6a5c784cff0029ada06a532c0dd90fffcfd8077e7f8d0fe98a96672ac85","181de63e8052b09c3b30266e5da17897d7392fec89ad1e7de6afa494fee2fa2e","e106ad357e721a3acb1ee991bca6a72f208ca944adfe3c6f0ecbbc6bfe54bac5","d330884f774b67acfecc0fd07ce1d4c833ea1f1fb88e3091af34c952d49f7fe6","1daa69e82bdf291608463662fe31280aa3972621b9c032443c68fc10ae30380c","19456e475b7af823800674a4beef52f73037e21c1b3e911adaa49e2f5d66ef35"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3480,3503],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p3480"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate to upper layer (to trigger the PC5 unicast link release) with the source L2 U2N Relay UE in case of SL indirect path change (i.e. a new L2 U2N Relay UE is indicated via sl-IndirectPathRelayUE-Identity);","paragraph_zero_based":3504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (i.e. the sl-IndirectPathMaintain is included in reconfigurationWithSync):","paragraph_zero_based":3505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the source L2 U2N Relay UE to be the L2 U2N Relay UE on indirect path in MP operation;","paragraph_zero_based":3506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if sl-IndirectPathAddChange is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the SL indirect path is released and release the corresponding configurations;","paragraph_zero_based":3508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to upper layer (to trigger the PC5 unicast link release) with the L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":3509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The MP direct path addition is realized by indirect-to-direct path switch procedure (i.e. ReconfigurationWithSync included in RRCReconfiguration message), where sl-IndirectPathAddChange is set to setup in RRCReconfiguration message.","paragraph_zero_based":3510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.2.3T421 expiry (Indirect path addition/change failure)","paragraph_zero_based":3511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> if T421 expires; or","paragraph_zero_based":3513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> if the (target) L2 U2N Relay UE (i.e., the UE indicated by sl-IndirectPathRelayUE-Identity in the received sl-IndirectPathAddChange) changes its serving cell to a different cell from the target cell (i.e. the cell indicated by sl-IndirectPathCellIdentity in the received sl-IndirectPathAddChange) during path addition or change:","paragraph_zero_based":3514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if MCG transmission is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":3515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the indirect path failure information procedure as specified in clause 5.7.3c to report SL indirect path addition/change failure;","paragraph_zero_based":3516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in clause 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":3518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3Configuration of N3C indirect path","paragraph_zero_based":3519},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3.1General","paragraph_zero_based":3520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For N3C indirect path,","paragraph_zero_based":3521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the N3C remote UE is provided with N3C indirect path configuration including relay UE identification as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the N3C relay UE is provided with N3C indirect path configuration including bearer mapping configurations as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.4, as well as Uu Relay RLC channel configuration as specified in 5.3.5.5.12 and 5.3.5.5.13.","paragraph_zero_based":3523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE: The data transmission/reception between the N3C remote UE and the N3C relay UE via the non-3GPP connection is outside the scope of 3GPP.","paragraph_zero_based":3524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3.2N3C remote UE configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The N3C remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if n3c-IndirectPathAddChange is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3527}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["03c43c6a5a9a4db32f9fd81ff5e973bec474ea7efc9ef73bac20d7b224d8bdac","c662a462492534b1368e433c26ca288fcc7653560e510860a915a1a1dd7bc01c","b1034b48c3876dda8af6ba6151640f595f470d7e4bec75d42ca38f621ab86780","750d691de5ed7a810ebfb9abaed2144f13121813d6f54da6640d292863136792","5666b1666a36420bff44c0f3253de618f2d701e11fedc9bdaf1e54c4059856d0","1c825acc89df70ba873cc349f211410477affad8d9cdd5332ae13e06be72c094","bbca4d65d9e6ba72787bbb734121de186b91547d606dde10a2c757384248791f","0593bb87e726ccc53becbc34af80556cf0175cf2dc07ee17951cda61414119e3","a9cea31d07bbea5d0fb9c318c5f84e8ea7b73a2c7b99d769d456b43816b7299d","80e09ef0ae405bccf1828d6c864dad8cb129328b9c125706a43ac742c891f9f6","de2dfd74870b3ccb31e4e68408038a88d2da25236e9849861ee49e462bd99852","202de12015e989993fc665ed83bd911227af2bc8537e7f479c19156eca117f43","4fb34dc90534bcdb4da697b8001a0124ec70499e3d1d28c24b34893cf1b13578","b3dc14ec33a5b0d5e7c0e393258fb9ff2c4d17bc645a723c63c8761714825b05","396dd690d37a0c2a1435aa8eea51194ecb2b7bc68588907fa24596b12e4817a6","0a775a7deb523e1e0ae4fd47f0371fbe14d9b2e483de9038706fa0e199700db9","ab2e524c251113f8ee92989d6f3ff26395a54fce47f578c7907f74c09116b937","aec5783f07815c66f277d4d806853c0d547249d7b28c53f04a34b799a36208c4","c60d703de83980e9a0e892841a97be4991b1577f21711a153857f88f300226c9","4cef514a1629f79cea761aa4011b070239575db39509eb58595ffbc1f639ccf5","9b0ca9a37622a5a5b69acc2d8626c6a5b6a337e1bde3cd7d4e571ef93e794d1b","e671bb85ca2ac041bac1f2af5667687faed627ab07bf35dd99ed5546e48d0427","b9481a03e01cfe9f83350ef7aa13decd4c5335b8dc4e64d8a3a28ccf3917b1c8","8241ddc822f8462400638e851752dde2ebdf63bea40d33df70df1d8cd7e85c6d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3504,3527],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p3504"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the non-3GPP connection with the relay UE indicated by the n3c-RelayIdentification to be used for the N3C indirect path;","paragraph_zero_based":3528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the source non-3GPP connection is not to be used in case of N3C indirect path change (i.e. a new relay UE is indicated by the n3c-RelayIdentification);","paragraph_zero_based":3529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if n3c-IndirectPathAddChange is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the indirect path is not to be used and release the corresponding configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":3531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3.2aN3C Indirect path addition/change failure","paragraph_zero_based":3533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The N3C remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> if N3C Indirect path addition/change failure is detected:","paragraph_zero_based":3535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if MCG transmission is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":3536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the indirect path failure information procedure as specified in clause 5.7.3c to report N3C indirect path addition/change failure;","paragraph_zero_based":3537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in clause 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":3539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE: How to detect N3C Indirect path addition/change failure is up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":3540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3.3N3C relay UE configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The N3C relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if n3c-MappingToReleaseList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":3544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform N3C bearer mapping release as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.4.1;","paragraph_zero_based":3545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if n3c-MappingToAddModList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":3546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform N3C bearer mapping addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.4.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the indirect path with the remote UE is released and release the corresponding configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":3549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3.4Bearer mapping management on N3C indirect path","paragraph_zero_based":3550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3.4.1Bearer mapping release","paragraph_zero_based":3551}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["690b3b10753a3a9970d3f520fefa8cef619810ad174a8c481c3bd582f9bc2c53","8dfb1ae77fbf5b321399c5234643ce0c6de6d398ee1629d7eb62c97753a153d9","782369125ac26ecbc421b6472be779f23cc72f9a3ae839d5ac0daa5710c309c3","7895810b40ef173fc3dad457f44f85d05833fac738eb59a8cdd1b7cf664418c5","b3942c4559088e4469ad02445a29b1dd514f6f10e661fb5ce8b4d64ef649d5fa","292c5d297f2bef46f1747f6758569bbf5e2ea7187d8d5ad8e8a433072f45293f","04791a9cff3f6cfaa375f5f17025dab73fa7cb0a2c5bfa48c46278a45c60c647","c861e843cd4e97445bdd048958c4f2c3ecb3ebb40c70bd50d59d85e2c4dff41d","824455cd3f8b0a215379e5b7ec9b25e01ee171711e3d00669e8500bdf7b8c0f8","9807beb98a86e8689f3bab3529b83af258fcdbe1e57e499b594786068468057b","4b62319e2f628371b28f24d5ebb9b51f3fa7f038957301668d0bf89dd9739bdf","42cfd878d8eb05144f6d36ab7874055d16cfb62096d13a8773397f0258dfb80e","212205dc66dd2885cb6bd49478c8aa103468fd72159655d7ce9c2c8353fe6b98","a780481c0aac1f20a46c97adf8305e9e285e3ff1046960a63d0328b5e27c8cac","e644dd7a6227727d23c98716c99e5d94659d6363ba5a01fb9c7acaee8c2913fe","173b71e66ca10dca0da4b05f32a7e1c0d10688730fb2f62cf26eefe4f59e6754","b9a8ade64455838d5330afaac0465651559ec74d5965d8d2bb1a140c0f8d9ea5","11bd81a484239bf940e2ca3b80fc28f6e9d5178c5d123354795fe9a47d9a5b72","c43a27104516013beff19b61d0128ffb045ef1ddadb68fb39d2b5041bb416dee","9815f565abbbe99563aa4de6f92359b52baaf1dd00dd2a4874f79b317c1669df","4c5786977b229652ed2332627b04eafd20d24477ebd7668b58bef3f95d9a49bc","da4ef09d345dde2703199a1b38627954d3307108ee8ca55d97a298db0572f832","4e4b9d9a83dd58ad036889444d6f9a3a744df7f2a9f2689bf481a640cdacd7f7","6daadc83f4f19ea08b2bea15c7731ef8d18fb3125727ace00d2f0f0dcc5f31c7"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3528,3551],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p3528"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":3553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for all configured SL-RemoteUE-RB-Identity value:","paragraph_zero_based":3554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release n3c-RLC-ChannelUu and n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":3555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the release is triggered by reception of the n3c-MappingToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-RemoteUE-RB-Identity value included in n3c-MappingToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the corresponding n3c-RLC-ChannelUu and n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":3558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.17.3.4.2Bearer mapping addition and modification","paragraph_zero_based":3559},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity value included in the n3c-MappingToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>associate the remote UE's RB indicated in n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity to the Uu Relay RLC channel indicated in n3c-RLC-ChannelUu;","paragraph_zero_based":3562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for the n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity value included in the n3c-MappingToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>update the associated Uu Relay RLC channel to the one indicated in n3c-RLC-ChannelUu.","paragraph_zero_based":3564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18LTM configuration and execution","paragraph_zero_based":3566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.1LTM configuration","paragraph_zero_based":3567},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network configures the UE with one or more LTM candidate configurations within the LTM-Config IE.","paragraph_zero_based":3568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In NR-DC, the UE may receive two independent ltm-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":3569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-an ltm-Config associated with the MCG that is included within an RRCReconfiguration message received via SRB1; and","paragraph_zero_based":3570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-an ltm-Config associated with the SCG that is included within an RRCReconfiguration message either received via SRB3, or, alternatively, embedded in an RRCReconfiguration message received via SRB1.","paragraph_zero_based":3571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case the UE receives two independent ltm-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":3572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE maintains two independent ltm-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE maintains two independent VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID, one associated with each ltm-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE maintains two independent VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID, one associated with each ltm-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3575}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b8ab1af5ac740e9a4bcabc30cddb3d111cb6913de3da54e39ddc1f62f416e65a","380a7b6299319497f130bc9dbce023c124cb38d4f57b63d14d95110d3fed8e5a","4f7c6d4e667294832a86eec4a50397f821622b4d539907f73790fa4c4bb162c4","70aeec0df9802cca21f5fd267f75d204156089927d9ccde5a846db2160f3cf91","49622bf84caabc3ec483ca9cd815a6c21324401f845fda41b5d1105757b0d1dc","60afe6c08654c58888aa59ef149742b7be2c462b281bcf1037708e42a5011513","575f6dfdee7d455e441144824a92f7c08f9ef54383a4a412a758e4157f27786e","1a72375d8645cf2092639a162c571f76a9017d7116acdbf3086e54fb6cfd8dda","f1f443964c06a284e2f51af69a5052de0a8b6c3211529ede26966fcb3de42ab5","8122efbeb6caa7050f7b5391bc9d5465c1f120ebf27eec11e58e9cf25250ad7a","64b8542b0e8aa6d223cb0b9397f13ff277a4a2a1876831e98803b5efac7dcac4","5ae605bcc49c628ec6517d0f52c04df4497fa1ae5d62d7f5eecb9ec86c957e45","230336b4c70b4b58ece294cb4024426203245468f2c92f8350c1bb576b02f6b7","950b648ac984d928e6ac73924dc922cf37e34f853d96143cdcb5af5d18aad078","d981c261196988f475ef2b630b19e6747e18f2767882bc1c45ad965b2e90b8da","428a0489f10f337eaf1ef4d6a04926c5b9f74d4b1070affba5ae626f5fc4e4cb","d341a1bb7ea7e46c7c4454dc3d90f6dc51aa410bfc9107e46ce6ee8f26890bdd","3b24b423ad579d7ea3f322c8025005546b6284c8ad9970e09190ac7f5d8f969f","c178948bd42fbc8909e78030e41c8d11a33cd91f4b8f2232b629d1d89d46ba9b","c8023d3f5975c15c7db2d2f57d4c6bd9dba2198fbc81211aa49b5aab60ae0243","543edfe99ee6d3394f23083c39ee890fc2a5d6c324d096ebbfef37a430b83570","cf561c2a0607f2fedcb48a0fcdb5203c8f687f38f6a15e61b92c7dbcc368e170","cf883b81fc26da8dfaac9a2cbd7302cd2f406f652d48be540f3e1edafab1ab28","57973fc4467342a11c8e1b433603c0446f69d25d652ee4c85b132fa4e0300620"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3552,3575],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p3552"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE independently performs all the procedures in clause 5.3.5.18 for each ltm-Config and the associated VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID and VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID unless explicitly stated otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":3576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall perform the following actions based on the received LTM-Config IE:","paragraph_zero_based":3577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received LTM-Config includes ltm-ServingCellNoResetID:","paragraph_zero_based":3578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID includes an ltm-ServingCellNoResetID:","paragraph_zero_based":3579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the ltm-ServingCellNoResetID value within VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID with the received ltm-ServingCellNoResetID;","paragraph_zero_based":3580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the received ltm-ServingCellNoResetID in VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID;","paragraph_zero_based":3582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received LTM-Config includes ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID:","paragraph_zero_based":3583},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID includes an ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID:","paragraph_zero_based":3584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID value within VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID with the received ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID;","paragraph_zero_based":3585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the received ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID in VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID;","paragraph_zero_based":3587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received LTM-Config includes the ltm-CandidateToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":3588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the LTM candidate configuration release as specified in 5.3.5.18.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received LTM-Config includes the ltm-CandidateToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the LTM candidate configuration addition or modification as specified in 5.3.5.18.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3591},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>reconfigure the UE according to all other fields of the received LTM-Config IE.","paragraph_zero_based":3592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.2LTM candidate configuration release","paragraph_zero_based":3593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each ltm-CandidateId value included in the ltm-CandidateToReleaseList that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the corresponding LTM-Candidate.","paragraph_zero_based":3596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.3LTM candidate configuration addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":3597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each ltm-CandidateId value in the ltm-CandidateToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":3599}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["93959bff5a3bd7b9371419929ee140361a2731033c1cf1116c0bcbadc9eef312","8d7a30cfe386aed78cd10a197ac53eddbe02d89c3f2c98b51b9ee16da7b05cf9","d4e584c57b9c3c826c2b79f3e503330fc36ddfaaba8978c2231cbe1db22aa945","d62bf6d3fe2cdbc4ae5a147fa2cbf884c7a25978c3d0d7f4c3434bb553d5d912","95cc4f82eaecc113c9e5c9dc7e8979741bfe3a04428cb5ff81eaae59b38cd0d6","f56a90c39abadbb00403e47b9c95e43763b76ceeae9135620fa9b668ef97b1b6","79389170a71f6c07790a196c2d46d0a45fd51b52a933f67646aa74c156187dae","2780d70defb14f9c8a01406557d1bfbe0e4fdb5429e357595c952b260522103d","9e304fc46a9f53a0ada31f0291942f343d5c88dd200b3617d2284e18fa4d4999","9c97009fa77c56820cfa33880a91efab4bf0298363da8b747de49c6a006bc0b0","6a0776a3cdd725e59b706a114772766447c1f38e3631f068cdf1d8267b6cc0cb","12b7c893a344703a521bc99b503849083132526748a7c83f4fc3119fdc11ee19","57fa0fb7c907f1415746a217e216ab0a982d0e51de45edaf0d7ed4d3e6f6c6d9","7dfb33c3460008516d0526a71b5cd3d6e2be6216306f34f6fa38440eb061503f","b1de9ff4eb00955a630b3113421881132782024bf25d5668768eaafd9acbfb9d","3a0f90b0d913191c412e2ee5629fafff06873d0247be4daf5baf5cdfd7b980c6","47192d073fee44eb2acacbdfe883aaa051fbd780d689823c6c5fe257e7c70183","bcf6b976030b895d29a523395eed14c780c4ec04a041bd50802819edee8a5a13","50b2bc62c486b3e45147d1f9aee2d4db20d189d0d1ac809b23e463980d1d3212","c9724f753770b2da0e2b38adabe249cd1b6cd22fdde7a137f21bd8c56481a49d","f4630bd1d44caa48f023a4801d63bccd81c1fb21c1ee017ee057c7903f2b51be","cefaeafd727cbe96873e51e866cbd003c1217ed971509ee65d1279568ee7cdf9","162dbd8916e397defb3cec700c795c425885403d6253b5a2312242dd200b23c4","ca6e9ccec4521349e35e4eb22656957960b56fa7984d7d972a832fc42f848025"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3576,3599],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p3576"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current UE configuration contains an LTM-Candidate with the ltm-CandidateId value:","paragraph_zero_based":3600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the corresponding LTM-Candidate in accordance with the received LTM-Candidate;","paragraph_zero_based":3601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>add the received LTM-Candidate;","paragraph_zero_based":3603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the LTM-Candidate with the received ltm-CandidateId value includes ltm-UE-MeasuredTA-ID:","paragraph_zero_based":3604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the value of ltm-UE-MeasuredTA-ID is equal to the value of ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID within VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID:","paragraph_zero_based":3605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>inform lower layers that the UE is configured with UE-based TA measurements for this LTM-Candidate;","paragraph_zero_based":3606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3607},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>inform lower layers that the UE is not configured with UE-based TA measurements for this LTM-Candidate.","paragraph_zero_based":3608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.4Void","paragraph_zero_based":3609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.5Void","paragraph_zero_based":3610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.6LTM cell switch execution","paragraph_zero_based":3611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon the indication by lower layers that an LTM cell switch procedure is triggered, or upon performing LTM cell switch following cell selection performed while timer T311 was running, as specified in 5.3.7.3, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each SRB/DRB in the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the LTM cell switch is triggered on the MCG and for the SRB/DRB using the master key; or","paragraph_zero_based":3614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the LTM cell switch is triggered on the SCG and for the SRB/DRB using the secondary key:","paragraph_zero_based":3615},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>keep the associated RLC, PCDP and SDAP entities, their state variables, buffers and timers;","paragraph_zero_based":3616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release all fields related to the SRB/DRB configuration except for srb-Identity and drb-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":3617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if this procedure has been triggered following cell selection performed while timer T311 was running (due to reconfiguration with sync failure), as specified in clause 5.3.7.3:","paragraph_zero_based":3618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>continue using PDCP entity for SRB1 (if configured) with state variables continuation as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":3619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release/clear all current dedicated radio configuration associated with the cell group for which the LTM cell switch procedure is triggered except for the following:","paragraph_zero_based":3620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the logicalChannelIdentity and logicalChannelIdentityExt of RLC bearers configured in RLC-BearerConfig and the associated RLC entities, their state variables, buffers, and timers;","paragraph_zero_based":3621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE variables VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID and VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID;","paragraph_zero_based":3622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the ltm-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3623}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["32b296b4b4c3ebc3d3630f2dd7d89fe992c9f05cb637cc0da51ebe6bf17a954a","d9409b95c8fb85e3895eb8256a04ecd57debc7c9495cbb7fae90e3f57f1364b2","ca3812369830c692c9a105f9f4f521d264daa004f20ff098034ea45fcaaaf352","c405a5c11f5e21eba508830317eda54e6f144444392c9ff32f18449959d208ab","e2e0d35af4f6c59a0ae3f9ce1f887b3cfee97bb96acae9e23c0198a5aba4265d","5d3710319eb19413337a38ddc3e437b2177708af9c25f46ecd47a990dfd22e2d","7fb1a54a4ec4dfb577acb1581c3a3fdfe7ccb6b335ceed83535326dc408652c8","ed8f6bffb2f700ecf32eb633b1e110c2db9c1d1d7bdd97eac903144552346c7c","7ce02f6e5743a6e37af16eb0583518b4dd85d3ab70d0b7025f5b11aca5c5d595","d77090d74dcbaf264a1498899ea38e2a4c5edc2e3e03cfb1ea0ee4d12ad1a04a","606541c2b23534a0581a53e438849f3bf55dce1e33050f50f67ed9bfee1e96b7","741d5a382ecdbbe91403474a96c80c5c0f40032c2e1fa566beb5e54aa84c7f9a","53a76d58a203b836c0a1ad020dade05f31d24a29b83694e73df2108b445d9966","c1e9d1d83eade2514a05d18e43e734d5e5556ae1ce8804099c57d62133fb22ed","531d35a080f39a1a70148fdb6d3c84efe353a8d977c1dfc7fee6dd5a150e5961","b562ed457689ebaea8c3e493d78c89c371f5ecdac22138ebc171dc03ea701ca2","63dec73305a0507b871cb51c26f957ea5154a875c14039a5ace29af62479e980","38262f44a88f84c20263600bd36448761ae4daf06370f608ce7894983430ccad","9a038e3a802ad43ed2d6d7a305d3f1182cb2655e8de0daf56319d32fea8f5727","a1a9b8502c9e49d1dbde73a46188ead344586c2810c5926c5901239cfc6e88c4","a9992fe48b3fc331d7f765e861a370c6b823b101443710fe3c54933d344e685f","1400b5bcfa23cc4d9fd74d5ebfcf3762eef01e97330e6b0bcddfcb9ac49d5a5e","cf0ce02faae4e2ecf3d51d029408bb906a86f4ab830c1fb3e7716f01b9bd2346","f44eeac965aa7b6c56fe02e92303943595dac49d9890dea89d2c38f4efd39b58"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3600,3623],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p3600"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the LTM cell switch is triggered on the MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":3624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the MCG C-RNTI;","paragraph_zero_based":3625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the AS security configurations associated with the master key;","paragraph_zero_based":3626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else, if the LTM cell switch is triggered on the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":3627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the AS security configurations associated with the secondary key;","paragraph_zero_based":3628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release/clear all current common radio configuration associated with the cell group for which the LTM cell switch procedure is triggered;","paragraph_zero_based":3629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>use the default values specified in 9.2.3 for timers T310, T311 and constants N310, N311 associate to cell group for which the LTM cell switch procedure is triggered;","paragraph_zero_based":3630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply the default MAC Cell Group configuration as specified in 9.2.2 for the cell group for which the LTM cell switch procedure is triggered;","paragraph_zero_based":3631},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each srb-Identity in the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the default SRB configuration defined in 9.2.1 for the corresponding SRB;","paragraph_zero_based":3633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the value of field ltm-NoResetID contained within the LTM-Candidate IE in ltm-Config indicated by lower layers or for the selected cell in accordance with 5.3.7.3 is not equal to the value of ltm-ServingCellNoResetID within VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID:","paragraph_zero_based":3634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each logicalChannelId and logicalChannelIdExt that is part of the current UE configuration for the cell group for which the LTM cell switch procedure is triggered:","paragraph_zero_based":3635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if servedRadioBearer is set to drb-Identity:","paragraph_zero_based":3636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>after the end of this procedure, re-establish the corresponding RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], after applying the LTM configuration in ltm-CandidateConfig within the LTM-Candidate IE in ltm-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each drb-Identity value that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":3638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if this DRB is an AM DRB:","paragraph_zero_based":3639},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>after the end of this procedure, trigger the PDCP entity of this DRB to perform data recovery as specified in TS 38.323 [5], after applying the LTM configuration in ltm-CandidateConfig within LTM-Candidate IE in ltm-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>replace the value of ltm-ServingCellNoResetID in VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID with the value of ltm-NoResetID in the LTM-Candidate in ltm-Config indicated by lower layers or for the selected cell in accordance with 5.3.7.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> if the LTM-Candidate IE in ltm-Config indicated by lower layers or for the selected cell in accordance with 5.3.7.3 contains the field ltm-UE-MeasuredTA-ID:","paragraph_zero_based":3642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the value of ltm-UE-MeasuredTA-ID is not equal to the value of ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID within VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID:","paragraph_zero_based":3643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the value of ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID in VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID with the value received within ltm-UE-MeasuredTA-ID;","paragraph_zero_based":3644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each LTM-Candidate IE in ltm-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":3645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the value of ltm-UE-MeasuredTA-ID within LTM-Candidate IE is equal to the value of ltm-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID within VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID:","paragraph_zero_based":3646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>inform lower layers that UE is configured with UE-based TA measurements for the LTM-Candidate;","paragraph_zero_based":3647}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4f903d74d74828865f8f2db7060b67e9d846a7e8ebe132bbb0cd8654b527b5f5","f24d86dbbc6ac1d4636b12615bbb86b97858f2ee64523b02549ff0e303d3f6d8","9cee269ff469e907f166057bc13c3e09e64a8396cccea844bb96fd0470fc9368","a37f31f8dc5697af685675f9cc7912f50ca2d65e5991c220a9d51c1bfdf9fad0","5a08e5ec726a772473b19f28d3a166bd5cc6f3b793b76574006acd0794127331","eedb59e12d02ac47a07de80de95fe1db71cb7c2f614a5a010b2bdbf6bfa67308","a2e2cf605cbf77263afafe00b556f6294e73b448b91b08c745feac518d0aadb8","a2f967de67aea4e761e872f11c46307f9d3722ed8b3c003722aca5f63882fed5","52ba33b7e41a631cbd629205ac4b762660254ea402591ff97c8828e56203fa78","1dfb4362cda8c8567afb335e16ae3e351ad85ee2bb42b4939cf5a84427ff5a03","28901dbfedf39574bebf8fd0ca0ec63dd4047ec6f18cc7da9b8fe1b5c7b47013","ca53e1630b3d26d41db7433aac053a24fa2382993fcc5aa7086aa1c0174ef510","5e35efd7f8205515068dcf4db3fc1a79ed71598808872402ba312c426dec9edc","e763fb0ed0ea11a05fb56b11772a19a30b3a51ceaee3f9583027eaa7f2cab7cf","8d8f8650afc9d9bac06e9d15f7a9b0b19917a09527c9ca29b11cc4603c6e3f4d","7c247527c64a338e82cfbd8e35dd7902b33d7da7c18f4f36b24f48192fa0f783","a9f159671bba22975c553b53ef8f163eb2402a6c38c769f61e392accd6ff6f4c","5f5e1b9e30a142c8373cea463dc3d36b3f84d7cf0aca2dccc3c4cfe1c9589f0b","fecb95ba2021ef9953f6f1b1dcda34ad2c0d48ac499c8d6a12993a156063130e","ff4ab47898e228ae8c2e934efd3729ccedb081e5893c93e3611073f2a483b65e","6bc713254d1d059f048f6463d121bf3659d55ce0ab0671b481724da759b687f0","61566c56780bd2e469e59b182eac1750318325e1b8f5b38af6e669bee7cad9bd","947201133a847f4cd39080862dc16390a4ebcc2f8ef6c28fd50d5d9aeb29d400","e2e9c46a5ce1f9f867a54751319c19e0c1cdd513f474158df55656fda02fdf0e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3624,3647],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p3624"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>inform lower layers that UE is not configured with UE-based TA measurements for the LTM-Candidate.","paragraph_zero_based":3649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if ltm-ConfigComplete is not included within the LTM-Candidate IE in ltm-Config indicated by lower layers or for the selected cell in accordance with 5.3.7.3:","paragraph_zero_based":3650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider ltm-ReferenceConfiguration in ltm-Config, associated with the cell group for which the LTM cell switch procedure is triggered, to be the current UE configuration for the fields and configurations to be released by the actions above in this procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":3651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if measConfig is included within ltm-ReferenceConfiguration in ltm-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the measurement configuration procedure as specified in clause 5.5.2 by considering the measConfig within ltm-ReferenceConfiguration in ltm-Config as the received measConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:When the UE considers the reference configuration to be the current UE configuration, the UE should store fields and configurations that are part of the reference configuration but should not execute any actions or procedures triggered by the reception of an RRCReconfiguration message which are described in clause 5.3.5.3, unless specified otherwise in this section.","paragraph_zero_based":3654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the LTM cell switch is triggered by an indication from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":3655},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the RRCReconfiguration message in ltm-CandidateConfig within LTM-Candidate IE in ltm-Config identified by the LTM candidate configuration identity received from lower layers according to clause 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (LTM cell switch triggered upon cell selection performed while timer T311 was running):","paragraph_zero_based":3657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the RRCReconfiguration message in ltm-CandidateConfig within LTM-Candidate IE in ltm-Config related to the LTM candidate configuration identity for the selected cell (i.e., in accordance with 5.3.7.3) according to clause 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the radio bearer(s) and the logical channel(s) that were part of the UE configuration before of this LTM cell switch procedure but not part of the LTM candidate configuration either indicated by lower layers or for the selected cell in accordance with 5.3.7.3, or the LTM reference configuration (in case the LTM candidate configuration does not include ltm-ConfigComplete).","paragraph_zero_based":3659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:When ltm-ConfigComplete is not included for an LTM candidate configuration, before an LTM cell switch is triggered a UE implementation may generate and store an RRCReconfigurationmessage by applying the received LTM candidate configuration on top of the LTM reference configuration, and the stored RRCReconfiguration message is applied when the LTM cell switch is triggered.","paragraph_zero_based":3660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.18.7LTM configuration release","paragraph_zero_based":3661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the cell group for which the LTM configuration release procedure is triggered, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>remove the entry within VarLTM-ServingCellNoResetID;","paragraph_zero_based":3663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>remove the entry within VarLTM-ServingCellUE-MeasuredTA-ID;","paragraph_zero_based":3664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release ltm-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":3665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.19T348 expiry","paragraph_zero_based":3666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE can apply the temporary UE capability restriction in accordance with the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-CapRestriction, as specified in 5.7.4.3.","paragraph_zero_based":3667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.6Counter check","paragraph_zero_based":3668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.6.1General","paragraph_zero_based":3669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.6.1-1: Counter check procedure","paragraph_zero_based":3671}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9b3147740a27db20df0a4d7f0f43749d938918791f8459b3f99715ebd1e73a46","07d31e5cef42b120df5339ad5e2dd7a5c3f03502fa922c92a5c385f8e00936e8","1efc1750aeab58b3bf01353b823afa909c21bba601fa3a98b75e7efbcec250e8","7050c12549727c815de67bba744289af203235fc363840d7791ef491432a6bf8","c11b58125766874e293f09db6074474ae90df24030a7fee98387b4f4382b512a","6d74c4868a90f00eb938fb6a3771831a3a52c415fd006562a7df0371404f460c","137c0910a1da6fd664acbe5f56c741bd9b58406fe8eaa1a6b8642c3e2eb983a8","9108aa370116b02cc94a83bcf17faa390078361ac406e8c50b7f5b6d3108527b","ea59e8e069fdd4fa6efc2dbe2ddb1a515a3ce82e79b670bc8d2471b1a036cc4f","fe6e32c22b276fb313352736f75e6a4721ac44303e7dd6a7342b63d33d34c6f3","9523393bcff51b00cb0e5f6b97bda18186d72fe26300cf884a9917aa21aeaa79","a47284eb0117ecf8199966c4912c4cee9ea9a45fd851be1637cbb4dacde0869f","f0882d7a9d1adb4526917d0b88c0f5e23542ddddacd68338adfceb4c929e0e43","086f347f980b3c7ef0c15f8c572567efe6ec441e0551b9452fca4707504f610b","f94af86d8684b0c07f93edc38090d181128a21a2d285cc9ac7ba9d7f9da88525","b50611a53ac1b3fe2fbd291bc414a3a0b0af235e9ddb62a91f8cb85144604227","4cb8cac58875dd90d485789fa436e724339577d43337b3f5cff2756773e5899f","f05c94acbd1e0aafd36163c487b0806a61d269fa545402476db6c80a37926080","06e82cb4bb2c6d34db77d931ae556ecd05c5ff55391bceae949073c26051d87a","53b8d5482536508e8e48fe1d8ec9da1592d9e05be903d4390ccdbcecf8704d9f","11b9adef1d36de8fdf7f87b0b7c15146a1a554e655b60be88f727e8a505db66e","3e36dfd8d79e0dbb3d649c20119c1a633fc3dcb1296aaa0d0d4229bd8bd6daa1","fe1824e94369bd12cc7694c98814491e8a6fd109bfdb820d4ea8fa1c2f23c762","0032656ddf70d325a3d7887a0ea045a8ab9b16cf373708e0010e282b67e928d9"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3648,3671],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p3648"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The counter check procedure is used by the network to request the UE to verify the amount of data sent/ received on each DRB. More specifically, the UE is requested to check if, for each DRB, the most significant bits of the COUNT match with the values indicated by the network.","paragraph_zero_based":3672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The procedure enables the network to detect packet insertion by an intruder (a 'man in the middle').","paragraph_zero_based":3673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.6.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":3674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network initiates the procedure by sending a CounterCheck message.","paragraph_zero_based":3675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The network may initiate the procedure when any of the COUNT values reaches a specific value.","paragraph_zero_based":3676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.6.3Reception of the CounterCheck message by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":3677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the CounterCheck message, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each DRB that is established:","paragraph_zero_based":3679},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if no COUNT exists for a given direction (uplink or downlink) because it is a uni-directional bearer configured only for the other direction:","paragraph_zero_based":3680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assume the COUNT value to be 0 for the unused direction;","paragraph_zero_based":3681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the drb-Identity is not included in the drb-CountMSB-InfoList:","paragraph_zero_based":3682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the DRB in the drb-CountInfoList in the CounterCheckResponse message by including the drb-Identity, the count-Uplink and the count-Downlink set to the value of TX_NEXT – 1 and RX_NEXT – 1 (specified in TS 38.323 [5]), respectively;","paragraph_zero_based":3683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if, for at least one direction, the most significant bits of the COUNT are different from the value indicated in the drb-CountMSB-InfoList:","paragraph_zero_based":3684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the DRB in the drb-CountInfoList in the CounterCheckResponse message by including the drb-Identity, the count-Uplink and the count-Downlink set to the value of TX_NEXT – 1 and RX_NEXT – 1 (specified in TS 38.323 [5]), respectively;","paragraph_zero_based":3685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each DRB that is included in the drb-CountMSB-InfoList in the CounterCheck message that is not established:","paragraph_zero_based":3686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the DRB in the drb-CountInfoList in the CounterCheckResponse message by including the drb-Identity, the count-Uplink and the count-Downlink with the most significant bits set identical to the corresponding values in the drb-CountMSB-InfoList and the least significant bits set to zero;","paragraph_zero_based":3687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the CounterCheckResponse message to lower layers for transmission upon which the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":3688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7RRC connection re-establishment","paragraph_zero_based":3689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.1General","paragraph_zero_based":3690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.7.1-1: RRC connection re-establishment, successful","paragraph_zero_based":3692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.7.1-2: RRC re-establishment, fallback to RRC establishment, successful","paragraph_zero_based":3695}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["dae613f6108621e57c26b97d5480760e52485053cbec630cc622fb67c9f6a511","ffc1628606cecfb222d80b06b381acc5c6543c10c3bcb9a2b4c848c586a3a5fd","1e65929259bcde248dd4b7125c96e79ef56355193349edc65dae7ded1a7aa1b5","80a62ebc7930f473ddd64cfb14f5886bf45049b1f9c723848043fc680d962e02","3081f0d166cb8bfb00b3bfa2b509a45c62f78ce412d97a397bae9dd09d1c5c5d","e4e94bc869dae45e28b66a385c4cad0f72cd30a6827ad09803a06043e305422b","ff94132377d7761f1019d66c6548cad505f38231baf434d56cb5496c0d261521","8a935331e63a87d2ecd7c47e3438c391fc022a038b2b7699579b6a39062d4e5a","61dccc8c17f121ca178b3a9b8b970314f6148abc8634d43bc5220c840bf17654","06f6f174b55aab9ada00e8eead8d27391dab7e2a573ecc17a4f62095db7748c1","f65968482307dc2f39e582753bb3f7da6af032df2bbe358d0540bb795387bfca","2c310b430a7e55f78a2d07e43efd6e24c9d9e87aa0ffed6ad341bff22fbc8a02","15a933acf88f5d8d4f8ef7bea866527eb99a3ddd434d64e90f68a8cb479d6a70","76e955640dc8dd8382a0f00096d60642d0885a5b83c4c5eff1ce55a9870f5713","0dbb8c3c2acfbece948a66773c28b5391bc6a8d266c6accabc4932f3d15ea824","310888c0a1531c4557c1b214344904e1b29b3462b9aaa3e79999d2d086aed248","e634d91bce1cb0078a8d60a0702257352d98406453984297352774ad060f0262","d0d165e8dc6d1a91cc17ef8d2c68b5e62856e2635365f3715f778780240b6ac5","8537c60635e2b362838502f7ff7e13803183de7bde241c6e9ee240b69480b3d8","c14d5f9e966472fc3c7e5b6374263f2f6bea365a9e6675b3fb7c6e8a5fe05630","00c401fe8736a3d367f5a15b1c6394d0639eccfdef7344aec92ac559a276bd14","96135ef5f01fd0da098116158f024654df3a9c7ac83bad8d4d9207136b833904","9fcc0f73a78d3fb8e2514eca265cac9ea31027ebd0182fbe04aa0b83bad4a9bf","ed3f9d1b909f2f90f0661fcc247e25da7f459efe1d62a52db390c198948be825"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3672,3695],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p3672"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to re-establish the RRC connection. A UE in RRC_CONNECTED, for which AS security has been activated with SRB2 and at least one DRB/multicast MRB setup or, for IAB and NCR, SRB2, may initiate the procedure in order to continue the RRC connection. The connection re-establishment succeeds if the network is able to find and verify a valid UE context or, if the UE context cannot be retrieved, and the network responds with an RRCSetup according to clause 5.3.3.4.","paragraph_zero_based":3696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network applies the procedure e.g as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":3697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-When AS security has been activated and the network retrieves or verifies the UE context:","paragraph_zero_based":3698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to re-activate AS security without changing algorithms;","paragraph_zero_based":3699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to re-establish and resume the SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-When UE is re-establishing an RRC connection, and the network is not able to retrieve or verify the UE context:","paragraph_zero_based":3701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to discard the stored AS Context and release all RBs and BH RLC channels and Uu Relay RLC channels;","paragraph_zero_based":3702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to fallback to establish a new RRC connection.","paragraph_zero_based":3703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If AS security has not been activated, the UE shall not initiate the procedure but instead moves to RRC_IDLE directly, with release cause 'other'. If AS security has been activated, but SRB2 and at least one DRB or multicast MRB or, for IAB and NCR, SRB2, are not setup, the UE does not initiate the procedure but instead moves to RRC_IDLE directly, with release cause 'RRC connection failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":3704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":3705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE initiates the procedure when one of the following conditions is met:","paragraph_zero_based":3706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG and t316 is not configured, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":3707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while SCG transmission is suspended, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":3708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while PSCell change or PSCell addition is ongoing, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":3709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while the SCG is deactivated, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":3710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon re-configuration with sync failure of the MCG, in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":3711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon mobility from NR failure, in accordance with clause 5.4.3.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":3712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon integrity check failure indication from lower layers concerning SRB1 or SRB2, except if the integrity check failure is detected on the RRCReestablishment message; or","paragraph_zero_based":3713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon an RRC connection reconfiguration failure, in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.2; or","paragraph_zero_based":3714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure for the SCG while MCG transmission is suspended, in accordance with clause 5.3.10.3 in NR-DC or in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.11.3 in NE-DC; or","paragraph_zero_based":3715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon reconfiguration with sync failure of the SCG while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":3716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon SCG change failure while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.7a; or","paragraph_zero_based":3717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon SCG configuration failure while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.2 in NR-DC or in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.5 in NE-DC; or","paragraph_zero_based":3718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon integrity check failure indication from SCG lower layers concerning SRB3 while MCG is suspended; or","paragraph_zero_based":3719}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["61cef4079c2b8dd6f5edee6a1fd3dbb2cf9bbafc89355c588ee089583675f02e","c2cd050eb1dc1e33376e7d8d2769181789418f9cb6063af6f1c4ecf5cea019dc","f36d559bc98f13d307fcd220f80e6a29b56802af2c46dac60436561ad89b8fe6","86ffc00b2ce17b5b0d21579ed5064b2e3d9ecaa2a3b8a304266fa38b1bb73389","126b81cf8de44a0b996d354436524ea676f721d2c0adf1d7cd56e10392995856","3b0bafbec58ced2f3d80201fb2a7afbd6001b7a70d37ff30785359be7c2e3544","72212074a92d74ea465520bcc6f5ed71b420c06b10812ccd1a7042354e5123aa","7275f9bcce9549e00ab4d28295fef2a40f37051e0e61aa876192ad911514c3c5","f457dfe3186da75d59b175b96b533a5b70cab5af6b10ea333667dafe4f003d2f","2eee922c05db2b7e29798a2dfe0408dcd3bd7970e50cb621eff2cbd436bb5a84","72d7bce31791eb166f806a02a3fd9e76b94e39a88faf7957e25f1ee61f8478e6","b19367bebc4c2dac8a3b36268fdf453a98c8c8df114351da2c23fc55783ef7ff","a012c07e808a0bc3ce8bf9699765d095e23fd71a7a5c3a152786c3d279c17647","3894d07f356a150bec97d18256a0711a558ba939e2b35c5058690480ece80033","3d84dc0b91ea2ba615c6418a4d98f994306154394a64d4f16efc416ce225ea37","12379bb8b4bc19bca84f69e292492d995d92d9394499a24e4d84ed22d401c508","96c0e1b6f45e6899da6de53d9adcf680910e984ec0cce08a891377889b5a38d4","e92a58380ee36803d48e87079df54ab2e884e742ee8f53f29716a3ee49709840","9c623cc946b2ad0a5424c7a49900a1a35c88fce387300ed4d343c6421e650fbf","bce080fac434609df3f0dc891effeb49f6ea268678f5bf7e49a9f1d60947497f","f917eb6a8120ad60904da4e695d76903d1291e6283a6cac935bf414071643424","7e968298e4be4e2558f7bd25ef16e749b269230c7a443f1a8b0911e9e07813e2","c8be17530dd6e5e59a1714878bffee1acae193410bec9216f8aba3afd346188a","3042ebf46a3d82e192df96d8fd7e7d825cbd88866c5e6158528ade0b6d5f86a5"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3696,3719],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p3696"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon T316 expiry, in accordance with clause 5.7.3b.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":3720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting sidelink radio link failure by L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED which is not configured with MP, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":3721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon reception of NotificationMessageSidelink including indicationType by L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED which is not configured with MP, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":3722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon PC5 unicast link release for the serving L2 U2N Relay UE indicated by upper layer at L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED which is not configured with MP while T301 is not running; or","paragraph_zero_based":3723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG (i.e. direct path) in accordance with clause 5.3.10 while the transmission of indirect path is suspended as specified in 5.3.5.17; or","paragraph_zero_based":3724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG (i.e. direct path) in accordance with 5.3.10 while MP indirect path addition or change is ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":3725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon detecting sidelink radio link failure of SL indirect path by L2 U2N Remote UE, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3, while MCG transmission (i.e. direct path) is suspended as specified in clause 5.7.3b; or","paragraph_zero_based":3726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon reception of NotificationMessageSidelink including indicationType in accordance with clause 5.8.9.10, while MCG transmission (i.e. direct path) is suspended as specified in clause 5.7.3b; or","paragraph_zero_based":3727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon PC5 unicast link release indicated by upper layer at L2 U2N Remote UE, while MCG transmission (i.e. direct path) is suspended as specified in clause 5.7.3b; or","paragraph_zero_based":3728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon detecting the failure of N3C indirect path by N3C remote UE in accordance with clause 5.7.3c, while MCG transmission (i.e. direct path) is suspended.","paragraph_zero_based":3729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:It is up to UE implementation whether to initiate the procedure while T346g is running.","paragraph_zero_based":3730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiation of the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T310, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T312, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T304, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>start timer T311;","paragraph_zero_based":3735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T316, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T421, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if UE is not configured with attemptCondReconfig; and","paragraph_zero_based":3738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if UE is not configured with attemptLTM-Switch:","paragraph_zero_based":3739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":3740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release spCellConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>suspend all RBs, and BH RLC channels for IAB-MT, and Uu Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N Relay UE, except SRB0 and broadcast MRBs;","paragraph_zero_based":3742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the MCG SCell(s), if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3743}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c24cbeb7c10a3ad7b75bc4ed253b5abd28bd502838f60a2a13d8e0f79aa75e7a","109c16263a4baece8ea24550b250ab1f10d5a83c0fe49e0a1be1230d9908de36","9be790fa3e2196f0345b16ca119813e1a8e11cc72b41fab0d0bb534063ee2b19","c3ce0810c91394da4224abdbaa15c944029402bf0126c8c2a278c0b87a26e47e","d1d70698d16c469fc6a8f8c816f9a47bee5d03abfbabcece66a42c642979da11","ecde49b804c2233ed66e88fca542705ba0e22ba87503e85be5baae3f355fcc84","074bbc3910759cefda2d798434bcedb394e5c78113587f71e2d3ab8d84d99e49","b50fa25fa1f959fb2df7d8763f50e9ede8a82d803404150f9581a00f87a97d1c","2ada76020b262f5651427564799670f39717f51391d4fdea7de861a2a817018a","99805b91dc7e45c3e26aff3adc11fe47cfbbfa1a73da9a337c50435e6e934b0a","360e6de16bc8129b9d2482cd2e696bedf09bb876a68a1dd30a420515186d1374","2cbd50ccf57193eb7f477b8fc3d0866b9233974b4ea246554de448382c911a29","64eb4600a0d476339f437c8db5eb7468b6ac7fe65934cb5ef1cd7c7f2d580b08","8cd420af0885978697fdc9eb2087542bb618044c851383583627dce2b11e2949","e6dd20be32304232210068a78679bac1a431898b52018a6211de6bc75eab0b28","b75dc8f94ca9eefe939a082dad22af49de987ef2938708c5d2377c95c23fe8a7","97b77d0cc1942f3771b616223d89064657df159d377c69c3567e9f7ca6cf0f01","e28ddb1d4fe128f82049922270ebc681c5e12e9591e6fe04cd1d6218a628d53a","9ad49fa801edd39dd52da210254a31944ade8169ec6e86aefcc04b5521456981","86b11c494e2aaf518550410441c4a56fdc0369bec6f22218190a37374810ca22","c413c92f8667e1dc730af5ff267b7959844405cae21f6597f12ecb2fc33f4120","de100d58a0ebd9f1fb5ef4cd2280ca777eb76a7758810c36a44ea64a582a6ed7","c5328eea1700580d8ae98fb0ff74ef4ae450d8abb1a7e82f495b8e37edbb35d7",