nfigured;","paragraph_zero_based":3781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the source MAC and release the source MAC configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":3783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":3784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the PDCP entity to release DAPS as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":3786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":3787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the PDCP entity for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the physical channel configuration for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the keys used in the source SpCell (the KgNB key, the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key), if any;","paragraph_zero_based":3791}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["12520d74be3f49613279e824db576ab0303df280fb371dd266a590cf8ae8fcb6","e10f811066475a420964fbe6ee4be6dd5a7d42d2e5b58c248debac4e1567c99d","dad58a21befbc18397fe0e2060e3de6b9512430adac71e4388a54596901b5610","5f939da2277bd90b0971b956253bb53480