{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measIdleCarrierListEUTRA in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains validityAreaList:","paragraph_zero_based":4081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received validityAreaList in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measReselectionCarrierListNR:","paragraph_zero_based":4083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measReselectionCarrierListNR in VarMeasReselectionConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measReselectionValidityDuration:","paragraph_zero_based":4085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measReselectionValidityDuration in VarMeasReselectionConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measIdleValidityDuration:","paragraph_zero_based":4087},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measReselectionValidityDuration in VarEnhMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCRelease includes suspendConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":4089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC and release the default MAC Cell Group configuration, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":4090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the received suspendConfig except the received nextHopChainingCount;","paragraph_zero_based":4091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sdt-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each of the DRB in the sdt-DRB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":4093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the DRB to be configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":4094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sdt-SRB2-Indication is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the SRB2 to be configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":4096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each RLC bearer (except those associated with broadcast MRBs and multicast MRBs) that is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":4097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>re-establish the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":4098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for SRB2 (if it is resumed) and for SRB1:","paragraph_zero_based":4099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>trigger the PDCP entity to perform SDU discard as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":4100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the PCell with the configured grant resources for SDT and instruct the MAC entity to start the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":4102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosRRC-Inactive is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4103}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["03eb94ddc39109706b3bcb3cbc6e260430b0d4ee4a6f5a2778a4e9aa9c3bb06e","236edd59cd670a4f035f58b506c2575f7520908493743792114daa0cb8629759","7458d9fed663bd4aba3c387334fd73e93af13576156f1a575db6e1ffefaedb1f","5b31e7500d247467b13c44ad5f147c6ff84565c9b6a25173b57bc8174b30ae65","d73a75f46b6eee9ed343dc0ee0a9290a75bba1b43d25a3cb8529eb084f47faee","00f3beda35e6e1f5a66bd1dd2dd64e1e39224a15fc88e679542a1ac83a6c5df3","8c5935cb25662f2c1f9e9b9aec31025dbb77