{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the SRS for positioning configuration in RRC_INACTIVE and instruct MAC to start the inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":4104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaNonPreConfig is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the SRS for positioning configuration in RRC_INACTIVE and instruct MAC to start the inactivePosSRS-ValidityAreaTAT;","paragraph_zero_based":4106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaPreConfigList is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":4107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaConfig and apply the SRS for positioning configuration in RRC_INACTIVE when requested by upper layers;2>else if srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaPreConfigList is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":4108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove all srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaPreConfigList, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":4109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1b:The Network should provide full configuration to UE for SRS for Positioning in RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":4110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the LTM configuration release procedure for the MCG and the SCG as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.7;","paragraph_zero_based":4111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all the entries within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":4112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the servingSecurityCellSetId within the VarServingSecurityCellSetID, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":4113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId of the MCG measConfig and for each measId of the SCG measConfig, if configured, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":4114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the associated reportConfigId:","paragraph_zero_based":4115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching reportConfigId from the reportConfigList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the associated measObjectId is only associated to a reportConfig with reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":4117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching measObjectId from the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry with the matching measId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4119},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for NCR-MT, if ncr-FwdConfig is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the ncr-FwdConfig includes periodic forwarding resource configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":4121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to NCR-Fwd to continue forwarding only in accordance with the configured periodic forwarding resource set(s);","paragraph_zero_based":4122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to NCR-Fwd to cease forwarding;","paragraph_zero_based":4124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE and is not configured with MP:","paragraph_zero_based":4125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":4126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":4127}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document