{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the specified configuration of SL-RLC0 used for the delivery of RRC message over SRB0 as specified in 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":4656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the SDAP configuration and PDCP configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2 for SRB0;","paragraph_zero_based":4657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the CCCH configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":4659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the timeAlignmentTimerCommon included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":4660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the resume procedure is initiated in a cell that is different to the PCell in which the UE received the stored sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":4662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the stored sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":4663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>instruct the MAC entity to stop the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":4664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if ncd-SSB-RedCapInitialBWP-SDT is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the resume procedure is initiated in a cell that is different to the PCell in which the UE received the stored ncd-SSB-RedCapInitialBWP-SDT:","paragraph_zero_based":4666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the stored ncd-SSB-RedCapInitialBWP-SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":4667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if conditions for initiating SDT in accordance with 5.3.13.1b are fulfilled:","paragraph_zero_based":4668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the resume procedure is initiated for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":4669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start timer T319a when the lower layers first transmit the CCCH message;","paragraph_zero_based":4670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider SDT procedure is ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":4671},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> else:","paragraph_zero_based":4672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start timer T319;","paragraph_zero_based":4673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to stop the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":4674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if ta-Report or ta-ReportATG is configured with value enabled and the UE supports TA reporting:","paragraph_zero_based":4675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate TA report initiation to lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":4676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the variable pendingRNA-Update to false;","paragraph_zero_based":4677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release successHO-Config from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":4678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release successPSCell-Config configured by the PCell from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":4679}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e9919663185f8a18fc2db180ab525bd0c072ee8105a66988376d8f9869660887","489ace6c68b0378affb728cc3d8c22252b1a45f275378d3e08e32bcef77e2d95","17fb06066334ff0e1acd6262b3fbf51f14c08ed6ca3140498e656047a3beeea9","b84fa7b94dc3dcf3721a09946c7ad3da1e11a86fcbadfcc45dc937eb7450142e","1e2fcdec52fdd2e51a5433b7a2dded1f0fa84723d9a0fce29c27326b972cdb96","d97f48957b7a9f5db3cad7b