{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release successPSCell-Config configured by the PSCell from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":4680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initiate transmission of the RRCResumeRequest message or RRCResumeRequest1 in accordance with 5.3.13.3.","paragraph_zero_based":4681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.3Actions related to transmission of RRCResumeRequest or RRCResumeRequest1 message","paragraph_zero_based":4682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of RRCResumeRequest or RRCResumeRequest1 message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if field useFullResumeID is signalled in SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":4684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>select RRCResumeRequest1 as the message to use;","paragraph_zero_based":4685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the resumeIdentity to the stored fullI-RNTI value;","paragraph_zero_based":4686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>select RRCResumeRequest as the message to use;","paragraph_zero_based":4688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the resumeIdentity to the stored shortI-RNTI value;","paragraph_zero_based":4689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>restore the RRC configuration, RoHC state, the EHC context(s), the UDC state, the stored QoS flow to DRB mapping rules and the KgNB and KRRCint keys from the stored UE Inactive AS context except for the following:","paragraph_zero_based":4690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-masterCellGroup;","paragraph_zero_based":4691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup, if stored; and","paragraph_zero_based":4692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-pdcp-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":4693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the resumeMAC-I to the 16 least significant bits of the MAC-I calculated:","paragraph_zero_based":4694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>over the ASN.1 encoded as per clause 8 (i.e., a multiple of 8 bits) VarResumeMAC-Input;","paragraph_zero_based":4695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>with the KRRCint key in the UE Inactive AS Context and the previously configured integrity protection algorithm; and","paragraph_zero_based":4696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>with all input bits for COUNT, BEARER and DIRECTION set to binary ones;","paragraph_zero_based":4697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>derive the KgNB key based on the current KgNB key or the NH, using the nextHopChainingCount value received in the previous RRCRelease message and stored in the UE Inactive AS Context, as specified in TS 33.501 [11];","paragraph_zero_based":4698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>derive the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key;","paragraph_zero_based":4699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>configure lower layers to apply integrity protection for all radio bearers except SRB0 and MRBs using the configured algorithm and the KRRCint key and KUPint key derived in this clause immediately, i.e., integrity protection shall be applied to all subsequent messages received and sent by the UE;","paragraph_zero_based":4700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Only DRBs with previously configured UP integrity protection shall resume integrity protection.","paragraph_zero_based":4701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>configure lower layers to apply ciphering for all radio bearers except SRB0 and MRBs and to apply the configured ciphering algorithm, the KRRCenc key and the KUPenc key derived in this clause, i.e. the ciphering configuration shall be applied to all subsequent messages received and sent by the UE;","paragraph_zero_based":4702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>re-establish PDCP entities for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":4703}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f58ceda8fc389f0639f9c632b96fab523ce482d56a2af672603e2726da0427b9","5e064292662c5d535494c9a659a59c54e7d98e386a24b2b9894fd9542804da7e","cce1951501870707618d995682f9c60b1d68e548a05cb9934d77ef2bb6fe3c20","1967ef8d07e9f123829f396b61d642846a4d51a509ac2f0d65463fa1672d7317","227b149bb46bdab7ded0e33d7046cf9ac286176d016872aa886da8ca8926c2f3","5dad8c3953d858356876f7a6dbe641ff38e00d147eb2435264f9bddb9c2cccb3","36eaafa35a051792e412fd470abd73e9599d8782960a9ba23be9f20479f451d2","798d76b6df61c1c4fc1070f4ed54c859ae558e63c596a3859229b523a45ed1d7","e5b8df4c3860b7482a163fd5174584f4f47f7672bb592253573694a84ce4db09","2b31933b4b92c8fa8db7bf430e0b1f8af40079de102edafb37a62a44b2382595","38040e9e1c0cd77eb8945ec3f8f4bceed39e6ca6805bd7c2ccf2bce11c4d304b","221c04c98a044634556351d0907c384b78ba1152025d1319250c90cddec6bf4f","9bfc9072ab5f00d4e0a7bacc07687954749828617eacdee5b8b41b67ed983222","28e2403beee6da7a7c250fc2ad85af575a6dc8222d84b7bedb06a0d5e78ae2ce","f47b88c2e5cd7168f7c582327e2a7c788c3a309787663cc69e376575d4e96c70","64c8dda7a23ea5314f8f57925d2c37738c2405681f0707dea2a1207f98bcb56e","bc73d1555371c10cd3dcbe4c60c5a975d9c20c49be3d89d5d3b1f7d66d65980c","7d4e9d8a24338098b13229cca099b7d2b74f4b032443236ae4598a5160cd2032","7d7613f6b83c1a7f2dd2fb44f220c43ed61733999d0cb96e52308905c36dede4","8c51b0df9c816f8257660286b79dc1e657bc635f86a65dca524d0a1e35b65436","c486223d34bf8b409b2aaa2da79675c836d720ec1e035b858c0d48673e9542f8","e77170649e3e401e4967d703e9b5ba83b238d2f4c51319707b5dda7bfe33cfa7","91549ee175cec1d4d18ef5bfa72c1a825d346c0e1e8f9a2c4395e0131e1ae248","f8796d79eac815c60c13808e007b74d08287b7118331a0d6dd478e297681da0c"],"pa