{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>resume SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":4704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the resume procedure is initiated for SDT:","paragraph_zero_based":4705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each radio bearer that is configured for SDT and for SRB1:","paragraph_zero_based":4706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>restore the RLC-BearerConfig associated with the RLC bearers of masterCellGroup and pdcp-Config from the UE Inactive AS context;","paragraph_zero_based":4707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the radio bearer is a DRB configured with Ethernet Header Compression:","paragraph_zero_based":4708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to lower layer that ethernetHeaderCompression is not configured;","paragraph_zero_based":4709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the radio bearer is a DRB configured with UDC:","paragraph_zero_based":4710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to lower layer that uplinkDataCompression is not configured;","paragraph_zero_based":4711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the radio bearer is a DRB configured with ROHC function:","paragraph_zero_based":4712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sdt-DRB-ContinueROHC is set to cell and the resume procedure is initiated in a cell that is the same as the PCell in which the UE received the previous RRCRelease message; or","paragraph_zero_based":4713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sdt-DRB-ContinueROHC is set to rna and the resume procedure is initiated in a cell belonging to the same RNA as the PCell in which the UE received the previous RRCRelease message:","paragraph_zero_based":4714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>indicate to lower layer that drb-continueROHC is configured;","paragraph_zero_based":4715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>indicate to lower layer that drb-continueROHC is not configured;","paragraph_zero_based":4717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish PDCP entity for the radio bearer that is configured for SDT without triggering PDCP status report;","paragraph_zero_based":4718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>resume all the radio bearers that are configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":4719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the selected message RRCResumeRequest or RRCResumeRequest1 for transmission to lower layers.","paragraph_zero_based":4720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:Only DRBs with previously configured UP ciphering shall resume ciphering.","paragraph_zero_based":4721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2a:Before the lower layers first transmit the RRCResumeRequest or RRCResumeRequest1, the UE may initiate a new resume procedure if other conditions for initiation of the resume procedure as specified in 5.3.13.2 are satisfied.","paragraph_zero_based":4722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If lower layers indicate an integrity check failure while T319 is running or SDT procedure is ongoing, perform actions specified in 5.3.13.5.","paragraph_zero_based":4723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is an (e)RedCap UE and the RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP is not associated with CD-SSB, the UE may continue cell re-selection related measurements as well as cell re-selection evaluation, otherwise the UE shall continue cell re-selection related measurements as well as cell re-selection evaluation. If the conditions for cell re-selection are fulfilled, the UE shall perform cell re-selection as specified in 5.3.13.6.","paragraph_zero_based":4724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:For L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_INACTIVE, the cell (re)selection procedure as specified in TS 38.304 [20] and relay (re)selection procedure as specified in 5.8.15.3 are performed independently and it is up to UE implementation to select either a cell or a L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":4725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.4Reception of the RRCResume by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":4726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4727}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["62c3cb1f28966800510dad027216b9fba0e26e13c98984539ff856b477d07f54","d24389bcab4f28c1393ab11a348714f88bcbd702364990e2f74438bd5525495e","e93cf436a79817de4ca850c74b7a0ed8da8ae06ee35418c5471a357dab618ca1","e5f19e5e172240ac2af5f5ec907a9d8dd9c7c0fa4d5bbf4be6c939689f9ae9a4","2bd378cc448f5aab83c46ed3de58ed1c517d27bbdcdb5e5c10a44cc48d2a4b7d","1a5bed60be20d80b9c70227da2e83bcf7614302bdebce9f64376d3b4a02e714c","2afd7a9d51b33535c28fad03c346995d0494d769772f59f8fc63077166589b45","574cfb234c1f740bc579f0278fcbe2eeebd56d3d3714d5127a23370c0a2e0f74","a84d308ac79e003c72af05cf03423e4ab5d699973e54d7c1076d4a222a7e61d3","cca739448aeb6a196217a8bc6ae91e3e4be11e60d718d918133b93ce4b5104aa","ee4dbb12c3f38decdeec7324fa2476a0431eec116bc8c640e3160b722d6d50ba","3418930a8209c331571b6bbd4824402e900cc5e47f9502c3d3d3ee862e904bf1","ca3a903e4fd534f1e2830edbc5f6e74b8ced4e557a7b48f2d5f264d9e2b4f421","54708eb99ff5fa0e45296eda174a3e9929ce1201fb77d2232f6de10067144e72","b8de07b0a8d312fc747cfe713db9a6766a306bca16731fbc9e0723da5de11edd","16f363e5fefa2f6dbc362c055d3f5d5b71c90bd1e3a0feb4868bb83a5b9e5864","a20b7f9c00e0ad71fb0d64bee2d603ce162a1934485fe8e6ebfca5f1af48a584","1504ac824c8e2747767b6ec464c5e93aca270bc2054e4d4004465f60c7a632bd","d496b4a138fbfa9c5c53b7cfe8267d9d09f973d0b6682fbe37019c18a5c27253","9f1072872b035b8959215af0659a836b1d5fb373410303950a0f695250abfceb","a5f8b84f4601e3c5