{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T319, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":4728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T319a, if running and consider SDT procedure is not ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":4729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T380, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":4730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T331 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":4731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T331;","paragraph_zero_based":4732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.7.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":4733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume includes the fullConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":4734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the full configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.11;","paragraph_zero_based":4735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCResume does not include the restoreMCG-SCells:","paragraph_zero_based":4737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the MCG SCell(s) from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":4738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCResume does not include the restoreSCG:","paragraph_zero_based":4739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the MR-DC related configurations (i.e., as specified in 5.3.5.10) from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":4740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>restore the masterCellGroup, mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup, if stored, and pdcp-Config from the UE Inactive AS context;","paragraph_zero_based":4741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure lower layers to consider the restored MCG and SCG SCell(s) (if any) to be in deactivated state;","paragraph_zero_based":4742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>discard the UE Inactive AS context;","paragraph_zero_based":4743},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the used nextHopChainingCount value associated to the current KgNB;","paragraph_zero_based":4744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is configured with multicast reception in RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":4745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":4746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to stop the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":4748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to start the timeAlignmentTimer associated with the PTAG, if it is not running;","paragraph_zero_based":4749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if srs-PosRRC-Inactive is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to stop inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":4751}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3d317a924834a2a3b4453cc619c3e195004af8df74e8c6b9cf2ab0e62a95e86d","3f181e8c308e5f2630d295f4486015f17c2682792b744307cc88ed07c862b89f","188afe68db7cff83d092ef6d445e3bc16f73a95e4b1e65d2c10c46db765f207d","e1c900b02a6a96f6a2f4b00b436a333176cddf983c0e28298969897195ac950b","4598a79e7e0f274cb7f0e95800fe0a47c3724ebac8e7e07662db696af8b9e185","5b5c1a19dbbae401ffd3ccdcae290a766bd52a2a5b9adc311c9086b87ec060c1","8651cd4456fbed1bb2d64e859e8a84bd4528c871590fae14aa1ca9c8b7393943","6c8851e426715073479e647e06cde71b840d5337965e524c1518639d7326033d",