{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":4776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":4778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":4779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":4780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":4781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":4783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RPLMN is not included in plmn-IdentityList in VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":4785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":4786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the application layer measurement configuration including its fields in the UE variables VarAppLayerIdleConfig and VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>discard any application layer measurement reports which were not yet fully submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":4788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement reports for the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":4789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the appLayerMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":4790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if idleInactiveReportAllowed is included in the RRCResume message:","paragraph_zero_based":4791},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is configured with at least one application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the procedure in 5.7.16.2 after the RRCResumeComplete has been transmitted;","paragraph_zero_based":4793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":4796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the application layer measurement configuration including its fields in the UE variables VarAppLayerIdleConfig and VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":4797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>discard any application layer measurement reports which were not yet fully submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":4798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement reports for the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":4799}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ebf6bb58bfcd8f29dd354fdd6823dfce5cddcd9a5a73529997e27984a9d102a0","615ff2c6f583f0a0de7cb8fa42fd10866e6b3e45a8d641abc1852e30d3f8e741","96e95b7befcc8e06a179793001dbf0fb3124fd723a9fa7b84bcda5e36c68dd04","311e9b36a06eb178b170b5d60ee5d8605ca75ca2b9339030bd873ef70f5cf313","3a7ea4847e16282e986a318f670b088e317fe014171db30fefe79da614608c7d","ef3b4dd0a673a9933812cf761b8155ea387dc68b6643cbb1056152ed72bedda4","e4ddb31fee019950dc58136cbff36749879d73dba5d65311475b471a3604d940","a212b516360bdde62a516d32ed28037f3d8ddcd2a83188da7b70bab03ccbc040","022e0b7a2a30b4b0eea583c0503c7af2270646b43c526fec682c474f3d02c2eb","47325ae93b31254d7eec8c3130a72d0adfbd4bcba7ef85ba49cecaf3baa34873","2ce19df179ec16c7ea663f3eb748c6d33af0c04e5dcbf27eeac386c79eb86c2a","78e2d292f6ac85f6fc9f1d045ae0eb74f57ae3cf33f87426bb20dde64d463fe9","d45609024ec7a67abfe2c47554f8f0d933296255d4081b48f2bb990469b6db8f","dcf3a159baba0e9219a2c29770925ebe93eca953f95b288ae29fa26fec56ee6c","e94c19e04593736c6ea860c601fd92e107074a61dca6790afb3fbaa5cfb4b142","f95a0fbdb83a438a333c7084e1f271d8f504255ef90ed5e8158df73577458073","01d017ffb1bc757096e9f00da3dcc88fdb6fdf2143686853ee67339b491718ea","2b3b065da22d2f9ac8dc3e7d9aaf4b14f49e2e1b5b539786cd19cec571d8910e","454cc6b181519bd5a3cd2af5507fb2a8397c911665203860a3ff95a37999a5eb","29578830eed7a96aaf28be8717c0c8107a33bfbd1310715065dd565598d51297","2e824f00db0be23a92c7e6a99f92d7ec6e741031eae2ee096956383c9c2d1868","45994ee6a72514e49f8591cfc8a2e2356849de8656b897af0db957e348b027a0","f6fb8a81586ea8a2f1ee44108529d86bb5eaa6e406eefcf35e20f1e7977dcb1e","e3d2cb26cf2dd9fe16b045a9f94bdeb24ab4c1e359dd2ba436518292e2e87103"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4776,4799],"pr