{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the application layer measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.13d;","paragraph_zero_based":4800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config (i.e. the UE is a L2 U2N Remote UE):","paragraph_zero_based":4801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the L2 U2N Remote UE configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.16;","paragraph_zero_based":4802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":4803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the sidelink dedicated configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.14;","paragraph_zero_based":4804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>resume SRB2 (if suspended), SRB3 (if configured), SRB4 (if configured), SRB5 (if configured), all DRBs (that are suspended) and multicast MRBs (that are suspended);","paragraph_zero_based":4805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:If the SCG is deactivated, resuming SRB3 and all DRBs does not imply that PDCP or RRC PDUs can be transmitted or received on SCG RLC bearers.","paragraph_zero_based":4806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if stored, discard the cell reselection priority information provided by the cellReselectionPriorities or inherited from another RAT;","paragraph_zero_based":4807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T320, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":4808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the measConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":4809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":4810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>resume measurements if suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":4811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":4812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":4813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":4814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T302 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":4815},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T302;","paragraph_zero_based":4816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":4817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>enter RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":4818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>indicate to upper layers that the suspended RRC connection has been resumed;","paragraph_zero_based":4819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop the cell re-selection procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":4820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop relay reselection procedure if any for L2 U2N Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":4821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the current cell to be the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":4822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the content of the of RRCResumeComplete message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4823}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3a4ec2cacfc2fe638744557c9de5312c14b78198d91396dafae113d2437b8f45","beb20563ead5730b1e306cc705bd12779484e1a087e578011baad1fb3ded657e","50cd493403849012b21a90c9e8b2c67e1937f52286bb5bb0b6043403adadb623","a85a3bae248ca2d773bf80bdac19d6561ef4210baed6c9916c226e18522dfdc1","dbb60d35d0855cce3c619c9f155729358e20e644f47cddb2d8ef4f0a76b7d704","90ef9f78834f1faac6e0723cdaf2ae607671c2bf1edd9a1d536caa2acb72c6ee","432a91a078f12c7218bd8d5bc442242f57594b33288e9dc8d9b66e7d8676ea99","46aef82e4e9b5c14ee0e3f08900fcc692c040a2d9ac828d9cf48fc6ae5ed1c86","495b5df29ab30972b8328b71551b6e0807f68575863a863b62f2c2e287f3c5ca","1133c24fda5d6485a34a9afde48fcded0cd45f4c15cd89ea9bb44dcbd2a8df70","f1b0f20366f414e8dfef8eeb61f15ca8a4078d58ddc9ca43fe08ae9238a93810","d3c7a096583c058452435ab07ceeed46a483158f84f25958a106f5d480a787fc","7a2dab4a72998b489d0da4243c9284dc876a38ac2338fab3c543f9ddaa237453","9847977e2547af31baee1ff8a334d59c0246368b9256aa937cd5106d929036dd","d161b83cfbb019fb8db8dae98642e4d1ff61e6954f441d4f79c637cdfb2c1cd4","2107d1f4f21ee778f350135d8d8ce752295353efdb36d1d9a70612208217ae23","f389e03a127c0faa0ab7e3425bbff656c99017efccb29f6ae28738a6da17a7e7","fe17a44b9db75336495d5769da7cbf0b46f80bb24c493cbd11115120cf6670cc","e3315ef2adc22a10d985c4295218028de1beb650c4c7c827a2d91e68c702d127","489886525d7c70555f6f76f58e33ab0c3ee9857c095ee69750a32e95b92c1a49","f30325725f290b80fb996af888187af28dc642949a8113b6ee77571b154dceed","c9890b80a4be721fcacc1eb7ee831fe25e9f912c770cb1dfd217dde360f0141d","eaeb9e18508a65c2584b429f0da4ce4e9f883b263a44e0991b78c67d25ae8a5b","7f265a40adaed922aba8b3efeeeb68f4d56d003280fa709bfb828e5d0c535d55"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4800,4823],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p4800"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the upper layer provides NAS PDU, set the dedicatedNAS-Message to include the information received from upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":4824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if upper layers provides a PLMN:","paragraph_zero_based":4825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is either allowed or instructed to access the PLMN via a cell for which at least one CAG ID is broadcast:","paragraph_zero_based":4826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the selectedPLMN-Identity from the npn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":4827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the selectedPLMN-Identity to the PLMN selected by upper layers from the plmn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":4829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the masterCellGroup contains the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent:","paragraph_zero_based":4830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList for each MCG serving cell with UL;","paragraph_zero_based":4831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include uplinkDirectCurrentBWP-SUL for each MCG serving cell configured with SUL carrier, if any, within the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList;","paragraph_zero_based":4832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the masterCellGroup contains the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":4833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":4834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the masterCellGroup contains the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":4835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":4836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has idle/inactive measurement information concerning cells other than the PCell available in VarMeasIdleReport:","paragraph_zero_based":4837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the idleModeMeasurementReq is included in the RRCResume message:","paragraph_zero_based":4838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if measIdleValidityDuration is included in VarEnhMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4839},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the measResultIdleEUTRA in the RRCResumeComplete message to the value of measReportIdleEUTRA in the VarMeasIdleReport for any valid measurement results, if available, and set validityStatus to value checked for each reported measurement;","paragraph_zero_based":4840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the measResultIdleNR in the RRCResumeComplete message to the value of measReportIdleNR in the VarMeasIdleReport for any valid measurement results, if available, and set validityStatus to value checked for each reported measurement;","paragraph_zero_based":4841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>discard the VarMeasIdleReport upon successful delivery of the RRCResumeComplete message is confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":4842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the measResultIdleEUTRA in the RRCResumeComplete message to the value of measReportIdleEUTRA in the VarMeasIdleReport, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":4844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the measResultIdleNR in the RRCResumeComplete message to the value of measReportIdleNR in the VarMeasIdleReport, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":4845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>discard the VarMeasIdleReport upon successful delivery of the RRCResumeComplete message is confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":4846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4847}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bb71d8e338a519d0f6e1b59bff3c41b40b1a711499b272923541fc138e5be969","ef9dcf3f26941e610e7b9a9174775b68b11343223d130cb2f6da09adf224742f","dc3d0547cec1e5264156995337f48a7e47cebc4fe0c3e60e0b680bbe8fc57c05","4303c3ebc69d03e5dde58ddb85b9f4f392dfc50dc361bbaf5fa8c5b03829151e","ab6230e5a0fb01a9e69fbc0319bf64bf9259bf12dfe119970e13cf58203c99b7","c594989febff13d696bc7f089c9df3e9ee4866e2d13fd1271244f2280be28237","1e05076f69531a90859972af548c8ba4d458e0b1597452523661ddf225006abb","cace504e6dabb1ca3b3eea5fd39ce3572b4dbb16f21c69ee603d58ed2721d770","812cccf456fbde58b96fb826a4bd4db1d324b35d773ad53b9288f876e21663e6","8485bfe5acee2a3c87bb4d2dccef9c37c85ed286a21f24cee44966eef91a3804","5d34a4843c4cf73bf8f993121ec35027f2d49d841281f86b57d7c8ad38d3922b","8c5dd600bf55a04db5114f61d23564584459955da4d047b68eb601444a66c677","e5808821afdfa3287a32d9647cdb93a3ca2e28916a8961f6f8d6d8dd35f69044","bd2279851d636f2157be0f0a124a7f0c8cd34235286170c571756135f0fa28e9","f9ed32f524a65167cda829a6ede1b32e08e59d39ce42808e93063cdd77d80240","10e67e26af8e0ebc367295657cdec0b25ce2a5abafb8375df028901ec42d16c4","8c7971e8fecf72e7e880ddb5cfaf6e0506530ab1660fb7a4d63fb0890d2be31f","60753008058931d0a4ecc754a0974575558e29ab89712d6fca28dfd59c496081","875ada731dbcf5981675cb446f8eface5404883fa2b6d880375f16a03c1d7fde","9ce147047b1028f983f7e3655c943bf00e6985c77a2591bfcb5b6e91ab955408","fe98b30fe0f7b0a25f6b71fa2f1affe1b6a6eac7d9a2422257db04fd29239154","9b21cbf4da6fa71856c562fcff7e554db9f20c901d5fa3d9bb407b5c006f4453","998e98a99051075f298fb263dc8c25c7a4f27f5fe42de5be53a9d5ff74119ef2","8178e54ccfedad6e8aeb7fcd696a86a111adaeb00d717d3a3a361835541f2ca7"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4824,4847],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p4824"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the SIB1 contains idleModeMeasurementsNR and the UE has NR idle/inactive measurement information concerning cells other than the PCell available in VarMeasIdleReport; or","paragraph_zero_based":4848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the SIB1 contains idleModeMeasurementsEUTRA and the UE has E-UTRA idle/inactive measurement information available in VarMeasIdleReport:","paragraph_zero_based":4849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the idleMeasAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":4850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has valid reselection measurements available;","paragraph_zero_based":4851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the reselectionModeMeasurementReq is included in the RRCResume message:","paragraph_zero_based":4852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> if measReselectionValidityDuration is included in VarMeasReselectionConfig","paragraph_zero_based":4853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the measResultReselectionNR in the RRCResumeComplete message to the valid NR measurement results, if available for any frequency listed in measReselectionCarrierListNR in VarMeasReselectionConfig and set validityStatus to value checked for each reported measurement;","paragraph_zero_based":4854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> else:","paragraph_zero_based":4855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the measResultReselectionNR in the RRCResumeComplete message to the NR measurement results, if available for any frequency listed in measReselectionCarrierListNR in VarMeasReselectionConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":4856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the SIB1 contains reselectionMeasurementsNR and the UE has valid NR reselection measurements available for any frequency listed in measReselectionCarrierListNR in VarMeasReselectionConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":4858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the reselectionMeasAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":4859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCResume message includes mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup set to eutra-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":4860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the eutra-SCG-Response the E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":4861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCResume message includes mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup set to nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":4862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the nr-SCG-Response the SCG RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":4863},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarLogMeasReport; or","paragraph_zero_based":4864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-ConfigIDList stored in VarLogMeasReport:","paragraph_zero_based":4865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the logMeasAvailable in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":4866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if Bluetooth measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":4867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the logMeasAvailableBT in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":4868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if WLAN measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":4869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the logMeasAvailableWLAN in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":4870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sigLoggedMeasType in VarLogMeasReport is included; or","paragraph_zero_based":4871}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["69109cfb8fe47b333a973da0e4b13ece42c99fec5a3d69ef3872879ccbfc6e47","15aab07387667b9c88d094161775cfc14eabe7eba799534adbca7add1fecec85","edfcd0a8eca24541e41385d211d85d66ad8fcc98f296b5bd97ee487994984a93","7da026d3706e2a053cb59f7ca0a367ee3f6b2afe586d3b1f2e6da34db6a5cfa9","bfb8e5a3a5ab81ab37bd634858882e811be8685cd7bca013e34da479f6f0ba25","607407a05a5313974d29f7c7062860c3b9e5e23aa8e39e994a01c63babced93e","643d3f3bc00b6d33ff1eecabdcdebc7080e45ee63e51a1d6e9bae0ad810fe3b4","bf071a17def9c11c86674a8ebacbf6f72eb88dc2e09242392595bde91c3fdff6","60c1449bfbbc0f3e40c333c33a6fae5defea99589aeceb4ea9dc1a6b04a2aa82","badd0a43ebd2be5a159e7ff997ef8f20557f395b65b602f98b41613cb791c7c1","49d91a863166acde3fb65dce6fb7fd4219d8984175d119089a03cf538e78891a","7c6da49d2f3135be192803d9a32c9c362ce5d5d9f7c826651b5da89cc25a7e86","70fdfc99e9f9c8e675c5024944ca52697b3d0d1de0e1ff8c37c6f9e2e22e9976","cc6bfb0caeb6f3383d42f3b61a305a813f8d80e93f929b06888f074681d9f950","dbfa2782222ab2745adb6c6efd9e31b6358eb23427dbe17e19353f30013993f3","ade49c0da16fb851f26dc05e970c21c1dfa2db0e39fe07426f302673710aa35d","371d00b80790a93e9bfd0caef3c5cd9d2a387f70739903e9f6323c3d9dc2bdb5","496a0fc8cc70c75beea9a1565acea6ecbc78b09b6d443e707b67aba6e1ca8847","aaedf3cdcb1053f651a0015f077e0e481459064a081f253a5d095f6e199ef23c","d1c8517793225a4d78b32a39ca28a94ec27bc514d2e7128b72c4749f3fa52595","17ea3e058a34108d0dbf926562a3bd325a00d50a7b6527cea62bae930081f599","442b6050a5f6d5fa65a80fc89f06b3e89448f626120ea0f964742e82e38ded7b","51ea39c096f9cc274aa1388f3c3be2e1e5aed1e8a0ca39f50a402e000a0a89b1","9377