{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports the override protection of the signalling based logged MDT for inter-RAT (i.e. LTE to NR), and if the sigLoggedMeasType in VarLogMeasReport of TS 36.331 [10] is included:","paragraph_zero_based":4872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if T330 timer is running (associated to the logged measurement configuration for NR or for LTE):","paragraph_zero_based":4873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to true in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":4874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has logged measurements in VarLogMeasReport or in VarLogMeasReport of TS 36.331 [10]:","paragraph_zero_based":4876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to false in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":4877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has connection establishment failure or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the RPLMN is equal to plmn-Identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or in at least one of the entries of VarConnEstFailReportList; or","paragraph_zero_based":4878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the registered SNPN identity is equal to snpn-identity in networkIdentity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or any entry of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":4879},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include connEstFailInfoAvailable in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":4880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":4881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10] and if the UE is capable of cross-RAT RLF reporting and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10]; or","paragraph_zero_based":4882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity are included in snpn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":4883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include rlf-InfoAvailable in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":4884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition related information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessPSCell-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":4885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarSuccessPSCell-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":4886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include successPSCell-InfoAvailable in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":4887},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessHO-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":4888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarSuccessHO-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":4889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include successHO-InfoAvailable in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":4890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports storage of mobility history information and the UE has mobility history information available in VarMobilityHistoryReport:","paragraph_zero_based":4891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the mobilityHistoryAvail in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":4892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if speedStateReselectionPars is configured in the SIB2:","paragraph_zero_based":4893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the mobilityState in the RRCResumeComplete message and set it to the mobility state (as specified in TS 38.304 [20]) of the UE just prior to entering RRC_CONNECTED state;","paragraph_zero_based":4894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has at least one stored application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4895}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cdffa13b86f4d1a57d35a7f0b246c5408f2b1d9aac48b60ab3c616c6bb1d1007","6ab8dfec6866c2fc07c205984b5b1947d2899cd66f1305067f546d62a8cfd52d","56b25bd70f3cc26ff76d4f660801c282959382282d3bd0d4ecae8ac729786934","9a8b87e7266379388da837577274d833c100d410dcbde3aa67d67420c95939e5","7c64cdf704997227355492bf9752f93a0c8981bd6c8c8cb9f51a5bdffacfb7bd","bf9518591c594bfa8d229aaca16c441bb59fa5d9fade9eca97253569f942b803","9a34659497edae8c32fce84bdf91eaa6ce595b76d0ec6f1f3a250f3b9db9da46","ca4347d8d2cf0eea4d965f1968139572e6e1dc33e08f251ee55641aa236ecb0b","3bc0786985ded65f36f9741c59dd5cb91ea5456814ccf69402b0d377f62a00dc","9681c7c4c4dbdcb9ebf12d666e7a8eee32b3ca044ec18ba9c93b23f6daaa5228","265b4678f22ed69197555994ae8985fc7211591493afa49a9509739ecc2e62ea","d66fcf4dfb049615206629b96a8939d7a4818f2d211ba46400ebd47bbbc9c0b9","e2fc1fc36b587fc5c9b67f88cf781ded39d57081324814b4f27773098792a066","ec8798fa8db20941ed37019efdf1984af67aa2a3a65fe45486255c40f0af08d1","fd21144b27d0d8ca7f16667f1b6edbfcf0e304d1dadc3d084a4fd90e344ddc42","076597038b860be1d336dcdb01dc7609df109772496b8d17a3e88ab982b36315","3a232ff029c262537eae01a6b1f554557c15fd1b9738631dc6b0c71c570ca571","eae15c261b58b9daf9feae82043ef234ffb1527e5d12fef5549813a875b36a42","02de3fda86ed03f766abff04d1d8d73da29e335e51d2649b137f7f13fa627d31","5446be6d30f0ebe290538992af6e4842cf090d9aa39a116af3b692cf509db378","4303742718d52d10ee741d3e2d966be9b6a97f4345808e636d522d59c561eb77","8d78365b27a35dfae67021f462c3f0ef4c2b556604172b131be8750fb4a55dbf","3b7ed824c1a32597cd68e9c1e9d3fbcfef08c57d2b29af84672347a0de50dca0","9f303ebb89da94ee1ae3f86d20bd69def296fd28cd60c9ce85dcdfe0814858ae"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4872,4895],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p4872"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include measConfigReportAppLayerAvailable in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":4896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":4897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the NeedForGapsInfoNR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> include intraFreq-needForGap and set the gap requirement information of intra-frequency measurement for each NR serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":4899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if requestedTargetBandFilterNR is configured, for each supported NR band that is also included in requestedTargetBandFilterNR, include an entry in interFreq-needForGap and set the gap requirement information for that band; otherwise, include an entry in interFreq-needForGap and set the corresponding gap requirement information for each supported NR band;","paragraph_zero_based":4900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the needForInterruptionConfigNR is enabled:","paragraph_zero_based":4901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the needForInterruptionInfoNR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include intraFreq-needForInterruption with the same number of entries, and listed in the same order, as in intraFreq-needForGap;","paragraph_zero_based":4903},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5> for each entry in intraFreq-needForInterruption:","paragraph_zero_based":4904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include interruptionIndication and set the interruption requirement information if the corresponding entry in intraFreq-needForGap is set to no-gap;","paragraph_zero_based":4905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include interFreq-needForInterruption with the same number of entries, and listed in the same order, as in interFreq-needForGap;","paragraph_zero_based":4906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each entry in interFreq-needForInterruption:","paragraph_zero_based":4907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include interruptionIndication and set the interruption requirement information if the corresponding entry in interFreq-needForGap is set to no-gap;","paragraph_zero_based":4908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":4909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the NeedForGapNCSG-InfoNR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> include intraFreq-needForNCSG and set the gap and NCSG requirement information of intra-frequency measurement for each NR serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":4911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-NR is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each supported NR band included in requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-NR, include an entry in interFreq-needForNCSG and set the NCSG requirement information for that band;","paragraph_zero_based":4913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include an entry for each supported NR band in interFreq-needForNCSG and set the corresponding NCSG requirement information;","paragraph_zero_based":4915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":4916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the NeedForGapNCSG-InfoEUTRA and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-EUTRA is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each supported E-UTRA band included in requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-EUTRA, include an entry in needForNCSG-EUTRA and set the NCSG requirement information for that band;","paragraph_zero_based":4919}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3b85b42193eb59b545120f1b3eb8558d898ef87d7ce348a39d01f9629c9ed911","5b26951a18c8fecc7a5b5a59cc1e837b116920470a967ecc0cac084df893f085","1945ba6bfc5504e2c246bd657e2ae38a9af3f103876348b34511354760777741","b4a9acc3175416a2c7294cdb95e53e6f8ec55bd0cedd0c21efe143783760d610","38ccb2e42bc8388ba3784c7f3fc254c49fe68a069d9f7a990159a7399f25fce1","e82161e31985e8edc6ea3c5fe28ed4598e8fc8c3e80d5822054e6d960e383021","cc6c2be6b33dd6d3d9c3ffbbb0ab6e2d4802ee082308d68a9895bf493fa4af80","ade4e7b90bbc9d64679c03288a85e80d9652ab59a279b3a57c337291d906a8f6","c3a6316f8ed10021120da8dcbbdce34efeff1e0495d3dc8b03cf15fe0bba412a","92b259ed44e0b34106a3ee18f3b70d89d5d638054a740afac85bb55fcd1c8514","c73541988b0fdaf33fde2faccd490f2089de21b2db18a745fc8ff47895a70fba","b96d0f2b37db6c286f34aaa3f1ffcfdd3eb8685f17521b9dd1428b33327d6f7d","385ad5fefad4987385af65575a228d8f467ba97db6c0ad337a5e940003b6a0a4","fc321579352833fb6256359be3d738bec862f9718e5f9cfb51a52174405d19af","bda95ea98ff1e3b9e2d92dc44f19822260a04c43802c0d2f480d1f4a137366ca","9f8c717afc5bca506d9b604fc4bc1504368b91f9bf40e9bb7b9fb35bcef6871e","a4e147d55e57853b169164b64d4c0fd403f2e94ba85627f8e012f7bb49ed13ed","2d90116b5c0b53ae6289d513bbde4a2ac1245ce90fb2fe866cc4f1ae2c79c283","c7219e94231343788a700ea5553577c00aa41f3f7d9b6e8d0b766aeb7f6c365a","54207323e8eae37d0f3fbc2a61541aaa12002c069584b6c9292d99779796a178","0d396674466112c4c1eb99ad00070c0841d4484bb93ba8c502e10e53a833db63","7f4a98256a9da9bf7c4d1b3a1bccb3ba5a303d9a335af62b5044b2a5e3acf482","2c3a6e27b596e8b3a4fde7c220378cfd84525a2f07a7a8949ef90b532c265d07","c8d932cb7514c66081450c74aec8d3429af48b2f588f4bb460d92efe87108e25"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4896,4919],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p4896"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include an entry for each supported E-UTRA band in needForNCSG-EUTRA and set the corresponding NCSG requirement information;","paragraph_zero_based":4921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SIB1 contains musim-CapRestrictionAllowed:","paragraph_zero_based":4922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if supported, include the musim-CapRestrictionInd in the RRCResumeComplete message upon determining it has temporary capability restriction;","paragraph_zero_based":4923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has flight path information available:","paragraph_zero_based":4924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include flightPathInfoAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":4925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the RRCResumeComplete message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":4926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":4927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:Network only configures at most one of reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent, reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier or reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier in one RRC message.","paragraph_zero_based":4928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:Upon reception of musim-CapRestrictionInd in RRCResumeComplete, it is up to network implementation to configure the UE with a limited configuration that is used until network sends RRCReconfiguration based on the actual restricted UE capabilities included in UEAssistanceInformation.","paragraph_zero_based":4929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.5Handling of failure to resume RRC Connection","paragraph_zero_based":4930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if timer T319 expires:","paragraph_zero_based":4932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports multiple CEF report:","paragraph_zero_based":4933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport and if the RPLMN is equal to plmn-identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport; and","paragraph_zero_based":4934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cell identity of current cell is not equal to the cell identity stored in measResultFailedCell in VarConnEstFailReport and if the maxCEFReport-r17 has not been reached:","paragraph_zero_based":4935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>append the VarConnEstFailReport as a new entry in the VarConnEstFailReportList;","paragraph_zero_based":4936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport and if the RPLMN is not equal to plmn-identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport; or","paragraph_zero_based":4937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the cell identity of current cell is not equal to the cell identity stored in measResultFailedCell in VarConnEstFailReport:","paragraph_zero_based":4938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset the numberOfConnFail to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":4939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReportList and if the RPLMN is not equal to plmn-identity stored in any entry of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":4940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear the content included in VarConnEstFailReportList;","paragraph_zero_based":4941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> clear the content included in VarConnEstFailReport except for the numberOfConnFail, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":4942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the following connection resume failure information in the VarConnEstFailReport by setting its fields as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4943}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ebda5aed531770c2e78855b0ea337a7fdb36f6c10f75087fa17e4ffbd526f39a","95714cf89764fcd1917e4bdd9563c009e5ddb9a0e65de722633165d1815bec43","3d218433cb5161c683720ca69d968eb3f7c1e0134155099f03bd1a03b232ce9b","afe1de05d88ad5360f3d4c3967f1ad526e8bb379170961c905266a0e79b9683b","ba8f7a76f61edddfe55247a575272a609438f16e4d92e00107352fec49083d14","696a3ff4029501dc2ec09620c3f2c98c8c506b52da536a91f11a14884eb5eebe","5cbb39d8b3729259497f6446379b4033800262e47e424ddfde1b3aa4903ed93e","c8380a4c48cdf9de743b38ce1972ca3e037d205e8f803a9aa6b97dcb0a843a29","a5d975171fbe17605214b2e47907c8e26b7722fb7de889af7202ae810d6eeba1","66c2147a21a124d1a71357713c042ade303fcbe4627674a53eb288ff43da5221","810f557323d52d986d4dc6cc5d40b73681e7684676f1898580849e4cd94247f0","01c19eb90c127ec138737aef36b89ce275dda9620216fbcf60bbcb63a37c9dd8","861896800900a787ab03a2c1eed750bebb9d024b3b7120c15551d86bcbc1bbe1","5e47730bc705746ab156af13b99be5879974a97f30934100d5f5f695dd28794f","1b2ae018ce5650c1d217eaa8b072604b86bdf3ea3655c48a684e7df0f8a9fcba","049262018685c95dd92541afebb86857578c4d8898143e29f2bd2323a270ca66","8acd6131bd635403b58064078e758a61e111c0aa1d4a4d09f7e88d6814632451","3e22845b347d3015510afc538a92af090f5012cd6dbc2d5e3771e8659efcfbd4","bf0e7815e2e0d7d10825f0f20bb9bc92a4f90bfd7e9133c1a36734f4a880e082","b733c4ed3e65771ee13e1ee5a78d98821cdcc375e4bf6ad607966a31da4b2764","1477f941b9cbb9be93f65ef821c784488efd80df8759fcbc8ee5617c599458cd","991bc674a2c9e79dc91f0537ad073c55054d0ef38dc4b7e7db599cd4677038d8","42b23086cb7ef3dfc6301232de3b3d5053daa178d387b8eca2bd44af0d403d82","27d087967d577c7e62960a9a4352f5f7beb0d625fe0d4b5bd0d6d246f8464169"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4920,4943],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p4920"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the plmn-Identity to the PLMN selected by upper layers (see TS 24.501 [23]) from the PLMN(s) included in the plmn-IdentityInfoList in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":4944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the measResultFailedCell to include the global cell identity, tracking area code, the cell level and SS/PBCH block level RSRP, and RSRQ, and SS/PBCH block indexes, of the failed cell based on the available SSB measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected connection resume failure;","paragraph_zero_based":4945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if available, set the measResultNeighCells, in order of decreasing ranking-criterion as used for cell re-selection, to include neighbouring cell measurements for at most the following number of neighbouring cells: 6 intra-frequency and 3 inter-frequency neighbours per frequency as well as 3 inter-RAT neighbours, per frequency/ set of frequencies per RAT and according to the following:","paragraph_zero_based":4946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each neighbour cell included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":4947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The UE includes the latest results of the available measurements as used for cell reselection evaluation, which are performed in accordance with the performance requirements as specified in TS 38.133 [14].","paragraph_zero_based":4948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if available, set the locationInfo as in 5.3.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":4949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set perRAInfoList to indicate the performed random access procedure related information as specified in 5.7.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":4950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if numberOfConnFail is smaller than 8:","paragraph_zero_based":4951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>increment the numberOfConnFail by 1;","paragraph_zero_based":4952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause 'RRC Resume failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":4953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if upon receiving integrity check failure indication from lower layers while T319 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":4954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause 'RRC Resume failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":4955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if indication from the MCG RLC that the maximum number of retransmissions has been reached is received while SDT procedure is ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":4956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if random access problem indication is received from MCG MAC while SDT procedure is ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":4957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the lower layers indicate that cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer or the configuredGrantTimer expired before receiving network response for the UL CG-SDT transmission with CCCH message while SDT procedure is ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":4958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if integrity check failure indication is received from lower layers while SDT procedure is ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":4959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T319a expires:","paragraph_zero_based":4960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider SDT procedure is not ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":4961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause 'RRC Resume failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":4962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE may discard the connection resume failure or connection establishment failure information, i.e. release the UE variable VarConnEstFailReport and the UE variable VarConnEstFailReportList, 48 hours after the last connection resume failure is detected.","paragraph_zero_based":4963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE either indicates to upper layers (to trigger PC5 unicast link release) or sends NotificationMessageSidelink message to the connected L2 U2N Remote UE(s) in accordance with 5.8.9.10.","paragraph_zero_based":4964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.6Cell re-selection or cell selection or L2 U2N relay (re)selection while T390, T319 or T302 is running or SDT procedure is ongoing (UE in RRC_INACTIVE) or SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE is configured","paragraph_zero_based":4965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if cell reselection occurs while T319 or T302 is running or while SDT procedure is ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":4967}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["db1418d304672f248a825cf2d4def27566de79c2b4ff699d80c86892aa08602a","ae8c502aa25fa5c940a7a3cb59bbb8a7ce5032d24d63e9d1462ba2a4e4a061ee","94099f5ea5c441aa8437450a0ecac78e9cdbd6d465f86bc23ac45bd27a75d5c6","4603e3962827ca4afdb10a2a4859e7bd036b4093b1c4c95765489c170cd2ca1e","db98231dddcc3016299bb74730bb9178ff168291cbdc4839ee4ac91492023813","017b0f3383ca1420967bc439a6cd80df48d7db029745ad6f68abfc804690ec76","36034213f29e88105ad19c8f3097f488988778014fd7431240e4952f84c80f19","01c64199183f618f012c8db42c0748357102aaed4f61ef126d170bd1eaf244ca","2aad05b2d038610fdeb54da2fce7e8f61cf4477873c9785e0ffda9e216e38297","832a3a582e9368d4a538f7af891a1a2e9f9d62ca53d24c3f231697ff1c116705","b75e9ad78b9c289abe8e5fb03f1971e12e58b75cad266226b8d862af753a3703","606a66fb28d03a62643f0dc71516126dad2b74a6845f5e474bddaa107220002a","c4434277a3ae1210a9a98d2635b60aa662e177fa19158bd3b665fde6cb127ba0","0998aa18b06d662c9dfa43cb6e95723887a225a4b4371dfb5d0404df1055d0f5","bfc71b6e0966c3b2470aac9baba08722a490ffe828e6d1f351efd2e462fb86ed","518325320df7fea7bd023059940af9dcea5453453b9cd41a96e811b60fd70d01","a73f1e85247629a8226e3ccb4f6da86c21b8801679cb4ee29cc191b2ff22c766","9d381b8ce63d7d064eb21934281b54e96b3444147ab03af998d1e742acaebce5","4ee314cfec635ae860af0e6f57a732e635d1e371976e64b078efe397ca575c56","5dcaeaab9e0a6cf943f25ca89bbf265500669d85178d90094d9dce80bfed070a","243b2a5df15bd00d2213bcab92f0dce811ff39ac3f7ac32668e9fd7680454e70","45d1d3b6470c3e80e04dec5465b79b63574585576d8f28b7d57feaa0d268417d","b6110dea154dcd000fb146575aa961f5db7909f3e67d891cf292a2079496adaa","555bb2d81cbe043b36393de8b7ac027f13ff356d00879dbeea65dbae124e13ef"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4944,4967],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p4944"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if relay reselection occurs while T319 is running; or","paragraph_zero_based":4968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if cell changes due to relay reselection while T302 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":4969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause 'RRC Resume failure';","paragraph_zero_based":4970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if cell selection or reselection occurs while T390 is running, or cell change due to relay selection or reselection occurs while T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":4971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":4972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4.","paragraph_zero_based":4973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if cell reselection occurs when srs-PosRRC-Inactive is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":4974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to the lower layer to stop inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":4975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the srs-PosRRC-Inactive.","paragraph_zero_based":4976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if cell reselection occurs when srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaPreConfig or srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaNonPreConfig is configured and if there is an on-going SRS for positioning transmission procedure in RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":4977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the selected cell is not included in the srs-PosConfigValidityArea:","paragraph_zero_based":4978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate to the lower layer to stop inactivePosSRS-ValidityAreaTAT;","paragraph_zero_based":4979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate RRC connection resume procedure in 5.3.13.2;","paragraph_zero_based":4980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the cell is included in the srs-PosConfigValidityArea:","paragraph_zero_based":4981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the selected cell and the previously camped cell are in the same srs-PosConfigValidityArea;","paragraph_zero_based":4982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if autonomousTA-AdjustmentEnabled is configured;","paragraph_zero_based":4983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>indicate to the lower layer to update Timing Advance and stored RSRP provided the Timing Advance validation requirements specified in clause 5.6.6.3 of TS 38.133 [14] is met;","paragraph_zero_based":4984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>instruct lower layers to continue transmitting SRS if Timing Advance validation condition as specified in TS 38.321 [3] are satisfied;","paragraph_zero_based":4985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the selected cell and previously camped cell are in the different srs-PosConfigValidityArea;","paragraph_zero_based":4986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate RRC connection resume procedure in 5.3.13.2;","paragraph_zero_based":4987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the SRS configuration srs-PosConfigValidityArea corresponding to the validity area of the selected cell and instruct lower layers to initiate SRS transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":4988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.7Reception of the RRCSetup by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":4989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the RRC connection setup procedure as specified in 5.3.3.4.","paragraph_zero_based":4991}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2d63a28a872a24c49c918891caa0d4af154dfd9a2e11d77a3033d2c854a1adc5","f688cae10da64db2195f7333520945ecbbea5cacd242d6525e8f8a842c55cf18","1d36dd3c1b7995d51bdc3dd057172e063bbeb23e9eef2256de250285f641a27f","c8b6ba1ce0db6c2a3603270ea8985a51e021958b839d261b00b984b7c07d8ede","b6ca053d683daccc0f434a8ec0a77befb3764ebd34cc669026e076be3ba32990","9959f95ce26cead77afd24cbb9e7be233c4766cfd96a0c7758ec751d206c89c3","dad69cd373d45215417212635fea13805ebd3f952f205ebf26b0c930cbe1179c","8fc6cd879e75a9e3396fdaa9197d343d87c2e4966e74444543c7caefa210dcdb","fc65da35421299065dcedb7029db5f0be4b66aacf7761c1a11ee17500610fd1d","6eba29f25d533afcfd0f01b205b0cc4f3c5662ae994b31f8f5495830dd3ad241","fda9c59cb383858c064837ec58f8438492e90031dc8fd33d03566415e956dffb","5a3e8d347e526e6b369cb9134ad7b2fbaa899fe3b01f5e8326067e2142b3b1c1","b0739a9e442b1576d70aa5c83e552651064845b3a2518c6f62b8bf0c7a565939","b2fdc3f629c08741c83fe60903a387f3ad3736ba51a51fd7ae3c5f0b26317708","732101f81eae283b89d42f3e94dd6a004342c49e4f2fb4bae311d81c0eb8c644","38ec6587099529e8b6f6d0ef02d0ed799ba722bbbc2083bf0b71ae841be7158d","0ec5101241e67292d967fe1a58069a774df884d2270f646c2af6b7f0f023850a","c97e0a4314d9816c959f86be6d4add039b567f24dbcd90aee12bf76d484bc088","237452b6f10b443045414c0febb08a9f35a61611d18f15eea545796fb55e73df","9361ec06d7c679dd81a737fc7b79aebcd65d52fa10f1b14c2c75d99c819a1411","b0872f2ee5fe2555abd0ee11bd0cef266db1bafd1d0385f5200a56dbd22f545f","cde7793c6e89c05e0d00df9cc445bbcffa564c711569490ff9433979e827dda1","0ba3412a5b15a43c6021aed404863434b69399869a280a5d9443c72bf9f068f7","9d26890358f11a73096135ef1df8c18bc869c19f42031df2fc1e9ec041e52a21"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4968,4991],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p4968"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.8RNA update","paragraph_zero_based":4992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In RRC_INACTIVE state, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T380 expires; or","paragraph_zero_based":4994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if RNA Update is triggered at reception of SIB1, as specified in 5.2.2.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":4995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if T319 is not running and SDT procedure is not ongoing:","paragraph_zero_based":4996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate RRC connection resume procedure in 5.3.13.2 with resumeCause set to rna-Update;","paragraph_zero_based":4997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if barring is alleviated for Access Category '8' or Access Category '2', as specified in 5.3.14.4:","paragraph_zero_based":4998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if upper layers do not request RRC the resumption of an RRC connection, and","paragraph_zero_based":4999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the variable pendingRNA-Update is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":5000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate RRC connection resume procedure in 5.3.13.2 with resumeCause value set to rna-Update.","paragraph_zero_based":5001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE in RRC_INACTIVE state fails to find a suitable cell and camps on the acceptable cell to obtain limited service as defined in TS 38.304 [20], the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause 'other'.","paragraph_zero_based":5003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:It is left to UE implementation how to behave when T380 expires while the UE is camped neither on a suitable nor on an acceptable cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.9Reception of the RRCRelease by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":5005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.8.","paragraph_zero_based":5007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.10Reception of the RRCReject by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":5008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.15.","paragraph_zero_based":5010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.11Inability to comply with RRCResume","paragraph_zero_based":5011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is unable to comply with (part of) the configuration included in the RRCResume message;","paragraph_zero_based":5013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause ′RRC Resume failure′.","paragraph_zero_based":5014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE may apply above failure handling also in case the RRCResume message causes a protocol error for which the generic error handling as defined in 10 specifies that the UE shall ignore the message.","paragraph_zero_based":5015}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b68df208414c7ac84c65283048554f37dd961983017636b2ec6f338e71770a59","5f10df7c7c7e5b233260347a05e927e2007ca94b1d099e1d7c0f6779c64e723f","0b521cda6447762d8ae464b6842e9be9645a574a0cb763089c54c23a78057b2b","eceaaa993a80f4920f85b490b72c11ef1fb57f2ef6e2499da13876627b92245b","d42e5768ff967a75333aad36406c7541cbb487b9921082aa9ffb63159cf5dda5","3d41393f0b5c88fa66b5cc746039db9b3bb8922aa8bdc62bab638fc1a0c93766","5bac767ad8a748603dd5af1b70a2b95f8e2b2979c67297eb4c3005614c609b3b","7e65f9821ce80e9f29f02627c4bd0d2efff80b5a14f15619ac7d8f90a9219e2c","c2e558216789c5bbd20850c27b60f5b56052f6d94f5d22abc7f7ecc00b1efa50","0265763b59cc12d3f8a0804ef796997e92b5ad33c2e66d5d214440161382c5ff","e755548faa69749989131609ccc30314cb5d84abcacb5f30bfe18a273e7290b7","27c6c93d5d423d0187064cd4444f4c241795db721ab76b441c4cd6f47c4ed916","5709d6179b352873834f3387ec6cccd0c5e655c21ddd05ce89dc36fcdd409df2","5d40068e1e9846c56ef94403a25903ee6f6925bb033e796870e31a56f88f7d6f","ca5e941698325ec2cd435fcb63e7e2fd6876b038538526bcd64e9e43dd6be93f","c3e748140f1ba485f1fd6241fc69daee73a49eadd08926e28029bde2947fc0fc","db875bcf26fe954affc7cb2c8e45fecad988d7b4abb7ffa8427ba10473356659","f0487cdabdf5f18ecbb425f0ad9e6bc71e92212b69deae8665baf2d42f816b5c","8f53bdf18fcfe05e09a3f924ea3566f183d02205b7a3c9d5f1c5e1018a49b18c","e3f687480ef9a7b57d289ae2d15660a34215d4d421a37576b37836b4622c2c52","225a81355d434a10c492bcf28155ef02700373f924dfa576ba3af059e0c919b0","0e1435b7df055a2a48ca2a0791069af426821574199381df5ec8cfd9135e88f2","27a8fb4fbb4ff8a8e6a3e14524f7c20be6fe26bdfbd8803c7036e41ef02a7508","d5931af346c78db25df1247691b59e88bb3155702de4a492ef1d943367ee6f93"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4992,5015],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p4992"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:If the UE is configured (i.e., via SIB1) to send MUSIM temporary capability restriction indication, and if the UE supports MUSIM temporary capability restriction, the UE does not apply above failure handling in case the UE is unable to apply (part of) the configuration resulting from RRCResume message due to UE temporary capability restriction for MUSIM operation. If UE does not go to RRC_IDLE in this case, UE still considers the configuration resulting from the RRCResume message as the current configuration as the baseline for delta configuration for future reconfigurations. It is up to UE implementation how to apply RRCResume message. For other cases, if the UE is unable to comply with part of the configuration, it does not apply any (part of) the configuration, i.e. there is no partial success/failure.","paragraph_zero_based":5016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.12Inter RAT cell reselection","paragraph_zero_based":5017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reselecting to an inter-RAT cell, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11, with release cause 'other'.","paragraph_zero_based":5019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.14Unified Access Control","paragraph_zero_based":5020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.14.1General","paragraph_zero_based":5021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to perform access barring check for an access attempt associated with a given Access Category and one or more Access Identities upon request from upper layers according to TS 24.501 [23] or the RRC layer. This procedure does not apply to IAB-MT and NCR-MT. This procedure does not apply to L2 U2N Relay UE initiating RRC connection establishment or RRC connection resume upon reception of any message from a L2 U2N remote UE via SL-RLC0 or SL-RLC1 in accordance to 5.3.3.1a or 5.3.13.1a.","paragraph_zero_based":5022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"After a PCell change in RRC_CONNECTED the UE shall defer access barring checks until it has obtained SIB1 (as specified in 5.2.2.2) from the target cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.14.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":5024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiation of the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if timer T390 is running for the Access Category:","paragraph_zero_based":5026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the access attempt as barred;","paragraph_zero_based":5027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if timer T302 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":5028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the Access Category is neither '2' nor '0'; or","paragraph_zero_based":5029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the Access Category is '0' for RRC resumption triggered by multicast reception as specified in 5.3.13.2:","paragraph_zero_based":5030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the access attempt as barred;","paragraph_zero_based":5031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the Access Category is '0':","paragraph_zero_based":5033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the access attempt as allowed;","paragraph_zero_based":5034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB1 includes uac-BarringPerPLMN-List that contains a UAC-BarringPerPLMN for the selected PLMN or SNPN:","paragraph_zero_based":5036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the procedure in 5.2.2.4.2 for a selected PLMN resulted in use of information in npn-IdentityInfoList and UAC-BarringPerPLMN has an entry with the plmn-IdentityIndex corresponding to used information in this list:","paragraph_zero_based":5037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the UAC-BarringPerPLMN entry with the plmn-IdentityIndex corresponding to used information in the npn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":5038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5039}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["801a9d25d3e0f1448c741828d22d11ccfe1520a2904ee93e208093e34ddaa157","a499d1627ccbc763fded52cab04e2007506e97540129c90777e86ccc3e0cb824","8459f056b47ba0d3b941cfd3ba408158dd95b6b0f2666544fba06ad4527a656f","969baa78f9d464c6f0a740640f8c1b797943fe3975dda997cff40941b7341e31","83887444a67a5a87130e93aaf0be6dfe4423b21f041c00aec2109fac4ca2f39b","5ffc729c402602cf0e2b5911244a6f54ed28f1158d4229031802ca73eedffcf0","ff332fd2c9a660f3a05187c8106bc76cfc19ed417ce19a27469367028348ed03","1d4b76faef5d2a5713079f9cd8fcebc058095182b1059e3921e09d80f4e247ad","8c3f4483e4d336250e7eb2b7525461fd23a1d916209275956495fc60152c6bba","deed883b661119c19c02a49877abebdd95795a3595b7d657bfb91eec471f7c7c","d08a341c4472754e7e822831be154d211463c1f9d6883eebf1283d6b9d94ca7a","4fc05448cfc349c162a07bc1963538c13258f5025607157286f176b6088d4c3a","9425dcbfae809eb383ca517258ce9fd77288662b7265fbafb1f4aec525f14f8a","a903ba308108079146abae4724c78d4dbe85b318ad3bca884749a58ab7fe691c","8a6104fde2ae945482a9cace0cb6287b6d3c2e394f4f9307d593e3fb3420dc0b","c62271aaf47191ea8fc4f27a8fae7d5c80c7071664b7c9552adff0e3ee40be21","9877f28441bb5d0215d4e122817b256f61974a6d148b9c45d95e35337e979b9e","119a839c55b9db67c06f58a26ead032a6e25ec24f102078629018432532eca91","b12e30b8253999c31c5c55c4281e270356e79aea6a5161877d3403b9475d2d24","2a4d6caf157834e98b1556bc150deec349bc1b6ae363a65421561448cc7e22ff","b93124b65dcc7e72225b8aa04dd017f86beb52a0b5aac439ea42555776c2653e","aba9c4f757722a42e1b51cf78f9448f4782ad6f5a5cf761057a7235a05b4fecd","71f7b4d5fe8f936523add1187bbe1cb642e8de72f709700e3a2eb71a0e5377c4","30254c72793e13a3fb2103a3ecca763d3238600b3d825b2a3be4a1dcd9373775"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[5016,5039],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p5016"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the UAC-BarringPerPLMN entry with the plmn-IdentityIndex corresponding to the selected PLMN and the PLMN-IdentityInfo, if any, or the selected SNPN and the npn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":5040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if any UAC-BarringPerPLMN entry is selected:","paragraph_zero_based":5041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>in the remainder of this procedure, use the selected UAC-BarringPerPLMN entry (i.e. presence or absence of access barring parameters in this entry) irrespective of the uac-BarringForCommon included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":5042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if SIB1 includes uac-BarringForCommon:","paragraph_zero_based":5043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>in the remainder of this procedure use the uac-BarringForCommon (i.e. presence or absence of these parameters) included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":5044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the access attempt as allowed;","paragraph_zero_based":5046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if uac-BarringForCommon is applicable or the uac-ACBarringListType indicates that uac-ExplicitACBarringList is used:","paragraph_zero_based":5047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the corresponding UAC-BarringPerCatList contains a UAC-BarringPerCat entry corresponding to the Access Category:","paragraph_zero_based":5048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the UAC-BarringPerCat entry;","paragraph_zero_based":5049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the uac-BarringInfoSetList contains a UAC-BarringInfoSet entry corresponding to the selected uac-barringInfoSetIndex in the UAC-BarringPerCat:","paragraph_zero_based":5050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>select the UAC-BarringInfoSet entry;","paragraph_zero_based":5051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>perform access barring check for the Access Category as specified in 5.3.14.5, using the selected UAC-BarringInfoSet as \"UAC barring parameter\";","paragraph_zero_based":5052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>consider the access attempt as allowed;","paragraph_zero_based":5054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the access attempt as allowed;","paragraph_zero_based":5056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the uac-ACBarringListType indicates that uac-ImplicitACBarringList is used:","paragraph_zero_based":5057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>select the uac-BarringInfoSetIndex corresponding to the Access Category in the uac-ImplicitACBarringList;","paragraph_zero_based":5058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the uac-BarringInfoSetList contains the UAC-BarringInfoSet entry corresponding to the selected uac-BarringInfoSetIndex:","paragraph_zero_based":5059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the UAC-BarringInfoSet entry;","paragraph_zero_based":5060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform access barring check for the Access Category as specified in 5.3.14.5, using the selected UAC-BarringInfoSet as \"UAC barring parameter\";","paragraph_zero_based":5061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the access attempt as allowed;","paragraph_zero_based":5063}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["27b91b70bc03d0b9339e4