{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each measObjectId included in the received measObjectToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":5424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if an entry with the matching measObjectId exists in the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig, for this entry:","paragraph_zero_based":5425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the entry with the value received for this measObject, except for the fields cellsToAddModList, excludedCellsToAddModList, allowedCellsToAddModList, cellsToRemoveList, excludedCellsToRemoveList, allowedCellsToRemoveList, tx-PoolMeasToRemoveList, tx-PoolMeasToAddModList, ssb-PositionQCL-CellsToRemoveList, ssb-PositionQCL-CellsToAddModList, cca-CellsToRemoveList, and cca-CellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":5426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the cellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":5427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each physCellId included in the cellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":5428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching physCellId from the cellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":5429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the cellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":5430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each physCellId value included in the cellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":5431},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if an entry with the matching physCellId exists in the cellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":5432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>replace the entry with the value received for this physCellId;","paragraph_zero_based":5433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>add a new entry for the received physCellId to the cellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":5435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the excludedCellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":5436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each pci-RangeIndex included in the excludedCellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":5437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching pci-RangeIndex from the excludedCellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":5438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:For each pci-RangeIndex included in the excludedCellsToRemoveList that concerns overlapping ranges of cells, a cell is removed from the exclude-list of cells only if all PCI ranges containing it are removed.","paragraph_zero_based":5439},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the excludedCellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":5440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each pci-RangeIndex included in the excludedCellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":5441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if an entry with the matching pci-RangeIndex is included in the excludedCellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":5442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>replace the entry with the value received for this pci-RangeIndex;","paragraph_zero_based":5443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>add a new entry for the received pci-RangeIndex to the excludedCellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":5445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the allowedCellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":5446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each pci-RangeIndex included in the allowedCellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":5447}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861