{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching pci-RangeIndex from the allowedCellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":5448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE2:For each pci-RangeIndex included in the allowedCellsToRemoveList that concerns overlapping ranges of cells, a cell is removed from the allow-list of cells only if all PCI ranges containing it are removed.","paragraph_zero_based":5449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the allowedCellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":5450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each pci-RangeIndex included in the allowedCellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":5451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if an entry with the matching pci-RangeIndex is included in the allowedCellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":5452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>replace the entry with the value received for this pci-RangeIndex;","paragraph_zero_based":5453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>add a new entry for the received pci-RangeIndex to the allowedCellsToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":5455},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each measId associated with this measObjectId in the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig, if any:","paragraph_zero_based":5456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE does not support Uplink PDCP delay measurements upon MO update; or","paragraph_zero_based":5457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports Uplink PDCP delay measurements upon MO update and if ul-DelayValueConfig or ul-ExcessDelayConfig is not configured for the associated reportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":5458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the measurement reporting entry for this measId from the VarMeasReportList, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":5459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>stop the periodical reporting timer or timer T321 or timer T322, whichever one is running, and reset the associated information (e.g. timeToTrigger) for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the tx-PoolMeasToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":5461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each transmission resource pool indicated in tx-PoolMeasToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":5462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching identity of the transmission resource pool from the tx-PoolMeasToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":5463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the tx-PoolMeasToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":5464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each transmission resource pool indicated in tx-PoolMeasToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":5465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if an entry with the matching identity of the transmission resource pool exists in the tx-PoolMeasToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":5466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>replace the entry with the value received for this transmission resource pool;","paragraph_zero_based":5467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>add a new entry for the received identity of the transmission resource pool to the tx-PoolMeasToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":5469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the ssb-PositionQCL-CellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":5470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each physCellId included in the ssb-PositionQCL-CellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":5471}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sh