{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop the periodical reporting timer for this measId, if running","paragraph_zero_based":5929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the reportType is set to eventTriggered and if the eventId is set to eventD1 or eventD2 or eventH1 or eventH2 and if the entering condition applicable for this event, i.e. the event corresponding with the eventId of the corresponding reportConfig within VarMeasConfig, is fulfilled during timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarMeasConfig, while the VarMeasReportList does not include a measurement reporting entry for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":5930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":5932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":5933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the reportType is set to eventTriggered and if the eventId is set to eventD1 or eventD2 or eventH1 or eventH2 and if the leaving condition applicable for this event is fulfilled for the associated VarMeasReport within the VarMeasReportList for this measId during timeToTrigger defined within the VarMeasConfig for this event:","paragraph_zero_based":5934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if reportOnLeave is set to true for the corresponding reporting configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":5935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":5936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the periodical reporting timer for this measId, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":5938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":5939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reportType is set to periodical and if a (first) measurement result is available:","paragraph_zero_based":5940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":5942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the corresponding reportConfig includes measRSSI-ReportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":5943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure as specified in 5.5.5 immediately when RSSI sample values are reported by the physical layer after the first L1 measurement duration;","paragraph_zero_based":5944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the corresponding reportConfig includes the ul-DelayValueConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":5945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after a first measurement result is provided from lower layers of the associated DRB identity;","paragraph_zero_based":5946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the corresponding reportConfig includes the ul-ExcessDelayConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":5947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after a first measurement result is provided from lower layers of the associated DRB identity(ies) according to the configured threshold per DRB identity(ies);","paragraph_zero_based":5948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the reportAmount exceeds 1:","paragraph_zero_based":5949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for the NR SpCell or for the serving L2 U2N Relay UE (if the UE is a L2 U2N Remote UE);","paragraph_zero_based":5950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e. the reportAmount is equal to 1):","paragraph_zero_based":5951}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bf8ce3b230387f0441ea2dad4f26428492601434e716facaeb7f88f12bce639d","a53168b3940616855c27f50a21d5811d73a06c3525e21e9fe8064be4ae137780","e85953b85d0dc322bc863ee4c7c5c15d74a032e278cfaed804b053b2ed70251d","ade280850f3d9d0a3302ca3f011cab301065c0dbbf359ada41490b6ab83a3056","dcb51c30f1b598997a4f6f8ff27e2d78f9d688c2187101cdeaf2872e10d846c2","2d990ceec6058f12bf69840bd3766a8ef928e08ddca071ae23648ca2b780a359","8f5a242ff83263477ba9aaa6778bb6a94b9319b39b020fd3949c6e8dbfecca63","c6d05da2f8fb899585f654b86bd73f4eab89cc57e27e2ac58a9cd9d37e44737d","338ef88ae892461c3e4ac84cd5a0f80296bfbcc40614d272405fdddc270ee485","132b480ea0b7a02900fecebc2f4851990740c034c39710fda2aeb6d033c3bc28","cd96f5a5b9508957a44d62e5c83eb7d200709a936ad214307084d5359d4c1f7e","d06bafcb2fb3aa58d087d593f8ace0110323c7ca3d1aff7a83f0bf3ed51a6034","4050108b3b6345fac35143efbdf244c6d812bdcfbd8e0fe4527deb0ef50ca7ec","d7022a0cc22ea9695d452ed3248d63726cc158acde86b74be898a3aa46c30be5","566af583c0429c778169ac970cc3dc29c5ff79fff0002f99a122497dc7d1b0a1","063f0e84ca78ed007998ec32f78335846a7953aa54638af49c1acaa7