{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for the NR SpCell and for the strongest cell among the applicable cells, or for the NR SpCell and for the strongest L2 U2N Relay UEs among the applicable L2 U2N Relay UEs; or initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for the serving L2 U2N Relay UE and for the strongest cell among the applicable cells, or for the serving L2 U2N Relay UE and for the strongest L2 U2N Relay UEs among the applicable L2 U2N Relay UEs (if the UE is a L2 U2N Remote UE);","paragraph_zero_based":5952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if, in case the corresponding reportConfig concerns the reporting for NR sidelink communication/discovery, reportType is set to periodical and if a (first) measurement result is available:","paragraph_zero_based":5953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":5955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for the NR SpCell and CBR measurement results become available;","paragraph_zero_based":5956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reportType is set to cli-EventTriggered and if the entry condition applicable for this event, i.e. the event corresponding with the eventId of the corresponding reportConfig within VarMeasConfig, is fulfilled for one or more applicable CLI measurement resources for all measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarMeasConfig, while the VarMeasReportList does not include a measurement reporting entry for this measId (a first CLI measurement resource triggers the event):","paragraph_zero_based":5957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":5959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the concerned CLI measurement resource(s) in the cli-TriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":5961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the reportType is set to cli-EventTriggered and if the entry condition applicable for this event, i.e. the event corresponding with the eventId of the corresponding reportConfig within VarMeasConfig, is fulfilled for one or more CLI measurement resources not included in the cli-TriggeredList for all measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarMeasConfig (a subsequent CLI measurement resource triggers the event):","paragraph_zero_based":5962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":5963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the concerned CLI measurement resource(s) in the cli-TriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":5965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reportType is set to cli-EventTriggered and if the leaving condition applicable for this event is fulfilled for one or more of the CLI measurement resources included in the cli-TriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId for all measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during timeToTrigger defined within the VarMeasConfig for this event:","paragraph_zero_based":5966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the concerned CLI measurement resource(s) in the cli-TriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if reportOnLeave is set to true for the corresponding reporting configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":5968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":5969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cli-TriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId is empty:","paragraph_zero_based":5970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop the periodical reporting timer for this measId, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":5972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reportType is set to cli-Periodical and if a (first) measurement result is available:","paragraph_zero_based":5973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":5975}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fc2fb0a164e1687562c24aa30b4af172565216d7db7007aba9d964ad166a1430","57d2224f15e8745f329b47e7cb5c82220d57dfc1c57a2c67be7d5ce0bd526e17","eb6d5793c14b42f0984c8116134087f5a8f571b19f2882e79b05ef7d87418eaa","15e7c695deb29e5db6b6539b6b819db97bd77ae6bbfc6cf4268b8937b588a68e","cf5b3e6a9547f1b7c9ea7185d8e3afa59ffed800b389864a5c76e9aec4bae285","3836a7b7a9a8abf12ee7856e474685b5e0925767b598d0f9e4e0a385151daa11","75abccd9124119f1b8925158247dea98113975f18f47f6aad767c3db48170235","f9262297d03bbfcf758125acb3918354029843ad57c115f2fc4b34c6b2e9d20d","dbbf2264f6a5dcd40964d4d89d4c444594cf2fc4a69212dfe2b4a5e7c2836752","3470fca0cd38f0d663213318c33c293c56a42f01ebbd7f8d6cd6ae8042162d9a","fcb90927b7ef35d64fbf1700fa3dd80aea19753abd92a200dad7256e7ed83714","83572b03e9cab445eb69a298afdd4f2f295edf8c9a10e760d5778e31278f608c","22ed836f16fd254452740c5c43acce245b50b8ae38ab42aa58400542186b7f27","d1ce50d99fa8b5b69ee22342e5477a2598cc5a0eb3d513279ea6daf74e0f076b","64fb84f49770a87190afce610c8bbbb25cd2c8183445d656ea8bde21b348aea2","de048c6b23d8978a627e9c674362ca0d9792973abf4237f82f2c11154a866a88","eafaaa5c299c8c431c6b41f2b4b5b46fe68fdc31494cc8c659b037d8ef2c31e9","7fe67ca03b4e3901109919ff0c16965d847efbc49237179a723274187469b15b","c51366978e1dfcf5d07213fe4923f01ced1538196136d242e5bc31ac9f3d79d8","bfce37314c8b21ddf6077b07c6e848d8eb721cf393d5bcc639fb7929bf86626d","c1babc6c42fb796764a90bd86122695bd4429e22adb1fd5a834924b9ed884e43","2182729c43f8fd9cb458e6438e09980251cdfba47566d9db6a10f17bb94b802e","aa404aac2e8cbbe26e976573063cd0c10ed4d56a2384ec6bcbb8c9e1e47b1ef8","a37599d305287842efdd10d20a20f96ec8b930f45f4f3567f6dc00d0cffea4d8"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[5952,5975],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p5952"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for at least one CLI measurement resource;","paragraph_zero_based":5976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reportType is set to rxTxPeriodical and if a (first) measurement result is available:","paragraph_zero_based":5977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":5979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":5980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon expiry of the periodical reporting timer for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":5981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5.","paragraph_zero_based":5982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the corresponding reportConfig includes a reportType is set to reportSFTD:","paragraph_zero_based":5983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the corresponding measObject concerns NR:","paragraph_zero_based":5984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the drx-SFTD-NeighMeas is included:","paragraph_zero_based":5985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the quantity to be reported becomes available for each requested pair of PCell and NR cell:","paragraph_zero_based":5986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>stop timer T322;","paragraph_zero_based":5987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":5988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else","paragraph_zero_based":5989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for each requested pair of PCell and NR cell or the maximal measurement reporting delay as specified in TS 38.133 [14];","paragraph_zero_based":5990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the corresponding measObject concerns E-UTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":5991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for the pair of PCell and E-UTRA PSCell or the maximal measurement reporting delay as specified in TS 38.133 [14];","paragraph_zero_based":5992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reportType is set to reportCGI:","paragraph_zero_based":5993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE acquired the SIB1 or SystemInformationBlockType1 for the requested cell; or","paragraph_zero_based":5994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE detects that the requested NR cell is not transmitting SIB1 (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 13):","paragraph_zero_based":5995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T321;","paragraph_zero_based":5996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":5998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":5999}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["819c8fe1386328e9851d4e499d68f594045076de2c32b4b20033b47050610e54","9dcc697eb562396745ba5fdc9b9d69526b233a40d724a345d430c94ba7801836","93183d201520f9d798d2293864dbb5a33454247f2b6bc46edcedf8a6631d8275","30a332ea2ce06cf18ca1f805157898004c2baf9dc67e724cafde661576cdae9f","47670d384808193363bdae6eca4ddc291cc1282b762a08277af8d57b4cfb370d","5bf9beba96be4564bc71aa8b945ca409acc97b21e167ac9aef5a90ca430e00bc","e81df8b06294b49d08ae9bd802090d094b6cb2f3864c4bc1764ceb869d6cc01d","6cb14d4af9088c8b9243d8600fcde2861afe3cfc8a25ca054fa90fc9bfe6a53d","a02da53710463e95fa20950234c9903a89844654c0929eef88a212af5ac02397","b03b6103011a346fda5881d7c790da02f1109f18eeed2e7720bf265a79b2f6ae","cd57ab5e9e01f05b137d59409578383f328a4b226476ffd3488ddcb6826e8a96","6afda45ebc59ca6a3e11a5172c2f2e9258889a3d87dd2672f7d0ec82e750fe47","d72c96fb4bc9938c97eee469941e10d7af31501e78ee7560670f56514d3213e4","ab60485f6785a7ca3daca06b793f9913d77bda663bafd24d7ee5b160e6c8d21b","8506f1ae087dbbb9c01acb9a8211c7b64ae7a5d976ff07c20b3c4fa92bc828b4","c21476dd38b60d9688448f710bdfe186c2f42e4e9221e9bcf9541b8bad34ef87","25f996771d4fa45d52bf8513bd200a648083a46a70269bc076ba86ad17ba563c","12e0a79f8b52cae0b949fa382718ef03a79bd593c03c88795bc818e7ac50eca8","5cc0b99c8752a57a221ab31a22fab9f2025fe878ca60d24a16226f6f74996076","b306ec103630fe7c2717b656b0d76f692143c758d22c518287d730a5cb8cc0af","9008aa85592d9f62aec0ac3c1b682621e477d0f6075392331a27dc2beb66c02b","f74d20a2bbec0823cd409d292dde2ad7a9b7e7d5d1d374a923be1fe6c7b63903","63b3d0e6286d3a983546ad25fe6a004add622825e240d5782cec5e12484c0124","2ca8ea5d30dfc094ccf7be2babd07b1c0b5ab811bb5c19defe44582d2fbf57e7"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[5976,5999],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p5976"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon the expiry of T321 for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":6000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":6001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":6002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5.","paragraph_zero_based":6003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon the expiry of T322 for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":6004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5.","paragraph_zero_based":6005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If AS security has been activated successfully and if SCell activation(s) indication is received from lower layer, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if reportType is set to reportOnActivation for any measId included in the measIdList within VarMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":6007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the activated SCell(s) fulfills the measurement requirement as specified in TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":6008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":6009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":6010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5.","paragraph_zero_based":6011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.2Event A1 (Serving becomes better than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":6012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A1-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A1-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6015},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for this measurement, consider the NR serving cell corresponding to the associated measObjectNR associated with this event.","paragraph_zero_based":6016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A1-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":6017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":6018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A1-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":6019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":6020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the measurement result of the serving cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6023}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bc40000091937cbba2acd5013add17a99373e49ec804c54011f731170d6c3cc3","389c98fe0622c74714937a68773b11f3d83fedce5382e5ed691d2b36ee44c162","6194ae8ade71b6f135bbd664c5aa8e4d13227e16bd2002b2200560a16ef961b0","0e9cb98bd308d3983f35ecc990835a884beabfa3f3a97070a3b74970ee28b2e9","f2f8afbce7e7e26fa40ca520b3d7486c524837b6521005ec893cb32eef18faa6","d6e2980544375aa0e3b74c45418ef3aecad3c6d11d21b686ddce6e014c3c1980","2eef2ee99dfe029a40a35e990973a664c1f9cdcb91dce07312af30ec3992c7d7","a981de439dcb9d5d8c5af5a30a61f0d1226b8284a9b90cc87dbca37a0f1ae092","6053d1e579515180e308e3867ff58ab0ac4ae9ce632c957949096e17079f5095","098bd5791c16bd6adc1211104e1341b1bc4272cc3bf0cd2ea5414a33ddbc18c5","971a6fa2669062c90a62149e29b75558a91a1ee8cb596415543c3b54231b49d7","85290174dfe7e9c39dd35601388a943d4c6f6b0d32b7d03658750c4435aaeb75","14f2cb8a66fa50ad25758bb29f8c63d1c119db5ec731b5856c8ee98a753d7a85","371e916eff115b40feceeb5c4d5ab636682f74eeba38cb47bab8e18d38390d69","2b79f4213c0189d5bbeb3c3cc30ae4ac3337eca8fa9ec3f108e536484f3ce6ff","b80afc79ef92541a61c487d5e36b1af4e710d7e97851ea57ab8f8936194f888f","281c47e9c86c142e9104511846a63676006dd4ff0dbc5fb10fbb5f10ddba11a6","1db7136a29d86174544fe8a22d03fab4b238b0eac8eb9786445fa56ba5ed5569","a024ee2d67ecf2dc2f2f4850e1493de7c6b82701acbe2c13548dbfea6a80b969","0a15cd880fdc7b9a4b123bcb5a955ff78c13972616fa2346ad30aacb2feb960d","043d5980f91e5e560dc854840b9c3774491efea4a9fcdff4a5eef810258f47dd","24a0fc985212c18425a027a2d7cb545140e18da2fad0da5fd59d9772830798dc","32f711d7bb47279eeede2240c9181d02f0e8b7618cac7994a2bc3326cea21ef6","394d5eed87e19216d2fa5ebe4c9896e94e9f3ee6929d6eced65454905cb0ee40"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6000,6023],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p6000"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. a1-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":6025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":6026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Ms.","paragraph_zero_based":6027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.3Event A2 (Serving becomes worse than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":6028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A2-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A2-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for this measurement, consider the serving cell indicated by the measObjectNR associated to this event.","paragraph_zero_based":6032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:If the SCell indicated by the measObjectNR associated to this event is not detectable, then the UE should consider for the value of Ms the lowest value of the value range of the measurement quantity as the SCell measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":6033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A2-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":6034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":6035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A2-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":6036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":6037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the measurement result of the serving cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. a2-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":6042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":6043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Ms.","paragraph_zero_based":6044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.4Event A3 (Neighbour becomes offset better than SpCell)","paragraph_zero_based":6045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A3-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6047}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["420357197e074aaa3c386f1063fc994c3d73831900d8abb35d96e51ac47e8b1d","5b7ddb476072ef64db060cd695a04e0ef62ae2f920b32b9a3f49a72579e95f2c","d1a81ca57cae3e0e9a79e86f19829502b0e6bdca64a87447f829f59877c6ca54","c76591791d01658bb9bfcc4c7db30338df4a8dd337f127c269f8a56b20ac07c7","e9700dbf78950adf0f57daefc3dc41d9bf6c859b62dd7ff9886c1c90fca3c424","12463a65b597d86b810e7e71bf042224dfc663b7c4537e90962b56b5a2367b0a","c29400402dea0a89bbfe0f7ad999f6fe941c1ace1de9b86bf10fa198b1905a06","d180a477e8ea3555d24dc4a204ca8ac136c479c09289d4927c0078245c470632","da4f2e02ec37ca8eedc7d30c1bc5d2889efed7f193b13f78f6197285cd256c98","de8c03eb21735b88d3b85be862466693b2c1ffa6a33f5803ed0ee382ec84ca4c","1436e8b3a48e9629072621122a07707753c83de03323fbab9c60b44691af836d","626f2d194a6e122a0b70c7b7543f0c9cbdb1bf709cf789463f63eed3d1f915d5","d38fb8f455a55053ff961c0401219579b8f8e56905bb16160314a321e46970a4","8973cbc08d0e4ca9f90a85f12d28bfefd6cf0cdeffe3afeaac5458a249dcf2be","d28ec02bb6ff22738c28d7b0b8088a74f785d5c8536908e0ac4f8229acb50ad1","613d3cf9c6c3d76f56adaec210a7a1c3b858c2d2ee6d2a1e5d10469a0124d4c7","da40b7a92f8541f64585518db5caa05330887a3a2422f8893a48282f25e21231","83050c3afd79632304d1988f2f45223e54f5bc6b971ce5fadd728cfae92f9008","d4a44c64b8d1dd8c4ac5f54b0ab6a11a098faa6c3650e5db5874b0e97f5627dd","68d55a2317fdb3537ef004114eff4cc689ec5f65cb2befdbca2589ad7aae7017","597641913efd869417b8874ddc5bbc659172d22f25fd92ade6ccb1575b464d0a","128204a262e075b0030b34560ead00213ca5e6a8e98bed4c08c48847c01f108d","978e2c92f1141b44859b72332c43fb0ba2a193a6fefb1e45d05c7d0d1474ea2d","5bad954d58521c0c042accd2fe2192f2b019d7d8aa86dc7ae31370818aba9f52"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6024,6047],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p6024"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A3-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>use the SpCell for Mp, Ofp and Ocp.","paragraph_zero_based":6049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The cell(s) that triggers the event has reference signals indicated in the measObjectNR associated to this event which may be different from the NR SpCell measObjectNR.","paragraph_zero_based":6050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":6051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys > Mp + Ofp + Ocp + Off","paragraph_zero_based":6052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":6053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys < Mp + Ofp + Ocp + Off","paragraph_zero_based":6054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the neighbouring cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the reference signal of the neighbour cell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the neighbour cell).","paragraph_zero_based":6057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the frequency of the neighbour cell, or cellIndividualOffset as defined within reportConfigNR), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":6058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp is the measurement result of the SpCell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofp is the measurement object specific offset of the SpCell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the SpCell).","paragraph_zero_based":6060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocp is the cell specific offset of the SpCell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the SpCell), and is set to zero if not configured for the SpCell.","paragraph_zero_based":6061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Off is the offset parameter for this event (i.e. a3-Offset as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn, Mp are expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":6064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Ofp, Ocp, Hys, Off are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":6065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The definition of Event A3 also applies to CondEvent A3.","paragraph_zero_based":6066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.5Event A4 (Neighbour becomes better than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":6067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A4-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A4-2, as specified below, is fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":6070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A4-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":6071}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["60a222d9ed769632c32b3c74cac50eac4fd151015abaa01a922632cb6f5d2ecc","eb3df066e66855f4a7a9ed16006833bd1dd6369a7655f737b790ae330c1f9e6d","444aedebdcbedfa11209c5c2e90f7493b2b3a3d6830a9fae80a0b16013b6ec83","b9ec20f450294b603458af132833b70ee65af437217ea9a823caa4d2a241e5f4","c0a8be64df7073df667f3e334be68e3eacc8e2d948aa6025cbeff423fd0dfc64","50aa54a61d8291f6b1a1d60566b9976ffbbeb62759b3e77e0f6ba4eff2912987","0ffe034c13ceb4ebdd21fe7fd12459714c214516f443c42299061c2c6dd82ce0","5fd82410855de8512f55fa8356544d64ea4a10c09123886dcbc436d0e10d264a","0a30e0a87ed2485edf2a86d318d0cf22995533df279bc5c3c91de1f35154fa75","4f2512da5a083adee9a984dbf3a8cafe1f931d52032ffc6638f4a60d9ee793ed","3ec2ade0a6bac157f27f2b6de22d20268eaa2d195bdf0ea2f16252dc4453e292","2ca7d8856dc1d95baacc3cd4a2729008a23c1383410b9eab84c7d8a9fffbe89e","ca84ae6ff9cf7dcc7b737dcf72613cf281699cd11b2a96fddf9b058856885d29","62abeaf377308011f10abe44687d37492d88e97c8ddb1c3240b78685d9f8ea83","0517cbe4c4682a38e70c78e2146720498d3fa0386cf5f9f953016408a9bd53db","39003f3faefa3f9a81c185abe144832780a516e325383d0d05c069c5085e8a53","45d0c36982ca26f139deb912e329b038ad700beb9eebfb49b1036ba93e8cb62c","adcb71fdab9f3305187e886f9f589292ea71f00b3aac5650bd21ee0d56f86047","ef4aa57c24cbe6f6fdc07af74bdf2477eb9ea8ee76d1e254fa43526c79fd2ad2","5e7947de8d862a323d838f0b360616f6643c64af886ea6b03e33b2e036d26220","3d04956f746877e92ce1c8377628602ecd3b448c7e8802477a4464dc777c306f","beb5b63f5cbdfc857ecaeaab4f1e01065e533a820e0d0f3a3261f5fcd7ad3ba6","3fa5a97afc78ba936ee3f7f2b4202fd65f697fd63f6a14796a64404c0cc46d76","d787860e43c75d2a4d016237e51ed2359d48dcc2fe3af5a94221b93ecbe03935"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6048,6071],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including 