ate.docx:p6072"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp – Hys > Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":6096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A5-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":6097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys < Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":6098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp is the measurement result of the NR SpCell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the neighbouring cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the neighbour cell).","paragraph_zero_based":6102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the neighbour cell, or cellIndividualOffset as defined within reportConfigNR), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":6103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. a5-Threshold1 as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. a5-Threshold2 as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn, Mp are expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":6107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":6108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1is expressed in the same unit as Mp.","paragraph_zero_based":6109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is expressed in the same unit as Mn.","paragraph_zero_based":6110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The definition of Event A5 also applies to CondEvent A5.","paragraph_zero_based":6111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.7Event A6 (Neighbour becomes offset better than SCell)","paragraph_zero_based":6112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A6-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A6-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for this measurement, consider the (secondary) cell corresponding to the measObjectNR associated to this event to be the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":6116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The reference signal(s) of the neighbour(s) and the reference signal(s) of the SCell are both indicated in the associated measObjectNR.","paragraph_zero_based":6117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A6-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":6118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ocn – Hys > Ms + Ocs + Off","paragraph_zero_based":6119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39