{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Ms.","paragraph_zero_based":6216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.13Void","paragraph_zero_based":6217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.14Void","paragraph_zero_based":6218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.15Event D1 (Distance between UE and referenceLocation1 is above threshold1 and distance between UE and referenceLocation2 is below threshold2)","paragraph_zero_based":6219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition D1-1 and condition D1-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition D1-3 or condition D1-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality D1-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":6223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml1-Hys>Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":6224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality D1-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":6225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml2+Hys<Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":6226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality D1-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":6227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml1+Hys<Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":6228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality D1-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":6229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml2-Hys>Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":6230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml1 is the distance between UE and a reference location for this event (i.e. referenceLocation1 as defined within reportConfigNR for this event), not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml2 is the distance between UE and a reference location for this event (i.e. referenceLocation2 as defined within reportConfigNR for this event), not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresisLocation as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is the threshold for this event defined as a distance, configured with parameter distanceThreshFromReference1, from a reference location configured with parameter referenceLocation1 within reportConfigNR for this event.","paragraph_zero_based":6235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is the threshold for this event defined as a distance, configured with parameter distanceThreshFromReference2, from a reference location configured with parameter referenceLocation2 within reportConfigNR for this event.","paragraph_zero_based":6236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml1 is expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":6237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml2 is expressed in the same unit as Ml1.","paragraph_zero_based":6238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed in the same unit as Ml1.","paragraph_zero_based":6239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["38b561e91a05cbe0022dc6ae5d476af248c0688c20c0cc6edc31c26807522b64","65072bc27f2a152d24e