{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is expressed in the same unit as Ml1.","paragraph_zero_based":6240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is expressed in the same unit as Ml1.","paragraph_zero_based":6241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The definition of Event D1 also applies to CondEvent D1.","paragraph_zero_based":6242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.15aEvent D2 (Distance between UE and serving cell moving reference location is above threshold1 and distance between UE and a moving reference location is below threshold2)","paragraph_zero_based":6243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition D2-1 and condition D2-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition D2-3 or condition D2-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality D2-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":6247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml1-Hys>Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":6248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality D2-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":6249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml2+Hys<Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":6250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality D2-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":6251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml1+Hys<Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":6252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality D2-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":6253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml2-Hys>Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":6254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml1 is the distance between UE and a moving reference location for this event, not taking into account any offsets. The moving reference location is determined based on movingReferenceLocation and the corresponding epoch time and satellite ephemeris for the serving cell broadcast in SIB19.","paragraph_zero_based":6256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml2 is the distance between UE and a moving reference location for this event, not taking into account any offsets. The moving reference location is determined based on referenceLocation2 as defined within reportConfigNR for this event and the corresponding epoch time and satellite ephemeris for the candidate cell.","paragraph_zero_based":6257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresisLocation as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is the threshold for this event defined as a distance, configured with parameter distanceThreshFromReference1 in reportConfigNR for this event, from a moving reference location derived based on the parameter movingReferenceLocation within SIB19.","paragraph_zero_based":6259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is the threshold for this event defined as a distance, configured with parameter distanceThreshFromReference2, from a moving reference location derived based on the parameter referenceLocation2 within reportConfigNR for this event.","paragraph_zero_based":6260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml1 is expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":6261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml2 is expressed in the same unit as Ml1.","paragraph_zero_based":6262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed in the same unit as Ml1.","paragraph_zero_based":6263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b489b163947856a0d04832bf224b163d5ead180e98460a9d69685435d33ce012","ab9dee2abdb7f945265f070070d6681db7cc150c4fe88a4274d27e68a3974010","817a11e7f654bac0d6ef662f6d18f6e8665f520842fbe6110742a95d57057324","59273101da208392dd0bbd172e204a0737516a23282a118a898d816f05d46104","f4aac4ed6f03806fe66707161937c3be495e4ab1e3ff903499f7c50d09ceb8d0","a8d9d3f4ebdef240d6de64ad9f2395707dfbe8ac35d53689e62b8393c8ad5384","25eacbbee47b72edd743ce30384b512fe21c97b177e020285a70ffb4037025b9","64de2161588c459addbb4ddd2ca6cc346bd204079ccbccd0bc933961000c4bc5","c17d1b8c770412c759cd383c209dff8ef47077be185c5b8cbde2786eb838b8ff","be4ddb0b3768829315c3a391e9b2edc7332af20fbed0bad6e5ed59928f47eb65","0d0dc0c74cc49ecc981bfe71217471f449014f364c988b34698bb8e3da636209","abc8ac0d105f9baf0743775cf234c7d70c09d555acdf037cffee8c6e7b860465","75825dc75ea4a3a1b46770c5fed3b05321ba34429fa12b703cc76927fdbc37cb","ec85cd23f319e6d6466ef650c47569d7c82b631399f65be131cfde1ed1c6cdfc","f482e83988bde6641554e34840df710dcd439581cd76292853919636a738f3e5","b31c40813bb72cde8b9972c9f9a6a3732db85a1381aee7f75a72d0e4f5c0db1c","a0c93b3f1a9f9de61ee4552af220f379751aef1ff6ead1104c008d90eee8bd5e","082cfd26d23ccacf0ed6231889559edab287d86e593d4021d58adb5241da7e96","8780315ec91f79fcbcda758e0ef18fa5edd87adeae0566c418ccbbc487bfbcbd","3b1742300a974d8011028303f3a03b452fbc0f0174b1a9dc5ff5c153bac3944f","edbeeec9e8f95f0f2af3b700610eb030a7d5c8c2b9a2b22793590b8de4011ec9","5f683874e7766d9a843317dc1d3a44208360ff5ceb837521f0e46ea255037c14","a0e81f94ced10470576f975a797197fd3c3f536868131d548c289b58e584e032","002de61f5ea46804f2027a62e67fea497e76a6038ab0918f9b031098c66391e8"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6240,6263],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p6240"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is expressed in the same unit as Ml1.","paragraph_zero_based":6264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is expressed in the same unit as Ml1.","paragraph_zero_based":6265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The definition of Event D2 also applies to CondEvent D2.","paragraph_zero_based":6266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.16CondEvent T1 (Time measured at UE is within a duration from threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":6267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition T1-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition T1-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality T1-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":6271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":6272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality T1-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":6273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":6274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mt is the time measured at UE.","paragraph_zero_based":6276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. t1-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Duration is the duration parameter for this event (i.e. duration as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mt is expressed in ms.","paragraph_zero_based":6279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is expressed in the same unit as Mt.","paragraph_zero_based":6280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Duration is expressed in the same unit as Mt.","paragraph_zero_based":6281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.17Event X1 (Serving L2 U2N Relay UE becomes worse than threshold1 and NR Cell becomes better than threshold2)","paragraph_zero_based":6282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition X1-1 and condition X1-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition X1-3 or condition X1-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality X1-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":6286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr + Hys < Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":6287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8b3b569b975e714bc140305fcce07e34333c2793ac5478050b06e476db226a3e","92c1d0b5cc491cc0c899ea54a997d7282cb498e03c9a789cb3dffa97a6cbfad2","66da5eab124061307e0dddb86b2244b2550739ca47d4d9ea87219583ea5f176f","9a4761848a20c3f69ec76f3ce1df098d967ae21a53c2770ef240491ffe74aaa7","da2e3a7a99bdf6eb47cb58fe399da40d5ae197031f6cfdac3d4c101c5e2a91f2","65ec9b7ee7161a16f6191e2db4cc7638e963f1fa366d14a1314f7eeacbd328e2","8913b3d19c9fa82bbfa5fb3f65025aa7d050a6044b9875e9c704596beb6f382b