{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality X1-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":6288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys > Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":6289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality X1-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":6290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr – Hys > Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":6291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality X1-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":6292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys < Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":6293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is the measurement result of the serving L2 U2N Relay UE, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the NR cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the reference signal of the NR cell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the NR cell).","paragraph_zero_based":6297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the NR cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the frequency of the NR cell, or cellIndividualOffset as defined within reportConfigNR), and set to zero if not configured for the cell.","paragraph_zero_based":6298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event.","paragraph_zero_based":6299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. x1-Threshold1-Relay/eventX1-SD-Threshold1 as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. x1-Threshold2 as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is expressed in dBm.","paragraph_zero_based":6302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":6303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":6304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is expressed in the same unit as Mr.","paragraph_zero_based":6305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is expressed in the same unit as Mn.","paragraph_zero_based":6306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.18Event X2 (Serving L2 U2N Relay UE becomes worse than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":6307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition X2-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition X2-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality X2-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":6311}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8837fbed91f6b0061ccda5abba3d6021afdca89b8fcdf14db71225c2009aa3f2","46870087521828a1f86db790ba67725dfb1fe8175f0268932cc53c1c25392d3d","920758191cb01e3c661ef7420236d7135ddfa5934f74e24715e23df94c7879cb","1b0