{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is the measurement result of the candidate L2 U2N Relay UE, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. y1-Threshold1 as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. y1-Threshold2-Relay as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":6340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is expressed in dBm or dB, depending on the measurement quantity of candidate L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":6341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":6342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is expressed in the same unit as Mp.","paragraph_zero_based":6343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is expressed in the same unit as Mr.","paragraph_zero_based":6344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.20Event Y2 (Candidate L2 U2N Relay UE becomes better than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":6345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition Y2-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition Y2-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality Y2-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":6349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr– Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":6350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality Y2-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":6351},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":6352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is the measurement result of the candidate L2 U2N Relay UE, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. y2-Threshold-Relay as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is expressed in dBm or dB, depending on the measurement quantity of candidate L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":6357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":6358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Mr.","paragraph_zero_based":6359}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9f3bc7531a009fbcc6bb7dcf3e1f5593758fcc8564d4996e3e7bc50c8a34341c","814232a0674c4b8f0b734a81562a816f25eaf43710c2ed0f0478694ef59fe04e","75d6bd0d55a0c4889781498e3438ba45838ffbf11ea996ebf69c7