{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.20bEvent Z1 (Serving L2 U2N Relay UE becomes worse than threshold1 and Candidate L2 U2N Relay UE becomes better than threshold2)","paragraph_zero_based":6360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition Z1-1 and condition Z1-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition Z1-3 or condition Z1-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality Z1-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":6364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr + Hys < Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":6365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality Z1-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":6366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn – Hys > Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":6367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality Z1-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":6368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr – Hys > Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":6369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality Z1-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":6370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Hys < Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":6371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is the measurement result of the serving L2 U2N Relay UE, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the candidate L2 U2N Relay UE, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. sl-rsrp in z1-Threshold1-Relay as defined within reportConfigInterRAT if the UE measures SL-RSRP, or sd-rsrp in z1-Threshold1-Relay as defined within reportConfigInterRAT if the UE measures SD-RSRP for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. z1-Threshold2-Relay as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is expressed in dBm or dB, depending on the measurement quantity of serving L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":6378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is expressed in dBm or dB, depending on the measurement quantity of candidate L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":6379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":6380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is expressed in the same unit as Mr.","paragraph_zero_based":6381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is expressed in the same unit as Mn.","paragraph_zero_based":6382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.21Event H1 (The Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":6383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["45b877165e990ed6294f4af28def6fc96d68cfeeb4e79a9182409fb68d1c77d2","ac6fdc4bb114bd41ad8428cd883b784477435a05c0fb