{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the Aerial UE altitude relative to the sea level.","paragraph_zero_based":6432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys2 is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. h1-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. h1-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn, Mp are expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":6435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys1, Ofp, Ocp, Off are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":6436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms, Hys2, Thresh are expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":6437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.24Event A3H2 (Neighbour becomes offset better than SpCell and the Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":6438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6439},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition A3H2-1 and condition A3H2-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A3H2-3 or condition A3H2-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>use the SpCell for Mp, Ofp and Ocp.","paragraph_zero_based":6442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The cell(s) that triggers the event has reference signals indicated in the measObjectNR associated to this event which may be different from the NR SpCell measObjectNR.","paragraph_zero_based":6443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3H2-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":6444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys1 > Mp + Ofp + Ocp + Off","paragraph_zero_based":6445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3H2-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":6446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys2 < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":6447},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3H2-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":6448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys1 < Mp + Ofp + Ocp + Off","paragraph_zero_based":6449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3H1-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":6450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":6451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the neighbouring cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the reference signal of the neighbour cell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the neighbour cell).","paragraph_zero_based":6454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the frequency of the neighbour cell, or cellIndividualOffset as defined within reportConfigNR), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":6455}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70