{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp is the measurement result of the SpCell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":6456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofp is the measurement object specific offset of the SpCell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the SpCell).","paragraph_zero_based":6457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocp is the cell specific offset of the SpCell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the SpCell), and is set to zero if not configured for the SpCell.","paragraph_zero_based":6458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys1 is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. a3-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Off is the offset parameter for this event (i.e. a3-Offset as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the Aerial UE altitude relative to the sea level.","paragraph_zero_based":6461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys2 is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. h2-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. h2-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":6463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn, Mp are expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":6464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys1, Ofp, Ocp, Off are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":6465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms, Hys2, Thresh are expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":6466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.25Event A4H1 (Neighbour becomes better than threshold1 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold2)","paragraph_zero_based":6467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition A4H1-1 and condition A4H1-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A4H1-3 or condition A4H1-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, is fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":6470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A4H1-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":6471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys1 > Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":6472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A4H1-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":6473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys2 > Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":6474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A4H1-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":6475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys1 < Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":6476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A4H1-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":6477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys2 < Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":6478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6479}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a34401882ed32a0677c685ad3e6e3aef043db520ed74b99e0d3decb305a7aa52","ebbc8383334acf57fa