{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as other and set the failureType-v1610 as t312-Expiry;","paragraph_zero_based":7296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the SCGFailureInformation message to provide reconfiguration with sync failure information for an SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":7297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as synchReconfigFailureSCG;","paragraph_zero_based":7298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the SCGFailureInformation message to provide random access problem indication from SCG MAC:","paragraph_zero_based":7299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the random access procedure was initiated for beam failure recovery:","paragraph_zero_based":7300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the failureType as other and set the failureType-v1610 as beamFailureRecoveryFailure;","paragraph_zero_based":7301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the failureType as randomAccessProblem;","paragraph_zero_based":7303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the SCGFailureInformation message to provide indication from SCG RLC that the maximum number of retransmissions has been reached:","paragraph_zero_based":7304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as rlc-MaxNumRetx;","paragraph_zero_based":7305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the SCGFailureInformation message due to SRB3 IP check failure:","paragraph_zero_based":7306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as srb3-IntegrityFailure;","paragraph_zero_based":7307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the SCGFailureInformation message due to Reconfiguration failure of NR RRC reconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":7308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as scg-reconfigFailure;","paragraph_zero_based":7309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the SCGFailureInformation message due to consistent uplink LBT failures:","paragraph_zero_based":7310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as other and set the failureType-v1610 as scg-lbtFailure;","paragraph_zero_based":7311},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if connected as an IAB-node and the SCGFailureInformation is initiated due to the reception of a BH RLF indication on BAP entity from the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":7312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as other and set failureType-v1610 as bh-RLF;","paragraph_zero_based":7313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the SCGFailureInformation message due to beam failure of the PSCell while the SCG is deactivated:","paragraph_zero_based":7314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as other and set failureType-v1610 as beamFailure;","paragraph_zero_based":7315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> include and set MeasResultSCG-Failure in accordance with 5.7.3.4;","paragraph_zero_based":7316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each MeasObjectNR configured by a MeasConfig associated with the MCG, and for which measurement results are available:","paragraph_zero_based":7317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include an entry in measResultFreqList;","paragraph_zero_based":7318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if there is a measId configured with the MeasObjectNR and a reportConfig which has rsType set to ssb:","paragraph_zero_based":7319}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d7