{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set ssbFrequency in measResultFreqList to the value indicated by ssbFrequency as included in the MeasObjectNR;","paragraph_zero_based":7320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if there is a measId configured with the MeasObjectNR and a reportConfig which has rsType set to csi-rs:","paragraph_zero_based":7321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set refFreqCSI-RS in measResultFreqList to the value indicated by refFreqCSI-RS as included in the associated measurement object;","paragraph_zero_based":7322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a serving cell is associated with the MeasObjectNR:","paragraph_zero_based":7323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set measResultServingCell in measResultFreqList to include the available quantities of the concerned cell and in accordance with the performance requirements in TS 38.133 [14];","paragraph_zero_based":7324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultNeighCellList in measResultFreqList to include the best measured cells, ordered such that the best cell is listed first, and based on measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected the failure, and set its fields as follows;","paragraph_zero_based":7325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>ordering the cells with sorting as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":7326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>based on SS/PBCH block if SS/PBCH block measurement results are available and otherwise based on CSI-RS;","paragraph_zero_based":7327},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>using RSRP if RSRP measurement results are available, otherwise using RSRQ if RSRQ measurement results are available, otherwise using SINR;","paragraph_zero_based":7328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE supports SCG failure information for mobility robustness optimization for conditional PSCell change or addition, for each neighbour cell, if any, included in measResultListNR in measResultFreqList:","paragraph_zero_based":7329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the neighbour cell is one of the candidate cells for which the reconfigurationWithSync is included in the secondaryCellGroup in the MCG VarConditionalReconfig (for CPA or inter-SN CPC in NR-DC) or SCG VarConditionalReconfig (for intra-SN CPC) at the moment of the detected SCG failure (radio link failure at PSCell or PSCell change or addition failure):","paragraph_zero_based":7330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the first entry of choConfig corresponds to a fulfilled execution condition at the moment of SCG failure; or","paragraph_zero_based":7331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the second entry of choConfig, if available, corresponds to a fulfilled execution condition at the moment of SCG failure:","paragraph_zero_based":7332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set firstTriggeredEvent to the execution condition condFirstEvent corresponding to the first entry of choConfig or to the execution condition condSecondEvent corresponding to the second entry of choConfig, whichever execution condition was fulfilled first in time;","paragraph_zero_based":7333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set timeBetweenEvents to the elapsed time between the point in time of fulfilling the condition in choConfig that was fulfilled first in time, and the point in time of fulfilling the condition in choConfig that was fulfilled second in time, if both the first execution condition corresponding to the first entry and the second execution condition corresponding to the second entry in the choConfig were fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":7334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each neighbour cell included:","paragraph_zero_based":7335},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the optional fields that are available.","paragraph_zero_based":7336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The measured quantities are filtered by the L3 filter as configured in the mobility measurement configuration. The measurements are based on the time domain measurement resource restriction, if configured. Exclude-listed cells are not required to be reported.","paragraph_zero_based":7337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:Field measResultSCG-Failure is used to report available results for NR frequencies the UE is configured to measure by SCG RRC signalling.","paragraph_zero_based":7338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if available, set the locationInfo as in 5.3.3.7 according to the otherConfig associated with the NR MCG.","paragraph_zero_based":7339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE supports SCG failure for mobility robustness optimization:","paragraph_zero_based":7340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the failureType is set to synchReconfigFailureSCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":7341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the failureType is set to randomAccessProblem and the SCG failure was declared while T304 was running:","paragraph_zero_based":7342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set perRAInfoList to indicate the performed random access procedure related information as specified in 5.7.10.5.","paragraph_zero_based":7343}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["df35fe66d51a693f703a31e3e3686ee28bbdc56d309d88e5f5ac4dbdfa0fc019","bb02666d5f2489ddbed5a0186e4724c7f0260d98b05d1aea77b21b54b3df4f24","a8dc9772f12a3047a9c0379f1b2aa9d03f96ecea31c2cf54ed20883cc5329d2f","910c6cc85c3969d646adf60983323e709327ea8dd14bd34b3b44efd3d481f28c","dc1d53b57b1d749baec21d3da4fff7ab221da8053b7b4911deaca79c75c88a39","3e24c24af57d5f92fbe0241e5fc770a2fe80de0777bc99c5a79d5ddc45e5bb5f","59a6856c149e543db701f957e881ce2800324fff412e2589f05934703f055a95","f4a9c3aa66724b8d612757b8621cb4306e9470558a629e67a50f338437760f76","d88a1320a917977351e009856112f684f3c91627001afa850009c84528aaac71","5d368b95c0999347260c67d68c228bd63b484464783661d3ddbb5c65e688fab9","8338f57e1c33f2978d0eb766ba053832c431659ee5951a68a4dc200cc366ffa4","48480b7fe00375ab39cfb06db54490e862e787c70d4c4fd6a736eabb5a2915d3","365a49383ef7b494cc62e150cc750f18b66f4a4a8b38d1e27479ac68f06fe78f","0c9a3e200ad1e25e097edfa62eac3022fa377017834a76f18e697c0ee3b76c3d","62a62b560f6b199cb8a6a825b835b7f9bd3800eaeaef09f75e7e8d1467676412","35606966341b495ab25aabbeacd6c7a4f2fdfea50b8a799e237ec30b4e261e68","a21bb5083d03839af27ea1831d7c4edcd623cbc239e4ded1282dca091b910222","272d9e05ecaa68484fd5683e93df7e08c5221f41f35aa464e86795068fc5c5d4","f4c6debacdc3985023ed40d931d91b178a3347c284c19674c6a554da0d3afcec","f7f5b6a71ba5d8e0555b37939d5f25bf5b02a8208fa8ef1219a29af84b88afcb","9f7164c6358ba6dfc6c8916d19608b273d3582a917a0d26c5a4f47a5b7dd10b6","3fb5d9a2c13073acb66d19a756edd16c47ca6e550ad76bf3521173c537531fc0","3e73b4d7974140dd35fd3edfd2ce616eb789dfa50c2f02f01d784eab535df31f","c7fdcbc22c7a5a16fb72383756d192eb1b7e4084e37db4de6cad6d6a1eb3f2d6"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7320,7343],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p7320"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the failedPSCellId to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the target PSCell of the failed PSCell change;","paragraph_zero_based":7344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the previousPSCellId to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the source PSCell associated to the last received RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":7345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the timeSCGFailure to the elapsed time since the last execution of RRCReconfiguration message including the reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG until declaring the SCG failure;","paragraph_zero_based":7346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the failedPSCellId to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the PSCell in which the SCG failure was declared;","paragraph_zero_based":7348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last RRCReconfiguration message including the reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG was received to enter the PSCell in which the SCG failure was declared:","paragraph_zero_based":7349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the timeSCGFailure to the elapsed time since the last execution of RRCReconfiguration message including the reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG until declaring the SCG failure;","paragraph_zero_based":7350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the previousPSCellId to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the source PSCell associated to the last received RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":7351},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release successPSCell-Config configured by the source PSCell, if available.","paragraph_zero_based":7352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the SCGFailureInformation message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":7353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3aEUTRA SCG failure information","paragraph_zero_based":7354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3a.1General","paragraph_zero_based":7355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":7356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.3a.1-1: EUTRA SCG failure information","paragraph_zero_based":7357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to inform NR MN about an SCG failure on E-UTRA SN the UE has experienced (e.g. SCG radio link failure, SCG change failure), as specified in TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.6.13.2.","paragraph_zero_based":7358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3a.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":7359},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE initiates the procedure to report EUTRA SCG failures when neither NR MCG nor EUTRA SCG transmission is suspended and in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.6.13.2. Actions the UE shall perform upon initiating the procedure, other than related to the transmission of the SCGFailureInformationEUTRA message are specified in TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.6.13.2.","paragraph_zero_based":7360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3a.3Actions related to transmission of SCGFailureInformationEUTRA message","paragraph_zero_based":7361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the SCGFailureInformationEUTRA message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":7362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>include failureType within failureReportSCG-EUTRA and set it to indicate the SCG failure in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.6.13.4;","paragraph_zero_based":7363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>include and set measResultSCG-FailureMRDC in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.6.13.5;","paragraph_zero_based":7364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each EUTRA frequency the UE is configured to measure by measConfig for which measurement results are available:","paragraph_zero_based":7365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultFreqListMRDC to include the best measured cells, ordered such that the best cell is listed first using RSRP to order if RSRP measurement results are available for cells on this frequency, otherwise using RSRQ to order if RSRQ measurement results are available for cells on this frequency, otherwise using SINR to order, and based on measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected the failure, and for each cell that is included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":7366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:Field measResultSCG-FailureMRDC is used to report available results for E-UTRAN frequencies the UE is configured to measure by E-UTRA RRC signalling.","paragraph_zero_based":7367}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["462a0abc378f0b527ee9d44d4909d554b159f129b26fe956c1e7f4a92397bc37","b2ecc71f8bed9ceac65c0ea43da1445789c0b07ccadf2649630affb1bc00eb62","9d084994dc2fc843b13155e814fdece209209f6cc1824a5a8e0127d7546900bd","83418e9876fbdf5ae0e60f255761d98ad5e7d77d3f144b518775aa7f916e3831","d0fd5e09697f44f0c3704c59dbad43de8e36bf5f82c56b92ae9bf615e406f8d9","058e123d042314b335e9ba5b067e1f19927b323c5183945e52e8882f0f126a43","80a37b4f44eb02ce52178f4c86d0f8185599cdd625779b98402542c1892b6f63","b2206db35bd678193cdcc968de3cc70213e363f7bd4eee10cfbf939608522432","8951d57c5b8d672ecb763f629f78aea4f252c20bd2e20c139a18865794ebae67","801ec7b68f4b1e03c550d3bfd6dd98b67dd75778427c7603c7a113378403c0f0","318743d7874b12e3c0c6d7ae7f69894c6f49886a0cfaa75f1942ece599202d02","9449c70f8e5a25eeb77b3bd209340d7682f535afccef15b001edbf62b788ad44","3443e26c54b24457b35ce43c6669ffe1dd6c28625bac769e30bb3e865bd06f28","0bfa69049ca6025c48594448a11fa659045df27bb2abfba50c039ad763747a6b","b48912d2e271255e36cf02666ca3126e77a591182aadb2c795ca1c695ccc5048","fb3a1a3cdf8afe49756f35a1d34551523db4afe42e651c69e7b55f7335e87dd1","5e6c6e87aa8d6aa6a53f92a7179ffc829d93e44908dca5ed9e2b5a03c29b1977","b3b7e99e454fda916d567b5da4e5b18141cccc099101e3d4c8e7128ab6602ace","b37ac577cf29394c34d92ad2ded06a194bf1981caa1b37f9d5a45ced4a809206","e2eeecebcf9e56bfe477f5b75ee244cd130936dffc3642c569383d759d60992d","4dd7c8017abb4b51328d680c09dac9a22976511c5d612150bbc98945b74056ca","0842a1508c70b44e0de4573e46ac99a0b4cb250d7a88a1d4172b3a047336213d","66be70af22c26338b77d0d9a707c2da0a105eda9895ba2670e7287773dc13908","8e2be20ba809b34e1bf2dd77de10bb7b3d86663110e3ff86315c413137bfbfd0"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7344,7367],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p7344"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if available, set the locationInfo as in 5.3.3.7.:","paragraph_zero_based":7368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the SCGFailureInformationEUTRA message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":7369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3bMCG failure information","paragraph_zero_based":7370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3b.1General","paragraph_zero_based":7371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":7372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.3b.1-1: MCG failure information","paragraph_zero_based":7373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to inform the network about an MCG failure the UE has experienced i.e. MCG radio link failure. A UE in RRC_CONNECTED, for which AS security has been activated with SRB2 and at least one DRB or multicast MRB setup or, for IAB, SRB2, may initiate the fast MCG link recovery procedure in order to continue the RRC connection without re-establishment.","paragraph_zero_based":7374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3b.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":7375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of MR-DC, a UE configured with split SRB1 or SRB3 initiates the procedure to report MCG failures when neither MCG nor SCG transmission is suspended, the SCG is not deactivated, t316 is configured, and when the following condition is met; or","paragraph_zero_based":7376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of MP, a MP remote UE configured with split SRB1 initiates the procedure to report direct path failures when neither MCG (i.e. direct path) nor indirect path transmission is suspended, t316 is configured, and when the following condition is met:","paragraph_zero_based":7377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG, in accordance with 5.3.10.3, while T316 is not running.","paragraph_zero_based":7378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":7379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T310 for the PCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":7380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T312 for the PCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":7381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>suspend MCG transmission for all SRBs, DRBs, multicast MRBs, except SRB0, and, if any, BH RLC channels;","paragraph_zero_based":7382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>reset MCG MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":7383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop conditional reconfiguration evaluation for CHO, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":7384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop conditional reconfiguration evaluation for CPC or subsequent CPAC, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":7385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initiate transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message in accordance with 5.7.3b.4.","paragraph_zero_based":7386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The handling of any outstanding UL RRC messages during the initiation of the fast MCG link recovery is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":7387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3b.3Failure type determination","paragraph_zero_based":7388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the MCG failure type as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":7389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message due to T310 expiry:","paragraph_zero_based":7390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as t310-Expiry;","paragraph_zero_based":7391}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3d7eae28e74a579d76cdc7afb3ae1f143f77096e782fc947fdc0cdc8078f878e","d5d78da8a47773e52e78b797302222b9f2f3eb24c7c5e4f03ce7da5fec4c26f2","f6045fd0b7726a46893c11b5bc8b2a9f9d1f399a229ab3c13f9d19b90f647463","b085aee9bb45ffde11de3759908c4d6d0e73368376668c0995cf7a67a467dd81","d942a9b8adb46177d5ea962e90f0dc1c4a4c549d6a00044c0717d8c64c6499e0","a2f5982ef44d7c292f956b0cc67b40265330ea2c6f480825f2d2fab2e12e59da","296f776716854868fbac61ba74c3f28eb7f66ab4d74609dcec7335bee1fe9b6f","221623cefc075e33ad1bd0785b7aaeb426f371d9f210521a97581be5e82dc04e","42fcaf4d6ddce424c5b6ce3e856646d9cf2ae81b4653dcd61fcd12a3e36024bc","9fcee39ade90677d26598d48b49e1e86acda3ecb9bd7abaf513cb3efcd6a518c","e8d57ca4be94ed0fbaed3f5c38db4f6d5eda68bcce7bcc9485adff3fa5788556","d0c504410a359b9dbd2af2fe87b15a0032ae8b6f15f3fbf89212d8b6140b8403","a89f797943c30f44cf2427be0aff03959fbec2ef3271546cd04a811e7cfd8088","a43c177474614d85bc3a456223c2a37f57cf4e27e19853043dcf47bc2fc7eebf","2a3aa49ba19e47bdb19873f3bd74851f06820746336b87a65663956773dee8ec","3ded8b8f0c1408eed0ea35fe2d45883d32a87a9c588df3bc2d699f6c2cddf560","2dad29f87c9ce03597cdb2f49a8de9fe4562a2519cdee430baa482606ebcf2ec","7e9c194660103cb08a622836eb3b5b5f5c288899833cc20ecce5f28de024dc8f","bf6a47b58410d856db5530b21e4843829dd664d39b02851ac34bdab5cbf7c639","972197081f65c4fe030a3ebc5f81b1c256a581d7f822fbedcff2e765f672f45c","46df4bd5f669292d1251934903fe903f96df1007496830a8fff0ce4e5e8ed85a","f61e6a2bf68ea339e530f5aca955b4c94c31fade45b4d2c4afd33910dd7eeb52","25746574e2708b3e3f168ef074c483ef1daff401444cc997edce65d33bf38c4a","1f7655ef7dcc35bf252ad9a234a1b21fdf6adbafcadd738822763a3ea62e7a09"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7368,7391],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p7368"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message due to T312 expiry:","paragraph_zero_based":7392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as t312-Expiry;","paragraph_zero_based":7393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message to provide random access problem indication from MCG MAC:","paragraph_zero_based":7394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the random access procedure was initiated for beam failure recovery:","paragraph_zero_based":7395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the failureType as beamFailureRecoveryFailure;","paragraph_zero_based":7396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the failureType as randomAccessProblem;","paragraph_zero_based":7398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message to provide indication from MCG RLC that the maximum number of retransmissions has been reached:","paragraph_zero_based":7399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as rlc-MaxNumRetx:","paragraph_zero_based":7400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message due to consistent uplink LBT failures on the MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":7401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as lbt-Failure;","paragraph_zero_based":7402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if connected as an IAB-node and the MCGFailureInformation message is initiated due to the reception of a BH RLF indication on BAP entity from the MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":7403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as bh-RLF.","paragraph_zero_based":7404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3b.4Actions related to transmission of MCGFailureInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":7405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the MCGFailureInformation message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":7406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>include and set failureType in accordance with 5.7.3b.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7407},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each MeasObjectNR configured by a measConfig associated with the MCG, and for which measurement results are available:","paragraph_zero_based":7408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include an entry in measResultFreqList;","paragraph_zero_based":7409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if there is a measId configured with the MeasObjectNR and a reportConfig which has rsType set to ssb:","paragraph_zero_based":7410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set ssbFrequency in measResultFreqList to the value indicated by ssbFrequency as included in the MeasObjectNR;","paragraph_zero_based":7411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if there is a measId configured with the MeasObjectNR and a reportConfig which has rsType set to csi-rs:","paragraph_zero_based":7412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set refFreqCSI-RS in measResultFreqList to the value indicated by refFreqCSI-RS as included in the associated measurement object;","paragraph_zero_based":7413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a serving cell is associated with the MeasObjectNR:","paragraph_zero_based":7414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set measResultServingCell in measResultFreqList to include the available quantities of the concerned cell and in accordance with the performance requirements in TS 38.133 [14];","paragraph_zero_based":7415}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["50e21badfeb8356c10acc1c2e739e7f172decefca090d462d4243441320299cd","1530d70f781bb3f6771950ef0e088cc03755c649faf3c3165a9e5f4b14f5e3f3","99ad6ab20f38c7a516044a17a0592d10179207056461a034d8c6ed8d6520c27f","4ce9671168458b93080874a47e48f1aff6e5d6018f33e731a76e090acd02ff3d","e5022fdeb7c5f4a4629b4b90c499c567bb3b921e9af2f6ee8742c46a2f2f0142","8124288b66475bc83ac18295ad2bf61c3fc0233b78b26a0b10112f52e8ebabcd","668516ea16b0832210a8d8c4c1281be96c9454e15ceb1519874bc14d8da3b7d4","0e203938569243a6125314bd8372a66b347e56f9e3ba02a9f9abc6560c4c6491","eb7c6b989636f86ca29567c4fc8bd67483a26574af07459054c20e5b9a0fb89f","043ce7aafd3fcb91fef7a3585c3b9c18f494aa09cb9fc2f903c5c3802239fbca","da0054918cbf88e2f996dab4c019d072c6b329e07bb9b2814f1865ba73d146c8","4d11684b6c2c5196bc1f29a91996e15e3d472ecceaf787ebdce26c477ff98c5a","2d653c779d1a981f7eb677c333068d8afe321ca94b2c7b823f7bcdeaa63accb9","27e482fe99200f8d6a1a64b48e58b26797d3e0fb236bee33ff37cef74c53aa51","f54dfc262aa6a5e807703a78d0389c0dee0353e0c686c6a27b56d61511ab5eb1","bca92c9be606ac167bfd18d4aa179dc4e8963795b6e4d2000b80c8bc81fdeabf","08553fd9cf8b905ef7e6f54c8d3f2dd0968293ca31b834d42227954660254186","1522fa6864245c0d9c3f49e7cb7874cdfe4068c0b234f1e3c94b1dd08750f8bd","fc2840b2f3d396d600e3820469d139ffd80905f429858904f2493e206e882457","9b36f96464dc046a516651a3dbd36230e9245e4f6e1eb3bf2d47ad0e97076307","fe347e37feea3412e88c3bdbd1d0a2625338554c5c75a242ee7b10292bb9288e","488f49d78c4d1b6578058490933bdbf60c0258d59fade65304bb21de172afdee","005eaba262d2f8713b87d6e93bbb744566ab328b7b4a70b6267d0b35997fb015","f839d68ae529102ed7c513334197eb526e1a63bdb859ae174f111de21aec4a6a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7392,7415],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p7392"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultNeighCellList in measResultFreqList to include the best measured cells, ordered such that the best cell is listed first, and based on measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected the failure, and set its fields as follows;","paragraph_zero_based":7416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>ordering the cells with sorting as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":7417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>based on SS/PBCH block if SS/PBCH block measurement results are available and otherwise based on CSI-RS;","paragraph_zero_based":7418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>using RSRP if RSRP measurement results are available, otherwise using RSRQ if RSRQ measurement results are available, otherwise using SINR;","paragraph_zero_based":7419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each neighbour cell included:","paragraph_zero_based":7420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the optional fields that are available.","paragraph_zero_based":7421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each EUTRA frequency the UE is configured to measure by measConfig for which measurement results are available:","paragraph_zero_based":7422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultFreqListEUTRA to include the best measured cells, ordered such that the best cell is listed first using RSRP to order the cells if RSRP measurement results are available for cells on this frequency, otherwise using RSRQ to order the cells if RSRQ measurement results are available for cells on this frequency, otherwise using SINR to order the cells, based on measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected the failure, and for each cell that is included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":7423},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each UTRA-FDD frequency the UE is configured to measure by measConfig for which measurement results are available:","paragraph_zero_based":7424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultFreqListUTRA-FDD to include the best measured cells, ordered such that the best cell is listed first using RSCP to order the cells if RSCP measurement results are available for cells on this frequency, otherwise using EcN0 to order the cells, based on measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected the failure, and for each cell that is included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":7425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":7426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in NR-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":7427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include and set measResultSCG in accordance with 5.7.3.4;","paragraph_zero_based":7428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in NE-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":7429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include and set measResultSCG-EUTRA in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.6.13.5;","paragraph_zero_based":7430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The measured quantities are filtered by the L3 filter as configured in the mobility measurement configuration. The measurements are based on the time domain measurement resource restriction, if configured. Exclude-listed cells are not required to be reported.","paragraph_zero_based":7431},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:Field measResultSCG-Failure is used to report available results for NR frequencies the UE is configured to measure by SCG RRC signalling.","paragraph_zero_based":7432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:Field measResultSCG-EUTRA is used to report available results for E-UTRAN frequencies the UE is configured to measure by E-UTRA RRC signalling.","paragraph_zero_based":7433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SRB1 is configured as split SRB and pdcp-Duplication is not configured:","paragraph_zero_based":7434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the primaryPath for the PDCP entity of SRB1 refers to the direct path when MP is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":7435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the primaryPath to refer to the indirect path;","paragraph_zero_based":7436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the primaryPath for the PDCP entity of SRB1 refers to the MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":7437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the primaryPath to refer to the SCG.","paragraph_zero_based":7438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":7439}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["692a362be1921344cbcb8f076ff9613e913cc20542db39d2f7170d14e746213d","506c1fc2daf5ff36ec97adb9d2a37d0bdbaba005d68c2ac41a94047e28494741","bcede118c0869ed247f00ec2535b35fd91261178cd29efd30a03d2632508054d","b60a9f8a97bb3683cf884c33af1cc4ad49407d727b45a44a34e7acb20f5d29b2","a6b50923314caed2014e081562f7c9011f10f03e854afd85af19e2b562bb79aa","25226da3482b0a1df9f59274ea05d7691518cf73f66d18e0a418af1d6fe9bb73","1be3f6815936f4246e85f31d0a1802712a7ecc7fd9ccb155c90ad7ef41c841d3","d35e41facf84c9778704e9c7416be4a07c4db4bd50d591e6afac5bfb634d7766","b2a1668a68b86255e90c816bc4742e0a97f7bfcd8fc102c12724f9625fe08e87","ff629f12a0bf1965c58b08f0561a14549bc1446aab89808fe1e9366af8edee1c","b29296d3f11d028b6a2fcb151ffaf5e6da12991a0ab8d4c6032753a18528db45","2879cd8ded735016b78559d9844fb7b97eb09e480682c5ab81a0c23243f4701e","29cc61181ed8593df9332b7c2c49016bf2ec8bc8f2dadaa0f8ea7b571984f819","057517c103f08ae62e9516d89b59e4c9b62debd874b3b7d7b67e139d6673c4bb","e64f5c78ec81b20b28648d0f2660fe3a835d68f900d498c4ec8699099f0f9366","5d030a7582da851455a806a99a65c746059b010106a3bd3cce360de468708050","1c681d5a9134ed4b7bece4a97cf59b2c5559b190e42d4c7e3da805d2162d67d6","8cdd1631d83ae10cec579329ced584989407e4b498f91f57d839d47a9e38c550","3ffb097bd439dc40138cbf934b002e22fa7d1d2fb32655ee938d7894c69c28c1","0b0916c7ef3303b262af53402468fe7919469c5ed4323efbfe1e375e58c6825f","48d96f2ee532f510ee76c7892ad8c7d5cc586510a5373434982d9cfd236137b4","52d2037e84db74cc6b4f3324c8bcc0cba6e7203e2d7f7308dc1b31752c2e0533","70ec8a3a4cf863794a3995821726cbc1dfa3dd8734463f040be1d1f34c4bd216","fd27ffa5ae566fa7eda57dfe7fcbc859491bd1bb40a43e5589ec6186ff699c93"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7416,7439],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p7416"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>start timer T316;","paragraph_zero_based":7440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SRB1 is configured as split SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":7441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the MCGFailureInformation message to lower layers for transmission via SRB1, upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":7442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (i.e. SRB3 configured):","paragraph_zero_based":7443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the MCGFailureInformation message to lower layers for transmission embedded in NR RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC via SRB3 as specified in 5.7.2a.3.","paragraph_zero_based":7444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3b.5T316 expiry","paragraph_zero_based":7445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":7446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T316 expires:","paragraph_zero_based":7447},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports RLF-Report for fast MCG recovery procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":7448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the pSCellId in the VarRLF-Report to the global cell identity of the PSCell, if available, otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":7449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the mcgRecoveryFailureCause in VarRLF-Report to t316-expiry;","paragraph_zero_based":7450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in 5.3.7.","paragraph_zero_based":7451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3cIndirect path failure information","paragraph_zero_based":7452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3c.1General","paragraph_zero_based":7453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":7454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.3c.1-1: Indirect path failure information","paragraph_zero_based":7455},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to inform the network about an indirect path failure the MP remote UE has experienced.","paragraph_zero_based":7456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3c.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":7457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of MP, a MP remote UE initiates the procedure to report indirect path failures when neither MCG transmission nor indirect path transmission is suspended and when one of the following conditions is met:","paragraph_zero_based":7458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting a SL indirect path failure resulting from sidelink radio link failure on the PC5 unicast link or reception of NotificationMessageSidelink from the L2 U2N Relay UE (except indicating relayUE-HO), or SL indirect path addition/change failure in accordance with 5.3.5.17.2.3, or PC5-RRC connection release requested by upper layers in accordance with clause 5.8.9.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":7459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting a N3C indirect path failure, including N3C connection failure or Uu failure of the N3C relay UE with N3C indirect path, or N3C indirect path addition/change failure in accordance with 5.3.5.17.3.2a;","paragraph_zero_based":7460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":7461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure was initiated to report SL indirect path failure:","paragraph_zero_based":7462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the sidelink specific MAC of the L2 U2N relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":7463}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f1d97c63dfe4e08b73c385e17fb2d3284882110a47597ae371d9c3ab6cc5a658","4e68f591ab4acf65d0786a72c8a7f53056dc405dda863bd70d54554888d1d65e","21c9336fbcb267e45e6200ce7bbfcc453077bc0167ee3a323e7eb00d821275bd","6dd652e0ee08f1ec24481acd23754b49773ceed09719a1404ca7d5cae10843c5","668d8d2c4b4001eee28c61465f11335b0a4be8b6868eece3794a7e2b98a7620f","2b7e020e1077934174bc12c27df60ae98b2d75cfc152d13116ff105cd0e2e493","3c12b789f007bc7da011ead4a67d8838a428ded4fa3f958b7c338f6e63d553d1","67ad32fc964582d06ae7c06e98ba469fcb538dca0a934c3a6ce918f60cc29e35","94cbed14483479e15cdf71e8f55db4ffa82f3bbeb515df39a71965cc0292acd7","3af6d7a70b75517f2b9c67ed9745c55ec0c888e4e9e37f0ce48085f76c460d38","82bbc7e2d34c8135a4be3a1e899e4a9be4166bbee777853a3f4731063d94ebf4","852b350e0314eccc3e744f64c82864e14011a385ef5de35ae075f88ca828b7db","09c94d6a7444fc9c931509b9c3f417dc5e493e33f878e746f36e3d5cc5210116","3f4ba2d25858aad350ffd276c9378da378249e602366e40e916be928bd51d098","8eb08f8a88626fe126d2bed55254ba889c59fa05731402dec7727f67164d4aea","c17a530040c38c0f705bb0e8ef77fa27f4bda1b0a9b607a97a09e8a2e11497c7","ca9c991d67481102497e3066429dd6f7d8fef5d3f5ffafc96c9187cc1d1a9cbd","da493f0f7a85b8d28a1cf34de85d16e08819b015c1cd1f51ceeaef449474487e","5827e26e878d2a188906f66cf3c796657ad4bdfe9e9347bbb899fbae046664a1","4aed8e2cc83b091a6681511dbe3b6972cd9c58973adce642104d1375c9bb77e8","ed0d7b8406d94e64bfcd0dd222631bc74c91f98f70eaaa9fd8ca864fd34ca18a","2f4f60be5e0a3fdaa13bd34720119dead0117bef002ee9300560f1ee63a2002a","ca78947c81c5647836fbdc5402b4897e0a8992e82b0dab7fc9cce21d38f54b19","3f2ae9c120a822f97cee068f7a0816fa83caffa2c17998449a36380f460638df"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7440,7463],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p7440"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop T421 if running;","paragraph_zero_based":7464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>suspend indirect path transmission for all SRBs and DRBs;","paragraph_zero_based":7465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initiate transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message in accordance with 5.7.3c.4;","paragraph_zero_based":7466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3c.3Failure type determination","paragraph_zero_based":7467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE configured with SL indirect path shall set the indirect path failure type as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":7468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message due to T421 expiry in accordance with clause 5.3.5.16.1.3:","paragraph_zero_based":7469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureTypeIndirectPath as t421-Expiry;","paragraph_zero_based":7470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message due to reception of the NotificationMessageSidelink including indicationType, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.10.4:","paragraph_zero_based":7471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureTypeIndirectPath as the value in indicationType received from NotificationMessageSidelink (except relayUE-CellReselection);","paragraph_zero_based":7472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message due to sidelink radio link failure in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3:","paragraph_zero_based":7473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureTypeIndirectPath as sl-Failure;","paragraph_zero_based":7474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message due to PC5-RRC connection release requested by upper layers in accordance with clause 5.8.9.5:","paragraph_zero_based":7475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureTypeIndirectPath as sl-PC5-Release;","paragraph_zero_based":7476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message due to that the (target) L2 U2N Relay UE (i.e., the UE indicated by sl-IndirectPathRelayUE-Identity in the received sl-IndirectPathAddChange) changes its serving cell to a different cell from the target cell (i.e. the cell indicated by sl-IndirectPathCellIdentity in the received sl-IndirectPathAddChange) during path addition or change; or","paragraph_zero_based":7477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message due to N3C Indirect path addition/change failure in accordance with clause 5.3.5.17.3.2a:","paragraph_zero_based":7478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureTypeIndirectPath as indirectPathAddChangeFailure;","paragraph_zero_based":7479},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The N3C remote UE shall set the indirect path failure type as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":7480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message due to N3C connection failure:","paragraph_zero_based":7481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureTypeIndirectPath as n3c-Failure;","paragraph_zero_based":7482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message due to Uu radio link failure on N3C indirect path in accordance with clause 5.3.10.3:","paragraph_zero_based":7483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureTypeIndirectPath as relayUE-Uu-RLF;","paragraph_zero_based":7484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:It is out of 3GPP scope how the remote UE detects N3C connection failure, or how the relay UE indicates Uu RLF to the remote UE on the N3C connection.","paragraph_zero_based":7485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3c.4Actions related to transmission of IndirectPathFailureInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":7486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":7487}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e2aab7d77b3a0a5328a8412052e4c686897a13ec13a7af2469f865951c8a4fac","e2423655d5c14173f71b34fd308c2f9dcfb16109ca0e56648bb3490933471e5d","d8bb62e39388f04bdac89b573b7c4d0b00d6a36d2b68957e3d91183d4b2123e4","d7adcf1a2fdd7130e03facbd855f2f2588c2c8f49c460b853fa592437f204d84","26c16b9b22a8a8139703de6a093819e9286be3d1ef58bc17c6462acea40b7a10","729341fa560dcce661fc6e4cd524cdb9e6264378d0efd090e0a52ee8c094ed53","b0882af79163e49373b49bc6eba18afa715c251f2b81063c2bf8c1adecf5cb8c","52d3c3c07d6b695064dc381d5ec0296ddab92cb2d6ec490eb5152fe77821af0f","6a2d0b95638d6161f3c724fc3802ee93a5199240af58878e1dcd351a9666c3ab","645abf9f9ec84ce8b4340251fcd241ed4d1295403d3b9c5340c9514486bb8cef","adb9ff8dedd2352c6ca3a8afb6b899823641ee949d9f8ee3ff1e95745a2d04e6","1f75bb45dc9e1073e95e1fa63e6d1db256ac919bad399936a5ac27c533658770","10b8cf71e0ca08a833cfa44bd8271b6b6d59959f8c97b1ff9cf07c1a41c84ff9","c895807500514185da6ad0f3ded39f2cc788220fdfe4e0ecf483f51acc1f1f22","c6921f705475c63caba964102240bc4e99438c34cca97e6353621eabe49933a8","9ae3790ff9340b50266a51a51c4e5203f8232c84a1e9d392353aa37cb04e5fe5","7fc567c86d3c809e5be911cbfa16466d3e0a6735de4e1987ce60aba75928f765","ba60297718c5d188577913781fc27cde933e5920284caf349bc4a56bfcbc7d0d","64b96257732b825242130d578d4a8ace79c69e2698e856e6f485d9681a413939","d11d2b47b0c0d896e4860a7052f2826a6e878ac33b581f541053726c6d201c07","93e088e8a70c0e74dfc4ae2170eb4018ef32d288f1cc7b7754900b224eeac90f","ef82e748be9c89aaa13d34ac83f16ea9152a24397c6e44bf82e37908aeeb418d","b66cd8ab975a8658929d3dd7aaf26e5e3a6057b1c22c749524386bc096161893","75d0833ccd2a2a7b915871e94a72c1e5fc77c54407e1e654e4f90060dbbcb2c8"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7464,7487],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p7464"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the failureTypeIndirectPath in accordance with 5.7.3c.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure was initiated to report SL indirect path failure:","paragraph_zero_based":7489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the sl-MeasResultServingRelay to include the measurement result for serving L2 U2N Relay UE if available;","paragraph_zero_based":7490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measObjectRelay included in MeasConfig, and for which measurement results are available:","paragraph_zero_based":7491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include an entry in sl-MeasResultsCandRelay;","paragraph_zero_based":7492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the procedure was initiated to report N3C indirect path failure;","paragraph_zero_based":7493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include n3c-relayUE-InfoList to report relay UE information with non-3GPP connection(s) if available;","paragraph_zero_based":7494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the IndirectPathFailureInformation message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":7495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.4UE Assistance Information","paragraph_zero_based":7496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.4.1General","paragraph_zero_based":7497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":7498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.4.1-1: UE Assistance Information","paragraph_zero_based":7499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is for the UE to inform the network of:","paragraph_zero_based":7500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its delay budget report carrying desired increment/decrement in the connected mode DRX cycle length; or","paragraph_zero_based":7501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its overheating assistance information; or","paragraph_zero_based":7502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its IDC assistance information; or","paragraph_zero_based":7503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on DRX parameters for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":7504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":7505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":7506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":7507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":7508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the RRC state; or","paragraph_zero_based":7509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication; or","paragraph_zero_based":7510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference in being provisioned with reference time information; or","paragraph_zero_based":7511}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e44bba886cd987e9a0d54a4c41b2b260c5ca561c8fcce605770b4b53c87d3d68","7a5c34ce093469b9609ae50748ed77ca2cf9728d38885392e0c4bc0ce2131e11","eb73e14989109b90c198b3934c46488366ca54c3c28debf99b971f702dd4ed6d","0601e1f8132d3beb62c552c77b31f6acc929985acd322447a9fa17243bed57dc","00de802be24f77763cfb04e3a2de7acd0493c4a2c306fdab6294b965b3750647","20ec050e5c4220485cac557cfc02544e0909c4d0897e59e7