{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference for FR2 UL gap; or","paragraph_zero_based":7512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state for MUSIM operation; or","paragraph_zero_based":7513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the MUSIM gaps; or","paragraph_zero_based":7514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the MUSIM gap priority; or","paragraph_zero_based":7515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the MUSIM temporary capability restriction; or","paragraph_zero_based":7516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its relaxation state for RLM measurements; or","paragraph_zero_based":7517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its relaxation state for BFD measurements; or","paragraph_zero_based":7518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-availability of data and/or signalling mapped to radio bearers which are not configured for SDT; or","paragraph_zero_based":7519},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference for the SCG to be deactivated; or","paragraph_zero_based":7520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-availability of uplink data to transmit for a DRB for which there is no MCG RLC bearer while the SCG is deactivated; or","paragraph_zero_based":7521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-change of its fulfilment status for RRM measurement relaxation criterion; or","paragraph_zero_based":7522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-service link (specified in TS 38.300 [2]) propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s); or","paragraph_zero_based":7523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on multi-Rx operation for FR2; or","paragraph_zero_based":7524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-availability of flight path information for Aerial UE operation; or","paragraph_zero_based":7525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-UL traffic information; or","paragraph_zero_based":7526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the information of the relay UE(s) with which it connects via a non-3GPP connection for MP; or","paragraph_zero_based":7527},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink positioning.","paragraph_zero_based":7528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.4.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":7529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing delay budget report in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, including upon being configured to provide delay budget report and upon change of delay budget preference.","paragraph_zero_based":7530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing overheating assistance information in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon detecting internal overheating, or upon detecting that it is no longer experiencing an overheating condition.","paragraph_zero_based":7531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing IDC assistance information in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon detecting IDC problem if the UE did not transmit an IDC assistance information since it was configured to provide IDC indications, or upon change of IDC problem information.","paragraph_zero_based":7532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on DRX parameters of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a preference on DRX parameters and upon change of its preference on DRX parameters.","paragraph_zero_based":7533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a maximum aggregated bandwidth preference and upon change of its maximum aggregated bandwidth preference.","paragraph_zero_based":7534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a maximum number of secondary component carriers preference and upon change of its maximum number of secondary component carriers preference.","paragraph_zero_based":7535}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b19db63aba511154553ad9f24626b63cecbc20f230b3ed2991293a242f0cc1b3","de2887d99602f787baaf17a1c287f9eb25459e8eaaee6b917ce7610e2a147545","5e874fdceab8025b054debf1a39dbeab1a9ca2e302a172c5a9656bdaa492927e","b7d7859c565ca2a6020df72b34c3bbe8699c70cc7c7f08a4e68dd5e0c9f5a926","979ab6c75051ca11f0d9c9fe21f7d0eab19969fc6a0be1902caa267ec34cbf1d","1c4e541ce6edd70cdc1ffa11ab6384377918e89cc86e62221671c1d614e46b78","63a282d0441a6ace98bfa653338514ccb067465bfd2db310056a886072b8b0a0","9f8483d807cd6c185c613ff5d465772b2cf822943a6218350f80b661b140f442","a88491e4a5cd6c6ffd2e5cb416a2ccef9df8f0b1c3d952dda8120c054256330d","87e611ec08aa924b4bba055d2fc6cd5a878cf3681ccb9035a9f7d25e8366cf9f","12807b93e66855c94a8ffa20a1e70d64d5ce39da4c43290b7d719486e5520c17","203b03d5bc8300389876bce22b167fd14a4ca9a2d9e32710a74645fe53086202","03feec957b1716cc17be75be64ab2cae7a8a28f4bc329153464b8fb3799c2b33","4da0f0bcd591b11d3d3dd3dc0aa6db0b6c0e7e68ab8e7a41bb481b6d2b3cd8d1","ddf40c38a27e55707d14c97d14e910de5a144bd28adacb8ccd7c2894ea52f31c","bb1360ce935249153f5aa9e7add0c520f9a550ccbfa9a46c71cab7d98fcd89b3","c5d8a418f902f7eca344688e683ddeac2da93301f00dacf050d59ec41067878c","9308dc2b0203fe75d739408c97d10eaac5b1233e3bb48cf8a41b7648566808d9","ad67c0a1ae7ded4d330553e44d78796c109759dbd93c3fd306bbd80c31470ac2","d3153ed0a8333a2288075db3dd82d9afa9ad54de3f053ca2052983695e64d260","be8deb1642ef747f3dde965e787cc137a46d9678b544b5584b4b3fc45506f82d","5a09b2e4e5e4870f88fad73f8d917ccea01dafb4f0081e8f5f3bd8762e20161a","d5ecc3e2b75beb24bd6a9b936a0b9117766893289a784dd7049af63729022ae4","b4ef028cd1089d95a964409bb6eee265514b84a1bbc90cf6fa62726bc5a73d5f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7512,7535],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p7512"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a maximum number of MIMO layers preference and upon change of its maximum number of MIMO layers preference.","paragraph_zero_based":7536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a minimum scheduling offset preference and upon change of its minimum scheduling offset preference.","paragraph_zero_based":7537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing assistance information to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon determining that it prefers to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state, or upon change of its preferred RRC state.","paragraph_zero_based":7538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, including upon being configured to provide traffic pattern information and upon change of traffic patterns.","paragraph_zero_based":7539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing an indication of its preference in being provisioned with reference time information may initiate the procedure upon being configured to provide this indication, or if it was configured to provide this indication and upon change of its preference.","paragraph_zero_based":7540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing an indication of its preference in FR2 UL gap may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon detecting the need of FR2 UL gap activation/deactivation.","paragraph_zero_based":7541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing MUSIM assistance information for gap preference may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon determining it needs the gaps, or upon change of the gap preference information.","paragraph_zero_based":7542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing MUSIM assistance information for gap priority preference may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon determining it has gap priority preference information.","paragraph_zero_based":7543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing MUSIM assistance information for leave indication may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so upon determining that it needs to leave RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":7544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing MUSIM assistance information for temporary capability restriction may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon determining it has temporary capability restriction or upon determining the removal of the capability restriction.","paragraph_zero_based":7545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of relaxing its RLM measurements of a cell group in RRC_CONNECTED state shall initiate the procedure for providing an indication of its relaxation state for RLM measurements upon being configured to do so, and upon change of its relaxation state for RLM measurements in RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":7546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of relaxing its BFD measurements in serving cells of a cell group in RRC_CONNECTED shall initiate the procedure for providing an indication of its relaxation state for BFD measurements upon being configured to do so, and upon change of its relaxation state for BFD measurements in RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":7547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of SDT initiates this procedure when data and/or signalling mapped to radio bearers that are not configured for SDT becomes available during SDT (i.e. while SDT procedure is ongoing).","paragraph_zero_based":7548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference for SCG deactivation may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon determining that it prefers or does no more prefer the SCG to be deactivated.","paragraph_zero_based":7549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE that has uplink data to transmit for a DRB for which there is no MCG RLC bearer while the SCG is deactivated shall initiate the procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":7550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing an indication of fulfilment of the RRM measurement relaxation criterion in connected mode may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon change of its fulfilment status for RRM measurement relaxation criterion for connected mode.","paragraph_zero_based":7551},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s) shall initiate the procedure upon being configured to do so, and upon determining that service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and a neighbour cell has changed more than threshPropDelayDiff compared with the last reported value.","paragraph_zero_based":7552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing an indication of its preference on multi-Rx operation for FR2 may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon detecting having a preference on multi-Rx operation for FR2 and upon change of its preference on multi-Rx operation for FR2.","paragraph_zero_based":7553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of indicating the availability of flight path information may initiate the procedure, if it was configured to do so, upon determining that an initial or updated flight path information is available.","paragraph_zero_based":7554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing UL traffic information shall initiate the procedure when this information is available upon being configured to do so, and upon change of UL traffic information.","paragraph_zero_based":7555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of N3C remote UE operation initiates the procedure upon being configured to report relay UE information on the available non-3GPP connection(s), and upon change of its available non-3GPP connection(s).","paragraph_zero_based":7556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing configured grant assistance information including SL-PRS transmission periodicity and priority for NR sidelink positioning in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":7557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor's Note: FFS the details of configured grant assistance information.","paragraph_zero_based":7558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":7559}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["91324bf90590c86118ec017602d634d30245375a4dab5d9cee75bbfb1dfe037d","1af1598300e9ab3822766d36c9f688797458813650bdf6e718bd221c8674859c","3152753b028cb333dd79c71823ce6ff549f549f50532459d86030b138e8fa5b2","b00ba5e6b053dc520c951e227351bb9623e1397ec11feeaa9886282bdd1696f6","acbd55ada9c2843a377797418f998d3508feca208c2633d0265e222a8f0eaa54","36c42b2bf11e14008974eba8db015d7cc438194aeabdae6cbea49dede51e6e35","583e02954925ba7257faed96753b6a38b699f796381430c75f0c3ed04256b784","f67961bcf9f31c207fcc16af503af2e2c1af99cf6be0f4b285baf3dc96099491","ef85591ceeacfcb1093c000718129e84ae9c249af8e8586544b83c8b20963215","9ec634cdb11d3109ca2c5669d25284b988be37c1e56a585f0eb0b0db9c6e6684","e6543cecadffc46be8d85572d7af58c25682a2ebb0c99f4f31860d006dc7b02c","fed155c06ce381d58f62fe5d70d3b58bd02c0bc08564676a27888d76f90ff799","110b459be8ba731cf610b18fcfd0fe84be79b1e5a3ac8952d13ab2bd0d295957","c6a066816b0d6ba74ee37f2481760b73dbd941d0be43d42c35325eb6cbbefc72","632466ecb9ff7a92258b6bbbc8d130534f60b0c881767778646e2a8d09055752","53e47ee5240634d12332c3f2a1b72451f61bf1afe1773084486dc83eca194edf","32c85cb2c27cc41497ecde0901445bc6b86e9478256ec82fc56c0c8a6d540375","d5e29d7826d593a7df6afaa454dac885bdd071e92f7def00a03d4433c456f433","b06e0b2b9ce4115863a3e307c83bcd893168e7234bbbccecec5d506ee01a36e8","3e847bb9e5517f6b68b80d7843b6759aadab65f9e37d349ad61e75b85c59e8cb","416b33d5a69e79870020c58ac1c4d535cbb309af3d13f17657322ad122cb17f8","13e0722da6c957690aa97e0a1fae0fbc330a0c76ad791630b63a303326799e1b","d7f60d554adce73d4952b0fddd3545dd12830ca11d87fcec3ce9fda6c30fc5b8","df2acb8bc7512f5f8d522c20c5567c785e7ef066732a231501766e64aa64488e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7536,7559],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p7536"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide delay budget report:","paragraph_zero_based":7560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with delayBudgetReport since it was configured to provide delay budget report; or","paragraph_zero_based":7561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current delay budget is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including delayBudgetReport and timer T342 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start or restart timer T342 with the timer value set to the delayBudgetReportingProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":7563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide a delay budget report;","paragraph_zero_based":7564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide overheating assistance information:","paragraph_zero_based":7565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the overheating condition has been detected and T345 is not running; or","paragraph_zero_based":7566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current overheating assistance information is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including overheatingAssistance and timer T345 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7567},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T345 with the timer value set to the overheatingIndicationProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":7568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide overheating assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":7569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide IDC assistance information based on candidateServingFreqListNR included in idc-AssistanceConfig of a cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":7570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with idc-Assistance since it was configured to provide IDC assistance information:","paragraph_zero_based":7571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if on one or more frequencies included in candidateServingFreqListNR, the UE is experiencing IDC problems that it cannot solve by itself; or","paragraph_zero_based":7572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if on one or more supported UL CA or NR-DC combination comprising of carrier frequencies included in candidateServingFreqListNR, the UE is experiencing IDC problems that it cannot solve by itself:","paragraph_zero_based":7573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide IDC assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":7574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the current idc-Assistance information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message:","paragraph_zero_based":7575},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide IDC assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":7576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide IDC assistance information based on idc-FDM-AssistanceConfig included in idc-AssistanceConfig of a cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":7577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with idc-FDM-Assistance since it was configured to provide IDC assistance information:","paragraph_zero_based":7578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if on one or more frequency ranges included in candidateServingFreqRangeListNR, the UE is experiencing IDC problems that it cannot solve by itself; or","paragraph_zero_based":7579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if on one or more supported UL CA or NR-DC combination comprising of frequency ranges included in candidateServingFreqRangeListNR, the UE is experiencing IDC problems that it cannot solve by itself:","paragraph_zero_based":7580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide IDC assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":7581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the current idc-FDM-Assistance information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message:","paragraph_zero_based":7582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide IDC assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":7583}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2dd4b4b347f333647dd384b6ccd96d9fd5ec6830805da6eb84fe8cfe28b5afd5","7581baeb9d9a5fc76c4e537b12e7bd5b1c9a02156da0de90dec2c205cd01da33","7a0f937c6acc535683a288462efde2e239d051811126a50288a7872b281fa510","6ac0ac6d8a80f1055f09ae07b4322ffac2960f61417d1eb840303f134ec81287","99b3e1ac984be24ea090660b5e2111d771eb51e696537ea8c05210dfd4ea6a52","f389e8209c94d09476a5f5ade1b412984c61db4bcd0b0cf8d3cf95cc854c87fb","f54117ea38e29381936e9c405112a517466b38091b29f0a3e896b158c72aa77a","b2a67807515ed44424e8b0a8a962cdf4df8c9205ee3847abe8debf8c2b7a7b97","f37fa6ffa08087d69f76594f06d4e10f678d186d9d8a9fff550578d6007a1ffb","eb94bf3d44dfc8d576374add015892177413004b7d2fb2c2972414d3e962eda2","84df095445f08ca5ad30c2de59174dc06d83087edb2aca09604590c50ea1e30c","029f482bf188c107d113bbe93538b4a55fa7a0a6f9985ab7f944b6c783463e82","42b9973291bb0fd90f7fa31c55a7dae02db3483d66672064416fee47af214960","5145dc9c62168be37d0dd964fd291175d3b57b559aa436d2a61f66ecc15c9b47","6619e5f56627e432c269038da28f44f5917797d96ea35220bca6bcf2d0f71b78","576ff5fa34e8f2f4b2a9ac2e7359d39b4656da1b5ae2c52a8b6b46ef0b00d8d9","7c81702e2804924f2267ee0294cb7a3972e43531ceb5c4abd7c3fed2a51faa13","9d834e82ab0f1f9b16a66e107b3c469dc11b276fc65f032ee03e79635a349610","021e5c2eac60bf067a6060686af5a62dd9d1f4bfcb56422429b815d29bf4e503","8aa4650013ad488f152e57413fbd1b7e532c4a659ef43b44875bcc607fe5376f","7beb6f807db353bd22836923110cdacf3aeb7f317e2fcf38d251eb2049644dcb","301c8ab6a92f1534ce264cd1fbf22205d66229a7ac16ce3c1fb84ff4729b9040","0ba824a4f497cac96e07548d44ebd1a75a2faa85aea0bd473c9ec2ac9a8da6f5","8f09b01776360748c03a385099532cc42a4d53586d211ab73f47125b919c0bc6"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7560,7583],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p7560"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide IDC assistance information based on idc-TDM-AssistanceConfig included in idc-AssistanceConfig of a cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":7584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with idc-TDM-Assistance since it was configured to provide IDC assistance information:","paragraph_zero_based":7585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if on one or more frequencies included in candidateServingFreqListNR or frequency ranges included in candidateServingFreqRangeListNR, the UE is experiencing IDC problems that it cannot solve by itself; or","paragraph_zero_based":7586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if on one or more supported UL CA or NR-DC combination comprising of carrier frequencies included in candidateServingFreqListNR or frequency ranges included in candidateServingFreqRangeListNR, the UE is experiencing IDC problems that it cannot solve by itself:","paragraph_zero_based":7587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide IDC assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":7588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the current idc-TDM-Assistance information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message:","paragraph_zero_based":7589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide IDC assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":7590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The term \"IDC problems\" refers to interference issues applicable across several subframes/slots where not necessarily all the subframes/slots are affected.","paragraph_zero_based":7591},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For the frequencies or frequency range(s) on which a serving cell or serving cells is configured that is activated, IDC problems consist of interference issues that the UE cannot solve by itself, during either active data exchange or upcoming data activity which is expected in up to a few hundred milliseconds.For frequencies or frequency range(s) on which a SCell or SCells is configured that is deactivated, reporting IDC problems indicates an anticipation that the activation of the SCell or SCells would result in interference issues that the UE would not be able to solve by itself.For a non-serving frequency or frequency range(s), reporting IDC problems indicates an anticipation that if the non-serving frequency or frequencies or frequency range(s) became a serving frequency or serving frequencies or frequency range(s) then this would result in interference issues that the UE would not be able to solve by itself.","paragraph_zero_based":7592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on DRX parameters of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":7593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on DRX parameters of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with drx-Preference for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on DRX parameters of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":7594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current drx-Preference information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including drx-Preference for the cell group and timer T346a associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346a with the timer value set to the drx-PreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":7596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current drx-Preference;","paragraph_zero_based":7597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":7598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with maxBW-Preference and/or maxBW-PreferenceFR2-2 for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":7599},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current maxBW-Preference information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including maxBW-Preference and/or maxBW-PreferenceFR2-2for the cell group and timer T346b associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346b with the timer value set to the maxBW-PreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":7601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current maxBW-Preference and/or maxBW-PreferenceFR2-2;","paragraph_zero_based":7602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":7603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with maxCC-Preference for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":7604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current maxCC-Preference information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including maxCC-Preference for the cell group and timer T346c associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346c with the timer value set to the maxCC-PreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":7606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current maxCC-Preference;","paragraph_zero_based":7607}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c2423bf1a6f4a89bf0d8fb9440c86268313e7af4ea4220992d814dc46e453602","73132e0a3bf5bdfe51a08acaff5e7246d970e2d1d3d7b7aee5d33be3c2b4bda8","bb91fdabe00397db0fa4e53f1639d27c71e4d29c1f7c1cbdb6f8896efdb1803b","8d00e0f26d199f5f59a2dcef7c9fd30230598f075da491bd51fc8294744601f8","aee04dc288e806667b799c87448aeb0d7e853c987f0d7abffc1807bce8a4459e","d7727621a7019aea718bec8f344651edd62aabf394ce100c205f1a6c4d5fddcb","e651cda60d2a48176aae7d43e4d56586165f135517a52855b208fd22c7a7a999","765f0c47190bdb9ff3e336c569c749bef17c741f8ef5f4ca531801c26c8afdf9","9a090e8796ddf7eb7f3492e8015b11c18cb272bf2f6c0e42eb01f2fb5ce24e33","4e7deb6b0b0e7e3cee7d8e81e56fa562159ab047ce2cbcbf59a66a13601fa346","6f00116f35275107ef518c90fb76b22b373a8f041a7f2d62cf407e579e791c80","1e31cedd4d6841e3eb000ceeb30f145c6f16c72d2535476444c0d7f7448a7b79","8466fafe4fd0ea99b07b1ff2f366f30b41f363c64f15cf253a6058a134db48a1","b67574658dcc60772ff567e9b04b5a1defaca09db9084e9c103d5ec0bd6a06e4","1c5fd68710ac427a96aa986107152ef7718fcc84f786a1101ee751ec9c6481e4","eb629ab1e6f8f389161bf3f1be0849ccfbed2bff32160a850bc36873b5b0b599","e44401817b38b5318c4b36c93900186e6dc186030b6f3214f96ae3a9c661f497","ac5309ebd69f346b3918259969b5967794e531f1af7a86cb06c4c32eaca433f8","d1f0447cb7910c15aeb2a3788c6c7b0e92516f66e23db7ba15373cee3086d57d","a6f88a7b2f8c1f007452dedc5774166e28364c231dd4151c4241aa295a9aac73","d2d75e1244345e03c7f9735af1be4ea406281256eb47ba741be1ab3a94311785","638cfc00103c271b5d4e1f97adb0aba98f2e96b800b2f9708cc35eb70cd195a7","4bfb864e523bc15f64465cc8a360aeb7d9d3555879eba8f99d013930cd7bdfb7","0f1bd6f88657b39d16a37754edba2ca360ebafa59e9d62046b277a9fd19d1ab1"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7584,7607],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p7584"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":7608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with maxMIMO-LayerPreference and/or maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2 for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":7609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current maxMIMO-LayerPreference information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including maxMIMO-LayerPreference and/or maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2 for the cell group and timer T346d associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346d with the timer value set to the maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":7611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current maxMIMO-LayerPreference and/or maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2;","paragraph_zero_based":7612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":7613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with minSchedulingOffsetPreference and/or minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":7614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current minSchedulingOffsetPreference and/or minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including minSchedulingOffsetPreference and/or minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt for the cell group and timer T346e associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7615},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346e with the timer value set to the minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":7616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current minSchedulingOffsetPreference and/or minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt;","paragraph_zero_based":7617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its release preference and timer T346f is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE determines that it would prefer to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":7619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured with connectedReporting and the UE determines that it would prefer to revert an earlier indication to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state:","paragraph_zero_based":7620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T346f with the timer value set to the releasePreferenceProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":7621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the release preference;","paragraph_zero_based":7622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":7623},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication;","paragraph_zero_based":7624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide preference in being provisioned with reference time information:","paragraph_zero_based":7625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with referenceTimeInfoPreference since it was configured to provide preference; or","paragraph_zero_based":7626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE's preference changed from the last time UE initiated transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including referenceTimeInfoPreference:","paragraph_zero_based":7627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide preference in being provisioned with reference time information.","paragraph_zero_based":7628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on FR2 UL gap:","paragraph_zero_based":7629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with ul-GapFR2-Preference since it was configured to provide its preference on FR2 UL gap information:","paragraph_zero_based":7630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference on FR2 UL gap activation/deactivation:","paragraph_zero_based":7631}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8