{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide FR2 UL gap preference;","paragraph_zero_based":7632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the current FR2 UL gap preference is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message:","paragraph_zero_based":7633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide FR2 UL gap preference.","paragraph_zero_based":7634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for leaving RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":7635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE needs to leave RRC_CONNECTED state and the timer T346g is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide MUSIM assistance information for leaving RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":7637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346g with the timer value set to the musim-LeaveWithoutResponseTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":7638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for gap preference:","paragraph_zero_based":7639},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for gap priority preference:","paragraph_zero_based":7640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference on the MUSIM gap(s) and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with musim-GapPreferenceList since it was configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for gap preference; or","paragraph_zero_based":7641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference on the MUSIM gap(s) and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with musim-GapPriorityPreferenceList since it was configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for gap priority preference; or","paragraph_zero_based":7642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the current musim-GapPreferenceList is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-GapPreferenceList and the timer T346h is not running; or","paragraph_zero_based":7643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the current musim-GapPriorityPreferenceList is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-GapPriorityPreferenceList and the timer T346h is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current musim-GapPreferenceList and/or musim-GapPriorityPreferenceList and/or musimGap-KeepPreference;","paragraph_zero_based":7645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start or restart the timer T346h with the timer value set to the musim-GapProhibitTimer.","paragraph_zero_based":7646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7647},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference on the MUSIM gap(s) and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with musim-GapPreferenceList since it was configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for gap preference; or","paragraph_zero_based":7648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the current musim-GapPreferenceList is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-GapPreferenceList and the timer T346h is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current musim-GapPreferenceList;","paragraph_zero_based":7650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start or restart the timer T346h with the timer value set to the musim-GapProhibitTimer.","paragraph_zero_based":7651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:The UE does not need to initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message if the difference between the current musim-GapPreferenceList and the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-GapPreferenceList is only due to removal of an ended aperiodic gap.","paragraph_zero_based":7652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for temporary capability restriction:","paragraph_zero_based":7653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has temporary capability restriction on the current configuration and timer T348 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current musim-Cell-SCG-ToRelease and/or musim-CellToAffectList;","paragraph_zero_based":7655}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d4d4a735d2387217da5b8b50c3081d8ab543968a076d136cc65d43a887dbdac0","1a853beefaaab2591711e5a4f05b3f37d697c150b7dc1556c384f3d786216113","63d367b99748562b70913b9c3d9147f5f6ca58251d2fcdc7852423e9db7ac4c4","0a0eb384bea9fc5f3b15054ccdde08e0618f2d9d9971fe4627c25a735524c4c1","cc354493db5cdd1f021fb98477cfefa4a91feb5f6460cae4b0c55cde0837acb7","0f80be0bbb23fa2d2c60c20b039092b2bf4d843832938161f55ca5f32b30a782","3f94451c7a2dbbb4406b3e86fbdde066d1ee7a9ba04e6560523afaa0cae44c14","cb7bdfd75c0cc164855592d0f6edf8ed4f131ac1193a89c18fdae2bd08c50f13","701486b0073f2d561fa70bb77788089add771bb8f9467861e9d8999754167022","488e765e04711ea4534046c7059d3440537deb199f56c6be803637cb0bca6b29","cb40f4fe173918114de0337e25cd5ff494ce386497b233195bdba33442504ddb","c4c272bfd9bcc89d0a58e5de438e73510925f6a5f0d6405eaa663427bcd9acc9","52804e295f4f4c93163c4a68bc2840bfdbe03556cbf56fd56359344f2b056462","749c8504165a7513a9d2652a18fd8cce930b89ad51d1ffe6f711c660cfefb18e","8dd1e0d78193aa4d0accc5dd7e2a815e41455bc350ab7021f9c70cdece182349","8068ecbdd657b741934e090e5c5fdbd4de498e70f597d3acdbb680fc44b3d245","a3b49014b327ad230879b90d6664af0c679cbc78ebe486fc9e435a431c04a98c","699b27ced1896add57435b268accf0a4ed594ea4fb02de1f9b751f55b6fe2bb8","d428b663adec6816910437e2f3bc4d3b7de54b8a8ca8e5f59ea3df5f90de53fb","2dc8f291f123d880a030e34ae5a56e494e728f25522859936378f827d379f2ab","ce22fbd1d590886045906520370647ddcc538597053cde886774294ed20713eb","1eee00fcf6d05f765fdf5f913aa6cf579edd7c172de35f785185d3c4dee6feff","577b91c5b7e62d907dd8b9a39276de07940f2280c83fba9db9f9d617f1f98e25","e378807094aafd85a053bf7651bab9c22e594ead6057aa6f5bf55af85ef91bb1"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7632,7655],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p7632"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T348 with the timer value set to the musim-WaitTimer.","paragraph_zero_based":7656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has temporary capability restriction on the combination(s) of bands comprising of band(s) included in musim-CandidateBandList and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with musim-AffectedBandsList and/or musim-AvoidedBandsList since it was configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for temporary capability restriction; or","paragraph_zero_based":7657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current musim-AffectedBandsList and/or musim-AvoidedBandsList is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-CapRestriction and timer T346n is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current musim-AffectedBandsList and/or musim-AvoidedBandsList;","paragraph_zero_based":7659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346n with the timer value set to the musim-ProhibitTimer.","paragraph_zero_based":7660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current musim-MaxCC is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-CapRestriction and timer T346n is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current musim-MaxCC;","paragraph_zero_based":7662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346n with the timer value set to the musim-ProhibitTimer.","paragraph_zero_based":7663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the measurement gap requirement information and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with measurement gap requirement information or RRCReconfigurationComplete message or RRCResumeComplete message with measurement gap requirement information since it was configured to provide its preference on the measurement gap requirement information for MUSIM; or","paragraph_zero_based":7664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current musim-NeedForGapsInfoNR is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-NeedForGapsInfoNR or RRCReconfigurationComplete message or RRCResumeComplete message including needForGapsInfoNR:","paragraph_zero_based":7665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current musim-NeedForGapsInfoNR;","paragraph_zero_based":7666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide the relaxation state of RLM measurements of a cell group and RLM measurement of the cell group is not stopped:","paragraph_zero_based":7667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with rlm-MeasRelaxationState since it was configured to provide the relaxation state of RLM measurements for the cell group; or","paragraph_zero_based":7668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the relaxation state of RLM measurements for the cell group is currently different from the relaxation state reported in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including rlm-MeasRelaxationState of the cell group and timer T346j associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T346j with the timer value set to the rlm-RelaxtionReportingProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":7670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the relaxation state of RLM measurements of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":7671},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide the relaxation state of BFD measurements of serving cells of a cell group and BFD measurement of the cell group is not stopped:","paragraph_zero_based":7672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with bfd-MeasRelaxationState since it was configured to provide the relaxation state of BFD measurements for the cell group; or","paragraph_zero_based":7673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the relaxation state of BFD measurements in any serving cell of the cell group is currently different from the relaxation state reported in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including bfd-MeasRelaxationState of the cell group and timer T346k associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T346k with the timer value set to the bfd-RelaxtionReportingProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":7675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the relaxation state of BFD measurements of serving cells of the cell group.","paragraph_zero_based":7676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if data and/or signalling mapped to radio bearers not configured for SDT becomes available during SDT (i.e. while SDT procedure is ongoing):","paragraph_zero_based":7677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with nonSDT-DataIndication since the initiation of the current resume procedure for SDT:","paragraph_zero_based":7678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide nonSDT-DataIndication.","paragraph_zero_based":7679}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f6f8fedebf49b5e5aef9d208d52a5cf2df9160cdeca9464914c4cfcd635648bc","7ee6388557030e44e2945a5da40714471ec2e62b47f52ba33d4e5d034a3d9cbe","9872c49f02f130084fc4245c08ef5abcae2e0a663fdee99f97e2e96e5379a576","da6f578a4d565bb18699277497ee55df862efb983e57bdf9e5ed60ba3596a711","7c8ad7cc40a0b7e1fe1cca793f71921a2ad072082646e7da4556f43139a5ed8d","56520c62e8a395d57afa0fcf0514a2d761728cd1b34db47737a674eb076840de","de8a430aa0e2924a2ec7c7664048f4b198bd25ce686ef02ca53413199d21afaa","afa0de6461a4ffffcab149911a5ab3aad69e737c4996d4d2a0d3e87754edbd2e","5437e024c4ac28f2f6973cf0877c07e6ceb6627a6f73c0699f4a11be8a335675","3bb4529a4af792df1804c93ec043953bee7223375a74290087172bed12f40555","8adc3c60acead084df695d826066a45c801bac1b6013e0f98e107d0eb53e8d9d","dc67368aa972518588e75d6ade896f398ae7cdeae474c8eaa478ab5d2280fbff","33a25978dbd053595a6dda47f452ccac4a77dfe56aab6b04974a2bf7f8295eff","0c158b8303b09c5014aa90df2164628c189a266182adc5b3f00f92412b398b55","1e839b174959cecc862e7ecbc688b12f09f10197d531a3c17d6f633dbfc1f5a0","f743c28c527524e73669c2e6eb83a781e3ba7be8351bd6e304dc694008fafad7","910a792d4d42045bf53eb09cd248150adf2d29dd957e85db92fe183e12a33642","c6524ffbb2579b63e736a60db9882ec505169b6be2089318424db0df6aae0035","305f5e317593d1475622453b6384b75b33ecf57aa1b70ff4e9ce502890c7ca39","f60bea483e5a7df4b7efea3cc12c2a5ebc197666e3b4897c4d3de55f529e8b30","ecd2e78ce0fa06db23b03c69994d829ef79db4f8e0801aed5968bb8dea2d7904","a4b0364319fc89b5cb68cc1b36a9515b5cc87d6e50e88b8eaf7c82dadbb96acf","a4e695e4fb17b2198133a5b228be38da163bbe9f4382d9e9bb914e32aa7e9fb2","1a792a7f386f667d1477af95ef63c3420153b179c570300b4969b6b51c7