{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference for SCG deactivation and timer T346i is not running;","paragraph_zero_based":7680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE prefers the SCG to be deactivated and did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with scg-DeactivationPreference since it was configured to provide its SCG deactivation preference; or","paragraph_zero_based":7681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE preference for SCG deactivation is different from the last indicated scg-DeactivationPreference:","paragraph_zero_based":7682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T346i with the timer value set to the scg-DeactivationPreferenceProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":7683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the UE preference for SCG deactivation;","paragraph_zero_based":7684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SCG is deactivated, and,","paragraph_zero_based":7685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>the UE has uplink data to send for an SCG RLC entity while the UE previously did not have any uplink data to send for any SCG RLC entity:","paragraph_zero_based":7686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to indicate that the UE has uplink data to send for a DRB whose DRB-Identity is not included in any RLC-BearerConfig in the CellGroupConfig associated with the MCG.","paragraph_zero_based":7687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to send indications of RRM measurement relaxation criterion fulfilment:","paragraph_zero_based":7688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the criterion in 5.7.4.4 is met for a period of TSearchDeltaP-StationaryConnected:","paragraph_zero_based":7689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with rrm-MeasRelaxationFulfilment as true since it was configured to provide indications of RRM measurement relaxation criterion fulfilment; or","paragraph_zero_based":7690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the last UEAssistanceInformation message indicated the criterion in 5.7.4.4 is not fulfilled with rrm-MeasRelaxationFulfilment as false:","paragraph_zero_based":7691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to indicate that the criterion for RRM measurement relaxation for connected mode is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":7692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last UEAssistanceInformation message indicated fulfilment of the criterion in 5.7.4.4 with rrm-MeasRelaxationFulfilment as true:","paragraph_zero_based":7694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to indicate that the criterion for RRM measurement relaxation for connected mode is not fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":7695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s);","paragraph_zero_based":7696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with propagationDelayDifference since it was configured to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s); or","paragraph_zero_based":7697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for any neighbour cell in neighCellInfoList, if the service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and the neighbour cell has changed more than threshPropDelayDiff since the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including propagationDelayDifference:","paragraph_zero_based":7698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and each neighbour cell included in the neighCellInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":7699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference for multi-Rx operation and timer T346m is not running;","paragraph_zero_based":7700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on multi-Rx operation for FR2 and did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with multiRx-PreferenceFR2 since it was configured to provide its preference on multi-Rx operation; or","paragraph_zero_based":7701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a different preference on multi-Rx operation for FR2 from the last indicated multiRx-PreferenceFR2:","paragraph_zero_based":7702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T346m with the timer value set to the multiRx-PreferenceReportingConfigFR2ProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":7703}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["36baa43ebbf007ba33a04b681ca4b2510a95677233f03658c21062ee99720c10","43befb4425926b82b97aeb622f481bc59f6af6848aee97baaab11eecc9f77f0d","718d3370aead2ba0ef2fa264885259779d7f545dbadc444befb46d77e2f1636b","ba29ac10dad2a7709ced8fc778a46c9951aa0c146a04b7dbf14a1741b769e0bc","e9dca5f33cd830a822e9e31af000329d29837ec5060f10e98b957224d0eb0ad8","930929de5560963abf03af55b1434a813bec3b132bf57f82c15474d7ecad10de","c35a0eb0821796fcbb82b544b4dd66aa4d7ae5037ee00bf42742a44e62982cf3","4248d257f0b2db75b2f317fd345b067db0ad0d6fcc0910009d0a1a8db40e3234","63deb9aa93d7a96024e5ef1f51f46073807e30751c80bfd392bed55992a90989","72c39fd0a653dd2c76bd89560e021d02b4e282befd5e75c31823046002c07714","21f7e612282643ba3beee03753cf3deb0c89fe411a7d762eccc0386a68366a74","418fb8e62000da6e9230e4164f0139389fb37f64a99f7f487ad2acc516a6b1e2","188b37922eeb8126585d1a795f6d2730b0b0aa7c2dedb36e19d24779e0ba8e61","ff4179e9e95a2a1ef01d8a216ed169ba9aa412e9ce0282cfc3c4c9da41b59959","3770d9574d9b60a401f1f10139713117f1952f8244e866af0621fc878b122db3","bbbc6ad7f47207170a1eb029833917f64973e9591a5d308acff0becf4577c188","27bbcd2e18dbd506d8fdbdc56a6bd038c1483477caf4a3a167865309b1e2804b","5f05c9bb8e72dd19498ae63b58dbf4a01a29755457b5c04f9723a62356a79db1","f8de8a2684353eb4624d0c2450591cec14620c87541b4d6df20adce27787ec11","ad1a3a3a6b9adb4c3b4ae932babcbd882defaee9278ef777b8b53cae3f1bcf70","e0ce9dc7c2088c48e64acd7ed5000507089a11e2b9f30a57651bc867f8762206","521f8570d427a9cc25d84d59f0767cca0a51e1e2f67ae40821fccd1022e41174","956722598221a2d66ed2d0ca65a6641b2768c789fb14b95769f4dce4b1350968","3277f67e65a7ccd13a1a920df38c168287370dc64a95395fe5b809f0cf03532e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7680,7703],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p7680"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the UE preference for multi-Rx operation for FR2.","paragraph_zero_based":7704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to indicate the availability of flight path information and the UE has (updated) flight path information available:","paragraph_zero_based":7705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE had neither provided a flight path information nor indicated the availability of flight path information since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":7706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if at least one waypoint or a timestamp corresponding to a waypoint location that was not previously provided since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state is available; or","paragraph_zero_based":7707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if at least one upcoming waypoint or a timestamp corresponding to a waypoint location that was previously provided since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state is to be removed; or","paragraph_zero_based":7708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if flightPathUpdateDistanceThr is configured and, for at least one waypoint, the 3D distance between the previously provided location and the new location is more than the distance threshold configured by flightPathUpdateDistanceThr; or","paragraph_zero_based":7709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> if flightPathUpdateTimeThr is configured and, for at least one waypoint, the time difference between the previously provided timestamp and the new timestamp, if available, is more than the time threshold configured by flightPathUpdateTimeThr:","paragraph_zero_based":7710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to indicate the availability of flight path information;","paragraph_zero_based":7711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:If neither flightPathUpdateDistanceThr nor flightPathUpdateTimeThr is configured, it is up to UE implementation whether to initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message when updated flight path information is available.","paragraph_zero_based":7712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide UL traffic information:","paragraph_zero_based":7713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with ul-TrafficInfo since it was configured to provide UL traffic information; or","paragraph_zero_based":7714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if UL traffic information included in the previous UEAssistanceInformation has changed since the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message containing ul-TrafficInfo for at least one QoS flow for which timer T346l is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":7715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide UL traffic information.","paragraph_zero_based":7716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 5:The UE only considers burstArrivalTime to have changed when it changes relative to the periodicity of the Data Burst arrival.","paragraph_zero_based":7717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to report relay UE information with non-3GPP connection(s):","paragraph_zero_based":7718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with n3c-relayUE-InfoList since it was configured to report available relay UE information with non-3GPP connection(s); or","paragraph_zero_based":7719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has new available non-3GPP connection(s); or","paragraph_zero_based":7720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the non-3GPP connection(s) with the reported relay UE(s) is not available:","paragraph_zero_based":7721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to report relay UE information with non-3GPP connection(s) included in the n3c-relayUE-InfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":7722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink positioning:","paragraph_zero_based":7723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink positioning;","paragraph_zero_based":7724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.4.3Actions related to transmission of UEAssistanceInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":7725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the UEAssistanceInformation message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":7726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide a delay budget report according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7727}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c88da21f6a0c08f14affc858c32c9ee57b0e5be544751fe7c597a8af1be2ee4a","5061b151aa238a5eed1502ec9cbe1ece5cbea1d548a70f99043418ea419cccec","3c6ee4aeffdf70023d566eefa84a25b3b5ce72d8eefe9be6209f3e37f6bda744","8895c5b7ce201e7efbcda9cbd688a9941679720667200a874b408d13dd76c28d","59667b4df62c739d4dfb173bcb934eb9d865d8ab84df3fb3e187865f27ef6072","1d550a961f8ef481503adff0e221d30a23bf37535139bd3564519e46d8c25619","27edc9ba0eaa1882065ca55ed1e158515547abca096f3c3ca