{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide minSchedulingOffsetPreference of a cell group for power saving according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":7848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include minSchedulingOffsetPreference in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":7849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for the cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":7850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K0 (TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.2.1) for cross-slot scheduling with 15 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":7851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK0-SCS-15kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K0;","paragraph_zero_based":7852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K0 for cross-slot scheduling with 30 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":7853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK0-SCS-30kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K0;","paragraph_zero_based":7854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K0 for cross-slot scheduling with 60 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":7855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK0-SCS-60kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K0;","paragraph_zero_based":7856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K0 for cross-slot scheduling with 120 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":7857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK0-SCS-120kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPre