{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set reducedBW-FR2-DL to the maximum aggregated bandwidth the UE prefers to be temporarily configured across all downlink carriers of FR2-1 of the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":8040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set reducedBW-FR2-UL to the maximum aggregated bandwidth the UE prefers to be temporarily configured across all uplink carriers of FR2-1 of the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":8041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE prefers to temporarily reduce maximum aggregated bandwidth of FR2-2 for SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":8042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include reducedMaxBW-FR2-2 in the OverheatingAssistance IE;","paragraph_zero_based":8043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set reducedBW-FR2-2-DL to the maximum aggregated bandwidth the UE prefers to be temporarily configured across all downlink carriers of FR2-2 of the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":8044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set reducedBW-FR2-2-UL to the maximum aggregated bandwidth the UE prefers to be temporarily configured across all uplink carriers of FR2-2 of the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":8045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE prefers to temporarily reduce the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR1 for SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":8046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR1 in the OverheatingAssistance IE;","paragraph_zero_based":8047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR1-DL to the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR1 of the SCG the UE prefers to be temporarily configured in downlink;","paragraph_zero_based":8048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR1-UL to the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR1 of the SCG the UE prefers to be temporarily configured in uplink;","paragraph_zero_based":8049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE prefers to temporarily reduce the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR2-1 for SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":8050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2 in the OverheatingAssistance IE;","paragraph_zero_based":8051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-DL to the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR2-1 of the SCG the UE prefers to be temporarily configured in downlink;","paragraph_zero_based":8052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-UL to the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR2-1 of the SCG the UE prefers to be temporarily configured in uplink;","paragraph_zero_based":8053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE prefers to temporarily reduce the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR2-2 for SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":8054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2-2 in the OverheatingAssistance IE;","paragraph_zero_based":8055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-2-DL to the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR2-2 of the SCG the UE prefers to be temporarily configured in downlink;","paragraph_zero_based":8056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-2-UL to the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR2-2 of the SCG the UE prefers to be temporarily configured in uplink;","paragraph_zero_based":8057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.4.4Relaxed measurement criterion for a stationary (e)RedCap UE","paragraph_zero_based":8058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The relaxed measurement criterion for a stationary UE is met when:","paragraph_zero_based":8059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-(SS-RSRPRefStationaryConnected – SS-RSRP) < SSearchDeltaP-StationaryConnected,","paragraph_zero_based":8060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Where:","paragraph_zero_based":8061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-SS-RSRP = current L3 RSRP measurement of the PCell based on SSB (dB).","paragraph_zero_based":8062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-SS-RSRPRefStationaryConnected = reference SS-RSRP value of the PCell (dB), set as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8063}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b9fd7653c8c78ce5e1eddb4ecd9e0f1afa27e452162e71f7f1cc6524bc25cc6e","be2447c4b7ac7ab35e24dc4ac1f837e4b4d2cc7a542f0ab8d84b69caee4ee077","6130db56f9a3453a91a02b690ed195627bd61a821df676c303cc4de6ca0fb630","748ae34a2885d6fa411226644af6ded115bd0d5a10fc0c38627482d2c871827d","2b46f73a2de23d877a87eb32f6578e078df74a5c5f5cb42e183530dfc7035d45","342e8e2dfde2a8fceb9f4eeee52e0def406e10d631cb9f1a33e1affcc3211d7a","b40143dee31ae8945a89d6e923c3ec3d16a8aa5c7eb9b912d0050e55673a4114","773983c72a8884132035bec09567d5783498151e68958de3ae48365512b36b79","20be02d62678398b5596037b00f17524d1945c52085b1e36f08dc367046c70c0","1de249e1903c96752e63116d3ea39dcd5df59804cdaf39a255cae50bdf60bd62","3c91188aae655f56e1cfa4c7e9632503e0b524330de9722eb205f3fc88cc2b1d","0d0274a84526a89372f93e48423e925978375bf02292ffbbd75c5bc7f71ef475","58a520fba5262844cb4141494ef31dd28dbc8bc8a6d405f4dc2e37496c11c3aa","7e69fb3de22c8cff37e29b94b9672ab40749cdd1b14df3c47e90bb5c7d2432e5","1801ba23d55470c541d2ac4341d183ebeefa12c39b5e2c5eb8d503fcf48494ac","478c4527d40fbbdfa832b62ab9b88b09179942468646d889004082f86f294a3c","cf92694025dd0b30f2d3dc43319ad8a934d704836901372fda8684549f6dc65a","de35e9a42908210faf3815d2b6ac2cacd399b5ba02c3bcb7d8ee00a619191093","36aced7f1320e274159de7505fd20d8913f803da3834c6c80987bfec982d060c","1da840db759530e5a15071458b037d6051e8c025e3b59bd99470324b7867a6d8","a8caefef87b043872379694cbb96c71b773c414c6e0120bd13a4461c51786265","031538d09889f0717efde13d8a8c32b56794ed1a54d49e2febaf6029b5a34cbc","9206fc88e2d6d6699a8ec08d8645415307891ae852861077719a498fb2b2b97e","796f827da61199867582e6153318b898b3126bd4858caf5b2fdd97f325004f8d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8040,8063],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8040"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-at the end of RRC reconfiguration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.3, when rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig is included in the RRCReconfiguration message; or","paragraph_zero_based":8064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-after MAC successfully completes a Random Access procedure after applying a reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig while stationary criterion is configured; or","paragraph_zero_based":8065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-if (SS-RSRP – SS-RSRPRefStationaryConnected) > 0; or","paragraph_zero_based":8066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-if the relaxed measurement criterion has not been met for TSearchDeltaP-StationaryConnected:","paragraph_zero_based":8067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-UE shall set the value of SS-RSRPRefStationaryConnected to the current SS-RSRP value of the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":8068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.4aVoid","paragraph_zero_based":8069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.5Failure information","paragraph_zero_based":8070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.5.1General","paragraph_zero_based":8071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":8072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.5.1-1: Failure information","paragraph_zero_based":8073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to inform the network about a failure detected by the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":8074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.5.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":8075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE initiates the procedure when there is a need inform the network about a failure detected by the UE. In particular, the UE initiates the procedure when the following condition is met:","paragraph_zero_based":8076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting failure for an RLC bearer, in accordance with 5.3.10.3;","paragraph_zero_based":8077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting DAPS handover failure, in accordance with 5.3.5.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":8078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":8079},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initiate transmission of the FailureInformation message as specified in 5.7.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":8080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.5.3Actions related to transmission of FailureInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":8081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":8082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if initiated to provide RLC failure information, set FailureInfoRLC-Bearer as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set logicalChannelIdentity to the logical channel identity of the failing RLC bearer;","paragraph_zero_based":8084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set cellGroupId to the cell group identity of the failing RLC bearer;","paragraph_zero_based":8085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as rlc-failure;","paragraph_zero_based":8086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if initiated to provide DAPS failure information, set FailureInfoDAPS as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8087}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["338d61736e77c42d36def3959392ab93e67c8e5883992908e904dbb5e8bff5aa","4292766542d83748751aff019b543088795435990bbc4e7d91e78d525dd3d529","0ac1152d24fbf465d12b2c46f164317278ec5ff93ce23e6b24b5390d5e3ffff8","eed5114f5d9ab19a21c5e6d63f6ded64d0108d93e62c0c9a34fb21ac2f3ee1f4","5ef227888f3b75b2e4c23df0789271dd52416944f228f38efa0aaef03d460a61","07ea80695695458a6badb89ac25d9acfeb61a9e4cfbd00621c78353a6b4cf3d4","3cae95b3649ede5aa52e118698f6314cd098eaabe9b41690b2e4b2ca934939d7","35b3f292b86751ccc51e0dec0ccb51a64dc513e9ce94fc6afa227dd955d58e77","0bbe415aab6db4580f229458906ba22af7d9c6db0d281103643b2576d62641d1","db4243020c20b94659927eb0d6828e1a2314f3faae855ebd9ca0b2db45fa7ce5","3f224900b653438c19fadabcfd8ea8a71a94f7a344f8d5e21e7e9d358e478e4a","629f62f42abc6342f672816939c0d648ac76d409fe0f006d587ac4882fec31de","7b12b2ae22c102938a2e81e72ad0a714d1fcd5bef9b9170d11fe180e9c47c165","3c8d25098a08ef9eb8a895163b20d195a5824559cfc42f34ef28a1e0d97883e1","1f274196c57b58bf61fb81ff5fa5853327246fb3b24f6d50b85bc7e04d1cb8fd","f2adefb3dc95578cc10011e52eca1fe108d3a76f959c27b1537522d8c4288fa1","bea983fd7791fd9fe6b54073203fc110209bcf8ce334e1fc927725d91d8b5875","9e8560f99f0559044a568aefd7bd857126979423306458eb55eb5ee514d128e7","1e76fe2d9afec7da1bcd02c1e143739d20b71a253a89ce15d2cdc7a063d15e6c","a1d5db0cf2122265ec7bbc01056ce26056d43db783ed0dacd36724eb78b23934","5e108e4f961f25d4924916c83b85eac6df4a780030da5c925110da46f8636d49","bd355292d77824a4517fcc6903b314d0a841cbb5c7188d4cb6c945163490f17a","5072181ea1cd46bf351e0e7002e15468ba5d3b903c104e1db9ba8fcecaa24301","80a1b6c2d2b8cdc9093cf151e6e3eced72196c1d50a80675091c3345ebb4b596"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8064,8087],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8064"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as daps-failure;","paragraph_zero_based":8088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if used to inform the network about a failure for an MCG RLC bearer or DAPS failure information:","paragraph_zero_based":8089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the FailureInformation message to lower layers for transmission via SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":8090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if used to inform the network about a failure for an SCG RLC bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":8091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SRB3 is configured;","paragraph_zero_based":8092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the FailureInformation message to lower layers for transmission via SRB3;","paragraph_zero_based":8093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else;","paragraph_zero_based":8094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is in (NG)EN-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":8095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the FailureInformation message via E-UTRA SRB1 embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in TS 36.331 [10].","paragraph_zero_based":8096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the UE is in NR-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":8097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the FailureInformation message via SRB1 embedded in NR RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in clause 5.7.2a.3.","paragraph_zero_based":8098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.6DL message segment transfer","paragraph_zero_based":8099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.6.1General","paragraph_zero_based":8100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":8101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.6.1-1: DL message segment transfer","paragraph_zero_based":8102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to transfer segments of DL DCCH messages from the network to the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":8103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The segmentation of DL DCCH message is only applicable to RRCReconfiguration and RRCResume messages in this release.","paragraph_zero_based":8104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.6.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":8105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network initiates the DL Dedicated Message Segment transfer procedure whenever the encoded RRC message PDU exceeds the maximum PDCP SDU size. The network initiates the DL Dedicated Message Segment transfer procedure by sending the DLDedicatedMessageSegment message.","paragraph_zero_based":8106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.6.3Reception of DLDedicatedMessageSegment by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":8107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving DLDedicatedMessageSegment message, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":8108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the segment included in rrc-MessageSegmentContainer;","paragraph_zero_based":8109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if all segments of the message have been received:","paragraph_zero_based":8110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>assemble the message from the received segments and process the message according to 5.3.5.3 for the RRCReconfiguration message or 5.3.13.4 for the RRCResume message;","paragraph_zero_based":8111}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0078f13960e984e9a91b2903fa656bc8612d817abc1b5e65723b6e5ddd17955b","65f675c68815fe5ef1aec00bbce53f7fec9ea604e7012da2b75c31c5296983a3","ad53d91170e023fc5601df177cf17f221ba706de0f7f4bd34f7aa49df3b082d0","65ea0baaa257f03be04cec9ad7b9530d709ae634d3fa85de52b77244935d9015","f1bda877017526986082dd01923191b13c7ae6fd1f28c81905996423660b1958","590e8691c7838331214d4bca5eedfc029b56d231f786618d35c9af88fec0265c","a22ae501960c17007bbd0c5625d659cbf78494d59493f645ad44b830f0bbace9","308e2f1ab45eca74acd960fb10d075b2a4c0ebb29cc463cbfb5fd9bf9208c4b7","4e459140f041def795bbfbacd8232915d00a4733ca10121353d83602b16e449d","7a10e24fa681c90444d429052eded40f303f437488d24049a567c0c5c4d15e3f","1286f7b0a7ce01a4c16a5ed1882a0344b6a765890e15e9dbfa2b35731819e484","b4928d50e9050f29d567745b45cbd903546c61d2aab378b042adc32c67fcacab","5fd3b5e917a286881341b5e0dd4286de8e7032707aa2f5ce8604c49999d609cd","e9fecd02e76ad71071fb33b15e1318feab5ba6ee4da7f5180b4c2fae8af6a7df","957ae9bec98f9592408fa593dc8aabe923cd48670c83069798c69d2e4ff1c4db","82406b16197b92543a021d0ff01c0a03902c81c80eef0fe9d9291c7b722b9074","b817ea21eb0d729ca9418f3606b3021fa2868740cec26c82dc1cc559d6188f15","a1ba475c39a5a1fe45a6263f9ff1711e21b63e1cc1d8c97b175278db6e4ce77d","ba8ca65b23f0265e552a331e2ebd7f87e2e64ec3a2ec98e26db810c19b2d60c6","38843c70045587f62897041e47eff3d96cee3cb475fded97b4bd64f8edb118b3","b116a9e3e54a80b823498cac732aa4f5ccc6f721aa9531fbd513f514ef92b887","f23c3e088324c8f6848d018c45e1d5707a52bacfacb9769771ffdfece7ed22ef","4e45ee2fbac7fd0968d55054d5c8d052358096fbe5d3c474a42881f4e932cde8","3508c01f6ee986303ee01c623a4f8293e3937797048f1aa1be3e3134b8cfee98"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8088,8111],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8088"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard all segments.","paragraph_zero_based":8112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.7UL message segment transfer","paragraph_zero_based":8113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.7.1General","paragraph_zero_based":8114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":8115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.7.1-1: UL message segment transfer","paragraph_zero_based":8116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to transfer segments of UL DCCH messages from UE to a NG-RAN in RRC_CONNECTED.","paragraph_zero_based":8117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The segmentation of UL DCCH message is only applicable to UECapabilityInformation and MeasurementReportAppLayer in this release.","paragraph_zero_based":8118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.7.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":8119},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of UL RRC message segmentation in RRC_CONNECTED will initiate the procedure when the following conditions are met:","paragraph_zero_based":8120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRC message segmentation is enabled based on the field rrc-SegAllowed, rrc-SegAllowedSRB4 or rrc-SegAllowedSRB5 received, and","paragraph_zero_based":8121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the encoded RRC message is larger than the maximum supported size of a PDCP SDU specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":8122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":8123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initiate transmission of the ULDedicatedMessageSegment message as specified in 5.7.7.3;","paragraph_zero_based":8124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.7.3Actions related to transmission of ULDedicatedMessageSegment message","paragraph_zero_based":8125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall segment the encoded RRC PDU based on the maximum supported size of a PDCP SDU specified in TS 38.323 [5]. UE shall minimize the number of segments and set the contents of the ULDedicatedMessageSegment messages as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>For each new UL DCCH message, set the segmentNumber to 0 for the first message segment and increment the segmentNumber for each subsequent RRC message segment;","paragraph_zero_based":8127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set rrc-MessageSegmentContainer to include the segment of the UL DCCH message corresponding to the segmentNumber;","paragraph_zero_based":8128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the segment included in the rrc-MessageSegmentContainer is the last segment of the UL DCCH message:","paragraph_zero_based":8129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the rrc-MessageSegmentType to lastSegment;","paragraph_zero_based":8130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the rrc-MessageSegmentType to notLastSegment;","paragraph_zero_based":8132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit all the ULDedicatedMessageSegment messages generated for the segmented RRC message to lower layers for transmission in ascending order based on the segmentNumber, upon which the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":8133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.8Idle/inactive Measurements","paragraph_zero_based":8134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.8.1General","paragraph_zero_based":8135}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c6fc652e774d