{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This procedure specifies the measurements to be performed and stored by a UE in RRC_IDLE and RRC_INACTIVE when it has an idle/inactive measurement configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":8136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.8.1aMeasurement configuration","paragraph_zero_based":8137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to update the idle/inactive measurement configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":8138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE initiates this procedure while T331 is running and SDT procedure is not ongoing and one of the following conditions is met:","paragraph_zero_based":8139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon selecting a cell when entering RRC_IDLE or RRC-INACTIVE from RRC_CONNECTED or RRC_INACTIVE; or","paragraph_zero_based":8140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon update of system information (SIB4, or SIB11), e.g. due to intra-RAT cell (re)selection;","paragraph_zero_based":8141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"While in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, and T331 is running, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":8142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if VarMeasIdleConfig includes neither a measIdleCarrierListEUTRA nor a measIdleCarrierListNR received from the RRCRelease message:","paragraph_zero_based":8143},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports idleInactiveEUTRA-MeasReport:","paragraph_zero_based":8144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the SIB11 includes the measIdleConfigSIB and contains measIdleCarrierListEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":8145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store or replace the measIdleCarrierListEUTRA of measIdleConfigSIB of SIB11 within VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":8146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the measIdleCarrierListEUTRA in VarMeasIdleConfig, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":8148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports idleInactiveNR-MeasReport:","paragraph_zero_based":8149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB11 includes the measIdleConfigSIB and contains measIdleCarrierListNR:","paragraph_zero_based":8150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store or replace the measIdleCarrierListNR of measIdleConfigSIB of SIB11 within VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":8151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the measIdleCarrierListNR in VarMeasIdleConfig, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":8153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports reselection measurement reporting:","paragraph_zero_based":8154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB11 includes the measIdleConfigSIB and contains measReselectionCarrierListNR:","paragraph_zero_based":8155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store or replace the measReselectionCarrierListNR of measIdleConfigSIB of SIB11 within VarMeasReselectionConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":8156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the measReselectionCarrierListNR in VarMeasReselectionConfig, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":8158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB11 includes the measIdleConfigSIB and contains measReselectionValidityDuration:","paragraph_zero_based":8159}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2c3fbf13e7da8f7cfd71675aa547fdccd10779e54ccb8ccbb7f155f8a071dc89","2fb68004121203b70ed1