{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>for the oldest PCell entry in visitedCellInfoList including visitedPSCellInfoListReport;","paragraph_zero_based":8304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>remove the oldest entry in the visitedPSCellInfoListReport;","paragraph_zero_based":8305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>remove the oldest entry in visitedPSCellInfoList in variable VarMobilityHistoryReport;","paragraph_zero_based":8307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for the included entry:","paragraph_zero_based":8308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the global cell identity of the PSCell (in case the UE continues to be connected to the same PSCell) or the previous PSCell (in case the UE changes PSCell, or in case PSCell is released) is available:","paragraph_zero_based":8309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the global cell identity of that cell in the field visitedCellId of the entry;","paragraph_zero_based":8310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8311},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of that cell in the field visitedCellId of the entry;","paragraph_zero_based":8312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the field timeSpent of the entry as the time spent in the PSCell, while being connected to previous PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE supports PSCell mobility history information and if the UE was not configured with a PSCell at the time of change of PCell in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":8314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include an entry in visitedPSCellInfoList after performing the following, if necessary;","paragraph_zero_based":8315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if visitedPSCellInfoListReport is available in the visitedCellInfoList in variable VarMobilityHistoryReport:","paragraph_zero_based":8316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>for the oldest PCell entry in visitedCellInfoList including visitedPSCellInfoListReport;","paragraph_zero_based":8317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>remove the oldest entry in the visitedPSCellInfoListReport;","paragraph_zero_based":8318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>remove the oldest entry in visitedPSCellInfoList in variable VarMobilityHistoryReport;","paragraph_zero_based":8320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for the included entry:","paragraph_zero_based":8321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the field timeSpent of the entry as the time without PSCell according to the following:","paragraph_zero_based":8322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the UE experienced a PSCell release since entering the previous PCell in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":8323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include the time spent with no PSCell since last PSCell release since entering the previous PCell in RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":8324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include the time spent with no PSCell since entering the previous PCell in RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":8326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE supports PSCell mobility history information and if visitedPSCellInfoList exists in VarMobilityHistoryReport:","paragraph_zero_based":8327}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256"