{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include visitedPSCellInfoList in VarMobilityHistoryReport in the visitedPSCellInfoListReport within the entry of the visitedCellInfoList associated to the latest PCell entry;","paragraph_zero_based":8328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove visitedPSCellInfoList from the variable VarMobilityHistoryReport;","paragraph_zero_based":8329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE supports PSCell mobility history information and upon entering 'camped normally' state in NR (in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE) or E-UTRA (in RRC_IDLE) while previously in RRC_CONNECTED state NR or LTE while not connected to a PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":8330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include an entry in visitedPSCellInfoList after performing the following, if necessary;","paragraph_zero_based":8331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if visitedPSCellInfoListReport is available in the visitedCellInfoList in variable VarMobilityHistoryReport:","paragraph_zero_based":8332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for the oldest PCell entry in visitedCellInfoList including visitedPSCellInfoListReport;","paragraph_zero_based":8333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the oldest entry in the visitedPSCellInfoListReport;","paragraph_zero_based":8334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8335},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the oldest entry in visitedPSCellInfoList in variable VarMobilityHistoryReport;","paragraph_zero_based":8336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the included entry:","paragraph_zero_based":8337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the field timeSpent of the entry as the time without PSCell according to the following:","paragraph_zero_based":8338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE experienced a PSCell release since entering the current PCell in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":8339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the time spent with no PSCell since last PSCell release after entering the current PCell in RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":8340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the time spent with no PSCell since entering the current PCell in RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":8342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon entering 'camped normally' state in NR (in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE) or E-UTRA (in RRC_IDLE) while previously in 'any cell selection' state or 'camped on any cell' state in NR or LTE:","paragraph_zero_based":8343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include an entry in variable VarMobilityHistoryReport possibly after removing the oldest entry, if necessary, according to following:","paragraph_zero_based":8344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the field timeSpent of the entry as the time spent in 'any cell selection' state and/or 'camped on any cell' state in NR or LTE.","paragraph_zero_based":8345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.9.3Release of Mobility History Information","paragraph_zero_based":8346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE supports storage of mobility history information, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":8347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if stored, discard the mobility history information, i.e. release the UE variable VarMobilityHistoryReport upon deregistration from the network as specified in TS 23.502 [43].","paragraph_zero_based":8348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.10UE Information","paragraph_zero_based":8349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.10.1General","paragraph_zero_based":8350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":8351}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_