{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if connEstFailReportReq is set to true and the UE has connection establishment failure or connection resume failure information in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the RPLMN is equal to plmn-Identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or in at least one of the entries of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":8400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if connEstFailReportReq is set to true and if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the registered SNPN identity is equal to snpn-identity in networkIdentity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or any entry of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":8401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set timeSinceFailure in VarConnEstFailReport to the time that elapsed since the last connection establishment failure or connection resume failure in NR;","paragraph_zero_based":8402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the connEstFailReport in the UEInformationResponse message to the value of connEstFailReport in VarConnEstFailReport;","paragraph_zero_based":8403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports multiple CEF report:","paragraph_zero_based":8404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each connEstFailReport in the connEstFailReportList in VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":8405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set timeSinceFailure to the time that elapsed since the associated connection establishment failure or connection resume failure in NR;","paragraph_zero_based":8406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each connEstFailReport in the connEstFailReportList in the UEInformationResponse message, set the value to the value of connEstFailReport in VarConnEstFailReport in VarConnEstFailReportList;","paragraph_zero_based":8407},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the connEstFailReport from VarConnEstFailReport and VarConnEstFailReportList upon successful delivery of the UEInformationResponse message confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":8408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the mobilityHistoryReportReq is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":8409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the mobilityHistoryReport and set it to include visitedCellInfoList from VarMobilityHistoryReport;","paragraph_zero_based":8410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include in the mobilityHistoryReport an entry for the current PCell, possibly after removing the oldest entry if required, and set its fields as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set visitedCellId to the global cell identity or the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the current PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":8412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set field timeSpent to the time spent in the current PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE supports PSCell mobility history information and if visitedPSCellInfoList is present in VarMobilityHistoryReport:","paragraph_zero_based":8414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for the newest entry of the PCell in the mobilityHistoryReport, include visitedPSCellInfoList from VarMobilityHistoryReport;","paragraph_zero_based":8415},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is configured with a PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":8416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the newest entry of the PCell in the mobilityHistoryReport, include the current PSCell information in the visitedPSCellInfoListReport, possibly after removing the oldest PSCell entry of a PCell in the mobilityHistoryReport, if required, and set its fields as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set visitedCellId to the global cell identity or the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the current PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":8418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set field timeSpent to the time spent in the current PSCell while being connected to the current PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the newest entry of the PCell in the mobilityHistoryReport, include a new entry in the visitedPSCellInfoListReport, possibly after removing the oldest PSCell entry of a PCell in the mobilityHistoryReport, if required, and set its fields as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set field timeSpent to the time spent without PSCell in the current PCell since last PSCell release since connected to the current PCell in RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":8422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the UE supports PSCell mobility history information:","paragraph_zero_based":8423}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b5e74652be9213709e84b58d6fad18194b1df3721f953b0026da9ded18a488ea","6e6a6b04871ead6d7b0c03daac089973d14220193a89679e994304455e8e0073","1d5ff4abfc4af274c25eca772a6dd052b1962befa95797d17f28ec55c01cd7ce","3f9043cff69f4a8dafe2d16a9ffad420164e1bb813b30ecde74b590a70d4c50f","db49dc66d6d14786c0b2793d1f782535bddd89bcf33e6a5798dfcf7222c1f093","38dbb4e377457c8fe664446be05c5fe2e300df485f56f1625a18437c9d324103","f2c81d5543c1c3f353e75eaef1b3b92245d17e684c93273b9f2b26f773318d55","daee9099777881145df69724b16dac3e3a4ce6983ba9a556755120fe67fa3d35","998c8d937866e45e16623cddc9bc5b5e36505ef63996c410fb118e657e0f369d","f9c2b468b26e107dcd24f45038b87b10205c766aa2a1dce464b6cd901af37d9c","19a18ffc0519e41b66053bf025df7a63a34460341ca918d601aa1238424e86e0","2e075d7e991f9efb22d6f923d4bf12997ec5bf4260243e461af7ba88164de001","d8b404f89f25bde6f494b81964f8c047348ffe571b6618c3155419637287fe7d","c75ac183bb276abfa9e6219260188618e5391babf4a1f02fd0fcd22e440c6ef4","77840290d187e1dba46c29e66be52e4f346518b20c19a7ef1f2212cbab2b7a19","1df852ac14e4ca9689237dc1e5c3d94da741be35511a9325a7cf26fd30607c2e","23a66e0e07a4371a4739431d93f57e5ca69a3202984c942c5a4ff8edb8b2768b","e768cc0d748c43ec2fb6791068204bd60f2653f202c5d008a09743eb76fb6749","8895204af4479e2a4184fea675b1881763e127fec32d6d9130ebadcbb48b8e1d","52044649282f06aa31bfd1c378643fbcf6ff0c15aa716d00e9838b077cfece91","94dc46f6ae44008d1ed10974cc6276443dc9ee5b2f66cd40cf2e85448cf5184b","81a3099bf9c84f5401a653be1fea628c9d761260ab6498090f931345162fe875","3e952f9b60d9099f4679b2a9533364d66bad9abea8f98dc056d2492ab0e23a18","29a69bac4d07987934e6beb02dd7f5c4ed2ba1c8abb6680c08e27156127c407a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8400,8423],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8400"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is configured with a PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":8424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the newest entry of the PCell in the mobilityHistoryReport, include the current PSCell information in the visitedPSCellInfoListReport, possibly after removing the oldest PSCell entry of a PCell in the mobilityHistoryReport, if required, and set its fields as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set visitedCellId to the global cell identity or the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the current PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":8426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set field timeSpent to the time spent in the current PSCell while being connected to the current PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the newest entry of the PCell in the mobilityHistoryReport, include a new entry in the visitedPSCellInfoListReport, possibly after removing the oldest PSCell entry of a PCell in the mobilityHistoryReport, if required, and set its fields as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set field timeSpent to the time spent without PSCell in the current PCell since connected to the current PCell in RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":8430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the successHO-ReportReq is set to true and if the UE has successful handover related information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the RPLMN is included in the plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessHO-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":8431},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the successHO-ReportReq is set to true and if the UE has successful handover related information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList if stored in the VarSuccessHO-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":8432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the successHO-Report in the VarSuccessHO-Report concerns a DAPS handover and if a PDCP PDU has been received from the source cell of the concerned HO and a non-duplicated PDCP PDU has been received from the target cell of the concerned HO:","paragraph_zero_based":8433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set upInterruptionTimeAtHO in VarSuccessHO-Report to include the time elapsed between the time of arrival of the last PDCP PDU received from the source cell of the concerned handover and the time of arrival of the first non-duplicate PDCP PDU received from the target cell of the concerned handover, as measured at the time of arrival of the first non-duplicate PDCP PDU received from the target cell;","paragraph_zero_based":8434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the successHO-Report in the VarSuccessHO-Report concerns a mobilityFromNRCommand:","paragraph_zero_based":8435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set timeSinceSHR in VarSuccessHO-Report to the time that elapsed since the successful handover report determination as specified in 5.7.10.6;","paragraph_zero_based":8436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the successHO-Report in the UEInformationResponse message to the value of successHO-Report in the VarSuccessHO-Report, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":8437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the VarSuccessHO-Report upon successful delivery of the UEInformationResponse message confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":8438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the successPSCell-ReportReq is set to true and if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessPSCell-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":8439},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the successPSCell-ReportReq is set to true and if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList if stored in the VarSuccessPSCell-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":8440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the successPSCell-Report in the UEInformationResponse message to the value of successPSCell-Report in the VarSuccessPSCell-Report;","paragraph_zero_based":8441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the VarSuccessPSCell-Report upon successful delivery of the UEInformationResponse message confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":8442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the coarseLocationRequest is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":8443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include coarseLocationInfo, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":8444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the flightPathInfoReq is included in the UEInformationRequest and the UE has (updated) flight path information available, set the flightPathInfoReport in the UEInformationResponse message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the list of up to maxWayPointNumber waypoints, if any, along the flight path;","paragraph_zero_based":8446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the includeTimeStamp is set to true, for each included waypoint:","paragraph_zero_based":8447}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a597067adeaa1f5d6b2147cb9e8095d36adab5af3e760d35702e1fbcb46823c4","b6c325c2465768c2337a7fb83ba83a67b78933a42adc3aed81f38cb174fab7fd","d3aa940706f75e24cc3d8789989481cd5ecc7cd596f22bda14e7f1e8786dce7c","fcb474e5801e8db2114b83d8f8e463789a9e1136ae0f5e7cc3806919484b5fb6","265dd99aa2cf6d0857c6f2679a689d7a9517da6b13962eb67c607cae8e8af7b9","3d63fb33fe629ba7c0f3ce648a9eed8866de409a6050743aab6804b86db4e919","3ec837fe836d1adbec39392225cb2c29ee9ec756f3e078f1c280c2eb7afe868c","c00455cfc43e6b3cbfd0195f9c0f49f5a00d0d46f9867eae56ad2669afe103a6","edfa727413ef275b7f3c6efdbbd4a1e194909f07922a67d3a264bae92eeafec5","d8497072420fe97367c8e123720b363540e205e26d2c49383eedce1fc3fbdc43","6feeeed2d4e43bf55666811d7ff6e484891d4105a0e41ae9f55fe161ce1182e0","2329bde724917e2a455495837c3f71a5b0786c68e6f38ff16d7325705ccc7ec2","1dcbc64cc640d6b8917819650eff746deb389d1fb8e308dd6f27dd0956871107","2b0af9bb47e4ee23b2bb33603514763932fb65213fc883059dd54af4933fbada","439520cdef14d567e403ddb79fc780b2207c0c75377de93dd0113dac0cde4e03","c4de08bd634882d4ab168f6d6ffa71597e55571ae34c7e4fd93a91d0183ad5ba","5b2836fab85b851ffd048276b99dd30a26f2c209a262f6806c4270595cc0ab50","1ce341d6ba4a1be364e0840b19689dad81729b04edda42e4c8c7d28a1ed288a7","743579b7b3cc785e3cd8c282e6e166602350b77b0d09a887ec16eef643663400","74be8664bb0be4a1e161d4446b3d01753b096e0550e0e12f3a9376f8ae693e71","7202f400002183df3434e5f2d4f01231f50423bc5cde0b66af8e25067283e349","ef1b88516bb30fca19930ad1c88871453bcd4956b2838328c1865b9bce737ae5","55fe01f00368560fe4fb75423b5c2dbb0631a4dc1d3467c3050d91ba294f5461","282a6345ca6c93180a869cebc73d08cf62306cb1d7b082a09ab1857ed4edfb33"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8424,8447],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8424"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if available, set the field timestamp to the time when UE intends to arrive at the waypoint;","paragraph_zero_based":8448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the logMeasReport is included in the UEInformationResponse:","paragraph_zero_based":8449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the UEInformationResponse message to lower layers for transmission via SRB2;","paragraph_zero_based":8450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the logged measurement entries included in the logMeasInfoList from VarLogMeasReport upon successful delivery of the UEInformationResponse message confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":8451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the UEInformationResponse message to lower layers for transmission via SRB1.","paragraph_zero_based":8453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.10.4Actions for the Random Access report determination","paragraph_zero_based":8454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon successfully performing random-access procedure initialized with 4-step or 2-step RA type, or upon failed or successfully completed on-demand system information acquisition procedure in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE state, or upon failed or successfully completed RA-SDT operation as specified in clause 5.3.13.5, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":8455},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RPLMN or the PLMN selected by upper layers (see TS24.501 [23]) from the PLMN(s) included in the plmn-IdentityList in SIB1 is not included in plmn-IdentityList stored in a non-empty VarRA-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":8456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the registered SNPN identity or the SNPN identity selected by upper layers (see TS24.501 [23]) from the list of SNPN(s) included in the NPN-IdentityInfoList in SIB1is not included in snpn-IdentityList stored in a non-empty VarRA-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":8457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>clear the information included in VarRA-Report;","paragraph_zero_based":8458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is not in SNPN access mode and if the number of RA-Report entries stored in the ra-ReportList in VarRA-Report is less than maxRAReport:","paragraph_zero_based":8459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the number of PLMN entries in plmn-IdentityList in identityList stored in VarRA-Report is less than maxPLMN; or","paragraph_zero_based":8460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the number of PLMN entries in plmn-IdentityList in identityList stored in VarRA-Report is equal to maxPLMN and the list of EPLMNs is subset of or equal to the plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRA-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":8461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>append the following contents associated to the random-access procedure as a new entry in the VarRA-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":8462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the list of EPLMNs has been stored by the UE:","paragraph_zero_based":8463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the plmn-IdentityList to include the list of EPLMNs stored by the UE (i.e. includes the RPLMN) without exceeding the limit of maxPLMN;","paragraph_zero_based":8464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the plmn-Identity, in plmn-IdentityList, to the PLMN selected by upper layers (see TS 24.501 [23]) from the PLMN(s) included in the plmn-IdentityInfoList in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":8466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the cellId to the global cell identity and the tracking area code, if available, otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the cell in which the corresponding random-access preamble was transmitted;","paragraph_zero_based":8467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports spCell ID indication:","paragraph_zero_based":8468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the corresponding random-access procedure was performed on an SCell of MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":8469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the spCellId to the global cell identity of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the corresponding random-access procedure was performed on an SCell of SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":8471}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f0de2c610f2220fd42540086f56f0922250fb8ba5000c821c28fd730197f3cac","73e0fed4290409533f1ae82eaa72606d33ee73bdfd7ef86b53c14a869072d03c","1b06dbe00d2a95411d67b85dc15e0ead145eeb66411581e0c295024119a7503b","a5db2abf519d93d4284ac405bdec76c59b72303e3585786cb11560f8268d675f","f2c7a05d2d366e870caaaa0d2763bd8067474e8d54c5e53eda4105c64dc7819a","eb21a4dac0a313bd3fe6e78af311ac6f4faeef15fbdf30c6fad1e07368194641","3ec2db481316421c16a7c261d242809e0c628f0f5c279aaeaa525a183e36f7e9","d9d00df1fdc56247c62f5cf058bbed310f9d680677948af2df2edc7016492585","775627e0d9b8f655c6d89b683f855696df6c5afc4c1ded1f346bbef1c5fc59cf","f5b80d161b790fa97776b121d8ee5ef19cc7329dccaad47439e2bd10365ceeb6","c23e74c7fc7572e76b93905d21f90a4ad8f11b1bbd5aa5b8444afb01533d2c83","948963b0c0828458aab442555c2cfdf8c1a934253569227af92ed6ec8d3e473b","375a77df0aadadfd048953d044f5d0b3056d335b3f4d9ff56922c4f523747bf8","08521215e29c04e125f50966a6bd79912ef542dd81eaeed1f77bb90ce455fe11","f8bbce4e71ca58712730811de3b19e0be7cfb3b4ef6453c24a2600fe389f1679","4a1af57cf7ccb8a22c1fc4038514e053cc986fc6d137de6ee8c20e1c2874691d","931f3781fe154a02c27b5595e7e33e731ec2eb38278f1bcc4c6d3dc3fd262b65","75e001b48eba83d5d2fce2adc51a8e0415f657f4737e0e24b9be6e8e074e2574","8648732f82ee858740ba0705ac706d18e3648cd6f0cd71c8430cecf897cab52d","87b1fdae4f33f1e063ff117c4b5427972e37adabc0322c544d6463661a9bf55d","f5e43de7c3bb50e6f2e6bd87b9103a4d75e30af7905a486eb25281ff5e81a034","5092ad87f6ad822db7ddcc273d520a647dec76821e1ce28459791588dfc43002","a3183ca05677093788c301f73cc7e3936b98ca271c924de24af928a52c613367","c83ef31ab294acf206ac3d5beecd7831a0f64b623e1e89baa62b68ae4c03b298"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8448,8471],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8448"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the spCellId to the global cell identity of the PSCell, if available, otherwise, set the spCellId to the global cell identity of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the corresponding random-access procedure was performed on PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":8473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the cellId is not set to the global cell identity of the PSCell, set the spCellId to the global cell identity of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the raPurpose to include the purpose of triggering the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the ra-InformationCommon as specified in clause 5.7.10.5.","paragraph_zero_based":8476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in SNPN access mode and if the number of RA-Report entries stored in the ra-ReportList in VarRA-Report is less than maxRAReport:","paragraph_zero_based":8477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the number of SNPN identity entries in snpn-IdentityList in identityList stored in VarRA-Report is less than maxNPN; or","paragraph_zero_based":8478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the number of SNPN identity entries in snpn-IdentityList in identityList stored in VarRA-Report is equal to maxNPN and the list of equivalent SNPN(s) is subset of or equal to the snpn-IdentityList stored in VarRA-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":8479},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>append the following contents associated to the random-access procedure as a new entry in the VarRA-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":8480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the list of equivalent SNPN(s) has been stored by the UE:","paragraph_zero_based":8481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the snpn-IdentityList to include the list of equivalent SNPN(s) stored by the UE (i.e. includes the registered SNPN identity) without exceeding the limit of maxNPN;","paragraph_zero_based":8482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the snpn-Identity, in snpn-IdentityList, to the SNPN identity selected by upper layers (see TS 24.501 [23]) from the SNPN identities included in the NPN-IdentityInfoList in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":8484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the cellId to the global cell identity and the tracking area code, if available, otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the cell in which the corresponding random-access preamble was transmitted;","paragraph_zero_based":8485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports spCell ID indication:","paragraph_zero_based":8486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the corresponding random-access procedure was performed on an SCell of MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":8487},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the spCellId to the global cell identity of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the corresponding random-access procedure was performed on an SCell of SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":8489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the spCellId to the global cell identity of the PSCell, if available, otherwise, set the spCellId to the global cell identity of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the corresponding random-access procedure was performed on PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":8491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the cellId is not set to the global cell identity of the PSCell, set the spCellId to the global cell identity of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the raPurpose to include the purpose of triggering the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the ra-InformationCommon as specified in clause 5.7.10.5.","paragraph_zero_based":8494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE may discard the random access report information, i.e. release the UE variable VarRA-Report, 48 hours after the last successful random access procedure or the failed or successfully completed on-demand system information acquisition procedure or the failed or successfully completed RA-SDT procedure related information is added to the VarRA-Report.","paragraph_zero_based":8495}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e7e01eef61c58dabe550049b5c99696109cb26ccc25bbb2f42215b22817e6bd9","79351f5ad013f197809ba7a271b7c760cf63cd5d62857320ff2dd751ce4db5b9","3fce77a925b7ce1a9c10f446d966d01228a08b85c72e521f09d47c9b6ab1520f","f0b48f8d994a97a72e15afdaf2093c40dabc3391e4f2ceaffa12da14460fcc84","8b282cc825b3a921b083da432aee92c36db6c69e36884342eeeca5cb258412a1","776956ce203e0e89e5022a6dabfcb6ce8a94ab17074392fab2c975201c7ddb90","698167a6a762305ce715f6020a45fccd33dba773a9743ed7d17b75c9bff78b95","f6bd18493ec57cb8bca47067708947f5def36c440b2ecd904f8bdf8935aec048","7ea0d18cebdf41f3955fac66871be49f1e08188b47d3cd747681e1160252a762","2027980c9fc1264d9eaadcfc2515d590e5646d44d50f26b8ce30092d6621fd2d","a60be6f821ca62c79fbf92ff5fafacf3473c6576c5b66ad44ed308696ac49de1","c7af4de39644e0573f781e0a3179df837fbbab5a1aec64c127ba9b7106303120","7cf20065a7513b1cee3cbdc0984b2efd1a09716aa70b0b1c0721c080eefb34f0","7864c83e5476c45c2be28ee15c25a795f77a2b60841b331d0e7b8b3cb2945664","b5bcd7e063b92372c128b7b72ffb5a26384b6bdfd4893aa192b768305ae7d61c","81f0e2b66942fe15814ad0c25b50a88ae2ef7f27fce46919c337370d80f7d17c","50e8c58c528dfa1c0c4b33446ee57200a549390e2d7509750bc787c9a4740d80","e8cf8b72c96a59ded8eba30f341ae47b6d1b7c476b97e55cedc4b7bc9a658ce9","fb469c02d6c89cb64140de9b843551d29a0b830b7aa998a550a15e936d933508","b2abc696b4b3b68357715676bbbf70c15933da921ebb67b9451ce747b2fdebcd","9d63906bcfc5bf94042b36c9f5317697521c325a568be38f2a9c18094a989841","119ab9095b2f7b8678f628d11f7f881820d93327a3bfab19c19d4c96513e81eb","ae9a33625f25009ada9638b8fd7ed43665829d4db188dc90c0fa7ff370d27a79","e3691cdae93cba82b49fb04009449943eed2f2d52db515776b185a34f566c860"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8472,8495],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8472"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":8496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.10.5RA information determination","paragraph_zero_based":8497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall, for the last successfully completed or last failed random-access procedure, set the content in ra-InformationCommon as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the absoluteFrequencyPointA to indicate the absolute frequency of the reference resource block associated to the random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the locationAndBandwidth and subcarrierSpacing associated to the UL BWP of the random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if contention based random-access resources are used in the random-access procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":8501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msgA_RO-FrequencyStart and msgA-RO-FDM and msgA-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 2 step random- access resources if used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if msgA-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 2 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure is available:","paragraph_zero_based":8503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msgA-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 2 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if only 2 step random-access resources are available in the UL BWP used in the random-access procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":8505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msgA-SCS-From-prach-ConfigurationIndex to the subcarrier spacing as derived from the msgA-PRACH-ConfigurationIndex used in the 2-step random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msg1-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 4 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msg1-FrequencyStart associated to the 4 step random-access resources if used in the random-access procedure, and if its value is different from the value of msgA-RO-FrequencyStart if it is included in the ra-InformationCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":8509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msg1-FDM associated to the 4 step random-access resources if used in the random-access procedure, and if its value is different from the value of msgA-RO-FDMCFRA if it is included in the ra-InformationCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":8510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if msg1-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 4 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure is available, and if its value is different from the value of msgA-SubcarrierSpacing if it is included in the ra-InformationCommon:","paragraph_zero_based":8511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msg1-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 4 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> else:","paragraph_zero_based":8513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msg1-SCS-From-prach-ConfigurationIndex to the subcarrier spacing as derived from the prach-ConfigurationIndex used in the 4-step random-access procedure, and if its value is different from the value of msgA-SCS-From-prach-ConfigurationIndex if it is included in the ra-InformationCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":8514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if contention free random-access resources are used in the random-access procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":8515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msg1-FrequencyStartCFRA and msg1-FDMCFRA associated to the 4 step random-access resources if used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> if msg1-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 4 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure is available:","paragraph_zero_based":8517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msg1-SubcarrierSpacingCFRA associated to the 4 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> else:","paragraph_zero_based":8519}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a3302964ca3d4af835178fa30af3c107124db94e9e0b7f8aac15b211eef68b5d","5a2fc004670a385d44fe60bcfee4fff27cfea33d3bd814b2442f81b92204afd9","570bca6aecdf41081622cfd71f985c0b83ec5cc2a89fac9e26336e1db2a2ffe9","73937fb9b13c9af89ba9ac7129f0d8fdbbb691831e7a0afbf72da84ad30059a4","f9f5968c6b608097675a6e6494b5b613c209c83e2fea7d9933da02f934e49387","22141940c346bd5bc4efe2a75be05e9368fff71ec402e792c0944bfe867a606e","e91e773b03cd2d6f2a1c9ba1590c65d748cf6a1e35a25b7b205410feb0321745","d3e6dce9d7a3b794a791cf44691756fb025dcc3ebfa0cb48a238a371e5fe8459","1cc0da6924639ba19629ed6272d0e111b0f6b11500d467c002411afaf74dbc9a","773aae9d5c7a5f2d3ac5937b6d99219fd28eb2cc48ffea8a932f8566aac5c936","42844bc7d263beaa5f801352920e73bea60638dcddffedc9a45b02efd1eddee5","089daa7c312dd425472b1fb3a7f199f4e70f49c4d300784ec535222424fb4f5f","baabf86b686a51a614deee2e10007755dbb477a73b93ad924895bda4f20f2d97","5c8360e6588d290ade27b637c01ed61714760183fa67b0c0850944eb6f682c38","03afe80a7a94e47ae9caa8d41d0bc222a07adb8d9b179c79c7e4562443cf8e63","9a63c4be83d8528b5423191831c0d6ceb060023f06ebc34d6c06cb99bfe2168c","19c6d0de286ad1169d5e3cf26e71e02a32a83ebb22671e4cbec950b8c6a58544","7931b9beafbf0ccd33c3f27e38b5b3ed34284895706228e71211543b34bb9232","15e5cf1de4ae4fa8238efb7b1cde1656830d7bcf13b75ae054e486aa6edb604b","344cb1e3e7e5e836d06ba964a8b500c5b9a2119212a0029fcb458a22c37e9e47","c9cdcca2946eecab8a745a9f29f1cddf0bf273c447cbef831e1fe6d8ef36eb9d","7ec4fc85a912877e99604e5e945d209b6f46c01d08f7f75073441a536ce413a2","b547a9cc38480f74cd309418d5893b7be4aaf2f37109c04f0c890e401140f4a1","2de91013056bed6e5557094865fdff9ee674fd1451caf7196c88ecce4fb7c1ac"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8496,8519],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8496"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msg1-SCS-From-prach-ConfigurationIndexCFRA to the subcarrier spacing as derived from the prach-ConfigurationIndex used in the 4 step random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msgA-RO-FrequencyStartCFRA and msgA-RO-FDMCFRA associated to the 2 step contention free random access resources if used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msgA-MCS, the nrofPRBs-PerMsgA-PO, the msgA-PUSCH-TimeDomainAllocation, the frequencyStartMsgA-PUSCH, the nrofMsgA-PO-FDM associated to the 2 step random-access resources if used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if msgA-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 2 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure is available:","paragraph_zero_based":8523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msgA-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 2 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if only 2 step random-access resources are available in the UL BWP used in the random-access procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":8525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msgA-SCS-From-prach-ConfigurationIndex to the subcarrier spacing as derived from the msgA-PRACH-ConfigurationIndex used in the 2-step random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8527},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msg1-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 4 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the random access procedure is initialized with RA_TYPE set to 2-stepRA as described in TS 38.321 [3]:","paragraph_zero_based":8529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the dlPathlossRSRP to the measeured RSRP of the DL pathloss reference obtained at the time of RA_Type selection stage of the initialization of the RA procedure as captured in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":8530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the configuration for the random access msgA-TransMax was configured in RACH-ConfigDedicated for this random access procedure, and raPurpose is set to reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":8531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set msgA-TransMax to the value of msgA-TransMax in RACH-ConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":8532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if msgA-TransMax was configured in RACH-ConfigCommonTwoStepRA:","paragraph_zero_based":8533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set msgA-TransMax to the value of msgA-TransMax in RACH-ConfigCommonTwoStepRA;","paragraph_zero_based":8534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msgA-PUSCH-PayloadSize to the size of the overall payload available in the UE buffer at the time of initiating the 2 step RA procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the purpose of the random access procedure is to request on-demand system information (i.e., if the raPurpose is set to requestForOtherSI or msg3RequestForOtherSI):","paragraph_zero_based":8536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the intendedSIBs to indicate the SIB(s) the UE wanted to receive as a result of the SI request;","paragraph_zero_based":8537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the ssbsForSI-Acquisition to indicate the SSB(s) used to receive the SI message;","paragraph_zero_based":8538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the on-demand system information acquisition was successful:","paragraph_zero_based":8539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the onDemandSISuccess to true;","paragraph_zero_based":8540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if one or more of the features including RedCap and/or Slicing and/or SDT and/or MSG3 repetitions and/or MSG1 repetitions and/or eRedCap are applicable for this random-access procedure as specified in clause 5.1.1b of TS 38.321[3]:","paragraph_zero_based":8541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the triggeredFeatureCombination to indicate all the features triggering this random-access procedure as below:","paragraph_zero_based":8542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if this random-access procedure is triggered by RedCap, include redCap;","paragraph_zero_based":8543}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["972a15ac549b0b33934affc9fc2e7594da6007e164d843b217f9cbfaff70a39c","121fedde24f7f27de4aca8de10666aa88a217ab2a0809ad417e1532a259d2d19","08360349b084ebfdb8f7041603e933082d04f2fa0edf0f8b4e07cfb1c87775a0","3f1bc80deb6aecac543ae83410827b3021b85bbbf5cfb21e747ee3098d02c4c3","380c65e4bd8ffd770d26c2a07a6ee40993b6b3cbe20723fe9084746c030853b9","5570b994da8366b12237485d2c96d78b3a9885204daf3f4fb055176545de817d","088a365c68302df7430fb6a352b27e3d56926892115bff052cf2122b4262995e","982aec3a5dc60aee081c9793852bf70a47ecfba6fe13b1c40ec8eb0511f0b65f","3138cf23e1a61f8abad3ab0719b6a5b13fcadbc2a7092655695eff0d1078e1a0","6af62b20e652e02fcab4696b05651ea21c37f2563c16836966a8066bcc6bdda8","86104ac8421ac95a9e79a8b8a2fa42105ae3a399686b4a578dd280b8c8b44e63","cf930ffa6a1d1e30830cd0dbba39ebe32d670dc5400a601bb9072b6b38897035","1b4b694a32919434571c54c0ec963591f64560fb73c5c32ebd5f9a23c8c49c25","df0a10ce291b46ac5913d38ec042969c2291a92f168287aaa5b6ff963b5cdc08","42c0cd98814ce2769dc486bfc36aed298c02d4b5fd1eb8188480c1b0621f1974","d14daf5d33935ab83675281db84f43abdd863f7fd875277eb19b8d5c474a831e","a6c905dabbff26ace6fa18705ea50c9b7f424a1c3863d40be648cf63ef8328aa","46e4ce3cd6031aa4b8dec093fe45625eec037aff79af84dd49a56c48ab4a0779","ae8cbe3a424bbab0b2379d0410116d9a1707e78c749dea541fef1632a74aa9e1","e52c3873d4c18ceabfc2e8d4af6e1975bbe80ace85b2c31702939f07d14c64e1","81b15981adc9fba267150fa0d73574eb7f851c71a7a4d7825cc1c35894953688","103b90878e794bf1976f540fec868a87c932478e8be881102343f7a1633f164a","164574496c3472e9a9edee02c6c79111d5c54eb743506be8162e777e7fea8d48","a3dcf198aba42e24a91553c8d0c5de332575eb09e81519fb342f95134b8fa5fe"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8520,8543],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8520"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if this random-access procedure is triggered by SDT, include smallData;","paragraph_zero_based":8544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if this random-access procedure is triggered by Msg3 repetitions, include msg3-Repetitions;","paragraph_zero_based":8545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if this random-access procedure is triggered by Msg1 repetitions, include msg1-Repetitions;","paragraph_zero_based":8546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if this random-access procedure is triggered by eRedCap, include eRedCap;","paragraph_zero_based":8547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if this random-access procedure is triggered by slicing, set nsag to the NSAG ID applied in the random-access procedure and set the triggered-S-NSSAI-List to include all the S-NSSAI(s) associated to the slices triggering the access attempt in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the value of used feature or combination of features is different from the triggeredFeatureCombination:","paragraph_zero_based":8549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the usedFeatureCombination to indicate one or more features of FeatureCombination associated to the random-access resource used in the random-access procedure as below:","paragraph_zero_based":8550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if RedCap is part of the used FeatureCombination, include redCap;","paragraph_zero_based":8551},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if SDT is part of the used FeatureCombination, include smallData;","paragraph_zero_based":8552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if Msg3 repetitions is part of the used FeatureCombination, include msg3-Repetitions;","paragraph_zero_based":8553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if Msg1 repetitions is part of the used FeatureCombination, include msg1-Repetitions;","paragraph_zero_based":8554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if eRedCap is part of the used FeatureCombination, include eRedCap;","paragraph_zero_based":8555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if NSAG(s) is part of the used FeatureCombination, set nsag to include the NSAG-ID(s) configured for the used FeatureCombination;","paragraph_zero_based":8556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the startPreambleForThisPartition to the value of startPreambleForThisPartition in FeatureCombinationPreambles associated to the used FeatureCombination;","paragraph_zero_based":8557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the numberOfPreamblesPerSSB-ForThisPartition to the value of numberOfPreamblesPerSSB-ForThisPartition in FeatureCombinationPreambles associated to the used FeatureCombination;","paragraph_zero_based":8558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the random-access procedure is initiated for SDT and the SDT transmission was failed:","paragraph_zero_based":8559},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the sdt-Failed;","paragraph_zero_based":8560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the parameters associated to the successive random-access attempts associated to the selected beam in the perRAInfoList as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the random-access resource used is associated to a SS/PBCH block, set the associated random-access parameters for the successive random-access attempts associated to the same SS/PBCH block for one or more random-access attempts as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the ssb-Index to include the SS/PBCH block index associated to the used random-access resource;","paragraph_zero_based":8563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfPreamblesSentOnSSB to indicate the number of successive random-access attempts associated to the SS/PBCH block;","paragraph_zero_based":8564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if all preamble transmissions for the successive random-access attempts associated to this SS/PBCH block were blocked by LBT:","paragraph_zero_based":8565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include allPreamblesBlocked;","paragraph_zero_based":8566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8567}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f332f92847e29f44aae90e302e8c023a5918c28e471340580bfac89ad99ed632","cb09869988450c829da68bd2a248cc31e77fb8ceb75bd4de527a2c32c5e11c1e","89eb70af6f2748c2f438f7f37c0117f5dcd1a5c3e12b88fb4454b034feaa257e","8aef395a530944320fc979642a59f925fddd2977ab607baa1f8df4d3446c332b","abf6ae10a8855e26eab73a635ceaf32366daf925228c092d06b9f74cfb228bba","6d5ef14c08423f2cc07487700ae3be729247928e82ef6de7a51512708a777aa6","2d7f2ed69ac07ae51d7f3cce72ab611fe5480a2ab9357d5d10978b100072f7ae","f312e46dd3c42e3dccf2581b29cb3f675dc1d2a5a653a4389ca89b604f804849","66502ab4bab806114c6a4920811ab05a145ea0307299ed6a9880312bf488ec0b","0e90948e5089c5ad58161df7565692297be31d790f4ef3a7e6750c835d71bfc4","d3ce5c43ed8fe041cd0f7634ed59a0994fe4e2b27609ec1764d363aaa55e95e5","13c7d3a23204430f7c010b718273dd1bdf992cd10cd923a2d12b5bff36fae6e2","c230fdc90a38cbf961dfe84a9fc4fe90b73b19e854b75528960098c2cb8f7add","4ecc4964731cb3bb47b2405d3c4bc2d84a6025ba6888fe05557a81da2d95f829","dd0348dd35a5b8020f438866501bf995788517158d3d92b9b6863e921b10e463","9bb9e4c8ae93b6f39c8948b3834e6a995c1b9c3de2968c40a9645e4db240a0aa","2e4af1b62008db7cfe9048b73e19906d4937f05bf9665b12260a24722695df3a","abc36e4783d5c9845e5a16d5b6c6a3a595734e2038bfd70443f0338a6a4bd387","6efd6682baa3d1644a6ea57ed980b0c6b99fa8aff41d21694c9d6f0c4af5d4aa","57e19d7d99e78a793c4be7e2724099cff78480085109eba7d69157e3f18f03de","ce386444e0be1245168bcf89de905f147377d482aaa7b0a316466b641297a6bd","9c9e8fba97d47a2dc53df26f4efc86091b72cc55b8e99cee33ef3e1ee45dbc8f","44e99737859cffa0c02afb1900c8d86b91ec545a64733674ad685f03e97879a0","271ff34017a5498cad725d376941a04d0614540cf2a94b99a020bb6a5de0e179"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8544,8567],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8544"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if LBT failure indication was received from lower layers for the last random-access preamble transmission attempt in the SS/PBCH block associated to the ssb-Index, before changing the SS/PBCH block for random access preamble transmission:","paragraph_zero_based":8568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include lbt-Detected;","paragraph_zero_based":8569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each random-access attempt performed on the random-access resource, except the random-access attempts for which LBT failure indication was received from lower layers, include the following parameters in the chronological order of the random-access attempt:","paragraph_zero_based":8570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the random-access attempt is performed on the contention based random-access resource and if raPurpose is not equal to 'requestForOtherSI', include contentionDetected as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if contention resolution was not successful as specified in TS 38.321 [6] for the transmitted preamble:","paragraph_zero_based":8572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the contentionDetected to true;","paragraph_zero_based":8573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the contentionDetected to false;","paragraph_zero_based":8575},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the random access attempt is a 2-step random access attempt:","paragraph_zero_based":8576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if fallback from 2-step random access to 4-step random access occurred during the random access attempt:","paragraph_zero_based":8577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set fallbackToFourStepRA to true;","paragraph_zero_based":8578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the random-access attempt is performed on the contention based random-access resource; or","paragraph_zero_based":8579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the random-access attempt is performed on the contention free random-access resource and if the random-access procedure was initiated due to the PDCCH ordering:","paragraph_zero_based":8580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the random access attempt is a 4-step random access attempt and the SS/PBCH block RSRP of the SS/PBCH block corresponding to the random-access resource used in the random-access attempt is above rsrp-ThresholdSSB; or","paragraph_zero_based":8581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the random access attempt is a 2-step random access attempt and the SS/PBCH block RSRP of the SS/PBCH block corresponding to the random-access resource used in the random-access attempt is above msgA-RSRP-ThresholdSSB:","paragraph_zero_based":8582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the dlRSRPAboveThreshold to true;","paragraph_zero_based":8583},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the dlRSRPAboveThreshold to false;","paragraph_zero_based":8585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the random-access resource used is associated to a CSI-RS, set the associated random-access parameters for the successive random-access attempts associated to the same CSI-RS for one or more random-access attempts as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the csi-RS-Index to include the CSI-RS index associated to the used random-access resource;","paragraph_zero_based":8587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfPreamblesSentOnCSI-RS to indicate the number of successive random-access attempts associated to the CSI-RS;","paragraph_zero_based":8588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if all preamble transmissions for the successive random-access attempts associated to this CSI-RS were blocked by LBT:","paragraph_zero_based":8589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include allPreamblesBlocked;","paragraph_zero_based":8590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8591}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a39f06b833aa22f50b8bdce5af9d61b9234cedf4aa0eada5e1af1b39f4c3e6dd","a559d2032b7ecac93f1a555e5200f0788cc9b35261ceca0aea5eb39546e69614","0261efdc404c4fac6f854810036b6d47e7be06b38d03e019f3affec047e37b27","453f97d419fec8abafa75b634a51a3478de9e32fe766478d052cc7a02d84df58","a69a70b6d5e1817bcd03874237589ac407cc7446728682883ccccb51405f6b5d","0416773989f684b20862c4d4e0a1e1048c1f6e3eabfeedf341321e02858aaeea","3dc635fafa40c760e125a31d8c108dbe6a31988d149399decc18ecc1f616338b","9fd5c83293b99f337f627e779567e0d47cee778ce90635ff0d75c15a6200b771","d25850c212ba993d1e53c0a29ee98c322a4358ed559a61e505dbf4f1f45b220a","81dc3d23a4f43c9ffa124777a5585c15873aa16489ad2e9c2132fa2087b6a310","5e4b7f6dfc1abea82b9d11db9d9c541dd369d1c087744fe483da7805fd314bd2","c658e70d31c063ff93a5be738d7566c539085369e83afc2c79d277a84900e3a1","08aba267297da3984103738c6ade352d4deaec5339c24b693342bf02b4836771","8cdfc959845eee94a04c29350df67d4afa989e351eecf79dec839fd4bd25df9b","580f89968d5967f447ca73ea29f32e0457776272d5352d08ebe24c78d3659015","cadcad8c48b10133b4f66e97a5e5774bc4e2a0891bfebbfa54f4a71b976a78d1","dd5c491e4274cd455d50dd6d6ac42d069d8f12b74a6583714cc21dd9b9a46455","626fa7cc52821f13b6825437ba33cd8a6a988c98ebaadbd69909adb61fcba5a0","e0c5098d3c4764568078aaa39c47695bdf5edc4921f36060c8b3122a00158a02","208b9a239ab7ae3a1b63f67d21d61a1d190efdc75797da3fcce73df3a4461a54","3e6bdf0762c6d1ec17bbfd948848079cf6c50d26c542ca214fadcb66fa80550d","f72cd0e88ebb6b4f688dfc3c5914cf7512a7c6c226e78e187c23ee0508b6bcea","5831f1e9d4dc8adda8d735939cd5b8caa0a1d2eec42c1ec782a4a03198021561","2588237f2d28497d28e508643c06f5c96fa265d0b31b7ef77384403da0f1a510"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8568,8591],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8568"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if LBT failure indication was received from lower layers for the last random-access preamble transmission attempt in the CSI-RS associated to the csi-RS-Index, before changing the CSI-RS for random access preamble transmission:","paragraph_zero_based":8592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include lbt-Detected;","paragraph_zero_based":8593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if at least one LBT failure indication has been received from lower layers during the random-access procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":8594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the numberOfLBTFailures to indicate the total number of random-access attempts for which LBT failure indications have been received from lower layers in the random-access procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":8595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall, for all the BWPs in which consistent LBT failures are triggered and not cancelled (according to TS 38.321 [3]) prior to successful RA completion or prior to RLF/HOF, set the below parameters in attemptedBWP-InfoList in the chronological order of BWP selection:","paragraph_zero_based":8596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the locationAndBandwidth and subcarrierSpacing associated to the UL BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":8597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":8598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:If allPreamblesBlocked is included, it is left to UE implementation how to set the numberOfPreamblesSentOnSSB-r16, numberOfPreamblesSentOnCSI-RS-r16 and the perRAAttemptInfoList-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":8599},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.10.6Actions for the successful handover report determination","paragraph_zero_based":8600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall for the PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":8601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync, and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T304 and the configured value of the timer T304, included in the last applied RRCReconfiguration message including the reconfigurationWithSync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT304 if included in the successHO-Config received before executing the last reconfiguration with sync; or","paragraph_zero_based":8602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync, and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T310 and the configured value of the timer T310, configured while the UE was connected to the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT310 included in the successHO-Config if configured by the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync; or","paragraph_zero_based":8603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync, and if the T312 associated to the measurement identity of the target cell was running at the time of initiating the execution of the reconfiguration with sync procedure and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T312 and the configured value of the timer T312, configured while the UE was connected to the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT312 included in the successHO-Config if configured by the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync; or","paragraph_zero_based":8604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync, and if sourceDAPS-FailureReporting is included in the successHO-Config before executing the last reconfiguration with sync and is set to true and if the last executed handover was a DAPS handover and if an RLF occurred at the source PCell during the DAPS handover while T304 was running; or:","paragraph_zero_based":8605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of Mobility from NR to E-UTRA, and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T310 and the configured value of the timer T310, configured while the UE was connected to the source PCell before executing the last Mobility from NR to E-UTRA, is greater than thresholdPercentageT310 included in the successHO-Config if configured by the source PCell before executing the last Mobility from NR to E-UTRA; or","paragraph_zero_based":8606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of Mobility from NR to E-UTRA, and if the T312 associated to the measurement identity of the target cell was running at the time of initiating the execution of the Mobility from NR to E-UTRA and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T312 and the configured value of the timer T312, configured while the UE was connected to the source PCell before executing the last Mobility from NR to E-UTRA, is greater than thresholdPercentageT312 included in the successHO-Config if configured by the source PCell before executing the last Mobility from NR to E-UTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":8607},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the successful handover information in VarSuccessHO-Report and determine the content in VarSuccessHO-Report as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear the information included in VarSuccessHO-Report, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":8609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is not in SNPN access mode, set the plmn-IdentityList to include the list of EPLMNs stored by the UE (i.e., includes the RPLMN);","paragraph_zero_based":8610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the UE is in SNPN access mode, set the snpn-IdentityList to include the list of equivalent SNPNs stored by the UE (i.e., includes the registered SNPN identity), if available;","paragraph_zero_based":8611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the c-RNTI to the C-RNTI assigned by the target PCell of the handover;","paragraph_zero_based":8612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync, for the source PCell in which the last RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync was applied; or","paragraph_zero_based":8613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of Mobility from NR to E-UTRA, for the source PCell in which the last MobilityFromNRCommand concerning an inter-RAT handover from NR to E-UTRA was applied:","paragraph_zero_based":8614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sourcePCellID in sourceCellInfo to the global cell identity and tracking area code, if available, of the source PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8615}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["da16ff8f1976bc0f885f2f0a2a005659d5d227819a0ec31aec99c543759a16fc","17f16fc5a8935061d98e449837af2d3c6e75d9f9a377a75c481fe4f94a549a11","acdb3372c012ec429feede67478c1a9ad112181ad765bd06934883a8652dd8df","26c4d4c21a30c632c007972f8ea156f7c9d76cf9c5854c69ddc54175129a466a","8fed28b7bc5d833ecbd4d57097ac2ca44bc6d82f2b85fc6ae96f5711d91f4e94","150657de0afc91827e9bccbdd0336d3ca82ec2c2374222fd1e32a5f6de0e8d8e","0045ba38f116501e55b19a1c3a196e9df175fe5e03c59b682201585b3718d499","2e1a66f479ed893d4db91fccc5f6657855dcd88144e745cc757ee3b061e3e47f","c19ccd93a28b6fa266eea312d6701f688771f6801c10250e53af5640b7712ceb","82826b44b039c2a3853c4a0da7ce4914adc5077b718d2469de28cde778b072a0","82e97babd339a9edd0b71bf6940c8e8dad809b5dd43812fa2c6227476ee68a43","42f2366b582892ef3dea3192bdc67c68e8eb00dea17397234ce39c4b63ee84f1","8093f97183c2f9e7729216b38a1156517f4285e5a49dc0d65a76ea685e159f1b","f0c86e3a3aef6abae7605716cd0fba02010e8a6076afbb78f417e27b526a01a8","7685fd6a0d6b2dd279ea36ed5353a5065b2e785a3daaf2d6b8052b8099b67374","26b96e104c53961acfd48a8eb19f359f1a2ce7ea52755493faebf463c5776096","6322c251311d12d74d4cf32d11fd424c28b5d908062255a14b836cddb6d4bc08","f3626681649f92b7e14810efd7d86e0fa69c10d9f325c81d34a350eb22d8a0ff","31502fab81e18a10552152df2db729e3638b96d7c468f450d39b5ef4a0df9926","e8ff22bf14c8ad120bb597f088fd9225dd272b4b48d001da5cf69ca4c9ad6f0e","c68859ff5bbd9da87e9722fb13f37982b6c7f43d4715e066ab55f809166d1919","61fffa7bfdab8c2a54b24d94af08c39ce20872c6058cb5eac4943dbae85681a2","6c33ba7208d98a24195dd58e168fa61d55166eaec2535363ef046f48bb4777af","bf58d553282a326fba855653307ff94de3e6220ad884690243e20af434d4e95b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8592,8615],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8592"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sourceCellMeas in sourceCellInfo to include the cell level RSRP, RSRQ and the available SINR, of the source PCell based on the available SSB and CSI-RS measurements collected up to the moment the UE sends RRCReconfigurationComplete message if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync, or up to the moment the UE sends the EUTRA RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of Mobility from NR to E-UTRA;","paragraph_zero_based":8616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the rsIndexResults in sourceCellMeas to include all the available SSB and CSI-RS measurement quantities of the source PCell collected up to the moment the UE sends RRCReconfigurationComplete message if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync, or up to the moment the UE sends the EUTRA RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of Mobility from NR to E-UTRA;","paragraph_zero_based":8617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last executed handover was a DAPS handover and if an RLF occurred at the source PCell during the DAPS handover while T304 was running:","paragraph_zero_based":8618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the rlf-InSourceDAPS in sourceCellInfo to true;","paragraph_zero_based":8619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync, for the target PCell indicated in the last applied RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":8620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the targetPCellID in targetCellInfo to the global cell identity and tracking area code, if available, of the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the targetCellMeas in targetCellInfo to include the cell level RSRP, RSRQ and the available SINR, of the target PCell based on the available SSB and CSI-RS measurements collected up to the moment the UE sends RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":8622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the rsIndexResults in targetCellMeas to include all the available SSB and CSI-RS measurement quantities of the target PCell collected up to the moment the UE sends RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":8623},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last applied RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync was included in the stored condRRCReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":8624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the timeSinceCHO-Reconfig to the time elapsed between the initiation of the execution of conditional reconfiguration for the target PCell and the reception of the last conditionalReconfiguration including the condRRCReconfig of the target PCell in the source PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of Mobility from NR to E-UTRA, for the target PCell indicated in the last applied MobilityFromNRCommand concerning an inter-RAT handover from NR to E-UTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":8626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the targetPCellId in eutraTargetCellInfo to the global cell identity and tracking area code, if available, and otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the targetCellMeas in eutraTargetCellInfo to include the cell level RSRP, RSRQ and the available SINR, of the target PCell based on the available measurements collected up to the moment the UE sends RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":8628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:If eutraTargetCellInfo is included, it is left to UE implementation how to set the targetCellInfo.","paragraph_zero_based":8629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T304 and the configured value of the T304 timer, included in the last applied RRCReconfiguration message including the reconfigurationWithSync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT304 if included in the successHO-Config received before executing the last reconfiguration with sync:","paragraph_zero_based":8630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set t304-cause in shr-Cause to true;","paragraph_zero_based":8631},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the ra-InformationCommon to include the random-access related information associated to the random access procedure in the target PCell, as specified in clause 5.7.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":8632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T310 and the configured value of the T310 timer, configured while the UE was connected to the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync or the last Mobility from NR to E-UTRA, is greater than thresholdPercentageT310 included in the successHO-Config if configured by the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync or Mobility from NR to E-UTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":8633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set t310-cause in shr-Cause to true;","paragraph_zero_based":8634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the T312 associated to the measurement identity of the target cell was running at the time of initiating the execution of the reconfiguration with sync procedure or Mobility from NR to E-UTRA, and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T312 and the configured value of the T312 timer, configured while the UE was connected to the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync or Mobility from NR to E-UTRA, is greater than thresholdPercentageT312 included in the successHO-Config if configured by the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync, or Mobility from NR to E-UTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":8635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set t312-cause in shr-Cause to true;","paragraph_zero_based":8636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync and if sourceDAPS-FailureReporting included in the successHO-Config if configured by the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync is set to true, and if the last executed handover was a DAPS handover and if an RLF occurred at the source PCell during the DAPS handover while T304 was running:","paragraph_zero_based":8637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sourceDAPS-Failure in shr-Cause to true;","paragraph_zero_based":8638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync, for each of the measObjectNR, configured by the source PCell, in which the last RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync was applied;or:","paragraph_zero_based":8639}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f0bf8f236396a99ae013399f06081029ce011b99604e70c58d43bebd7ce631ba","125f458a51b3117c7b4b6571519a1bd8bb8ec7f99a542e57460f60b4818aa4f4","6fff92a967cf403b11135a9acda8d3bad997fee50a403264edde0efb0336dde3","34f8eedccf7baa570afd27d7e272dbc5be6e2c4d1d7fe80a484e9d409dfecd7f","a696660e81863136e5a60ff8ff4e44f2dbec8eef100e054f73f9633b91bce5e8","982fa91a8a899aefab32944c3fd518b5e6af8308daa89d38e4d36e852097712d","25aa273084cd8e433b32db207916b26f7dca38d7515f250db911e6856ca8ef1d","f27247ae5d15885a65cf392807c25a912b42b84f81466d4c15384610cdcedbc1","57be64cb91de43e732ecc6540fb056e0cb58999f6bd7b90d47304480cb27dbb7","ba8437874eeb84fcdc6145cb706bde3833e9fdcb1066d7bf32589efeef63600a","3c44f43beb6d73f037321de8b607900d8cf318096b44db0e9a09303d130bc514","a024583bf78e92b5ce7664c4f3733981b84b0de8087188e0a9e4c14a0dfdd185","4855a1f2fe2f08726333f6608a0486d3a663a3f4222fd05eebf96baf8e442f38","d8782d395e23914cdbdfd092d603b2209c917394777e3fad09d750575d072243","3559fafb01d76a066939f93f4994f179e836ae87d4d8af0227bf1add6006f140","6fe79ea108352bb6c67f542020d5687c0edd669a52f0c519dda92a5999a19a8c","c761325a4b24405ab437882e7c9cdcf1c183d13d0b83f28a9a43ae8ae3024d10","f536a578fa2760ef7a670d36890fe21ee1b92ffd97ac3e21c1ffe347858524a7","012ac1140277a6f482aac4564fc9448c3b92233e40acfcfaa4ed390483439883","6af01e06ca7b6ad5eaff229ad8b0e43746751fd28e0bd16d0ca3fc7783bf9b34","ab129e342cc334736a2f177614503028e98563a535db9c714f61c5594ec0f8e9","05ccb4237f9238ffdab05ed21f9b632fb8ce8fcfc83e59d1da32dd7f57a83695","ecb00de19e5e1c2d0e6805595a49a9e9772640b864454d2a6464a89864810532","15231176c5128791d15af0cc202b6023e116743b2c8d4325007ca2ebbea2cfbf"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8616,8639],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8616"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of Mobility from NR to E-UTRA, for each of the measObjectNR, configured by the source PCell, in which the last MobilityFromNRCommand concerning an inter-RAT handover from NR to E-UTRA was applied:","paragraph_zero_based":8640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if measRSSI-ReportConfig is configured for the frequency of the source PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":8641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync:","paragraph_zero_based":8642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the measResultServCell-RSSI to the linear average of the available RSSI sample value(s) provided by lower layers for the frequency of the source PCell up to the moment the UE sends the RRCReconfigurationComplete message","paragraph_zero_based":8643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of Mobility from NR to E-UTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":8644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the measResultServCell-RSSI to the linear average of the available RSSI sample value(s) provided by lower layers for the frequency of the source PCell up to the moment the UE sends the EUTRA RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":8645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each of the configured measObjectNR if measRSSI-ReportConfig is configured for the configured frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":8646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync:","paragraph_zero_based":8647},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the measResultNeighFreq-RSSI in the measResultNeighFreqList-RSSI to the linear average of the available RSSI sample value(s) provided by lower layers for the associated neighbouring frequency up to the moment the UE sends the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":8648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of Mobility from NR to E-UTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":8649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the measResultNeighFreq-RSSI in the measResultNeighFreqList-RSSI to the linear average of the available RSSI sample value(s) provided by lower layers for the associated neighbouring frequency up to the moment the UE sends the EUTRA RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":8650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if measurements are available for the measObjectNR:","paragraph_zero_based":8651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the SS/PBCH block-based measurement quantities are available:","paragraph_zero_based":8652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the measResultListNR in measResultNeighCells to include all the available measurement quantities of the best measured cells, other than the source PCell or target PCell, ordered such that the cell with highest SS/PBCH block RSRP is listed first if SS/PBCH block RSRP measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest SS/PBCH block RSRQ is listed first if SS/PBCH block RSRQ measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest SS/PBCH block SINR is listed first, based on the available SS/PBCH block based measurements collected up to the moment the UE sends the RRCReconfigurationComplete message if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync, or up to the moment the UE sends the EUTRA RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of Mobility from NR to E-UTRA;","paragraph_zero_based":8653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>for each neighbour cell included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":8654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:For the neighboring cells set included in measResultListNR in measResultNeighCells ordered based on the SS/PBCH block measurement quantities, the UE includes also the CSI-RS based measurement quantities, if available.","paragraph_zero_based":8655},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the CSI-RS measurement quantities are available:","paragraph_zero_based":8656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the measResultListNR in measResultNeighCells to include all the available measurement quantities of the best measured cells, other than the source PCell and target PCell, ordered such that the cell with highest CSI-RS RSRP is listed first if CSI-RS RSRP measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest CSI-RS RSRQ is listed first if CSI-RS RSRQ measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest CSI-RS SINR is listed first, based on the available CSI-RS based measurements collected up to the moment the UE sends the RRCReconfigurationComplete message if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync, or up to the moment the UE sends the EUTRA RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of Mobility from NR to E-UTRA;","paragraph_zero_based":8657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>for each neighbour cell included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":8658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For the neighboring cells set ordered based on the CSI-RS measurement quantities, the UE includes measurements only for the cells not yet included in measResultListNR in measResultNeighCells to avoid overriding SS/PBCH block-based ordered measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":8659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync, for each of the measObjectEUTRA, configured by the source PCell in which the last RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync was applied; or:","paragraph_zero_based":8660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of Mobility from NR to E-UTRA, for each of the measObjectEUTRA, configured by the source PCell in which the last MobilityFromNRCommand concerning an inter-RAT handover from NR to E-UTRA was applied:","paragraph_zero_based":8661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if measurements are available for the measObjectEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":8662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the measResultListEUTRA in measResultNeighCells to include the best measured cells ordered such that the cell with highest RSRP is listed first if RSRP measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest RSRQ is listed first, based on measurements collected up to the moment the UE sends the RRCReconfigurationComplete message if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of reconfiguration with sync, or up to the moment the UE sends the EUTRA RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message if the procedure is triggered due to successful completion of Mobility from NR to E-UTRA;","paragraph_zero_based":8663}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["62b2b550c8f0320634e05b5a92d60515fad01c00d13ebb2514648b561e48ba53","420ace86063613d9c75086e523ddef0c5b5e93e146c1c92ea7297f1e14f8986a","6ab701134b5b74a02e08276fc52d5581411d201c7bbcf0856dd276e7cd34090e","fba833bc0843767141a85bf4396d7304d94dafaf0ae38c9455980313a10f4d0d","621dda5971e4aa744057462a0aabe0f346e36ec02e1060744783d7ad1c7f3897","2d86bb2b1940bb270b6cab47591f644178e250f7dee2e6d3e4617b2b80be75bb","4d998e976e7fa68a79533cdcfff2b06dab370b18307bd7cbc8047e5907b9c67c","84d55f1bab2c310e6346b97b6cf5eabc741d0dbfa073ec9429e5aedcafbf5dff","63f6a02329f3669390582ddc206d57fc5387b553bbeba178b5ef6124aadf87cf","40ffa288d833120895c219940b7f5346652bcab798c4e8f6d5521e0db9cbab73","5ecd21998b9d86d2fe7d8ed00c4fd3a2380304b9d494e211a2afde393fd72f17","01ae5ab2468c79b22f011ca52fdaf19db76c33cdbf26434e48c3eaeb7c19d8a4","7fb43530a46c130aaa09e61ad4846bbbfba46081216d79d9a7f823d7513fb230","4513dcba27a3b77d8efb4ace8e3e1c685741163a97ba0948a5ce4d08041bc962","bf9984200334db88c9cb50a8eda04b1f31cd704ef3cbf9681ab0635dd7819ca2","44ca0a5288249851222a9a2da4802f339f94109bc9d7e91cdf55332ea5f522a4","a660714e115248c81a35cdec2c8210cacc9879e901faefebbee8c4903ea497e3","5222aa6309b304a95eaadbe66490588bbd5e7f186b5e7e9dc5fc37f0307375e4","095800866f0c853358b86d1f77d360953131ff81629e1689945ac46521c122b6","eacf3b9716b34ef999b22e9515ecaaeb4afa6184f65475abfd4157e9be841be9","4e71ba4b060070147fa2106c4d605564d8eac04401ac86014c0edf7bd24f2d57","b01451c7689ca03dc7e28176d89a8dd867974463addd617cdb8758dea7e52a12","b170b1d81e17f93989d04419b96fe14b8d3b76e28c62c4520e744439081fa720","21849f8240a5fd3321e3d9c3615aa32f8401ff5d5b87b0968bb1cc86cceec3a8"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8640,8663],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8640"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each neighbour cell included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":8664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each of the neighbour cells included in measResultNeighCells:","paragraph_zero_based":8665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the cell was a candidate target cell included in the condRRCReconfig within the conditionalReconfiguration configured by the source PCell, in which the last RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync was applied:","paragraph_zero_based":8666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the choCandidate to true in measResultNR;","paragraph_zero_based":8667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if available, set the locationInfo as in 5.3.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":8668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release successHO-Config configured by the source PCell and thresholdPercentageT304 if configured by the target PCell.","paragraph_zero_based":8669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE may discard the successful handover information, i.e., release the UE variable VarSuccessHO-Report, 48 hours after the last successful handover information is added to the VarSuccessHO-Report.","paragraph_zero_based":8670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.10.7Actions for the successful PSCell change or addition report determination","paragraph_zero_based":8671},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall for the PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":8672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T304 and the configured value of the timer T304, included in the last applied RRCReconfiguration message for the SCG including the reconfigurationWithSync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT304-SCG if included in the successPSCell-Config received before executing the last reconfiguration with sync for the SCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":8673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sn-InitiatedPSCellChange is configured in the RRCReconfiguration including the last applied RRCReconfiguration with reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T310 and the configured value of the timer T310, configured while the UE was connected to the source PSCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync for the SCG, is greater than thresholdPercentageT310-SCG included in the successPSCell-Config if configured by the source PSCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync for the SCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":8674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sn-InitiatedPSCellChange is configured in the RRCReconfiguration including the last applied RRCReconfiguration with reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG and if the T312 associated to the measurement identity of the target PSCell was running at the time of initiating the execution of the reconfiguration with sync procedure for the SCG and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T312 and the configured value of the timer T312, configured while the UE was connected to the source PSCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT312-SCG included in the successPSCell-Config if configured by the source PSCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync for the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":8675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sn-InitiatedPSCellChange is not configured in the RRCReconfiguration including the last applied RRCReconfiguration with reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T310 and the configured value of the timer T310, configured while the UE was connected to the source PSCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync for the SCG, is greater than thresholdPercentageT310-SCG included in the successPSCell-Config if configured by the PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync for the SCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":8676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sn-InitiatedPSCellChange is not configured in the RRCReconfiguration including the last applied RRCReconfiguration with reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG and if the T312 associated to the measurement identity of the target PSCell was running at the time of initiating the execution of the reconfiguration with sync procedure for the SCG and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T312 and the configured value of the timer T312, configured while the UE was connected to the source PSCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT312-SCG included in the successPSCell-Config if configured by the PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync for the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":8677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>clear the information included in VarSuccessPSCell-Report, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":8678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the successful PSCell change or addition information in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and determine the content in VarSuccessPSCell-Report as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8679},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is not in SNPN access mode, set the plmn-IdentityList to include the list of EPLMNs (including the RPLMN) stored by the UE;","paragraph_zero_based":8680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the UE is in SNPN access mode, set the snpn-IdentityList to include the list of equivalent SNPN identities (including the registered SNPN identity) stored by the UE, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":8681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the pCellId to the global cell identity and tracking area code, if available, of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the source PSCell (in case of PSCell change procedure) in which the last RRCReconfiguration message for the SCG including reconfigurationWithSync was applied:","paragraph_zero_based":8683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sourcePSCellId in sourcePSCellInfo to the global cell identity and tracking area code, and otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the source PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sourcePSCellMeas in sourcePSCellInfo to include the cell level RSRP, RSRQ and the available SINR, of the source PSCell based on the available SSB and CSI-RS measurements collected up to the moment the UE successfully completed the random access procedure for the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":8685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the rsIndexResults in sourcePSCellMeas to include all the available SSB and CSI-RS measurement quantities of the source PSCell collected up to the moment the UE successfully completed the random access procedure for the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":8686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the target PSCell indicated in the last applied RRCReconfiguration message for the SCG including reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":8687}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4bda247e9e55b86e1b545a743c78bf5926ba00c537dd4222719ef6383f6388bf","609d554ca0cea16a87c305095ce48c315970e4feb83845c1935eabea2863e391","e3be776b01fb4bd99fe7fbea728f53bb9e17d0a034a853a51ba5b56cf3d730bc","8ab4c840c3675a97963399e63b2a6f898513d62a58f6c2ecb81970c2f422ab2b","1424dcf28d6be0f5a43d362535f549dcfb150065c7dd3578eb0583c58287fa8a","6e85cd0df1a46900eca2805f05f0236cafbc25c383e9b06a7e58c6b04fc7203e","544177d8db8debb714a52be19b74b8f2b357e56cadb57298906a25ddf0ca79fb","5f02d7bb3cb967ff91c87754af9f2a519bd99377b9c9b4ab9ac81d3219e956b2","f0b5d84831707532e9adff38744b3775dbb09a7d7ddcee1eeec51d6c6c3d320c","cff0604a059996ba9eb9febe115bb34199b128822cd9a8797075350276ebdeac","49fdc5aa63a0495822254f9184a91496aedfd595d3482c9a24b0583983c76556","97c559f13da6a58d1be9c480b6b56de5b7c889f2e78002ecec1d846a4a3d06a9","5aa8f93c9442f9e763e5854705be3f84ac6a93642ebb20e461441e40847e78fd","ebec9bd358fd7f650abc48784ace40dccbfac107f65c1e29a46d0c8767b9d535","bc99f169e47ea8ac125f029658e35d6e2ff40afc96f52b6d1c00bbdcdbd2fa22","796b8b3184bb5e89a07fd838cb852ba97b1795536226b5cc17990e22a96bca71","7f33f93a202d062f922096966bfe61c6e6da61328f8eddae9d6349808d7e85f6","5fd32c76d6deb7cfff7204c5ba54abb215908322b72a664e19216bdf7d7d3fd9","14da02aba390d9071096ed7c8148b49da8848a90a44d4f42d9001b2476ecce45","f492616e12d0afd1ef7ae18d9775e0434031739d33f857edbc1ee5c016435c80","fefa2b05d62dd6bdcd7a86b831d54c036ab2e7e7ce989a23b9aa8a95407cf452","6bde86c2b0b285471582acdbd3de99bd3e4b0c520c7293c5d0699920f3a36505","8f217cacadda1de7fa654154ca951f0e68213d7302b2d32e25a570c649f10f8c","da559038561b29df59c2da88bd597e1ffb5b1cc1c6c88a6c6384a3200c2c339c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8664,8687],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8664"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the targetPSCellID in targetPSCellInfo to the global cell identity and tracking area code, if available, and otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the target PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the targetPSCellMeas in targetPSCellInfo to include the cell level RSRP, RSRQ and the available SINR, of the target PSCell based on the available SSB and CSI-RS measurements collected up to the moment the UE successfully completed the random access procedure for the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":8689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the rsIndexResults in targetPSCellMeas to include all the available SSB and CSI-RS measurement quantities of the target PSCell collected up to the moment the UE successfully completed the random access procedure for the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":8690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last applied RRCReconfiguration message for the SCG including reconfigurationWithSync was included in the stored condRRCReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":8691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the timeSinceCPAC-Reconfig to the time elapsed between the initiation of the execution of conditional reconfiguration for the target PSCell and the reception of the last conditionalReconfiguration for the SCG including the condRRCReconfig of the target PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T304 and the configured value of the T304 timer, included in the last applied RRCReconfiguration message for the SCG including the reconfigurationWithSync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT304-SCG if included in the successPSCell-Config received before executing the last reconfiguration with sync for the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":8693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set t304-cause in spr-Cause to true;","paragraph_zero_based":8694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the ra-InformationCommon to include the random-access related information associated to the random access procedure in the target PSCell, as specified in clause 5.7.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":8695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T310 and the configured value of the timer T310, configured while the UE was connected to the source PSCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync for the SCG, is greater than thresholdPercentageT310-SCG included in the successPSCell-Config if configured before executing the last reconfiguration with sync:","paragraph_zero_based":8696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set t310-cause in spr-Cause to true;","paragraph_zero_based":8697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the T312 associated to the measurement identity of the target PSCell was running at the time of initiating the execution of the reconfiguration with sync procedure for the SCG and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T312 and the configured value of the timer T312, configured while the UE was connected to the source PSCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT312-SCG included in the successPSCell-Config if configured before executing the last reconfiguration with sync:","paragraph_zero_based":8698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set t312-cause in spr-Cause to true;","paragraph_zero_based":8699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sn-InitiatedPSCellChange is configured in the RRCReconfiguration including the last applied RRCReconfiguration with reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":8700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider all measObjectNR configured by the the source PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider all measObjectNR configured by the the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each of the considered measObjectNR:","paragraph_zero_based":8704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if measurements are available for the measObjectNR:","paragraph_zero_based":8705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the SS/PBCH block-based measurement quantities are available:","paragraph_zero_based":8706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include in the measResultListNR in measResultNeighCells all the available measurement quantities of the best measured cells, other than the source PSCell (in case of PSCell change procedure) or target PSCell, ordered such that the cell with highest SS/PBCH block RSRP is listed first if SS/PBCH block RSRP measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest SS/PBCH block RSRQ is listed first if SS/PBCH block RSRQ measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest SS/PBCH block SINR is listed first, based on the available SS/PBCH block based measurements collected up to the moment the UE successfully completed the random access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>for each neighbour cell included, include the optional fields that are available (including the CSI-RS based measurement quantities, if available);","paragraph_zero_based":8708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the CSI-RS measurement quantities are available for the cells not yet included in measResultListNR in measResultNeighCells:","paragraph_zero_based":8709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include in the measResultListNR in measResultNeighCells all the available measurement quantities of the best measured cells, other than the source PSCell (in case of PSCell change procedure) and target PSCell, ordered such that the cell with highest CSI-RS RSRP is listed first if CSI-RS RSRP measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest CSI-RS RSRQ is listed first if CSI-RS RSRQ measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest CSI-RS SINR is listed first, based on the available CSI-RS based measurements collected up to the moment the UE successfully completed the random access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":8710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>for each neighbour cell included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":8711}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eab732d97a7e6fe0d00d938ce14038e529313506eeef0e7c99c710efa6a1d0fa","5b6862430d195c1bd07afec8bc33ce2cb97281e05aaa70d545282beba5e7346c","35f4a61a5ad0d38f7f3df09577e427280af2f2cafd2c12d97b2be23b598fb3bc","2850a668f4cede3af654202287bc8b0c3003d1ebde7a636912a2a31ca60c30d5","40a7365c7803fe89915a4aa297a79c962d8b633c2145f2887b4fb312ef8208f3","db9690b6527f7caaf22b112fbf65348c50fad6142fe08ede10e661d6b592fb86","c781979cb483ddb79e2be596cb193c2a57fc83e0b616555944a70ae8dc5fb1d9","714d943b52f2445ae21a328b463b2e2a6ff59afd574a0f3607d5f1d4ee9ef69b","414ca41f92477fe7425b5c80e99f06c6cf3a201a9494fe70a326e741da97c3d0","ec6cd85914051f2e165bbdab86beda623eb7b0ffe3c70dd7d76fc4732cec9581","03ce48abd3f698e091feacd4df14d8e6fa18fcd4ab7b535d935143db2d1784d5","465fbc40651d544af62b73ff8bd569d83175158384a4b671024b5cb5208285de","82aad9b7d39494d5ba71520255c7e9f520717e918850d1e62787d0c68ad53742","fb4cdb6a5346e73491e6c95dd59052b3448fea5b43aa71c9a24049618795d19e","2916ae2adf43f56b618a573c1481eb1070ca1aa90514c530c3d0811b34694a48","de8da6870199d9e9b0b809b37259bae6030f7bbed950dd091a6141ed8103095f","97b35d7b91179239b276835334fbbabc007f781781fd5c1d859e671e791c700a","1c17d0f22c9291f5bd44f1aa5776a387412497142bf58652a99a1bc6291e00ad","3ac6a84d510bf5cd90795bcdd7230ce788cfedcc70a79c2c05cb74f618b35a03","287b98c18c2102927187ecd53f2d1c848dc5b1d35a2184dd24a8b9fcf99b96f3","278d0038c4ce9d2c6c6ba88cbd11deb720c24545f67d631bd3e56e4ab03f14e5","de5ddff014de5b5d6e3ccec7597fe434e44b7e473f460b5dffe199244d1b47ad","3270701c1ad59d2af2e0a6c0a3636ab63236119ae0d9f4b4e2343d84e66c2995","a6a0e0d3161c07244a4ce7c01077c423b0176e5af3f81bc55b980578af09fac9"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8688,8711],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8688"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each of the neighbour cells included in measResultNeighCells:","paragraph_zero_based":8712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the cell was a candidate target cell included in the condRRCReconfig within the conditionalReconfiguration, configured by the source PCell or by the source PSCell (in case of PSCell change) when the last RRCReconfiguration message for the SCG including reconfigurationWithSync was applied:","paragraph_zero_based":8713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the choCandidate to true in measResultNR;","paragraph_zero_based":8714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sn-InitiatedPSCellChange is configured in the RRCReconfiguration including the last applied RRCReconfiguration with reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":8715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if available, set the locationInfo as in 5.3.3.7 7 according to the otherConfig associated with the source PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include sn-InitiatedPSCellChange;","paragraph_zero_based":8717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if available, set the locationInfo as in 5.3.3.7 7 according to the otherConfig associated with the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":8719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release successPSCell-Config configured by the source PSCell if available and thresholdPercentageT304 if configured by the target PSCell.","paragraph_zero_based":8720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE may discard the successful PSCell change or addition information, i.e., release the UE variable VarSuccessPSCell-Report, 48 hours after the last successful PSCell change or addition information is added to the VarSuccessPSCell-Report or upon deregistration from the network as specified in TS 23.502 [43].","paragraph_zero_based":8721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.11Void","paragraph_zero_based":8722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.12IAB Other Information","paragraph_zero_based":8723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.12.1General","paragraph_zero_based":8724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":8725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.12.1-1: IAB Other Information procedure","paragraph_zero_based":8726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB Other Information procedure is used by IAB-MT to request the IAB-donor-CU to allocate IP address or inform the IAB-donor-CU of the IP address for the collocated IAB-DU.","paragraph_zero_based":8727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.12.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":8728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiation of the procedure, the IAB-MT shall:","paragraph_zero_based":8729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initiate transmission of the IABOtherInformation message in accordance with 5.7.12.3;","paragraph_zero_based":8730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.12.3Actions related to transmission of IABOtherInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":8731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB-MT shall set the contents of IABOtherInformation message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":8732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is used to request IP addresses:","paragraph_zero_based":8733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if IPv4 addresses are requested:","paragraph_zero_based":8734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the iab-IPv4-AddressNumReq to the number of IPv4 addresses requested per specific usage;","paragraph_zero_based":8735}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["36ab6985ef97c73065e47a949683310d90b8eab78f0ae450935930e4768b6eaf","86337727c9cf4f5a38dd45ca2d1869143a9bf5113278ded2e7a02594491e2e8f","e72135ba3dc08f1ff28a1f891174a8fe644abe82045dba3e33acea0eedc24e91","6fc510e1fdf88f092a2a63c4ef75001057d0312e270417a7bba66b67ef156c15","1efa2824e4526e7f3f615bc3aa87e9ba66358e4c7bf306c9d7c33e266430231e","b81e27cb04b0ffa4399060007f9237ac180250caa5705426f9cad8e3488dd490","746031fb4851fab6c0c5bb53075bafa65c8f893408837dfea84a55688673d031","9535e9c5f102d2f5ea77fe24a0ecc51b4ed4ed2144f860e217b875710c3854b0","f3f05cb59e2c99d89fc0f694304c0ef1e932b8e691fd6eaa9322db8701769e58","155553987cf2fea0dd4cc03e33b9aa8b6bce9ec64199547067332d7377b6e04d","2fa5a396aa476c1b88b76d7657268a839804db43438168cfa015db5b82c168d0","6600ce8d901c1b0ceded4b244488e19290232bae8a1fcdccd58e72dcf33a85df","a972c31dde4b1913f90f97d97a3c85972e0fae66a3f2b77389a60d16259761ae","33069e54260550aaf2b9e8e99d1c893e194e07e2410b32f90d85e7990939568d","c2ed0ab3797bf0e4e4b797c4ae56b6d91253754ae2117cc9872b504a01cef72d","0a44d344d6c81ced2d22b966f49e3998d4d1da769f01aa0b3521aa294480b065","ae6773863fbb52117c2098d5b5cd0363ece751da438bb47df1e28477f7d8679a","85ffbfa7fab6557a570c24f8c7aa4832485331b32dd05a0c9fd96db75776e186","367bfc046afaaf0f2667f3c874bcf88a73ceb16d77a5e1114bb73de58a29c0d5","4a0ae57397a4d1d36d6f519925406076576f915718fb246e78a3c23fd425e7fa","9f8fe47d2c4fd2e541362710f24f3474335731bc80b7eaa75444711d3cca3b7e","e5d77118d5a1f3ff92e2a703c62dd0f325c91503551fed7777f77f87d9694b05","3b7edc403a19b10c7bf24e4105d3dc02646db1aaaf5bbfc7e0306a4900f241a6","2a509d8f9d71b4b01830299b6ccf796d413175650c4c79719173af2d19550b09"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[8712,8735],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p8712"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if IPv6 addresses or IPv6 address prefixes are requested:","paragraph_zero_based":8736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if IPv6 addresses are requested:","paragraph_zero_based":8737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the iab-IPv6-AddressNumReq to the number of IPv6 addresses requested per specific usage;","paragraph_zero_based":8738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if IPv6 address prefixes are requested:","paragraph_zero_based":8739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the iab-IPv6-AddressPrefixReq to true per specific usage;","paragraph_zero_based":8740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is used to report IP addresses:","paragraph_zero_based":8741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if IPv4 addresses are reported:","paragraph_zero_based":8742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include iPv4-Address in iab-IPv4-AddressReport, and for each IP address included:","paragraph_zero_based":8743},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if IPv4 addresses are used for F1-C traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":8744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include these addresses in f1-C-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":8745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if IPv4 addresses are used for F1-U traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":8746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include these addresses in f1-U-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":8747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if IPv4 address are used for non-F1 traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":8748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include these addresses in non-f1-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":8749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if IPv4 addresses are used for all traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":8750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include these addresses in all-Traffic-IAB-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":8751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if IPv6 addresses or IPv6 address prefixes are reported:","paragraph_zero_based":8752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if IPv6 addresses are reported:","paragraph_zero_based":8753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include iPv6-Address in iab-IPv6-AddressReport, and for each IP address included;","paragraph_zero_based":8754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if IPv6 addresses are used for F1-C traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":8755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include these addresses in f1-C-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":8756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if IPv6 addresses are used for F1-U traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":8757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include these addresses in f1-U-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":8758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if IPv6 addresses are used for non-F1 traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":8759}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cb649674663d7e19f91c3fd4100e96806f04b49369490fd2598bd4d12877771d","13d4e0a6cbd6a929f1977a414718bb3509b16132721e245c41f3dc01841ca37f","058154670ddbd1e9eb4e510014ca7c1f571a6b3f3b253bfc98257b73105be988","5a7a081bf2ef6e3b289339f8ed16fb35c95c1964dbab20dec7d0c9bce792beb7","9c7143e61c24c8b58ff13a8ddcf1c23213d0b19e44083028f23e6aeef24e365a","1916bddf158a2be13d5cf134ced7bee75a66b2eee51776dcad515679842f356c","793b2f86b7c909d5395e54675d6eb57fb797ffd3016b066e9a09d47523f54075","39f85b1be1a8df649bca9d4ab217d1a00a9c5ce42b94f260f5a04f83818e44a0","956f99f3f8228502dd3c8713b2842823841e8c3042b8741e0d9d481d92b4e68e","a4bae3dc6d5b21bfc0b3cf02405cc4d36c59ae7ec9b4e5bdbf