{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L3-U2U-RelayDiscovery in case of L3 U2U relay operation; or","paragraph_zero_based":8976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-RxInterestedFreqListDisc; or if the frequency configured by upper layers to receive NR sidelink discovery messages on has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":8977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RelayUE-ConfigCommon; or","paragraph_zero_based":8978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is selecting a U2N Relay UE / has a selected U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommon; or","paragraph_zero_based":8979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of U2U Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RelayUE-ConfigCommonU2U; or","paragraph_zero_based":8980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is selecting a U2U Relay UE / has a selected U2U Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommonU2U:","paragraph_zero_based":8981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR relay sidelink discovery reception frequency of interest in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":8982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-RxInterestedFreqListDisc:","paragraph_zero_based":8984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it is no longer interested in NR relay sidelink discovery messages reception in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":8985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-NonRelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":8986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":8987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-NonRelayDiscovery; or","paragraph_zero_based":8988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqListDisc; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqListDisc has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":8989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages resources required by the UE in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":8990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":8991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqListDisc:","paragraph_zero_based":8992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it no longer requires NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages resources in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":8993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L2U2N-Relay; or if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery; or","paragraph_zero_based":8994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2U relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L2-U2U-Relay; or ","paragraph_zero_based":8995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2U relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L3-U2U-RelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":8996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":8997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR; or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L2U2N-Relay in case of L2 U2N relay operation; or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery in case of L3 U2N relay operation; or","paragraph_zero_based":8998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L2-U2U-Relay in case of L2 U2U relay operation; ","paragraph_zero_based":8999}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f2