{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-DestinationIdentityDisc to the destination identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink discovery messages transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sl-SourceIdentityRelayUE to the source identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink L2 U2N relay discovery messages transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-CastTypeDisc to the cast type of the associated destination identity for the NR sidelink discovery messages transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TxInterestedFreqListDisc to indicate the frequency of the associated destination for NR sidelink discovery messages transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TypeTxSyncListDisc to the current synchronization reference type used on the associated sl-TxInterestedFreqListDisc for NR sidelink discovery messages transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-DiscoveryType to the current discovery type of the associated destination identity configured by the upper layer for NR sidelink discovery messages transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE is acting as L2/L3 U2U Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include ue-TypeU2U and set it to relayUE;","paragraph_zero_based":9128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE is acting as L2/L3 U2U Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include ue-TypeU2U and set it to remoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":9130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB12 includes sl-L2U2N-Relay and if configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication and the UE is acting as L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include sl-TxResourceReqL2U2N-Relay in sl-TxResourceReqListCommRelay and set its fields (if needed) as follows for each destination for which it requests network to assign NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication resource:","paragraph_zero_based":9132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-DestinationIdentityL2U2N to the destination identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TxInterestedFreqListL2U2N to indicate the frequency of the associated destination for NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TypeTxSyncListL2U2N to the current synchronization reference type used on the associated sl-TxInterestedFreqListL2U2N for NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-LocalID-Request to request local ID for L2 U2N Remote UE transiting to RRC_CONNECTED or in RRC_CONNECTED state;","paragraph_zero_based":9136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE to the paging UE ID received from peer L2 U2N Remote UE, if it is not released as in 5.8.9.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":9137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-CapabilityInformationSidelink to include UECapabilityInformationSidelink message, if any, received from peer UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include ue-Type and set it to relayUE;","paragraph_zero_based":9139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB12 includes sl-L2U2N-Relay and if configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication and the UE has a selected L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include sl-TxResourceReqL2U2N-Relay in sl-TxResourceReqListCommRelay and set its fields (if needed) as follows to request network to assign NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication resource:","paragraph_zero_based":9141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TxInterestedFreqListL2U2N to indicate the frequency of the associated destination for NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TypeTxSyncListL2U2N to the current synchronization reference type used on the associated sl-TxInterestedFreqListL2U2N for NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5202c4c6e68b74a18b2b0b5a833bbc409bef08fa75cfae5e32509af8a8336840","b72a857c7c83e128d0775d6fa444c9b77eb9bc4d249d067e56621dc4f5269dfa","d5d2df0d6ddf012c190de75e795439320f0853720ff66bc2d0b3996115cc52d2","9926e18dfad570e18aaabf44741da416ceefa47ae63141c45ba7b1b479d0bde3","8d73e6f984380f3a49258e645ce03dfa53212a6f9a477d1d9474d9196bd85671","63fd211c52a7e45a2bb5a0851090b367ad27f1e6b5b054ba368bffd6c260ca5e","99e39b7063285e7989ce29225766a25f47cdb4d54dbbb57b68fee7ca89a1e3b3","153f0c5380dcbe3b55f789ba038703ac1f2b6a2b1e1f1c703e5c592d3699c30c","f36190b49b308084460b32784ef92234a3bd3361e32864461f27cc9af61f395a","329b959a1ada1b602a270dd05427d241782680590ce1db85910a4d078300ad51","e129330c1ce917a7171eb7fd38ce70b37f22b773f36de44b6a74709eb1d2636f","3b69d84cecdc1c8b114392e992bc1758a1dfb3c8318e62c57028afcf2197de76","eea595c758fbe1f060f26f81cb0636dd88516f1a565c9acc73bd057a0b35e0eb","0d7ec19ad1d40b