{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-CapabilityInformationSidelink to include UECapabilityInformationSidelink message, if any, received from peer UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include ue-Type and set it to remoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":9145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB12 includes sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery and if configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay communication:","paragraph_zero_based":9146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include sl-TxResourceReqL3U2N-Relay in sl-TxResourceReqListCommRelay and set its fields (if needed) as follows for each destination for which it requests network to assign NR sidelink L3 U2N relay communication resource:","paragraph_zero_based":9147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-DestinationIdentity to the destination identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink L3 U2N relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-CastType to the cast type of the associated destination identity configured by the upper layer for the NR sidelink L3 U2N relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-RLC-ModeIndication to include the RLC mode(s) and optionally QoS profile(s) of the sidelink QoS flow(s) of the associated RLC mode(s), if the associated bi-directional sidelink DRB has been established due to the configuration by RRCReconfigurationSidelink;","paragraph_zero_based":9150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-QoS-InfoList to include QoS profile(s) of the sidelink QoS flow(s) of the associated destination configured by the upper layer for the NR sidelink L3 U2N relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TxInterestedFreqList to indicate the frequency of the associated destination for NR sidelink L3 U2N relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TypeTxSyncList to the current synchronization reference type used on the associated sl-TxInterestedFreqList for NR sidelink L3 U2N relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-CapabilityInformationSidelink to include UECapabilityInformationSidelink message, if any, received from peer UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include ue-Type and set it to relayUE if the UE is acting as NR sidelink L3 U2N Relay UE or to remoteUE otherwise;","paragraph_zero_based":9155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB12 includes sl-L2-U2U-Relay and if configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2U relay communication and the UE is acting as L2 U2U Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include sl-TxResourceReqL2-U2U and set its fields (if needed) as follows for each destination for which it requests network to assign NR sidelink L2 U2U relay communication resource:","paragraph_zero_based":9157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-DestinationIdentityL2-U2U to the destination identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink L2 U2U relay communication transmission to peer L2 U2U Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TxInterestedFreqListL2-U2U to indicate the frequency of the associated destination for NR sidelink L2 U2U relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TypeTxSyncListL2-U2U to the current synchronization reference type used on the associated sl-InterestedFreqListL2-U2U for NR sidelink L2 U2U relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-CapabilityInformationSidelink to include UECapabilityInformationSidelink message, if any, received from peer L2 U2U Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include sl-U2U-InfoList and set its fields (if needed) for each entry as follows, to report the related information of the connected L2 U2U Remote UEs:","paragraph_zero_based":9162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the source L2 U2U Remote UE's L2 ID in sl-SourceUE-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":9163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include sl-PerSLRB-QoS-InfoList, with each entry including the per-SLRB second-hop QoS profile and the corresponding sl-RemoteUE-SLRB-Identity which is set to the same value as the SLRB-PC5-ConfigIndex received in RRCReconfigurationSidelink message from the L2 U2U Remote UE for the same end-to-end SLRB;","paragraph_zero_based":9164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-RLC-ModeIndicationListL2-U2U to include the RLC mode(s), if the associated bi-directional PC5 RLC channel(s) has been established due to the configuration by RRCReconfigurationSidelink;","paragraph_zero_based":9165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB12 includes sl-L2-U2U-Relay and if configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2U relay communication and the UE has a selected L2 U2U Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8f292dab7fb5de3fa268ea17015086f1c63a42c0a2e446134a753fb94f225fc6","9472f565c45ff0d45e6efd4f55fdce12359a3bcbf7b41668e12506e0dbb8f807","195bfd3d0a6838a25a369c8b0d90604e6e141644a94d853360e4fcf7af8c5bec","c85a26cc596a6e57baf1bc62594c9fae1cd99566aa0997f8415c0f7d328d236f","8fb2fd7f83fcc1a60be58cd695d5a9de664a1b45c229db04fcc93a23f9f96c1e","f776511165cec0e76f5da55633ecf16f18d9ec031c52c7545131fb53fb6074dc","f597371585bbe2d19633f2b9ab02eb2fe68f71f39d86f19d5fa8d107fb419e61","08c2f9590e37560d90520d2a2b8d7efa15ce9400eff8a67f209e037c59957c74","a02e7453da81515d5d95002aec63d2fc08db310c339d4e7fa99b950d762e720c","ff9dc0fbf5a4eb1f0cc2cab9942e3909edd21ed2e0aacb683c443da065721d4d","84e001e985998a31eb5cb42f173f99c66e0a3246fbda13d80e2b9796d04a0d9b","91905f8ba6ed27523cc1f3c4f24d1bf5f4aa742675d58a52fbe12114787bbde3","07ff7f7cf0028195c18145b72d0d0da6fe7fd158edc65107e16ac42d33183854","4b0df0cd5bc9e6119baa3c87b1185ffe3bbccb235632e16f5a79333a1cd247aa","a3d127c4411e9b1cfab5ecf408283da0ba8aceaa95f905f8dfeb472573dd9ee4","5c4822a2cfbe59f19782f76d143c7e176acead5dbfca50b51596199aa4047961","efcd80377b968f381fbb30cc84a68bef55aa2179177089c0eac049aa7a7c086e","c29fa9f1cbbe21a05255ac831c5fc21f775ad74f60289cc0b9acc08ba558c169","da1b349a408b68094a62a4f563ca5a5be16f6a5dcbc4279e5e30779bc9625652","f43b3768d526e59c0fda22fb31d425ccff336620eb07960946e515cb2aef6452","f4dd534864580a373f9d9ffeab1665797bd744c067231b6dc2e47ed583911aa1","8d83a0f03fde51f8498411f85c4cd8a39c08f9b165cb96bc17cb178eaf2fba80","608d65e72f12f51a967aefec9e65e73a39dc2b24035d5ab1bb341231d023471c","38c13a9642f93bd8dbfdb72b3f21b77ba182bf05ff0c4df6aad5d0a35dc01e76"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9144,9167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include sl-TxResourceReqL2-U2U and set its fields (if needed) as follows to request network to assign NR sidelink L2 U2U relay communication resource:","paragraph_zero_based":9168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-DestinationIdentityL2-U2U to the destination identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink L2 U2U relay communication transmission to L2 U2U Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TxInterestedFreqListL2-U2U to indicate the frequency of the associated destination for NR sidelink L2 U2U relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TypeTxSyncListL2-U2U to the current synchronization reference type used on the associated sl-InterestedFreqListL2-U2U for NR sidelink L2 U2U relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-CapabilityInformationSidelink to include UECapabilityInformationSidelink messages received from L2 U2U Relay UE and the peer L2 U2U Remote UE, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":9172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include sl-U2U-InfoList and set its fields (if needed) for each entry as follows to report the related end-to-end and the first hop information for the end-to-end PC5 connection with each peer L2 U2U Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sl-TargetUE-Identity to the destination identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink L2 U2U relay communication transmission to peer L2 U2U Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sl-E2E-QoS-InfoList to include end-to-end QoS profile(s) of the sidelink QoS flow(s) of the associated destination configured by the upper layer for the NR sidelink L2 U2U relay communication transmission to peer L2 U2U Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sl- PerHop-QoS-InfoList to include the first-hop split PDB of the sidelink QoS flow(s) received from the sl-SplitQoS-InfoListPC5 in UEInformationResponseSidelink message for the associated destination in accordance with the received sl-TargetUE-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":9176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC is included in SIB12-IEs:","paragraph_zero_based":9177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink reception:","paragraph_zero_based":9178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include sl-RxDRX-ReportList and set its fields (if needed) as follows for each destination for which it reports to network:","paragraph_zero_based":9179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sl-DRX-ConfigFromTx to include the accepted sidelink DRX configuration of the associated destination for NR sidelink unicast communication, if received from the associated peer UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include sl-RxInterestedGC-BC-DestList and set its fields (if needed) as follows for each Destination Layer-2 ID for which it reports to network:","paragraph_zero_based":9181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sl-RxInterestedQoS-InfoList to include the QoS profile of its interested service(s) that sidelink DRX is applied for the associated destination for NR sidelink groupcast or broadcast reception;","paragraph_zero_based":9182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:It is up to UE implementation to set the QoS profile in sl-RxInterestedQoS-InfoList for reception of NR sidelink discovery message or ProSe Direct Link Establishment Request message as described in TS 24.554 [72], or for reception of Direct Link Establishment Request message as described in TS 24.587 [57].","paragraph_zero_based":9183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sl-DestinationIdentity to the associated destination identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink groupcast or broadcast reception;","paragraph_zero_based":9184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink transmission and configured with sl-ScheduledConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":9185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include sl-TxResourceReqList and/or sl-TxResourceReqListCommRelay and/or sl-FailureList and set its fields (if needed) as follows for each destination for which it reports to network:","paragraph_zero_based":9186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sl-DRX-InfoFromRxList to include the sidelink DRX assistance information of the associated destination, if any, received from the associated peer UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message includes the sl-DRX-ConfigReject:","paragraph_zero_based":9188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>set sl-Failure as drxReject-v1710 for the associated destination for the NR sidelink communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sl-DRX-Indication to include the sidelink DRX on/off indication for the associated destination for NR sidelink groupcast transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SIB23 including sl-PosConfigCommonNR is provided by the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":9191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["55f61c31efc9838e5e76f342ce5d0954f288e36842853754111ce71ed6ead541","00334f3349efda967dde0e8307e903e3f25daabaa3f25df855a8aa526df56bf7","abe09b6a9b9f1f59821723c5892bd226fb89d60