{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured to transmit SL-PRS:","paragraph_zero_based":9192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include sl-PosTxResourceReqList and set its fields (if needed) as follows for each destination for which it requests network to assign NR sidelink positioning resource:","paragraph_zero_based":9193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-DestinationIdentity to the destination identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink positioning transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-CastType to the cast type of the associated destination identity configured by the upper layer for the NR sidelink positioning transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-InterestedFreqList to indicate the frequency of the associated destination for SL-PRS transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TypeTxSyncList to the current synchronization reference type used on the associated sl-InterestedFreqList for NR sidelink positioning transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the sl-PosQoS-InfoList to include the SL-PRS transmission QoS profile;","paragraph_zero_based":9198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured to perform SL-PRS measurements;","paragraph_zero_based":9199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include sl-PosRxInterestedFreqList and set it to the frequency for NR sidelink positioning reception;","paragraph_zero_based":9200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates the procedure while connected to an E-UTRA PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":9201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the SidelinkUEInformationNR to lower layers via SRB1, embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferIRAT as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.6.28;","paragraph_zero_based":9202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":9204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:When multiple lists are reported in SidelinkUEInformationNR, a UE can report up to maxNrofSL-Dest-r16 SL destinations in sl-TxResourceReqList, sl-TxResourceReqListDisc and sl-TxResourceReqListCommRelay in total.","paragraph_zero_based":9205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.4Void","paragraph_zero_based":9206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.5Sidelink synchronisation information transmission for NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning","paragraph_zero_based":9207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.5.1General","paragraph_zero_based":9208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.5.1-1: Synchronisation information transmission for NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning, in (partial) coverage","paragraph_zero_based":9210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.5.1-2: Synchronisation information transmission for NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning, out of coverage","paragraph_zero_based":9212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to provide synchronisation information to a UE. This procedure also applies to NR sidelink discovery.","paragraph_zero_based":9213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.5.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":9214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink communication/discovery and SLSS/PSBCH transmission shall, when transmitting NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning, and if the conditions for NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning operation are met and when the following conditions are met:","paragraph_zero_based":9215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["99fc2df28bd669bb5960464f2f406583c17995dceb16713271b6c4c68bce7354","23fd8b83288ddb895b62ffc95245f042c31ea5ca450738b9ed0aee0a5f7f4448","61ed8011f94dec31332a804d617071864617a924599143d5fe99fa2ef7a21535","eab1f4c128905aac81ebf6d38af81dadccf9d56e669c77f0f15c35247d3f7c35","022d07790fcc956d64b43db37f51d9c4a64adb38c4e320b118bd97809cca3475","84d10d0b2712bbb29240fe807f15f833966c2cabbe2fa7f5407b86d0e2bab5c7","65b8fdae7e4677429ff12d7b062dc89c4af51563b27fea4e9fa9baa0ae78fc83","3979076558b2843b5e3a570f1197db180e376f0ed4ddc53df609755fb5ad0fca","13a33368836c00725858338091fc7f5c177d0ea1d8db458ba9a2cabd0f3ec721","7a5d8194eef8e4f953b7fcf2c6adfb512338bcc832087ab770b82ba31957a547","1cbf5ea3692fd08cea499285b632b27ba2b9f026a26e35680e7e2b580881b764","5bc4eba6f5729a4840530bb781df5b0449ca1d29585e875ae1ed73f5cdbb665f","a1091dfda500a9c27c5482b09fa3fbcde07287e39529ec4dee8ef0ceb6240f99","b0f4dccbf8da3b87b04895caea0e4725a1466559fb4e8f08c5195260171a8ac4","2ec5a03e2cdc5bb36ec5c25de9f67e0788316a678525eb4313e74429f09e4abd","89f7cbee2ec1c8bc51575024c72a8567f8b48ef8ee718709354580aac2ee8fa6","7f312ab5926c64e5d90871d6bb1ba0dd4f9120d4bbd841f37eea4f8b268f0462","b323eb9dea726e3c8a55cceef353dc86123e05331873930706ccfc461e868e86","7cdcc58a7aeed03150c7ab16e3a2e0556b7e1b889ce93145f2f3b8b5075dcd6d","55e9471678b5d11315f2fbe8830c6872481d5e0a682237b75444bfb26d5654b3","7433019bccf9f69319339f40c96fa5437ffdbde3b5c638bb700befc7671d96b3","c02130a45026a4504a25628097395a1d89061d4bbed3362a348aa302f28c26db","a7abaf9963689df516e6f7594332b6a9fbfb117e9ffa61605e28fc790d8773e0","3ec4c7b0e76c3381a43c1de6a1335388bc1d8bb87d73dcd42ceff711193e042d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9192,9215],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9192"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in coverage on the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning, as defined in TS 38.304 [20]; and has selected GNSS or the cell as synchronization reference as defined in 5.8.6.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":9216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if out of coverage on the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning, and the frequency used to transmit NR sidelink communication/discovery is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-FreqInfoList/sl-FreqInfoListSizeExt within SIB12 or SIB23 for NR sidelink positioning; and has selected GNSS or the cell as synchronization reference as defined in 5.8.6.3:","paragraph_zero_based":9217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-SyncFreqList is neither included in RRCReconfiguration nor in SIB12; or","paragraph_zero_based":9218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-SyncFreqList is included in RRCReconfiguration or in SIB12; and if none of the frequency(ies) selected as specified in TS 38.321 [3] is included in the sl-SyncFreqList or the concerned frequency is selected as the synchronisation carrier frequency in accordance with 5.8.6.2; or","paragraph_zero_based":9219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-SyncFreqList and sl-SyncTxMultiFreq are included in RRCReconfiguration or in SIB12; and if the concerned frequency has been selected for NR sidelink communication transmission as specified in TS 38.321 [3] and is included in sl-SyncFreqList; and if the UE has selected a frequency other than the concerned frequency as the synchronisation carrier frequency in accordance with 5.8.6.2; and if sl-SyncTxDisabled corresponding to the concerned frequency is not configured in RRCReconfiguration or in SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":9220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if in RRC_CONNECTED; and if networkControlledSyncTx is configured and set to on; or","paragraph_zero_based":9221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if networkControlledSyncTx is not configured; and for the concerned frequency syncTxThreshIC is configured; and the RSRP measurement of the reference cell, selected as defined in 5.8.6.3, for NR sidelink communication/discovery transmission is below the value of syncTxThreshIC:","paragraph_zero_based":9222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>transmit sidelink SSB on the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery in accordance with 5.8.5.3 and TS 38.211 [16], including the transmission of SLSS as specified in 5.8.5.3 and transmission of MasterInformationBlockSidelink as specified in 5.8.9.4.3;","paragraph_zero_based":9223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-SyncFreqList is not included in SL-PreconfigurationNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":9225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-SyncFreqList is included in SL-PreconfigurationNR, and if none of the frequency(ies) selected as specified in TS 38.321 [3] is included in the sl-SyncFreqList or the concerned frequency is selected as the synchronisation carrier frequency in accordance with 5.8.6.2; or","paragraph_zero_based":9226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-SyncFreqList and sl-SyncTxMultiFreq are included in SL-PreconfigurationNR, and if the concerned frequency has been selected for NR sidelink communication transmission as specified in TS 38.321 [3] and included in sl-SyncFreqList; and if the UE has selected a frequency other than the concerned frequency as the synchronisation carrier frequency in accordance with 5.8.6.2; and if sl-SyncTxDisabled corresponding to the concerned frequency is not configured in SL-PreconfigurationNR:","paragraph_zero_based":9227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery, if syncTxThreshOoC is included in SidelinkPreconfigNR; and the UE is not directly synchronized to GNSS, and the UE has no selected SyncRef UE or the PSBCH-RSRP measurement result of the selected SyncRef UE is below the value of syncTxThreshOoC; or","paragraph_zero_based":9228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery, if the UE selects GNSS as the synchronization reference source:","paragraph_zero_based":9229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>transmit sidelink SSB on the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery in accordance with 5.8.5.3 and TS 38.211 [16], including the transmission of SLSS as specified in 5.8.5.3 and transmission of MasterInformationBlockSidelink as specified in 5.8.9.4.3;","paragraph_zero_based":9230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.5.3Transmission of SLSS","paragraph_zero_based":9231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall select the SLSSID and the slot in which to transmit SLSS as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":9232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if triggered by NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning and in coverage on the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning, as defined in TS 38.304 [20]; or","paragraph_zero_based":9233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if triggered by NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning, and out of coverage on the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning, and the concerned frequency is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-FreqInfoList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt within SIB12 or SIB23 for NR sidelink positioning:","paragraph_zero_based":9234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has selected GNSS as synchronization reference in accordance with 5.8.6.2:","paragraph_zero_based":9235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select SLSSID 0;","paragraph_zero_based":9236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use sl-SSB-TimeAllocation1 included in the entry of configured sl-SyncConfigList corresponding to the concerned frequency, that includes txParameters and gnss-Sync;","paragraph_zero_based":9237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select the slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation1;","paragraph_zero_based":9238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has selected a cell as synchronization reference in accordance with 5.8.6.2:","paragraph_zero_based":9239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["523a55e8d6fbfcc3ac7bc51fdba4f14f784dcd785a33d74d464e81a10c4fe4ed","9db67c6747d8c9cd423008698899d09945d4ae7306a653c217ff219251f94e8f","ed34edef11a937b5dfaabd24b0883b1221f2667ca0e76bb3472ef34499c4d876","e4fae0cf840edc88b323289c97b72dba9d102e125c408a49d91a8abcd1191068","870633acf96906d5b29ed4ca254ec07a60e710d3d28c7f3a8a8f8bc7b1b3656f","4f07f386df90adddb3b7275aee572b9179efb4efdd7a0684667ab803c71c5d65","c140e84a4983eaa83b3f931e5345caa7315fc32f2e1345e2cce9dcf5a6da8b11","80c8e92d682f8ca7a5ea5e0654e83960ba126cf9bf218974bf76fc75b5f5753c","6ca96d282d6417d373aeb28c29b91b69d1884fabc674ab25febf86d921608533","d4664eae10edab430982a6706dd078aed26c987576f7fd9a4fa728221406e15b","25e9ac2a04cdf3272dc772ddc406cc94650fc1ae04b6adf128a37897ae3bb2aa","af423bbc6389c3769e9cdc0998dc4d53fa491976e0393f289d2034fb573fbfe6","8f24d04275720ecc074f410d6db710928e2dfe239809bc5b8a1e74f4f4fe8848","808bb9d5f13b769abdc687be7d0799a9bcf58e6f15c0bc399e24a77e01b27a76","ab8e602275715b4114c856eba6c5b14bf8a575f30d3131f167a88bcae268890b","db904f992d162862595769d490293262cc34b48d715b7e44c571da940c1bb17f","3b38755b7a6c98a34f769a18777a52a9ff0ab32c50ecd7295c11ccd657e9a821","90f3ac7b8427c449391f5bcd4aeb009d6d395d959029dd17fa9ce5449d8d775a","a1af8ca6a51eea73130a07a552d26d340542c2628c07c77696489f114052ce09","bbbb2b71f0b1537640a92487ff86c3ea98953d877da246da96a359289d8ceba4","9ca7afdaba8e5ec8d5feb20b56025be2c2b3ffaa7f89ba677295ce653472632c","2ff7ab57a3e258fb05244d4fba6cc7579a0bc3ff6b96d83ebcc782ffacc7f153","8c276bdb0ec6ef8da7888898a644410b4f89089d0841adaea70d4939ba5ef891","950b191c2f7df82114df93f68010ac4cc0aef4095bc35ff2d80dc9a4b7a549ca"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9216,9239],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9216"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select the SLSSID included in the entry of configured sl-SyncConfigList corresponding to the concerned frequency, that includes txParameters and does not include gnss-Sync;","paragraph_zero_based":9240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select the slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation1;","paragraph_zero_based":9241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if triggered by NR sidelink communication/discovery and the UE has GNSS as the synchronization reference:","paragraph_zero_based":9242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>select SLSSID 0;","paragraph_zero_based":9243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3 is configured for the frequency used in SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":9244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select the slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3;","paragraph_zero_based":9245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select the slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation1;","paragraph_zero_based":9247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>select the synchronisation reference UE (i.e. SyncRef UE) as defined in 5.8.6;","paragraph_zero_based":9249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected SyncRef UE and inCoverage in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE is set to true; or","paragraph_zero_based":9250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected SyncRef UE and inCoverage in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE is set to false while the SLSS from this UE is part of the set defined for out of coverage, see TS 38.211 [16]:","paragraph_zero_based":9251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select the same SLSSID as the SLSSID of the selected SyncRef UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select the slot in which to transmit the SLSS according to the sl-SSB-TimeAllocation1 or sl-SSB-TimeAllocation2 included in the preconfigured sidelink parameters corresponding to the concerned frequency, such that the timing is different from the SLSS of the selected SyncRef UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE has a selected SyncRef UE and the SLSS from this UE was transmitted on the slot(s) indicated sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3, which is configured for the frequency used in SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":9254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select SLSSID 337;","paragraph_zero_based":9255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select the slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation2;","paragraph_zero_based":9256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE has a selected SyncRef UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select the SLSSID from the set defined for out of coverage having an index that is 336 more than the index of the SLSSID of the selected SyncRef UE, see TS 38.211 [16];","paragraph_zero_based":9258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select the slot in which to transmit the SLSS according to sl-SSB-TimeAllocation1 or sl-SSB-TimeAllocation2 included in the preconfigured sidelink parameters corresponding to the concerned frequency, such that the timing is different from the SLSS of the selected SyncRef UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (i.e. no SyncRef UE selected):","paragraph_zero_based":9260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has not randomly selected an SLSSID:","paragraph_zero_based":9261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>randomly select, using a uniform distribution, an SLSSID from the set of sequences defined for out of coverage except SLSSID 336 and 337, see TS 38.211 [16];","paragraph_zero_based":9262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>select the slot in which to transmit the SLSS according to the sl-SSB-TimeAllocation1 or sl-SSB-TimeAllocation2 (arbitrary selection between these) included in the preconfigured sidelink parameters in SidelinkPreconfigNR corresponding to the concerned frequency;","paragraph_zero_based":9263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1fe31b1094d5c79ed5e41ddd5c7cdfcf33dc667c643b2908afd4c1a00bb9058b","dd4a7a6c6bcfcb2da95d5be7e6ca47a52c65c1d75c44cb2c995edc3d8bbc7e85","097d617add21212579b139c80e2aee4921277a4a9045642ed7788829d8567d75","64d237f36229bbc533ae3f6733ff60b1cb59c21e9e90aac36bd729751de601a3","23083ebe9365b8a1d8ad0bd788d3636c21da332b762689cf961c02cc0a381b25","5f7f52de54ac454019c508b05f023416c3d154e47acaaecc0000f5d8c5ab1b32","6fa5b8c815c80c2b29096aacbbbfa204f48c4a8cf58dbf4df811ffc034ebee46","fe31e0954e79d152b16c1a33693f068d05fc02e8100b393bb3a2f79e793f7042","b841cbd92c8442743869ea622f9c9f163e69a792358a71af09d92e9354106152","96b3c08ab58b038806b1b94494a5c7fb90d75664c3f0847d95455394628024ad","4d404bd51732e9c824879813b75de0e82ec5b39258ecdae57fc595d3bf4e91bd","7ad8ad14ba9a55bf4ddc2876c3eed933d46579b74831a1283757fb22e6186713","6433ffeb8e60a273319d7f3f4a050af219e20c043af6a58c7f249d4da2810140","1002f9d90839bfe58a044d4ed8c348acee11b3cf20c362817d525ba1742bee28","f616784964fb5cccc822509e3e386101d6a8e9359c308eeeefbf1167e2673470","452e0214f75449715b762169bf22546306cd2a77719fc4490df31a469f46578a","76d27f897c3c3a864fac59cdaf0f7b2f5cdddd69035cd8f7792d50a1a1b3d55b","fbce7d589a16c61073ace2c3ed83762ef4b8d505b5598da8303e65cbd75dd1c4","6430c752536a44582668e5a1443f3a39f3005208647597c817e18a8718a83f65","845e5b8f00b42d8229b3faf3c68d6cb5951185755898d202e77da4323eb85b41","424c7d0a456ffc4fa62036b44ade3b7882c9facbc98ab2781ebdd8e490aa1e9c","6bb2aa1394407ae48d4629886fea88174c204731605d465dc49e0f00a6e14bff","509a9eea7aed19568be60ec800fa9077773d5ca9c9f05acc8d49c069d3062009","036b3d5fb2e2ea08ed2ec09658ef1e445b47d5b7400d576c25805fe609642304"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9240,9263],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9240"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.5aSidelink synchronisation information transmission for V2X sidelink communication","paragraph_zero_based":9264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.5a.1General","paragraph_zero_based":9265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.5a.1-1: Synchronisation information transmission for V2X sidelink communication, in (partial) coverage","paragraph_zero_based":9267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.5a.1-2: Synchronisation information transmission for V2X sidelink communication, out of coverage","paragraph_zero_based":9269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to provide synchronisation information to a UE.","paragraph_zero_based":9270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.5a.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":9271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of V2X sidelink communication initiates the transmission of SLSS and MasterInformationBlock-SL-V2X according to the conditions and the procedures specified for V2X sidelink communication in clause 5.10.7 of TS 36.331 [10].","paragraph_zero_based":9272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1: When applying the procedure in this clause, SIB13 and SIB14 correspond to SystemInformationBlockType21 and SystemInformationBlockType26 specified in TS 36.331 [10] respectively.","paragraph_zero_based":9273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.6Sidelink synchronisation reference","paragraph_zero_based":9274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.6.1General","paragraph_zero_based":9275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to select a synchronisation reference and used when transmitting NR sidelink communication/discovery. This procedure also applies to NR sidelink discovery.","paragraph_zero_based":9276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.6.2Selection and reselection of synchronisation reference","paragraph_zero_based":9277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall for frequency(ies) which have been selected for NR sidelink communication/discovery as specified in TS 38.321 [3]:","paragraph_zero_based":9278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-SyncFreqList is not included in RRCReconfiguration nor in SIB12; or","paragraph_zero_based":9279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-SyncFreqList is included in RRCReconfiguration or in SIB12, and none of the frequency(ies) selected as specified in TS 38.321 [3] is included in the syncFreqList:","paragraph_zero_based":9280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-ConfigCommonNR within SIB12, and sl-SyncPriority is configured for the concerned frequency and set to gnbEnb:","paragraph_zero_based":9281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select a cell as the synchronization reference source as defined in 5.8.6.3:","paragraph_zero_based":9282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:When an out of coverage L2 U2N Remote UE receives SIB12 with sl-SyncPriority set to gnbEnb, the L2 U2N Remote UE continues using the current synchronization source until higher priority synchronization source is found or the current synchronization source becomes unreliable.","paragraph_zero_based":9283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-ConfigCommonNR within SIB12, and sl-SyncPriority for the concerned frequency is not configured or is set to gnss, and GNSS is reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":9284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select GNSS as the synchronization reference source;","paragraph_zero_based":9285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery is included in SL-PreconfigurationNR, and sl-SyncPriority in SidelinkPreconfigNR is set to gnss and GNSS is reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":9286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select GNSS as the synchronization reference source;","paragraph_zero_based":9287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b526906c513127eef038d1167ae0f7b771aec6a68fa0628ab63a7ff7a6d762e9","5637eb96ae3bab7533c69beda4504127f08d2006fbd740cb8f41959301fa4d67","78902edf51ef1becb626581b8e444e51cb8d5002afef0d09fa4b06dd54855bb8","24c4575c11866aa89eaa2c88a652a1d7516b3424b207b53d0015ed133d912f35","f638d0ddd3e3a2f6c52071596913467c48ea2045df51241e71ef4c76146ce654","058a51197c01bcab5a429f7914f438fafe39de2ab5eef67a53d4e4475ac9b7a1","77a62b232b764dde5e02a9e82a5c484cd9e87c6e7daa7e49d4fb639cff3c22e9","e8cad30d8929ffb6d9e0d7f9298f41ab0187690cab36666d4faf8c3863f27d71","dcc63b7cae2d38ef3ea5d313b242b3a3b0b37ea7d3f573396da1a7a65e8a31a5","e5e4982cfe6e32eddb22274daf5b788198e56229791283c1fdad0c287ea661a6","7b6d9244309a090dfe8868fe378a6cd66fb84b4f4668aa666939ad3d010f20bb","20ddac888b0455d5d291999dc08a906156e0b2ccd0fb8130e83c69d53a7bf425","e3de0992471cb2d5e932cd051a31aa13f14a4a8cb855d82e61bdf1b939c68d0f","6ae903dda04b7bd2038064d3192918feaeb831612c645aa4bf69d12614058fee","160a9175bdcab577fd1ca69825423c6b11b0dc424cfc510766a1810d65e36233","25f87f9c9e460b6ddce31630256986b1cb71860c5424b2912e1dd4c39db5ff14","2490a30ff0385968270d4093d635b386f28f50c8b2518faef71ef6bc197ea0d5","9cb75e43fd412787625feba241bba2f4cd2f56c0d2e6942043b78b31a7ba6ce7","6660e5946fe5a9b9a45915738563e9ca6ed25356d983c79b4a1b25888e6c9a81","2d18d500a648e91a468d9eed99ddf4580dcedc78c778d5dfc084981479369363","c49f8e173ed303263e5c1997d65ccf701d2f367e34b36d4a36312abcf58d3062","5ad1516e6a5fdd816be0ed3c72e1f52318c920647adc90062c14f4363cd422d7","e977b688c7c3fc43510eda346c5b22eba03833d7e14f8abccf5235aea032bbc0","b3f66faed0c332bee70342b2de9944a1b4d108f32dc57170d2501de325cb6c8b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9264,9287],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9264"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform synchronization reference search procedure as defined in 5.8.6.2b on each frequency which is used for NR sidelink communication/discovery;","paragraph_zero_based":9289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has not selected any synchronization reference:","paragraph_zero_based":9290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each frequency which is used for NR sidelink communication/discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":9291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE detects one or more SLSSIDs for which the PSBCH-RSRP exceeds the minimum requirement defined in TS 38.133 [14] by sl-SyncRefMinHyst and for which the UE received the corresponding MasterInformationBlockSidelink message (candidate SyncRef UEs), or if the UE detects GNSS that is reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14], or if the UE detects a cell, select a synchronization reference according to the priority group order as defined in 5.8.6.2a:","paragraph_zero_based":9292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-SyncFreqList is included in RRCReconfiguration or in SIB12, and includes at least one of the concerned frequency(ies)","paragraph_zero_based":9293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the concerned frequency(ies) are included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-ConfigCommonNR within SIB12, and sl-SyncPriority is configured for the concerned frequency(ies) and set to gnbEnb:","paragraph_zero_based":9294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select one frequency from the concerned frequency(ies) which are included in sl-SyncFreqList as the synchronisation carrier frequency;","paragraph_zero_based":9295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select a cell in accordance with the synchronisation carrier frequency as the synchronization reference source as defined in 5.8.6.3:","paragraph_zero_based":9296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the concerned frequency(ies) are included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-ConfigCommonNR within SIB12, and sl-SyncPriority for concerned frequency(ies) are not configured or are set to gnss, and GNSS is reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14]; or if the concerned frequency(ies) are included in SL-PreconfigurationNR, and sl-SyncPriority in SidelinkPreconfigNR is set to gnss and GNSS is reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":9297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select one frequency from the concerned frequency(ies) which are included in sl-SyncFreqList as the synchronisation carrier frequency;","paragraph_zero_based":9298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select GNSS in accordance with the synchronisation carrier frequency as the synchronization reference source;","paragraph_zero_based":9299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform a synchronization reference search procedure as defined in 5.8.6.2b on each concerned frequency which is included in sl-SyncFreqList;","paragraph_zero_based":9301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has not selected any synchronization reference:","paragraph_zero_based":9302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each concerned frequency which is included in sl-SyncFreqList:","paragraph_zero_based":9303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE detects one or more SLSSIDs for which the PSBCH-RSRP exceeds the minimum requirement defined in TS 38.133 [14] by sl-SyncRefMinHyst and for which the UE received the corresponding MasterInformationBlockSidelink message (candidate SyncRef UEs), or if the UE detects GNSS that is reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14], or if the UE detects a cell,","paragraph_zero_based":9304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>select the synchronisation reference source(s) according to the following priority group order as defined in 5.8.6.2a;","paragraph_zero_based":9305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>select the frequency with the highest synchronisation reference source priority as the synchronisation carrier frequency, according to the following priority group order as defined in 5.8.6.2a, and consider the synchornization reference source (i.e. eNB/gNB, GNSS or SyncRef UE) that selected on the synchronisation carrier frequency as the synchronization reference:","paragraph_zero_based":9306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:How the UE achieves subframe boundary alignment between V2X sidelink communication and NR sidelink communication/discovery (if both are performed by the UE) is as specified in TS 38.213, clause 16.7.","paragraph_zero_based":9307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.6.2aSidelink synchronization reference priority group order","paragraph_zero_based":9308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-SyncPriority corresponding to the concerned frequency is set to gnbEnb:","paragraph_zero_based":9309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>UEs of which SLSSID is part of the set defined for in coverage, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to true, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 1);","paragraph_zero_based":9310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>UE of which SLSSID is part of the set defined for in coverage, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 2);","paragraph_zero_based":9311}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["27b01f9a3237e95eb09928d340bae67aecb80f2802d196fd70721159d59ec82c","7b1fa22ab7fd7080498efa1dc59f942bcf4efa821be018c1ed5d9e8593e0c66c","fef2ef1c90bd7ddbdf06a8b14e9e4005bcc72bd3b0886ab393092d92f1ad92d8","4463ccdab5b392dd2c93490d1c04540e19a0bc79dd5f15739b4fec8f36c7b5c9","82dc3c66e3812d90eb0b9956797096aaa29611628f8131d27a1f1960f2d63622","15e9ac853d02b6a705785dc7b214ff969118c1f6a0c85a5b1a85588e0f3f9246","0ce72a817d68c0716ce77c17188ae080256da94309e0a86f48dc49c925a8db01","2e042171de5a4a2574efa9124a18a5c3ebc3f67b44853359c076f54a2ca831bf","a56fdacc448198c2ab9dfeb15070aa57db67939e9feee4e98587d21196437622","8bebab2afd65f246ca22ae2494f7aa0acd33d3c6d8ef3b6a6e007047c535c34e","b2ef295b4788114c8058841e2536808a6112f2ac17de9f511f81e78123266584","708a0fbe53e7311232e9da2c493900fef8a9649f72b51b2bf45e4e64fc421b34","5d07ec5685baab4d22b9fec3dd0e82b58001582277610857deb56fa92fe19552","311209639f08ad789d3185571e7db2c1cdf83e94834a74e075b0f3efcb314ffd","ea28020a125e2b3d804a1afbc4ecafccf2143fee7f6b1fd330954a0a40f1f75f","a13fb18bb7abd5aee015dda45d56a00ca0923b537dab7b9891d0d3e0d72c2820","e98d50d95a7c49eae8c46e07560c9804800abca564b16b2db5e7369d76f5d93c","98e74b798a7434c34f377980fcf911cf0ddcee7e36bcd7fecf207e2e69e8b4c5","cbe9c2ce8d81fb8cf76976f1b8713dd1fb0fe183fc8646ed2bb1e62ea53e77e3","623ad73a5c200ae6318d848f4add14245afcf2a403ed6209c01abca7a1e96506","82452a864f1c1f50b529c82a0605cbbce17f4eff7ea1b7903bef441c99b213ab","9fcea8be9c5dd6ae6c291a807501c12c10cd519c5deb569b334e18240523613d","f340e561b6fba92646d70865b85bf635b7755464ba858607d6cedc15c3822f75","8e713d8c00c1ae87fd675f17afd950ce639523a5f01000821ddf5019c6e4145e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9288,9311],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9288"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>GNSS that is reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14] (priority group 3);","paragraph_zero_based":9312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>UEs of which SLSSID is 0, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to true, or of which SLSSID is 0 and SLSS is transmitted on slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 4);","paragraph_zero_based":9313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>UEs of which SLSSID is 0 and SLSS is not transmitted on slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 5);","paragraph_zero_based":9314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>UEs of which SLSSID is 337 and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 5);","paragraph_zero_based":9315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>Other UEs, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 6);","paragraph_zero_based":9316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-SyncPriority corresponding to the concerned frequency is set to gnss, and sl-NbAsSync is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":9317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>UEs of which SLSSID is 0, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to true, or of which SLSSID is 0 and SLSS is transmitted on slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 1);","paragraph_zero_based":9318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>UEs of which SLSSID is 0 and SLSS is not transmitted on slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCHS-RSRP result (priority group 2);","paragraph_zero_based":9319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>UEs of which SLSSID is 337 and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 2);","paragraph_zero_based":9320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the cell detected by the UE as defined in 5.8.6.3 (priority group 3);","paragraph_zero_based":9321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>UEs of which SLSSID is part of the set defined for in coverage, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to true, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 4);","paragraph_zero_based":9322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>UE of which SLSSID is part of the set defined for in coverage, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 5);","paragraph_zero_based":9323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>Other UEs, starting with the UE with the highest S-RSRP result (priority group 6);","paragraph_zero_based":9324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-SyncPriority corresponding to the concerned frequency is set to gnss, and sl-NbAsSync is set to false:","paragraph_zero_based":9325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>UEs of which SLSSID is 0, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to true, or of which SLSSID is 0 and SLSS is transmitted on slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 1);","paragraph_zero_based":9326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>UEs of which SLSSID is 0 and SLSS is not transmitted on slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCHS-RSRP result (priority group 2);","paragraph_zero_based":9327},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>UEs of which SLSSID is 337 and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 2);","paragraph_zero_based":9328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>Other UEs, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 3);","paragraph_zero_based":9329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.6.2bSidelink synchronization reference search","paragraph_zero_based":9330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall for the indicated frequency(ies)","paragraph_zero_based":9331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform a full search (i.e. covering all subframes and all possible SLSSIDs) on each indicated frequency to detect candidate SLSS, in accordance with TS 38.133 [14];","paragraph_zero_based":9332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>when evaluating the one or more detected SLSSIDs, apply layer 3 filtering as specified in 5.5.3.2 using the preconfigured sl-filterCoefficient, before using the PSBCH-RSRP measurement results;","paragraph_zero_based":9333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has selected a SyncRef UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PSBCH-RSRP of the strongest candidate SyncRef UE exceeds the minimum requirement TS 38.133 [14] by sl-SyncRefMinHyst and the strongest candidate SyncRef UE belongs to the same priority group as the current SyncRef UE and the PSBCH-RSRP of the strongest candidate SyncRef UE exceeds the PSBCH-RSRP of the current SyncRef UE by syncRefDiffHyst; or","paragraph_zero_based":9335}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f7dd1588c91be2e9734b37794ab229dd424636c723befa4c7f8c6fb727863129","5a8779938bd82678a459edf265965b5697e7ba880019609f4b1020c963b6e3d7","18d22432fe4becc6d8ff81e75853bd0f5d0aedb0e8f2f99453f922bf28b5f09b","32a1a245bffa73ff3ca0056481d0aa195e6af84cf8236025697b331495ec0296","af80d35d36f6edf43e4c602b3f9740b6e079d3a00f7e42de7fac47041d0e4c1d","3b764f0b873ccb82869b56d7e52f2b1a2f0e57679526b119e9ad2a11dc67032b","2cdf9ccfae6d9d7cd05a4b6be947dfaced2696924d8a26b978f3013fc14ccc17","33c17c3ba6be8c51d84d110806caf2ca82f3d4e49325836f4b327850c8fcbee7","8b2858af82427301ecbef34f8da833e682e90479bc27faa48e4179b6433455fd","36799daff2d0fb0ff6433b9c371dc2e9f716c39947a960df33cbd4d56eb6ff28","d85cf5a17e7b38a7e32b484ab2f5f6c5774e79e384f5ce87d7c9ca8ba44df7d1","94b1ffd15454bdd45869b9e5faca4163aa2101b93ba510cab088d8b0cf245a41","175b90dd2d1430b39227b76aa0fe53df68b7b1532dbf71ba2b2f148d4714bd57","c2d0e191804cf746d2928e308b063d1bf3d80811f45b619da16e40db0140e458","bb2b87f30692b682660f2696180e51955bf36eb0b1d9270b1b7cef29a0155c70","218317ca212a7b7ef80a5d2f1ac367fa64046a1fdcfd58be46b52c44366907b7","b9e4b47d87592aa687d046a3ac9d0cb20c5e79fbcae40b285054eae5db9df136","9ce1ff605b3a0ff9c24367abcc77343ba8a80e6b47e7a201eebcc07c02a81da4","73f2b7968eda85df7352d9dcbf75663491e43c853a472423c5ab2ea8e18222b9","771b59ee95f1561bf2fe54a82e78fa244076c8858e9307d1e4bda0677e6570da","4eb96f3c85e4793e08b12d1a456757ab9dec5411bbf874983d741bca63b8c610","fa01be5404c6f0b5ddb227eaffe6506cf00c5ff5e1d4db9a3741df69d8d8f45e","e6c117abd94bc3602d765391fb5160c53e1460d4e09a1c2d16e70cf1bd4c4c63","65965a96c2f3398b59898114b76bd1102209393f58d48ecd8663c81b863a5465"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9312,9335],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9312"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PSBCH-RSRP of the candidate SyncRef UE exceeds the minimum requirement TS 38.133 [14] by sl-SyncRefMinHyst and the candidate SyncRef UE belongs to a higher priority group than the current SyncRef UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":9336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if GNSS becomes reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14], and GNSS belongs to a higher priority group than the current SyncRef UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":9337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a cell is detected and gNB/eNB (if sl-NbAsSync is set to true) belongs to a higher priority group than the current SyncRef UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":9338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PSBCH-RSRP of the current SyncRef UE is less than the minimum requirement defined in TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":9339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider no SyncRef UE to be selected;","paragraph_zero_based":9340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has selected GNSS as the synchronization reference for NR sidelink communication/discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":9341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PSBCH-RSRP of the candidate SyncRef UE exceeds the minimum requirement defined in TS 38.133 [14] by sl-SyncRefMinHyst and the candidate SyncRef UE belongs to a higher priority group than GNSS; or","paragraph_zero_based":9342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if GNSS becomes not reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":9343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider GNSS not to be selected;","paragraph_zero_based":9344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has selected cell as the synchronization reference for NR sidelink communication/discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":9345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PSBCH-RSRP of the candidate SyncRef UE exceeds the minimum requirement defined in TS 38.133 [14] by sl-SyncRefMinHyst and the candidate SyncRef UE belongs to a higher priority group than gNB/eNB; or","paragraph_zero_based":9346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the selected cell is not detected:","paragraph_zero_based":9347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell not to be selected;","paragraph_zero_based":9348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.6.3Sidelink communication transmission reference cell selection","paragraph_zero_based":9349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink communication/discovery that is configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink communication/discovery shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for the frequency used to transmit NR sidelink communication/discovery, select a cell to be used as reference for synchronization in accordance with the following:","paragraph_zero_based":9351},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the frequency concerns the primary frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":9352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the PCell or the serving cell as reference;","paragraph_zero_based":9353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the frequency concerns a secondary frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":9354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the concerned SCell as reference;","paragraph_zero_based":9355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is in coverage of the concerned frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":9356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the DL frequency paired with the one used to transmit NR sidelink communication/discovery as reference;","paragraph_zero_based":9357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (i.e., out of coverage on the concerned frequency):","paragraph_zero_based":9358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the PCell or the serving cell as reference, if needed;","paragraph_zero_based":9359}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d204bba5c62e0bba3f52dde95d0dda865bf1144db4fb94d0fb94be5aaf790ef2","ec78f9d536456f87a0af7cad5411a2c5c014746f8608e806a66dc996c8b6f9d0","ac712ee0d1594eae5190c618e30580bc80ff55bcd6b5c3b1b449640d596cfce2","8de1e54ec203b3c5f89d0b822569d6acc99916ca3e2ce728439b4d6fa13259bf","9c850add66f2d07f329eeb2a7ad4c5d1912a494dc7ad174909090db4534316a9","fad0be8305ff97fd4fbb4af49e1a0f62529f5d93057ec80fe9e9482f892d94d6","16efb213ef367066a71f4b59527be159ce34fb8f4e60447a244116da8aa5e9e8","691ba39959b39fe176395e482d65aec40dbd8fbb16477cad5b982bc661ecb27a","cc64302683591fda62b08093eafd43855eab5f06bf945c6502c427ba33a2808a","b70faa746522efff00cb01cf36c362681bdf81d9dbd7ed44e40e74e9cb33710b","bb35a0529b14f71045687ffb5dafd09d555b01bca5d33654eaa239ac99818711","69a188cd1ba9d2e63b6963e905e2d54d27a96b3e980d8e2caa26e7fb0a2997a8","a8239f3cb40fb639382a4ff04d84f6ac363e33cb01d0356d5fccd42f2932953c","c373d98717741e5bcc289a0f3dbe7c888adc555a25963bea428da003960c89af","180924aa733dc3ae02252af3423f8d43950734ff144f5da3b71d658497e72feb","9e17dfbae0619f2128688cea4324e8111b55f402f2904ae5c39fd6d1e1e5fd7f","8b2153c7be69560bacf8aecb6af08725fac485537cdebd9d78e9f609f2a3ff4b","c159968260d2477024c313df053643ed5f54f0a2188ad3b59d87ef9fb2dfc3c6","29d2c6a1d3e5256dbc0513f8b61ed5af9abd4f4514c9d549af969a9869f9518c","c0d9c6be2d3314e31cfd6205eefb546432bf0e80b03f5618df10bc1d475c5186","c8cbef05b2ca9071a7e7a74b6686f90e795bd626faa93090731824cd6db0a0d0","62d78fc928f50164ab86192c794918e352e797206941c4549d8e46400b511c4b","08245babcb3b271cb9db0660a62855a68a18345414fa4d3a5896d61aa1ab15dd","e2531b6262c4ddd3698e68a08c9b53796021dc3dc42545ea6f485ee729173efc"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9336,9359],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9336"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.7Sidelink communication reception","paragraph_zero_based":9360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured by upper layers to receive NR sidelink communication shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the conditions for NR sidelink communication operation as defined in 5.8.2 are met:","paragraph_zero_based":9362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the frequency used for NR sidelink communication is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt in RRCReconfiguration message or sl-FreqInfoList/sl-FreqInfoListSizeExt included in SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":9363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is configured with sl-RxPool included in RRCReconfiguration message with reconfigurationWithSync (i.e. handover):","paragraph_zero_based":9364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers to monitor sidelink control information and the corresponding data using the pool(s) of resources indicated by sl-RxPool;","paragraph_zero_based":9365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the cell chosen for NR sidelink communication provides SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":9366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers to monitor sidelink control information and the corresponding data using the pool(s) of resources indicated by sl-RxPool in SIB12;","paragraph_zero_based":9367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to monitor sidelink control information and the corresponding data using the pool(s) of resources that were preconfigured by sl-RxPool in SL-PreconfigurationNR, as defined in clause 9.3.","paragraph_zero_based":9369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.8Sidelink communication transmission","paragraph_zero_based":9370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink communication and has related data to be transmitted shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the conditions for NR sidelink communication operation as defined in 5.8.2 are met:","paragraph_zero_based":9372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the frequency used for NR sidelink communication is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-ConfigCommonNR within SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":9373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED and uses the frequency included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":9374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE acting as U2U Relay UE is performing U2U Relay Communication with integrated Discovery as specified in TS 23.304[65] and sl-DiscConfig is included in RRCReconfiguration, and if the NR sidelink U2U Relay UE threshold conditions for integrated Discovery as specified in 5.8.16.2 are met based on sl-RelayUE-ConfigU2U; or","paragraph_zero_based":9375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE capable of U2U Remote UE is performing U2U Relay Communication with integrated Discovery as specified in TS 23.304[65] and sl-DiscConfig is included in RRCReconfiguration, and if the NR sidelink U2U Remote UE threshold conditions for integrated Discovery as specified in 5.8.17.2 are met based on sl-RemoteUE-ConfigU2U; or","paragraph_zero_based":9376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is performing NR sidelink communication other than U2U Relay Communication with integrated Discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":9377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:For U2U Relay UE, it can be up to UE implementation on cross-layer interaction for the AS layer condition check for Direct Communication Request message with integrated discovery forwarding.","paragraph_zero_based":9378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE is configured with sl-ScheduledConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":9379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if T310 for MCG or T311 is running; and if sl-TxPoolExceptional is included in sl-FreqInfoList/sl-FreqInfoListSizeExt for the concerned frequency in SIB12 or included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR in RRCReconfiguration; or","paragraph_zero_based":9380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if T301 is running and the cell on which the UE initiated RRC connection re-establishment provides SIB12 including sl-TxPoolExceptional for the concerned frequency; or","paragraph_zero_based":9381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if T304 for MCG is running and the UE is configured with sl-TxPoolExceptional included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR for the concerned frequency in RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":9382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on random selection using the pool of resources indicated by sl-TxPoolExceptional as defined in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":9383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["707c8ad3fbc3a0529cd4c2464ba7c3cfbe4646bdd5e186f019184104b41028dd","02fd4ebce74c5ad2345c4aadb7e5f7ffb8e9baca1b677f7a618289d357e0bf66","ba6ddcd421b579348bf5edbcbd8fdf7ebf1d5716dd24ab8cd48231b16fa23d63","6b654a85158b1051be7e4c789bdf922f414b52191ce728bd3b6bf50d037ffdce","f5184259e740258628c05c03a9b362eec3b0793860b2cf86f0d73cb42ec858e1","ef310fba36b2a825438029e7b6be00782339a4cdba5064e9744cc7b506c78326","b97d82319e86036aa982d5fe022680887bc0d8c10217e7a227a83f42b5aeb218","601784868b04721bad42e4d6f006d0afa648679f21593835ca60691d7cfbaee5","1100759d2d14520e6b5209513e284cb897cc619a97661275a0affeb42df2d662","25236e84103be00d2c92425396d8b48273bb4f665292bc62e8ee432539ef2161","3aff7e3f2bd3f8e588946e01fea3d43b97d678cd2503230e21c6585cba88160c","295139d19f70408f227b67a66c99f4c1bddff9ffb2c7842f4682702ef166375c","fa96a04d9f0c3b9644c3c4930e305da0b85cdeba62b6bf1201f0a9835faf253c","efef0507f0dc2a48870b62187884bb7d6d819276131b82a43121018f897f809b","c2a642d70ce137fc929494fe8a0c09ee977ce0beb5c2e0f039c60fad87bc0226","9972b011f753ab5a1d606f24e2c54e885e7d005d5138feb99f4abeaa41b7063d","20a4c4a4dec9ef401a6674998f00ffe934c9d83a8d97d512121bbcb3caa0516d","e9b7085593d1701c13928ac70e1f921695bf5203072341e6678f533f61d174e7","f86aafd7ef93516c32b7c7639fd571d76d73557cbbf325b745ad5740b5d85ef2","60a2c784bb15cce8d4e6e922a37081880d24177b0d949dcf0b9eeb752fa317da","66ea7acaa1a01beb33fa4b93bfee82b9a52bf074b4a432d66dfdb1e96bac53d5","02814512cdfd3ea5e3e8258611849ae229606bd526d165032af95a44ee9e589c","e62ca33690e982c0d9c4d7d7512590efe752117c301965f317b50039146f5558","dcf5efa6744c2dbd622f25d44d83ef0ad3847fa2c857f197cb83bcdccda0da1e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9360,9383],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9360"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 1 for NR sidelink communication;","paragraph_zero_based":9385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if T311 is running, configure the lower layers to release the resources indicated by rrc-ConfiguredSidelinkGrant (if any);","paragraph_zero_based":9386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE is configured with sl-UE-SelectedConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":9387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if a result of full/partial sensing, if selected and is allowed by sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig, on the resources configured in sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for the concerned frequency included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration is not available in accordance with TS 38.214 [19];","paragraph_zero_based":9388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>if sl-TxPoolExceptional for the concerned frequency is included in RRCReconfiguration; or","paragraph_zero_based":9389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>if the PCell provides SIB12 including sl-TxPoolExceptional in sl-FreqInfoList/sl-FreqInfoListSizeExt for the concerned frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":9390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on random selection using the pool of resources indicated by sl-TxPoolExceptional as defined in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":9391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else, if the sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for the concerned frequency is included in the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":9392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on resource selection operation according to sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig (as defined in TS 38.321 [3] and TS 38.214 [19]) using the pools of resources indicated by sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for the concerned frequency;","paragraph_zero_based":9393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the cell chosen for NR sidelink communication transmission provides SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":9395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE acting as U2U Relay UE is performing U2U Relay communication with integrated Discovery as specified in TS 23.304[65], and if the NR sidelink U2U Relay UE threshold conditions for integrated Discovery as specified in 5.8.16.2 are met based on sl-RelayUE-ConfigCommonU2U in SIB12; or","paragraph_zero_based":9396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE capable of U2U Remote UE is performing U2U Relay Communication with integrated Discovery as specified in TS 23.304[65], and if the NR sidelink U2U Remote UE threshold conditions for integrated Discovery as specified in 5.8.17.2 are met based on sl-RemoteUE-ConfigU2U in SIB12; or","paragraph_zero_based":9397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE is performing NR sidelink communication other than U2U Relay Communication with integrated Discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":9398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if SIB12 includes sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for the concerned frequency, and a result of full/partial sensing, if selected and is allowed by sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig, on the resources configured in the sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal is available in accordance with TS 38.214 [19] or random selection, if allowed by sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig, is selected:","paragraph_zero_based":9399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on resource selection operation according to sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig using the pools of resources indicated by sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for the concerned frequency as defined in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":9400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else if SIB12 includes sl-TxPoolExceptional for the concerned frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":9401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>from the moment the UE initiates RRC connection establishment or RRC connection resume, until receiving an RRCReconfiguration including sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, or receiving an RRCRelease or an RRCReject; or","paragraph_zero_based":9402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>if a result of full/partial sensing, if selected and is allowed by sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig, on the resources configured in sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for the concerned frequency in SIB12 is not available in accordance with TS 38.214 [19]:","paragraph_zero_based":9403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on random selection (as defined in TS 38.321 [3]) using the pool of resources indicated by sl-TxPoolExceptional for the concerned frequency;","paragraph_zero_based":9404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE acting as U2U Relay UE is performing U2U Relay communication with integrated Discovery as specified in TS 23.304[65], and if the NR sidelink U2U Relay UE threshold conditions for integrated Discovery as specified in 5.8.16.2 are met based on sl-RelayUE-PreconfigU2U in SidelinkPreconfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":9406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE capable of U2U Remote UE is performing U2U Relay Communication with integrated Discovery as specified in TS 23.304[65], and if the NR sidelink U2U Remote UE threshold conditions for integrated Discovery as specified in 5.8.17.2 are met based on sl-RemoteUE-PreconfigU2U in SidelinkPreconfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":9407}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d1710be7798783a3bad948258edf261ccf623a30fe277f767110b0f418c7481c","c47925494ef9afc7c39c72364608e1516e4f1443275fd3fb45546f7f71ca43d0","538e0207644d1d4dcfee51902249d4eb1dbfd0649d2d93f9368a2f0d925b71f1","c4f7be3fbe53280a8162775c38e6241ff11992fcdfe1e4d47a99c3b48f9d73a8","069b50c0c81d807e51f66f7ff4868f0d44a084438e24738d67d503d0e672a412","14579cfb8e0de46d591c73f112f259d8c2c2750f204273a7e39ee98961476b29","a6e9c63dbd5d9454d462a6ae870343b1a51e745e7dc473b0594015cc68f05b7b","fb83b4cd92221f978c26fa463436d142c89db6edc29a09d21ce376007e9c8a09","79f38459889b0f43afaa7aa59ac60f32706c4660fb52e76aeaf62c4a32a5f670","723b29c6f23daf067af0f244e5b6c4d753b7449f314eb6e1c3c1335769b92284","a2a1ae61e43454d4aff141f812927b9a831dd1b6d7da9d8c403739b38cb5d650","cd935cf60bc08cb68255c15642e4e3207f2f16db1a9747f75ed75706106cb9ca","ab3422ef0d7f9453c67f2778425f413b79c8c826cece906895c4a88e2016828a","780b6e534c0b943d0c469450c5527b6697973de2b23d4ff6f4941e3f1ad99b9b","a8da84d67bdf879a2adfacb9e1f28a4f287a78cad13e25d1aa55f5e05070b8ea","dd4498f85c455fbf9b8c9d2d94c9c8f0a146bc4b9c4542e43a9d4931cb49f2dd","b468d7193a7028de6eedc45f7f5b77fa805d4ceaa6269ed6a4f94bafee190182","306c5b165c749e2eefcb88e870c4abbcc1c9ac5c85e16211c6ee856a143f2993","6b7655a48911b8c54b310569d0f8e6ad46c48db9dcacb2589206ec38a67cb425","bd4040317da6ad6e5ea8e275cd7b702eb7e8c5df804e152458f54ae61cb18585","c29f585c93e81ada84b016c4d87d0ca3727b12ccd484699dd7fd8e0e5b2b5eba","ef98f9c5bdda61bc9ed67d2e6a9b90998a4b5c7d8229304350114876c99bd7d3","54177f41ad72da1f5dbb0e3e850fb59464271a0cc3d7a494bee8de09a8b3a5e9","d0c383d75dafef62485ba6ed626debfab68ceb4c339fa5a6945d12b8aec70bbe"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9384,9407],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9384"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is performing NR sidelink communication other than U2U Relay Communication with integrated Discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":9408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on resource selection operation according to sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig (as defined in TS 38.321 [3] and TS 38.214 [19]) using the pools of resources indicated by sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal in SidelinkPreconfigNR for the concerned frequency.","paragraph_zero_based":9409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE continues to use resources configured in rrc-ConfiguredSidelinkGrant (while T310 is running) until it is released (i.e. until T310 has expired). The UE does not use sidelink configured grant type 2 resources while T310 is running.","paragraph_zero_based":9410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:In case of RRC reconfiguration with sync, the UE uses resources configured in rrc-ConfiguredSidelinkGrant (while T304 on the MCG is running) if provided by the target cell.","paragraph_zero_based":9411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:It is up to UE implementation to determine, in accordance with TS 38.321[3], which resource pool to use if multiple resource pools are configured, and which resource allocation scheme is used in the AS based on UE capability (for a UE in RRC_IDLE/RRC_INACTIVE) and the allowed resource schemes sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig in the resource pool configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":9412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:In case that the network does not provide resource pools in SIB12, a UE which is out of coverage, will be unable to obtain sidelink resources to send the first UL RRC message.","paragraph_zero_based":9413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If configured to perform sidelink resource allocation mode 2, the UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink communication shall perform resource selection operation according to sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig on all pools of resources which may be used for transmission of the sidelink control information and the corresponding data. The pools of resources are indicated by SidelinkPreconfigNR, sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, or sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal in SIB12 for the concerned frequency, as configured above.","paragraph_zero_based":9414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9Sidelink RRC procedure","paragraph_zero_based":9415},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1Sidelink RRC reconfiguration","paragraph_zero_based":9416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.1General","paragraph_zero_based":9417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.9.1.1-1: Sidelink RRC reconfiguration, successful","paragraph_zero_based":9420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.9.1.1-2: Sidelink RRC reconfiguration, failure","paragraph_zero_based":9422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to modify a PC5-RRC connection, e.g. to establish/modify/release sidelink DRBs or additional sidelink RLC bearer or PC5 Relay RLC channels, to add/modify/release sidelink carrier, to (re-)configure NR sidelink measurement and reporting, to (re-)configure sidelink CSI reference signal resources, to (re)configure CSI reporting latency bound, to (re)configure sidelink DRX, to (re-)configure the latency bound of SL Inter-UE coordination report, and to indicate the SFN-DFN offset.","paragraph_zero_based":9423},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE may initiate the sidelink RRC reconfiguration procedure and perform the operation in clause 5.8.9.1.2 on the corresponding PC5-RRC connection in following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":9424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the release of sidelink DRBs associated with the peer UE, or L2 U2U Relay UE and peer L2 U2U Remote UE in case of L2 U2U Relay operation, as specified in clause 5.8.9.1a.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the establishment of sidelink DRBs associated with the peer UE, or L2 U2U Relay UE and peer L2 U2U Remote UE in case of L2 U2U Relay operation, as specified in clause 5.8.9.1a.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the modification for the parameters included in SLRB-Config of sidelink DRBs associated with the peer UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.1a.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the release of additional sidelink RLC bearer associated with the peer UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.1a.5;","paragraph_zero_based":9428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the establishment of additional sidelink RLC bearer associated with the peer UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.1a.6;","paragraph_zero_based":9429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the modification for the parameters included in SL-RLC-BearerConfig of additional sidelink RLC bearer associated with the peer UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.1a.6;","paragraph_zero_based":9430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the release of PC5 Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N/U2U Relay UE and Remote UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.7.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9431}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fbf7a043fc056506e6e20a3ed37e381765cce58e5be8efcf357122356cb8372d","b5c6c43305fac1953c7753b39a9a9280b2f82fdcfec2816fca6db08d12540e5b","5330a905a2e2a6f69396e90c0d0e026f847589a25553e49f75b0c74c8939cd34","1fbca0e0d511c78a1b8fca42450f7dedb38742100d6fdd76273e198c943b7f14","cee959f072778dd68c94aea7fca6c12875c6e687e354d7b0470f83b9d8657a17","e94f482d5ee8e959319afdb5459579e434eee9a400bd38eda2e0806d38e948aa","36c49d68049ac9d29145ef8123612cb430f3f299d4db9e4f391769b28e6e8e8c","513db2809b71069c671ec680f603e2144b75e0e3527cb7d622bf7646f519b180","bdee77557d06d8a325bd96ac81d29988bd55c52da7d103fda944e91d6a33df06","9d61fdaa1eccfa253bd1c1182ec950131763498d81fcd393ba10aad9e6136fb7","2e10b3863ddea358f268f0ece302155a5950032cf4d16008996336e8b3e05cd9","991586cb2daebba9c64d27f41928170e256368a57a0604c659c6accef3196f0f","2de47a756a1a78b9e097217697125752fe508d2cb6ee066cfe02fa1c77501e60","e98f9d841e8a4fde748ac5f46314f374203a4b79eb6168a66e5cce560c2e3117","4f36322f9400df21c053f40cb123c19166f5e3682af7e4e10abdcbffc54c4bb7","72735419f13fa938845047a0809e2fc91641eefc2afa01869a8a8819f3278130","67489d5b1d8b9487ee23b7184a3d07d28ea548d1af4e1add40604ce879958f17","6d8dabe7ddc4a471ab59832a17882ffce483160953b64e7fcdec7f03b18e237f","56d2cec0d9d846b13b4b1bce335bcd4d71b6d9e64efe7b3472e020e736c77aa2","60333b66cd019aebbe30594d4b838428fb0514f7a024f308924892434ab08e6d","065a1ed1f0f3446d8423bc43778d3af0eca724bdc41093ac14a0afafb66bd93a","b3ba8bb22968ef74ed69eed1d2b96e53000894250cf5735665f6907e448a1ac5","d8b04e0c082b824413b7f402388dc64014877909939df388c463bd379e76731e","b4351c68158f7577703a985391f8c9c2f363ef371301870b9ff547d6239c4d74"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9408,9431],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9408"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the establishment of PC5 Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N/U2U Relay UE and Remote UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.7.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the modification for the parameters included in SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 of PC5 Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N/U2U Relay UE and Remote UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.7.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the release of sidelink carrier associated with the peer UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.1b.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the addition of sidelink carrier associated with the peer UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.1b.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the modification of sidelink carrier associated with the peer UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.1b.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the (re-)configuration of the peer UE to perform NR sidelink measurement and report.","paragraph_zero_based":9437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the (re-)configuration of the sidelink CSI reference signal resources and CSI reporting latency bound;","paragraph_zero_based":9438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the (re-)configuration of the peer UE to perform sidelink DRX;","paragraph_zero_based":9439},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the (re-)configuration of the latency bound of SL Inter-UE coordination report;","paragraph_zero_based":9440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the (re-)configuration of the local UE ID pair for L2 U2U Remote UE and its peer L2 U2U Remote UE by L2 U2U Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":9441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the response to the request in a RemoteUEInformationSidelink message for the SFN-DFN offset from the L2 U2N Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the change in the value of the SFN-DFN offset at the L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":9443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:It is up to L2 U2N Relay UE implementation to determine when the SFN-DFN offset has changed in value to a degree requiring an update to be sent to the L2 U2N Remote UE.","paragraph_zero_based":9444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In RRC_CONNECTED, the UE applies the NR sidelink communications parameters provided in RRCReconfiguration (if any). In RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, the UE applies the NR sidelink communications parameters provided in system information (if any). For other cases, UEs apply the NR sidelink communications parameters provided in SidelinkPreconfigNR (if any). When UE performs state transition between above three cases, the UE applies the NR sidelink communications parameters provided in the new state, after acquisition of the new configurations. Before acquisition of the new configurations, UE continues applying the NR sidelink communications parameters provided in the old state.","paragraph_zero_based":9445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.2Actions related to transmission of RRCReconfigurationSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":9446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of RRCReconfigurationSidelink message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":9447},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sidelink DRB that is to be released, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1.1, due to configuration by sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, by upper layers, or due to end-to-end sidelink DRB release:","paragraph_zero_based":9448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the entry included in the slrb-ConfigToReleaseList corresponding to the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":9449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sidelink DRB that is to be established or modified, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.2.1, due to receiving sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":9450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sidelink DRB is a per-hop sidelink DRB (i.e. the UE is performing non-L2 U2U relay NR sidelink communication with a peer UE):","paragraph_zero_based":9451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if a sidelink DRB is to be established:","paragraph_zero_based":9452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>assign a new logical channel identity for the logical channel to be associated with the sidelink DRB and set sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 in the SLRB-Config to include the new logical channel identity;","paragraph_zero_based":9453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the SLRB-Config included in the slrb-ConfigToAddModList, according to the received sl-RadioBearerConfig and sl-RLC-BearerConfig corresponding to the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":9454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the sidelink DRB is an end-to-end sidelink DRB (i.e. the UE is acting as a L2 U2U Remote UE, and configure peer L2 U2U Remote UE with end-to-end SDAP and PDCP):","paragraph_zero_based":9455}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f385ffce9fd3cdfa3bf24b4f689113e4c8248770c6dba621f0b330c7bb56fcc7","5a4969b856002e9a1b6451d5163c23f5b7ce8412fc2d8c041c295295a44bbd44","98522739a3216d3f95666b3e0e9f6e5ca65966ee70f499667b8bf4ddbe2b7437","77d4746a54312e214b0ef4855ad92848b735bab68b39cf7094002cc65dea89ea","f404ab285ee9b8ea5fd7af6833b474c01eeca404925ff121dd3a6dee2e348491","56532d923cca0b77afe1669a60ec3b97d50432918295af2f21a0777f4512b02d","30445162601eef4c92c455fc3fc803f9983f03457d51c2364eb9ba2846a3c6ac","7bf9c422933a282129258a89efcbb75b0a70f995507024546e252ad4fb5ea4e0","a46af171572d27bbec188cdd352bc1b52ecd2ba8c9f224618ada663e9261563b","865c9cc81b0970933ed3d59b168aec3f1c6f9b37b311d7e7dc4fafaee8978aeb","da688cba880f7cfdde31b1433e22c3f1707303baa4c238e3300475bbd45b18aa","eb1264f9050ff86e846567dba15ef0ffe00fb47b99605264e62691b31121da82","f47a435d33c064c72b72d97ef5af5d16966ecbf5b2c2bff067a4e84a5e47aeac","36d79b031408b77a4c2ad97cf1a2f2adb044873a942320aed393a6ad305a68ca","d11a6327e1a52f9b8bdf30c8aa06a4253a91d6b08f5b187aa3ded352801c89e0","799b89624d08bfc8367b21690d1c87d09bd4378a6ac6d580873eb9c595c4fabf","7ef6d6de5aa2c73cb4d2f31e4dbc18cbe2c38d371fb749f0ad299f5f8ffd7a21","c4dc30a32c8def097ec00e404151a94813d193de4c0f86d1bdaff3fc5f4fef3f","75d92550dc6444de57ef90209b09ef5db6858ac66a2057d9b1c0c2950c3361db","fff799dcb1c8ade2028d0da089a34a66c5a6ddf100d6c929420b88dd246e259f","b72ebf970cf84dc3cbc1d95d7ec9e50b48c4407bb8624ed03fd8e9ad5bcf0ed3","6c26b18cb2290c87e3300cc319a8412fc4fe639333740c3a1a146be320f475be","3e3f49fe6219a9a03a7c5e69f208e2d7ca31ddaf1510ee9e4103bf9cac1a111b","b9571880920264989ede6d25433a3943a7abfceadc80a097fd78433793da1b2e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9432,9455],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9432"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>","paragraph_zero_based":9456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"set the SLRB-Config included in the slrb-ConfigToAddModList, according to the received sl-RadioBearerConfig corresponding to the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":9457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each additional sidelink RLC bearer that is to be released, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.5.1, due to configuration by sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":9462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the entry included in the sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList corresponding to the additional sidelink RLC bearer;","paragraph_zero_based":9463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each additional sidelink RLC bearer that is to be established or modified, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.6.1, due to receiving sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":9464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if an additional sidelink RLC bearer is to be established:","paragraph_zero_based":9465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assign a new logical channel identity for the logical channel to be associated with the additional sidelink RLC bearer and set sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 in the SL-RLC-BearerConfig to include the new logical channel identity;","paragraph_zero_based":9466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the SL-RLC-BearerConfig included in the sl-RLC-BearerToAddModList, according to the received sl-RadioBearerConfig and sl-RLC-BearerConfig corresponding to the additional sidelink RLC bearer;","paragraph_zero_based":9467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each carrier that is to be released, according to clause 5.8.9.1b.1.1:","paragraph_zero_based":9468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the corresponding sidelink carrier in the sl-CarrierToReleaseList;","paragraph_zero_based":9469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each carrier that is to be added, according to clause 5.8.9.1b.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":9470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the corresponding sidelink carrier in the sl-CarrierToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":9471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-MeasConfig as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":9472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>If the frequency used for NR sidelink communication is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-ConfigCommonNR within SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":9473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE is in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":9474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-MeasConfig according to stored NR sidelink measurement configuration information for this destination;","paragraph_zero_based":9475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":9476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-MeasConfig according to stored NR sidelink measurement configuration received from SIB12;","paragraph_zero_based":9477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the sl-MeasConfig according to the sl-MeasPreConfig in SidelinkPreconfigNR;","paragraph_zero_based":9479}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha2