{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-LatencyBoundIUC-Report;","paragraph_zero_based":9480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>start timer T400 for the destination;","paragraph_zero_based":9481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-CSI-RS-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":9482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-LatencyBoundCSI-Report;","paragraph_zero_based":9483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-ResetConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":9484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Whether/how to set the parameters included in sl-LatencyBoundIUC-Report, sl-CSI-RS-Config, sl-LatencyBoundCSI-Report and sl-ResetConfig is up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":9485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5 as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":9486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>If the frequency used for NR sidelink communication is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-ConfigCommonNR within SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":9487},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE is in RRC_CONNECTED and if sl-ScheduledConfig is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":9488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5 according to stored NR sidelink DRX configuration information for this destination;","paragraph_zero_based":9489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:If UE is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or out of coverage, or in RRC_CONNECTED and sl-UE-SelectedConfig is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration, it is up to UE implementation to set the sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5.","paragraph_zero_based":9490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each PC5 Relay RLC channel that is to be released due to configuration by sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":9491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the SL-RLC-ChannelID corresponding to the PC5 Relay RLC channel in the sl-RLC-ChannelToReleaseListPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":9492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each PC5 Relay RLC channel that is to be established or modified due to receiving sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":9493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a PC5 Relay RLC channel is to be established:","paragraph_zero_based":9494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assign a new logical channel identity for the logical channel to be associated with the PC5 Relay RLC channel and set sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 in the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 to include the new logical channel identity;","paragraph_zero_based":9495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 included in the sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModListPC5 according to the received SL-RLC-ChannelConfig corresponding to the PC5 Relay RLC channel, including setting sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 to the same value of sl-RLC-ChannelID received in SL-RLC-ChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":9496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is operating as a L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the destination UE is a L2 U2N Remote UE that requested the SFN-DFN offset in a previous RemoteUEInformationSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":9498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the SFN-DFN offset has changed since a previous transmission of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message, or no previous transmission of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message has occurred since the reception of the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":9499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-SFN-DFN-Offset according to the relation between the SFN timeline of the PCell and the DFN timeline;","paragraph_zero_based":9500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Relay UE, and if the procedure is initiated to configure local ID pair to a connected L2 U2U Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the local ID pair is to be assigned or modified for an end-to-end PC5 connection, and if the per-hop PC5-RRC connection with this L2 U2U Remote UE and the per-hop PC5-RRC connection with its peer L2 U2U Remote UE are successfully established:","paragraph_zero_based":9502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include an entry in sl-LocalID-PairToAddModList, and set the fields as below:","paragraph_zero_based":9503}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3ea02a3955f9d19bd7cffe9e850641b071bbb869804fc1df79190ed187f3139e","982d21236803b83f5cb52a2b82ef8727a10ca8c12545d9b82b6b6d9597390f7d","d66f623583c2ad930953822ac75097c1862e94e7e8d4ee78a8ba8b94ec863b30","9f81e535960802c546b77182f660da7066c96ea3ebdd407175f8aa119ec3fdd4","9bc047d9efacdb91fde09bb5449fcecb5a3b5b2b889224010304fbde18270c35","1704cfaf7061254c4f56e4a3f6f81166a7ce1adcb8594cc0a38db640af32b429","7f28f2a448a6db7caf3af0536bc1af1ed7bb80eaa0f9033bf94e5d48d4db15b6","53cc87cf66af878953700ec984e43462ff45f09aa7314e8bed6615207c8fbf41","bca67cc40d1824c19de66199ff9a87b474f0e200327a7598978734c5ccd13562","9a806dde63a1be5fdd2e9cdcb07510af86f4ff32ada3b8af1b8a1f457ca2ce13","01ba789a09ef83700ffb022b6552c0ab5bc74cc68b89853e830c80fc64f94242","55ae29d9ae70e6494ebae0b2579e325486723cb1337170a267bbda37c31e0c27","dc1283d3aff42cd1a789c6ec711ffcdbba3d30786b0e8ae2ce6e0e1081648868","35814b4da23669028d69aa31633dd0f0393a0277fb9c0f5145b596a6ef241f44","f85678d2a0e3d310c8b0f0dc13c889e255dd3e508bd79356650ff4794b5c3a7f","3725ed271610bd2a13e9fa669411ae844c37c530816016b6067397c4fe8738bd","a7354eb49bb036327e1430490a131bd9fbd0f4d7f21cdc6a4b7bb603dd5063eb","3c62a46214165dd39c93c46479adac9b45ed31e969b3f45384cf5939865b85d1","aecc264d5226199fb21919b613af7166822f00f1f9aa768704fb4742dc490e40","04ac4cc8785f0b9b7d454366129c1bdb76cf501288ce16afbc2f954bded64158","4ca355b81fc63bb76497bd2c3323faad9ac00af1f2a1de9f9007b2f828335969","503d693ef47d3325897456bd16db4863ea8c443237d8f4313ed326fb62b6b9e6","117fa206e8e67bbe75a2970cb582ac41a77b757d59f4d2c20d30d4770d68444e","4ad2439f6586a7172cbd78b74fa1377d088b2877fd640a2222de5fa9ab292e41"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9480,9503],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9480"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>according to association between User Info and L2 ID as specified in TS 23.304 [65], set sl-RemoteUE-L2Identity to the source L2 ID of this L2 U2U Remote UE, and set sl-RemoteUE-LocalIdentity to include the new local UE ID assigned to this L2 U2U Remote UE, in the SL-SRAP-ConfigPC5, if needed;","paragraph_zero_based":9504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>according to association between User Info and L2 ID as specified in TS 23.304 [65], set sl-PeerRemoteUE-L2Identity to the destination L2 ID of the peer L2 U2U Remote UE, and set sl-PeerRemoteUE-LocalIdentity to include the new local UE ID assigned to the peer L2 U2U Remote UE, in the SL-SRAP-ConfigPC5, if needed;","paragraph_zero_based":9505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Remote UE (i.e. Tx UE) and is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or out of coverage, and if the procedure is initiated to add/modify the first hop PC5 Relay RLC channel of an end-to-end sidelink DRB to the connected L2 U2U Relay UE (i.e. Rx UE), based on configuration in SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":9508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Relay UE (i.e. Tx UE) and is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or out of coverage, and if the procedure is initiated to add/modify the second hop PC5 Relay RLC channel to the connected L2 U2U Remote UE (i.e. Rx UE) based on configuration in SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":9509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a PC5 Relay RLC channel is to be established:","paragraph_zero_based":9510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assign a new RLC channel ID and set sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 in the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 to include the new RLC channel ID;","paragraph_zero_based":9511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assign a new logical channel identity for the logical channel to be associated with the PC5 Relay RLC channel and set sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 in the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 to include the new logical channel identity;","paragraph_zero_based":9512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":9513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 included in the sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModListPC5 according to the SL-RLC-BearerConfig derived based on the per-hop QoS of the end-to-end SLRB according to SIB12;","paragraph_zero_based":9514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is out of coverage:","paragraph_zero_based":9515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 included in the sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModListPC5 according to the SL-RLC-BearerConfig derived based on the per-hop QoS of the SLRB according to SidelinkPreconfigNR;","paragraph_zero_based":9516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Remote UE (i.e. Tx UE) and is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or out of coverage, and the procedure is initiated to release the first hop PC5 Relay RLC channel of an end-to-end sidelink DRB to the connected L2 U2U Relay UE (i.e. Rx UE) according to clause 5.8.9.7.1; or","paragraph_zero_based":9517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Relay UE (i.e. Tx UE) and is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or out of coverage, and the procedure is initiated to release the second hop PC5 Relay RLC channel of an end-to-end sidelink DRB to the connected L2 U2U Remote UE (i.e. Rx UE) according to clause 5.8.9.7.1:","paragraph_zero_based":9518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the SL-RLC-ChannelID corresponding to the PC5 Relay RLC channel in the sl-RLC-ChannelToReleaseListPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":9519},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":9521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.3Reception of an RRCReconfigurationSidelink by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":9522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall perform the following actions upon reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink:","paragraph_zero_based":9523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-ResetConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":9524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the sidelink reset configuration procedure as specified in 5.8.9.1.10;","paragraph_zero_based":9525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the slrb-ConfigToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":9526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each entry value included in the slrb-ConfigToReleaseList that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":9527}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8ad0c7f08d6330e3d1f523051340a0a020da69fe232dd660cff417da1f67783e","e7c66a567008b3095bfdb7917eccea83f956cade80f0503149066484173e6959","f1fc7687c9d5a0ce00390520a3efa86fb0b236145b8994dc5743b73db6e15e99","23ffb638af2e43da4c42c8affa3a205e353a1021d8fca22043f112829c1fde98","6629e842139a7c8c8b545e92300739a8b3e83a2febe650e97cac20751c3ed5c8","8ab61d0f84baec32238cc97e15b5f9b75d9a37713a61cadbc109be9ebe845c74","651a9866f9a83e9e952c11a523e8d8b9ce0ff19594c52923e91708435bd4b6fd","11cbad0bc3a438bacd67c0dac91f72ba535b11c53ad3d113e68d6c699fb0bcb3","45da466a326c7e20a4052817d45fc2823b582f8f3e230ddda942ffedcd171654","ded8dab4bcab898423e12c1061ec746d36cbd104649e9a7cbbfcd0cf76a3dfd7","ecb540b011fc6e30eaadb4314cb6ee851924f3c7cef2fb77abf78ae9940f1671","7d9df92ffbc8fe1e8c4a8445fc90055a47cd600cc0761d5632446e2260047b9e","bdb91d3f80102725565e331ef658799ca6ed507bbeff1859745dd00ca54d9d43","27fe2c29e94524408bcf2b6fb837727c48ffa164d48cfafc7b0ed26570bff96f","b1580009fe3fe1eec4945a86fc1b3ad06cf1c912eaf11616ba60c8fb5c88ff09","5796244f0b02e0b30313ce4293d0b1472c3bcd440f2114e5ce73bdcea4c13251","f861a83a65c033530e5c1139ad9e993ec373ab142f87308a7e9b374b99dc42d2","b344bfd9a1e1b156095099010532eda99bf836a1e35c8cd447d8d6de0759c7e7","144137080d3fba4807ba25e58a43d1413db19c576ce7135f8beb8f2faf25561c","c531d214c46f14228a1d0ccb70e2bf0a12d7ee64a32f4eebcd515cbd013679d6","02666fb0798e73704ef1f59bf0a5bd452dd4f572b9f934e68de20b0adc4bc8ae","26ff4cf59f7a82cd908c373cf123a095c96ca33af8894ac017cc788439a1df8c","2d4c8db4e378c2118e2bf6c439d265a8306fecc7e3e3483e5a22618a0fcabecd","31e302770b6f1e907450c703d39ab9226545b5a2e9aae2c34802a34383282610"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9504,9527],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9504"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the sidelink DRB release procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the slrb-ConfigToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":9529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each slrb-PC5-ConfigIndex value included in the slrb-ConfigToAddModList that is not part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":9530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToAddList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":9531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the SL-PQFI included in sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToAddList;","paragraph_zero_based":9532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the sidelink DRB addition procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each slrb-PC5-ConfigIndex value included in the slrb-ConfigToAddModList that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":9534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToAddList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":9535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>add the SL-PQFI included in sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToAddList to the corresponding sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":9536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToReleaseList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":9537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the SL-PQFI included in sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToReleaseList from the corresponding sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":9538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sidelink DRB release conditions as described in clause 5.8.9.1a.1.1 are met:","paragraph_zero_based":9539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the sidelink DRB release procedure according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the sidelink DRB modification conditions as described in clause 5.8.9.1a.2.1 are met:","paragraph_zero_based":9541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the sidelink DRB modification procedure according to clause 5.8.9.1a.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":9543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each entry value included in the sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":9544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the additional sidelink RLC bearer release procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.5;","paragraph_zero_based":9545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-RLC-BearerToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":9546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex value included in the sl-RLC-BearerToAddModList that is not part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":9547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the additional sidelink RLC bearer addition procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.6;","paragraph_zero_based":9548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex value included in the sl-RLC-BearerToAddModList that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":9549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the additional sidelink RLC bearer modification procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.6;","paragraph_zero_based":9550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-CarrierToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":9551}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_