_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9528"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each entry value included in the sl-CarrierToReleaseList that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":9552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the sidelink carrier release procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1b.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-CarrierToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":9554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-Carrier-Id value included in the sl-CarrierToAddModList that is not part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":9555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the sidelink carrier addition procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1b.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-Carrier-Id value included in the sl-CarrierToAddModList that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":9557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the carrier modification procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1b.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-MeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":9559},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the sidelink measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.8.10;","paragraph_zero_based":9560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-CSI-RS-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":9561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the sidelink CSI-RS configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":9562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-LatencyBoundCSI-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":9563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the configured sidelink CSI report latency bound;","paragraph_zero_based":9564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-RLC-ChannelToReleaseListPC5:","paragraph_zero_based":9565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-RLC-ChannelID value included in the sl-RLC-ChannelToReleaseListPC5 that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":9566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel release procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.7.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9567},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModListPC5:","paragraph_zero_based":9568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 value included in the sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModListPC5 that is not part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":9569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.7.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 value included in the sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModListPC5 that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":9571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel modification procedure according to clause 5.8.9.7.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5; and","paragraph_zero_based":9573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE accepts the sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5:","paragraph_zero_based":9574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure lower layers to perform sidelink DRX operation according to sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5 for the associated destination as defined in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":9575}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e550f396381838dc28a387381c951ae364c39a1bb5aeb3bef912a50539f0a21e","4df7b4687726a546f8172d323c6b7ef166948b073539179ff2ddd85dc423eecf","2091d6b9a0bc6577ed8ebb9a90a475e3e120e7f3d6cd2935f527bc595608f6f8","296a0b24fcbbb379376bc1a593d1f8474fe1242db71d8e9904503dc7f6c073b2","c38eeca22049611da7e3d16dcf417b20d9166ac217aa17bb18f33bc43c71c149","04eaed33a9f70302309e47791f3abe18021ef863b06c455c66e01d74ea50c4b2","3f251214a6600375854be0cdca6a437e1e672279082af5855bd6f390a405a423","19ab8413adecc8e368c2d2348fcea4c382e7bca73b6d85438a69a43844142617","b3db1aaee9bafd4dbb2cdae1d951c8632a8b3f4fa40462cb4b1e922c26c11a73","1c066143b721524a12ed67de8fc97702c6801153252e048ce9beb2d7693954aa","925325e8eb172d2d35874d26ec444f63302dcb7faa3df354f41b39feda4c0efa","7d7e7f08f6deaea5e26dc521b3b1d9ceaf7a69be51b996492c1aba287a7c1cd0","24be6b4febb2fdf956e12ea62511671bed210d03b5f7e483e9f20ee02cd8ce80","4e3db94d76f2384752795d89cc83236fe8dfe23b55c14c96e3ce748d822abae3","e19464a726be6faa83758fb7da920f29c0b90c500d550c5cffca0f55a24166f2","d743f23ccef9e2339770f39f5c9e1d2c95dc044fa4297629c5e4505301ed1e60","e7d16740c8053f25f3e9068bab90a852410ac2fa29e3258f789396f5eaca5634","0393b2f0ed0b68b6aaf460276be141208d6eac9c5f48739f4dfa7accedad4373","865115517ba21282386a1d575848ee26e84a2ac54ed8dc61b5d71cb5bba29b70","e582647f887b884434482d45355fd7a300a6367bbc67172e895351473d41fe57","42f7f468825d82aa10ad23f5188780f710ea183fbef2a0e8e1cd3b3bc5e76d75","8eba77f696f79c694e1ec3e9a651759bb56309cf29e15f419cbb3f5057ff2529","c8c05fca429c6d998ed6838b76279da98360e1d9c84073d0719d6953c7936ce7","6a4e63f4ad09b5a7c0633fc78087b5c10edd57290307ba9297c7df2e7b32e3bb"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9552,9575],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9552"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-LatencyBoundIUC-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":9576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the configured sidelink IUC report latency bound;","paragraph_zero_based":9577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-LocalID-PairToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":9578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure SRAP entity to perform NR sidelink L2 U2U relay operation accordingly for the end-to-end PC5 connection peer L2 U2U Remote UE as defined in TS 38.351 [65];","paragraph_zero_based":9579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is unable to comply with (part of) the configuration included in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink (i.e. sidelink RRC reconfiguration failure):","paragraph_zero_based":9580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>continue using the configuration used prior to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message;","paragraph_zero_based":9581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the content of the RRCReconfigurationFailureSidelink message;","paragraph_zero_based":9582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationFailureSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9583},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-SFN-DFN-Offset:","paragraph_zero_based":9584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-SFN-DFN-Offset is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":9585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the configured SFN-DFN time offset;","paragraph_zero_based":9586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-SFN-DFN-Offset is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":9587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the received sl-SFN-DFN-Offset;","paragraph_zero_based":9588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the content of the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message;","paragraph_zero_based":9590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE rejects the sidelink DRX configuration sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5 received from the peer UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9591},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the sl-DRX-ConfigReject in the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message;","paragraph_zero_based":9592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider no sidelink DRX to be applied for the corresponding sidelink unicast communication;","paragraph_zero_based":9593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:When the same logical channel is configured with different RLC mode by another UE, the UE handles the case as sidelink RRC reconfiguration failure.","paragraph_zero_based":9595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:It is up to the UE implementation whether or not to indicate the rejection to the peer UE for a received sidelink DRX configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":9596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:When UE transmits SL-PRS in dedicated SL-PRS resource pool, the sidelink DRX configuration is not applied.","paragraph_zero_based":9597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.4Void","paragraph_zero_based":9598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.5Void","paragraph_zero_based":9599}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4bf559bf93ae0b9aeba24f24d8285433c91297023d7b3c1e668d4456c751715e","9d5d53a303c346e8a979a006b04b4ca40633912b567900f08dccf49a51f130fa","71ee8e8b983f0a176121a32cf8739841e7c273da395e4659eb444dde868f9320","dc0163f852930b643b069e94e965f5ba53c6a4ed2221ab1a84bca174d6a78806","32d11dda09fd84dc48af577458797cae212c5f99dfd1ecbdc7774181c0c3274c","02459079ba1079bce41bb481e4c48762359eb8a0fbb1304e6c48c87dd9a2123a","da1d7c8e871861d9dede425082a056f6715bb01dc43f48028755f731d1c3294c","1b01fb499e3a4570248423f7d47d6014c7ae32f1b175c5cd7c7a688fb66e5516","f0efbd0895e9a2dc9c4c39d47e6d1b0ff660e041f11a34dbc383fea4b0b85731","ba9eb20d8f6dab70f293e84626f7fbfd8b413f6b240ff62d85be5865f5b1d8be","11dfa3ec47bf65ff007adc5494ca97bff0625c1308aa73d5cc80e1c730d2dc4e","2455419e3826192d95cb9f66785b639d1ed36e0691e41efe1b9186b2cdff9adb","dc41aefceb90e7a9d6649b334c785d71a450214400ffccd0b2a1b9f183171c90","e19d41a44055218152918932224d13313d682299c8e0934db696227237aa7201","0df4f9e3edd3bf673b7f27f6482942e242f1a2fde197381bf1916e52f5c0c4f5","3a5a3a1bf7369565ea730a194695ebb29ce7639f675e0d16d4a73c4be9753ec9","a7e40cf93e6d7ee76cba59dc4edd2a407f5dc7196a965d953f8a11fb304943ff","3a32831d3eb8da4b66011d30c6d0c432eadab9e4626f155c3cdd079e65c24f99","767e8ae2b945da793b90acd0f6d042f4102a9e5008e68d3827a40703402e034e","2f1064a8a8c7349056e7e3dbc6ca28764c5252951a78cac9d371b42f696fcf98","2031777278e6b8af119fac18398eef9475cf1c079468bfd2a43402e199b15f1d","29faae9f9c2f955cc1b3029d2851569483179302d0b40843317bf7905dbf58fe","b77b0923624b124f3441b92c470b51971baef69312bb45609fe8da6c2d77abb9","0f67a1864fa83af9a549ded85f62fe3628891791613105a534119c5827ccc1cd"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9576,9599],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9576"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.6Void","paragraph_zero_based":9600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.7Void","paragraph_zero_based":9601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.8Reception of an RRCReconfigurationFailureSidelink by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":9602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall perform the following actions upon reception of the RRCReconfigurationFailureSidelink:","paragraph_zero_based":9603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T400 for the destination, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":9604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>continue using the configuration used prior to corresponding RRCReconfigurationSidelink message;","paragraph_zero_based":9605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if UE is in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":9606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the sidelink UE information for NR sidelink communication procedure, as specified in 5.8.3.3 or clause 5.10.15 in TS 36.331 [10];","paragraph_zero_based":9607},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.9Reception of an RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":9608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall perform the following actions upon reception of the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink:","paragraph_zero_based":9609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T400 for the destination, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":9610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the configurations in the corresponding RRCReconfigurationSidelink message to be applied.","paragraph_zero_based":9611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message includes the sl-DRX-ConfigReject:","paragraph_zero_based":9612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider no sidelink DRX to be applied for the corresponding sidelink unicast communication.","paragraph_zero_based":9613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.10Sidelink reset configuration","paragraph_zero_based":9614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9615},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release/clear current sidelink radio configuration of this destination received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink;","paragraph_zero_based":9616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the sidelink DRBs of this destination, in according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the additional sidelink RLC bearer of this destination, if configured, in according to clause 5.8.9.1a.5;","paragraph_zero_based":9618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>reset the sidelink specific MAC of this destination, except for end-to-end PC5 connection in L2 U2U Relay operation.","paragraph_zero_based":9619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Sidelink radio configuration is not just the resource configuration but may include other configurations included in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message except the sidelink DRBs of this destination.","paragraph_zero_based":9620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:After the sidelink DRB release procedure, UE may perform the sidelink DRB addition according to the current sidelink configuration of this destination, received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12 and SidelinkPreconfigNR, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.2.","paragraph_zero_based":9621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1aSidelink radio bearer management","paragraph_zero_based":9622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.1Sidelink DRB release","paragraph_zero_based":9623}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["20beb0341f5b20e60ff84d035e460380dbd26438790e19694a8fd956a815da96","163b784aa76493c5e1a0a35f38232dd996768533752328ec0b23f21cfa6c6383","84c86f38146f4eeb57326134b7d9966b28c0d01a53460e2d9f5e41fd7876e9bc","c5f805934b0d7072b7d7132f5d311d2c8e0c78b2f290abebf56e48e8f9051896","05324425d3d5502404779aadc3c8a537b9b67d9b34203d8aae466d6764728798","c19bdc72fbd12494e7bb67d9e75a5f369be3501cc2107aa6bf62dc3f6c5ed23d","626bdd20840677746054b09efcd8410b9a8b7d8f679f541de32cdc26e8043173","79fba4f32332a2505d8e89037f5544fa0ca31576cacc2dbed3df204e8f521e48","cda9cb408a797cce2544d752b24e401cc1f92c55c0054aa6b5c7dd04d238bc00","6b6ffb52af9e1bb0a4536c411ba2ba01747d3aa0e610a1927d24baa7df4af5d8","2a46a1317d99af960c696bf1724f7d1143753e55adfce0f70ecf7e076ea936b2","b0ae4e95339a6bb09894f98438a86b7489deafd24a89b30ce1f43b04401dfa46","a00501105af5eace14f5d0b775f98ddc4534ac94b634d9a30494e3ec59c4be47","75233cdbae403390908eefff2fa9f0e124f08760a87844bbdde83e3c0f79fa68","8fe3dea8e51699bc271800150349b8e2baf44ade2424a94d751238f1cd9feeb6","a2d261aff51f4f9d3ed5b341d3f7fafad1b0c2cb47558f38c89b4d15a59d7c1a","0990c5e8390d9fa105196b22c28c7f1f7abdc30d03fd44a0d6f6f92ee3c96da1","350c668c10dc1ffbee9472100d5fbad38c71c276efb8204ac06e6105c019f517","492389db90abcb14341acf3eab3ec3cbf24d11a1628c67209559b30d7eb78895","47fdc39b4b352e5c0e66049c3f26ad0a108fa94b4b523a3515f345269703f4fd","b8950737df8a2bd1bad80195161f7490651c0c390648a3469f53802422b7a07d","8f51bd8743c6f56cd4cabe1403a172085803212da79d832dea30355717ffeba0","de61f4e5c7e61ca0ff67bc72fdec71d3af7549bc4e53c3f792bbe38a6fb2cf85","9052c7e6ffe0fcb5fb7cbc4e565eb4a210e7cadbe79bafdfad08fb4a9873c94c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9600,9623],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9600"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.1.1Sidelink DRB release conditions","paragraph_zero_based":9624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For NR sidelink communication, a sidelink DRB release is initiated in the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":9625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast, broadcast and unicast, if slrb-Uu-ConfigIndex (if any) of the sidelink DRB is included in sl-RadioBearerToReleaseList in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":9626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast, if no sidelink QoS flow with data indicated by upper layers is mapped to the sidelink DRB for transmission, which is (re)configured by receiving SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":9627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast, broadcast and unicast, if SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex (if any) of the sidelink DRB is included in sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList/sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseListSizeExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":9628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if no sidelink QoS flow with data indicated by upper layers is mapped to the sidelink DRB for transmission, which is (re)configured by receiving SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR, and if no sidelink QoS flow mapped to the sidelink DRB, which is (re)configured by receiving RRCReconfigurationSidelink, has data; or","paragraph_zero_based":9629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if SLRB-PC5-ConfigIndex (if any) of the sidelink DRB is included in slrb-ConfigToReleaseList in RRCReconfigurationSidelink or if sl-ResetConfig is included in RRCReconfigurationSidelink; or","paragraph_zero_based":9630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, when the corresponding PC5-RRC connection is released due to sidelink RLF being detected, according to clause 5.8.9.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":9631},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, when the corresponding PC5-RRC connection is released due to upper layer request according to clause 5.8.9.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":9632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for L2 U2U relay operation, when the corresponding end-to-end PC5 connection failure/release is detected according to clause 5.8.9.3a, or 5.8.9.3b; or","paragraph_zero_based":9633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for L2 U2U relay operation, if the end-to-end sidelink DRB is removed from source L2 U2U Remote UE in UEInformationRequest message when the UE is acting as L2 U2U Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":9634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.1.2Sidelink DRB release operations","paragraph_zero_based":9635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each sidelink DRB, whose sidelink DRB release conditions are met as in clause 5.8.9.1a.1.1, the UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink communication shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast; or","paragraph_zero_based":9637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the sidelink DRB release was triggered after the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":9638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the sidelink DRB release was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or indicated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":9639},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity for NR sidelink communication associated with the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":9640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SDAP entity for NR sidelink communication associated with this sidelink DRB is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":9641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the release of the sidelink DRB to the SDAP entity associated with this sidelink DRB (TS 37.324 [24], clause 5.3.3);","paragraph_zero_based":9642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release SDAP entities for NR sidelink communication, if any, that have no associated sidelink DRB as specified in TS 37.324 [24] clause 5.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast; or","paragraph_zero_based":9644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the sidelink DRB release was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":9645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-RLC-BearerConfigIndex included in the received sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList/sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseListSizeExt that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":9646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity and the corresponding logical channel for NR sidelink communication, associated with the sl-RLC-BearerConfigIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":9647}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9fc438bc68a9e77b73960b1049026730ea39b864d2d62e9b22b3a05f7d6ca8c1","60d0e167716c97330c410b816e2924fa904c28b58855f443ae808abeab91ee5f","33332ee7893b1d3eb948c92ca07be4a0fe32634a26c48983ba64e034ccaddf31","a151adbc0cdd719524a036019c558c4298c7455daf26a64bfc45c6309d0ea40f","12067bd0fdf0586fde087fbd22dfadf43ce1326949c7a346f1f2cf6402c4eb5e","40eb885174910782fd73209dba35144267b4ef6e76737be60037db20d6ecfede","6a553a0999a223855088887095a3275323a02359012f2b22c609a4904af4e3d7","b1b9140c48bf39f8b2b847d68526c35ed386aa18f9f54711df7f2f6e7e0f6b32","2c8b7a2ccfea8ebf4b59a11e8d68b783d074a81a6b14bcb49fd9988330c68034","6ecd3e6f97fdb228ad446961d9c8ba4b2e6c3afd013ff9f7984cffa8272141aa","6b9ae112d5d45678c51ad49aea82db5791a3f6f759b0d086f842b967eee0ba61","3e77241b2590e99a06ca9171c2a201ef08422d2c0cd8ad7028d585da0e0e30e6","f7dce6574e63e29d9e7884bef4e54551b812167d30ed191cc8beda23324768d5","9296d8d011549db7e2b47398340d44b2d533c47ae04041231699dea71ef38e82","814aaf43f91c8fd3b805087909c1ab11039182ad0c67e5956d5ba0e85d6aac97","e20adfcd9dd0910a1a168ff576e814ae695ded60483a31c06438ffe9116e1e21","51b05b30809cc9a12cf372de92e6d0390e9f2339b6093528cdffcbe1bae85741","941084e2592f4f4b1d8d1c04390f579463e75f6322470ffd66e2f58075112d13","4e6afda7316394250e9f4e7cbe4fbdb08d59eb01e3fb811eab45c1962954b499","558f68a8c0e9032f1764fe908b932b81fbc519f11319fc3f9d84104c53971b4a","1ec8237ce21e192c00b7db0e4bd7b493b677e142354d1fef161c028ed33debfc","21c629f4e7ea897731a1b6d4b6d6cbf4bebb8b448628b2d909ffe768be56f6a7","fff633d2c870a11c9bebab4f82304a0558e4f0d86922ad6533c63e52d3cb74d1","ab675c5094a5998012ffe674272f6809a43483641e4c905851088e1505bf0756"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9624,9647],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9624"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the sidelink DRB release was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":9648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the sidelink DRB release was triggered due to the configuration received within the SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or indicated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":9649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the RLC entity and the corresponding logical channel for NR sidelink communication associated with the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":9650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the sidelink UE information procedure in clause 5.8.3 for unicast if needed.","paragraph_zero_based":9651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the sidelink radio link failure is detected for a specific destination","paragraph_zero_based":9652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":":","paragraph_zero_based":9653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of the sidelink DRB for the specific destination;","paragraph_zero_based":9654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> if the UE is acting as a L2 U2U Remote UE, and if the end-to-end sidelink DRB release is triggered by end-to-end PC5 connection failure due to per-hop PC5 link failure, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3a:","paragraph_zero_based":9655},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity(ies) of the end-to-end sidelink DRB(s) for the specific end-to-end PC5 connection;","paragraph_zero_based":9656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the sidelink DRB is an end-to-end sidelink DRB in L2 U2U relay operation:","paragraph_zero_based":9657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel release according to 5.8.9.7.1, if there is no other end-to-end sidelink DRB(s) associated with this RLC channel and the PC5 Relay RLC channel is not released yet;","paragraph_zero_based":9658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as a source L2 U2U Remote or L2 U2U Relay UE and is in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":9659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the SRAP entity for the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":9660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is acting as a source L2 U2U Remote UE or L2 U2U Relay and is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, or","paragraph_zero_based":9661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":" is out of coverage:","paragraph_zero_based":9663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the mapping between the end-to-end sidelink DRB and the egress PC5 relay RLC channel, and reconfigure the SRAP entity; ","paragraph_zero_based":9664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.2Sidelink DRB addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":9665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.2.1Sidelink DRB addition/modification conditions","paragraph_zero_based":9666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For NR sidelink communication, a sidelink DRB addition is initiated only in the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":9667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any sidelink QoS flow is (re)configured by sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR and is to be mapped to one sidelink DRB, which is not established; or","paragraph_zero_based":9668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any sidelink QoS flow is (re)configured by RRCReconfigurationSidelink and is to be mapped to a sidelink DRB, which is not established;","paragraph_zero_based":9669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any sidelink QoS flow is (re)configured by source L2 U2U Remote UE and is mapped to a end-to-end sidelink DRB for transmission when the UE is acting as L2 U2U Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The above conditions also apply to L2 U2U Remote UE for end-to-end sidelink DRB addition. For L2 U2U Relay UE, an end-to-end sidelink sidelink DRB addition is initiated only in the case it receives new end-to-end sidelink sidelink DRB information from the source L2 U2U Remote UE as in clause 5.8.9.11.3.","paragraph_zero_based":9671}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7d2c902c1688e218357c6374d67b88d5e7ed4b688a24874b3e02880a458f7df9","8abe97f9042bcf010a8f24e04f336d77cc1dee8a5790c6fddf1a45a171379238","00e419b350ee6b6cb86cec5472c4334c11250fde445aec55d54eb9bd69c90dfe","7df4e8a6b82fd5936af93e1578c3760c064e7a4cae15e9a7eb2459b150498536","563aa7c069fb001a9d08722ebf0435f112225f4009340359f72cca2148d006ca","0cb005681b1de36ecbbe7d9b7315fd86eff3347e4fdfdce790d3be65513534a0","530706c7612759363d875f0b76d52793b09400379d3a2ddecc13ca43def1e42f","459f0faa3bd4a9702439dc52a0f048d7cf79a01eade4cba7b624ccf0845e8c34","9fe9a2e9c765172851975c3c40b1ca63da55eaec2e1f4c80cd83bddb94d78f6a","a0d17069965318f848f20952d3f7d1c26e3de8725f1dcc50398d5d411f848858","d2a2d463e818290417e28c3cf9bfe86e82a9bc28ec375d1b06fa29ac3a85af33","b1d9d034b4bd6bf0e413b21e789c904ca422a1f9b7b342a2f16fed97dd006572","9ca2c736c61aeccd260eab6646ea2b9f5cde9b64c2ff8680c8f2e5f3c533438a","9a0aa8a3816724af06c64e88f812e83903b299aa45a9a3600faa2a30ecd39b76","de0f4b59751d752e5fe455951f922013700d2b1ff4d72231f62e70affcd66ea8","eeae984f0152fbdd0ef0f31733298cac234d680c02faa8c6e6b5ce0fa85e8841","485607b90cbae3e6aae097f60b644fe04a4d4e070bf1fb9a705f4762d3e922d5","3fd8ceadd88464ccb633dd0760c07a5a14e8d1e1b0d939538c5dfce83c9c70bc","9224898e331ce58e71d1d2cf51e81fbb1066bf0444f5b07dd6fef4fb030be1b4","e5a2c3d6cd55a92734fe4dadc33af2f0df3cd89b26933c7b08668565fa39ff9a","931d0b6d792601502bff78bbed3f34ff3cdefd5bcd75718e8885f176aba2302c","9d61d9cdd9124cccbd9c078081a062b51775919ab4ab2c79459bad12f242aff0","66c961adb81cf9e4d24cf5a72f811b61e773ed74ec7e66b56606f25a7d6f6363","ac25d5ceeb1f6df87072c2e0687dd90f33da0c7d14e942beae4e11a8b9866bb2"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9648,9671],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9648"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For NR sidelink communication, a sidelink DRB modification is initiated only in the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":9672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any of the sidelink DRB related parameters is changed by sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or RRCReconfigurationSidelink for one sidelink DRB, which is established;","paragraph_zero_based":9673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The above conditions also apply to L2 U2U Remote UE for end-to-end sidelink DRB modification. For L2 U2U Relay UE, an end-to-end sidelink sidelink DRB modification is initiated only in the case it receives updated end-to-end sidelink sidelink DRB information from the source L2 U2U Remote UE as in clause 5.8.9.11.3.","paragraph_zero_based":9674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.2.2Sidelink DRB addition/modification operations","paragraph_zero_based":9675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the sidelink DRB, whose sidelink DRB addition conditions are met as in clause 5.8.9.1a.2.1, the UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink communication shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast; or","paragraph_zero_based":9677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the sidelink DRB addition was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":9678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the sidelink DRB addition was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or indicated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":9679},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if an SDAP entity for NR sidelink communication associated with the destination and the cast type of the sidelink DRB does not exist:","paragraph_zero_based":9680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish an SDAP entity for NR sidelink communication as specified in TS 37.324 [24] clause 5.1.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>(re)configure the SDAP entity in accordance with the sl-SDAP-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-SDAP-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, associated with the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":9682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish a PDCP entity for NR sidelink communication and configure it in accordance with the sl-PDCP-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-PDCP-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, associated with the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":9683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for a per-hop sidelink DRB (i.e. the UE is performing non-L2 U2U relay NR sidelink communication with a peer UE):","paragraph_zero_based":9684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish a RLC entity for NR sidelink communication and configure it in accordance with the sl-RLC-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-RLC-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, associated with sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":9685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if this procedure was due to the reception of a RRCReconfigurationSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":9686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance with the sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink associated with the sidelink DRB, and perform the sidelink UE information procedure in clause 5.8.3 for unicast if needed;","paragraph_zero_based":9687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if this procedure was due to the reception of a RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":9688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the MAC entity with a logical channel associated with the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig received in the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR;","paragraph_zero_based":9689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e. for groupcast/broadcast):","paragraph_zero_based":9690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the MAC entity with a logical channel associated with the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig received in the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR and assign a new LCID to this logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":9691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for an end-to-end sidelink DRB (i.e. the UE is acting as L2 U2U Remote UE or L2 U2U Relay UE):","paragraph_zero_based":9692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":9693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>(re)configure the SRAP entity for the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, received from RRCReconfiguration;","paragraph_zero_based":9694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, or out of coverage:","paragraph_zero_based":9695}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e3c0108ef521ff63bcbd16b98a7000ecc7a00b617776ef4958582a2cc76a2b7a","2a448575b49b8c914ff3520d808ca6abe72c11c832885b30baff6d3d6dcb08bc","1df263064aaa6b36593b8b0b83edf77a939bffccb8e69e890f8b641a25bcb0fd","9560a42971edba01aeb9c25480128c109d0b2fedb14394a60078d9fddb5a0f46","7bbb993afb0b38b2502f412be77405bb9e764d02758c282537567fa74138e4c2","2e39de0ff6fe39077ac5967930c73205f70c1ded7e626fb2d1a0fb9f9b673b91","bf29b0cb003d5dd3b4e24dde08126212cbd83bd3b18866a0eb65571be7059789","3d90fc6e95dca39ddecfd943bda49c71d1ac9f3e3fb506b3dd7b17be79ff4dde","29e2bd9bb6695633566493bb339471eeca306fa683c16a609827abedbb636640","49e7abb412aed29737cf3580d1c1934c2da517969a7c3b934e140ef25401b773","906208043da827650416922a0afe15138f58b43727c81e22643066314a81f553","e3b7e5637706a25c1b06d8cb76f62358d5bd4349861010b5891b6c3ccf126ceb","c12394eeb559002080ee518c8292c5a90855760a3c62f2672e3e4e3f2dd7a19e","5dcf2dff54b6723e84590b17d369f8732dce995d0e7a4d75a0f3b5944841d234","84eab93b78cfb5bf32e635a68416ab339ce75d8682c0941e94ee012d6b327d5c","f3b4ec060fa3e466ef018f65d6cd3c501799c9be8804ab9b32105d86d3e73ff1","2675730eb44a71c8d3623855109e232e6d8a88a4b51477cdeb6ed55fd2670dd0","b451f05824026202c88b109718e3f86c5fab9e489b90f89845e1840fb5695ba3","34e684886a012d79f89fcac5e6495d0227ff7424e38030e9ffdb046c16724717","9e6b3768282eedb8e0f9617a39b6427ef667087786fb6252590915caee3b9002","9bed41376a05a486bb6e52bd52c2793d7743dc270246ecf62224579f0c614ece","df1b2a019e52de1596a80ea2274d81aaeeacce6c1e1cb23977e8b875f909075c","f1627145567dc33529bcd53d68f871de0066357165fa9fe4e67cba72447d5f6e","683bed95bf5d5c73f3eb3b943c31be2fecf1ac0eaf0790e81683622a7b75694e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9672,9695],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9672"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification as specified in clause 5.8.9.7.2 if needed, according to the derived PC5 RLC channel configuration as described in clause 5.8.9.11;","paragraph_zero_based":9696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the PC5 RLC channel appling the derived PC5 RLC channel configuration as the egress PC5 Relay RLC channel; ","paragraph_zero_based":9697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the egress PC5 Relay RLC channel for this end-to-end sidelink DRB to SRAP;","paragraph_zero_based":9698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:When a sidelink DRB addition is due to the configuration by RRCReconfigurationSidelink, it is up to UE implementation to select the sidelink DRB configuration as necessary transmitting parameters for the sidelink DRB, from the received sl-ConfigDedicatedNR (if in RRC_CONNECTED), SIB12 (if in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE), SidelinkPreconfigNR (if out of coverage) with the same RLC mode as the one configured in RRCReconfigurationSidelink.","paragraph_zero_based":9702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the sidelink DRB, whose sidelink DRB modification conditions are met as in clause 5.8.9.1a.2.1, the UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink communication shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast; or","paragraph_zero_based":9704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the sidelink DRB modification was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":9705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the sidelink DRB modification was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":9706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the SDAP entity of the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-SDAP-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-SDAP-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":9707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the PDCP entity of the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-PDCP-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-PDCP-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":9708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the RLC entity of the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-RLC-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-RLC-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":9709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the logical channel of the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":9710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for an end-to-end sidelink DRB (i.e. the UE is acting as L2 U2U Remote UE or L2 U2U Relay UE):","paragraph_zero_based":9711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":9712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the SRAP entity for the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":9713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, or out of coverage:","paragraph_zero_based":9714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the derived PC5 RLC channel configuration of this end-to-end sidelink DRB as described in clause 5.8.9.11 is changed: ","paragraph_zero_based":9717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> if there is no other end-to-end sidelink DRB(s) associated with this RLC channel:","paragraph_zero_based":9718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel release as specified in 5.8.9.7.1; ","paragraph_zero_based":9719}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0d4482e5f05b2c211dc860490bb1a186eef7a800029bfe4ebf413c6287a54aa3","1ce00ee60047e26572da107a75c52c23f6bb27384bb40cd5a91600c56b7dbb94","c975ebd8813ed92c133cd39d4cb8b20ca04b870b3cfbc1226e0feed32263a9bd","735dd0c8efdd8b897c08ed262f0e2a9c0cc887cfe81d4cb15be3cdcec3751838","65f68976d53db902b41814672ec66ebf2298d9a785393b3c8fe244d6bfb0178c","70ae355f43a708fae17936ba38fa184b6c6b90c49417f1b383892ae6940afa64","4ed880bbb16d30cdc31a1e66900a6a9be956637203cb37e7fb17b4803253dbaf","01692da3fd38d435cea00dca0c595b5d4f6179ce3c0b4f9be42f7dbb3ab428c5","5c57f28a18aa639d27116bce49ecc80b2e01baad0fbc8c6c2a52c1ba967edc6a","202461cdfe0e9c396bb3a803acf87b0d959d0574096ac55485a584508111e54d","bff3abcd64d053d58fe86fdf6702ce7cc7fc42c9b2c913f81031aa9edbeb80a7","0221d0d3b6ee2312e71b152762f363d8c977b58fdd012f2dbf06693af689764d","26f1f92278da6fa74689f57a92231e0ec5f3d1330bbd501ffa4d911f2271ac74","7ea20534071871ae8fdd33e7e3ac19401adda7554a2ebbb63ee481f2f7db6938","f82bce719a237ee128037a7d78ecfa003b6ceb82febd3df2b0aa2963ab40d574","ae04de78584305a229ff3cf86f8b37a4d7b1a28bb4d1cbd9c27703eb341fce57","4b438458547e51eb9a00aad664531274128f1fd10e578d853c1aa1ad1de597f0","ab618d23791afda6d94e01fe02157537124c676aece2e5cd731c9aaf139c704f","fb1d3df7c0d5ed6803e64f190e9d009845276165f58e90618c4e03e8e4e3fbdb","1527d23484bc0dbeab2079a6c0ccc07b567f4052ebcdd6f58e64fd945dde6d75","d9d1c274a6b3b849daa9bccb38e40977ac191e6c85f5ec935960e6b0af0eb669","0d31ade900a81c92afa30e5ee371b638497d601ea489b8c5cb74b258a4b7b99a","3912df80d003312523a02eaee127fb2b1cac8f2b4e17c88aa570f56ca8691232","0efd8efaa61d62895e19697eaafabdc1aa38372cb22fe0636d3caea3b4f8443c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9696,9719],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9696"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> else:","paragraph_zero_based":9720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification as specified in 5.8.9.7.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the PC5 RLC channel applying the PC5 RLC channel configuration as the egress PC5 relay RLC channel;","paragraph_zero_based":9722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>reconfigure the SRAP entity with the the egress PC5 relay RLC channel for the end-to-end sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":9723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.3Sidelink SRB release","paragraph_zero_based":9724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if a PC5-RRC connection release for a specific destination is requested by upper layers or AS layer; or","paragraph_zero_based":9726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the sidelink radio link failure is detected for a specific destination:","paragraph_zero_based":9727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of the sidelink SRB for PC5-RRC message of the specific destination;","paragraph_zero_based":9728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the PC5-RRC connection is released for the destination.","paragraph_zero_based":9729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if PC5-S transmission for a specific destination is terminated in upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":9730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of the sidelink SRB(s) for PC5-S message of the specific destination if any;","paragraph_zero_based":9731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if discovery transmission for a specific destination is terminated in upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":9732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of the sidelink SRB4 for discovery message of the specific destination;","paragraph_zero_based":9733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if an end-to-end PC5-RRC connection release/failure is detected:","paragraph_zero_based":9734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting L2 U2U Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the PDCP entity of the end-to-end sidelink SRB for the end-to-end PC5 connection;","paragraph_zero_based":9736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the association between the end-to-end sidelink SRB and the egress PC5 RLC channel, and reconfigure SRAP configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":9737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.4Sidelink SRB addition","paragraph_zero_based":9738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of PC5-S message for a specific destination is requested by upper layers for sidelink SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":9740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of a sidelink SRB for PC5-S message if needed, as specified in clause 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":9741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if in coverage on the frequency used for the NR sidelink communication as defined in TS 38.304 [20]:","paragraph_zero_based":9742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the allowed carrier for the RLC bearer of the SRB before the reception of initial RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message as specified in subclause 5.8.9.1.9, as indicated in sl-FreqInfoList, to lower layer;","paragraph_zero_based":9743}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9109f5c7ca8159ebdbb06a124c772d855285ede946ab40cf5daed4002ee87d2e","1e3f5f51c5a6f84dfd0dda5e2d32925866266fd3dfaa745cdb81ecbbe7e2dca9","b49c8f92b5304db64282427759cb1db2209c706f84c3a020c19a0da1c9727f1f","cc9122bb9ffe13ba3f87b7877cc8f2edd59c5939366fd8bcbf9f964857f7e1ad","142877f40e9ddc16afc8f64e3f5ac6d371f373ac4622513ef2ca9273091d2b1f","983e89ff211a7e8ef6895f6928dd4e54a81c52e9d59b4f0bf05731782958a6b3","fa3ac2cb5c17ff9e02da811e17b3f88db48b2d287ee6cb672cbe471af5b37208","289d4a4a724df3993fabf3c7061005179c54c9a6e4b66236ecce99139d34f230","d2d6f9b2dc4a30962e3517ed2de55abdfe50155e22cd2e8d8cb3893352787cf9","2eb91476f1512873d04f1d96742571857761db5349584a76fc4c3b426a2bb489","0444c0b96cbe8d28c04fb3e46cf0719ab74c39a644ac0d3682d85106cd5f7f70","47bb12057c95d88f213a4782ff2b35c4806be9a4adf415509354e02e784ab352","b3fbf9a25e3ed4ec5e8ceab1cc48533a515c56e6974ac7d7f0a4c5d31f226575","ed22a0849309a68504a8f3e32f445cf17416120704578b625cedd85df3549039","d73f1edd44ba0a63f0e538804fcbc046d73e05c48e8515f3e546e595002751ee","c0e765b903da1bb1a85370da92b4eae56abd7e0f9cd81a3176d7ed8568529a35","e2f454a09ba59afb86ce0774545cebdf0a83c64ff125b98641f7a7961a7df591","2601eb3d8c372686a97640be5c926de617bfbd8b672270f6e21d2b3312a48d28","f2146e07cf8168d4ebd74ee797e0d3b23d9ce82e625d30bcc8c4fcafc40e46d4","4dd5e4d487fef7c57d0cf87f0ce02cab5b26bc77537eabf0e21d3fa213f69562","1bd87014e1e60ec0da40d02635538204cc611963352c8d5c7135c50c0ed2cc0d","e6fb74d4e15bd15282d13bd660ad6ccbac09fe68a586eeaa8b96423a180ce1c4","cadd677810266bb3872c1cbfe13c234b36296236a1111ecc685ad76be9dc126e","60abd6960c458d4029144da3cb20e4c1a9b2bb6e8ad9f1d35f5f3d6be8152f6d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9720,9743],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9720"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the allowed carrier for the RLC bearer of the SRB before the reception of initial RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message as specified in subclause 5.8.9.1.9, as indicated in sl-PreconfigFreqInfoList, to lower layer;","paragraph_zero_based":9745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of discovery message for a specific destination is requested by upper layers for sidelink SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":9746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of a sidelink SRB4 for discovery message, as specified in clause 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":9747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if a PC5-RRC connection establishment for a specific destination is indicated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":9748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of a sidelink SRB for PC5-RRC message of the specific destination if needed, as specified in clause 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":9749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the PC5-RRC connection is established for the destination;","paragraph_zero_based":9750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for end-to-end SRB1/2/3:","paragraph_zero_based":9751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting L2 U2U Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the SL-U2U-RLC as specified in clause 9.1.1.4 as the egress PC5 relay RLC channel;","paragraph_zero_based":9753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>associate this end-to-end sidelink SRB with the SL-U2U-RLC and configure the mapping between the end-to-end sidelink SRB and the egress PC5 relay RLC channel to SRAP.","paragraph_zero_based":9754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.5Additional Sidelink RLC Bearer release","paragraph_zero_based":9755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.5.1Additional Sidelink RLC Bearer release conditions","paragraph_zero_based":9756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For NR sidelink communication, additional sidelink RLC bearer release is initiated in the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":9757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for sidelink DRB, the release conditions are met as in clause 5.8.9.1a.1.1 for the associated sidelink DRB; or","paragraph_zero_based":9758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for sidelink SRB, the release conditions are met as in clause 5.8.9.1a.3 for the associated sidelink SRB; or","paragraph_zero_based":9759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for sidelink DRB, if SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex (if any) of the sidelink DRB is included in sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList in RRCReconfigurationSidelink; or","paragraph_zero_based":9760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for sidelink DRB, if SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex (if any) of the additional Sidelink RLC Bearer is included in sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseListSizeExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR;","paragraph_zero_based":9761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.5.2Additional Sidelink RLC Bearer release operation","paragraph_zero_based":9762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast; or","paragraph_zero_based":9764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the additional sidelink RLC bearer release was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":9765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-RLC-BearerConfigIndex included in the received sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseListSizeExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":9766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity and the corresponding logical channel of the additional sidelink RLC bearer for NR sidelink communication, associated with the sl-RLC-BearerConfigIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":9767}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e276c466733f1fc392200f65d20a036965e6b466839a9a566f7b8b749cf4f62e","a05984f2719b5bb9bc45456666ccdfe5397a5d7c72005e577d3dc286f1128a89","d1bba4c1c8d79e51f5b6d12e6ef115b9031c2eaf7fb64342fe5177aeae7366b8","d4eadd8f1c33e54db372fc9c7e6366e748295c126eb4c27059858cc7963283e0","91d2457ebe804a1cbdc7d4cb04cfd2d0093d5d8b09215fbe04587c7a0896b1b5","018daaae4d5dd3fb56d9b5fba42459269b017b967eb6e795fec2dbb9577e6436","3e5b7488d1cfa8cff2d25a586611bdd69c0b7e9236d716b17cce943a1a3d776a","4b83a8aad43e64d925d05fa474648cdeb30cc78dffd2d9102cf61e6acb339788","ba720c2eb731dd599ca25d0589764551d0c16938fdf3d8584b273167b248efb4","7b79d5088d6581e88af83cfc951b47f5b84db900facc836ff73f3e6969f4f54b","725710ace424f0329a5f873ebb9c5eff58c47cf632f4dc32da3de1b401a4cfb5","1bf5453fc167850f8eed8d273a2355043f777e8a4ea96d93deaed969830d81c1","4686f1be67ee9012d9ab88da690549503b5098141f38a34b7d6722980f973bda","eafc543ddf6539786520005fde286ada5bfcb6afc0d0b8459b893a4089d3332d","7dc8619fb6035437eeddaad93339a7448f9a8c4d84701a2577ec79ebce5e27e4","cd968d0f6d67d00000493763b1835ad55eba1397655fa5b86a356f2f09acc1e6","fe8649fcf9e1afbbe1050036956483dc84e34628abe126afa2ec7afdf6aedffe","eef1b828319c963b807e7d659b035e7ef72aa73ed37d5acbb29ba431b3656135","f156fab732f1cd6d08c7c9ba58cf2da9f7b5f768cd42c86cbda8442ee3e5728f","6ddaed3e8c06d5d32a560a228953006cb5a16efda7d66564d1bff6097b77ea46","32ad9ce9962b4a371f07b40a00521a0fa85a029005ac4aaacf7e434f70163177","8a8f3d3ce6fa2053da516f3cc56a92e4d6089b189b6258f16f281a3c55013822","32164e6eca24a983ffbe87f75b7ae31c670e2643c2110d3afbad3575b29e7870","eacd5ea39e37c3c60fbe745a683cf00e5b93fd399f4cbebc42b86c31c43a7e60"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9744,9767],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9744"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the additional sidelink RLC bearer release was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":9768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex included in received sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList in RRCReconfigurationSidelink that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":9769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity and the corresponding logical channel of the additional sidelink RLC bearer for NR sidelink communication associated with the SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex;","paragraph_zero_based":9770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the additional sidelink RLC bearer release was triggered due to the configuration received within the SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or indicated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":9771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex included in transmitted sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList in RRCReconfigurationSidelink that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":9772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity and the corresponding logical channel of the additional sidelink RLC bearer for NR sidelink communication associated with the SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex;","paragraph_zero_based":9773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.6Additional Sidelink RLC Bearer addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":9774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.6.1Additional Sidelink RLC Bearer addition/modification conditions","paragraph_zero_based":9775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For NR sidelink communication, additional sidelink RLC bearer addition is initiated only in the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":9776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, for sidelink DRB, if SL-RLC-BearerConfig is received in sl-RLC-BearerToAddModList in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink for a slrb-PC5-ConfigIndex; or","paragraph_zero_based":9777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast, for sidelink DRB, if SL-RLC-BearerConfig is received in sl-RLC-BearerToAddModListSizeExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR for a sl-ServedRadioBearer; or","paragraph_zero_based":9778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, for sidelink DRB, if SL-RLC-BearerConfig is received in sl-RLC-BearerToAddModListSizeExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR for a sl-ServedRadioBearer; or","paragraph_zero_based":9779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast, for sidelink DRB, if SL-RLC-BearerConfig is received in sl-RLC-BearerConfigListSizeExt in SIB12 or in SidelinkPreconfigNR for a sl-ServedRadioBearer, if the sidelink DRB has been established as in clause 5.8.9.1a.2 and has not been released as in clause 5.8.9.1a.1, and if the SL-TxProfile of all associated QoS flow(s) for the sl-ServedRadioBearer indicates backwardsIncompatible; or","paragraph_zero_based":9780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast, for sidelink DRB, if SL-RLC-BearerConfig is received in sl-RLC-BearerConfigListSizeExt in SIB12 or in SidelinkPreconfigNR for a sl-ServedRadioBearer, if the sidelink DRB has been established as in clause 5.8.9.1a.2 and has not been released as in clause 5.8.9.1a.1, and if the SL-TxProfile of at least one QoS flow for the sl-ServedRadioBearer indicates backwardsCompatible and UE decides to use PDCP duplication; or","paragraph_zero_based":9781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, for sidelink DRB, if SL-RLC-BearerConfig is received in sl-RLC-BearerConfigListSizeExt in SIB12 or in SidelinkPreconfigNR for a sl-ServedRadioBearer, and if both UEs support PDCP duplication; or","paragraph_zero_based":9782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, for sidelink SRB, if UE decides to use PDCP duplication;","paragraph_zero_based":9783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For NR sidelink communication, additional sidelink RLC bearer modification is initiated only in the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":9784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any of the additional sidelink RLC bearer related parameters is changed by sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or RRCReconfigurationSidelink for one additional sidelink RLC bearer, which is established;","paragraph_zero_based":9785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.6.2Additional Sidelink RLC Bearer addition/modification operation","paragraph_zero_based":9786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the additional Sidelink RLC bearer, whose addition conditions are met as in clause 5.8.9.1a.6.1, the UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink communication shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast; or","paragraph_zero_based":9788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the additional Sidelink RLC bearer addition was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":9789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, for DRB, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the additional Sidelink RLC bearer addition was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or indicated by upper layers; or","paragraph_zero_based":9790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, for SRB, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the additional Sidelink RLC bearer addition was decided by UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9791}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["dac80681bd896d245654b2c477f95e140edd9e1e270a8ea05a9f16fbd4c31902","a2a6b5faaadaccc442bf7cfa59961a9dd86f0d681c2125618b3da9ac912c3162","d820ffdac7a62c619d881a59e3f61393522fb6025458b25dfbd05c2704f2192a","bd0748b9fcb6af3669ee5467a8260f13761b417a353d4153f5cde1686d2bc565","0cd490d19d059e016272fcef090ace004cf08f37882408c8c553c5e779cd2320","279a660cc4327ccfa134ea97e7eb5cebe68f07ee71c565bff7967a9043cda8b4","50a82632403ab305ca7aa3c612101a4a4baa92819ca9c8559368a62887720126","af230bcc9f8570d9eb6a023a2ab7466dec68ce04f5e43ad80e6a475d2f6569ec","4ff89a854c0d02df2ad19ee258ab916770b1bc5d91082627e44ce1846b7048e5","94ff8c5078e0ccf610ea439aabdb5486d4daad1ebdf556163a48f7e3b6b17f16","85c07f4203ca255ab555a1bba01824e595141c8992cf237fa8bd2f934df99fec","3fa81b5a171b0eddedcc0571da66d0f23920961b38596a42bbb6f7a5e6482569","44a84fa648d18ddf393332b915093117ebfd832137e25c2bf0168dbc3c0541e9","4d4e86723ec977f3ad3e4e2c21cba741e7f640051f8b8a8f152a000e22198921","03cf63910487225329ae4f6ab86238cd1dfc00887c65e268991ba883f928e721","9dddd1526410a8e5204df25f1ab810d059d9864ca4c67e394491a5abbe5e2603","8a269d214e07a94df2b5eb00e0f70de34e3f4c1baa59546133aecad774126b77","ea659d71f8432d7d41b88eb6ef967c009ea16e24a5bd8443098f12a132ef4f01","0e8091f72cf76b7e95304c7bfb42327e2c4c16ba2e1a39549e043a2f098ae002","8f07ceacf80912006c7b93f438d416a5ce1c9072e952693332fcbf2b7c4e6381","7a19785a786b488e1c01421e6a6fdbd622941ad424db4ee27acd90e128a72f37","b2e715b431259ae01fd07f8b916de040db5e14e2f062c2c7ec73b4721d61257a","260bd0a81ab55978a40dd2fe2778210cd3e9f71998d7a2da7a3b5b9d96cc713b","40b56542096f2f5d09387d8e9ce58bdf78e2e14d085a4e0ca27f77b2f53c3720"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9768,9791],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9768"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish an additional RLC entity for NR sidelink communication and configure it in accordance with each sl-RLC-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-RLC-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR for SL DRB, or as specified in clause 9.1.1.4 for SL SRB;","paragraph_zero_based":9792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if this procedure was for Sidelink DRB:","paragraph_zero_based":9793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if this procedure was due to the reception of a RRCReconfigurationSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":9794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance with the sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink associated with the sidelink RLC entity;","paragraph_zero_based":9795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if this procedure was due to the reception of a RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":9796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the MAC entity with a logical channel associated with the sidelink RLC entity, in accordance with the sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig received in the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR;","paragraph_zero_based":9797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e. for groupcast/broadcast):","paragraph_zero_based":9798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the MAC entity with a logical channel associated with the sidelink RLC entity, in accordance with the sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig received in the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR and assign a new LCID to this logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":9799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":9800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate the allowed carriers for the two RLC bearers of the DRB, as indicated in sl-AllowedCarriers, to lower layer;","paragraph_zero_based":9801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate the allowed carriers for the two RLC bearers of the DRB, decided by UE implementation, to lower layer, where the carrier indicated in sl-FreqInfoList is used for the RLC bearer if the SL-TxProfile of at least one associated QoS flow for the sl-ServedRadioBearer indicates backwardsCompatible;","paragraph_zero_based":9803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (i.e., if this procedure was for Sidelink SRB):","paragraph_zero_based":9804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the MAC entity with a logical channel associated with the sidelink RLC entity, as specified in clause 9.1.1.4.","paragraph_zero_based":9805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED and if sl-AllowedCarrierFreqSet1/sl-AllowedCarrierFreqSet2 are configured:","paragraph_zero_based":9806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate the allowed carriers for the two RLC bearers of the SRB, as indicated in sl-AllowedCarrierFreqSet1/sl-AllowedCarrierFreqSet2, to lower layer;","paragraph_zero_based":9807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate the allowed carriers for the two RLC bearers of the SRB, decided by UE implementation, to lower layer, where the carrier indicated in sl-FreqInfoList is used for the RLC bearer if the SL-TxProfile of at least one associated QoS flow for the sl-ServedRadioBearer indicates backwardsCompatible;","paragraph_zero_based":9809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the additional Sidelink RLC bearer, whose modification conditions are met as in clause 5.8.9.1a.6.1, the UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink communication shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast; or","paragraph_zero_based":9811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the additional Sidelink RLC bearer modification was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":9812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the additional Sidelink RLC bearer modification was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":9813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the RLC entity of the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-RLC-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-RLC-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":9814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the logical channel of the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, if included.","paragraph_zero_based":9815}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8bc2940f37ec0e0bd2efc5a2d1c2fd37f011fc2d6dceed7cb6a60d11a6369072","162898570cd52c51c3d0a93ca53e4240995b547ed54ea49bbe7dda72c45cdae1","73f77032cab050650e5c41713d69f0a537a6b024a7b89757a063cfad0525bace","4f7ce6363deb5afd4cebbccc5a0c650990ab9201e766f17a7f109587477c29f6","48490b43cb4c1990a1510cda340f0584909ef3a34ed091017dc3b1abf879e1ce","d2911479e1ffec416e45b252cfa485c1697135ad5ec0936e86f0dad95ce791d0","234a50e07dec297cb7a63aa009983753dc62cdf8364a71b26df31ca20cc65a75","104388619ed3793ffd1b89c69823313c77c68f0fbf2d56391b5d2880d69e24bf","60414b76a7e8a2f201f1489296db2f13d9c1d2733ab5fcfb7060c1bdae2d944b","a09733e1bf032643a5df230e8cd0a69de0039b26486899133bff64c0b5ee3734","edd7d77658a02d790a1f8ef9d652cc1cadcc2cf04a8965d496e83449c9cd890c","1a1621b0a88ce2d182edc9962769cd884460bea82c2dc1220d912a2f672fab1d","8f1539f3777d770b46763304f1cb0b17d4b91e18274781b1c3ea3cb3e82770a4","fcc08417464f418ca84cddfaba755872bd4192e886591af2dad4a093abedf59e","caf710c19bcd5d7836d977b8d0f61c6ecbd3f0265cb6bc675c17805fa6c5f321","ec2f42dc3b2d5eaa4c3f26752f2e5942915ad3dd40ad3030a829d58ac0058350","cafbd8681e5fecf6872c07f23d40ee07366e2716c0616bda3aef899cafc422aa","153c5a1d22ac23e2642e655155f4f47232d107fae97cc67c8179223a0b90862a","f73f6b263f75aaf07034f040a79cc018c490eea06812cb3f9d99dbdc87669313","25cf7b0a48b1c0a54d81812398b405f2ef625245ed6d83b65f9052e50c784244","b63956466c7acd604692b6494e61c9686e079f4574470b1372957aad4f016f49","bda7a382b006ed5f45ff5d437edac8214eb6cb469ccd62c1249c65d4408efa69","6da2aa4acbece416ca8429c71b31791e191613bff224e9d8dd67169ce064c76e","edb2e1e2b3eebb073b2b262366d0da405a7502093925ae361ad1a08cdb916079"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9792,9815],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9792"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1bSidelink Carrier Configuration","paragraph_zero_based":9816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1b.1Sidelink Carrier Release","paragraph_zero_based":9817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1b.1.1Sidelink Carrier Release Condition","paragraph_zero_based":9818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For NR sidelink communication, sidelink carrier release is initiated in the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":9819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if sl-Carrier-Id of the sidelink carrier is received in sl-CarrierToReleaseList in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink; or","paragraph_zero_based":9820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if a sidelink carrier failure has been indicated by MAC layer; or","paragraph_zero_based":9821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the sidelink carrier release was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or upper layer; or","paragraph_zero_based":9822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the sidelink SRB(s), DRB(s) or additional sidelink RLC bearer(s), which was associated with the sidelink carrier(s), are released according to clause 5.8.9.1a.3.1, 5.8.9.1a.1.1 or 5.8.9.1a.5.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1b.1.2Sidelink Carrier Release Operation","paragraph_zero_based":9824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the sidelink carrier release was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":9826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-Carrier-Id value included in the sl-CarrierToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":9827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the current UE configuration includes a sidelink carrier with value sl-Carrier-Id:","paragraph_zero_based":9828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the sidelink carrier for reception.","paragraph_zero_based":9829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the sidelink carrier release was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or indicated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":9830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-Carrier-Id value included in the sl-CarrierToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":9831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the current UE configuration includes a sidelink carrier with value sl-Carrier-Id:","paragraph_zero_based":9832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the sidelink carrier for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":9833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1b.2Sidelink Carrier Addition","paragraph_zero_based":9834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1b.2.1Sidelink Carrier Addition Condition","paragraph_zero_based":9835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For NR sidelink communication, sidelink carrier addition is initiated in the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":9836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if sl-Carrier-Id of the sidelink carrier is received in sl-CarrierToAddModList in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink; or","paragraph_zero_based":9837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if sl-Carrier-Id of the sidelink carrier is received in sl-CarrierToAddModList in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink; or","paragraph_zero_based":9838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if a sidelink SRB(s), DRB(s) or additional sidelink RLC bearer(s), which is associated with the sidelink carrier(s) (taking into account at least carrier(s) mapped to the sidelink QoS flow(s) configured by the upper layer, carriers configured in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR, and carrier(s) supported by both UEs), are established according to clause 5.8.9.1a.4, 5.8.9.1a.2.1 or 5.8.9.1a.6.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9839}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7c913f4e8198e81c102353235d56a2a4884e944f80ba71f14eb48bd5eb0890a9","5c4616ebd8fd1f81bb4b71f72a9ea9d8f4d4035e5c08a95dac306bcb65794f33","534c60fa7f138aee20d564cc1197258eaae6006f50eaa9b1e81b26c06fbd791d","21719b2318081ebe284ae5bfcacfbd00959e03c29e5dba2383dba6d0094b47f8","cc3d835a518ada9069492b073a23e577c4892bb553573c13a555e4b7ca814bd0","aa71b89432f9dbc37623d5acf04a3a38e1deffcf0b8f10f810d48b263aae8cdc","a29ca4aacde3e88dbbb37c0d73300eabbefcc91aa35750863b37712e32fa04cb","bd56c135cf827e74130616705e4e21dc79e492ca9911dde8eabc4b33130fcbc9","3616fdddcb1c6780c932854546d79cc886a7ff1350d06bff2f81e536f9c86075","97e32727331ff9675ceac54f4e51b511bcaadd23bf0df11cde3355df85fa0ec4","6029dd2f78b6e0d6961cd1f1e4ab1d9054b2b54d7efa07679c0c692030780053","b8deb3e7b91948ef2e514a0b356fac3ffba0ea2ba677ab10f18bc3446cdec432","8cb6ff27dc601a9c754b90b09c6ffd67a0142b138880618eb23fc3beb5984436","acc550118ee72eff4b8a3021701c7040d973514af5722949de67eb61112fb6ab","0b750c894e92ad66eb3f883f9a1e60b3a6057a9808a0c88f139365d08d262665","870654598815ff6252fcb78d2c4c474951cb6c644e61cbac482564a178daa42e","b2afe5a3838b329661e284699c2363310a9cf6b498fa60cd4a39cfe012a2c6b6","6dec306aa0bfe279e403fa3da175ae2105e19c097575c216d269e731bdeb3292","cdec749b8b024ceb480146debf340eea904865b9990237bb37884782036b2e31","6f66ccf9afbbc5f1f3e305089da36a7eb0bd9ae5da7abb59c7cc0f60116c823b","d55f5617b2b7276ac7f1a6715e6f7b976baa38f4e3578c712d356989d4bf8eb2","cfd2620c4c20b26ee34203ac39595163915062785d76903f37135612754fc3ac","4637379e9121a9b2d34026796c29bcb54a536f68d13a337e4908df9ced5b9e7e","b9091571a77cb4fb947e448b5453555ad80f088d816960873eb898e7fd9a18ff"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9816,9839],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9816"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1b.2.2Sidelink Carrier Addition Operation","paragraph_zero_based":9840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the sidelink carrier addition was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":9842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-Carrier-Id value included in the sl-CarrierToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (sidelink carrier addition):","paragraph_zero_based":9843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>add the sidelink carrier, corresponding to the sl-Carrier-Id, in accordance with the sl-AbsoluteFrequencyPointA for reception;","paragraph_zero_based":9844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the sidelink carrier addition was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or indicated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":9845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-Carrier-Id value included in the sl-CarrierToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (sidelink carrier addition):","paragraph_zero_based":9846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>add the sidelink carrier, corresponding to the sl-Carrier-Id, in accordance with the sl-AbsoluteFrequencyPointA for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":9847},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.2Sidelink UE capability transfer","paragraph_zero_based":9848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.2.1General","paragraph_zero_based":9849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This clause describes how the UE compiles and transfers its sidelink UE capability information for unicast to the initiating UE.","paragraph_zero_based":9850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.9.2.1-1: Sidelink UE capability transfer","paragraph_zero_based":9852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.2.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":9853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE may initiate the sidelink UE capability transfer procedure upon indication from upper layer when it needs (additional) UE radio access capability information.","paragraph_zero_based":9854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.2.3Actions related to transmission of the UECapabilityEnquirySidelink by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":9855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The initiating UE shall set the contents of UECapabilityEnquirySidelink message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":9856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>include in UE radio access capabilities for sidelink within ue-CapabilityInformationSidelink, if needed;","paragraph_zero_based":9857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:It is up to initiating UE to decide whether ue-CapabilityInformationSidelink should be included.","paragraph_zero_based":9858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set frequencyBandListFilterSidelink to include frequency bands for which the peer UE is requested to provide supported bands and band combinations;","paragraph_zero_based":9859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The initiating UE is not allowed to send the UECapabilityEnquirySidelink message without including the field frequencyBandListFilterSidelink.","paragraph_zero_based":9860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the UECapabilityEnquirySidelink message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":9861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.2.4Actions related to reception of the UECapabilityEnquirySidelink by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":9862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The peer UE shall set the contents of UECapabilityInformationSidelink message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":9863}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fe5fa22a65b59cca213032694179a84fcbbbffcb7389b5f59b29ba2471b2a3a6","fa8f6d98dd8d3d77fe5d1af774c482893c6de5c3a826801439cc2d4e2eb63be5","285d4e44a6e52a3c4f03d1a9a7431629be5d21c67d0e1d394eaf9b1a7a499bde","eb64e078ca98a4a4c39f3959ddb06463798316c0d8751476a77b34a5c25879f8","0505fce45d0002ac4179ade6a7a76e90e0ab16ebf5b315545070e2aafec70328","d8b7703a724498b85ccff48e52c321c9a49f49920e06108e75960651ebdc545c","807158648a1eb50c803e732d46ba75334807db29e2e7f83d7fae78403ddf47b0","677e41c0367cae9cf442b15d622b1b0784a0fbaf04c10792c66d0af4e21d4fb1","2c1690616ae692e96ae45290dca03d2d2c75486d10124eefcb20c586a4cf7088","0d791685a42b38dcd55ebaaddbf89aa64016e3ea23fd68dec56bb11cf6e9af4a","277a88c53e3d178f8e8ab66c1aae8371841308a63f43f37017d9c70f8825602a","131475af8f2141f400882be3f8f4e9e34b8cc94f8483464bb4d60d62de145227","a132c7fce83e5667361b19e8bb7cc5354cec205bbbcc570f2a59d95b2e454f75","1f502704dbf00466482ccf386e2549d31acbb06f560a5dff8d105b3754382887","7639d85990fa6f50407346c381d1cd4724b89342c37f0718f15303cea706ebd5","b468176e3b4f21712bef302de20da0dbaffa0dc86f8a5db7dfad4c0d2cb5170d","4de1034da819d75eb46a1a23c0c6fcf57503a26eb94ee6837819fbc062f68666","76a6a12e413b402b725099af9d696b545ce36fb0a8feefcc6fdbb6382a24fe89","2b51e84936dc424fbc70fc4d5333d29a360de3961eae58e53a9aa750a6f27c93","cbf136b8b868fcef37842a9305170c88a9b9c06b2e1c822b7e3a83cb366a74f5","18f023d4329b2ea7bc7cbff79c4b5a9373d91d0e34036af1c71e9bc6f44d56df","f6f0666106a54f4abe0796e374beeb888e64e9ed5d52b0e2e8f09a10066304bc","f51b3425f68b7a6210cfb0e289262d4ac080b8c62ca003d0883576d39dd5507b","588a9e5d854ab9209fdd02a0ac88b16815b259880ad733784391ab09cb9b124c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9840,9863],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9840"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>include UE radio access capabilities for sidelink within ue-CapabilityInformationSidelink;","paragraph_zero_based":9864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>compile a list of \"candidate band combinations\" only consisting of bands included in frequencyBandListFilterSidelink, and prioritized in the order of frequencyBandListFilterSidelink (i.e. first include band combinations containing the first-listed band, then include remaining band combinations containing the second-listed band, and so on).","paragraph_zero_based":9865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>include into supportedBandCombinationListSidelinkNR as many band combinations as possible from the list of \"candidate band combinations\", starting from the first entry;","paragraph_zero_based":9866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>include the received frequencyBandListFilterSidelink in the field appliedFreqBandListFilter of the requested UE capability;","paragraph_zero_based":9867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the UECapabilityInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":9868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:If the UE cannot include all band combinations due to message size or list size constraints, it is up to UE implementation which band combinations it prioritizes.","paragraph_zero_based":9869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.3Sidelink radio link failure related actions","paragraph_zero_based":9870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9871},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon indication from sidelink RLC entity that the maximum number of retransmissions for a specific destination has been reached; or","paragraph_zero_based":9872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon T400 expiry for a specific destination; or","paragraph_zero_based":9873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon indication from MAC entity that HARQ-based Sidelink RLF for a specific destination has been detected; or","paragraph_zero_based":9874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon integrity check failure indication from sidelink PDCP entity concerning SL-SRB2 or SL-SRB3 for a specific destination; or","paragraph_zero_based":9875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon indication of consistent sidelink LBT failures for all RB sets from MAC entity:","paragraph_zero_based":9876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider sidelink radio link failure to be detected for this destination;","paragraph_zero_based":9877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the DRBs (if any) of this destination, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the SRBs of this destination, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.3;","paragraph_zero_based":9879},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PC5 Relay RLC channels of this destination if configured, in according to clause 5.8.9.7.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the NR sidelink communication related configuration of this destination;","paragraph_zero_based":9881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the sidelink specific MAC of this destination, except for end-to-end PC5 connection in L2 U2U Relay operation;","paragraph_zero_based":9882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the PC5-RRC connection is released for the destination;","paragraph_zero_based":9883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate the release of the PC5-RRC connection to the upper layers for this destination (i.e. PC5 is unavailable);","paragraph_zero_based":9884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if UE is in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":9885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE for the destination:","paragraph_zero_based":9886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if MP is configured, and neither MCG transmission nor indirect path transmission is suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":9887}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7d300fd26b084fd28fd09e4d735c30a7d1442bb0043d224477c51b6c02c9fd93","afea5831d844e0852254b1817d017d5d5bc20ee6a5ceb9a0c50cee5dd449a1d3","b3cfe9fb62b9f6b2fa8891118575a1116a65fdca4c6967830dabd6ca79b5aee7","fbfe877cfed4860242889385ed44b46a4a0ca20549efa62d67fc4957d1af173c","2605285ef3b28c6eb05f3d296309822c5910f49c23bd6359fa0e72dcee09d52d","75ebaf59abb1f0b535db66c21008d398683a5f3c3c1acdd3a870c5a2f5edfa67","e85539c23b186198b48cf332b21c1f26563b5d6dab15423ce52345e0ebe72741","012bda6d50989c15b1d4265a8a6659683b844733a7243c6a7ea800dc58e2f04a","d9d15644c7755107bdf8454f51c00521aa6b0043aff21172723dc3c5f8749ca0","dbfa64bd7c23e3c67255eb1039fae9f037805b2df2c81980608f7fd78bacff7f","d7d6652087673e6091b22bb4bacaa0bd94f8a88c5e4c7fa8411dc5ee82e7e4d8","035635f82ca27cb8ab89ea7d5e71dbdd1e727e7a47ad32b3b83a4b68194d3df9","8fb5260b4e649c2bcb1ee81de7cf04106583e92fa068b1ecf9395f1511a7b823","3b3a34977d16d8fbe66c06b9041463d4ba408d73bf3539d9f2dda6f808404066","904601bc440e22c74fdb5f8f5361bb414a66acf8f6bb2cf68dc0e125f489855a","010b9bc5e30fd086f2c347766c9b2996ad78c4b4dfd6e9a47e6b814b2f757f31","d4f44e6be4ac105c6b2f7b0ab25c17a3cb183e85989f9b876438019f47b995f6","612b98415824bf80dee5568ccfcb4c39ea8a697b878eb1fc5efb7b5cb4fca30a","ad28cf098e7eac1f25181fa5a7b6d0ca4604fec47b65f84b44f233a51fc90831","48acdc3ecbe7336e01f92e75212dbe58743abe88b2d4e9cdc19d325e94341325","8cdfce2bd95cc7e078e44e57673becaf8a3111ee25d6610a641416fbb86e4851","d14fa6f4d45a419bcef7078dd00f778cf54136e3bd29cac5700d2daab38cf4f6","104d04ddc5d7b05b0e6128a634e55620b0580a695fc75dd0b77d33ee5acc0c5f","19904dfd893f02f3060c82db3a9730728b8c514b46dadd71d170ae91ec518a2a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9864,9887],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9864"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the indirect path failure information procedure as specified in 5.7.3c;","paragraph_zero_based":9888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else (i.e., MP is not configured, or MP is configured and MCG transmission or indirect path transmission is suspended):","paragraph_zero_based":9889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the RRC connection re-establishment procedure as specified in 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":9890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the sidelink UE information for NR sidelink communication procedure, as specified in 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":9892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Relay UE for the destination which identifies a connected L2 U2U Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the end-to-end PC5 connection failure for the end-to-end PC5 connection(s) over the per-hop PC5 link established with the L2 U2U Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>send NotificationMessageSidelink to the peer L2 U2U Remote UE(s) of the end-to-end PC5 connection(s), in accordance with 5.8.9.10.","paragraph_zero_based":9895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the end-to-end PC5 connection failure related actions as specified in 5.8.9.3b;","paragraph_zero_based":9896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Remote UE for the destination which identifies a connected L2 U2U Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the end-to-end PC5 connection failure for the end-to-end PC5 connection(s) over the per-hop PC5 link established with the L2 U2U Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the end-to-end PC5 connection failure related actions as specified in 5.8.9.3a; ","paragraph_zero_based":9899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:It is up to UE implementation on whether and how to indicate to upper layers to maintain the keep-alive procedure [55].","paragraph_zero_based":9900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.3aEnd-to-end PC5 connection failure related actions performed by L2 U2U Remote UE","paragraph_zero_based":9901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE acting as NR sidelink L2 U2U Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detection of end-to-end PC5 connection failure due to per-hop PC5 link failure, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":9903},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detection of end-to-end PC5 connection failure due to per-hop PC5 link release, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":9904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon T400 expiry for an end-to-end PC5 connection; or","paragraph_zero_based":9905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon integrity check failure indication from sidelink PDCP entity concerning SL-SRB2 or SL-SRB3 for an end-to-end PC5 connection; or","paragraph_zero_based":9906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detection end-to-end PC5 connection failure due to reception of NotificationMessageSidelink indicating PC5 RLF from the L2 U2U Relay UE for a specific destination based on the received sl-DestinationIdentityRemoteUE, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.10.4:","paragraph_zero_based":9907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the end-to-end DRBs for this end-to-end PC5 connection, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the end-to-end SRBs for this end-to-end PC5 connection, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.3;","paragraph_zero_based":9909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the end-to-end NR sidelink communication related radio resources and configuration for this end-to-end PC5 connection, including local ID pair in SRAP configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":9910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the end-to-end PC5-RRC connection is released for this end-to-end PC5 connection;","paragraph_zero_based":9911}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["945e578beb557d5eb8815614f332ede80bc6755c4f1751bfcac0e7cb32209a06","f12002b6019ea0c14c83822d2b79c762ccb747f1230e5922b2dbcf67298156cb","5220fc66f516d35d08d82c85fc379b4e678546f03b99b5e478dc8d6480246527","441ce6850067183dc1ceb19c2262e46657672db364ab18efd92d4fffb3a25680","6b817ef44d930427fc4d2bce898774dba6655d19c708121845b26cbf6ffa4741","d8e88c88a582f16fcecdb1fe5a31a7ad96ed923d8839167d4eb1796c93e21e8c","c8cc6558bb41a55f6205b15830904bfbc2b211849fdbba92a963443e81facb9c","81e356002bcc67bf953948b9c0b2165c7dfc7fd40d46aab70f2ce28d5177eb57","74c41a77f6ce0af3ed61d65ccad3082573310132773631ec08549dc09083102e","310c8e2df5ecc2288090e9f4864a1c939dc2f8c68c555a81f0858b2ca0fd3dad","a10aa71c71380b96720f97c2b3d622fe9ca82edd03dc3678f8a05b41cc171ef1","118751f19fdf6ab690272eb6ed6e184314ab3b26c1cd3f0ca73eab07283cac00","d2271e21a550461b3ccbd625620c2a9b0bc244eaa92a08685e8680af9c72d4c7","729d772fdbabd401027c438b234e6b7da01daa3e679224b1f8aa2a4f9fb2ade0","4e4523e4b4d9de09aa7743695246839963ea1de480d36afe4f20e0b603d8f7ce","c4daad856f84375d925b71ea2c53837f6d899a4f775af4f66caeda8d97e96c3b","2e286b46b6f3cacd2ec2a12218c3dc8f087748051d248dca883f00ea2b963ad6","22fdf366228abc046c118131aac159fca373690c421106f1fbc5913a34e508dc","a0d0519693c1250d475bdbbadc71648140e279699ecfe3b6f68281c8d6bccd05","d2a359e3ce16f99b5565dacdae4ccc8b5ae4732abd9a28392648ad985ca974b4","9bdd11581699778de5e499f1136d674cd92e3ab54ccd49ca9916cf4962e0df5b","e3141524ffa3574d2a4aaeaf0a18b108959fd05a14c7faf6a374238b8d270bde","9cefdf6faf02a92c98ec02813240e6d16b4f8b1e000895b386a139cc84373998","8af6c08d61925450989d2a28fb7f97cfa81f8f7478bd62aeb48369a5d55d35ab"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9888,9911],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9888"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate the release of the end-to-end PC5-RRC connection to the upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":9912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the end-to-end PC5 connection failure is due to T400 expiry or integrity check failure of SL-SRB2 or SL-SRB3:","paragraph_zero_based":9913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>send RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to the L2 U2U Relay UE of the end-to-end PC5 connection(s) in accordance with 5.8.9.8.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.3bEnd-to-end PC5 connection failure/release related actions performed by L2 U2U Relay UE","paragraph_zero_based":9915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE acting as NR sidelink L2 U2U Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detection end-to-end PC5 connection failure due to per-hop PC5 link failure, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":9917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detection end-to-end PC5 connection failure due to per-hop PC5 link release, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":9918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon reception of RemoteUEInfomationSidelink indicating end-to-end connection release or failure for a specific destination based on the received sl-DestinationIdentityRemoteUE, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.8.3:","paragraph_zero_based":9919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the end-to-end DRB(s) for this end-to-end PC5 connection is to be released, and perform the sidelink DRB release operations according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the end-to-end SRBs for this end-to-end PC5 connection are to be released, and perform the sidelink SRB release operations according to clause 5.8.9.1a.3;","paragraph_zero_based":9921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the end-to-end NR sidelink communication related radio resources and configuration for this end-to-end PC5 connection, including end-to-end SRB/DRB related configuration, QoS related configuration, SRAP configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":9922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.4Sidelink common control information","paragraph_zero_based":9923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.4.1General","paragraph_zero_based":9924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The sidelink common control information is carried by MasterInformationBlockSidelink. The sidelink common control information may change at any transmission, i.e. neither a modification period nor a change notification mechanism is used. This procedure also applies to NR sidelink discovery.","paragraph_zero_based":9925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE configured to receive or transmit NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has a selected SyncRef UE, as specified in 5.8.6:","paragraph_zero_based":9927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>ensure having a valid version of the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message of that SyncRef UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.4.2Actions related to reception of MasterInformationBlockSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":9929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving MasterInformationBlockSidelink, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply the values included in the received MasterInformationBlockSidelink message.","paragraph_zero_based":9931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.4.3Transmission of MasterInformationBlockSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":9932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":9933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in coverage on the frequency used for the NR sidelink communication/positioning as defined in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":9934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set inCoverage to true;","paragraph_zero_based":9935}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3c95530f452e32ea2d3ca4d602fe8b14dffe01c56497903f1525815b4a6dfba9","4d2aff74c8ae1ff6b61cc50922ede5df68764acb51f4ace7c48360483c8cb4c6","5dbf885201eddc6f3a860f4be9c19e953e49af000a1f736b68777bd1e18892cc","fc2ff3202951276e1304cc4526ff78a5fa8c684803b84739a5b0fada830c25e6","03f1e1bc290c18e628e70eccedc8c1b4aabbb7cc93a833ea04a106df332f5191","4b09a3e60963f29df7d1ccb3669c8605826e0a604ac9a6218dc37dceb099600d","7491402b6c6764bd66b7074fa61e684d956d54f3188dfa68e8e0a9a6e03a2bfb","f40e2217857cd980cdca74f6577e35a9f199b1b0afa21a72c5341b58a7155e67","8943ee921515b366774641f0ad2b01b87754d7f3bff2bb18d867caa02ad1c884","1f08eb2f14f52ae68b1259b24e94ceb0ed16aaeedc0dd6e5be5d268bfbc15a1d","c2c00b836e4187e8518bbf6a922046f2acaf7b84b938dd3bcc621d36c39891b9","ecb8b0ef33f463c2d878c0665b33b5805057f760b0e7aa9f802f17ef6a70e831","95e6bc2b725148f28066321bb5323d9915af6dff0085fac9d3a3e4b740c4c4c5","9fed2da7488e34c647044cfdbc4e140f541e18d6819eab3ec183a611de32ad3f","78dcaf2396610f611daca7e6ba9161a302f4ee3a93aae5769c6a15a25cdfa59f","31a2f8a1b435418e0e3ceabc105719cbddd37f8c054e7ec93ed89740fdc3b968","9782f1c4e46bfc094698033812b3158246141acb4fcffed968de92aa33bc590c","493a313a46bc19d48fc71b0118bfc34d0463834d0c3e8976bef495dd80182b07","b0c419e13aaad49bf26deb12caf0981b334cde9e3d9faaab3758f5313a44738f","473439378e6d3e722716f3e96c11411c370648071e40428397e12269b5a3e1b8","330b327284c95ac12681db50161c49e3288fb5e597854457a2594af4eef8a388","21c865cee1c7140591ecdccf598604675729ef27e32914906c5bcc778c0ec9d3","e655d1556ff1f435ef09cbdd7ea37f6a77fc89d01c1a0213fba6f915637c53fa","a7fe8ab7d4a1d10300a529e0bf3276db59f31dca0147636e369f63e2e81ae19b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9912,9935],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9912"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if tdd-UL-DL-ConfigurationCommon is included in the received SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":9936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set sl-TDD-Config to the value representing the same meaning as that is included in tdd-UL-DL-ConfigurationCommon, as described in TS 38.213, clause 16.1 [13];","paragraph_zero_based":9937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set sl-TDD-Config to the value as specified in TS 38.213 [13], clause 16.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if syncInfoReserved is included in an entry of configured sl-SyncConfigList corresponding to the concerned frequency from the received SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":9940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set reservedBits to the value of syncInfoReserved in the received SIB12;","paragraph_zero_based":9941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set all bits in reservedBits to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":9943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if out of coverage on the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/positioning as defined in TS 38.304 [20]; and the concerned frequency is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt in RRCReconfiguration or in sl-FreqInfoList/sl-FreqInfoListSizeExt within SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":9944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set inCoverage to true;","paragraph_zero_based":9945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set reservedBits to the value of the corresponding field included in the preconfigured sidelink parameters (i.e. sl-PreconfigGeneral in SidelinkPreconfigNR defined in 9.3);","paragraph_zero_based":9946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set sl-TDD-Config to the value representing the same meaning as that is included in the corresponding field included in the preconfigured sidelink parameters (i.e. sl-PreconfigGeneral in SL-PreconfigurationNR defined in 9.3) as described in TS 38.213, clause 16.1 [13];","paragraph_zero_based":9947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if out of coverage on the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/positioning as defined in TS 38.304 [20]; and the UE selects GNSS as the synchronization reference and sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3 is not configured for the frequency used in SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":9948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set inCoverage to true;","paragraph_zero_based":9949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set reservedBits to the value of the corresponding field included in the preconfigured sidelink parameters (i.e. sl-PreconfigGeneral in SidelinkPreconfigNR defined in 9.3);","paragraph_zero_based":9950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set sl-TDD-Config to the value representing the same meaning as that is included in the corresponding field included in the preconfigured sidelink parameters (i.e. sl-PreconfigGeneral in SL-PreconfigurationNR defined in 9.3) as described in TS 38.213, clause 16.1 [13];","paragraph_zero_based":9951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE has a selected SyncRef UE (as defined in 5.8.6):","paragraph_zero_based":9952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set inCoverage to false;","paragraph_zero_based":9953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set sl-TDD-Config and reservedBits to the value of the corresponding field included in the received MasterInformationBlockSidelink;","paragraph_zero_based":9954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":9955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set inCoverage to false;","paragraph_zero_based":9956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set reservedBits to the value of the corresponding field included in the preconfigured sidelink parameters (i.e. sl-PreconfigGeneral in SidelinkPreconfigNR defined in 9.3);","paragraph_zero_based":9957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> set sl-TDD-Config to the value representing the same meaning as that is included in the corresponding field included in the preconfigured sidelink parameters (i.e. sl-PreconfigGeneral in SL-PreconfigurationNR defined in 9.3) as described in TS 38.213, clause 16.1 [13];","paragraph_zero_based":9958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set directFrameNumber and slotIndex according to the slot used to transmit the SLSS, as specified in 5.8.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":9959}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["21042c5a333b681c035712d93b9062e83d10a290c150f8ab8482553a14dd2e64","3dad231dc032c534fcaa37425216722b9254a3c00bfe3af2d0c8f54104e69daf","44369a63c59da884318de1ef486dc274d2d4d4e01618ca00efb43014b3d92ffe","ef2ea750533fd5e2c387f35b5c487e535ab1c80653c209f98cef32d02971eafc","b87bec275fa1d81acfbd1b4b0f095c9f0a9942cc7a30a4f034340872c6c6a11b","faebcae6bee135ed80188ff7f51b015e15d25cd6dd79555389859554c5f7bc82","e75df0871fc8ca1a489830a161401202b1cc119611ee95eb88452b4140957d96","fd7789dfe768669e8568bb37ef97f79619d8bb8af407e2edfd23838773d9eba6","01f0b24a542dc11eec5d97bedb4d0f203de45c9cfdfaa0932be42b9ea80d181d","e61fbe8606033afa478e45bdd8e3fd48324f33f57e44b64974c9f384ac831ea9","bf2b6ea679c657092427b24e2e85f456c0e3ac8db5cc3b7cc84f93cdcb47f9bf","4dabfec249ee219790e23f3acb4ab270dfa22a66ea30d460448414fb8dc63926","0ee15387827061f3a211004d22a5153f056a7c7d5da0a045a36eb126e8207a78","cda4a720723aebcc1657ebbaa7f3c4f3416d63a13ef38dedcaccfa5f748a623e","40e9412f39ca145ad12d03cff70b2cc62f175b81559ff1058bbd15432c365391","426bf359a1e5bc5fd28a6276c608525efc7c9c218d383996e8ae0bfba0fd8e3c","21e82c49a264a0c3ab9760848b2f3358f5a22896e7af645027aca428cc968d5a","03069799d280767225b60f2b8ecb572aaed8f1c39f10e7355021073421ac376d","29a6cc42018b56d459b7db8e9a9535e44233a8f258a435747a273dc4db8df298","67b0dead4917e54c8795b2c1eafad1954cc314906c63ca17d53d2c0d69b69ba7","52f4bf40390a7546831cac5f207d2e3f1377aaa8ea7a3017f2c10dc3eb8a1235","c018a46eff898c384fda0d0030720cc9ae5ae9e8c64750a7252d0cb7ea61e2ce","b4a15c4c089d66ddc77ded58f37873ef02372df9e420ee7ba432ca45b00497b9","5d901f80ee3dc9aab30e50886633654d77c6f7f29f15a3c83d9404f365cbfff4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9936,9959],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9936"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the MasterInformationBlockSidelink to lower layers for transmission upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":9960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.5Actions related to PC5-RRC connection release requested by upper layers","paragraph_zero_based":9961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE initiates the procedure when upper layers request the release of the PC5-RRC connection as specified in TS 24.587 [57] or TS 24.554 [72]. The UE shall not initiate the procedure for power saving purposes.","paragraph_zero_based":9962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the PC5-RRC connection release for the specific destination is requested by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":9964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the NR sidelink communication related configuration of this destination;","paragraph_zero_based":9965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the DRBs of this destination if configured, in according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the SRBs of this destination, in according to clause 5.8.9.1a.3;","paragraph_zero_based":9967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PC5 Relay RLC channels if configured, in according to clause 5.8.9.7.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the sidelink specific MAC of this destination except for end-to-end PC5-RRC connection in L2 U2U relay operation.","paragraph_zero_based":9969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the PC5-RRC connection is released for the destination;","paragraph_zero_based":9970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as MP remote UE, and this destination identifies a connected MP relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if neither MCG transmission nor indirect path transmission is not suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":9972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the indirect path failure information procedure as specified in 5. 7. 3c to report indirect path failure;","paragraph_zero_based":9973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if T301 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":9974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the RRC connection re-establishment procedure as specified in 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":9975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Remote UE, and this destination identifies a connected L2 U2U Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the end-to-end PC5 connection failure for the end-to-end PC5 connection(s) over the per-hop PC5 link established with the L2 U2U Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the end-to-end PC5 connection failure related actions as specified in 5.8.9.3a;","paragraph_zero_based":9978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Relay UE, and this destination identifies a connected L2 U2U Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":9979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the end-to-end PC5 connection failure for the end-to-end PC5 connection(s) over the per-hop PC5 link established with the L2 U2U Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":9980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>send NotificationMessageSidelink message to the peer L2 U2U Remote UE(s) for the end-to-end PC5 connection(s) in accordance with 5.8.9.10;","paragraph_zero_based":9981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the end-to-end PC5 connection failure related actions as specified in 5.8.9.3b;","paragraph_zero_based":9982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.5aActions related to end-to-end PC5-RRC connection release performed by L2 U2U Remote UE","paragraph_zero_based":9983}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4dd0283586c98c60fcda3e01515a715a613143955c6949d0bc2b22960bce4e4c","266db03d3052121be30f7868d4b3fcd4b34c27d963ce3ba310f52bc2e279995d","2f516dca165270de7bf59e1afbdfa655bf24f1b1acbd3987340d591c77b2d623","fff9798ec18e8b5d4ca7437cedaa686a844761bdf4dde6b0d9ecf875f7638ddb","3213a7d6ba79bbcf3ec3bb3928db79ab2ac766be131eee5528b35c1f685facb8","737f8410ccbb2d3ad6cad4534a17f1fadc89efc711aedb5ffea7fee645055be1","de4d7acf163568fc3f51fca758a1a05a6b58daa3b45a88e901a922b945ca5101","38d628fecf7bd1ebf4dead53894d8bfa0004929bed70700457412b826e35e816","49a65ac0215c10ebb3d48f1d9c6cff65836deea0f697f35b8ae7c8e3842dffc2","ce29cf1045b8bd63dea936e3ef678a4c807555fc2468ac4a63b1e0ec8f75e9c7","e9016dce102b475ef20b548246be232ae1ca09a85ead0452c784950f9084754f","f2868679f94bff211d7cdd6b3b12b6453f2816ce71a6281263d8c4605bdea6db","989ef9c740e8511537f8ccd4ac290899c86921b8e66a2903d9e94b35e47bb8d6","00a15542f89aa2442c7e79c61cde820fc497e75edc66bb7182c04c599da98213","8e5500c46abe512efd6e2293af1b3ba7061f83ad409a230ce6e86504d2b84fa4","e368cfc770f2d28757837a6c7cb926ac9756b5530731ebe9d2a41616233a5853","12a7aae399239bb5e5997d5bada668bb22769799067c6abe6a76bbb1be4dc974","702196b2fa14acb1b7a010c41b29428b620ac16fa6bb525307cdaaae32a50862","553c4296f5b9a90468fa3d6460d1fddd6567173d4affd1cf0d021cfcdc482a21","091bf6896e5f71eb32f3fc33b190385de22be9f0adfcaaf30b3fe9c2a2757ac3","e3c0b639a0512d2f80ad7c9b7c1166f1e7527bf488be2c1cecb4b299bbcc7b1c","08286cc41b514c101b5591c04679bf148226669d0494a6030190d1dfac8d179c","064544a11954306bff7c857c5c94737e5083fd885950d6ee40493c760c2bc4ae","28566d099b9fc13c585eb09b20183d3bca5d0e5dd48784d5ea4c839c12afa280"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9960,9983],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9960"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE acting as sidelink L2 U2U Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":9984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the end-to-end PC5-RRC connection release is requested by upper layers as specified in TS 23.304 [65]:","paragraph_zero_based":9985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the NR sidelink communication related configuration for this end-to-end PC5-RRC connection, including SRAP configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":9986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the end-to-end DRBs for this end-to-end PC5-RRC connection if configured, in according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1;","paragraph_zero_based":9987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the end-to-end SRBs for this end-to-end PC5-RRC connection, in according to clause 5.8.9.1a.3;","paragraph_zero_based":9988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard all the radio resources and  configuration for this end-to-end PC5-RRC connection, including local ID pair in SRAP configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":9989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the end-to-end PC5-RRC connection is released for this end-to-end PC5-RRC connection;","paragraph_zero_based":9990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>send RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to the L2 U2U Relay UE of the end-to-end PC5 connection(s) in accordance with 5.8.9.8.2;","paragraph_zero_based":9991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.6Sidelink UE assistance information","paragraph_zero_based":9992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.6.1General","paragraph_zero_based":9993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.9.6.1-1: Sidelink UE assistance information","paragraph_zero_based":9995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is for a UE to inform its peer UE of the sidelink DRX assistance information used to determine the sidelink DRX configuration for unicast communication.","paragraph_zero_based":9996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For sidelink unicast, a UE may include its desired sidelink DRX configurations in the UEAssistanceInformationSidelink as the sidelink DRX assistance information which is transmitted to its peer UE.","paragraph_zero_based":9997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:It is up to UE implementation to determine its desired sidelink DRX configurations for unicast communication.","paragraph_zero_based":9998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.6.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":9999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For sidelink unicast, if both a RX UE and its peer TX UE for a direction of sidelink communication are capable of sidelink DRX, the RX UE that is interested in sending the sidelink DRX assistance information may send the UEAssistanceInformationSidelink as the sidelink DRX assistance information to its peer UE when the sidelink DRX assistance information has not been sent previously or when the previously transmitted sidelink DRX assistance information has changed.","paragraph_zero_based":10000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.6.3Actions related to reception of UEAssistanceInformationSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":10001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For sidelink unicast, when a UE is in RRC_CONNECTED and is performing sidelink operation with resource allocation mode 1, it may report the sidelink DRX assistance information received within the UEAssistanceInformationSidelink from its peer UE to the network as specified in 5.8.3. For sidelink unicast, when a UE is in RRC_CONNECTED and is performing sidelink operation with resource allocation mode 2 or is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE or out of coverage, regardless of whether the UE has obtained the sidelink DRX assistance information from the UEAssistanceInformationSidelink transmitted from its peer UE or not, it may determine the sidelink DRX configuration SL-DRX-ConfigUC for its peer UE.","paragraph_zero_based":10002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:When UE determines the sidelink DRX configuration for its peer UE, it may take the sidelink DRX assistance information received from its peer UE into account.","paragraph_zero_based":10003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.7PC5 Relay RLC channel management for L2 U2N or U2U relay","paragraph_zero_based":10004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.7.1PC5 Relay RLC channel release","paragraph_zero_based":10005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":10006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the PC5 Relay RLC channel release was triggered after the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":10007}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6e6f3634688e707d6dd894482ef49b2b3ccc0192f757edfbfa3cb4ca95e298bd","42f923fb35710377fd0878755c619db13f0206f95c91aab2e8537e708ce3051e","c4bb32d48f10d37bd2eca140e547f1ab1d5ecf6ad8de84a87a04b0b5636bc5ca","b7f8faed17d1e1699e17a079932523fdc3b3b9afcfe239a0258cade487785926","83fe2e62857366c17cb8e5f4a6d3fb8912bd30cb9c787975e6fa88f75341f5a4","f6d108668a4eae3c41a28d72d66c722e49f0cf6e9917ea33142d72a67896ddbe","c9b1ee43a1669c2e03cdb4b09d7da004c66b063b1fdde0d6805b0890f98dbeeb","75b9aa6f9068413c24b0112e010af741ba9de9226de50374566fa9317e22f9c8","3820799ddd3201e1190d161ac26f48a12486983094e6232e4c3557c19a1f3c32","6344b50b798b4de786465e06c72a8be341bf68c51ba946c13b18fff0247abe7f","e75c6edcbdf10bc7304e30ea7920e153519a7bf0c23774952d09177caa299589","6871a5b084c1e3ee17e786cbf6e557e1ec677e4e2d90f26df53ceeb8cd0b7de2","dd99a3a6a67e24ab930ad7cee3ca4d53aff5cc7c3448bd15cd56a2022a282611","c9f48bb35a4160637ffa1e6f63045100d23a7aea9876641dbfc55b55f5cae112","21842fe14491dff7ebfe25b7afd69dd59e55a8cdf84b13570bc25a14ee78020a","49a30e3555ffddbe43dc4bd1ce0ef47d2c6f4e68a606385f47de22142f474200","061dc25e2513bff76e28d090fdd121e381a660b3780552a6317b73e5e5bba18e","2270e7c7c74acd9f486d64092b665e16bd564b47beda4ff02e620b8dab07e365","66b6571911a61d6b985e67255386f2e5b32f4a6b8e41f533606166852e02efad","6925021072b504c5d9066fbab2b16e455724e62e33782de46404ffbcc0344921","67fa6cf601ff867690e274855cd8a899e7b22d84445dd208142d0e79d1034bc4","c172b7582e90223177e16c6664c44051cf8619c7279e2dc40ebf52b4829338ca","2cd89ab1d8be76cd71ebae31709fbf424e8f63d276751928f5be11c7f436e96e","93f94ef5c53930ab92cd1581d15e787d05ba3c7c235b4c860cc05022cf7252be"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[9984,10007],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p9984"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the PC5 Relay RLC channel release was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":10008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-RLC-ChannelID in sl-RLC-ChannelToReleaseList received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration, or for each SL-RLC-ChannelID included in the received sl-RLC-ChannelToReleaseListPC5 that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":10009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity and the corresponding logical channel associated with the SL-RLC-ChannelID;","paragraph_zero_based":10010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the PC5 Relay RLC channel release was triggered by end-to-end DRB release as specified in 5.8.9.1a.1.2; or ","paragraph_zero_based":10011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the PC5 Relay RLC channel release was triggered by end-to-end DRB modification as specified in 5.8.9.1a.2.2:","paragraph_zero_based":10012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":10013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PC5 Relay RLC channel release was triggered after the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":10014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message;","paragraph_zero_based":10015},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity and the corresponding logical channel associated with the end-to-end DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":10016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the PC5 Relay RLC channel release was triggered for a specific destination by upper layers as specified in 5.8.9.5, or due to sidelink RLF as specified in 5.8.9.3:","paragraph_zero_based":10017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the RLC entity and the corresponding logical channel associated with the SL-RLC-ChannelID of the specific destination;","paragraph_zero_based":10018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.7.2PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":10019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon PC5-RRC connection establishment between the L2 U2N Relay UE and L2 U2N Remote UE, the L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":10020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66], if no SRAP entity has been established;","paragraph_zero_based":10021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC specified configuration of SL-RLC0 as specified in clause 9.1.1.4:","paragraph_zero_based":10022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC default configuration of SL-RLC1 as defined in clause 9.2.4 if the L2 U2N Relay UE is in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE state;","paragraph_zero_based":10023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon PC5-RRC connection establishment between two UEs for L2 U2U relay operation UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":10024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66], if no SRAP entity has been established;","paragraph_zero_based":10025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC specified configuration of SL-U2U-RLC as specified in clause 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":10026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For L2 U2U Relay operation in RRC_IDLE/RRC_INACTVE or out of coverage, the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification can be triggered due to the addition/modification/release of the end-to-end SL DRB(s). The source L2 U2U Remote UE and L2 U2U Relay UE derive the configuration for the corresponding PC5 Relay RLC channel based on SIB12/Preconfiguration, as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":10027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The source L2 U2U Remote UE derives the configuration for the PC5 Relay RLC channel(s) between the source L2 U2U Remote UE and L2 U2U relay UE (i.e. the first hop PC5 Relay RLC channel(s)), by aggregating the QoS profile(s) of the QoS flow(s) with split QoS information of the first hop into a per-SLRB level QoS profile for each end-to-end SL DRB as described in clause 5.8.9.11.4, and considering the SL-RLC-Config (linked to the SL-RadioBearerConfig which matches the per-SLRB level QoS profile) as the first hop RLC channel configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":10028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The L2 U2U Relay UE derives the configuration for the PC5 Relay RLC channel(s) between L2 U2U relay UE and the target L2 U2U Remote UE (i.e. the second hop PC5 Relay RLC channel(s)), by aggregating the QoS profile(s) of the QoS flow(s) with split QoS information of the second hop into a per-SLRB level QoS profile for each end-to-end SL DRB as described in clause 5.8.9.11.3, and considering the SL-RLC-Config (linked to the SL-RadioBearerConfig which matches the per-SLRB level QoS profile) as the second hop RLC channel configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":10029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":10030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":10031}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a5cfb7aae5a9d74174f7a0a4cc313caf62e1fc4c075611968e75305b2dd92124","93c6268ccc34317b281a8fcc43b8c5d537fb2c51bd917724f6f5c3f0bf47527a","c2b29f836b51bfb8ce2e798f0ca5f8ad50da2b65b1733fd6d6889e0430e6fe7f","3d23e03592dfbd09836d5af7831459efc50191ca6f4f8483313fee9b72ddafe1","20c8b044a334be32f006e71fd8a0861f7df60e121fc3fcc134beb72554ca2cd7","835bca70e4ddd55f924a6809ce41702ebaf52cbf738581f09587dc4ec3ffc8d2","150e1c059b240e91635020baf585aaa49d7895ab16a8b57ab2c69a7984c9d601","85944a0055de498060b1d185cbf681cb133f0fdb944c9adb89b65cda0ab9bafe","3a0af28be9b6f72ea14e177981b7bad9a6189e898c6dcdd7def244e560846ee4","4c544d3e1c33bb32f388f2dc997872e7c829b60dbdae5f410a4142cd1e24d400","7bbb71e54edab2fdca68479aee35c5c43861b277bb971d10314bb26a1fd55fa8","706c313c01a69fa238309cb2c79ba90c545e041619f1b8e82df95d33c0b601af","be137edb3276db839ee0f7e9df43ee47b3ea8f4db89a7661533f6f32786422d8","87593847955e37263fad1da8b72cf6d2cc37a43260b209d74bd0e03e21731f4a","8edf772e7b066e1b59aa745dbfcd4cab53245cb4cb6fabedecf8c46bb66621c5","44f8ed377c648099629b9ebf522e97ded0c32c270b6899971dc2150da4074ae7","ea58f6e9a624eaec77dd80629e37a51298ec324c2649963671d36ad52e7e8a21","07e9aba52bc4fa9180a9763556994a8ab0d387f58c03a31eaa0a49b17ae840c8","3e65b99702344a2146518a5e41d4f2f92bd7d9e2e014c2b7496b1e31714bd0c5","80174ac6d6b854bcba3dd3126cb08e561e3bbb4fb425f7a5062e4007e0936d3e","f3feed6a1e1187e88c1e755d13ea6f8c1ddd0b46c9d1c4ab7904dec3bc0323b9","5c304f1d6d3cebde5181fb380c34e3275825c07f7652bb926eb9dbe4973562f3","1da7268c3d47a831e1b2e52ead31fcc92fe76b6cf578e3ef78433a5a728f877c","40512073d5e9ea41cab9ff8d4a1a909eaf0f4ddd645a41290ee6a34ebc573bdc"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[10008,10031],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p10008"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":10032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered for an end-to-end sidelink DRB based on the configuration in SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":10033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current configuration contains a PC5 Relay RLC channel with the received sl-RLC-ChannelID or sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5; or","paragraph_zero_based":10034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the configuration in SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR has updated, based on which the PC5 Relay RLC channel is derived:","paragraph_zero_based":10035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the sidelink RLC entity in accordance with the received sl-RLC-Config or sl-RLC-ConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":10036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the sidelink MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance with the received sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig or sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":10037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (a PC5 Relay RLC channel with the received sl-RLC-ChannelID or sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 was not configured before):","paragraph_zero_based":10038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish a sidelink RLC entity in accordance with the received sl-RLC-Config (in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, or SIB12, or SidelinkPreconfigNR) or sl-RLC-ConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":10039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the sidelink MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance with the received sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig or sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5.","paragraph_zero_based":10040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.8Remote UE information","paragraph_zero_based":10041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.8.1General","paragraph_zero_based":10042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":10043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.9.8.1-1: Remote UE information","paragraph_zero_based":10044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This procedure is used by the L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_IDLE/RRC_INACTIVE to inform about the required SIB(s) /posSIB(s), provide Paging related information to the connected L2 U2N Relay UE, request the SFN-DFN offset from the connected L2 U2N Relay UE, and trigger L2 U2N Relay UE in RRC_IDLE/RRC_INACTIVE to enter RRC_CONNECTED during indirect path addition/change in MP operation. This procedure is also used by the L2 U2U Remote UE to send end-to-end PC5 connection release/failure related information to L2 U2U Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":10045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This procedure is used by the L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED to request the SFN-DFN offset from the connected L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":10046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:MIB is not required by a L2 U2N Remote UE.","paragraph_zero_based":10047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.8.2Actions related to transmission of RemoteUEInformationSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":10048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When entering RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, or upon change in any of the information in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink while in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, the L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":10049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has SIB request information to provide (e.g. the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1 and the requested SIB has not been indicated in RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to the L2 U2N Relay UE before):","paragraph_zero_based":10050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include sl-RequestedSIB-List in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink to indicate the requested SIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":10051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has not stored a valid version, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several posSIB(s) that the UE requires for a positioning operation, and the requested posSIB has not been indicated in RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to the L2 U2N Relay UE before, and the connected L2 U2N relay UE set posSIB-ForwardingSupported to supported:","paragraph_zero_based":10052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include sl-RequestedPosSIB-List in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink to indicate the requested posSIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":10053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE needs the SFN-DFN offset based on the request from upper layers and the connected L2 U2N relay UE set sfn-DFN-OffsetSupported to supported:","paragraph_zero_based":10054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set sl-SFN-DFN-OffsetRequested to true;","paragraph_zero_based":10055}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3553e7518cd23d27f7557d7eb2920ced0fd3a250e1b2467d3bc4338a95c66412","3fa0e10493a25aadbbc29c9e26cfea32d66a7f72bdee036d444be72ce1e2b371","e31b861026b24089db77bd843c0ea9ef99cd18261fb444fccd6a6daaf1162fda","a875407b176d0d2f958c214f249ef47018af07c5c9f227cea615c89f07dee3fa","d1936a04ed43e8c267233e7fb6c5ed20d774ce82d397f98862bc9ac3f0f079b6","1566ff39917bdb62a9208c8a3ac656e8822fb3eebd955f1b04a1cbef20ffbd63","6acb526d43f65a0a233dbd9556610f66e6b4b1414a3056fb8415522dbbdc2237","ce5571367d75f7a110d2701f8cca2894ccee2284e66d8b4997cd08a07fd19755","b024c5c78b66d8c59bd3a7b27ecdf83ba0b6335202f75a27ff8aa89a5f1947b4","768f0b2e4cbbd087afd63b7c827f2ab1dc29320821ac4c3bd70517403375e204","e0f3db8f85dd9a98549165877c4ad7ce37638de531af91b64343eb5612426dec","70f203d03516cb7cd8c8eb473e0eaf7ecea58647d2bd5a992a47fd000eff1fe5","9b2924eae0f2a079141be2f11fcf5dcfa1dd938cd0acdd8712b7ec2951cd45f8","689765d7ecbc96bd4bffa2e9c9f743b86dd82220bafa7843b5f629cd252361d4","de30115e89e56019b265ec1d0f3f34d304f0c97ee5b20ecda848a71392255a1f","7f3e3e99c6c79b7f3068a06f23b7c85cfeb2591ff974451c49e409b55038e4cd","b9987898d2dca82f387c485bb42e052a2000cb857c8eb37fcde9f66e8062cb8c","2e8dacbeddcb5815775069cbd9806eec147b6f648f21e12fbfd913e28ef5246f","b285c9ab436443e3f2d840a41c9a3d4226546189b895e574eb4c90eb78f230cf","2f8000afee3869f2f8acf331ee07679cfdad634f7d67d68d5ead2a0eb95e6347","41fb522f54c7cc152b4d0bdc58870115c4d80b28b164de5a7a33a9dd49b862ee","698b3c1ebe5be1587457da96c0d5ec91b39c694d324678197a915c3f9ed1e0b7","71d46015ada8b57a209939a45be763b4b9765b113e57a9d02918ef51b6e088fe","2d22436e49bf5acdc9fbd510df68e4e8d00d35c6b68835dc42f2f243b18cae13"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[10032,10055],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p10032"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has paging related information to provide (e.g. the UE has not sent sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to the L2 U2N Relay UE before), set sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":10056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the L2 U2N Remote UE is in RRC_IDLE:","paragraph_zero_based":10057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include ng-5G-S-TMSI in the sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":10058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE specific DRX cycle is configured by upper layer, set sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE to the value of UE specific Uu DRX cycle configured by upper layer;","paragraph_zero_based":10059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the L2 U2N Remote UE is in RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":10060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include ng-5G-S-TMSI and fullI-RNTI in the sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":10061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE specific DRX cycle is configured by upper layer,","paragraph_zero_based":10062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE to the minimum value of UE specific Uu DRX cycles (configured by upper layer and configured by RRC);","paragraph_zero_based":10063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":10064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE to the value of UE specific DRX cycle configured by RRC;","paragraph_zero_based":10065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":10066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When entering RRC_CONNECTED, if L2 U2N remote UE had sent sl-RequestedSIB-List, sl-RequestedPosSIB-List, and/or sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE, the L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":10067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-RequestedSIB-List to the value release if requested before;","paragraph_zero_based":10068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-RequestedPosSIB-List to the value release if requested before;","paragraph_zero_based":10069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE to the value release if sent before;","paragraph_zero_based":10070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":10071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon any change in the need of SFN-DFN offset while in RRC_CONNECTED, the L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":10072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE needs the SFN-DFN offset based on the request from upper layers and the connected L2 U2N relay UE set sfn-DFN-OffsetSupported to supported:","paragraph_zero_based":10073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set sl-SFN-DFN-OffsetRequested to true;","paragraph_zero_based":10074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":10075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED shall:","paragraph_zero_based":10076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is configured with sl-IndirectPathAddChange set to setup, and not configured with split SRB1 with duplication:","paragraph_zero_based":10077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include connectionForMP;","paragraph_zero_based":10078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":10079}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c3ad73d3b0cd3ba74083a516dd4154780730fb08df313c358d961c5194092838","0cc4977c5068ece25187f34d1f8e5f14731b1d3b7cf60302ca8a0091a06f5b4d","1462df0bb52958814e83b238817ba9485d7c29209b570da0a6bcfa6c9aebae2a","ab5854734304d72632d41f499e18e10b9960123f750cedfe8bad3f9f0c1143be","6745b0ed87ef94622b587eb5bedaa7d306b9331cca200a88c30f972ccad028f2","0bf1843cdc173b5cd59e0d08d7e4b6005b53de37f2add3d6da46218a9725ba1c","36f860ffb55931aae441a924104ff29da458db78bd5f560cd885f0661cd19159","d2e6fb13eae035f8204a536b630157bd2b6afe3129e219c9f3bb3ff96f68ddf1","60b1fd9ac61a82cd351f19212a7613c49fe46c5dd3d47a0a1cc518ba35334ebb","4fb3f9d3e9b9a5495803f1005c8e966a06f0b01c79e35646f42c5465747c3e3b","e2069f76fbc8c4f7164636f6968d7049dd194188a9de0a6b9c3645fc7eacbc51","b9e78c34a6bff3339b050d11a4a3384fd5963e6fd296338408814039299ad290","18845fffb655efb253086bfec0b63487f58ec2bfbecc2634571b3a98b3689e82","a1bfddf0911e67b025e632a9bc3e16fa0d8cf8de8cfba0494af97f1b92335c7c","846f3a3f6077a0d358dbd3333737679798dceff242ef25e8b22ed3400516acff","e202077b9ef51d75e93816f61045ac9f32db8875a566c817ea72f5912eebd3ee","40bc0b093d4975896940e40a592d1e15302fd18a077fcd89269712e6dc7755a4","c2f63e1859dcaa76d1298c5ccd8cd1170adab7a86dd1e73226e4121227d97660","315ca3b316e4c6f7e211f8112e9e098b790c7f15a4f9c37bf721cf5f163f184e","6e75a60b3b04ce6603e7510a2c5915336f1df1c166af468c6338130c5f552327","38244affdad24de34c6134b134a1feb391c47ea7c8e33297d4940ab942a57a6a","5cf38e75012465a8077886c767459d3bbf7d61ee3e76bc3e2616a5314eeb1583","81d0cf2985df93aae34c9660ab85f12c96e21ae8d91ce59ac220807e60b77d74","856ba204bdcdcd33d9009f391746f6c068bc37db0c64207f441b3f986e21ac2c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[10056,10079],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p10056"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2U Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":10080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon end-to-end PC5-RRC connection release; or","paragraph_zero_based":10081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon end-to-end PC5-RRC connection failure due to T400 expiry or integrity check failure of SL-SRB2 or SL-SRB3:","paragraph_zero_based":10082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include sl-DestinationIdentityRemoteUE-r18;","paragraph_zero_based":10083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":10084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.8.3Reception of RemoteUEInformationSidelink message by the L2 U2N/U2U Relay UE","paragraph_zero_based":10085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":10086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RemoteUEInformationSidelink includes the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE:","paragraph_zero_based":10087},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED on an active BWP with common search space configured including pagingSearchSpace; or","paragraph_zero_based":10088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":10089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":10090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>monitor the Paging message at the L2 U2N Remote UE's paging occasion calculated according to sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE and sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE included in sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":10091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE is set to release):","paragraph_zero_based":10092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop monitoring the Paging message at the L2 U2N Remote UE's paging occasion;","paragraph_zero_based":10093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the received paging information in sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":10094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED on an active BWP without pagingSearchSpace configured):","paragraph_zero_based":10095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":10096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the received sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE in SidelinkUEInformationNR message and perform Sidelink UE information transmission in accordance with 5.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":10097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE is set to release):","paragraph_zero_based":10098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to release the sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE in SidelinkUEInformationNR message in accordance with 5.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":10099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the received paging information in sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":10100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RemoteUEInformationSidelink includes the sl-RequestedSIB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":10101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-RequestedSIB-List is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":10102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the L2 U2N Relay UE has not stored a valid version of SIB(s) indicated in sl-RequestedSIB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":10103}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["77c1abf595efbd53e0731f