{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field21                           InformationElement11           OPTIONAL,  -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":10944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":10945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":10946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":10947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":10948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":10949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The handling of need codes as specified in the previous implies that:","paragraph_zero_based":10950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-if field1 in RRCMessage-IEs is absent, UE does not modify or take action on any child fields configured within field1 (regardless of their need codes);","paragraph_zero_based":10951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-if field2 in RRCMessage-IEs is absent, UE releases the field2 (and also its child field field21);","paragraph_zero_based":10952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-if field1 or field2 in RRCMessage-IEs is present, UE retains or releases their child fields according to the child field presence conditions;","paragraph_zero_based":10953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-if field1 in RRCMessage-IEs is present but the extension group containing field13 and field14 is absent, the UE releases field13 but does not modify field14;","paragraph_zero_based":10954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-if nonCriticalExtension defined by IE RRCMessage-v1570-IEs is absent, the UE does not modify field3 but releases field4;","paragraph_zero_based":10955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6.1.3General rules","paragraph_zero_based":10956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In the ASN.1 of this specification, the first bit of a bit string refers to the leftmost bit, unless stated otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":10957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of a list not using ToAddModList and ToReleaseList structure, the UE shall delete all entries of the list currently in the UE configuration before applying the received list and shall consider each entry as newly created. This applies also to lists whose size is extended (i.e. with a second list structure in the ASN.1 comprising additional entries), unless otherwise specified. This implies that Need M should not be used for fields in the entries of these lists; if used, UE will handle such fields equivalent to a Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":10958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6.2RRC messages","paragraph_zero_based":10959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6.2.1General message structure","paragraph_zero_based":10960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NR-RRC-Definitions","paragraph_zero_based":10961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This ASN.1 segment is the start of the NR RRC PDU definitions.","paragraph_zero_based":10962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":10963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NR-RRC-DEFINITIONS-START","paragraph_zero_based":10964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":10965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-RRC-Definitions DEFINITIONS AUTOMATIC TAGS ::=","paragraph_zero_based":10966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":10967}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["49ebf8b5fc503c7aa99c6c6e93e7b772c9f582996443432e8eed23d624d79e58","a6e66eb1bd2ab78dd29e42e189287cf38b4bd3fb33ee8f1483db73ac37ff44a5","16a743002b0df555f8a8a37266d2e6711a0