{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    outOfCoverage     NULL,","paragraph_zero_based":11808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    eventL1           SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":11809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        l1-Threshold      MeasTriggerQuantity,","paragraph_zero_based":11810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        hysteresis        Hysteresis,","paragraph_zero_based":11811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        timeToTrigger     TimeToTrigger","paragraph_zero_based":11812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    },","paragraph_zero_based":11813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":11814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":11815},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":11816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-LOGGEDMEASUREMENTCONFIGURATION-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":11817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":11818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":11819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"LoggedMeasurementConfiguration field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":11820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"absoluteTimeInfo","paragraph_zero_based":11821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the absolute time in the current cell.","paragraph_zero_based":11822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"areaConfiguration","paragraph_zero_based":11823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Used to restrict the area in which the UE performs measurement logging to cells broadcasting any of the included cell identities, the included tracking area codes/ frequencies, the included PNI-NPN identities or the SNPN identities. If areaConfiguration-r17 is present, the UE shall ignore areaConfiguration-r16. The areaConfiguration-v1800 is a non-critical extension of areaConfiguration-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":11824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"earlyMeasIndication","paragraph_zero_based":11825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If included, the field indicates the UE is allowed to log measurements on early measurement related frequencies in logged measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":11826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eventType","paragraph_zero_based":11827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The value outOfCoverage indicates the UE to perform logging of measurements when the UE enters any cell selection state, and the value eventL1 indicates the UE to perform logging of measurements when the triggering condition (similar as event A2 as specified in 5.5.4.3) as configured in the event is met for the camping cell in camped normally state.","paragraph_zero_based":11828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"plmn-IdentityList","paragraph_zero_based":11829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates a set of PLMNs defining when the UE performs measurement logging as well as the associated status indication and information retrieval i.e. the UE performs these actions when the RPLMN is part of this set of PLMNs.","paragraph_zero_based":11830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sigLoggedMeasType","paragraph_zero_based":11831}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f9ea6d988c48ade890442b24be037e5aabc3579d2357ba51bf321bd990222b55","f31004e97cf0bbbecd587f15f76f81354e3b9cbf45236717c08a4defdf82eaad","9c0f47aa109e4b1a0f7f54eca71ea74697665cc14c3fea8c3cee56c8010ddba2","aa72f9e09f9c90df0274c934bbb86bfd1d0e34486e7ebe125a92fd706f02705a","61be6a30796e036a68f9df76eaa7598555bba872dd9c59e2fb703c3c623b0ddc","3762cbe934f6bc1a23f9f058b4053c8f