ceList-r17                 OPTIONAL,","paragraph_zero_based":11898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    lateNonCriticalExtension          OCTET STRING                        OPTIONAL,","paragraph_zero_based":11899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nonCriticalExtension              MBSInterestIndication-v1800         OPTIONAL","paragraph_zero_based":11900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":11901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":11902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBSInterestIndication-v1800 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":11903}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7fdbf78623c30b40dacb7469e4323a80bece6acd87ff21b17eda8cb3a74d32ca","67c6c228aac819d5da59de88ff58d884198fac1a7c40f61f33df02e73682f2d9","9a8cc01830460b5f9791dc8202ae5f4abb7e307c5c89bda5cd27d70cf77c0ee1","d91f8fb0fe2d9dd061061f0707d347fe405147f891934e16c22c0c1270620b7c","058d1a18c71a0affa4b0152cf0e48c35c929dfd588c4092ffd2acb522fa83cbd","5343a209812affe4829ad50320f541188dc181940758c420d8cdb2aacfefb96f","b5ed10b796ce02dd5a46036aab8c5cfdf37d5b5994dbebbaa027b0c884da3eb9","e0a789bd0cd7cdbfcb8078a2f9a1c058b3cfc8453943a5e14a14360ee2a13679","ca6c2e629f39cbe642dd1b376a65754524c45a56c326f4d41713927335c8b4ec","d2b948dc6a68f82f6e8547102339b2201fecad63aa94cd8a80489902d1db1a37","691ec60be5c941881b11c60ecc97d7084de564415b429e16fd550102b0f9b697","bbc91dfb7b2319e3f4ae6acb1cbd5c07073b41b04050a5547f7eaab4dff972b1","0e123050015cf91882bd2a6a6032cc2479dc54b5f30c00f8c17611a180433f91","15b327d4f041eb6673e25bb8c6b32ce33a998e2170838609e67d47d257810b0b","bb16627072ca244d2e2f811df76c423e4c024861ba5256380fe5b7162f856cbd","58c03eaf4c977fe2dfd08dfa908a23fef12e0956432adfff9239238ba04e2b79","e696c5b83e2e90511f25c911129b4d3b42ecb447d961f9b2a4305c0e85d15bda","6f83b2fa0cee767cce4f559b8bff4ea0be5884f708204f4d39bac9d520e283fb","925c196e90941679eafed55d2f95ff0ee261a5eb4090eb88b327f7797315fd2e","3a433d68d7f9b94ca58618e547a7055760e33f05c4e42eb7bdeac683051c006d","3e1d92e43b02ebf79f01ac741e476f650ec3640186e71f4822b42ae61e4904e2","e35c27a38f38de06f8102709ba5eda8cd7059d2e9df3444e1fc29a663420de16","f1c9fbf8f6df4c52be9136467142ff4838f8814d187d95f4635b5e9905f9ba04","8f308a28baabbd4a14b393a7cba494f47e019ac45c1f3b4e192d332f8b10c403"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[11880,11903],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p11880"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    mbs-NonServingInfoList-r18        MBS-NonServingInfoList-r18          OPTIONAL,","paragraph_zero_based":11904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nonCriticalExtension              SEQUENCE {}                         OPTIONAL","paragraph_zero_based":11905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":11906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":11907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MBSINTERESTINDICATION-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":11908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":11909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":11910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBSInterestIndication field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":11911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mbs-FreqList","paragraph_zero_based":11912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of MBS frequencies on which the UE is receiving or interested to receive MBS broadcast service via a broadcast MRB.","paragraph_zero_based":11913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mbs-NonServingInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":11914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates information for MBS broadcast reception on the non-serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":11915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mbs-Priority","paragraph_zero_based":11916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE prioritises MBS broadcast reception above unicast and MBS multicast reception. The field is present (i.e. value true), if the UE prioritises reception of broadcast services, on frequencies indicated in mbs-FreqList, above a reception of any of the unicast bearers and multicast MRBs. Otherwise the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":11917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mbs-ServiceList","paragraph_zero_based":11918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of MBS broadcast services which the UE is receiving or interested to receive.","paragraph_zero_based":11919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":11920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MBSMulticastConfiguration","paragraph_zero_based":11921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MBSMulticastConfiguration message contains the control information applicable for MBS multicast services transmitted via multicast MRBs for RRC_INACTIVE UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":11922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Signalling radio bearer: N/A","paragraph_zero_based":11923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-SAP: UM","paragraph_zero_based":11924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Logical channel: multicast MCCH","paragraph_zero_based":11925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Direction: Network to UE","paragraph_zero_based":11926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBSMulticastConfiguration message","paragraph_zero_based":11927}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["62b559efda79664e071a625c9461db39d93db9f5f4df9f47ee4f242736ce2940","e5006fe0da8b17945a2f8218e7e54a5618f79f12035cd117c563ca0e4c9a9e70","9f25bb430cb3d403feb54730808d825fda9e28e590b4ce3f6249fd6eb61f52a0","016a44500c3d7ea9e9fc77b043abf6d9595645bc793e8a082d40e7e07a42f10c","f39c50254ab913dbb92b47e864cc4023344d9048be14f6e6b10f606ea5ed98ab","24408b9878bd361c69cf82b50868718e01d27681d2c49f131fe3e0e2496899f4","2f6f7c99e14ea220044412044cf711b42398da78d0c56e4fcdd67cd9f46400bb","7286e3cfae7dd7373e7640efeccdc5123c133f6ead89159ad2a428c4c0f67b84","764fdf53d0c728d898e0ac718f7382f8662722a5b145562a5da381c3f7a1b692","87d41087a4b52b038f256cc6c257565f5b2017acea69b58b39af0071c149c253","8