{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"appLayerSessionStatus","paragraph_zero_based":12120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that an application layer measurement session in the application layer starts or ends. For application layer measurements applicable to RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, the UE transmits appLayerSessionStatus upon transfer to RRC_CONNECTED if transmissionOfSessionStartStop is set to true for the application layer measurement configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":12121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measReportAppLayerContainer","paragraph_zero_based":12122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field contains the application layer measurement report container, see Annex L (normative) in TS 26.247 [68], clause 16.5 in TS 26.114 [69] and TS 26.118 [70].","paragraph_zero_based":12123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measReportAppLayerContainerList","paragraph_zero_based":12124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field contains a list of application layer measurement report containers for each measConfigAppLayerId, see Annex L (normative) in TS 26.247 [68], clause 16.5 in TS 26.114 [69] and TS 26.118 [70].","paragraph_zero_based":12125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ran-VisibleMeasurements","paragraph_zero_based":12126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field contains the RAN visible application layer measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":12127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":12128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RAN-VisibleMeasurements field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":12129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"appLayerBufferLevelList","paragraph_zero_based":12130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field indicates a list of application layer buffer levels, and each AppLayerBufferLevel indicates the application layer buffer level in ms. Value 0 corresponds to 0ms, value 1 corresponds to 10ms, value 2 corresponds to 20 ms and so on. If the buffer level is larger than the maximum value of 30000 (5 minutes), the UE reports 30000.","paragraph_zero_based":12131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"playoutDelayForMediaStartup","paragraph_zero_based":12132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the application layer playout delay for media start-up in ms. Value 0 corresponds to 0ms, value 1 corresponds to 1ms, value 2 corresponds to 2 ms and so on. If the playout delay for media start-up is larger than the maximum value of 30000ms, the UE reports 30000.","paragraph_zero_based":12133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"pdu-SessionIdList","paragraph_zero_based":12134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of PDU session identities and QoS flow identities per PDU session associated with the application data flows subject to the RAN visible application layer measurements. If pdu-SessionIdListExt-v1800 is present, it contains the same number of entries, listed in the same order as in pdu-SessionIdList-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":12135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":12136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MIB","paragraph_zero_based":12137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MIB includes the system information transmitted on BCH.","paragraph_zero_based":12138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Signalling radio bearer: N/A","paragraph_zero_based":12139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-SAP: TM","paragraph_zero_based":12140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Logical channel: BCCH","paragraph_zero_based":12141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Direction: Network to UE","paragraph_zero_based":12142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MIB","paragraph_zero_based":12143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f