ency is configured in both FreqPriorityListNR and FreqPriorityListDedicatedSlicing, the frequency is only counted once.","paragraph_zero_based":13142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cnType","paragraph_zero_based":13143},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate that the UE is redirected to EPC or 5GC.","paragraph_zero_based":13144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"deprioritisationReq","paragraph_zero_based":13145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the current frequency or RAT is to be de-prioritised.","paragraph_zero_based":13146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"deprioritisationTimer","paragraph_zero_based":13147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the period for which either the current carrier frequency or NR is deprioritised. Value minN corresponds to N minutes.","paragraph_zero_based":13148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measIdleConfig","paragraph_zero_based":13149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates measurement configuration to be stored and used by the UE while in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":13150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mpsPriorityIndication","paragraph_zero_based":13151}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["734c460808a501ee494e82114d1efd06165bf7a3acde59620fee0fda27d7afc9","79b1f9cd676783ff87d75593414678c6f537bfa67609336d1bf6446bb16eaa26","ef0f110f13d6c227f92d57a96f7d67ebf3a452f8a8afbcb9a0002440bf30c3f9","5e2d36f8cf64a6e0b88bee0e20a03e2aee048617d8331465fd694e89761dcf3a","43fef248e4b7ebb2ce9385343f22c939a27acb2526614324a21788d5bc1c956e","f84edc254bdab3fbff128341f4b6edc83cb12c1c64a50dfd44be0f4916b2280d","654e5b46fa3273bd55fb0493fdfedcb77566bf9a29b86701307770a055422000","3f67f6ff86