{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 is present:","paragraph_zero_based":13824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The UE generates a list of concatenated SI messages by appending the SI messages containing type1 SIB configured by schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 to the SI messages configured by schedulingInfoList in si-SchedulingInfo.","paragraph_zero_based":13825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-According to the order of entry in the list of concatenated SI messages, first bit corresponds to first/leftmost listed SI message, second bit corresponds to second listed SI message, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":13826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"requestedPosSI-List","paragraph_zero_based":13827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains a list of requested SI messages which are configured by posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo and schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 (if present) in SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":13828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 is not present:","paragraph_zero_based":13829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-According to the order of entry in the list of SI messages configured by posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo in SIB1, first bit corresponds to first/leftmost listed SI message, second bit corresponds to second listed SI message, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":13830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 is present:","paragraph_zero_based":13831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The UE creates a list of concatenated SI messages by appending the SI messages containing type2 SIB configured by schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 to the SI messages configured by posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo.","paragraph_zero_based":13832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-According to the order of entry in the list of concatenated SI messages, first bit corresponds to first/leftmost listed SI message, second bit corresponds to second listed SI message, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":13833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":13834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SCGFailureInformation","paragraph_zero_based":13835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The SCGFailureInformation message is used to provide information regarding NR SCG failures detected by the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":13836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Signalling radio bearer: SRB1","paragraph_zero_based":13837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-SAP: AM","paragraph_zero_based":13838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Logical channel: DCCH","paragraph_zero_based":13839},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Direction: UE to Network","paragraph_zero_based":13840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCGFailureInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":13841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":13842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SCGFAILUREINFORMATION-START","paragraph_zero_based":13843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":13844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCGFailureInformation ::=                   SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":13845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    criticalExtensions                           CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":13846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        scgFailureInformation                        SCGFailureInformation-IEs,","paragraph_zero_based":13847}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_s