{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PerHop-QoS-InfoList","paragraph_zero_based":14640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used by L2 U2U Remote UE to indicate a list of split QoS info for the first hop.","paragraph_zero_based":14641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PerSLRB-QoS-InfoList","paragraph_zero_based":14642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used by L2 U2U Relay UE to indicate a list of split QoS info for the second hop in per-SLRB level, with each entry in accordance with an end-to-end SLRB.","paragraph_zero_based":14643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-U2U-Identity","paragraph_zero_based":14644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is to identify an end-to-end PC5 link. For a L2 U2U Remote UE acting as source UE it includes sl-TargetUE-Identity to indicate the target L2 U2U Remote UE on the second hop, and for a L2 U2U Relay UE, it includes sl-SourceUE-Identity to indicate the source L2 U2U Remote UE on the first hop.","paragraph_zero_based":14645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SystemInformation","paragraph_zero_based":14647},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The SystemInformation message is used to convey one or more System Information Blocks or Positioning System Information Blocks. All the SIBs or posSIBs included are transmitted with the same periodicity.","paragraph_zero_based":14648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Signalling radio bearer: N/A","paragraph_zero_based":14649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-SAP: TM","paragraph_zero_based":14650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Logical channels: BCCH","paragraph_zero_based":14651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Direction: Network to UE","paragraph_zero_based":14652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SystemInformation 