{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PRS-Priority-r18                   INTEGER (1..8)                                                            OPTIONAL,","paragraph_zero_based":15096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PRS-DelayBudget-r18                INTEGER (0..1023)                                                         OPTIONAL,","paragraph_zero_based":15097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PRS-Bandwidth-r18                  ENUMERATED {mhz5, mhz10, mhz15, mhz20, mhz25, mhz30, mhz35, mhz40,","paragraph_zero_based":15098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                      mhz45, mhz50, mhz60, mhz70, mhz80, mhz90, mhz100}             OPTIONAL,","paragraph_zero_based":15099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":15100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":15102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"--Editor's Note: sl-PRS-Priority and sl-PRS-DelayBudgetis FFS.","paragraph_zero_based":15103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-UEASSISTANCEINFORMATION-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":15105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":15106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UEAssistanceInformation field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":15108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"activeDuration","paragraph_zero_based":15109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the UE's preferred active duration to resolve the IDC problem. Value in multiples of 1/32 ms (subMilliSeconds) or in ms (milliSecond). For the latter, value ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, value ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":15110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"affectedBandwidth","paragraph_zero_based":15111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the bandwidth around the center frequency of the carrier frequency range which is affected by the IDC problem. Value mhz5 corresponds to 5 MHz, value mhz10 corresponds to 10 MHz and so on. If candidateBandwidth is not configured, the UE is allowed to report the frequency range for any bandwidth as indicated by affectedBandwidth, within the frequency band limitation as defined in TS 38.101-1 [15], TS 38.101-2 [39], TS 38.101-3 [34] and TS 38.101-5 [75].","paragraph_zero_based":15112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"affectedCarrierFreqList","paragraph_zero_based":15113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates a list of NR carrier frequencies that are affected by IDC problem.","paragraph_zero_based":15114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"affectedCarrierFreqRangeList","paragraph_zero_based":15115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates a list of NR carrier frequency ranges that are affected by IDC problem.","paragraph_zero_based":15116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"affectedCarrierFreqCombList","paragraph_zero_based":15117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates a list of NR carrier frequency combinations that are affected by IDC problems due to Inter-Modulation Distortion and harmonics from NR when configured with UL CA or NR-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":15118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"affectedCarrierFreqRangeCombList","paragraph_zero_based":15119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["dfc35c146f9e7ceaca550aae6a6be03a936980f2ce3dfe3508c2cd113baaa09c","8be02b2f498cd90d51764f550