SPONSE-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":15932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":15933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UEInformationResponse-IEs field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":15935}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["55128bbf48403e3be4f62ad91190a9ecb104792ebbc7831711a519349f794cc8","3d99df01ac1dabe7e9f2ce971d1aba7ea6a89462c0d20899d1fe3e2650c47573","93aef06fa6c553b27260620bbefc21fb13175fd4f161f71bbcf0a49c5d8c4e04","55bd5340e5a2589162c99660890b377c4d55100914f8906d52692d5e5a0f817b","711279b324a0f70dee81b75e139553bef59faf7bf32b01b348c5ffc204e23a6d","b4bce77eccb3c108fd41fe6fa97b4950cd058415982eff22f509fa5ea5d81494","8ae57346ac542701361c04d4ba3f5b77a9a62716e91a964b1106e2f41976c650","3a0c39dca084a0f289d7fd35c7ded19af362905c6d251956038c2e9d5443b649","73bf5de355d5035ec581acf2e4c2bb3b314219720b94474b211fc3f7c151ee5d","cae638f64c9398b49b75fb60f417600b24460f3cd1eb71fa7e6f06dcb7b38981","34e9d608f9fb77b8b5f431a11f548e772082d9494f864d1c60537a3c69948868","fe3f0d5e5682e339cb6baa13fec46cdbe815da8ebf5edf121c27bcc03da2d63b","b83d9acb5ac6cf01f217c7b647336137baf30c3938622bbe054d659020980880","2d4528bfe97e91e5880919a879b4acb17630b75a914e7c959d9d2003e928ba7a","f80b7bc2a6418b6900bd74d4df735f7e086e96a08515e21b1b55fba74194ae9d","de04899da5c5527f27fcb14ee3b6da8b58ef6bd16887240deb4cdd687ffa63df","b8a474b23ba968a3c7a5a7570ce8f2b9974fd4f71058e01d6fdd7e1fb2a0151b","6e9847d334e75d1a60d4b1bc1c95fb15062023dfe97a26ba94dd4010d950d617","d3343ef5ad603f635c542ecd9c4e424eeff6604ae8526d77929070b8c3062f62","0baf5d9e0af8017394b21f8e37bf74f84e167caf9bd65b69937dac51e144ea1e","c166f1a34037ff0c53968b82a39cff01a51357cce7095ebc90072040fa6400c5","4538960799c1977add657f1f3c9d769077efca5fffc2cdc496b9b08ddeda81cb","16b44146541720dff6c2de4dfb3ca9964ca00ca443da09add637623d8826cc4f","208a8af0a804b9a97b53f1ff5c970b30d649b6ebb54f347e39865ec1048686bf"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[15912,15935],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p15912"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"coarseLocationInfo","paragraph_zero_based":15936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter type Ellipsoid-Point defined in TS 37.355 [49]. The first/leftmost bit of the first octet contains the most significant bit. The least significant bits of degreesLatitude and degreesLongitude are set to 0 to meet the accuracy requirement corresponds to a granularity of approximately 2 km.","paragraph_zero_based":15937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is up to UE implementation how many LSBs are set to 0 to meet the accuracy requirement.","paragraph_zero_based":15938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"connEstFailReport","paragraph_zero_based":15939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to provide connection establishment failure or connection resume failure information.","paragraph_zero_based":15940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"connEstFailReportList","paragraph_zero_based":15941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to provide the list of connEstFailReport that are stored by the UE for the past up to maxCEFReport-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":15942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"flightPathInfoReport","paragraph_zero_based":15943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to provide the flight path information as list of waypoints and, if available, corresponding timestamps. List of size zero indicates the previously provided flight path information is no longer valid.","paragraph_zero_based":15944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"logMeasReport","paragraph_zero_based":15945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to provide the measurement results stored by the UE associated to logged MDT. ","paragraph_zero_based":15946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultIdleEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":15947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"EUTRA measurement results performed during RRC_INACTIVE or RRC_IDLE.","paragraph_zero_based":15948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultIdleNR","paragraph_zero_based":15949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR measurement results performed during RRC_INACTIVE or RRC_IDLE.","paragraph_zero_based":15950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ra-ReportList","paragraph_zero_based":15951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to provide the list of RA reports that is stored by the UE for the past upto maxRAReport-r16 number of successful random access procedures, or failed or successful completion of on-demand system information request procedure. If the UE is an eRedCap UE, this field is used to provide the list of RA reports that is stored by the UE for the past up to 2 number of successful random access procedures, or failed or successful completion of on-demand system information request procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":15952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rlf-Report","paragraph_zero_based":15953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to indicate the RLF report related contents.","paragraph_zero_based":15954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"successHO-Report","paragraph_zero_based":15955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to provide the successful handover report if triggered based on the successful handover configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":15956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"successPSCell-Report","paragraph_zero_based":15957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to provide the successful PSCell change or addition report if triggered based on the successful PSCell change or addition report configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":15958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15959}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ee223250f0b1f5b5adb40f171eb1351dd2b31f0f18994d78ad0b1be94a34805c","44e579b7def41f2cf6b61a2eb10119a7616050653809b1c2a936abaa8716c3c1","e288ffbbfa10730287a5eb0dad9e81bd3072b1b20da7a0ad89571e872c45be6a","c62c1f14db12eab9e1ab25c6504535258cbd9b6aa55a237b009ad852e3f014a5","7125b4393dcee735f27b84361823d77a15633c45363972f8bf6fda68def1dc3a","6ec1476e55ced9c435b82650fb343808048ac9d44415d6b27093b0808fc2095a","55ef3a3081fa29aa7c0a7fba42ae3bfc1a1d9cd91cbde21585b6d2ce927fb5af","8314e98111c173475bfaf6672bb71f978e6349dae1208be343f6efe47fa413c0","d2aac73a93184ec0e03ea2e4d5409332b3ed0565be9f896cb046a63174ccfd69","3549b82e4d057a0bdd7c8e4d6059f5a894419debaf3c55a7e485d1bff34a7fe5","439871d272d82df697c89ba58150d0dd200e815232948596a216f858b7c6cf25","840a3dc39d257e63f5b585f7257f0b42b4b48f3513c8fde7d53fc17e15e15a82","9d75fa49edf5fc87df83e4a2f674ab8f9c7d0f5c0b684b089795e75ef5482a8c","ed3b5442f3e4dd3d770bce0b65e715556e8b6adae29d195c6584317916eca12a","4040001a39504d376b89c04205fb2958f4aacf5243962709f53d6e02be8b9970","74c970cd00002408dbdcab3d02ed2eb721678d3040509d7f0f6b5a95ceab20ab","909abb14c4de8431fc7d9036512cb9263998c6a889670082c2752f322347089e","fac19e22cac1507e557b8962468565739cc0246aa6b809723625814532579398","568a0980f7267e7caf49bbae5ed4b268a037f70dac85d61e0ad1dd055e45e71f","743505dd0561ac2f5c4cda919f0273cad726fe9a28cf3a9b057d90cefa3287bc","99ec8025c38d7c6ed9eacc26760d8736e40b4d642e2449feeb5ca261fbe69e42","8cbb9d33c79e9123ea80e8bfe73d43dce174df6f95b36a2b17984452125d0be8","9209e60dbd3d2808675d2e932e6da6b085f0c82c8bb04c75f161a6371595e8dc","c34d42e1034cd61fb781c7df0e224b77c7697db54e18dc429f41d1caf4281522"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[15936,15959],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p15936"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"LogMeasReport field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":15960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"absoluteTimeStamp","paragraph_zero_based":15961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the absolute time when the logged measurement configuration logging is provided, as indicated by NR within absoluteTimeInfo.","paragraph_zero_based":15962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"anyCellSelectionDetected","paragraph_zero_based":15963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to indicate the detection of any cell selection state, as defined in TS 38.304 [20]. The UE sets this field when performing the logging of measurement results in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE and there is no suitable cell or no acceptable cell.","paragraph_zero_based":15964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"inDeviceCoexDetected","paragraph_zero_based":15965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that measurement logging is suspended due to IDC problem detection.","paragraph_zero_based":15966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultServingCell","paragraph_zero_based":15967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field refers to the log measurement results taken in the Serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":15968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"numberOfGoodSSB","paragraph_zero_based":15969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the number of good beams (beams that are above absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation, if configured by the network) associated to the cells within the R value range (which is configured by network for cell reselection) of the highest ranked cell as part of the beam level measurements. If the UE has no SSB of a neighbour cell whose measurement quantity is above the absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation or if the network has not configured the absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation, then the UE does not include numberOfGoodSSB for the corresponding neighbour cell. If the UE has no SSB of the serving cell whose measurement quantity is above the absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation or if the network has not configured the absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation, then the UE shall set the numberOfGoodSSB for the serving cell to one.","paragraph_zero_based":15970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"relativeTimeStamp","paragraph_zero_based":15971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the time of logging measurement results, measured relative to the absoluteTimeStamp. Value in seconds.","paragraph_zero_based":15972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"tce-Id","paragraph_zero_based":15973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter Trace Collection Entity Id: See TS 32.422 [52].","paragraph_zero_based":15974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"traceRecordingSessionRef","paragraph_zero_based":15975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter Trace Recording Session Reference: See TS 32.422 [52].","paragraph_zero_based":15976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ConnEstFailReport field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":15978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultFailedCell","paragraph_zero_based":15979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field refers to the last measurement results taken in the cell, where connection establishment failure or connection resume failure happened.","paragraph_zero_based":15980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultNeighCells","paragraph_zero_based":15981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field refers to the neighbour cell measurements when connection establishment failure or connection resume failure happened.","paragraph_zero_based":15982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"numberOfConnFail","paragraph_zero_based":15983}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates