iteria for a UE to detect that it is not at cell edge while stationary, in order to relax measurement requirements for cell reselection (see TS 38.304 [20], clause 5.2.4.9.4).","paragraph_zero_based":16528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cellEquivalentSize","paragraph_zero_based":16529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The number of cell count used for mobility state estimation for this cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":16530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cellReselectionInfoCommon","paragraph_zero_based":16531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Cell re-selection information common for intra-frequency, inter-frequency and/ or inter-RAT cell re-selection.","paragraph_zero_based":16532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cellReselectionServingFreqInfo","paragraph_zero_based":16533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Information common for non-intra-frequency cell re-selection i.e. cell re-selection to inter-frequency and inter-RAT cells.","paragraph_zero_based":16534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"combineRelaxedMeasCondition","paragraph_zero_based":16535}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a758da1e3ffcc76b99407ca0aedf0924228b386fec84d7be5e84493db2deb523","d01b976651e626192bdd6ea734c951a549590ec995b79e80dccb3470628b7c5b","03ea74096ead831abae0b357ea78324b75ba25f958edf81a0da51a1fa363f1dd","e04ea1a6339940750fce917e56a8bb70696f4c769925ee466c2d8e2ce1f54d6a","05a7f9a98cb33ca7658239aed2da091a3f00621f1e4f58a5400f96439f0eb691","7b3c43cb68cd1bb07529ef2078dc6d1851b0904793866403efebb98afaee896c","b10be2595fc5182a999d61fb877d2bbc774d2b9be42c6ff7d9265298956d22e5","357f9d110753f95f7e8ecc82792a3c09390f81e606d0b564c66eb85371260691","2f7edc37ff