{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SIB5-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SIB5 field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":17043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"carrierFreqListEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":17044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of carrier frequencies of E-UTRA. If the carrierFreqListEUTRA-v1610/ carrierFreqListEUTRA-v1700/ carrierFreqListEUTRA-v1800 is present, it shall contain the same number of entries, listed in the same order as in the carrierFreqListEUTRA (without suffix).","paragraph_zero_based":17045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dummy","paragraph_zero_based":17046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is not used in the specification. If received it shall be ignored by the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":17047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eutra-ExcludedCellList","paragraph_zero_based":17048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of exclude-listed E-UTRA neighbouring cells.","paragraph_zero_based":17049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eutra-FreqNeighHSDN-CellList","paragraph_zero_based":17050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of neighbouring EUTRA HSDN cells as specified in TS 36.304 [27].","paragraph_zero_based":17051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eutra-multiBandInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":17052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of frequency bands in addition to the band represented by carrierFreq for which cell reselection parameters are common, and a list of additionalPmax and additionalSpectrumEmission values, as defined in TS 36.101 [22], table 6.2.4-1, for the frequency bands in eutra-multiBandInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":17053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"highSpeedEUTRACarrier","paragraph_zero_based":17054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the field is present, the UE shall apply the enhanced NR-EUTRA inter-RAT measurement requirements to support high speed up to 500 km/h as specified in TS 38.133 [14] to the E-UTRA carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":17055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"idleModeMeasVoiceFallback","paragraph_zero_based":17056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether E-UTRA idle/inactive measurements and reporting for EPS fallback can be used.","paragraph_zero_based":17057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"p-MaxEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":17058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The maximum allowed transmission power in dBm on the (uplink) carrier frequency, see TS 36.304 [27].","paragraph_zero_based":17059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"q-QualMin","paragraph_zero_based":17060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter \"Qqualmin\" in TS 36.304 [27]. Actual value Qqualmin = field value [dB].","paragraph_zero_based":17061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"q-QualMinOffsetCell","paragraph_zero_based":17062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter \"Qqualminoffsetcell\" in TS 36.304 [27]. Actual value Qqualminoffsetcell = field value [dB].","paragraph_zero_based":17063}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6ed9b2c2debcdd326697a8e541276a1446d2b46ddcad6340d285a81dd30d9882","3154f6bce25734abe8c1b65c54ca76a1729372fa5c1e19ca6bcdb8061e7f730e","394a4697da64173c3726d1769c712083d736dbb93c506bbf7647deca948d00fa","54d3c3159584715edf3b483db3da225d835ab81e09646c1f72b8172f97a5e609","78067faf353e242d4649026b18d62f62817b143cf74003b690cc416c2783a3dc","df72f7