{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"warningMessageSegmentNumber","paragraph_zero_based":17184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Segment number of the CMAS warning message segment contained in the SIB. A segment number of zero corresponds to the first segment, one corresponds to the second segment, and so on. If warning area coordinates are provided for the warning message, then this field applies to both warning message segment and warning area coordinates segment.","paragraph_zero_based":17185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"warningMessageSegmentType","paragraph_zero_based":17186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the included CMAS warning message segment is the last segment or not. If warning area coordinates are provided for the warning message, then this field applies to both warning message segment and warning area coordinates segment.","paragraph_zero_based":17187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":17189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":17190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Segment1","paragraph_zero_based":17191},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present in the first segment of SIB8, otherwise it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":17192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SIB9","paragraph_zero_based":17194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SIB9 contains information related to GPS time and Coordinated Universal Time (UTC). The UE may use the parameters provided in this system information block to obtain the UTC, the GPS and the local time.","paragraph_zero_based":17195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The UE may use the time information for numerous purposes, possibly involving upper layers e.g. to assist GPS initialisation, to synchronise the UE clock.","paragraph_zero_based":17196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SIB9 information element","paragraph_zero_based":17197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":17198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SIB9-START","paragraph_zero_based":17199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SIB9 ::=                            SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":17201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    timeInfo                            SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":17202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        timeInfoUTC                         INTEGER (0..549755813887),","paragraph_zero_based":17203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        dayLightSavingTime                  BIT STRING (SIZE (2))                   OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        leapSeconds                         INTEGER (-127..128)                     OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        localTimeOffset                     INTEGER (-63..64)                       OPTIONAL    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    }                                                                               OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17207}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c5fa219b67ce80c5702f1f8b3855cafecd6590339b58ace1ec5a5878fb38c83f","4e63b5f78b5460030ca12f948eafca284330d8d16747c255482241994a765740","45c52f2e5