{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    lateNonCriticalExtension            OCTET STRING                                OPTIONAL,","paragraph_zero_based":17208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":17209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":17210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    referenceTimeInfo-r16               ReferenceTimeInfo-r16                       OPTIONAL    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]],","paragraph_zero_based":17212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":17213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    eventID-TSS-r18                     INTEGER (0..63)                             OPTIONAL    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":17215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":17216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SIB9-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SIB9 field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":17221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dayLightSavingTime","paragraph_zero_based":17222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates if and how daylight-saving time (DST) is applied to obtain the local time. The semantics are the same as the semantics of the Daylight Saving Time IE in TS 24.501 [23] and TS 24.008 [38]. The first/leftmost bit of the bit string contains the b2 of octet 3 and the second bit of the bit string contains b1 of octet 3 in the value part of the Daylight Saving Time IE in TS 24.008 [38].","paragraph_zero_based":17223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eventID-TSS","paragraph_zero_based":17224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the status of the 5G access stratum time distribution parameter Clock Quality Reporting Control Information as defined in TS 23.501 [32].","paragraph_zero_based":17225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"leapSeconds","paragraph_zero_based":17226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of leap seconds offset between GPS Time and UTC. UTC and GPS time are related i.e. GPS time -leapSeconds = UTC time.","paragraph_zero_based":17227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"localTimeOffset","paragraph_zero_based":17228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Offset between UTC and local time in units of 15 minutes. Actual value = field value * 15 minutes. Local time of the day is calculated as UTC time + localTimeOffset.","paragraph_zero_based":17229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"timeInfoUTC","paragraph_zero_based":17230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Coordinated Universal Time corresponding to the SFN boundary at or immediately after the ending boundary of the SI-window in which SIB9 is transmitted. In an NTN cell, the indicated time is referenced at the uplink time synchronization reference point (RP), i.e., UE should take into account the propagation delay between UE and RP when determining the UTC time at the UE. The field counts the number of UTC seconds in 10 ms units since 00:00:00 on Gregorian calendar date 1 January, 1900 (midnight between Sunday, December 31, 1899 and Monday, January 1, 1900). See NOTE 1. This field is excluded when determining changes in system information, i.e. changes of timeInfoUTC should neither result in system information change notifications nor in a modification of valueTag in SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":17231}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["20b48b5c2772d933db41593651468bbbea7859f408e8318b22d80e52b6ec8416","54babc9c7157b7f70216500945a545cb8647e4d1e808cd70b05052a1cf5003ac","1f07398050fa03cdc7e65e0a5286d12404ac6e9ac13564cfc9504354ee9b3b81","6f4ca76fea62f7d4fbd34c5970bec5b237c0456a96dcdaae7bee2a6588264386","06ded58c624ac651318aff8002f9bfbdea4651cfa6487ba6eda767232872f62b","abda5d37d5b832b913b115b3c692be0ceea2366afc98c9d355311d1950f974a9","762a81325d3c9ec34396734e83cf486de9eecfeedfe657a5cf21b4737d2d16ee","d8698dde391b71ab370b25dcf7b67b99927f193a6adc6bfa50f4799c0c652b68","0d41344bce913989319983d87aefa0ea25a702659d248a147ad02c1e21afb4b4","a52685e0d61be06803ee04f5f5727a3c5fc3c40d2a4b4a4e25d16cd8fe3f14be","67bfb83e452cb7e27b788ccf4590eab130c1bcc0b39933741353543ac22e2663","b320f18558da229fb2593d4298d8741732462f738d792a6d31e26cebb5b5f61c","03fe058bf4f184f5c7bd77ef66f9b72560e20411047c3ce961cb09a74f5930a6","781be9ec5db385eaf04af85eca2fd37d78bf5c8297a010896bac7af632107d1c","42806f1871f5be078b4dad298af40705e0bf6666cbfabe53ff1046b3c50ecebe","904b6d56c1dbb6fe76f48c3494fc00a9591c08ba1339d2d55bc80d86732adafb","7b64c765a37246105737af4c129a08755120f6f464152973f098a8800431ca17","8d34affb40d133674dd4eae6370dce7e9f222119ef9112fccc450de29234447e","906db4b5ded7a0c769da0cc3019ec55f40544404aa4eaddaaa509e314dab9e49","0669bd5d48714b9dade3c2cc60ee518fff1620ba07bb2e132b6fefd026648e7a","cd11e0b3b75b8833f77a4a8be1e7fd083b9fab4c573e82922e958f6eb834350d","b7c3f25445cdae88900f2f19c71ce935306fc00d4ca93baf5c480b39f8a10de0","3df7f46dca0084ff5371e9aaeaf9de38e3b3dcf6107ad5440be1a03c910c1af6","323e661d793b312adc12d0a44efa00ad8386903467f545048d841efc89101d30"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[17208,17231],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for