 field identifies the sequence number of a segment of SIB23-IEs. A segment number of zero corresponds to the first segment, A segment number of one corresponds to the second segment, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":17846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"segmentType","paragraph_zero_based":17847},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates whether the included segment is the last segment or not.","paragraph_zero_based":17848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PosConfigCommonNR","paragraph_zero_based":17849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the NR sidelink positioning configuration. ","paragraph_zero_based":17850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PosConfigCommonNR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":17852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PosMeasConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":17853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the measurement configurations (e.g. RSRP) for NR sidelink positioning.","paragraph_zero_based":17854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PosNR-AnchorCarrierFreqList","paragraph_zero_based":17855}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["68916536f7fe95906066cc7c09df81c2bb4272d0f41b67b881c89d061c7a12a5","36bb3f69b929039a217231441c61532c9e3dce8921874d66c8dd3decd817d1a6","a702bb3acd5513a8d559b6ee9bb99ddc5fbc72623bddec2684663c2036ecd133","9e5630728e76c6300faadc9ce0084b9a9976b2e73278891357edbf8dfcb63671","79bb1d55ce2591dbbe872c08385898b4a2e3dc6decf6f68263b032bcde43952c","d7a65000337a9a5a76d398d3dea77182406440bc9159d2be5dce6d215e298750","d97bde7b135832fe23726a513c9dc8b00d41eb3afdbfdcec74ec30e4a1aec8f7","8ad23a67828d