{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":18528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BETAOFFSETS-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BetaOffsets field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":18533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetACK-Index1","paragraph_zero_based":18534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Up to 2 bits HARQ-ACK (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 11.","paragraph_zero_based":18535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetACK-Index2","paragraph_zero_based":18536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Up to 11 bits HARQ-ACK (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 11.","paragraph_zero_based":18537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetACK-Index3","paragraph_zero_based":18538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Above 11 bits HARQ-ACK (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 11.","paragraph_zero_based":18539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetCSI-Part1-Index1","paragraph_zero_based":18540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Up to 11 bits of CSI part 1 bits (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 13.","paragraph_zero_based":18541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetCSI-Part1-Index2","paragraph_zero_based":18542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Above 11 bits of CSI part 1 bits (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 13.","paragraph_zero_based":18543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetCSI-Part2-Index1","paragraph_zero_based":18544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Up to 11 bits of CSI part 2 bits (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 13.","paragraph_zero_based":18545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetCSI-Part2-Index2","paragraph_zero_based":18546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Above 11 bits of CSI part 2 bits (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 13.","paragraph_zero_based":18547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–BetaOffsetsCrossPri","paragraph_zero_based":18549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE BetaOffsetsCrossPri is used to configure beta-offset values for cross-priority HARQ-ACK multiplexing on PUSCH.","paragraph_zero_based":18550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BetaOffsetsCrossPri information element","paragraph_zero_based":18551}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2932996d9117da890ceaa21ee3455f3336c86d77d7199578dee83951de8c8123","3b608082f60eca28169b0ae6c73b35ea1aa544903eb21e728b6971b3caa9e666","c2e02df3fd4feccd60d1c0a7130d29e9117bbb3bb1a0b732dea19c48b2af102e","bda4fc0b88156bcf1131d1a9f02b1308ea9cf64966c3060089a20b9f01e039de","6dcb2886cb04d97bbc98e7deccca5e27a1d6522a632f6c713ac6f9f439a9e981","86dd80df45266234740ed39633b3d62083c7c9bc956c275f836fb1e602838803","aa390e25a69d6a66efde4ab3fdc5d9762183f5008b67eaa60f991491a68336eb","d6954c540314c33aa504729a78a34f7405d4a5cd5f48646e0911c0a014c3528c","d0d3348817054231a5d891096a5849778b8c259ea2ae39a235b1a99044e162a4","bab146a0519116c156c86efbd0fa11e236eda1b94c3e7705b65094fe77454c3c","b5a482331a40d6b28c9b3fcdf63