{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TD-DD-Config-r18 ::=        SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":20281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"   vectorLengthDD-r18           ENUMERATED {n1,n2,n4,n8},","paragraph_zero_based":20282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"   unitDurationDD-r18           ENUMERATED {m1,m2}                                    OPTIONAL,  -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":20283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"   aperiodicResourceOffset-r18  INTEGER(1..2)                                         OPTIONAL,  -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":20284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"   tdCQI-r18                    ENUMERATED {n11,n12,n2, spare1}                              OPTIONAL   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":20285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":20286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20287},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CODEBOOKCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":20288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":20289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CodebookConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":20291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"codebookMode","paragraph_zero_based":20292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CodebookMode as specified in TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.2 8 and 5.2.2.9.","paragraph_zero_based":20293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"codebookType","paragraph_zero_based":20294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CodebookType including possibly sub-types and the corresponding parameters for each (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.2).","paragraph_zero_based":20295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"n1-n2-codebookSubsetRestriction, n1-n2-codebookSubsetRestrictionList","paragraph_zero_based":20296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of antenna ports in first (n1) and second (n2) dimension and codebook subset restriction (see TS 38.214 [19] clause 5.2.2.2.3).","paragraph_zero_based":20297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of bits for codebook subset restriction is CEIL(log2(nchoosek(O1*O2,4)))+8*n1*n2 where nchoosek(a,b) = a!/(b!(a-b)!). The number of elements in n1-n2-codebookSubSetRestrictionList is up to the number of elements of nzp-CSI-RS-Resources in NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet(S) indicated by nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceSetList in the CSI-ResourceConfig indicated by resourcesForChannelMeasurement in the CSI-ReportConfig in which the CodebookConfig is included. Each element in n1-n2-codebookSubsetRestrictionList has same n1-n2 bitstring.","paragraph_zero_based":20298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"n1-n2","paragraph_zero_based":20299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of antenna ports in first (n1) and second (n2) dimension and codebook subset restriction (see TS 38.214 [19] clause 5.2.2.2.1).","paragraph_zero_based":20300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ng-n1-n2","paragraph_zero_based":20301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Codebook subset restriction for Type I Multi-panel codebook (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.2.2).","paragraph_zero_based":20302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"numberOfBeams","paragraph_zero_based":20303}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f902a2c1c8a79832d09227e39b93ec5e7a99f8cd7d8baa739a5191d38ec3691a","4174949ba0b6ca518b3f4c3b6b3248f0c5c6e2cd73e1942863bc02b9ac0eccbd","ae9b81e5a5e53e35394689d39ad6bac3074f866539cb43682ef409c930d1bef6","c1e38cf9b13e7d5