{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of beams, L, used for linear combination.","paragraph_zero_based":20304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"numberOfPMI-SubbandsPerCQI-Subband","paragraph_zero_based":20305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field indicates how PMI subbands are defined per CQI subband according to TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.2.5, 5.2.2.2.8 and 5.2.2.9.","paragraph_zero_based":20306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"paramCombination, paramCombination-CJT-r18, paramCombination-CJT-L-r18, paramCombination-CJT-PS-r18, paramCombination-CJT-PS-alpha, paramCombinationDoppler-r18, paramCombinationDoppler-PS-r18","paragraph_zero_based":20307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field describes supported parameter combination (M, , ) as specified in TS 38.214 [19] Clause 5.2.2. For fields paramCombination-CJT-L-r18 or paramCombination-CJT-PS-alpha  the number of elements is 1, 2 or 4, and the values are configured according to the number of nzp-CSI-RS-Resources in NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet elements from Tables 5.2.2.2.8-1 and 5.2.2.2.9-1 in TS 38.214 [19], respectively. The allowed configuration combinations for paramCombination-CJT-r18 and paramCombination-CJT-L-r18 are given in Table 5.2.2.2.8-3 in TS 38.214 [19]. The allowed configuration combinations for paramCombination-CJT-PS-r18 and paramCombination-CJT-PS-alpha-r18 are given in Table 5.2.2.2.9-3 in TS 38.214 [19].","paragraph_zero_based":20308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"phaseAlphabetSize","paragraph_zero_based":20309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The size of the PSK alphabet, QPSK or 8-PSK.","paragraph_zero_based":20310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"portSelectionSamplingSize","paragraph_zero_based":20311},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The size of the port selection codebook (parameter d), see TS 38.214 [19] clause 5.2.2.2.6.","paragraph_zero_based":20312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"predictionDelay","paragraph_zero_based":20313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prediction delay for Doppler and Doppler port selection codebooks see TS 38.214 [19], Clause 5.2.1.4. The first value m0 means that the first slot for which the CSI corresponds to is the slot where the CSI reference resource is located at.","paragraph_zero_based":20314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the other three candidate values (n0, n1, n2), then the first slot for which the CSI corresponds to is given by l= n+delta, where delta can take on values of 0, 1, 2 and n the slot in which CSI is reported.","paragraph_zero_based":20315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"restrictedCMR-Selection","paragraph_zero_based":20316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Enabling CSI-RS resource (CMR) restriction, (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.2.8)","paragraph_zero_based":20317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ri-Restriction","paragraph_zero_based":20318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Restriction for RI for TypeI-MultiPanel-RI-Restriction (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.2.2).","paragraph_zero_based":20319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subbandAmplitude","paragraph_zero_based":20320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If subband amplitude reporting is activated (true).","paragraph_zero_based":20321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"twoTX-CodebookSubsetRestriction","paragraph_zero_based":20322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Codebook subset restriction for 2TX codebook (see TS 38.214 [19] clause 5.2.2.2.1).","paragraph_zero_based":20323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeI-SinglePanel-codebookSubsetRestriction-i2","paragraph_zero_based":20324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"i2 codebook subset restriction for Type I Single-panel codebook used when reportQuantity is CRI/Ri/i1/CQI (see TS 38.214 [19] clause 5.2.2.2.1).","paragraph_zero_based":20325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeI-SinglePanel-ri-Restriction","paragraph_zero_based":20326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Restriction for RI for TypeI-SinglePanel-RI-Restriction (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.2.1).","paragraph_zero_based":20327}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["552ddbc06e9161aad3baf36a38a86b0a06883e1a30f85f284f8ded1c764fa8a6","a3f2bd378dde165fc071013dbc4aebbddd633c37b517da1ca398a465a2087798","cbbaba5ee2a894b2679c93fb869ac00f4720f8074d8fc9bc8dfd959b8bc2c690","758dbb4d35500ccece1bddadc3d65fd5a21391b87f2b7d470493b6210191936e","8a80565a39894b8b824afea003ff12c16d9c9a8dec00b830759d9e876bfc2d0b","52a2410725864f753f632f06434dd6d33bad7f8780286e297a30e51a41161213","6fecf20ec97642fe446a92c0d079b050dbcc458c3b7c1a9ed9d27ed39dcdbd95","2bf87a2da2c3c0f50e3fece8ed678fef4b26a38e5bf0cc39678aaaabc535b203","61c541ae11efc507376a7161f63153e80c3f90de49a9b68048abf7a72b4ac739","8e427d61d1a5c0117ebcfe57197872dc3230c7b9a24b8eaa7f266c87b6512c44","9d7a59a82ca8a9afcefa927c035abb7987d3ea85d3795dff2ebba714c3ddee56","a9cede4048ebc5829be2e03b34e464d90b93b881a47d0ec456bcdc8f4c38db78","b7cab0c62bd8ff06eafafde2137f7c8649b5793eefb59ab2d9ece5e78a5f974b","711aa36a98460a9be487c39f3d1f875c92f9d48748e52276415049a7182f5ff5","c68ecf99158305c7fa1d95b71dea9a3c140ce8ee8734473b80e166cab4cff55a","665ea8c29f7c5a3ecc0d12911df2b09224be6b46f25fc8243cb30683b9ac42e4","3f41fc64f81c420f53f1dfaeff38c4b9d3a6deb25a0cf0edd7a424a6aa5dc5cc","ed9cd275b7f50f68c6f26b052e5ac911bafbc8ed1bd03d81b43098917ab92836","be04bc32b4a2a2b74db46ed8bf19269b845041cce0612e83f6c5e414790cc766","e9684aea801db49c26c25bc9f73702b0e876a22cf8343c1b9af628c4b027e020","88ecb29df6afe56824c065672e84a7b677cf7d32515886e28314a12aa777a650","b62beb67c8618a6e8654b987a8782291b7625f36f48a68a3c50149af4ab641a4","810a52a4156d22004da6cdbc8b48bc2a04130ba7f31d027eeaeb91326cf874a7","f4f4047edef1e6964d779ef71fc74fd421b8ab877f4c5c5ea58dc3906c83143e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[20304,20327],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p20304"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeI-SinglePanel-Group1, typeI-SinglePanel-Group2","paragraph_zero_based":20328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configures codebooks for CSI calculation when UE is configured with two CMR Groups with CMRGroupingAndPairing in the NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet associated with the CSI-ReportConfig. Network configures the same number of ports for both codebooks.","paragraph_zero_based":20329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeI-SinglePanel-ri-RestrictionSDM, typeI-SinglePanel-ri-RestrictionSTRP","paragraph_zero_based":20330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Restriction for RI for N Resource Pairs when two CMR Groups are configured with CMRGroupingAndPairing in the NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet associated with the CSI-ReportConfig (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.4.2).","paragraph_zero_based":20331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeII-PortSelectionRI-Restriction","paragraph_zero_based":20332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Restriction for RI for TypeII-PortSelection-RI-Restriction (see TS 38.214 [19], clauses 5.2.2.2.4, 5.2.2.2.6 and 5.2.2.2.7).","paragraph_zero_based":20333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeII-RI-Restriction","paragraph_zero_based":20334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Restriction for RI for TypeII-RI-Restriction (see TS 38.214 [19], clauses 5.2.2.2.3 and 5.2.2.2.5).","paragraph_zero_based":20335},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"valueOfN","paragraph_zero_based":20336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field provides the value of parameter N as specified in TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.2.7. The field is present only when M=2 set by paramCombination, see TS 38.214 [19].","paragraph_zero_based":20337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"valueOfO3","paragraph_zero_based":20338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"O3: oversampling factor for frequency-domain basis selection offset","paragraph_zero_based":20339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Only applicable when CodebookMode = 'Mode1'.","paragraph_zero_based":20340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"valueOfN-CJT","paragraph_zero_based":20341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field describes the size of the window of FD basis for Rel-18 Type II CJT PS codebook. For M=2, N=2,4 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.2.9)","paragraph_zero_based":20342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"valueOfN-Doppler","paragraph_zero_based":20343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field describes the size of the window of FD basis for Rel-18 Type II Doppler PS codebook. For M=2, N=2,4 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.2.9)","paragraph_zero_based":20344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TD-DD-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":20346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"aperiodicResourceOffset","paragraph_zero_based":20347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Offset m between two consecutive aperiodic CSI-RS resources. See TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.4.","paragraph_zero_based":20348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"tdCQI","paragraph_zero_based":20349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of TD CQIs (X) in each SB and ref slot(s) + ref W2(s).","paragraph_zero_based":20350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1-1: 1 TD CQI, ref = 1st slot and 1st W2","paragraph_zero_based":20351}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a706de89ae9d62ab40feb852b4c3c024de5fcbe3fae4b4ca879f8619511d5f75","08e4d9e47341c3ab712482db851709c686e2f0ab924c0b224b2d1533a9975217","698f0918e65c8ee7e4f1efd67cdc1d81c941bea11f2c434e653a0a21090afe