ndReconfigExecCondSCG-r17) OPTIONAL,    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":20440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":20441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":20442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondExecutionCondToReleaseList-r18 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1.. maxNrofCondCells-r16)) OF CondReconfigId-r16","paragraph_zero_based":20444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CONDRECONFIGTOADDMODLIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":20446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":20447}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ca56965c955da9ea9cda96919bf2369c020e80944bffa56cfc79fa9dca30895d","6d76eed32c4223fa894697a6d716a0062ed95097b6833def4be8d696b1cf1e9c","8662f53beed4dcb41b10950fa41fc1692137bd255dcb8e3264345c41ce383e35","741dedeff8b9710490098a63207bcb13e48ea1d99aad26e86f831285d7f1c70f","d53e2c0505ac81c92cc519d4c59040738525497592dcbde67aae45edf2451efc","a91ace56f89ab4a62260e2a8665053085e4a9d270cfc36ee5af384d823fddd32","41c3cf944fedbc3e6117dad7c9e7d1657a7039b7910fab27c97b8b8baa1a5cc1","b93c986d496a1b1b968c0ff2327bdaba65f8bd6e668bba28490df12f0d75f2f1","46530ec1a29ea3900f7f173c8d4f7bafc86c663721770cd12f8dd4aad9a49153","15a022dcc18a6fe77e09d223cb683907814e3647a49d6a64f70cd4d5f057a25a","11d50fc9cb3ca1e68dbc737184c86eeb0d04c5b8e4ec441934c36c2a0519fe56","f88fa51b7b8580cfa1be737be4e4edb40a0866a25c341e82cff695516b942578","0c2749fe9b3ac2b046743f17393f8901dd12afe72841966bd4cf070cbabde2b0","692c7446843e8f112d6cf6a44a1a6a71a4bb6eae4157b0b2e709e8984b3b0329","8144b46bc49c15b48b87ffcad4730e22a1f16976691b39ef5a0244babf172c0d","829f58b0cb182fc835d47d7bdd532c6b78d1cfa32a076d9f73fbc32414bc6db6","5c2c47dc13c15e46fc12953e47430759f5758cff04c8bcf4b519d1c6df8b5b41","af429417f5ffe6f3ce163c4d9307f98bff98948a90d80bb510040b7831e6336e","6345fb2c7f8e407e75d253a5694c0f0bd53f2eb85c3b5e803f613a0eeb51cc56","38560b70cc347f462dacea459a370ea8d8c657823f61ed362371129196fabf1f","0713aba1743c6036c0e7a056baf45505755a60346c92c062f48438c48942bd8a","e553ca23bc59da33207e34127464d0648f1dcda341e1996025321fca2f76bca0","14ce870ba6600f6fcb957c41a08d3c7fa38c8dae7ceb34954238e9e17bd7c15e","9631360c6fde7ff8d0ed94ff775ae73da0e15872897b843ce73f50e10e78484a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[20424,20447],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p20424"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondReconfigToAddMod field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":20449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"condExecutionCond","paragraph_zero_based":20450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The execution condition that needs to be fulfilled in order to trigger the execution of a conditional reconfiguration for CHO, CPA, intra-SN CPC without MN involvement, or MN initiated inter-SN CPC. When configuring 2 triggering events (Meas Ids) for a candidate cell, the network ensures that both refer to the same measObject. The network configures at most one from condEventD1, condEventD2 or condEventT1 for the same candidate cell. For CPA and for MN-initiated inter-SN CPC, the network only indicates MeasId(s) associated with condEventA4. For intra-SN CPC, the network only indicates MeasId(s) associated with condEventA3 or condEventA5.","paragraph_zero_based":20451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"condExecutionCondPSCell","paragraph_zero_based":20452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The execution condition that needs to be fulfilled for the associated PSCell in order to trigger the execution of a conditional reconfiguration for CHO with candidate SCG(s). The Meas Ids refer to the measConfig associated with the MCG. When configuring 2 triggering events (Meas Ids) for a candidate cell, network ensures that both refer to the same measObject. The network only indicates MeasId(s) associated with condEventA4.","paragraph_zero_based":20453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"condExecutionCondSCG","paragraph_zero_based":20454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains execution condition that needs to be fulfilled in order to trigger the execution of a conditional reconfiguration for SN initiated inter-SN CPC. The Meas Ids refer to the measConfig associated with the SCG. When configuring 2 triggering events (Meas Ids) for a candidate cell, network ensures that both refer to the same measObject. For each condReconfigId, the network always configures either condExecutionCond or condExecutionCondSCG (not both). The network only indicates MeasId(s) associated with condEventA3 or condEventA5.","paragraph_zero_based":20455},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"condRRCReconfig","paragraph_zero_based":20456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The RRCReconfiguration message to be applied when the condition(s) are fulfilled. The RRCReconfiguration message contained in condRRCReconfig cannot contain the field conditionalReconfiguration or the field daps-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":20457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scpac-ConfigComplete","paragraph_zero_based":20458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates whether the configuration contained in condRRCReconfig for subsequent CPAC is a complete configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":20459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subsequentCondReconfig","paragraph_zero_based":20460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains the execution conditions that need to be fulfilled in order to trigger the execution of a subsequent CPAC. If the field is configured, the configuration of candidate PSCells for subsequent CPAC is supported. The subsequent execution condition is used for conditional reconfiguration evaluation for other candidate cells when the RRCReconfiguration message contained in condRRCReconfig has been applied.","paragraph_zero_based":20461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondExecutionCondToAddMod field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":20463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subsequentCondExecutionCond","paragraph_zero_based":20464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The execution condition that needs to be fulfilled in order to trigger the execution of a conditional reconfiguration for SN initiated intra-SN subsequent CPAC without MN involvement. When configuring 2 triggering events (Meas Ids) for a candidate cell, the network ensures that both refer to the same measObject. The network only indicates MeasId(s) associated with condEventA3 or condEventA5.","paragraph_zero_based":20465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subsequentCondExecutionCondSCG","paragraph_zero_based":20466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains execution condition that needs to be fulfilled in order to trigger the execution of a conditional reconfiguration for SN initiated inter-SN subsequent CPAC, SN initiated intra-SN subsequent CPAC with MN involvement, or MN initiated inter-SN subsequent CPAC. The Meas Ids refer to the measConfig associated with the SCG. When configuring 2 triggering events (Meas Ids) for a candidate cell, network ensures that both refer to the same measObject. The network only indicates MeasId(s) associated with condEventA3 or condEventA5.","paragraph_zero_based":20467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":20469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":20470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"condReconfigAdd","paragraph_zero_based":20471}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ff25e0897206dd261a4a05db5587a1ad9d2c215c591a131451bbd077199c0e9d","7995b13c9b1b21fc70d08dd65978c546869a69dfa47d132845e65148a85124ab","fc4659e1fa2d0c1f75faa321cb126a12be793fbe8ae4194a57333a54d984d8b1","e8105130c9200e86609f273585fad32ca0ff7f07569d56f83d341c22c78f82b9","0a447376e018c68c8dc2422c15a0e481c2e2bead72f6df