{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":22056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-SEMIPERSISTENTONPUSCHTRIGGERSTATELIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":22058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":22059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SemiPersistentOnPUSCH-TriggerStateList field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":22061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"csi-ReportSubConfigTriggerList","paragraph_zero_based":22062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of sub-configuration ID(s) of N sub-configurations out of L configured sub-configurations within a CSI-ReportConfig associated with a triggering state for semi-persistent CSI reporting on PUSCH.","paragraph_zero_based":22063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ltm-AssociatedReportConfigInfo","paragraph_zero_based":22064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field configures semi-persistent CSI reports on PUSCH of LTM candidate cells. If ltm-associatedReportConfigInfo is configured the UE shall ignore the field associatedReportConfigInfo.","paragraph_zero_based":22065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sp-CSI-MultiplexingMode","paragraph_zero_based":22066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates if the behavior of transmitting SP-CSI on the first PUSCH repetitions corresponding to two SRS resource sets configured in srs-ResourceSetToAddModList or srs-ResourceSetToAddModListDCI-0-2 with usage 'codebook' or 'noncodebook' is enabled or not.","paragraph_zero_based":22067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CSI-SSB-ResourceSet","paragraph_zero_based":22069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-SSB-ResourceSet is used to configure one SS/PBCH block resource set which refers to SS/PBCH as indicated in ServingCellConfigCommon and ServingCellConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":22070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSet information element","paragraph_zero_based":22071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":22072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-SSB-RESOURCESET-START","paragraph_zero_based":22073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSet ::=             SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":22075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    csi-SSB-ResourceSetId               CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId,","paragraph_zero_based":22076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    csi-SSB-ResourceList                SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofCSI-SSB-ResourcePerSet)) OF SSB-Index,","paragraph_zero_based":22077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":22078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":22079}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a60b9a7591995c92c9857363245bdc928fab1b97b32df022c92663a1865b642a","17336119facdd6638dba83d8531de2f67d493a2d1ba2091f6da1a4dc041c38c0","27b1cd06742728f069fb74ec76697748f0f2c051481aef1c76cbcf34163c221d","e0ebae7bda0d1cf3e583bbc66b5003518edc868a9377c39b9b4d43b7f5556212","177f5aaa90a768b1fe4e721fe751d3802c19f641e39a6d2d9cedeb7b611b47e6","84189217292782d4313eff25a24869360f8dc5bf85b653bcc3fc79c876515443","bb5e49ee3a849f129aa830645d0fa4ea2212bd948a35350d10ece4c11d94ad57","87e9e1d3f6417356dbf3087b6fab16ca5188f0f5b751f872a14f594ad888cc13","5154747c7afdbcd3c30ebaf66b68