{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    servingAdditionalPCIList-r17        SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofCSI-SSB-ResourcePerSet)) OF ServingAdditionalPCIIndex-r17  OPTIONAL  -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":22080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":22081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":22082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServingAdditionalPCIIndex-r17  ::=  INTEGER(0..maxNrofAdditionalPCI-r17)","paragraph_zero_based":22084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-SSB-RESOURCESET-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":22086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":22087},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSet field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":22089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servingAdditionalPCIList","paragraph_zero_based":22090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the physical cell IDs (PCI) of the SSBs in the csi-SSB-ResourceList. If present, the list has the same number of entries as csi-SSB-ResourceList. The first entry of the list indicates the value of the PCI for the first entry of csi-SSB-ResourceList, the second entry of this list indicates the value of the PCI for the second entry of csi-SSB-ResourceList, and so on. For each entry, the following applies:","paragraph_zero_based":22091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- If the value is zero, the PCI is the PCI of the serving cell in which this CSI-SSB-ResourceSet is defined;","paragraph_zero_based":22092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- otherwise, the value is additionalPCIIndex-r17 of an SSB-MTC-AdditionalPCI-r17 configured using the additionalPCI-ToAddModList-r17 in ServingCellConfig, and the PCI is the additionalPCI-r17 in this SSB-MTC-AdditionalPCI-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":22093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId","paragraph_zero_based":22095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId is used to identify one SS/PBCH block resource set.","paragraph_zero_based":22096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceId information element","paragraph_zero_based":22097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":22098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-SSB-RESOURCESETID-START","paragraph_zero_based":22099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId ::=           INTEGER (0..maxNrofCSI-SSB-ResourceSets-1)","paragraph_zero_based":22101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-SSB-RESOURCESETID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":22103}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8cdd908bee041ee515e757c20fbf71670eecbf7eedaba7ef09bc92ed4f3e96da","6aa33e1eb76ed3b7da1ed06932ff08119eb605a9ebcd7843de9647ed83224240","a87c6fe0b138e114407ad4b39d53be9d66905a456f0c6c6aee8858abc67c3aef","ca2f8436796f48aa3ea4a151fb3f466ea00ac3ec645d4376d42e580b8bb2ca44","90120a38200581c2e67de421e3bdfdb0dd23e9c8d823a648bb2bfc127c5064ea","a8b380a13741065e1742bf0981fea1be3f239ccb551766c8cc1600fe211adad5","8fec206dd0b81fb1b46fba9e83ab01957dc7e3346fd337ab28459fa5cdfe09e5","519d908e7c003912f78f0ffca7a45a973b76bfe4435f44d41d3f6775d0637d4c","2c