{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":22800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-ConfigSecondaryGroup field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":22802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-InactivityTimer","paragraph_zero_based":22803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiple integers of 1 ms. ms0 corresponds to 0 ms, ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. The network configures a drx-InactivityTimer value for the second DRX group that is smaller than the drx-InactivityTimer configured for the default DRX group in IE DRX-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":22804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-onDurationTimer","paragraph_zero_based":22805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiples of 1/32 ms (subMilliSeconds) or in ms (milliSeconds). For the latter, value ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, value ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. The network configures a drx-onDurationTimer value for the second DRX group that is smaller than the drx-onDurationTimer configured for the default DRX group in IE DRX-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":22806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–DRX-ConfigSL","paragraph_zero_based":22808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE DRX-ConfigSL is used to configure additional DRX parameters for the UE performing sidelink operation with resource allocation mode 1, as specified in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":22809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-ConfigSL information element","paragraph_zero_based":22810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":22811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIGSL-START","paragraph_zero_based":22812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-ConfigSL-r17 ::=            SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":22814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerSL-r17        INTEGER (0..56),","paragraph_zero_based":22815},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    drx-RetransmissionTimerSL-r17   ENUMERATED {sl0, sl1, sl2, sl4, sl6, sl8, sl16, sl24, sl33, sl40, sl64, sl80, sl96, sl112, sl128,","paragraph_zero_based":22816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                sl160, sl320, spare15, spare14, spare13, spare12, spare11, spare10, spare9, spare8,","paragraph_zero_based":22817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                spare7, spare6, spare5, spare4, spare3, spare2, spare1}","paragraph_zero_based":22818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":22819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIGSL-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":22821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":22822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22823}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6a98d29e5e9cfc2cb37419992b9f4ca869bc1e50795c3fc5f6bd2703a33e5cea","4e0edaf2cf4fad165e6e081e71bddc22a5e913904155001da1673c482f918ae5","58be80565048468cd1907f1790da8e1e9cd15f8ce9519eed29c1aae3fdb03b1b","324ae339694092ab5d9ce20f5372d6c3855ef15caf5b5c097434ea41cc506b54","e8e6406544a09c4a84a63dcfe1649cd676cd151c97f75f23c0a41fe081e6354a","dc52a2a7b88352c15cbc31a83ad215e1d617bb