{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MEASCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":24193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":24194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":24196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"effectiveMeasWindowConfig","paragraph_zero_based":24197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Used to setup and release effective measurement window in NR for E-UTRA measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":24198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"interFrequencyConfig-NoGap-r16","paragraph_zero_based":24199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the field is set to true, UE is configured to perform SSB based inter-frequency measurement without measurement gaps when the inter-frequency SSB is completely contained in the active DL BWP of the UE, as specified in TS 38.133 [14], clause 9.3. Otherwise, the SSB based inter-frequency measurement is performed within measurement gaps. In NR-DC, the field can only be configured in the measConfig associated with MCG, and when configured, it applies to all the inter-frequency measurements configured by MN and SN.","paragraph_zero_based":24200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measGapConfig","paragraph_zero_based":24201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Used to setup and release measurement gaps in NR.","paragraph_zero_based":24202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measIdToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":24203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of measurement identities to add and/or modify.","paragraph_zero_based":24204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measIdToRemoveList","paragraph_zero_based":24205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of measurement identities to remove.","paragraph_zero_based":24206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measObjectToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":24207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of measurement objects to add and/or modify.","paragraph_zero_based":24208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measObjectToRemoveList","paragraph_zero_based":24209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of measurement objects to remove.","paragraph_zero_based":24210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportConfigToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":24211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of measurement reporting configurations to add and/or modify.","paragraph_zero_based":24212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportConfigToRemoveList","paragraph_zero_based":24213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of measurement reporting configurations to remove.","paragraph_zero_based":24214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"s-MeasureConfig","paragraph_zero_based":24215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9453b44b8be993f92a71f7b9aba78dbcd042b31298f1cf414c7bf32054dc3047","12853a60bc4efbb939e7bea1a444901a2b336220f2423d9a5c4115a0b3343550","2221fc09c585bc83c5b4eaba9645e44333c40482c19154b23222dc1eedceeb24","e2d622596f2fde249c48ef5ac25bcf13b0804db270e224819850bc5d491567c6","1480b56566b44267d24a86ac77fe4482d778c84ddd313f0362dcc4d9fe04f8c3","179a79293a12be764902106ecf3ee79cb7cffe1240cf385ac09d6253937569a3","df210caf18c2e133ab81541aa1b992f761c91c005eb825bc32e748ed5049369e","8f94e561876d0293854248947733fca00708a7b9705f9ca8e6647d0df289b157","58fc4463e754325351a967b30892a5ea9d07dcb928c711371c2416194d3afecd","0578a64727270c55d26d5d79b8767d8e3661012e0b2e0d6bd990b16cebf5c9da","7dd125cd60fdee8