based":24498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the NR carrier frequency to be used for measurements during RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":24499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"carrierFreqEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":24500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the E-UTRA carrier frequency to be used for measurements during RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":24501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"deriveSSB-IndexFromCell","paragraph_zero_based":24502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates whether the UE may use the timing of any detected cell on that frequency to derive the SSB index of all neighbour cells on that frequency. If this field is set to true, the UE assumes SFN and frame boundary alignment across cells on the neighbor frequency as specified in TS 38.133 [14].","paragraph_zero_based":24503}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5fc0ef1c63a00e46cfd4472003b4d5ef4a7e35d3127b1a4852b16b5c4de4225a","7bcaf21c0d1a41898c0abffc9651708f431ea1b8f39d9777b581c15656269967","44fc65eb34bd2436740ec1fe32bbdbc93fbcc27ac93bc5fd67579ab3444a62de","a3d3288244d232c4888f4d88568e9291498e043c8f84cff104e650dd7cb938f0","6338de3032d81aa2f7193cdc4fe40e2902129954ea4eb2a1dcd7854921213f01","707db923fac69eafa001115c5a2ee05fa6d84f70f8add6735e9bc03b00927ed2","e25d7bd09d6f0c47efe87163622a14c255705ebc5483ff0105a9ab5ef9dc182f","e80a7c42c08195d73dcd544e2b421d99cd5e3fcc6d59d8bb2f3fbcb347fff99b","30c4daf1f845b82ea4a12bab0a25e34cffdd40f21f2a772d661f46735b5ef5a5","b63b207df3c41bfb0f95de67fe1626d6d87ad04f9a73b2e20c5e5aaf6dd4a6dd","33b83c54ab7db3ed977707e69411764cf8ea199f72c4da5ad5926afa26339b7a","be08288024f10176cff95dda070bf