{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qualityThresholdEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":24528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the quality thresholds for reporting the measured cells for idle/inactive E-UTRA measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":24529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportQuantities","paragraph_zero_based":24530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates which measurement quantities UE is requested to report in the idle/inactive measurement report. ","paragraph_zero_based":24531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportQuantitiesEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":24532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates which E-UTRA measurement quantities the UE is requested to report in the idle/inactive measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":24533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportQuantityRS-Indexes","paragraph_zero_based":24534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates which measurement information per beam index the UE shall include in the NR idle/inactive measurement results.","paragraph_zero_based":24535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"smtc","paragraph_zero_based":24536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement timing configuration for inter-frequency measurement. If this field is absent in VarMeasIdleConfig, the UE assumes that SSB periodicity is 5 ms in this frequency.","paragraph_zero_based":24537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssbSubcarrierSpacing","paragraph_zero_based":24538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates subcarrier spacing of SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":24539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Only the following values are applicable depending on the used frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":24540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR1:    15 or 30 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":24541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR2-1:  120 or 240 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":24542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR2-2:  120, 480, or 960 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":24543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-ToMeasure","paragraph_zero_based":24544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The set of SS blocks to be measured within the SMTC measurement duration (see TS 38.215 [9]). When the field is absent in VarMeasIdleConfig, the UE measures on all SS-blocks.","paragraph_zero_based":24545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ss-RSSI-Measurement","paragraph_zero_based":24546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the SSB-based RSSI measurement configuration. If the field is absent in VarMeasIdleConfig, the UE behaviour is defined in TS 38.215 [89], clause 5.1.3.","paragraph_zero_based":24547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"validityAreaList","paragraph_zero_based":24548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of frequencies and optionally, for each frequency, a list of cells within which the UE is required to perform measurements while in RRC_IDLE and RRC_INACTIVE. ","paragraph_zero_based":24549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MeasIdToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":24551}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["35c1dd5a8914705ac29cdfb51294b8ceb4bcdcf50da5bc8452b6b10e2e33972b","947d2b7884353793ead993ab46519ee5a8634177de017c3d23dfdfb083500b4a","78412c17cfb8c3084d42408e3c1e2cab5e8ddef78a9988604da290b581a9f397","56a4f6480886edbf459588690ce5608c801548a0a8e00fea6d149580058cb7b6","24131cfa21a7b6e8d374401b286907441bdbdd6cf8e5ce282bfbfaba1e243669","edf406a0539568a3d814a4128bdc283b1f1e14d0295e770fb99a7b5fce4b7926","8d184061e5