{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the recommended sequence for intra/inter-RAT intra/inter-frequency measurement. Value 1 means the corresponding frequency is measured firstly. Value 2 means the corresponding frequency is measured secondly and so on. If more than one frequency is configured with the same value, it means no recommended sequence among these frequencies. If not configured, it means there is no recommended sequence for the corresponding frequency. This field is only configured for NR standalone or if the measObject is associated to the MCG.","paragraph_zero_based":24744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"widebandRSRQ-Meas","paragraph_zero_based":24745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If set to true, the UE shall, when performing RSRQ measurements, use a wider bandwidth in accordance with TS 36.133 [40]. The network may set the field to true if the measurement bandwidth indicated by allowedMeasBandwidth is 50 resource blocks or larger; otherwise the network sets this field to false.","paragraph_zero_based":24746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MeasObjectId","paragraph_zero_based":24748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MeasObjectId used to identify a measurement object configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":24749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasObjectId information element","paragraph_zero_based":24750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":24751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MEASOBJECTID-START","paragraph_zero_based":24752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasObjectId ::=                    INTEGER (1..maxNrofObjectId)","paragraph_zero_based":24754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MEASOBJECTID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":24756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":24757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MeasObjectNR","paragraph_zero_based":24759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MeasObjectNR specifies information applicable for SS/PBCH block(s) intra/inter-frequency measurements and/or CSI-RS intra/inter-frequency measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":24760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasObjectNR information element","paragraph_zero_based":24761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":24762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MEASOBJECTNR-START","paragraph_zero_based":24763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":24764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasObjectNR ::=                    SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":24765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ssbFrequency                        ARFCN-ValueNR                                                   OPTIONAL,   -- Cond SSBorAssociatedSSB","paragraph_zero_based":24766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ssbSubcarrierSpacing                SubcarrierSpacing                                               OPTIONAL,   -- Cond SSBorAssociatedSSB","paragraph_zero_based":24767}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["979db42443e571e1f5ebd6f4172bef9830d58779f8ad5827e7513b9e6f4ff55a","bce021cf978a39a1df5b19a6392a3959ea2b56ab4db83cea157c9978c602a881","97fb4f7862e95cb55d2e1ed763aeb27bf37522202975b94a45d7a6adad803915","861e4b52e852c2b338cf025e4254cbd6