{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    bandNR-r16                                   FreqBandIndicatorNR,","paragraph_zero_based":26496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    gapIndication-r16                            ENUMERATED {gap, no-gap}","paragraph_zero_based":26497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":26498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NeedForGapsInfoNR-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapsInfoNR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"intraFreq-needForGap","paragraph_zero_based":26504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement gap requirement information for NR intra-frequency measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":26505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"interFreq-needForGap","paragraph_zero_based":26506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement gap requirement information for NR inter-frequency measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":26507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapsIntraFreq field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servCellId","paragraph_zero_based":26510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the serving cell which contains the target SSB (associated with the initial DL BWP) to be measured. ","paragraph_zero_based":26511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndicationIntra","paragraph_zero_based":26512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap is required for the UE to perform intra-frequency SSB based measurements on the concerned serving cell. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed if any of the UE configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB) do not contain the frequency domain resources of the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB). Value no-gap indicates a measurement gap is not needed to measure the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB) for all configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB), no matter the SSB is within the configured BWP or not. This field shall be set to 'no-gap' for the serving cell(s) belonging to the corresponding band(s) where bwpOperationMeasWithoutInterrupt-r18 is supported by the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":26513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapsNR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bandNR","paragraph_zero_based":26516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the NR target band to be measured.","paragraph_zero_based":26517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndication","paragraph_zero_based":26518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap is required for the UE to perform SSB based measurements on the concerned NR target band while NR-DC or NE-DC is not configured. The UE determines this information based on the resultant configuration of the RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume message that triggers this response. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed, value no-gap indicates a measurement gap is not needed. ","paragraph_zero_based":26519}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843