{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NextHopChainingCount information element","paragraph_zero_based":26664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NEXTHOPCHAININGCOUNT-START","paragraph_zero_based":26666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NextHopChainingCount ::=                    INTEGER (0..7)","paragraph_zero_based":26668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NEXTHOPCHAININGCOUNT-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26671},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NG-5G-S-TMSI","paragraph_zero_based":26673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NG-5G-S-TMSI contains a 5G S-Temporary Mobile Subscription Identifier (5G-S-TMSI), a temporary UE identity provided by the 5GC which uniquely identifies the UE within the tracking area, see TS 23.003 [21].","paragraph_zero_based":26674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NG-5G-S-TMSI information element","paragraph_zero_based":26675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NG-5G-S-TMSI-START","paragraph_zero_based":26677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NG-5G-S-TMSI ::=                         BIT STRING (SIZE (48))","paragraph_zero_based":26679},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NG-5G-S-TMSI-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NonCellDefiningSSB","paragraph_zero_based":26684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NonCellDefiningSSB is used to configure a NCD-SSB to be used while the UE operates in an RedCap-specific initial BWP or a dedicated BWP that does not contain the CD-SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":26685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NonCellDefiningSSB information element","paragraph_zero_based":26686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26687}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0167730707d63c148cbd4094de31ec60b90dee1f385f04438faf70f490a8a56e","9cd345233e4c4d3402b183f42354837e28985e6351334f881113cf39472ed46e","0c68bac05d6d8a1ac8856855d2a88154cd8d86e8b9fd5e681e322a5e5e4e0c27","8784b6e3633233331c81c1ba365968bf423473fb0704762336cf0694edfbb9e0","c9e299337a1da6f22297e60cf8f5b5ac41f15747728f41ced9e01cb48356795f","957b2ef96af0306be06e79b34b748d6a0ce9841de042910254d4ccfe5c810ade","8dd6589170c53f47f8f995f6d4ca5a95dbf50a06223d802eade075c4d5be36b2","f5357fd8d2ca41ce9336aadc1dad27be298819a764ec39d75c740dcce835d1d7","1252564c6e6b4f85e9dcb6a1fcb013df1b8abf11b42fba75aedbd5f4276ef801","0e85609afbd3b1101ca4559a064a2cee829f00ba4a8f25fd3f24765d7748053d","59e6288bdd0e08fa59b0695287f2457e5bedabf85ba0cc7ab89cc35f91f8db91","e02d3a54fc8fca97c0fe09b818b425ee7d1dba24799f6317cfdb1c73afd5c0a1","946771ba2f2bede5a36e5361297f2b0c99767680db294e034944328eae3c0660","1574108c936aac92b207c831111c47ffd5f4e0087c09f6a2afb9e16837fca41d","17e889e91a1706cd9012c5eb61e07d1aaba2ed27f12b3d8f799438314870f40a","dc21c1032b02f673daa469d1df90bde35d1caa62cb3ae5d942562b747c6fdab0","5161b741ec453d1a7b02b49c3f573e30b9cee620d961655546695cddfdbac89a","7cdc4ce0145a1e820dcb571c1fb50bd475d91662f2fda81723b1dc399a7b891c","0e14208b26ad4c704b5a4dada7a24dd80a84ee8d4ea37af068fddbeb8a2dd684","2a9175f67b7225874166daa0bc591f527a9aea177433af38bb279ec6df1ffaf1","214360de0a2fd4d6899433e86afc9fc6d3b4b642fe0a64fbf17ac95d40b8b154","3efd64949ee0a28be90118da86fceb1cb10d28c199555797f2355024e5927165","677638cd1f0758e7eb753324dc610de4cab59525ebc0c4076e850e4ae9e606db","308ab683230fb8c5c37b11c879146ed0e08a28c1d17e98e21e610b44f87e9d2f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[26664,26687],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p26664"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NONCELLDEFININGSSB-START","paragraph_zero_based":26688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NonCellDefiningSSB-r17 ::=      SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":26690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    absoluteFrequencySSB-r17        ARFCN-ValueNR,","paragraph_zero_based":26691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ssb-Periodicity-r17             ENUMERATED { ms5, ms10, ms20, ms40, ms80, ms160, spare2, spare1 }       OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":26692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ssb-TimeOffset-r17              ENUMERATED { ms5, ms10, ms15, ms20, ms40, ms80, spare2, spare1 }      OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":26693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":26694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":26695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NONCELLDEFININGSSB-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NonCellDefiningSSB field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"absoluteFrequencySSB","paragraph_zero_based":26701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Frequency of the NCD-SSB. The network configures this field so that the SSB is within the bandwidth of the BWP configured in BWP-DownlinkCommon.","paragraph_zero_based":26702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-Periodicity","paragraph_zero_based":26703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The periodicity of this NCD-SSB. The network configures only periodicities that are larger than the periodicity of serving cell's CD-SSB. If the field is absent, the UE applies the SSB periodicity of the CD-SSB (ssb-periodicityServingCell configured in ServingCellConfigCommon or ServingCellConfigCommonSIB).","paragraph_zero_based":26704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-TimeOffset","paragraph_zero_based":26705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The time offset between CD-SSB of the serving cell and this NCD-SSB. Value ms5 means the first burst of NCD-SSB is transmitted 5ms later than the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted after the first symbol of SFN=0 of the serving cell, value ms10 means the first burst of NCD-SSB is transmitted 10ms later than the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted after the first symbol in SFN=0 of the serving cell, and so on. If the field is absent, UE considers that the time offset between the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted in the serving cell and the first burst of this NCD-SSB transmitted is zero. For UEs in TDD cells, the network configures this time offset to be an integer multiple of the periodicity of the serving cell's CD-SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":26706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NPN-Identity","paragraph_zero_based":26708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NPN-Identity includes either a list of CAG-IDs or a list of NIDs per PLMN Identity. Further information regarding how to set the IE is specified in TS 23.003 [21].","paragraph_zero_based":26709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NPN-Identity information element","paragraph_zero_based":26710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":26711}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_s