{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    cellIdentity-r16                 CellIdentity,","paragraph_zero_based":26760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    cellReservedForOperatorUse-r16   ENUMERATED {reserved, notReserved},","paragraph_zero_based":26761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    iab-Support-r16                  ENUMERATED {true}                                           OPTIONAL,       -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":26762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":26763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":26764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    gNB-ID-Length-r17                INTEGER (22..32)                                            OPTIONAL        -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":26765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]],","paragraph_zero_based":26766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":26767},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    mobileIAB-Support-r18            ENUMERATED {true}                                           OPTIONAL        -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":26768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":26769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":26770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NPN-IDENTITYINFOLIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":26773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NPN-IdentityInfoList field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"iab-Support","paragraph_zero_based":26776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field combines both the support of IAB and the cell status for IAB. If the field is present, the cell supports IAB and the cell is also considered as a candidate for cell (re)selection for IAB-nodes; if the field is absent, the cell does not support IAB and/or the cell is barred for IAB-node. This field is absent if mobileIAB-Cell is broadcasted in the cell.","paragraph_zero_based":26777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gNB-ID-Length","paragraph_zero_based":26778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the length of the gNB ID out of the 36-bit long cellIdentity. This field is always present if the mobileIAB-Support is broadcasted in a cell.","paragraph_zero_based":26779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mobileIAB-Support","paragraph_zero_based":26780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the support of mobile IAB and whether the cell can be considered as a candidate for cell (re)selection for mobile IAB-node. This field is absent if mobileIAB-Cell is broadcasted in the cell. If the field is absent, the cell is barred for mobile IAB-node.","paragraph_zero_based":26781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NPN-IdentityInfo","paragraph_zero_based":26782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The NPN-IdentityInfo contains one or more NPN identities and additional information associated with those NPNs. Only the same type of NPNs (either SNPNs or PNI-NPNs) can be listed in a NPN-IdentityInfo element.","paragraph_zero_based":26783}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3361131b3f57edafce0b125ad00fa9dc901c919cbcfa145add4ec536b6456bf2","df76de8807d12d64caf0861664ba63da6bf9f47d7c7a3e19a89d350b0a6d6d75","5d88b49a92aa88592cf1194005394d1b5a7c7074e8f2b52cf44072721c7dd231","3612933d031c6ae3d7da9e47c84405301d66337eb7656382