{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":27216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–P-Max","paragraph_zero_based":27218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE P-Max is used to limit the UE's uplink transmission power on a carrier frequency, in TS 38.101-1 [15] and in TS 38.101-5 [75], and is used to calculate the parameter Pcompensation defined in TS 38.304 [20]. In ATG cell, actual value of P-Max = 9 + field value [dBm].","paragraph_zero_based":27219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"P-Max information element","paragraph_zero_based":27220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":27221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-P-MAX-START","paragraph_zero_based":27222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"P-Max ::=                           INTEGER (-30..33)","paragraph_zero_based":27224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-P-MAX-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":27226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":27227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PathlossReferenceRS","paragraph_zero_based":27229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PathlossReferenceRS is used to configure a Reference Signal (e.g. a CSI-RS config or a SS block) to be used for path loss estimation for PUSCH, PUCCH and SRS for unified TCI state operation.","paragraph_zero_based":27230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PathlossReferenceRS information element","paragraph_zero_based":27231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":27232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and