I-Range is used to encode either a single or a range of physical cell identities. The range is encoded by using a start value and by indicating the number of consecutive physical cell identities (including start) in the range. For fields comprising multiple occurrences of PCI-Range, the Network may configure overlapping ranges of physical cell identities.","paragraph_zero_based":27308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PCI-Range information element","paragraph_zero_based":27309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":27310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PCI-RANGE-START","paragraph_zero_based":27311}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3c6d0313f522f59cf6f8cfb04ed8bd10dc321818f46f787b078f0306dd0b16c0","11a2633f8e668e47dcb1dc3488fb638e35e56f3149380cb744caa048e8efa23d","e52434edfa90bdbc3ca3bec7d97aeae6672cb0cd2d94f6d4dfb0772e0f0e2694","6bc091dbc46a7eeef4b953730fd1f8451146811cc507b8b24283a2a0e972fb24","9ac1ca6b3952345e67b2071cd93eb17b6c44644aa729933b91c7b797a5e940a5","3ceb67b7f53733ab4af1b9db921a6df786d555a198ce27f22605ae81a799f1dc","9a47c0295842a6176c13fba28a530bc56182ad44dccf966061976a248e9ccb6b","274bed45c4da37030091bae9a4add1f4a8a67119d1dfa3ffef17ec2c72f9802e","a0b8bd71cccbf8c9c818aaa24c815116c9a4cfd53e2770fb7980ba915442e060","5cef78efe6111e34afec31a7805a1274996d04af549eeb4d94df62dd5ff71ea3","1707c191633cd45b0e5884652c0d24204a9de2ab184e6a212e7f65bdd3b7b03f","355f17d9963cc49ec8bd3327f5a5543c47200c9f2d74af423dcb986bd659c63b","8594b02bf8cafb6942c64060b35298c54fff8386fbbf73f745386ea2adf962d4","593b5a4e050e6f832927736491b0419669b9549e239cb7c2620c9333ad557b35","c02a280026b9bdb8fcaf53805de8ac1a48d661b23daebc7dd8094cbd8ebe9dec","12dfa08d2002a0511cc9cec549b1b27dc87047fa2ad6e57c694a4042094d68c9","a4897e55705a11969a45e51031b2cd6c879f6f11f985478716ecf20a4e1ccd87","d6c25f4f7fd8baf67fbaf6e69b4807ccf5c5a5c9637b6c778d89e67086b064a6","06ef309915ea37689e6700a883ae9b93b1d2b6435aa021c55a686155305190eb","2a6bb3505d702905b097356e1e40da31ee2f189e060ccee940a7072fb1d696f8","8daea38505eae20c528506bcc5884214c4e33b103f7bb918d9a68fe18da42f82","8ade5a34741fdb9094f7eeaa4d17dc2ae980c8fad7f952aa4ab2c88a75f03bde","94d1c0d83693de9b2dba9b9e738a79c99009d65e8c674b633fd372290d63aef2","5324b20d5f157f285584532681be7a72c6dfa9afd34ee82ac4adf99fdab832c5"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[27288,27311],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p27288"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PCI-Range ::=                       SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":27313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    start                               PhysCellId,","paragraph_zero_based":27314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    range                               ENUMERATED {n4, n8, n12, n16, n24, n32, n48, n64, n84,","paragraph_zero_based":27315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                    n96, n128, n168, n252, n504, n1008,spare1}                  OPTIONAL    -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":27316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":27317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PCI-RANGE-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":27319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":27320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PCI-Range field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":27322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"range","paragraph_zero_based":27323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the number of physical cell identities in the range (including start). Value n4 corresponds with 4, value n8 corresponds with 8 and so on. The UE shall apply value 1 in case the field is absent, in which case only the physical cell identity value indicated by start applies.","paragraph_zero_based":27324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"start","paragraph_zero_based":27325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the lowest physical cell identity in the range.","paragraph_zero_based":27326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27327},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PCI-RangeElement","paragraph_zero_based":27328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PCI-RangeElement is used to define a PCI-Range as part of a list (e.g. AddMod list).","paragraph_zero_based":27329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PCI-RangeElement information element","paragraph_zero_based":27330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":27331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PCI-RANGEELEMENT-START","paragraph_zero_based":27332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PCI-RangeElement ::=                SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":27334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    pci-RangeIndex                      PCI-RangeIndex,","paragraph_zero_based":27335}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7117a4655999be17f3ea0a52697b6ed5889ccb9ff761e491ec17d878898f4eb7","e7ededde60c3e373610c23c51d2743f6e27c007729081673dc1c4c58eda09c0f","04645bbdbb00342dcaacc31e7e3253689ee80ea7b80bacd60a4fdd48de0b2c59","a2fb10b998eb41d7499817028b4c976fd36a45bf2792288f0fa520522a2e3126","d2431d97ac3af765fbdbf4b63001f2ebb9db76864ac2e416aecc37d65c3c4d60","02fd7cdf3983f975e9880e13f0058e8b948bb23365bece8bb5501459d32b56a3","30776d34907be997347688f3eb8ee06585bfc6edb506233b4efa20092cde257d","5b62032e826747183ef8df5d0adecfa6f8e9e3c1b1fe1cb36109ceeb6276d4db","6051aa8d850c8d4c4be1887084bba842696c631897f4984a2867132769ce40c7","b9677f60fd7120e4826b895e3e40c4f2e097072ecfe837d758fa24cb6f7d2d2b","386516edd22a99fe2437af34dda0168cd436ccdffe8c061ecee32a26579ec298","73f9766f12b0712876f58d93e0f5dabe88b832af69a6360a010e555c9d5d489d","e277615e82caba61de3a52c305288675ef8a27a5a671e8c653a690c252f6d93e","7270044158a5f42bc6