{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The value of the timer in slots for monitoring PDCCH in the active DL BWP of the serving cell before moving to the default search space group (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 10.4).","paragraph_zero_based":27624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For 15 kHz SCS, {1..20} are valid.","paragraph_zero_based":27625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For 30 kHz SCS, {1..40} are valid.","paragraph_zero_based":27626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For 60kHz SCS, {1..80} are valid.","paragraph_zero_based":27627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For 120 kHz SCS, {1..160} are valid.","paragraph_zero_based":27628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For 480 kHz SCS, {1..640} are valid.","paragraph_zero_based":27629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For 960 kHz SCS, {1..1280} are valid.","paragraph_zero_based":27630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network configures the same value for all serving cells in the same CellGroupForSwitch.","paragraph_zero_based":27631},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"slotFormatIndicator","paragraph_zero_based":27632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of Slot-Format-Indicators to be monitored in the correspondingly configured PDCCHs of this serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":27633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PDCP-Config","paragraph_zero_based":27635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PDCP-Config is used to set the configurable PDCP parameters for signalling, MBS multicast and data radio bearers.","paragraph_zero_based":27636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PDCP-Config information element","paragraph_zero_based":27637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":27638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PDCP-CONFIG-START","p