{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"numberOfBitsForRV-DCI-1-3","paragraph_zero_based":28128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configures the number of bits for \"Redundancy version\" in the DCI format 1_3 (see TS 38.212 [17], clause 7.3.1 and TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.2.1).","paragraph_zero_based":28129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rbg-SizeDCI-1-3","paragraph_zero_based":28130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Selection among config 1, config 2 and config 3 for RBG size for PDSCH scheduled by DCI format 1_3. The UE ignores this field if resourceAllocationDCI-1-3 is set to resourceAllocationType1. (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.2.2.1).","paragraph_zero_based":28131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourceAllocationDCI-1-3","paragraph_zero_based":28132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of resource allocation type 0 and resource allocation type 1 for DCI format 1_3 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.2.2).","paragraph_zero_based":28133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourceAllocationType1GranularityDCI-1-3","paragraph_zero_based":28134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configure the scheduling granularity applicable for both the starting point and length indication for resource allocation type 1 in DCI format 1_3. If this field is absent, the granularity is 1 PRB (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.2.2.2).","paragraph_zero_based":28135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":28137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":28138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DCI-1-3","paragraph_zero_based":28139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present when ScheduledCellListDCI-1-3 is configured to the serving cell. Otherwise, it is absent, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":28140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PDSCH-ConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":28142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PDSCH-ConfigCommon is used to configure cell specific PDSCH parameters.","paragraph_zero_based":28143},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PDSCH-ConfigCommon information element","paragraph_zero_based":28144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":28145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PDSCH-CONFIGCOMMON-START","paragraph_zero_based":28146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PDSCH-ConfigCommon ::=                  SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":28148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    pdsch-TimeDomainAllocationList                  PDSCH-TimeDomainResourceAllocationList          OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":28149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":28150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":28151}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["42668dad5e618e07aefa64b09e1d0dd92c8d28b5a023f18032ff3352f018ba5f","671b5de27fe274301af89754a507c219a0715c09c12c6ce2ea6f22afe1ae3b36","573b073431d49fa48829644df1d5caa19c31ae35d2a554133e0a0c22af681f59","798376700bbb69b4969bae99f9c729c12270d7155a150ac41a6b482050660692","b15dfb868b38759a4f44c6796e1ffbf276ad6617cb114b0be688ebcc1ba3d404","e64feb691d8f3bbc83941722c1ba8ebc351999628df9b87b830e26aaabf41563","b6c7e7657798ad4f54e287077cb700f692305b3eaaa03578c46ae2d439a6c11e","65b47de26188208a7ba7887cd265d7dc8dc74864176049156325b748a2f0d9d2",