{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DL-DataToUL-ACK-r17 ::=                    SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..8)) OF INTEGER (-1..127)","paragraph_zero_based":29089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DL-DataToUL-ACK-v1700 ::=                  SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..8)) OF INTEGER (16..31)","paragraph_zero_based":29091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DL-DataToUL-ACK-DCI-1-2-r16 ::=            SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..8)) OF INTEGER (0..15)","paragraph_zero_based":29093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DL-DataToUL-ACK-DCI-1-2-r17 ::=            SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..8)) OF INTEGER (0..127)","paragraph_zero_based":29095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UL-AccessConfigListDCI-1-1-r16 ::=         SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..16)) OF INTEGER (0..15)","paragraph_zero_based":29097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UL-AccessConfigListDCI-1-2-r17 ::=         SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..16)) OF INTEGER (0..15)","paragraph_zero_based":29099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UL-AccessConfigListDCI-1-1-r17 ::=         SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..3)) OF INTEGER (0..2)","paragraph_zero_based":29101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DL-DataToUL-ACK-MulticastDCI-Format4-1-r17 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..8)) OF INTEGER (0..15)","paragraph_zero_based":29103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PUCCH-CONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":29105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":29106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":29108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PUCCH-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":29109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-DataToUL-ACK, dl-DataToUL-ACK-DCI-1-2","paragraph_zero_based":29110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of timing for given PDSCH to the DL ACK (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.1.2). The field dl-DataToUL-ACK applies to DCI format 1_1 and the field dl-DataToUL-ACK-DCI-1-2 applies to DCI format 1_2 (see TS 38.212 [17], clause 7.3.1 and TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.2.3). The dl-DataToUL-ACK-v1700 is applicable for NTN and dl-DataToUL-ACK-r17 is applicable for up to 71 GHz. If dl-DataToUL-ACK-r16 or dl-DataToUL-ACK-r17 or dl-DataToUL-ACK-v1700 is signalled, UE shall ignore the dl-DataToUL-ACK (without suffix). The value -1 corresponds to \"inapplicable value\" for the case where the A/N feedback timing is not explicitly included at the time of scheduling PDSCH. The fields dl-DataToUL-ACK-r17 and dl-DataToUL-ACK-DCI-1-2-r17 are only applicable for SCS of 480 kHz or 960 kHz.","paragraph_zero_based":29111}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["08d7e872abac02e4faf42b93f93f1f79bcb033b676e6303ef1bdb5a76a5e2bb9","bc0117289872d24a938e631939ba8f5aa2c99e9dfe1bb195bc1bcca660a9404a","903c0be1f012e5260a442c40ebebbccbf5b83392adea1ed717a74edf46a079e3","470191df9cbb3d13a2dd0499d503e6c5cc4ba8c9f26c25a761a956647dcb6753","8d3df09bbb2514e9c99c62a15ba2c6858cedd3a428ef76b1818146c9df400e6c","0ca568d84ec37