{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":30120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    numberOfRepetitionsExt-r17                ENUMERATED {n1, n2, n3, n4, n7, n8, n12, n16, n20, n24, n28, n32, spare4, spare3, spare2,","paragraph_zero_based":30121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                          spare1}                           OPTIONAL,   -- Cond Format01-02-For-TypeA","paragraph_zero_based":30122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    numberOfSlotsTBoMS-r17                   ENUMERATED {n1, n2, n4, n8, spare4, spare3, spare2, spare1}   OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":30123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    extendedK2-r17                            INTEGER (0..128)                              OPTIONAL    -- Cond MultiPUSCH","paragraph_zero_based":30124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":30125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":30126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PUSCH-TIMEDOMAINRESOURCEALLOCATIONLIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":30128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":30129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PUSCH-TimeDomainResourceAllocationList field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":30131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extendedK2","paragraph_zero_based":30132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Corresponds to L1 parameter 'K2' (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1.2.1) configurable per PUSCH allocation. Only values {0..32} are applicable for PUSCH SCS of 120 kHz and for FR1.","paragraph_zero_based":30133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When the field is absent for the first PUSCH if multiple PUSCH are configured per PDCCH and k2-r16 is absent, or when the field is absent and only one PUSCH is configured per PDCCH and k2-r16 is absent, the UE applies the value 1 when PUSCH SCS is 15/30 kHz; the value 2 when PUSCH SCS is 60 kHz, the value 3 when PUSCH SCS is 120 kHz, the value 11 when PUSCH SCS is 480 kHz, and the value 21 when PUSCH SCS is 960 kHz. If multiple contiguous PUSCHs are configured per PDCCH, when the field extendedK2(n) corresponding to k2 of the PUSCH(s) in the n-th slot (n>1), or of the PUSCH(s) except the first PUSCH in the first slot (n=1), is absent, the UE applies k2 of the first PUSCH plus n-1.","paragraph_zero_based":30134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"k2","paragraph_zero_based":30135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Corresponds to L1 parameter 'K2' (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1.2.1). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 1 when PUSCH SCS is 15/30 kHz; the value 2 when PUSCH SCS is 60 kHz, and the value 3 when PUSCH SCS is 120 kHz. k2 is absent/ignored if extendedK2 is present.","paragraph_zero_based":30136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"length","paragraph_zero_based":30137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the length allocated for PUSCH for DCI format 0_1/0_2 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1.2.1).","paragraph_zero_based":30138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mappingType","paragraph_zero_based":30139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mapping type (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1.2.1).","paragraph_zero_based":30140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"numberOfRepetitions","paragraph_zero_based":30141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of repetitions for DCI format 0_1/0_2 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1.2.1). When numberOfSlotsTBoMS-r17 is set to 2, 4 or 8 (i.e. TB processing over multi-slot (TBoMS) PUSCH is enabled), it indicates the number of repetitions of a single TBoMS.","paragraph_zero_based":30142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"numberOfRepetitionsExt","paragraph_zero_based":30143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fe2bd9a896c72a6cc06a68800be6a69410dd8d918d9298c237c9aec4c02dad03","5d8c7a98a87ee863f4caa6affe5db1699d872228def0fa2019bf79dc925436aa","b2d1acb709e139b72aa46e4573aa68a20eee6ad684b8693102d76ecdb67ae806","54bda06e28927a3fcdf71e1c032dae1f6bb73a28722c52980847055c715fda71","94fd7cc0f9a690d17f2dd2bb0d1c42b2f344e093b8182d82d5bf67b2ffc647db","0603e1a38f1d9b3d2cb84bc71017137ccbead94879c41c6e1d0b77f4deb4c18d","75cb7f41b1e5f693d1b039abb95244ac996c17480e2115a02b17e8ce3834a340","fa58677d8a613eb0138eef375b8fc05575f53c0e8d5690e88a06944ec3869b1d","cb0fb3ba026a21df92933ca3dd8a7597f38fe30fa5b4ade6bb6f05a407f0d865","8de1f35304b2659618628697f3c4f112cb7f34b97a9a00c789902bdf8b34516b","d70796154eae5987f1d945e381342629371a334e3fe39c589b7b7a9f1f981f17","b20ca053c0118d38e9a546233f3c128d9b747f2a59da7b248bba472b14c45610","1f6ea9e7efee4ce26fb4def93b538c3b9189933db80525a877ee011a633f9809","46250b1d8618692ca6d88d28a9db189a4f37c084a4b3df3e0df220fd2b7efb3d","82a9b15551b2c3caab9dbde6072d979ad63f44f24e466d7ead8bb641dc0164b7","dbbecbe1590bc81d1efa778d9927c97a06bd53674cfb1e821bb247efe15a5d44","40355a11519c7270a58109be7185f7a0d037385e8ce81aa05d2da80d52bd9c21","7cf461e71bf5ea9c5633349fe1521e931305e15ec129df83ba4d1849981c54c8","cdbdddd6b807cfd299f05d8e2e1c4fdccace17c66a97df6105d33c9b0dab3c12","62924a32d1bdcf291f0fe204bd0a724d5217c5c63ada985d54784bd7dd0d9135","348a8b220023d217eb1cd6947400966fc23858e8f0f5881955ff2fc58bb08d76","00df52088e7296c0b1a2a89f2d7208e5510b60ba96051649d44db44d77146ed0","cf7ce882cefbc9f53ba527133e8ca5124fabe43e30ba0cf879d8b6bef05cb08a","79add12ab43ce81eb8ad1ddf07dbfb78ac889005b2a0bb934bbeb52b8d754c46"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[30120,3