{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of repetitions for DCI format 0_1/0_2 if pusch-RepTypeIndicatorDCI-0-1/pusch-RepTypeIndicatorDCI-0-2 is not set to pusch-RepTypeB (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1.2.1). If this field is present, the field numberOfRepeitions-r16 is ignored for PUSCH repetition Type A.","paragraph_zero_based":30144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"numberOfSlotsTBoMS","paragraph_zero_based":30145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of slots allocated for TB processing over multi-slot PUSCH for DCI format 0_1/0_2. If a number of repetitions K is configured by numberOfRepetitions or numberOfRepetitionsExt, the network configures numberOfSlotsTBoMS (N) and K such that N*K ≤ 32 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1.2.1). The network does not configure the numberOfSlotsTBoMS-r17 simultaneously with the pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListForMultiPUSCH-r16. The network does not configure numberOfSlotsTBoMS-r17 together with enhancedSkipUplinkTxDynamic or enhancedSkipUplinkTxConfigured with value true.","paragraph_zero_based":30146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"puschAllocationList","paragraph_zero_based":30147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field puschAllocationList-r16 indicates one or multiple PUSCH continuous in time domain which share a common k2 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1.2.1). In this release, this field configures one or multiple PUSCH that may be in consecutive or non-consecutive slots (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1.2.1). The puschAllocationList-r16 only has one element in pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListDCI-0-1-r16 and in pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListDCI-0-2-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":30148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"startSymbol","paragraph_zero_based":30149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the index of start symbol for PUSCH for DCI format 0_1/0_2 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1.2.1).","paragraph_zero_based":30150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"startSymbolAndLength","paragraph_zero_based":30151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"An index giving valid combinations of start symbol and length (jointly encoded) as start and length indicator (SLIV). The network configures the field so that the allocation does not cross the slot boundary. (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1.2.1).","paragraph_zero_based":30152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":30154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":30155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Format01-02","paragraph_zero_based":30156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListForMultiPUSCH-r16, the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":30157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListDCI-0-1 and in pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListDCI-0-2, the field is mandatory present.","paragraph_zero_based":30158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Format01-02-For-TypeA","paragraph_zero_based":30159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListForMultiPUSCH-r16, the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":30160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListDCI-0-1, the field is optionally present if pusch-RepTypeIndicatorDCI-0-1 is not set to pusch-RepTypeB, Need R. It is absent otherwise, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":30161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListDCI-0-2, the field is optionally present if pusch-RepTypeIndicatorDCI-0-2 is not set to pusch-RepTypeB, Need R. It is absent otherwise, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":30162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NotFormat01-02-Or-TypeA","paragraph_zero_based":30163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListForMultiPUSCH-r16, the field is mandatory present.","paragraph_zero_based":30164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListDCI-0-1, the field is mandatory present if pusch-RepTypeIndicatorDCI-0-1 is not set to pusch-RepTypeB. It is absent otherwise, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":30165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListDCI-0-2, the field is mandatory present if pusch-RepTypeIndicatorDCI-0-2 is not set to pusch-RepTypeB. It is absent otherwise, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":30166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RepTypeB","paragraph_zero_based":30167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["36f7dda3c89e94f16b3e90a369cc01fb7c222108eab25a4c0caac30aecb0e422","f388c44dc6dcae94acdf02436c661eac771732f97d3acf3e6c280ae7443d1bd2","80b03b1bfa1155cecc68613ed14418b451bdf27f687c039f791e70d6b945db6c","ff346e175c5e5ae4ff44f35c6043406652a7c91f29862b39ab2583830c55bfb3","27e2400b41f2f24d6df65ec1056e9b78ba5eb55e20c8f03c0a6c6127335da054","4c98b4b9f3a673a5247776820bc17fa5ab1a7899450b0d6ffcd9c438b3712bd1","daca9a206e56d8a63f46ae38335984fbf221639bb1be2280fc9bd57927e8f5a7","2efd5425f0666ad78638442198262e874e3f650c6deebbe3da7cfd2b61c9c20e","cec86d721e62b741a0aa959512f69c463200653fafe372616d6fea042dc4699c","5b2232ef551b1012947dc0afb9fb3878881eecca61061359da86a191a4a1465a","a1799b4da11640100857413af59bf9e68059387f7cd1ea5f304373bb7b68a99a","69d77bf2288b102e44c5945935977d89fd0db6ea0673de9796215bee437af520","fa2b196cfe615cd81e2343d141cc8997c82d8f18b5c808d30b9d12d2a207dabf","3cf24e00cd077fd7d488010ab22fb54d48d07fe20affae4def68b759e3ae1726","8468fa21d945604411f117a0e11e1c3cf8c542e0d355b95876d0927b9e94d480","399d6ac668e1ec7567fbdc6b0e143ac453508fa2b9647fa33a1f00337ca4bbee","fee8397c5a31e143d4c0c23b602e1c8620b174df35a67de8a84b6bbe5d6d576a","cecda543267159eba56e2d9d9391e703a300c2d6a6223f536e1bb1319eaecd58","2d18549f6705a89f6b19757cc46e6498aea9e792967e2c23f8f5b5a0d1d228d5","f106cc585a598005d9eae465aa99fde2bcb9ded0c90c3440c093262abb994578","1e98e3d9d6b6d4c0b7a37afda368a5b3fc2284e11ef378c9bba16ab6dc212b39","cd1ef92e1065162dee9a909d9a42cc63e2b66dd460390db7327bac2d1ea06d6f","d686b8906b009159a19f28245a0f4fe2183d4d7ffb9fe205adb6c976bd08890b","12e2f6ce65fda02b0212c563c2f02f7fbcd538800695636dd7ee4007e22c3464"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[30144,30167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p30144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListForMultiPUSCH-r16, the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":30168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListDCI-0-1, the field is mandatory present if pusch-RepTypeIndicatorDCI-0-1 is set to pusch-RepTypeB. It is absent otherwise, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":30169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In pusch-TimeDomainAllocationListDCI-0-2, the field is mandatory present if pusch-RepTypeIndicatorDCI-0-2 is set to pusch-RepTypeB. It is absent otherwise, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":30170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MultiPUSCH","paragraph_zero_based":30171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case size of puschAllocationList is higher than 1, the field extendedK2(n) corresponding to k2 of the n-th PUSCH, n>1, is mandatory present for all n, if any two consecutive PUSCHs are non-contiguous. Otherwise, it is optionally present, Need S.","paragraph_zero_based":30172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PUSCH-TPC-CommandConfig","paragraph_zero_based":30174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PUSCH-TPC-CommandConfig is used to configure the UE for extracting TPC commands for PUSCH from a group-TPC messages on DCI.","paragraph_zero_based":30175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PUSCH-TPC-CommandConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":30176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":30177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PUSCH-TPC-COMMANDCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":30178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PUSCH-TPC-CommandConfig ::=         SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":30180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    tpc-Index                           INTEGER (1..15)                                                 OPTIONAL,   -- Cond SUL","paragraph_zero_based":30181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    tpc-IndexSUL                        INTEGER (1..15)                                                 OPTIONAL,   -- Cond SUL-Only","paragraph_zero_based":30182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    targetCell                          ServCellIndex                                                   OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":30183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":30184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":30185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PUSCH-TPC-COMMANDCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":30187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":30188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PUSCH-TPC-CommandConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":30190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"targetCell","paragraph_zero_based":30191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4190aa316efa9881ee47438a4d0318d404c81db231e0111b1f773c9abdedb87e","eada93170c95b3750ac77dfffee1921d0b81617a51aeacdcb18bf4bf510af51b","0b2f72f71e83d007f32465759ebadce78074b021bbe280fc34fa926236c49cdf","01a9b39c67fa05dbc71a54447889bcc382c36cd8c5f4854b59c78d04dee93f0d","263154131f2348582795bf51839b824ed39822bf5b87aba8589c046e214ca302","312e64425b5122f3f200014a7d8af058890d60f1f6121005068a649383daf578","32bdfd759c79ab5c2c0d853a3c16767de600c250c482b8689f72ea48f97579b8","39dad