{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For utra-FDD-RSCP: The actual value is field value – 115 dBm.","paragraph_zero_based":31608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For utra-FDD-EcN0: The actual value is (field value – 49)/2 dB.","paragraph_zero_based":31609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"y1-Threshold1","paragraph_zero_based":31610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR threshold to be used in measurement report triggering condition for event Y1.","paragraph_zero_based":31611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"y1-Threshold2-Relay","paragraph_zero_based":31612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2 U2N Relay threshold value associated with the selected trigger quantity (i.e. RSRP) to be used in measurement report triggering condition for event Y1.","paragraph_zero_based":31613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"y2-Threshold-Relay","paragraph_zero_based":31614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2 U2N Relay threshold value associated with the selected trigger quantity (i.e. RSRP) to be used in measurement report triggering condition for event Y2.","paragraph_zero_based":31615},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"z1-Threshold1-Relay","paragraph_zero_based":31616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2 U2N Relay threshold value associated with the selected trigger quantity (i.e. SL-RSRP and/or SD-RSRP) to be used in measurement report triggering condition for serving Relay UE in event Z1. If the field sd-RSRP is not included, the UE considers it to be equal to sl-RSRP.","paragraph_zero_based":31617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"z1-Threshold2-Relay","paragraph_zero_based":31618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2 U2N Relay threshold value associated with the selected trigger quantity (i.e. SD-RSRP) to be used in measurement report triggering condition for candidate Relay UE in event Z1.","paragraph_zero_based":31619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PeriodicalReportConfigInterRAT field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":31621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxReportCells","paragraph_zero_based":31622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Max number of non-serving cells/candidate L2 U2N Relay UEs to include in the measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":31623},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportAmount","paragraph_zero_based":31624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of measurement reports applicable for eventTriggered as well as for periodical report types","paragraph_zero_based":31625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportQuantity, reportQuantityUTRA-FDD","paragraph_zero_based":31626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The cell measurement quantities to be included in the measurement report. If the field reportQuantityUTRA-FDD is present, the UE shall ignore the value(s) provided in reportQuantity.","paragraph_zero_based":31627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CellIndividualOffsetList-EUTRA field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":31629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cellIndividualOffset","paragraph_zero_based":31630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Cell individual offsets applicable to a specific measurement event.","paragraph_zero_based":31631}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["260d7df5cf5d2c3cfffa73c856dd152cb70ed56f4dd787e77abf535460535aa8","34ac31ace89c149a357da7b694ecdcb7f90f3d4eef37404940fcbeb9101dc419","d3655e58a7aec8f93da42c02bcd62f09a8899de0833e753d3b2df635a59b7a95","eb71fbfeceda84104af92ae0f73bfd94