{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"physCellId","paragraph_zero_based":31632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Physical cell identity of a E-UTRAN cell in the cell list.","paragraph_zero_based":31633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":31634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ReportConfigNR","paragraph_zero_based":31635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ReportConfigNR specifies criteria for triggering of an NR measurement reporting event or of a CHO, CPA or CPC event or of an L2 U2N relay measurement reporting event. For events labelled AN with N equal to 1, 2 and so on, measurement reporting events and CHO, CPA or CPC events are based on cell measurement results, which can either be derived based on SS/PBCH block or CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":31636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A1:Serving becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":31637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A2:Serving becomes worse than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":31638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A3:Neighbour becomes amount of offset better than PCell/PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":31639},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A4:Neighbour becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":31640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A5:PCell/PSCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Neighbour/SCell becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":31641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A6:Neighbour becomes amount of offset better than SCell;","paragraph_zero_based":31642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event D1:Distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation1 becomes larger than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference1 and distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation2 becomes shorter than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference2;","paragraph_zero_based":31643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event D2:Distance between UE and a moving reference location based on movingReferenceLocation and its corresponding satellite ephemeris and epoch time broadcast in SIB19 for the serving cell becomes larger than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference1 and distance between UE and a moving reference location determined based on referenceLocation2 becomes shorter than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference2;","paragraph_zero_based":31644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A3: Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes amount of offset better than PCell/PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":31645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A4: Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes better than absolute threshold where condEventA4 can also be used for current PSCell (i.e., in case it is configured as candidate PSCell for CondEvent A4 evaluation) for CHO with candidate SCG(s) case;","paragraph_zero_based":31646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A5: PCell/PSCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":31647},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent D1: Distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation1 becomes larger than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference1 and distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation2 of conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes shorter than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference2;","paragraph_zero_based":31648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent D2: Distance between UE and a moving reference location determined based on movingReferenceLocation and its corresponding satellite ephemeris and epoch time broadcast in SIB19 for the serving cell becomes larger than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference1 and distance between UE and a moving reference location determined based on referenceLocation2 of conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes shorter than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference2;","paragraph_zero_based":31649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent T1: Time measured at UE becomes more than configured threshold t1-Threshold but is less than t1-Threshold + duration;","paragraph_zero_based":31650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event X1:Serving L2 U2N Relay UE becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND NR Cell becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":31651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event X2:Serving L2 U2N Relay UE becomes worse than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":31652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For event I1, measurement reporting event is based on CLI measurement results, which can either be derived based on SRS-RSRP or CLI-RSSI.","paragraph_zero_based":31653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event I1:Interference becomes higher than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":31654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The reporting events concerning Aerial UE altitude are labelled HN with N equal to 1 and 2. Additionally, the reporting events concerning Aerial UE altitude and the neighboring cell measurements simultaneously are labelled AMHN with M equal to 3, 4, 5 and N equal to 1, 2.","paragraph_zero_based":31655}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ed2f3ddcf670fefaf8a32de5afbbc33a3da665934f5bdf417a555ab076d96b85","4145f6ea9333b43d5878de180bb5d3b509ed969b5b6df03181b81f84bf3ccf9e","a2186c1fbb7e12496d4ecb826b0af3877514515e