":33281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SEMISTATICCHANNELACCESSCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":33282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":33283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":33284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SemiStaticChannelAccessConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":33285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"period","paragraph_zero_based":33286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the periodicity of the semi-static channel access mode (see TS 37.213 [48], clause 4.3). Value ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, value ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, value ms2dot5 corresponds to 2.5 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":33287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["92e8ac7f696a1d4370732906db2962f8010a8e18fa4fda10678cbd5650395acf","7bcc1b0fef29fddbc7e0bee41071455bdcbea7c52131a061f98ed990f4d53964","aa0d412c2d474e184ba2f7a06fbf413755ef48265e76dbc76d013e25324d23de","9804174a1f95df9d0bf89988db70f1714b54c4c457b60afe9630b931117949e0","09e0f6cde830cfb5a89a8da5ed037c1fd6ce24404fccdd88d1a2261047af22fd","b1098957457f4a366bf5906b00d0b85cbcc59d3687bfb202de50a5a71403ed86","844727d1bcf86bb8377e2f4022c7358c43dd5a2a733a358bb6f004bb752b73b2","35ca29d5022db79c0a4b0c7915721c2d0a14f6de694946ce1f3c5569ed4d822c","5d7249a16534b7b94fec08d99caff224586b414db7f3bafa9cadc1c0f8555863","10dbfa72c462cf423b78a18aa26d8d459b3809e388d5e34a3205200c97d7e43c","44c9e013c9f592a9527c92f7c139a145400bdcc21927db40200ed3d94810fde4","8871b31fa4f17410e3e3cdc833873f4c3e27a8235431ad236cf8a0492b2bbfaa","ddd13cee0b88f67abfd886f0edddc33c2e9fc74537359b094dfdde5bcfd4e2e1","942129e8c38c5e0d6da14b7db6da48ec19bc0c59ba08b13cdaef5d31190f9b