{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServingCellAndBWP-Id-r17 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":33336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    servingcell-r17              ServCellIndex,","paragraph_zero_based":33337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    bwp-r17                      BWP-Id","paragraph_zero_based":33338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":33339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":33340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SERVINGCELLANDBWP-ID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":33341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":33342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":33343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ServCellIndex","paragraph_zero_based":33344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ServCellIndex concerns a short identity, used to uniquely identify a serving cell (i.e. the PCell, the PSCell or an SCell) across the cell groups. Value 0 applies for the PCell, while the SCellIndex that has previously been assigned applies for SCells.","paragraph_zero_based":33345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServCellIndex information element","paragraph_zero_based":33346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":33347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SERVCELLINDEX-START","paragraph_zero_based":33348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":33349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServCellIndex ::=                   INTEGER (0..maxNrofServingCells-1)","paragraph_zero_based":33350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":33351},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SERVCELLINDEX-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":33352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":33353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":33354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ServingCellConfig","paragraph_zero_based":33355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ServingCellConfig is used to configure (add or modify) the UE with a serving cell, which may be the SpCell or an SCell of an MCG or SCG. The parameters herein are mostly UE specific but partly also cell specific (e.g. in additionally configured bandwidth parts). Reconfiguration between a PUCCH and PUCCHless SCell is only supported using an SCell release and add.","paragraph_zero_based":33356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServingCellConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":33357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":33358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SERVINGCELLCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":33359}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["53cfafc73e1617f2f8f20089954f240d56c947d22a179d71c8def8d946168539","f9982a24e329580d84ece01d9bd48c592412031b861b4db1d71b7c2a8c52f00c","7dc139fc59f32fdaad205cb234ddcdee21b5ee07117684bea6e55d07c6477de5","101ac8e78d05dcc76361272aa1cb7f4d98203b410e28b640a96ba2394e630c17","889f778027dc1f440fd28cbc1fc8337dce7c4fe8a99eb40a1e39bef1f49a6e9d","94317e1b51a05d78c5601f8ab06aa56b23a6c531e628787b0d4aa5953d55c1e8","f73168d6628485cb738cdaf326153bf6af351dfb5b5bc79b8530054a0b886b01","a67404ce1de7dc8f436ff7ba113d6d37285ada6a29fdc19fab5c172701f90af8","3b7c0f4391e3d5db03c4ea9a8d1ff09bfd173d1714ec6e78db394e5b9542c721","db64d53e5330e0497cf74799720fff0b2ba0cf3491c771f860e34e9c3e8e2486","0b30b1e0b1df5d904767d313d8840bf32b2bf72377748088eca80dde1056833c","8c6121bfc4ef333afc9e82fc2bf3d97bdab8b495a7b29d77cbbdb84c1cde908d","cbc81ce9378be100c502