{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nrofUplinkSlots                     INTEGER (0..maxNrofSlots),","paragraph_zero_based":35904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nrofUplinkSymbols                   INTEGER (0..maxNrofSymbols-1),","paragraph_zero_based":35905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":35906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":35907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    dl-UL-TransmissionPeriodicity-v1530     ENUMERATED {ms3, ms4}                                               OPTIONAL -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":35908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":35909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":35910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-TDD-UL-DL-CONFIGCOMMON-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":35912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":35913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TDD-UL-DL-ConfigCommon field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":35915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"referenceSubcarrierSpacing","paragraph_zero_based":35916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reference SCS used to determine the time domain boundaries in the UL-DL pattern which must be common across all subcarrier specific carriers, i.e., independent of the actual subcarrier spacing using for data transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":35917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Only the following values are applicable depending on the used frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":35918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR1:    15, 30, or 60 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":35919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR2-1:  60 or 120 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":35920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR2-2:  120, 480, or 960 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":35921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network configures a not larger than any SCS of configured BWPs for the serving cell. The network or SL-PreconfigGeneral configures a not larger than the SCS of (pre-)configured SL BWP.See TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1.","paragraph_zero_based":35923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TDD-UL-DL-Pattern field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":35925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-UL-TransmissionPeriodicity","paragraph_zero_based":35926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Periodicity of the DL-UL pattern, see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1. If the dl-UL-TransmissionPeriodicity-v1530 is signalled, UE shall ignore the dl-UL-TransmissionPeriodicity (without suffix).","paragraph_zero_based":35927}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9112abeb73b0a5c49f5ad720705f241945ad8ab42585ab6dac01c407cbefe421","a8a2f3f464c8c529e32f0ab215e3c762be293387bf0afcf0b8d3b569ce3fe11d","666abfb19b994b2d20a0ded9451b0b7d9c795f3a8aaa2ab6d68086c1b1b4db8e","4a0c2bb791ac3a58fb3cdc65e372746c2c8288eaf139627febd2372261632d8d","73b310e1dab5e49ed7f3a03a666d70d143453f872b780408659e9210a64004cf","b5e48bb31e9de13efa0514f83a697b95a4bab2db7711edc91459f969bf294ad1","ac1c440663605dd58018e2610821c4762b4f0b872e319ddb289cac00fa6f1199","1f6c0488a518b29983ea7df856d55913e29aec3e31582b321de95ef88f6c834f","b7973aced0078a81f1b426a223af1d75b5919e063dad8af104ca530cb62e2006","ca181799eeceed110ee02b651bea6857575b8f4999f27685c485eaac75a75770