{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nrofDownlinkSlots","paragraph_zero_based":35928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of consecutive full DL slots at the beginning of each DL-UL pattern, see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1. In this release, the maximum value for this field is 320.","paragraph_zero_based":35929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nrofDownlinkSymbols","paragraph_zero_based":35930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of consecutive DL symbols in the beginning of the slot following the last full DL slot (as derived from nrofDownlinkSlots). The value 0 indicates that there is no partial-downlink slot. (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1).","paragraph_zero_based":35931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nrofUplinkSlots","paragraph_zero_based":35932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of consecutive full UL slots at the end of each DL-UL pattern, see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1. In this release, the maximum value for this field is 320.","paragraph_zero_based":35933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nrofUplinkSymbols","paragraph_zero_based":35934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of consecutive UL symbols in the end of the slot preceding the first full UL slot (as derived from nrofUplinkSlots). The value 0 indicates that there is no partial-uplink slot. (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1).","paragraph_zero_based":35935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":35936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–TDD-UL-DL-ConfigDedicated","paragraph_zero_based":35937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE TDD-UL-DL-ConfigDedicated determines the UE-specific Uplink/Downlink TDD configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":35938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TDD-UL-DL-ConfigDedicated information element","paragraph_zero_based":35939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1S