{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"timeGranularityForCI","paragraph_zero_based":36336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configures the number of partitions within the time region of this serving cell (servingCellId) (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.2A).","paragraph_zero_based":36337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"uplinkCancellationPriority","paragraph_zero_based":36338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configures uplink cancellation behavior if both UL CI and intra-UE priority indicator are configured for a given UE. If the field is present, then UL CI is only applicable to the UL transmissions indicated/configured as low priority level. If the field is absent, UL CI is applicable to UL transmission irrespective of its priority level (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.2A).","paragraph_zero_based":36339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":36341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":36342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SUL-Only","paragraph_zero_based":36343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, Need R, if supplementaryUplink is configured in ServingCellConfig. It is absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":36344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SymbolPeriodicity","paragraph_zero_based":36345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present if the configured UL CI monitoring periodicity indicated by monitoringSlotPeriodicityAndOffset for DCI format 2_4 is 1 slot with more than one monitoring occasion, otherwise absent.","paragraph_zero_based":36346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–UplinkConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":36348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE UplinkConfigCommon provides common uplink parameters of a cell.","paragraph_zero_based":36349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UplinkConfigCommon information element","paragraph_zero_based":36350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":36351},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-UPLINKCONFIGCOMMON-START","paragraph_zero_based":36352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UplinkConfigCommon ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":36354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    frequencyInfoUL                     FrequencyInfoUL                                 OPTIONAL,   -- Cond InterFreqHOAndServCellAdd","paragraph_zero_based":36355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    initialUplinkBWP                    BWP-UplinkCommon                                OPTIONAL,   -- Cond ServCellAdd","paragraph_zero_based":36356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    dummy                               TimeAlignmentTimer","paragraph_zero_based":36357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":36358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36359}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5e27423b053d3b0d66e1f15c03285f119f0cd3da43987058aab616adf9512c7a","afdee2dc4560ded93feb435532ea13f62a656e909a777dcfbcbf1a9a508afce7","2115409ef2d5476a996ce237475f12e9d1786a299f5217091d0ad09fa6a4fe79","9f0c8e7b84cf5512cfc712448d0bb6391a3fe2e9681a4bcdbf45bdd92824e59a","cf4554941b6c4393c7f280c5d7dbaa7f0889585338da6c0e05f65e484f6212d8","c67219b5503edd907dfaf1901711a274f49edaa6eb7fd8213aa906368bc76585","cbb16d9443bc3a466198ce071d8edead358b4a34