{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ZP-CSI-RS-Resource is used to configure a Zero-Power (ZP) CSI-RS resource (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.4.2). Reconfiguration of a ZP-CSI-RS-Resource between periodic or semi-persistent and aperiodic is not supported.","paragraph_zero_based":36648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP-CSI-RS-Resource information element","paragraph_zero_based":36649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":36650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-ZP-CSI-RS-RESOURCE-START","paragraph_zero_based":36651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP-CSI-RS-Resource ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":36653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    zp-CSI-RS-ResourceId                ZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId,","paragraph_zero_based":36654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    resourceMapping                     CSI-RS-ResourceMapping,","paragraph_zero_based":36655},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    periodicityAndOffset                CSI-ResourcePeriodicityAndOffset                OPTIONAL, --Cond PeriodicOrSemiPersistent","paragraph_zero_based":36656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":36657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":36658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId ::=            INTEGER (0..maxNrofZP-CSI-RS-Resources-1)","paragraph_zero_based":36660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-ZP-CSI-RS-RESOURCE-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":36662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":36663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":36664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP-CSI-RS-Resource field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":36665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"periodicityAndOffset","paragraph_zero_based":36666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Periodicity and slot offset for periodic/semi-persistent ZP-CSI-RS (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.4.2). Network always configures the UE with a value for this field for periodic and semi-persistent ZP-CSI-RS resource (as indicated in PDSCH-Config).","paragraph_zero_based":36667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourceMapping","paragraph_zero_based":36668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"OFDM symbol and subcarrier occupancy of the ZP-CSI-RS resource within a slot.","paragraph_zero_based":36669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"zp-CSI-RS-ResourceId","paragraph_zero_based":36670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP CSI-RS resource configuration ID (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.4.2).","paragraph_zero_based":36671}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["43e7db8e2c983a3fe27ea8f61f83c1c3aded840d68c04261bd4f7b3b8834b05d","45889bf91a9d99a2e07d51e7d533c21ceffc8798582a661af3774b324c92d904","b2595c5af4cf3321ce67ae3417d5460d80730bdea3523e5f1e2005fa19f0310d","5aed548f9c89d411a57544c1212bcc802871b43fe1e81c9bb98798694ae39f13","5cd66bacdbd33689cc0480f8563a836406d424df61e3da9f3be52997517c1a61","da51f636c6110890f04558c5218e44fab0dc5e97a96eff24ea202df297f79f27","2777f311b335c8d6ba0ed735823716b3f19ea8c500d50d5e4615c79e7a31d3e9","1f5ae94f5db1ef8a9977dec02f42196f6284d5de29b2ae0bcb447527bf111c26","1ece3ccf785a2f8338e54a231d31db91af59821336e2dc261efc642002d06d98","f68f981abdb2b7d7e7f207b2b4a35404ce6c0b3475e16c2d445b915e5ff0125e","b7c1d0db6c7fc1ef4d