{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FeatureSetCombinationId","paragraph_zero_based":38929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FeatureSetCombinationId identifies a FeatureSetCombination. The FeatureSetCombinationId of a FeatureSetCombination is the position of the FeatureSetCombination in the featureSetCombinations list (in UE-NR-Capability or UE-MRDC-Capability). The FeatureSetCombinationId = 0 refers to the first entry in the featureSetCombinations list (in UE-NR-Capability or UE-MRDC-Capability).","paragraph_zero_based":38930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The FeatureSetCombinationId = 1024 is not used due to the maximum entry number of featureSetCombinations.","paragraph_zero_based":38931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetCombinationId information element","paragraph_zero_based":38932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":38933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETCOMBINATIONID-START","paragraph_zero_based":38934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetCombinationId ::=         INTEGER (0.. maxFeatureSetCombinations)","paragraph_zero_based":38936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETCOMBINATIONID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":38938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":38939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FeatureSetDownlink","paragraph_zero_based":38941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FeatureSetDownlink indicates a set of features that the UE supports on the carriers corresponding to one band entry in a band 