{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    -- R4 24-5 CRS-IM in non-DSS and 30 kHz NR SCS scenario, with the assistance of network signaling on LTE channel bandwidth","paragraph_zero_based":39360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    crs-IM-nonDSS-NWA-30kHzSCS-r17      ENUMERATED {supported}                                                  OPTIONAL","paragraph_zero_based":39361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":39362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETDOWNLINKPERCC-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":39364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":39365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC-Id","paragraph_zero_based":39367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC-Id identifies a set of features applicable to one carrier of a feature set. The FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC-Id of a FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC is the index position of the FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC in the featureSetsDownlinkPerCC. The first element in the list is referred to by FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC-Id = 1, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":39368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC-Id information element","paragraph_zero_based":39369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":39370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETDOWNLINKPERCC-ID-START","paragraph_zero_based":39371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC-Id ::=      INTEGER (1..maxPerCC-FeatureSets)","paragraph_zero_based":39373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETDOWNLINKPERCC-ID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":39375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":39376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FeatureSetEUTRA-DownlinkId","paragraph_zero_based":39378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FeatureSetEUTRA-DownlinkId identifies a downlink feature set in E-UTRA list (see TS 36.331 [10]. The first element in that list is referred to by FeatureSetEUTRA-DownlinkId = 1. The FeatureSetEUTRA-DownlinkId=0 is used when the UE does not support a carrier in this band of a band combination.","paragraph_zero_based":39379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetEUTRA-DownlinkId information element","paragraph_zero_based":39380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":39381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETEUTRADOWNLINKID-START","paragraph_zero_based":39382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":39383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cf72aad959a14b263584648880ebce503adbb333882c6c8bc88a6ed07107d155","fadbefb233ced94fd209a458f10ba014579282e18c504cd985760db386dcf527","41724b1b16ce289babb752a187ac8323e40298009ed2d6799fa5522fd274a7f4","6c46b915ba1ff38bd9c758aa9680f1c5a60a0ea4b56b8aa1f54bc415beaf7a0d","e863fba4c8d2c353b778e1bff8cfb0b1bdeccbb7c34e5c7e55a3ed34e064dfb0","12933fc999ee27a2fa53145ad4a77db8563fa5b0c5d619a926b87a9027a90ba6","670e757bd666f63854ab6fffdadbecad5c912a8a59578ed5517eb59d43c6da91","867a042c191f865166ef053f7a81b4c7b8e1b7d0ada15cd25863986a1dfeb91b","66b2de814b4a503cabb01c1eb1ba464903dfb528d01f7645d963732fcce2497f","b1237fd