{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"btNameList","paragraph_zero_based":45360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report measurements from specific Bluetooth beacons. NG-RAN configures the field if includeBT-Meas is configured for one or more measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":45361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateBandwidth","paragraph_zero_based":45362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the bandwidth of the candidate frequency range around the center frequency.","paragraph_zero_based":45363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateCenterFreq","paragraph_zero_based":45364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the center frequency of the candidate frequency range.","paragraph_zero_based":45365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateServingFreqListNR","paragraph_zero_based":45366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates for each candidate NR serving cells, the center frequency around which UE is requested to report IDC issues.","paragraph_zero_based":45367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateServingFreqRangeListNR","paragraph_zero_based":45368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the candidate frequency range with the combination of the center frequency and the candidate bandwidth, around which the UE is requested to report IDC issues.","paragraph_zero_based":45369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"connectedReporting","paragraph_zero_based":45370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that the UE can report a preference to remain in RRC_CONNECTED state following a report to leave RRC_CONNECTED state. If absent, the UE cannot report a preference to stay in RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":45371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"delayBudgetReportingProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":45372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for delay budget reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot4 means prohibit timer is set to 0.4 seconds, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":45373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-PreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":45374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's DRX preferences for power saving.","paragraph_zero_based":45375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-PreferenceProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":45376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for DRX preferences assistance information reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":45377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"idc-AssistanceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":45378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about UE detected IDC problem.","paragraph_zero_based":45379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxBW-PreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":45380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's preferred bandwidth for power saving.","paragraph_zero_based":45381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxBW-PreferenceProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":45382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for preferred bandwidth assistance information reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":45383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"do