{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CR-Limit","paragraph_zero_based":46032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum limit on the occupancy ratio. Value 0 corresponds to 0, value 1 to 0.0001, value 2 to 0.0002, and so on (i.e. in steps of 0.0001) until value 10000, which corresponds to 1.","paragraph_zero_based":46033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CBR-PSSCH-TxConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":46034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of available PSSCH transmission parameters (such as MCS, sub-channel number, retransmission number and CR limit) configurations.","paragraph_zero_based":46035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-TxParameters","paragraph_zero_based":46036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates PSSCH transmission parameters.","paragraph_zero_based":46037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-CBR-CommonTxDedicated-SL-PRS-RP-List","paragraph_zero_based":46039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-CBR-CommonTxConfigListDedicated-SL-PRS-RP indicates the list of SL PRS transmission parameters (such as Maximum SL PRS transmission power, Maximum Number of SL PRS (re-)transmissions, and CR limit) in sl-CBR-SL-PRS-TxConfigList, and the list of CBR ranges in sl-CBR-RangeConfigList-Dedicated-SL-PRS-RP, to configure congestion control to the UE for sidelink positioning.","paragraph_zero_based":46040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-CBR-CommonTxDedicatedSL-PRS-RP-List information element","paragraph_zero_based":46041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":46042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG- SL-CBR-COMMONTXDEDICATEDSL-PRS-RP-LIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":46043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-CBR-CommonTxDedicatedSL-PRS-RP-List-r18 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":46045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-CBR-RangeDedicatedSL-PRS-RP-List-r18     SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxCBR-ConfigDedSL-PRS-1-r18)) OF SL-CBR-LevelsDedicatedSL-PRS-RP-r18","paragraph_zero_based":46046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                                                                                 OPTIONAL,    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":46047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-CBR-SL-PRS-TxConfigList-r18              SEQUENCE (SIZE (1.. maxNrofSL-PRS-TxConfig-r18)) OF SL-CBR-SL-PRS-TxConfig-r18","paragraph_zero_based":46048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                                                                                 OPTIONAL     -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":46049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":46050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-CBR-LevelsDedicatedSL-PRS-RP-r18 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (0..maxCBR-LevelDedSL-PRS-1-r18)) OF SL-CBR-Dedicated-SL-PRS-RP-r18","paragraph_zero_based":46052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-CBR-SL-PRS-TxConfig-r18 ::=          SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":46054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PRS-CR-Limit-r18                     INTEGER(0..10000)                                                    OPTIONAL,    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":46055}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8c27b8da7c6439eebff17aece42d3c756b6673ab