{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PRS-SchedulingRequestId","paragraph_zero_based":46200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If present, it indicates the scheduling request configuration applicable for Sidelink PRS Request MAC CE, as specified in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":46201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SSB-PriorityNR","paragraph_zero_based":46202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the priority of NR sidelink SSB transmission and reception.","paragraph_zero_based":46203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SyncFreqList","paragraph_zero_based":46204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates a list of candidate carrier frequencies that can be used for the synchronisation of NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":46205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SyncTxMultiFreq","paragraph_zero_based":46206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that the UE transmits S-SSB on multiple carrier frequencies for NR sidelink communication. If this field is absent, the UE transmits S-SSB only on the synchronisation carrier frequency.","paragraph_zero_based":46207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-SCCH-CarrierSetConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":46209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-AllowedCarrierFreqSet1, sl-AllowedCarrierFreqSet2","paragraph_zero_based":46210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the set of carrier frequencies applicable for the transmission of the MAC SDUs from the sidelink SRB logical channels whose associated destination is included in sl-destinationList. If present, network ensures sl-AllowedCarrierFreqSet1 and sl-AllowedCarrierFreqSet2 do not include the same carrier frequency. The value 1 corresponds to the frequency of first entry in sl-FreqInfoList broadcast in SIB12, the value 2 corresponds to the frequency of first entry in sl-FreqInfoListSizeExt broadcast in SIB12, the value 3 corresponds to the frequency of second entry in sl-FreqInfoListSizeExt broadcast in SIB12 and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":46211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-DestinationList","paragraph_zero_based":46212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the list of destination identify that the sl-AllowedCarrierFreqSet1 and sl-AllowedCarrierFreqSet2 apply. Only destination identity for unicast link can be included in this field.","paragraph_zero_based":46213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SRB-Identity","paragraph_zero_based":46214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the list of sidelink SRB identities that the sl-AllowedCarrierFreqSet1 and sl-AllowedCarrierFreqSet2 apply.","paragraph_zero_based":46215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":46217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":46218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2RelayUE","paragraph_zero_based":46219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For L2 U2N Relay UE, the field is optionally present, Need M. Otherwise, it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":46220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2RemoteUE","paragraph_zero_based":46221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For L2 U2N Remote UE, the field is optionally present, Need M. Otherwise, it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":46222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2U2N","paragraph_zero_based":46223}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha