{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PosBWP-List-r18                SEQUENCE ( SIZE (1..maxNrofSL-BWPs-r16)) OF SL-PosBWP-ConfigCommon-r18 OPTIONAL  -- Cond SIB23","paragraph_zero_based":46680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":46681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":46682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-FREQCONFIGCOMMON-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":46683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":46684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-FreqConfigCommon field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":46686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"absenceOfAnyOtherTechnology","paragraph_zero_based":46687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Presence of this field indicates absence on a long term basis (e.g. by level of regulation) of any other technology sharing the carrier; absence of this field indicates the potential presence of any other technology sharing the carrier, as specified in TS 37.213 [48] clauses 4.5.5. This parameter is not expected to be provided if the sidelink carrier is overlapped with uplink carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":46688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-EnergyDetectionConfig","paragraph_zero_based":46689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether to use the maxEnergyDetectionThreshold or the energyDetectionThresholdOffset (see TS 37.213 [48], clause 4.5.5).","paragraph_zero_based":46690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-EnergyDetectionThresholdOffset","paragraph_zero_based":46691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the offset to the default maximum energy detection threshold value. Unit in dB. Value -13 corresponds to -13dB, value -12 corresponds to -12dB, and so on (i.e. in steps of 1dB) as specified in TS 37.213 [48], clause 4.5.5.","paragraph_zero_based":46692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyShift7p5khzSL","paragraph_zero_based":46693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Enable the NR SL transmission with a 7.5 kHz shift to the LTE raster. If the field is absent, the frequency shift is disabled.","paragraph_zero_based":46694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"harq-ACK-FeedbackRatioforCW-AdjustmentGC-Option2","paragraph_zero_based":46695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the ratio threshold for contention window adjustment for SL groupcast option 2 as specified in TS 37.213 [48], clause 4.5.4. Unit is percentage.","paragraph_zero_based":46696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MaxEnergyDetectionThreshold","paragraph_zero_based":46697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the absolute maximum energy detection threshold value. Unit in dBm. Value -85 corresponds to -85 dBm, value -84 corresponds to -84 dBm, and so on (i.e. in steps of 1dBm) as specified in TS 37.213 [48], clause 4.5.5.","paragraph_zero_based":46698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-AbsoluteFrequencyPointA","paragraph_zero_based":46699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Absolute frequency of the reference resource block (Common RB 0). Its lowest subcarrier is also known as Point A.","paragraph_zero_based":46700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-AbsoluteFrequencySSB","paragraph_zero_based":46701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the frequency location of sidelink SSB. The transmission bandwidth for sidelink SSB is within the bandwidth of this sidelink BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":46702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-List","paragraph_zero_based":46703}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9e