{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the list of sidelink BWP(s) on which the NR sidelink communication configuration. In this release, only one BWP is allowed to be configured for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":46704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-NbAsSync","paragraph_zero_based":46705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates whether the network can be selected as synchronization reference directly/indirectly only, if sl-SyncPriority is set to gnss. If this field is set to TRUE, the network is enabled to be selected as synchronization reference directly/indirectly. The field is only present in SidelinkPreconfigNR. Otherwise it is absent. All values in sl-NbAsSync are same across all carrier frequencies configured for UEs performing NR sidelink communication on multiple carrier frequencies.","paragraph_zero_based":46706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SyncTxDisabled","paragraph_zero_based":46707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that the carrier, even though equipped with synchronisation resources, cannot be used as a synchronisation carrier frequency to transmit S-SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":46708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SyncPriority","paragraph_zero_based":46709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates synchronization priority order, as specified in clause 5.8.6. All values in sl-SyncPriority are same across all carrier frequencies configured for UEs performing NR sidelink communication on multiple carrier frequencies.","paragraph_zero_based":46710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SyncConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":46711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the configuration by which the UE is allowed to receive and transmit synchronisation information for NR sidelink communication. Network configures sl-SyncConfig including txParameters when configuring UEs to transmit synchronisation information. If this field is configured in SL-PreconfigurationNR-r16, only one entry is configured in sl-SyncConfigList.","paragraph_zero_based":46712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ue-ToUE-COT-SharingED-Threshold","paragraph_zero_based":46713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the energy detection threshold that a UE uses to initiate a channel occupancy with to other UE(s), and the other UE(s) that shares the initiated channel occupancy shall use this configured parameter for accessing the channel(s) as specified in TS 37.213 [48], clause 4.5.5 for sidelink channel access. Unit in dBm. Value -85 corresponds to -85 dBm, value -84 corresponds to -84 dBm, and so on (i.e. in steps of 1dBm).","paragraph_zero_based":46714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"valueN","paragraph_zero_based":46715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the NR SL transmission with a valueN *5kHz shift to the LTE raster (see TS 38.101-1 [15], clause 5.4E.2).","paragraph_zero_based":46716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":46718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":46719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SIB12","paragraph_zero_based":46720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is optional present if included within SIB12, need R. Otherwise, the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":46721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SIB23","paragraph_zero_based":46722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is optional present if included within SIB23, need R. Otherwise, the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":46723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"V2X-SL-Shared","paragraph_zero_based":46724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present if the carrier frequency configured for NR sidelink communication is shared by V2X sidelink communication. It is absent, Need R, otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":46725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-FreqSelectionConfig","paragraph_zero_based":46727}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["da76d471c86be93091bc7e172096573d6256b4c49f5d87f65b8c7f49eeec309f","492fc391baba862a167b8f1c0c10e3697ca691b0deee24b0e8a50e8494190df5","fd1fbda6197306c2f3fcc7b3b9dca60b66076c9938dae1fe3fbb0519856d0016","8918b67a6887df5cdb1555e4c1e74c2efb4a43aea1b2e80bac6ea9a9f7709186","87ec5fc1b0c1530cc93191b9f2fb124e171e3f22d05e0343e4f1519f912fc665","cca3d8e3cea5ee3a8e2405d5ed5c243618b5807c051505a62ba8d965b4168b94","24b86d54987965b46fa158c686af148581efc69f360053b91e89f36966008dda","03a0b839ce146b92b4f4cc809153cb4871f0e758745da5eff79bca1c1c1e09f1","d82b575eda2741b01130513cfe3ef1fd61850e80971c7b8f148a74bafd264e8a","cac03a1138113bcf6611f0f9bf81a3381fff5247bef4a00009e3854803e854f6","5b75c7374d71953a97133fff8a76722378c8e395b26bc13a3463f6dd3d19b2e5","2f3e9925f14c0c12e34090798b46ba8692ddfee9ef76ed7cbb338fc7e36be9ef","88fa095cb58b3be1577e8878781264b9cf3bf2339625bfc5f3e5055aba86fbf9","a49122942e062fb9feeea669cf1120bc7caa6d8b99e0222ec637364d3d8e6cea","c42587f40ea0a9c7cbc77f75eb0c28e3e1453de12cbade3c4898d585a556aba1","141aa12b76df637290d014e99a6d5a5c45705712f8519f03c8edf41102518ee7","60f128ac708acfa267c16aa2e1f354cc902e9d36d8fd95c0603348f1a9082b2f","877d8e94a0c721b93fd90c380e910aeecead55446af95beee90e9d1eba1ec5f1","8ca055705fdd585e4dcbc9b85c66f5f4c2f5d9ddaaa5d6e8d9c151ffb3875e43","776ef60f7cd4616ef9e1521dc1043c46f3deb7f0b05601d399e2b7ba0719daa4","06b95392c74d7f8782ae96e27fc93c98409094cea75b1d045da9b0e5c83cc2db","d50529562153082b01e552f31389ae0727414dc7d7a93ff5a1a3c98e863ab28a","f7e00b1051c374191bc74619d55d80e38afcbced5b90257de47d3b79b3bdf513","74df83c3fabcdea0d522b54564f22680e26df5ca8721f6e46780a2b35b75b8c0"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[46704,46727],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx:p46704"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-FreqSelectionConfig specifies the configuration information for carrier selection for NR sidelink transmission using UE autonomous resource selection.","paragraph_zero_based":46728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-FreqSelectionConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":46729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":46730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-FREQSELECTIONCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":46731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-FreqSelectionConfig-r18 ::=   SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":46733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-priorityList-r18              SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..8)) OF INTEGER (1..8),","paragraph_zero_based":46734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-threshCBR-FreqReselection-r18 SL-CBR-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":46735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-threshCBR-FreqKeeping-r18     SL-CBR-r16","paragraph_zero_based":46736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":46737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-FREQSELECTIONCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":46739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":46740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-FreqSelectionConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":46742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-priorityList","paragraph_zero_based":46743},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of sidelink logical channel priority which is associated with the configurations in sl-threshCBR-FreqReselection and in sl-threshCBR-FreqKeeping. ","paragraph_zero_based":46744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-threshCBR-FreqReselection","paragraph_zero_based":46745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the CBR threshold based on which UE determines whether the carrier frequency can be (re)selected for the transmission of NR sidelink. See TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":46746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-threshCBR-FreqKeeping","paragraph_zero_based":46747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the CBR threshold based on which UE determines whether the UE can keep using the carrier which was selected for the transmission of NR sidelink. See TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":46748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":46749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-IndirectPathAddChange","paragraph_zero_based":46750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-IndirectPathAddChange specifies the configuration information of SL indirect path for SL indirect path addition/change in MP.","paragraph_zero_based":46751}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["888cf8a84b07dad65118a09d4298fe40206e8e454b6208fcebc50ea2a42eed88","4f4d89dd76fa868ac8d8dd18cf829c748e094025538f86fa540265fbf9ffc969","aa71c7ace911adcb5e4a7faf2901c32fbc7c79275f2cbd2dfed2b7b73eb4ae4f","ce85fd79234eb8dcec2a04d3740562b913034bf5426fe29e62efcaabb3cfb5ab","a9d82c4d856756e9bfe36f6a2258446cff366d88280b81081b5b15949aea3699","dfef478e1923ce74d9c0828b1f3f758a60d27633275b35064494c6e0010f7510","669536766aa36c95cefb667894c7d02eebae23b5b149ee30bc1c8b4fb8a23d69","4ba6a6adc1b2ddaf8d2aac66ff9862e6eb53d6fbcf494f53ff03bce6e10499a2","f718cd158af109dd0a2e04caf70f6df0721ee22bca08eacdc3173654c8bf9574","cb0063fa6c12c1fb331e96ce25d2d